values
  ('12849006818825526', 'Sinners of Paris', 1958, 'Crime', 'Pierre Chenal, Marcel Grignon', 'Jean Ferry, Pierre Chenal, Paul Andréota', 'Charles Vanel, Bella Darvi, Danik Patisson, Michel Piccoli, François Guérin, Marcel Mouloudji, Jean Brochard, Georges Vitray', null, 'Michel Piccoli plays a police inspector whose best friend is murdered on the orders of gang boss Charles Vanel. The inspector knows full well that Vanel is too crafty and well-connected to ever stand trial for his crime, so he carefully lays a subtle trap for his adversary. Unfortunately, both Piccoli and Vanel are thwarted by a pair of scheming females.', 'Michel Piccoli plays a police inspector whose best friend is murdered on the orders of gang boss Charles Vanel. The inspector knows full well that Vanel is too crafty and well-connected to ever stand trial for his crime, so he carefully lays a subtle trap for his adversary. Unfortunately, both Piccoli and Vanel are thwarted by a pair of scheming females.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7mCv4fwZgHaNIL13dNn0MY6Lh4p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137340'),
  ('789881666355107303', 'Sinners'' Holiday', 1930, 'Crime, Romance', 'John G. Adolfi, Ira H. Morgan', 'Marie Baumer', 'Grant Withers, Evalyn Knapp, Lucille La Verne, Warren Hymer, James Cagney, Joan Blondell, Noel Madison, Otto Hoffman', 'NR', 'Ma Delano runs a penny arcade in Coney Island, living upstairs with her sons and daughter. Story involves rum-running, accidental murder and a frame-up.', 'Ma Delano runs a penny arcade in Coney Island, living upstairs with her sons and daughter. Story involves rum-running, accidental murder and a frame-up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/642a4zJYqrfR9yohcvlaQYTjN93.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166655'),
  ('1061142784087204700', 'Sins of Desire', 1993, 'Thriller', 'Jim Wynorski, Stacy Fish, Larry Litton', 'Peter Liapis, Mark Thomas McGee', 'Gail Harris, John Henry Richardson, Delia Sheppard, Tanya Roberts, Carrie Stevens, Nick Cassavetes, Pamela Pond, Jeana Wilson', 'R', 'When a young girl dies mysteriously after being treated at a sex therapy clinic, her sister Kay goes undercover to find out who is responsible.', 'When a young girl dies mysteriously after being treated at a sex therapy clinic, her sister Kay goes undercover to find out who is responsible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdj3W0QDr0XBvueoYqZyfJOYCeo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29810'),
  ('251806361018462861', 'Sins of My Father', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Nicolás Entel', 'Pablo Farina, Nicolás Entel', 'Pablo Escobar, Nicolás Entel', null, 'Nicolas Entel''s searing documentary tells the story of Pablo Escobar -- Colombian drug kingpin, murderer and family man -- through the eyes of his son Sebastian as well as the sons of two of Escobar''s most prominent victims. Sebastian shares stories of living in luxury and on the lam, but more significantly, he attempts to end the cycle of bloody retribution and make peace with two of the men his father so deeply wronged.', 'Nicolas Entel''s searing documentary tells the story of Pablo Escobar -- Colombian drug kingpin, murderer and family man -- through the eyes of his son Sebastian as well as the sons of two of Escobar''s most prominent victims. Sebastian shares stories of living in luxury and on the lam, but more significantly, he attempts to end the cycle of bloody retribution and make peace with two of the men his father so deeply wronged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5j7IHhwwUjnfnPxwZjiGAgllnLe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46558'),
  ('68651172173623158', 'Sins of the Flesh', 1974, 'Romance, Thriller', 'Claude Mulot', 'Claude Mulot', 'Anne Libert, Francis Lemonnier, Patrick Penn, Barbara Sommers, Georges Guéret, Katia Tchenko, Bob Asklöf, Claudine Beccarie', null, 'Benoit has been driven to voyeurism and impotence due to having a cold, treacherous industrialist as a father and an exhibitionist aunt who constantly parades around nude. Jean-Pierre is a thief. Isabelle is a runaway whose stepfather tried to rape her. When the three cross paths, criminal activity, rape, madness and murder follow in this psycho-drama filled with soft-core sex.', 'Benoit has been driven to voyeurism and impotence due to having a cold, treacherous industrialist as a father and an exhibitionist aunt who constantly parades around nude. Jean-Pierre is a thief. Isabelle is a runaway whose stepfather tried to rape her. When the three cross paths, criminal activity, rape, madness and murder follow in this psycho-drama filled with soft-core sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5orClr9AdGQDyCOoIBIwetrxrCG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477222'),
  ('17116275846546024', 'Sins of the Fleshapoids', 1965, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Mike Kuchar, Mike Kuchar', 'Mike Kuchar', 'Bob Cowan, George Kuchar, Donna Kerness, Maren Thomas, Gina Zuckerman, Julius Middleman', null, 'One million years in the future, the human survivors of a nuclear war are served by robots called "fleshapoids." One day, fleshapoid Xar runs wild, kills its mistress and seeks its mate, a servant of wicked Prince Gianbeno.', 'One million years in the future, the human survivors of a nuclear war are served by robots called "fleshapoids." One day, fleshapoid Xar runs wild, kills its mistress and seeks its mate, a servant of wicked Prince Gianbeno.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/md3chTPMaH6VjYsk18ZwJ9IO3i4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65455'),
  ('817491127693411899', 'Sins of the Mother', 1991, 'Drama, TV Movie, Comedy', 'John Patterson, Jules Brenner', null, 'Elizabeth Montgomery, Dale Midkiff, Heather Fairfield, Talia Balsam, Jerry Bossard, Mimi Kennedy, Joycelyn O''Brien, Dixie K. Wade', 'NR', 'A charismatic Real Estate agent, Kevin Coe, is publicly proud of his mother, a prominent socialite, but privately he must put up with her constant belittlements and taunts. And while his latest girlfriend starts discovering the depths of his anguish, no one connects him with a long series of violent rapes that have been troubling the area.', 'A charismatic Real Estate agent, Kevin Coe, is publicly proud of his mother, a prominent socialite, but privately he must put up with her constant belittlements and taunts. And while his latest girlfriend starts discovering the depths of his anguish, no one connects him with a long series of violent rapes that have been troubling the area.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8pWr7v5RiN8sMW6Pjgjy65ZDlN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82983'),
  ('713141857597103617', 'Sins of the Night', 1993, 'Thriller', 'Gregory Dark, Glenn Kershaw, Phil Robinson', 'Russell Lavalle', 'Nick Cassavetes, Deborah Shelton, Miles O''Keeffe, Richard Roundtree, Courtney Taylor, Matt Roe, Michelle Moffett, Lee Anne Beaman', null, 'Jack Nietsche is a hardened ex-con who now works for an P.I. firm, run by Ted Quincy. Quincy''s ex-lover is Roxie, now wife to godfather Tony Falcone. In a huge mix-up/double-cross, Roxie plots with Jack to get rid of Falcone and Quincy, one an abusive husband, the other a demented role playing ex-lover, and run away with Jack. But the double crossings don''t end there', 'Jack Nietsche is a hardened ex-con who now works for an P.I. firm, run by Ted Quincy. Quincy''s ex-lover is Roxie, now wife to godfather Tony Falcone. In a huge mix-up/double-cross, Roxie plots with Jack to get rid of Falcone and Quincy, one an abusive husband, the other a demented role playing ex-lover, and run away with Jack. But the double crossings don''t end there', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64yKiyIMScqcPWQ3JxtemH7KpkP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137736'),
  ('224144219220514389', 'Sintel', 2010, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Colin Levy', 'Esther Wouda', 'Halina Reijn, Thom Hoffman', 'PG', 'A wandering warrior finds an unlikely friend in the form of a young dragon. The two develop a close bond, until one day the dragon is snatched away. She then sets out on a relentless quest to reclaim her friend, finding in the end that her quest exacts a far greater price than she had ever imagined.', 'A wandering warrior finds an unlikely friend in the form of a young dragon. The two develop a close bond, until one day the dragon is snatched away. She then sets out on a relentless quest to reclaim her friend, finding in the end that her quest exacts a far greater price than she had ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BMG9hk9NvSBeQvC82sVmVRK140.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45745'),
  ('956188303504153675', 'Sinthia: The Devil''s Doll', 1970, 'Horror, Drama', 'Ray Dennis Steckler, Ray Dennis Steckler', 'Ray Dennis Steckler, Herb Robins', 'Bunny Allister, Peter Balakoff, Bret Zeller, Gary Kent, Maria Lease, Diane Webber, Herb Robins, Lynn Levin', null, 'Cynthia Kyle enters puberty with a vengeance, murdering her parents as they make love: she''s wanted her father to love only her. Eight years later, she''s free and wants to marry, but nightmares plague her so she seeks psychiatric help. The doctor asks her to describe a dream: it''s long and elaborate with dreams within dreams of Lucifer, Hell, and her parents in various guises. To shed her guilt, the shrink recommends that she commit suicide in her next dream. In it, she falls in love with an artist who reminds her of her father, responds to a woman who finds her attractive, and celebrates her first school-yard kiss. The dream takes her back to her parents'' bedside. Is any cure possible?', 'Cynthia Kyle enters puberty with a vengeance, murdering her parents as they make love: she''s wanted her father to love only her. Eight years later, she''s free and wants to marry, but nightmares plague her so she seeks psychiatric help. The doctor asks her to describe a dream: it''s long and elaborate with dreams within dreams of Lucifer, Hell, and her parents in various guises. To shed her guilt, the shrink recommends that she commit suicide in her next dream. In it, she falls in love with an artist who reminds her of her father, responds to a woman who finds her attractive, and celebrates her first school-yard kiss. The dream takes her back to her parents'' bedside. Is any cure possible?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yE9Pm1ZWaMaRcX4mUA4B7DvQFAD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99537'),
  ('811362071523761933', 'Sione''s Wedding', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Chris Graham, Aaron Morton, Christina Asher', 'James Griffin, Oscar Kightley', 'Oscar Kightley, Shimpal Lelisi, Iaheto Ah Hi, Teuila Blakely, Madeleine Sami, Maryjane McKibbin-Schwenke, Nathaniel Lees, Pua Magasiva', 'PG-13', 'Meet best friends Michael, Albert, Stanley and Sefa; the ladies'' man, the good boy, the weird one and the party boy. They''re staring down the barrel of their thirtieth birthdays, but still act as if they''re sixteen; they get drunk, they chase the wrong women and they have a remarkable record of misbehaving and causing chaos at every wedding they attend. But now Michael''s younger brother Sione is getting married, and everything is about to change. Sione is their boy, the kid they used to look after, who grew up while they were still partying. And to ensure his big day isn''t spoiled by his boys and their idiot antics, Sione has issued an ultimatum; the guys all have to bring dates to the wedding. And not just any dates; real girlfriends, someone they''ve made a commitment to. They have one month. So just how hard can it be to get a date for your best boy''s wedding?', 'Meet best friends Michael, Albert, Stanley and Sefa; the ladies'' man, the good boy, the weird one and the party boy. They''re staring down the barrel of their thirtieth birthdays, but still act as if they''re sixteen; they get drunk, they chase the wrong women and they have a remarkable record of misbehaving and causing chaos at every wedding they attend. But now Michael''s younger brother Sione is getting married, and everything is about to change. Sione is their boy, the kid they used to look after, who grew up while they were still partying. And to ensure his big day isn''t spoiled by his boys and their idiot antics, Sione has issued an ultimatum; the guys all have to bring dates to the wedding. And not just any dates; real girlfriends, someone they''ve made a commitment to. They have one month. So just how hard can it be to get a date for your best boy''s wedding?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDnYtSBp8W8DCp9xjJeyy9IBAeV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13338'),
  ('829454532561068872', 'Sioux City', 1994, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Lou Diamond Phillips, James W. Wrenn', 'L. Virginia Browne', 'Lou Diamond Phillips, Salli Richardson-Whitfield, Melinda Dillon, Lise Cutter, Bill Allen, Apesanahkwat, John Dye, Gary Farmer', null, 'A young Lakota Sioux, adopted by a wealthy Jewish couple in Beverly Hills, gets in touch with his cultural roots and solves a mystery in this thriller.', 'A young Lakota Sioux, adopted by a wealthy Jewish couple in Beverly Hills, gets in touch with his cultural roots and solves a mystery in this thriller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwQgpAUF4Clbr9uJ3UIio2qLToS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291680'),
  ('390671709287819742', 'Sipsipan', 2025, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rodante Pajemna Jr.', null, 'Micaella Raz, Lea Bernabe, Astrid Lee, JC Tan, Mark Dionisio, Joliver Infante, Izza Watanabe, Reina Castillo', null, 'At Sipsipan, a shady stop where truckers trade fuel for cash and pleasure, one man’s craving leads him down a path of lust, lies, and no return.', 'At Sipsipan, a shady stop where truckers trade fuel for cash and pleasure, one man’s craving leads him down a path of lust, lies, and no return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s8L60mdRK3aBhu9EjXFAvc0KiSQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1506450'),
  ('1129729053171969702', 'Sir', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rohena Gera, Dominique Colin', 'Rohena Gera', 'Tillotama Shome, Vivek Gomber, Geetanjali Kulkarni, Rahul Vohra, Divya Seth Shah, Chandrchoor Rai, Dilnaz Irani, Bhagyashree Pandit', null, 'A prosperous young Indian man falls in love with his servant, a widow with the dream of becoming a fashion designer.', 'A prosperous young Indian man falls in love with his servant, a widow with the dream of becoming a fashion designer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xlh1jh9Lxz4OzusFKeljqoRxjL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518497'),
  ('781320380171777842', 'Sir Alex Ferguson: Never Give In', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Jason Ferguson', 'Mark Monroe', 'Alex Ferguson, Éric Cantona, Ryan Giggs, Gordon Strachan, Jason Ferguson', null, 'A look at the life and legend of Sir Alex Ferguson, from his working-class roots in Glasgow through to his career as one of the greatest football managers of all time. While recovering from a traumatic brain haemorrhage in 2018, Sir Alex intimately recounts vivid details of his life and career to his son, including his legendary 26-year tenure as manager of Manchester United.', 'A look at the life and legend of Sir Alex Ferguson, from his working-class roots in Glasgow through to his career as one of the greatest football managers of all time. While recovering from a traumatic brain haemorrhage in 2018, Sir Alex intimately recounts vivid details of his life and career to his son, including his legendary 26-year tenure as manager of Manchester United.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knoiXr69RksDX4sDApXo9TUNfR1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:790850'),
  ('552978792861978966', 'Sir Henry at Rawlinson End', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Steve Roberts', 'Vivian Stanshall, Steve Roberts', 'Trevor Howard, Vivian Stanshall, Patrick Magee, Denise Coffey, J.G. Devlin, Harry Fowler, Sheila Reid, Suzanne Danielle', null, 'Sir Henry Rawlinson attempts to exorcise the ghost of his brother Humbert, who was accidentally killed in a drunken duck-shooting incident.', 'Sir Henry Rawlinson attempts to exorcise the ghost of his brother Humbert, who was accidentally killed in a drunken duck-shooting incident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNIOfBUAPbraJRDyGm832NQ1oRk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50670'),
  ('260159873668166265', 'Sirāt', 2025, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Oliver Laxe, Gemma Abillà, Carla Altimir', 'Oliver Laxe, Santiago Fillol', 'Sergi López, Bruno Núñez, Stefania Gadda, Joshua Liam Henderson, Richard Bellamy, Tonin Janvier, Jade Oukid, Ahmed Abbou', 'R', 'A man and his son arrive at a rave lost in the mountains of Morocco. They are looking for Marina, their daughter and sister, who disappeared months ago at another rave. Driven by fate, they decide to follow a group of ravers in search of one last party, in hopes Marina will be there.', 'A man and his son arrive at a rave lost in the mountains of Morocco. They are looking for Marina, their daughter and sister, who disappeared months ago at another rave. Driven by fate, they decide to follow a group of ravers in search of one last party, in hopes Marina will be there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bzBtsLi17rK4G6kDvOXfUZfAhca.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1151272'),
  ('788569972026215305', 'Siren', 2010, 'Horror', 'Andrew Hull, Noureddine Oueslah, Will Humphris', 'Geoffrey Gunn, Andrew Hull', 'Eoin Macken, Anna Skellern, Tereza Srbova, Tarek Anthony Jabre', 'R', 'A group of friends escaping the city for a weekend away have a simple plan, to tour the coast for a relaxing weekend. Things hit a snag when one of the friends spots a seductive, sultry young woman waving for help off the shore of one of many secluded islands along the coast. Reaching out to rescue her turns deadly and they risk everything to get off the island alive.', 'A group of friends escaping the city for a weekend away have a simple plan, to tour the coast for a relaxing weekend. Things hit a snag when one of the friends spots a seductive, sultry young woman waving for help off the shore of one of many secluded islands along the coast. Reaching out to rescue her turns deadly and they risk everything to get off the island alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r7gfNhxv1XDnRCahmTo4dbxtYQ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58718'),
  ('777011697901604743', 'Siren', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Gregg Bishop, George Feucht, Katie Schuck', 'David Bruckner, Nicholas Tecosky, Ben Collins', 'Chase Williamson, Justin Welborn, Hannah Fierman, Michael Aaron Milligan, Hayes Mercure, Randy McDowell, Lindsey Garrett, Stephen Caudill', null, 'A bachelor party becomes a savage fight for survival when the groomsmen unwittingly unleash a fabled predator upon the festivities.', 'A bachelor party becomes a savage fight for survival when the groomsmen unwittingly unleash a fabled predator upon the festivities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dAEodQQODOtOlhiQQTW7n1eS9ft.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:355506'),
  ('272848395379149683', 'Siren of Atlantis', 1949, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Walter Mayo, Gregg Tallas, Karl Struss', 'Rowland Leigh, Robert Lax', 'Maria Montez, Jean-Pierre Aumont, Henry Daniell, Morris Carnovsky, Alex Minotis, Rus Conklin, Allan Nixon, Pierre Watkin', 'NR', 'Two Foreign Legion soldiers, Jean (Dennis O''Keefe) and Andre (Jean Pierre Aumont), accidentally discover the famed lost continent of Atlantis. Bewitched by the sultry, beauty of the Queen of Atlantis (Maria Montez) the two men vie for her affections; little realising that her previous lovers have been embalmed into statues that line the passages of her kingdom.', 'Two Foreign Legion soldiers, Jean (Dennis O''Keefe) and Andre (Jean Pierre Aumont), accidentally discover the famed lost continent of Atlantis. Bewitched by the sultry, beauty of the Queen of Atlantis (Maria Montez) the two men vie for her affections; little realising that her previous lovers have been embalmed into statues that line the passages of her kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yl0WXjpRETFHkHcXJWVcW5kCi71.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3471'),
  ('1034065678786224335', 'Siren of the Tropics', 1927, 'Music, Drama', 'Mario Nalpas, Henri Étiévant, Luis Buñuel', 'Maurice Dekobra', 'Josephine Baker, Pierre Batcheff, Régina Dalthy, Regina Thomas, Georges Melchior, Kiranine, Adolphe Candé', null, 'Marquis Sévéro, a rich, lazy Parisian, wants to divorce his wife so that he can marry his own goddaughter Denise. But Denise herself loves André Berval, an engineer employed by the marquis. Filled with jealousy, the marquis sends André to the Antilles, to prospect some land he has just acquired. He promises André that he can marry Denise if he is successful in the tropics, but he then writes to Alvarez, his manager at the site, asking him to prevent André from ever returning to France. The brutal Alvarez forms an instant hatred for André when the engineer breaks up Alvarez''s attempt to rape Papitou, a beautiful native girl. Papitou becomes devoted to André, and protects him against Alvarez''s schemes. But she faces a crisis herself when she learns that André plans to marry Denise.', 'Marquis Sévéro, a rich, lazy Parisian, wants to divorce his wife so that he can marry his own goddaughter Denise. But Denise herself loves André Berval, an engineer employed by the marquis. Filled with jealousy, the marquis sends André to the Antilles, to prospect some land he has just acquired. He promises André that he can marry Denise if he is successful in the tropics, but he then writes to Alvarez, his manager at the site, asking him to prevent André from ever returning to France. The brutal Alvarez forms an instant hatred for André when the engineer breaks up Alvarez''s attempt to rape Papitou, a beautiful native girl. Papitou becomes devoted to André, and protects him against Alvarez''s schemes. But she faces a crisis herself when she learns that André plans to marry Denise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3yzCPmr53StzHYiHplmfLblOaDX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42508'),
  ('762315282172335862', 'Siren XXX: Magical Pleasure', 2010, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Shintarô Ashizuka, Naoyuki Uchida, Takehiko Tamiya', 'Takehiko Minato', 'Marica Hase, Yuko Sakurai, Ryuki Nishimoto, Nao Okabe', null, 'In a rural port town, Kenji Ishikawa runs a barber shop together with his new wife, who speaks very little and has mysterious eyes to match her amorous presence. Running the shop isn’t easy as hardly any customers come… One evening, a man comes to the shop, as if lured by the faint hum of the wife. As the man takes a seat, Kenji exits his shop. The wife then gently fingers the man’s neck…', 'In a rural port town, Kenji Ishikawa runs a barber shop together with his new wife, who speaks very little and has mysterious eyes to match her amorous presence. Running the shop isn’t easy as hardly any customers come… One evening, a man comes to the shop, as if lured by the faint hum of the wife. As the man takes a seat, Kenji exits his shop. The wife then gently fingers the man’s neck…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QFciT2BXoqaFZsDeLrvxMmVRMq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399897'),
  ('849282526310433370', 'Siren''s Call', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Ramin Matin, Tayman Tekin', 'N. Can Kantarci', 'Deniz Celiloğlu, Ezgi Çelik, Gökçen Gökçebağ, Gizem Erdem, Müfit Kayacan, Erdem Şenocak, İpek Türktan, İbrahim Selim', null, 'Welcome to the New Istanbul. A massive concrete jungle feeding on chaos and hypocrisy; it''s inhabitants at the end of their tether. Tahsin is a burnt-out architect suffocated by his existence in this very city. One night, he re-encounters an old friend, Siren; a changed woman who now lives on the remote southern coast of Turkey where she works on an organic farm. Instantly enchanted, he decides to follow her down south. He packs his suitcase, bids angry farewells at work and heads for the airport. Yet, little does he know what a tragicomic odyssey awaits him.', 'Welcome to the New Istanbul. A massive concrete jungle feeding on chaos and hypocrisy; it''s inhabitants at the end of their tether. Tahsin is a burnt-out architect suffocated by his existence in this very city. One night, he re-encounters an old friend, Siren; a changed woman who now lives on the remote southern coast of Turkey where she works on an organic farm. Instantly enchanted, he decides to follow her down south. He packs his suitcase, bids angry farewells at work and heads for the airport. Yet, little does he know what a tragicomic odyssey awaits him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uvlVaEqUxelZtnUis7o2gIN9NpY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:559491'),
  ('1080494009572029029', 'Sirena', 2026, 'Drama', 'Bobby Bonifacio', 'Bobby Bonifacio', 'Micaella Raz, Van Allen Ong, Rica Gonzales, Rash Flores, Renz Tantoco', null, 'Micaella Raz ignites the screen as she plays a mythic siren who feeds on sexual energy, draining men in exchange for prosperity. A fisherman accidentally caught her and offers himself. When his wife learns the truth, she too makes a sacrifice for the sake of their family.', 'Micaella Raz ignites the screen as she plays a mythic siren who feeds on sexual energy, draining men in exchange for prosperity. A fisherman accidentally caught her and offers himself. When his wife learns the truth, she too makes a sacrifice for the sake of their family.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FvOI7DzSJQylwqo1UgiIBZIftY7h.jpg', 'plex:movie:sirena-2026'),
  ('909437619174501224', 'Sirene', 1968, 'Fantasy, Animation, Drama, Comedy', 'Raoul Servais', 'Raoul Servais', null, null, 'Monsterlike cranes reign over an inhospitable harbour as prehistorical reptiles. The only human being they accept is a lonesome fisherman. He is to witness a strange encounter between a ship''s mate and a mermaid. Imagination or reality?', 'Monsterlike cranes reign over an inhospitable harbour as prehistorical reptiles. The only human being they accept is a lonesome fisherman. He is to witness a strange encounter between a ship''s mate and a mermaid. Imagination or reality?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHHNIMqgtNuMNebgN0QeFgIhdWY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224429'),
  ('501916362808747809', 'Sirènes', 2024, 'Thriller, Comedy', 'Adeline Picault', 'Adeline Picault, Carine Prevot, Stéphane Kazandjian', 'Alice Pol, Shirine Boutella, Ramzy Bedia, Natacha Lindinger, Serge Hazanavicius, Jéremy Gillet, Medi Sadoun, Giovanni Cirfiera', null, 'Alison Flesh, a rebellious and intrepid Nice police captain, is forced by her superior, Commissioner Djiba, to work in tandem with Parisian lieutenant Leïla Balani, an expert in criminology but a real drag in the field. On the trail of a serial killer, Flesh and Balani will have to team up even if it means turning over the entire Riviera.', 'Alison Flesh, a rebellious and intrepid Nice police captain, is forced by her superior, Commissioner Djiba, to work in tandem with Parisian lieutenant Leïla Balani, an expert in criminology but a real drag in the field. On the trail of a serial killer, Flesh and Balani will have to team up even if it means turning over the entire Riviera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fUAzK5RRPIrmY2gFVKgfdXlrTiX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1170719'),
  ('637623150448590246', 'Sirens', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama', 'John Duigan, Geoff Burton, P.J. Voeten', 'John Duigan', 'Hugh Grant, Tara Fitzgerald, Sam Neill, Elle Macpherson, Portia De Rossi, Kate Fischer, Pamela Rabe, Ben Mendelsohn', 'R', 'In 1930s Australia, Anglican clergyman Anthony Campion and his prim wife, Estella, are asked to visit noted painter Norman Lindsay, whose planned contribution to an international art exhibit is considered blasphemous. While Campion and Lindsay debate, Estella finds herself drawn to the three beautiful models sitting for the painter''s current work, freethinking Sheela, sensual Pru and virginal Giddy.', 'In 1930s Australia, Anglican clergyman Anthony Campion and his prim wife, Estella, are asked to visit noted painter Norman Lindsay, whose planned contribution to an international art exhibit is considered blasphemous. While Campion and Lindsay debate, Estella finds herself drawn to the three beautiful models sitting for the painter''s current work, freethinking Sheela, sensual Pru and virginal Giddy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bOUDHgOlxANs1KsYZEsLSjZBTkd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12519'),
  ('893942029432622825', 'Sirens', 1999, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'John Sacret Young, Eagle Egilsson', 'John Sacret Young', 'Dana Delany, Keith Carradine, Justin Theroux, Vondie Curtis-Hall, Brian Dennehy, Sabrina Grdevich', 'R', 'Who can you turn to when protectors become predators? Dana Delany, Keith Carradine, and Brian Dennehy star in this moving, suspenseful drama about one woman''s courageous battle to bring a rogue cop to justice. Sally Rawlings (Delany), a corporate executive with a bright future, watches her life spin out of control after a policeman, Officer Wexler (Carradine), cold-bloodedly kills her ex-husband before her very eyes. Wexler is acquitted of any wrongdoing, and Sally finds herself standing alone against a shocking police department cover-up. Thwarted at every turn by a system steeped in deceit and corruption, Sally takes the law into her own hands. Hacking into computer files, staking out Wexler and questioning witnesses, Sally will risk everything – including her own life – to expose the truth.', 'Who can you turn to when protectors become predators? Dana Delany, Keith Carradine, and Brian Dennehy star in this moving, suspenseful drama about one woman''s courageous battle to bring a rogue cop to justice. Sally Rawlings (Delany), a corporate executive with a bright future, watches her life spin out of control after a policeman, Officer Wexler (Carradine), cold-bloodedly kills her ex-husband before her very eyes. Wexler is acquitted of any wrongdoing, and Sally finds herself standing alone against a shocking police department cover-up. Thwarted at every turn by a system steeped in deceit and corruption, Sally takes the law into her own hands. Hacking into computer files, staking out Wexler and questioning witnesses, Sally will risk everything – including her own life – to expose the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCKn02u5tuY91dW02UiVu1uXIXq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277804'),
  ('280910401633053388', 'Sirens in the Aegean', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Nikos Perakis, Giorgos Argyroiliopoulos, Sergios Konstadinidis', 'Nikos Perakis', 'Giannis Tsimitselis, Yorgos Seitaridis, Ioannis Papazisis, Socratis Patsikas, Stelios Xanthoudakis, Orfeas Avgoustidis, Vassilis Haralambopoulos, Vicky Kaya', null, 'A group of Greek solders, who serve their military service in Kos, is sent to guard the skerry of Pitta. Everything looked normal until a Turkish boat disembarks 4 castaways on Pitta.', 'A group of Greek solders, who serve their military service in Kos, is sent to guard the skerry of Pitta. Everything looked normal until a Turkish boat disembarks 4 castaways on Pitta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppF4Eq9DZZLH84uJRzzObFe7QXx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48122'),
  ('307866956691991041', 'Sirf Ek Bandaa Kaafi Hai', 2023, 'Drama', 'Arjun Kukreti, Apoorv Singh Karki, Rahul Nanda', 'Deepak Kingrani', 'Manoj Bajpayee, Adrija Sinha, Nikhil Pandey, Surya Mohan Kulshreshtha, Gauransh Sharma, Priyanka Setia, Jaihind Kumar, Durga Sharma', null, 'An ordinary lawyer is out to fight an extraordinary case! But can he win against a powerful godman accused of assaulting a minor and deliver justice to the victim?', 'An ordinary lawyer is out to fight an extraordinary case! But can he win against a powerful godman accused of assaulting a minor and deliver justice to the victim?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8wMjVoQOyo9XUOrQk60WCcklCj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1123960'),
