  ('375980248270610850', 'Siri Hustvedt - Dance Around the Self', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Sabine Lidl', 'Sabine Lidl', 'Siri Hustvedt, Paul Auster, Sophie Auster, Katerina Fotopoulou, Liv Hustvedt', null, 'Sabine Lidl presents Siri Hustvedt’s journey from her first novel to being a leading voice in contemporary literature – a film about feminist perspectives, Hustvedt’s soulmate Paul Auster, and the power of thought.', 'Sabine Lidl presents Siri Hustvedt’s journey from her first novel to being a leading voice in contemporary literature – a film about feminist perspectives, Hustvedt’s soulmate Paul Auster, and the power of thought.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F5LD6fL8fd3xoeznsRu5SXFio26E.jpg', 'plex:movie:siri-hustvedt-dance-around-the-self'),
  ('78705697933745285', 'Sirius', 1942, 'Comedy, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Dezső Ákos Hamza, Rudolf Icsey, Gyula Rónay', 'Péter Rákóczi', 'Katalin Karády, László Szilassy, Sári Déry, Elemér Baló, Ila Nagy, Lajos Rajczy, Ilona Bánhidy, Zoltán Greguss', null, 'Tibor Ákos, an intrepid and dreamy Hungarian count, embarks on an incredible adventure when he accepts the inconceivable challenge set by the eccentric Professor Sirius, who has invented a peculiar machine.', 'Tibor Ákos, an intrepid and dreamy Hungarian count, embarks on an incredible adventure when he accepts the inconceivable challenge set by the eccentric Professor Sirius, who has invented a peculiar machine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1d5a5GYbXOxvRy0cxYOwFhEiRJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317018'),
  ('260134719763183329', 'Sirius Remembered', 1959, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'A tribute to Stan Brakhage''s pet dog Sirius, whose decompostion was recorded over 6 months after he had died. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation in 2010.', 'A tribute to Stan Brakhage''s pet dog Sirius, whose decompostion was recorded over 6 months after he had died. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation in 2010.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qBko3nn6gzpA1ey5m8RScmqZPRf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144994'),
  ('691398158610274323', 'Sirley', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Elisa Amoruso, Martina Cocco', 'Elisa Amoruso, Eleonora Cimpanelli, Paola Randi', 'Micaela Ramazzotti, Giampaolo Morelli, Emma Fasano, Manon Bresch, Federico Ielapi, Orietta Notari, Clara Galante, Sara Franchetti', null, 'Nina is 13 years old and has an incredibly messy family. She finds herself catapulted from the center of Rome in a suburban neighborhood: grey high-rises, boys on scooters and a funny grandmother who spends all of her time gambling on cards. A sudden encounter upsets everything, like a storm: she is 13 years old, lives in the opposite building, and dances the Lambada. Her name is Sirley, she comes from French Guiana and has an ambitious dream: to interpret the Madonna in the neighborhood procession. Between the two an intense, very strong bond is created. Their friendship will lead Nina to finally lose control, and to discover her place not only in the world, but in the heart of her family.', 'Nina is 13 years old and has an incredibly messy family. She finds herself catapulted from the center of Rome in a suburban neighborhood: grey high-rises, boys on scooters and a funny grandmother who spends all of her time gambling on cards. A sudden encounter upsets everything, like a storm: she is 13 years old, lives in the opposite building, and dances the Lambada. Her name is Sirley, she comes from French Guiana and has an ambitious dream: to interpret the Madonna in the neighborhood procession. Between the two an intense, very strong bond is created. Their friendship will lead Nina to finally lose control, and to discover her place not only in the world, but in the heart of her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojJBnLgY6JNKW0PiUNUZcMb4obK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660599'),
  ('943667821550128674', 'Sirocco', 1951, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Burnett Guffey, Curtis Bernhardt', 'A.I. Bezzerides, Hans Jacoby', 'Humphrey Bogart, Märta Torén, Lee J. Cobb, Everett Sloane, Gerald Mohr, Zero Mostel, Nick Dennis, Onslow Stevens', 'NR', 'A mysterious American gets mixed up with gunrunners in Syria.', 'A mysterious American gets mixed up with gunrunners in Syria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9gsUSoeTlG1GfM7ckAxmHzkgi0n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30025'),
  ('313450635714043091', 'Sirocco and the Kingdom of Winds', 2023, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Marie Bureau, Titouan Bordeau, Benoît Chieux', 'Benoît Chieux, Alain Gagnol', 'Loïse Charpentier, Maryne Bertieaux, Aurélie Konaté, Pierre Lognay, Laurent Morteau, Éric De Staercke, David Dos Santos, Géraldine Asselin', 'NR', 'Agnès, Juliette and Carmen''s neighbour, writes children''s storybooks that take place in a fantasy world, The Kingdom of the Winds. The intrepid sisters discover a passageway between their world and this extraordinary universe. Once on the other side, the girls take on the appearance of cats and discover Sirocco, a terrifying character who can control the wind.', 'Agnès, Juliette and Carmen''s neighbour, writes children''s storybooks that take place in a fantasy world, The Kingdom of the Winds. The intrepid sisters discover a passageway between their world and this extraordinary universe. Once on the other side, the girls take on the appearance of cats and discover Sirocco, a terrifying character who can control the wind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3n8tWaBBGS6Df1MtX44aTFws7WJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:676696'),
  ('486119773318629041', 'Sisi & I', 2023, 'Drama, History', 'Frauke Finsterwalder, Thomas W. Kiennast', 'Frauke Finsterwalder, Christian Kracht', 'Susanne Wolff, Sandra Hüller, Tom Rhys Harries, Johanna Wokalek, Angela Winkler, Stefan Kurt, Maresi Riegner, William Erazo Fernández', null, 'After an elaborate application process, Empress Elisabeth of Austria hires Countess Irma as her new lady-in-waiting and takes her to her summer residence on Corfu. As the two women become closer there, this soon leads to tensions back in Vienna.', 'After an elaborate application process, Empress Elisabeth of Austria hires Countess Irma as her new lady-in-waiting and takes her to her summer residence on Corfu. As the two women become closer there, this soon leads to tensions back in Vienna.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6J61mawQOGhYXXuKGuZrsiqC7fV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:913521'),
  ('13092264186276644', 'Sissi', 1955, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ernst Marischka, Bruno Mondi, Rudolf Zehetgruber', 'Ernst Marischka', 'Romy Schneider, Karlheinz Böhm, Magda Schneider, Uta Franz, Gustav Knuth, Vilma Degischer, Josef Meinrad, Karl Fochler', null, 'The young Bavarian princess Elisabeth, who all call Sissi, goes with her mother and older sister Néné to Austria where Néné will be wed to an emperor named Franz Joseph, Yet unexpectedly Franz runs into Sissi while out fishing and they fall in love.', 'The young Bavarian princess Elisabeth, who all call Sissi, goes with her mother and older sister Néné to Austria where Néné will be wed to an emperor named Franz Joseph, Yet unexpectedly Franz runs into Sissi while out fishing and they fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGy9j4AdhkiOYRYeTSpq7g3zayL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457'),
  ('1061182663041530137', 'Sissi - Forever My Love', 1962, 'Romance, Drama, History', 'Ernst Marischka', 'Ernst Marischka', 'Romy Schneider, Karlheinz Böhm, Magda Schneider, Peter Weck, Vilma Degischer, Josef Meinrad, Gustav Knuth, Walther Reyer', null, 'The beautiful account of the powerful drama of love and courage of Austrian Archduke Franz Joseph and Princess Elizabeth of Bavaria. This is a condensed version of the original German language 3-part "Sissi" series.', 'The beautiful account of the powerful drama of love and courage of Austrian Archduke Franz Joseph and Princess Elizabeth of Bavaria. This is a condensed version of the original German language 3-part "Sissi" series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7v9oEkW9jFE0y8WabrAgcb4lyJK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46205'),
  ('28685664756460269', 'Sissi: The Fateful Years of an Empress', 1957, 'Romance, Drama, History', 'Bruno Mondi, Ernst Marischka, Rudolf Zehetgruber', 'Ernst Marischka', 'Romy Schneider, Karlheinz Böhm, Magda Schneider, Gustav Knuth, Uta Franz, Walther Reyer, Vilma Degischer, Josef Meinrad', null, 'After a wonderful time in Hungary Sissi falls extremely ill and must retreat to a Mediterranean climate to rest. The young empress’ mother takes her from Austria to recover in Madeira.', 'After a wonderful time in Hungary Sissi falls extremely ill and must retreat to a Mediterranean climate to rest. The young empress’ mother takes her from Austria to recover in Madeira.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6B5zxNzWR6hvT77IbjjUXdCtEu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459'),
  ('250959151938748042', 'Sissi: The Young Empress', 1956, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Bruno Mondi, Ernst Marischka, Rudolf Zehetgruber', 'Ernst Marischka', 'Romy Schneider, Karlheinz Böhm, Magda Schneider, Vilma Degischer, Gustav Knuth, Walther Reyer, Josef Meinrad, Senta Wengraf', null, 'Sissi is now the empress of Austria and attempts to learn etiquette. While she is busy being empress she also has to deal with her difficult new mother-in-law, while the arch-duchess Sophie is trying to tell the emperor how to rule and also Sissi how to be a mother.', 'Sissi is now the empress of Austria and attempts to learn etiquette. While she is busy being empress she also has to deal with her difficult new mother-in-law, while the arch-duchess Sophie is trying to tell the emperor how to rule and also Sissi how to be a mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGBCl0qGEwNbNu0nc5KOWYdBce4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458'),
  ('795077608958235213', 'Sissy', 2022, 'Horror, Comedy, Thriller, Drama', 'Steve Arnold, Kane Senes, Hannah Barlow', 'Kane Senes, Hannah Barlow', 'Aisha Dee, Emily De Margheriti, Hannah Barlow, Daniel Monks, Yerin Ha, Lucy Barrett, Shaun Martindale, Amelia Lule', 'NR', 'Cecilia is a successful social media influencer living the dream, until she runs into her ex-childhood best friend and is invited away on her bachelorette weekend. Suddenly, Sissy finds herself stuck in a remote cabin with her school bully... and a taste for revenge.', 'Cecilia is a successful social media influencer living the dream, until she runs into her ex-childhood best friend and is invited away on her bachelorette weekend. Suddenly, Sissy finds herself stuck in a remote cabin with her school bully... and a taste for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQ0Dd4epB7meJtRxdLfqbRklQjd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:934207'),
  ('1072932494818278065', 'Sissy-Boy Slap-Party', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Guy Maddin, Richard O''Brien-Moran', 'Guy Maddin', 'Louis Negin, Brent Neale, Tyson Smith, Chris Read, David James Lewis, Caelum Vatnsdal, Noam Gonick, Simon Hughes', null, 'Sailors in repose on an island paradise seemingly have no worries of war or danger — until a playful gesture is interpreted as an act of wilful aggression. Soon, the innocent act of slight slapping becomes a relentless and unforgiving orgy of open-palmed face-smacking.', 'Sailors in repose on an island paradise seemingly have no worries of war or danger — until a playful gesture is interpreted as an act of wilful aggression. Soon, the innocent act of slight slapping becomes a relentless and unforgiving orgy of open-palmed face-smacking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cx3AfBJHWM7cJ47TcsWMd4tnIpf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143281'),
  ('686409533308843520', 'Sister', 2012, 'Drama', 'Ursula Meier, Agnès Godard, Jérôme Brière', 'Gilles Taurand', 'Kacey Mottet Klein, Léa Seydoux, Martin Compston, Gillian Anderson, Jean-François Stévenin, Yann Trégouët, Gabin Lefebvre, Magne-Håvard Brekke', null, 'A drama set at a Swiss ski resort and centered on a boy who supports his sister by stealing from wealthy guests.', 'A drama set at a Swiss ski resort and centered on a boy who supports his sister by stealing from wealthy guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xiHYVuBYXKfYTCKEGgMEtfLL09.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102000'),
  ('392945590298315285', 'Sister', 2018, 'Animation, Drama', 'Siqi Song, Bongani Mlambo', 'Siqi Song', 'Bingyang Liu', null, 'A man remembers his childhood memory of growing up with an annoying little sister in 1990s China. How would his life have been if things had gone differently?', 'A man remembers his childhood memory of growing up with an annoying little sister in 1990s China. How would his life have been if things had gone differently?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yIMcN34jLhwl6S2sjMNjktgMJkm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:569529'),
  ('373072272531195533', 'Sister', 2019, 'War, Drama', 'Aleksandr Galibin, Mikhail Agranovich', 'Aydar Akmanov', 'Arslan Krymchurin, Marta Timofeeva, Yusuf Rakhmetov, Ilgiza Gilmanova, Sulpan Abdrahimova, Rauis Zagitov, Vitalii Salii, Nazhiba Iskandarova', null, 'How many Yamil remembers himself, war has always been. He is very much waiting for it to end - after all, then the father will return, whom the boy knows only from photographs and letters. One day, Mom leaves for a distant city and brings the silent girl Oksana with her. Mum transmits the order of his father to take care of Oksana, as if he was a little sister ... A film adaptation of the story “The Joy of Our Home” by the classic of Soviet literature Mustay Karim.', 'How many Yamil remembers himself, war has always been. He is very much waiting for it to end - after all, then the father will return, whom the boy knows only from photographs and letters. One day, Mom leaves for a distant city and brings the silent girl Oksana with her. Mum transmits the order of his father to take care of Oksana, as if he was a little sister ... A film adaptation of the story “The Joy of Our Home” by the classic of Soviet literature Mustay Karim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uouixy2mo3qAtzySrLxHMLoRiio.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:579881'),
  ('902173413236906668', 'Sister', 2021, 'Drama', 'Piao Songri, Yin Ruoxin', 'Xiaoying You', 'Zhang Zifeng, Xiao Yang, Zhu Yuanyuan, Duan Bowen, Liang Jingkang, Wang Shengdi, Jin Yaoyuan, Sun Jialing', null, 'A girl who has lost her parents due to a tragic car crash is facing the issue of pursuing an independent life of raising her younger brother that she barely likes…', 'A girl who has lost her parents due to a tragic car crash is facing the issue of pursuing an independent life of raising her younger brother that she barely likes…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2uERPgtiKtoHetTX6xW5dESQBn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:798751'),
  ('810395627008464314', 'Sister', 2026, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Byun Bong-sun, Jin Sung-moon', 'Jin Sung-moon, J Blakeson', 'Jung Zi-so, Lee Soo-hyuk, Cha Joo-young, Jung Ji-woo', null, 'Desperate to raise money for her younger sister''s surgery, Hae-ran teams up with Tae-soo to kidnap her half-sister So-jin. So-jin wakes up confined in an unfamiliar place. Hae-ran and Tae-soo demand a hefty ransom, expecting her wealthy father to cough up the money. Upon discovering that one of her captors is her half-sister, So-jin enters a precarious alliance that blurs the lines between victim and perpetrator as she plots a counterattack against the ruthless Tae-soo.', 'Desperate to raise money for her younger sister''s surgery, Hae-ran teams up with Tae-soo to kidnap her half-sister So-jin. So-jin wakes up confined in an unfamiliar place. Hae-ran and Tae-soo demand a hefty ransom, expecting her wealthy father to cough up the money. Upon discovering that one of her captors is her half-sister, So-jin enters a precarious alliance that blurs the lines between victim and perpetrator as she plots a counterattack against the ruthless Tae-soo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkYVyFZWMlmD3ILiBLdwvWwyIXG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1394098'),
  ('128309330479740512', 'Sister Act', 1992, 'Music, Comedy', 'Emile Ardolino, Adam Greenberg, Ian Woolf', 'Paul Rudnick', 'Whoopi Goldberg, Maggie Smith, Kathy Najimy, Wendy Makkena, Mary Wickes, Harvey Keitel, Bill Nunn, Robert Miranda', 'PG', 'When lively lounge singer Deloris sees her mobster beau commit murder, she is relocated for her protection. Set up in the guise of a nun in a California convent, she proceeds to upend the quiet lives of the resident sisters.', 'When lively lounge singer Deloris sees her mobster beau commit murder, she is relocated for her protection. Set up in the guise of a nun in a California convent, she proceeds to upend the quiet lives of the resident sisters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZvVSZ0RTxIjblLV87vs7ADM12m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2005'),
  ('865198149657144789', 'Sister Act 2: Back in the Habit', 1993, 'Music, Comedy', 'Bill Duke, Oliver Wood, Ernie F. Orsatti', 'James Orr, Jim Cruickshank, Judi Ann Mason', 'Whoopi Goldberg, Kathy Najimy, Lauryn Hill, Sheryl Lee Ralph, Maggie Smith, Barnard Hughes, Mary Wickes, James Coburn', 'PG', 'Deloris Van Cartier is again asked to don the nun''s habit to help a run-down Catholic school, presided over by Mother Superior. And if trying to reach out to a class full of uninterested students wasn''t bad enough, the sisters discover that the school is due to be closed by the unscrupulous chief of a local authority.', 'Deloris Van Cartier is again asked to don the nun''s habit to help a run-down Catholic school, presided over by Mother Superior. And if trying to reach out to a class full of uninterested students wasn''t bad enough, the sisters discover that the school is due to be closed by the unscrupulous chief of a local authority.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jmPYqep3r2eumauyTauNIhSmR7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6279'),
  ('306029336529751063', 'Sister Alyonushka and Brother Ivanushka', 1953, 'Animation', 'Olga Khodatayeva, Ekaterina Rizo, Tatyana Sazonova', 'Vladimir Danilov', 'Mariya Babanova, Vera Orlova, Georgiy Vitsin, Anatoliy Papanov, Anastasiya Zuyeva, Boris Andreyev', null, 'Soviet cartoon film, filmed in 1953 by the director-animator Olga Khodataeva based on the Russian folk tale.', 'Soviet cartoon film, filmed in 1953 by the director-animator Olga Khodataeva based on the Russian folk tale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tiwWtmgG43Y3cMRugmmrMtw120h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72212'),
