  ('1113858116394096664', 'Sisters', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Jason Moore, Barry Peterson, Adam Escott', 'Paula Pell', 'Amy Poehler, Tina Fey, Maya Rudolph, Dianne Wiest, John Leguizamo, Ike Barinholtz, James Brolin, John Cena', 'R', 'Two disconnected sisters are summoned to clean out their childhood bedrooms before their parents sell their family home.', 'Two disconnected sisters are summoned to clean out their childhood bedrooms before their parents sell their family home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hpvHqAiusQtGNDx48dA3z5ejjon.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266294'),
  ('374784107180286897', 'Sisters', 2021, 'Drama', 'Antoine Roch, Yamina Benguigui', 'Sylvain Saada, Farah Benguigui, Yamina Benguigui', 'Isabelle Adjani, Rachida Brakni, Maïwenn, Hafsia Herzi, Rachid Djaïdani, Faïza Guène, Fettouma Ousliha-Bouamari, Manel Belkhelfa', null, 'For thirty years, French-Algerian sisters Zorah, Nohra and Djamila have been living in the hope of finding their brother Rheda, abducted by their father, and hidden in newly decolonised Algeria. Their relationship is shaken when Zorah, the eldest sister, decides to write a play based on the traumatising events of their childhood that haunted them their whole life. But when they learn that their father is dying, the three sisters decide to go to Algeria to seize their last opportunity to have him reveal where their brother is. When the past catches up, the three sisters have no choice but to put their differences aside.', 'For thirty years, French-Algerian sisters Zorah, Nohra and Djamila have been living in the hope of finding their brother Rheda, abducted by their father, and hidden in newly decolonised Algeria. Their relationship is shaken when Zorah, the eldest sister, decides to write a play based on the traumatising events of their childhood that haunted them their whole life. But when they learn that their father is dying, the three sisters decide to go to Algeria to seize their last opportunity to have him reveal where their brother is. When the past catches up, the three sisters have no choice but to put their differences aside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/le2yhiZ7Zjp9FhtqG9UWegyA0CC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582884'),
  ('612890819907915489', 'Sisters Apart', 2021, 'Drama, War', 'Daphne Charizani, Falko Lachmund, Makis Gazis', 'Daphne Charizani', 'Almila Bağrıaçık, Zübeyde Bulut, Maryam Boubani, Christoph Letkowski, Gonca de Haas, Niels-Bruno Schmidt, Yiannis Niarros, Lucas Prisor', null, 'Rojda, a native of Iraqi Kurdistan and a soldier in the German army, travels to a refugee camp in Greece where she manages to meet her mother, who has bad news about her sister Dilan.', 'Rojda, a native of Iraqi Kurdistan and a soldier in the German army, travels to a refugee camp in Greece where she manages to meet her mother, who has bad news about her sister Dilan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ft6sTxzqqe4pZps7X8n5TNpxbhC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:663991'),
  ('1114692355614744323', 'Sisters Forever', 2021, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Andrea Porporati', 'Mauro Caporiccio, Andrea Porporati', 'Donatella Finocchiaro, Anita Caprioli, Claudio Castrogiovanni, Francesco Foti, Marta Brocato, Carla Cintolo, Maurizio Jiritano, Noemi Pecorella', null, 'Two previously unknown families see their lives turned upside down when a seemingly insignificant mistake leads them to a shocking discovery about their children''s identities. The film is based on a true story.', 'Two previously unknown families see their lives turned upside down when a seemingly insignificant mistake leads them to a shocking discovery about their children''s identities. The film is based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iakVgZNh1ZaceLKD0xBr1Rc07gj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:875107'),
  ('476805604376216135', 'Sisters in Arms', 2019, 'Action, War, Adventure', 'Caroline Fourest, Stéphane Vallée, MJ Bassett', 'Caroline Fourest', 'Dilan Gwyn, Amira Casar, Camélia Jordana, Noush Skaugen, Esther Garrel, Maya Sansa, Nanna Blondell, Mark Ryder', null, 'Kenza and Yaël are two young French women who go to Syria to fight alongside the Kurdish forces. There they meet Zara, a Yezidi survivor. Born in different cultures but deeply united, the women-fighters heal their past wounds and discover their present strength, especially the fear they inspire in their opponents. The three young women soon bound together and become true sisters-in-arms.', 'Kenza and Yaël are two young French women who go to Syria to fight alongside the Kurdish forces. There they meet Zara, a Yezidi survivor. Born in different cultures but deeply united, the women-fighters heal their past wounds and discover their present strength, especially the fear they inspire in their opponents. The three young women soon bound together and become true sisters-in-arms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6sqF5XvmcawutVXkzzefqrbxlJ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618326'),
  ('18215405584206925', 'Sisters of Death', 1976, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Grady Martin, Joseph Mazzuca', 'Peter Arnold, Elwyn Richards', 'Arthur Franz, Claudia Jennings, Sherry Boucher, Paul Carr, Joe E. Tata, Cheri Howell, Sherry Alberoni, Elizabeth Bergen', 'PG', 'During an all-girl secret society initiation, one of the new members is killed playing Russian Roulette. Many years later the survivors are invited for a reunion to a lavish estate, which turns out to be owned by the crazed father of the girl who died.', 'During an all-girl secret society initiation, one of the new members is killed playing Russian Roulette. Many years later the survivors are invited for a reunion to a lavish estate, which turns out to be owned by the crazed father of the girl who died.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/juVkFdUYpGMITvnzrKeHdMQDV8d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49304'),
  ('286067114556302012', 'Sisters of the Gion', 1936, 'Drama', 'Kenji Mizoguchi, Kōichi Takagi, Shigeto Miki', 'Yoshikata Yoda, Kenji Mizoguchi', 'Isuzu Yamada, Yōko Umemura, Benkei Shiganoya, Eitarō Shindō, Taizō Fukami, Shizuko Takizawa, Namiko Kawashima, Fumio Okura', null, 'A geisha in the Gion district of Kyoto feels obliged to help her lover when he asks to stay with her after going bankrupt and leaving his wife. However, her younger sister opposes this, thinking that they should both find wealthy patrons to support them.', 'A geisha in the Gion district of Kyoto feels obliged to help her lover when he asks to stay with her after going bankrupt and leaving his wife. However, her younger sister opposes this, thinking that they should both find wealthy patrons to support them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pPm0GreGDWgCxHEQSJaUlchz2Lo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74581'),
  ('871836401483322345', 'Sisters Virus', 2021, 'Drama', 'Choi Jae-hoo', null, 'Yoon Yool, Rika, Yeon Joo, Lee Dae-gon', null, 'Hyeong-woo is forced to be quarantined with her sisters-in-law for 21 days due to the new virus. Hyeong-woo, who remains with his sister-in-law is shaken by the temptation of prohibition. Eventually, the virus spreads and becomes the beginning of human extinction. However, rumors are circulating that sharing forbidden love can amplify the energy and defeat the new virus, which they cannot help but believe. Their own sex, which began like that, makes them forget even the fear of the virus and makes them unable to break up.', 'Hyeong-woo is forced to be quarantined with her sisters-in-law for 21 days due to the new virus. Hyeong-woo, who remains with his sister-in-law is shaken by the temptation of prohibition. Eventually, the virus spreads and becomes the beginning of human extinction. However, rumors are circulating that sharing forbidden love can amplify the energy and defeat the new virus, which they cannot help but believe. Their own sex, which began like that, makes them forget even the fear of the virus and makes them unable to break up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSvLzCvjA8nVWE3vywODTPQfNei.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:826945'),
  ('938715730275747924', 'Sisters-In-Law', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Onur Bilgetay', 'Gupse Özay', 'Gupse Özay, Merve Dizdar, Ferit Aktuğ, Uraz Kaygılaroğlu, Füsun Demirel, Ali İpin, Hülya Duyar, Kubilay Tunçer', null, 'Two sisters-in-law live as neighbors in the same apartment building with the mother-in-law who promised to give a beautiful sea-view penthouse to the one who delivers the first grandchild. A battle of egos erupts on social media.', 'Two sisters-in-law live as neighbors in the same apartment building with the mother-in-law who promised to give a beautiful sea-view penthouse to the one who delivers the first grandchild. A battle of egos erupts on social media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9yDCxsVLUag3WXyB52S5eeAGed.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664593'),
  ('587138726679393737', 'Sisu', 2022, 'Action, War, Thriller', 'Jalmari Helander, Kjell Lagerroos, Olli Kasper', 'Jalmari Helander', 'Jorma Tommila, Aksel Hennie, Jack Doolan, Mimosa Willamo, Onni Tommila, Tatu Sinisalo, Wilhelm Enckell, Vincent Willestrand', 'R', 'When an ex-soldier who discovers gold in the Lapland wilderness tries to take the loot into the city, German soldiers led by a brutal SS officer battle him.', 'When an ex-soldier who discovers gold in the Lapland wilderness tries to take the loot into the city, German soldiers led by a brutal SS officer battle him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ygO9lowFMXWymATCrhoQXd6gCEh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:840326'),
  ('848680163760720212', 'Sisu: Road to Revenge', 2025, 'Action, War', 'Jalmari Helander, Mika Orasmaa, Georgia Topley', 'Jalmari Helander', 'Jorma Tommila, Stephen Lang, Richard Brake, Tommi Korpela, Kaspar Velberg, Pääru Oja, Erki Laur, Maksim Demidov', 'R', 'Returning to the house where his family was brutally murdered during the war, "the man who refuses to die" dismantles it, loads it on a truck, and is determined to rebuild it somewhere safe in their honor. When the commander who killed his family comes back hellbent on finishing the job, a relentless, eye-popping cross-country chase ensues.', 'Returning to the house where his family was brutally murdered during the war, "the man who refuses to die" dismantles it, loads it on a truck, and is determined to rebuild it somewhere safe in their honor. When the commander who killed his family comes back hellbent on finishing the job, a relentless, eye-popping cross-country chase ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNsttCWZyPtW66MjhUozBzVsRb7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1223601'),
  ('238564218975614134', 'Sisyphus', 1974, 'Animation', 'Marcell Jankovics, Zoltán Bacsó', null, null, null, 'The film is an artistically spare depiction of the Greek myth of Sisyphus, sentenced to eternally roll a stone up a mountain. The story is presented in a single, unbroken shot, consisting of a dynamic line drawing of Sisyphus, the stone, and the mountainside.', 'The film is an artistically spare depiction of the Greek myth of Sisyphus, sentenced to eternally roll a stone up a mountain. The story is presented in a single, unbroken shot, consisting of a dynamic line drawing of Sisyphus, the stone, and the mountainside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vTwOXNBIAQpFAWgxP33ZmxDCHp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90909'),
  ('1103170549386384139', 'Sita Ramam', 2022, 'History, Romance, Drama', 'Shreyaas Krishna, P. S. Vinod, Hanu Raghavapudi', 'Raj Kumar Kandamudi, Hanu Raghavapudi', 'Dulquer Salmaan, Mrunal Thakur, Rashmika Mandanna, Sumanth, Gautham Vasudev Menon, Tharun Bhascker, Vennela Kishore, Shatru', null, 'Afreen, a rebellious Pakistani student sets ablaze the car of an Indian in London. Angered Afreen returns to Pakistan to ask for money from her grandfather that she has to pay in a month''s time as damages. However, she gets to know that he is no more and the only thing he has left for her is a letter-delivering task, written by Ram to Sita. As Afreen sets out to find Ram, there begins her journey of discovering the secret behind the 20-year-old letter.', 'Afreen, a rebellious Pakistani student sets ablaze the car of an Indian in London. Angered Afreen returns to Pakistan to ask for money from her grandfather that she has to pay in a month''s time as damages. However, she gets to know that he is no more and the only thing he has left for her is a letter-delivering task, written by Ram to Sita. As Afreen sets out to find Ram, there begins her journey of discovering the secret behind the 20-year-old letter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1O94ZBzsQXJihtVkrsStRLyUDR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:894803'),
  ('253272697722696431', 'Sita Sings the Blues', 2008, 'Animation, Drama, Music, Romance, Fantasy', 'Nina Paley', 'Nina Paley', 'Reena Shah, Debargo Sanyal, Annette Hanshaw, Aseem Chhabra, Bhavana Nagulapally, Manish Acharya, Sanjiv Jhaveri, Pooja Kumar', 'NR', 'Utilizing the 1920s jazz vocals of Annette Hanshaw, the epic Indian tale of exiled prince Ramayana and his bride Sita is mirrored by a spurned woman''s contemporary personal life, and light-hearted but knowledgeable discussion of historical background by a trio of Indian shadow puppets.', 'Utilizing the 1920s jazz vocals of Annette Hanshaw, the epic Indian tale of exiled prince Ramayana and his bride Sita is mirrored by a spurned woman''s contemporary personal life, and light-hearted but knowledgeable discussion of historical background by a trio of Indian shadow puppets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hrtW78FNfwFSiIetgey0cR8AT0g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20529'),
  ('911536028340067450', 'Sitaare Zameen Par', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'R. S. Prasanna, G Srinivas Reddy, Casting Bay', 'David Marqués', 'Aamir Khan, Genelia D''Souza, Dolly Ahluwalia, Brijendra Kala, Happy Ranajit, Deepraj Rana, Gopi Krishna Varma, Gurpal Singh', 'NR', 'A disgraced basketball coach is given the chance to coach a team of players who are intellectually disabled as part of community services. Gulshan has apprehensions at first and feels out of place but soon realizes they just might have what it takes to make it to the national championships.', 'A disgraced basketball coach is given the chance to coach a team of players who are intellectually disabled as part of community services. Gulshan has apprehensions at first and feels out of place but soon realizes they just might have what it takes to make it to the national championships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adYjCJGSNiL7CIaDW3g0Bcg7r2Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1190511'),
  ('690103495146070655', 'Sitcom', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Yorick Le Saux, François Ozon', 'François Ozon', 'Évelyne Dandry, François Marthouret, Marina de Van, Adrien de Van, Stéphane Rideau, Lucía Sánchez, Jules-Emmanuel Eyoum Deido, Jean Douchet', 'NR', 'The adventures of an upper-class suburban family abruptly confronted with the younger brother''s discovery of his homosexuality, the elder sister''s suicide attempt and sadomasochist tendencies, and the intrusion of a very free-spirited maid and her husband. And it all started with the arrival in the family of an innocent looking rat.', 'The adventures of an upper-class suburban family abruptly confronted with the younger brother''s discovery of his homosexuality, the elder sister''s suicide attempt and sadomasochist tendencies, and the intrusion of a very free-spirited maid and her husband. And it all started with the arrival in the family of an innocent looking rat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2rbWkcmHertfXMWUmn54px5DSjI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46761'),
  ('555343880442301127', 'Site', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'Jason Eric Perlman, Eun-ah Lee', 'Jason Eric Perlman', 'Arielle Kebbel, Theo Rossi, Jake McLaughlin, Clyde Kusatsu, Yoson An, Miki Ishikawa, Kavi Raz, Danni Wang', null, 'After a terrifying encounter at an abandoned government test site, a small town family man begins seeing haunting visions of a past that threatens to destroy his present.', 'After a terrifying encounter at an abandoned government test site, a small town family man begins seeing haunting visions of a past that threatens to destroy his present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ynfYUQ2qIFtE2sd7YiN1XzaKOjt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1188423'),
