  ('989063250191451489', 'Sitting Bull', 1954, 'Western', 'Sidney Salkow', 'Jack DeWitt, Sidney Salkow', 'Dale Robertson, Mary Murphy, J. Carrol Naish, John Litel, Joel Fluellen, Iron Eyes Cody, John Hamilton, Douglas Kennedy', 'NR', 'Chief Sitting Bull of the Sioux tribe is forced by the Indian-hating General Custer to react with violence, resulting in the famous Last Stand at Little Bighorn. Parrish, a friend to the Sioux, tries to prevent the bloodshed, but is court- martialed for "collaborating" with the enemy. Sitting Bull, however, manages to intercede with President Grant on Parrish''s behalf.', 'Chief Sitting Bull of the Sioux tribe is forced by the Indian-hating General Custer to react with violence, resulting in the famous Last Stand at Little Bighorn. Parrish, a friend to the Sioux, tries to prevent the bloodshed, but is court- martialed for "collaborating" with the enemy. Sitting Bull, however, manages to intercede with President Grant on Parrish''s behalf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/os1oEOxH8wuVNk1JlsWPyhPcjNk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105536'),
  ('441400519452285145', 'Sitting in Bars with Cake', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Trish Sie, Matthew Clark', 'Audrey Shulman', 'Yara Shahidi, Odessa A''zion, Bette Midler, Ron Livingston, Maia Mitchell, Aaron Dominguez, Rish Shah, Martha Kelly', 'PG-13', 'Extrovert Corinne convinces Jane, a shy, talented baker, to commit to a year of bringing cakes to bars, to help her meet people and build confidence. But when Corinne receives a life-altering diagnosis, the pair faces a challenge unlike anything they''ve experienced before.', 'Extrovert Corinne convinces Jane, a shy, talented baker, to commit to a year of bringing cakes to bars, to help her meet people and build confidence. But when Corinne receives a life-altering diagnosis, the pair faces a challenge unlike anything they''ve experienced before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGENInUWI9tRVg4ae8XAVgAWpEi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:936952'),
  ('159881948925476761', 'Sitting on a Branch, Enjoying Myself', 1989, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Juraj Jakubisko, Laco Kraus, Yvonne Vavrová', 'Jozef Paštéka, Juraj Jakubisko', 'Bolek Polívka, Ondřej Pavelka, Markéta Hrubešová, Deana Horváthová, Štefan Kvietik, Miroslav Macháček, Viliam Polónyi, Juliana Mrvová', null, 'Pepe and Prengel, returning from war, meet Ester and both fall in love with the girl and live together in a deserted house. Fanatic communist, Zelmira, wants to turn their world upside-down.', 'Pepe and Prengel, returning from war, meet Ester and both fall in love with the girl and live together in a deserted house. Fanatic communist, Zelmira, wants to turn their world upside-down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zA2WWLGMDs2ygfvl1S5BC5lEAuG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136472'),
  ('299351878465168238', 'Sitting Pretty', 1948, 'Comedy', 'Walter Lang, Norbert Brodine, Gaston Glass', 'F. Hugh Herbert', 'Robert Young, Maureen O''Hara, Clifton Webb, Richard Haydn, Louise Allbritton, Randy Stuart, Ed Begley, Larry Olsen', null, 'Tacey and Harry King are a suburban couple with three sons and a serious need of a babysitter. Tacey puts an ad in the paper for a live-in babysitter, and the ad is answered by Lynn Belvedere. But when she arrives, she turns out to be a man. And not just any man, but a most eccentric, outrageously forthright genius with seemingly a million careers and experiences behind him.', 'Tacey and Harry King are a suburban couple with three sons and a serious need of a babysitter. Tacey puts an ad in the paper for a live-in babysitter, and the ad is answered by Lynn Belvedere. But when she arrives, she turns out to be a man. And not just any man, but a most eccentric, outrageously forthright genius with seemingly a million careers and experiences behind him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZYDJs8MUcVtwjtL9YgMa9cZWCM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76211'),
