  ('5581412920234743', 'Six Bears and a Clown', 1972, 'Family, Comedy', 'Oldřich Lipský, Michal Vostřez, Aleš Dospiva', 'Oldřich Lipský, Miloš Macourek', 'Lubomír Lipský, Jiří Sovák, Miloš Kopecký, Jan Libíček, František Filipovský, Marie Rosůlková, Zora Polanová, Darja Hajská', null, 'The owner of a circus decides to swap his trained bears for trained pigs, and fires clown Cibulka. The clown gets a job at a local school, bears escape and seek him out and a school inspector comes into town.', 'The owner of a circus decides to swap his trained bears for trained pigs, and fires clown Cibulka. The clown gets a job at a local school, bears escape and seek him out and a school inspector comes into town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDEoqrBXg7T7YbxzpCyJmZW2KK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117237'),
  ('827116246443254303', 'Six Black Horses', 1962, 'Western', 'Ivan Volkman, Harry Keller, Maury Gertsman', 'Burt Kennedy', 'Audie Murphy, Dan Duryea, Joan O''Brien, George D. Wallace, Roy Barcroft, Bob Steele, Henry Wills, Phil Chambers', 'NR', 'A beautiful woman with an ulterior motive hires two gunslingers to escort her through Indian territory so she can be reunited with her awaiting husband.', 'A beautiful woman with an ulterior motive hires two gunslingers to escort her through Indian territory so she can be reunited with her awaiting husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ddnhAycJiXxqBMXquuoLc0LW3TX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38660'),
  ('466823948609844992', 'Six Bridges to Cross', 1955, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Joseph Pevney, Ronald R. Rondell, Russ Haverick', 'Sydney Boehm', 'Tony Curtis, George Nader, Julie Adams, Jay C. Flippen, Sal Mineo, Jan Merlin, Richard Castle, William Murphy', 'NR', 'Follow the evolution of a small time juvenile delinquent hood to a big time racketeer. Based on the famous 1950 Brinks Robbery in Boston that netted the crooks $2.5 million. The story delves into the psychology of the perpetrators, as well as the intricate mechanics of the hold-up.', 'Follow the evolution of a small time juvenile delinquent hood to a big time racketeer. Based on the famous 1950 Brinks Robbery in Boston that netted the crooks $2.5 million. The story delves into the psychology of the perpetrators, as well as the intricate mechanics of the hold-up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ct1JCNCOyaDwu8zObbtTUKAkJF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29688'),
  ('354335814606880307', 'Six Days Seven Nights', 1998, 'Comedy, Action, Adventure, Romance', 'Michael Chapman, Ivan Reitman, Michael Neumann', 'Michael Browning', 'Anne Heche, Harrison Ford, David Schwimmer, Jacqueline Obradors, Temuera Morrison, Allison Janney, Cliff Curtis, Danny Trejo', 'PG-13', 'In the South Pacific island of Makatea, career-driven magazine editor Robin Monroe is on a week-long vacation getaway with her boyfriend, Frank Martin. An emergency work assignment in neighboring Tahiti requires Robin to hire the cantankerous pilot Quinn Harris who had flown them to Makatea on a small transport plane. While flying, a powerful storm forces Quinn to make an emergency landing on a nearby deserted island. The dissimilar pair avoid each other at first, until they''re forced to team up to escape from the island -- and some pirates who want their heads.', 'In the South Pacific island of Makatea, career-driven magazine editor Robin Monroe is on a week-long vacation getaway with her boyfriend, Frank Martin. An emergency work assignment in neighboring Tahiti requires Robin to hire the cantankerous pilot Quinn Harris who had flown them to Makatea on a small transport plane. While flying, a powerful storm forces Quinn to make an emergency landing on a nearby deserted island. The dissimilar pair avoid each other at first, until they''re forced to team up to escape from the island -- and some pirates who want their heads.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fzWrrCzRa16v51TXAUuT6Wendw7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6068'),
  ('1101560409863413045', 'Six Degrees of Celebration', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Timur Bekmambetov, Yaroslav Chevazhevsky, Ignas Jonynas', 'Roman Nepomnyashchiy, Alexey Fedorov, Givi Shavgulidze', 'Ivan Urgant, Sergey Svetlakov, Vera Brezhneva, Elena Plaksina, Aleksandr Golovin, Kristina Asmus, Dato Bakhtadze, Sergey Garmash', null, 'A collection of several interlinked stories that happen on the New Year''s eve...', 'A collection of several interlinked stories that happen on the New Year''s eve...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rhCyyt2FXF7fk5PUGR7KKs73En.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57809'),
  ('1109629693023481776', 'Six Degrees of Celebration 2', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Aleksandr Baranov, Alexander Kott, Dmitry Kiselev', 'Timur Bekmambetov, Olga Kharina, Anna Matison', 'Sergey Svetlakov, Ivan Urgant, Vera Brezhneva, Sergei Bezrukov, Vladimir Menshov, Gosha Kutsenko, Aleksandr Golovin, Viktor Verzhbitskiy', null, 'Everything goes wrong for several people based in different Russian cities on New Year''s eve. To fix their problems, they have to do a lot within just a few hours. Find rent money for an apartment. Win 8-years-old daughter’s confidence. Recover from amnesia. Find a way to be with a boyfriend against Dad’s will. Climb the city''s main New Year''s tree in a dragon costume to prove your love for your fiancé. Conquer a pop diva`s heart. Save a plane from a crash. And even find your youth sweetheart 40 years later.', 'Everything goes wrong for several people based in different Russian cities on New Year''s eve. To fix their problems, they have to do a lot within just a few hours. Find rent money for an apartment. Win 8-years-old daughter’s confidence. Recover from amnesia. Find a way to be with a boyfriend against Dad’s will. Climb the city''s main New Year''s tree in a dragon costume to prove your love for your fiancé. Conquer a pop diva`s heart. Save a plane from a crash. And even find your youth sweetheart 40 years later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x60Spm8ruNxfOVSz6KtFlD4kMT8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85317'),
  ('641920605355012221', 'Six Degrees of Celebration 3', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Dmitry Kiselev, Alexander Kott, Olga Kharina', 'Olga Kharina, Roman Nepomnyashchiy, Anna Matison', 'Ivan Urgant, Sergey Svetlakov, Valentin Gaft, Tatyana Dogileva, Anna Chipovskaya, Mariya Shukshina, Konstantin Khabenskiy, Aleksandr Golovin', null, 'And again a heroes of "Yolki" series are ready and prepared for a New Year.', 'And again a heroes of "Yolki" series are ready and prepared for a New Year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xatqXlZWysUgTpX9lZhc06oYxmp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248747'),
  ('108656273211440965', 'Six Degrees of Santa', 2022, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Michael Kennedy, Ryan Knight', 'Shannon Latimer', 'Kathryn Davis, Steve Lund, Alex Jade, Kimberly Huie, Ainara Marin-Alleyne, R Austin Ball, Baeyen Hoffman, Dorian Grey', 'G', 'Christmas enthusiast Steph, has created a program, Six Degrees of Santa. When Steph''s own gift lands in the hands of a leading internet entrepreneur, Jason, he''s convinced that the original Santa might be his soul mate.', 'Christmas enthusiast Steph, has created a program, Six Degrees of Santa. When Steph''s own gift lands in the hands of a leading internet entrepreneur, Jason, he''s convinced that the original Santa might be his soul mate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXnRVyG9lChu0whGndpKCRXsGne.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1008366'),
  ('807130655304216339', 'Six Degrees of Separation', 1993, 'Mystery, Drama, Comedy', 'Fred Schepisi, Ian Baker, Amy Sayres', 'John Guare', 'Stockard Channing, Will Smith, Donald Sutherland, Ian McKellen, Mary Beth Hurt, Bruce Davison, Richard Masur, Anthony Michael Hall', 'R', 'The story of a young, gay, black, con artist who, posing as the son of Sidney Poitier, cunningly maneuvers his way into the lives of a white, upper-class New York family.', 'The story of a young, gay, black, con artist who, posing as the son of Sidney Poitier, cunningly maneuvers his way into the lives of a white, upper-class New York family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bROsFCnsHr0e09M7VA0aCcNF432.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23210'),
  ('885855444232853999', 'Six in Paris', 1965, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Éric Rohmer, Jean-Luc Godard, Jean Douchet', 'Claude Chabrol, Jean Douchet, Jean-Luc Godard', 'Barbara Wilkin, Jean-François Chappey, Jean-Pierre Andréani, Nadine Ballot, Barbet Schroeder, Gilles Quéant, Micheline Dax, Claude Melki', null, 'Six vignettes set in different sections of Paris, by six directors. St. Germain des Pres (Douchet), Gare du Nord (Rouch), Rue St. Denis (Pollet), and Montparnasse et Levallois (Godard) are stories of love, flirtation and prostitution; Place d''Etoile (Rohmer) concerns a haberdasher and his umbrella; and La Muette (Chabrol), a bourgeois family and earplugs.', 'Six vignettes set in different sections of Paris, by six directors. St. Germain des Pres (Douchet), Gare du Nord (Rouch), Rue St. Denis (Pollet), and Montparnasse et Levallois (Godard) are stories of love, flirtation and prostitution; Place d''Etoile (Rohmer) concerns a haberdasher and his umbrella; and La Muette (Chabrol), a bourgeois family and earplugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wgiXwjpoKEQUszDBqv8BQn4MA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51808'),
  ('739716915509133320', 'Six Kids and Their Uncle', 1966, 'Family, Comedy', 'Annelise Reenberg, Ole Lytken', 'Annelise Reenberg, Gitte Palsby', 'Axel Strøbye, Karl Stegger, William Rosenberg, Jeanne Darville, Pusle Helmuth, Sonja Oppenhagen, Bjørn Puggaard-Müller, Hugo Herrestrup', null, 'Erik Lund is a child psychologist and defend a doctoral thesis on the subject. His knowledge is at the very theoretical level, and he will be seriously trouble when he for a time has to babysit his sister''s six children ranging in age from baby to teenager. Fortunately, the neighbor cute daughter, Lisbeth has a more practical take on things.', 'Erik Lund is a child psychologist and defend a doctoral thesis on the subject. His knowledge is at the very theoretical level, and he will be seriously trouble when he for a time has to babysit his sister''s six children ranging in age from baby to teenager. Fortunately, the neighbor cute daughter, Lisbeth has a more practical take on things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QgOoWQLHFEixsl00A5Lj6QpSUA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50781'),
  ('35844569293123833', 'Six Men Getting Sick', 1967, 'Animation', 'David Lynch', null, null, null, 'Lynch''s first film project consists of a looping animation of six people vomiting projected on to a special sculptured screen featuring twisted three-dimensional faces.', 'Lynch''s first film project consists of a looping animation of six people vomiting projected on to a special sculptured screen featuring twisted three-dimensional faces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n74O3gK18pZC7AWEIPhAmUzfoj8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48784'),
  ('433383006566757058', 'Six Minutes to Midnight', 2020, 'Thriller, Drama, History, War', 'Andy Goddard, Chris Seager', 'Andy Goddard, Celyn Jones, Eddie Izzard', 'Eddie Izzard, Carla Juri, James D''Arcy, Celyn Jones, David Schofield, Jim Broadbent, Judi Dench, Maria Dragus', 'PG-13', 'Summer 1939. Influential families in Nazi Germany have sent their daughters to a finishing school in an English seaside town to learn the language and be ambassadors for a future looking National Socialist. A teacher there sees what is coming and is trying to raise the alarm. But the authorities believe he is the problem.', 'Summer 1939. Influential families in Nazi Germany have sent their daughters to a finishing school in an English seaside town to learn the language and be ambassadors for a future looking National Socialist. A teacher there sees what is coming and is trying to raise the alarm. But the authorities believe he is the problem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hOdW30Yk3aAmiWGjbfeNJ316QQY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:670439'),
  ('24076271800424802', 'Six of a Kind', 1934, 'Comedy', 'Leo McCarey, Henry Sharp', 'Harry Ruskin, Walter DeLeon', 'Charles Ruggles, Mary Boland, W.C. Fields, George Burns, Gracie Allen, Alison Skipworth, Bradley Page, Grace Bradley', 'NR', 'The Whinneys share expenses for their trip to Hollywood with George and Gracie and their great Dane. A clerk in Whinney''s bank has put fifty thousand dollars in a suitcase, hoping to rob Whinney on the road, but instead Whinney takes another road and is himself arrested in Nevada.', 'The Whinneys share expenses for their trip to Hollywood with George and Gracie and their great Dane. A clerk in Whinney''s bank has put fifty thousand dollars in a suitcase, hoping to rob Whinney on the road, but instead Whinney takes another road and is himself arrested in Nevada.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTlIRE6DLbOm3Qqp8gKiaBUeI8d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127973'),
  ('305897166293580708', 'Six Pack', 1982, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Daniel Petrie, Mario Tosi, Michael D. Moore', 'Alex Matter, Mike Marvin', 'Kenny Rogers, Diane Lane, Erin Gray, Barry Corbin, Terry Kiser, Anthony Michael Hall, Buddy Baker', 'PG', 'Stopping briefly in a small Texas town, an itinerant race car driver finds that his stock car, on a trailer behind his motor home, has just been quickly and expertly stripped. He chases down the miscreants, who turn out to be six orphan children. He has no recourse to the law, for the corrupt local sheriff takes most of the proceeds of their thievery in exchange for not putting them in an orphanage. They are charming rogues who are in turn charmed by him. Disliking their arrangement with the sheriff, they stow away with him, and he finds himself becoming a reluctant stepfather. Thanks to their enthusiasm and incredible mechanical know-how, he begins to make a name for himself on the racing circuit. But the sheriff doesn''t take kindly to losing his extra income...', 'Stopping briefly in a small Texas town, an itinerant race car driver finds that his stock car, on a trailer behind his motor home, has just been quickly and expertly stripped. He chases down the miscreants, who turn out to be six orphan children. He has no recourse to the law, for the corrupt local sheriff takes most of the proceeds of their thievery in exchange for not putting them in an orphanage. They are charming rogues who are in turn charmed by him. Disliking their arrangement with the sheriff, they stow away with him, and he finds himself becoming a reluctant stepfather. Thanks to their enthusiasm and incredible mechanical know-how, he begins to make a name for himself on the racing circuit. But the sheriff doesn''t take kindly to losing his extra income...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etxC3zXOFWPHBxDEhBMqiwMj4CM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46925'),
  ('547054852188588149', 'Six Shooter', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Martin McDonagh, Maureen Hughes, Baz Irvine', 'Martin McDonagh', 'Brendan Gleeson, Rúaidhrí Conroy, David Wilmot, Aisling O''Sullivan, Gary Lydon, Domhnall Gleeson, David Murray, Tadgh Conroy', null, 'Overwhelmed by grief following the death of his wife, Donnelly shares a train carriage home with a troubled young man identified only as the ''Kid''. As the Kid becomes more agitated and foul-mouthed, the journey takes on a violent and dangerous hue – for the bereaved Donnelly and for other hapless passengers on the train. Academy Award Winner: Best Live Action Short Film – 2005', 'Overwhelmed by grief following the death of his wife, Donnelly shares a train carriage home with a troubled young man identified only as the ''Kid''. As the Kid becomes more agitated and foul-mouthed, the journey takes on a violent and dangerous hue – for the bereaved Donnelly and for other hapless passengers on the train. Academy Award Winner: Best Live Action Short Film – 2005', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBJTJi0SH4avrBr7OQqBZuYPvmA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25126'),
  ('816429974742393242', 'Six Swedish Girls in a Boarding School', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Erwin C. Dietrich', 'Erwin C. Dietrich', 'Brigitte Lahaie, Nadine Pascal, France Lomay, Danièle Troeger, Kathleen Kane, Elsa Maroussia, Eric Falk, Mike Montana', null, 'Miss Klein runs a boarding-school. The girls that go there are really "free spirited." They chloroform a peeping Tom, lock two plumbers in the dormitories, strip for a gamekeeper and tease their gym teacher. In class, their biology teacher gets carried away while giving a demonstration of sex positions with the gym teacher. In the meantime, one of the girls makes some exciting alterations to their bicycles to make their rides more enjoyable.', 'Miss Klein runs a boarding-school. The girls that go there are really "free spirited." They chloroform a peeping Tom, lock two plumbers in the dormitories, strip for a gamekeeper and tease their gym teacher. In class, their biology teacher gets carried away while giving a demonstration of sex positions with the gym teacher. In the meantime, one of the girls makes some exciting alterations to their bicycles to make their rides more enjoyable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVJcfDu9gPjLe5p6vC6l7urlyr7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244784'),
  ('300124120857139283', 'Six Swedish Girls in Alps', 1983, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Paul Grau, Sabine Gail, Peter Baumgartner', 'Erwin C. Dietrich', 'Petra van Hoven, Marianne Aubert, Evelyne Lang, Elke Sjöberg, Michaela Larsen, Anita Lamar, Brigitte Lahaie, Christophe Mulai', null, 'This comedy has everyone''s favorite 6 Swedish gals enjoying their stay in the alps. When the girls aren''t enjoying the pleasure of their own company they''re out having a good time with nearly everyone else in town.', 'This comedy has everyone''s favorite 6 Swedish gals enjoying their stay in the alps. When the girls aren''t enjoying the pleasure of their own company they''re out having a good time with nearly everyone else in town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5Ks2f3lEPsJR0YrzZXOvETNrhi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264859'),
  ('10430600355400950', 'Six Ways to Sunday', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Adam Bernstein, John Inwood', 'Adam Bernstein, Marc Gerald', 'Norman Reedus, Debbie Harry, Adrien Brody, Paul D''Amato, Holter Graham, Peter Appel, Kathy Lee Hart, Paul Lazar', null, 'Harry Odum is a henpecked 18-year-old momma''s boy with a violent temper in Youngstown, Ohio. After impressing a local boss of the Jewish Mafia, he begins working as a hit man alongside crack addict Arnie Finklestein.', 'Harry Odum is a henpecked 18-year-old momma''s boy with a violent temper in Youngstown, Ohio. After impressing a local boss of the Jewish Mafia, he begins working as a hit man alongside crack addict Arnie Finklestein.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Y2MYk6966UCtxY1tm9d41H2LyT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47501'),
  ('1019521596586975153', 'Six Weeks', 1982, 'Drama', 'Tony Bill, Michael D. Margulies', 'David Seltzer', 'Dudley Moore, Mary Tyler Moore, Katherine Healy, Michael Ensign, Bill Calvert, Anne Ditchburn, Shannon Wilcox, John Harkins', 'PG', 'A wealthy cosmetic tycoon and her 12-year-old daughter, who''s dying from leukemia, strike up a sentimental friendship with a California politician. Since the girl has only six weeks or less to live, the trio fly to New York City where the daughter skates the ice rink at Rockefeller Center, assumes the lead in The Nutcracker ballet, and sightsees most of the city.', 'A wealthy cosmetic tycoon and her 12-year-old daughter, who''s dying from leukemia, strike up a sentimental friendship with a California politician. Since the girl has only six weeks or less to live, the trio fly to New York City where the daughter skates the ice rink at Rockefeller Center, assumes the lead in The Nutcracker ballet, and sightsees most of the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBYjrbMFjYYA3CwrdFUayTqHaAz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77073'),
  ('1097425210480820299', 'Six-Pack', 2000, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Alain Berbérian, Jean-François Robin', null, 'Richard Anconina, Frédéric Diefenthal, Chiara Mastroianni, Jonathan Firth, Bernard Fresson, François Berléand, Jean-Claude Dauphin, Carole Richert', null, 'A serial killer is on the loose in Paris and he seems to be an american citizen working in the US embassy and being in the middle of a french-american economical affair.', 'A serial killer is on the loose in Paris and he seems to be an american citizen working in the US embassy and being in the middle of a french-american economical affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6R4BKzfhsPggTfPHQQsgdX2OEU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5643'),
  ('1040140963862491557', 'Six-String Samurai', 1998, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Kristian Bernier, Lance Mungia, Jeffrey Falcon', 'Jeffrey Falcon, Lance Mungia', 'Jeffrey Falcon, Justin McGuire, Kim De Angelo, Clifford Hugo, Oleg Bernov, Igor Yuzov, Zhenya Kolykhanov, Avi Sills', 'PG-13', 'In a post-apocalyptic world where the Russians have taken over a nuked USA and Elvis is king of Lost Vegas, Buddy is a ''50s rocker and wandering warrior rolled into one, too-cool package. Armed with his six-string in one hand and his sword in the other, Buddy is on his way to Vegas to succeed Elvis as King. Along the way, he saves an orphan who decides to tag along.', 'In a post-apocalyptic world where the Russians have taken over a nuked USA and Elvis is king of Lost Vegas, Buddy is a ''50s rocker and wandering warrior rolled into one, too-cool package. Armed with his six-string in one hand and his sword in the other, Buddy is on his way to Vegas to succeed Elvis as King. Along the way, he saves an orphan who decides to tag along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Lo0pT1gnDAL4hTVMYLwpVWcqR1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24746'),
