  ('841246906625562653', 'Sixpack Annie', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Fred G. Thorne, Daniel Lacambre', 'Norman Winski, David Kidd, Wil David', 'Lindsay Bloom, Bruce Boxleitner, Billy Barty, Stubby Kaye, Jana Bellan, Joe Higgins, Larry Mahan, Ray Danton', 'R', 'A buxom, beer-guzzling and naive country gal travels from her small town to Miami to find a ''sugar daddy'' to save the family restaurant.', 'A buxom, beer-guzzling and naive country gal travels from her small town to Miami to find a ''sugar daddy'' to save the family restaurant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6Z0HoDMwZXY0dYH1zKpgUpSDNA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141703'),
  ('944724842325288489', 'Sixteen', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Philippe Lioret, Olive Chenieux, Charlie Thiltges', 'Philippe Lioret', 'Sabrina Levoye, Teïlo Azaïs, Nassim Lyes, Jean-Pierre Lorit, Marie Dompnier, Arsène Mosca, Fejria Deliba, Myriem Akheddiou', null, 'Nora and Léo, 16, live in the same town, in the same suburbs, go to the same highschool, but everything opposes them: their social backgrounds, their families religions, their everyday lives. Yet, they fall in love at first sight. But from a theft accusation bringing into conflict their respective families, their love story will have to face a series of trials and dramas.', 'Nora and Léo, 16, live in the same town, in the same suburbs, go to the same highschool, but everything opposes them: their social backgrounds, their families religions, their everyday lives. Yet, they fall in love at first sight. But from a theft accusation bringing into conflict their respective families, their love story will have to face a series of trials and dramas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xxu4Z5lYY22k5mQNS7Uh9ihR9rU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:967545'),
  ('116082685865138300', 'Sixteen Candles', 1984, 'Comedy, Romance', 'John Hughes, James Giovannetti Jr., Newt Arnold', 'John Hughes', 'Molly Ringwald, Michael Schoeffling, Haviland Morris, Gedde Watanabe, Anthony Michael Hall, Justin Henry, Paul Dooley, Carlin Glynn', 'PG', 'With the occasion all but overshadowed by her sister''s upcoming wedding, angst-ridden Samantha faces her 16th birthday with typical adolescent dread. Samantha pines for studly older boy Jake, but worries that her chastity will be a turnoff for the popular senior. Meanwhile, she must constantly rebuff the affections of nerdy Ted, who is unfortunately the only boy in school who seems to take an interest in her.', 'With the occasion all but overshadowed by her sister''s upcoming wedding, angst-ridden Samantha faces her 16th birthday with typical adolescent dread. Samantha pines for studly older boy Jake, but worries that her chastity will be a turnoff for the popular senior. Meanwhile, she must constantly rebuff the affections of nerdy Ted, who is unfortunately the only boy in school who seems to take an interest in her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3WGCAgJF33kZdlxUdyXHYdbYax.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15144'),
