  ('162035549642775774', 'Skrallan, Ruskprick and Gurnard', 1967, 'Family', 'Kalle Bergholm, Olle Hellbom', 'Astrid Lindgren', 'Stephen Lindholm, Kajsa Dandenell, Hans Alfredson, Tage Danielsson, Louise Edlind, Bengt Eklund, Eva Stiberg, Maria Johansson', null, 'The children of Seacrow Island take a public ferry to visit a relative only to find that she has went to hospital. When they try to row back home they lose the oars and must take refuge on a desolate island. 4-year-old Skrallan is the first to discover that two colorful smugglers are hiding on the island.', 'The children of Seacrow Island take a public ferry to visit a relative only to find that she has went to hospital. When they try to row back home they lose the oars and must take refuge on a desolate island. 4-year-old Skrallan is the first to discover that two colorful smugglers are hiding on the island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKpnYyXcXaLPpjRtxKzYEEgN2BK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456920'),
  ('466132288837131949', 'Skull: The Mask', 2020, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Armando Fonseca, Kapel Furman, Andre Sigwalt', 'Armando Fonseca, Kapel Furman', 'Natallia Rodrigues, Wilton Andrade, Ivo Müller, Tristan Aronovich, Ricardo Gelli, Guta Ruiz, Greta Antoine, Eduardo Semerjian', 'NR', 'The story of an ancient mask that possesses the human form to commit visceral sacrifices of vengeance for the incarnation of its God.', 'The story of an ancient mask that possesses the human form to commit visceral sacrifices of vengeance for the incarnation of its God.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Bt11FIme9eFM6jUTZd5Tnc8Jwb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:704269'),
  ('780218393395841285', 'Skunk', 2024, 'Drama', 'Koen Mortier, Nicolas Karakatsanis, Martine Temmerman', 'Koen Mortier', 'Thibaud Dooms, Natali Broods, Boris Van Severen, Dirk Roofthooft, Colin H. Van Eeckhout, Sarah Vandeursen, Janne Desmet, Dolores Bouckaert', null, 'The story of Liam, a neglected teenager who lives in a family where alcohol, violence and sex play the main role. He grows up to be a confused youngster which ends in a very aggressive act to break with his past.', 'The story of Liam, a neglected teenager who lives in a family where alcohol, violence and sex play the main role. He grows up to be a confused youngster which ends in a very aggressive act to break with his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZ9xz8ugGi5lxLnJlJwMnKyjxvO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:885246'),
  ('1057407925581271523', 'Sky', 1962, 'Drama, War', 'Takis Kanellopoulos', 'Takis Kanellopoulos, Giorgos Kitsopoulos', 'Aimilia Pitta, Faidon Georgitsis, Takis Emmanuel, Eleni Zafeiriou, Niki Triantafillidi, Costas Messaris, Stavros Tornes, Nikos Tsachiridis', null, 'During the cold spring of 1941, with Greece already under German occupation, a long-suffering squad of war-battered soldiers receives orders from the headquarters in Athens to fall back, leaving behind the Albanian Front. As the men retreat through the snow-covered landscapes of the bomb-scarred Greek countryside, the terrifying certainty that nothing will ever be the same again crushes their weary human souls.', 'During the cold spring of 1941, with Greece already under German occupation, a long-suffering squad of war-battered soldiers receives orders from the headquarters in Athens to fall back, leaving behind the Albanian Front. As the men retreat through the snow-covered landscapes of the bomb-scarred Greek countryside, the terrifying certainty that nothing will ever be the same again crushes their weary human souls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5OyJNlqUNPHZqFFwRGvvzBUYMX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198847'),
  ('1125216671377995578', 'Sky', 2015, 'Drama', 'Fabienne Berthaud, Nathalie Durand', 'Fabienne Berthaud, Pascal Arnold', 'Norman Reedus, Diane Kruger, Gilles Lellouche, Lena Dunham, Q''orianka Kilcher, Michelle Lombardo, Laurene Landon, Joshua Jackson', null, 'A woman embarks on a journey alone across the United States after fleeing from her violent husband.', 'A woman embarks on a journey alone across the United States after fleeing from her violent husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCMOtpzERbm065R03t8XbD5oogn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333367'),
  ('243494417265935694', 'Sky', 2026, 'Drama', 'Pridhvi Pericherla', 'Pridhvi Pericherla, Murali Krishnam Raju', 'Shruti Shetty, Anand Bharathi, Rakesh Master, Klk Mani, Murali Krishnam Raju', null, 'Modern relationships intertwine with career ambitions as adults navigate love and success. A gifted young musician''s emotional journey weaves through their interconnected lives.', 'Modern relationships intertwine with career ambitions as adults navigate love and success. A gifted young musician''s emotional journey weaves through their interconnected lives.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BMGMyMDdjMzctNmQxZC00ZTI4LWJkMzktZWQ1OWVjNzlhNDA2XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:sky-2026'),
  ('769648763030878979', 'Sky Above and Mud Beneath', 1961, 'Documentary', 'Pierre-Dominique Gaisseau', 'Pierre-Dominique Gaisseau', null, null, 'In September, 1959, six Europeans leave Cook''s Bay on the southern coast of Dutch New Guinea, now West Papua or Irian Jaya, to trek north to the far side of the island. The journey (450 miles, as a crow flies) across unmapped territory took seven months; three Muyu porters died. Near both coasts, the expedition met villagers who invited them to observe rituals and live with them. In the interior, all villagers kept them at bay, and they depended on air lifts from Hollandia for food and supplies. They climbed above 10,000 feet, built 14 bridges, and fought leeches and malaria. The narrator focuses on describing Stone Age savages, headhunters, and cannibals.', 'In September, 1959, six Europeans leave Cook''s Bay on the southern coast of Dutch New Guinea, now West Papua or Irian Jaya, to trek north to the far side of the island. The journey (450 miles, as a crow flies) across unmapped territory took seven months; three Muyu porters died. Near both coasts, the expedition met villagers who invited them to observe rituals and live with them. In the interior, all villagers kept them at bay, and they depended on air lifts from Hollandia for food and supplies. They climbed above 10,000 feet, built 14 bridges, and fought leeches and malaria. The narrator focuses on describing Stone Age savages, headhunters, and cannibals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNKcc97ZaoAGZvd00bWYJ5hKpp4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114507'),
  ('779665897584168914', 'Sky Captain and the World of Tomorrow', 2004, 'Mystery, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Kerry Conran, Eric Adkins, Marcia Gay', 'Kerry Conran', 'Jude Law, Gwyneth Paltrow, Angelina Jolie, Giovanni Ribisi, Michael Gambon, Bai Ling, Omid Djalili, Laurence Olivier', 'PG', 'When gigantic robots attack New York City, "Sky Captain" uses his private air force to fight them off. His ex-girlfriend, reporter Polly Perkins, has been investigating the recent disappearance of prominent scientists. Suspecting a link between the global robot attacks and missing men, Sky Captain and Polly decide to work together. They fly to the Himalayas in pursuit of the mysterious Dr. Totenkopf, the mastermind behind the robots.', 'When gigantic robots attack New York City, "Sky Captain" uses his private air force to fight them off. His ex-girlfriend, reporter Polly Perkins, has been investigating the recent disappearance of prominent scientists. Suspecting a link between the global robot attacks and missing men, Sky Captain and Polly decide to work together. They fly to the Himalayas in pursuit of the mysterious Dr. Totenkopf, the mastermind behind the robots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cO73CS7XKRPfGYh6G36StnhswQc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5137'),
  ('775324502471938019', 'Sky Fighters', 2005, 'Action, Adventure', 'Pascal Lebègue, Gérard Pirès', 'Gilles Malençon, Gérard Pirès', 'Benoît Magimel, Clovis Cornillac, Géraldine Pailhas, Alice Taglioni, Jean-Baptiste Puech, Christophe Reymond, Philippe Torreton, Rey Reyes', null, 'Two air force pilots prevent a terrorist attack on the Bastille Day celebrations in Paris.', 'Two air force pilots prevent a terrorist attack on the Bastille Day celebrations in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IMSZ2F4tfmkBIBguPWdlfpL1PV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10798'),
  ('605623981144463522', 'Sky Force', 2025, 'Action, Thriller, War, History', 'Santhana Krishnan Ravichandran, Abhishek Kapur, Sandeep Kewlani', 'Sandeep Kewlani, Carl Austin, Niren Bhatt', 'Veer Pahariya, Akshay Kumar, Nimrat Kaur, Sara Ali Khan, Sharad Kelkar, Mohit Chauhan, Manish Chaudhary, Naisha Khanna', null, 'In the 1965 Indo-Pak War, India faces a devastating surprise attack. Wing Commander Ahuja leads a retaliatory strike, but Squadron Leader Vijaya goes missing after a heroic solo engagement against a superior enemy jet. Ahuja spends 23 years seeking the truth and uncovering a cover-up.', 'In the 1965 Indo-Pak War, India faces a devastating surprise attack. Wing Commander Ahuja leads a retaliatory strike, but Squadron Leader Vijaya goes missing after a heroic solo engagement against a superior enemy jet. Ahuja spends 23 years seeking the truth and uncovering a cover-up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1KLUpaW7rbXhUm5SxG1lpPFFCJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1143407'),
  ('452349749317509208', 'Sky High', 1922, 'Western, Adventure', 'Lynn Reynolds, Benjamin H. Kline, George Webster', 'Lynn Reynolds', 'Tom Mix, J. Farrell MacDonald, Eva Novak, Sid Jordan, William Buckley, Adele Warner, Pat Chrisman, Wynn Mace', 'NR', 'A government agent investigates a ring that is smuggling Chinese aliens across the border from Mexico. His investigation takes him to the Grand Canyon. He finds a dazed girl wandering around who has become separated from her companions and is lost. He and the girl are soon found by her companions - the smuggling ring!', 'A government agent investigates a ring that is smuggling Chinese aliens across the border from Mexico. His investigation takes him to the Grand Canyon. He finds a dazed girl wandering around who has become separated from her companions and is lost. He and the girl are soon found by her companions - the smuggling ring!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gDYdtKZbgDLY8al8KGv7fLx61jQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127277'),
  ('248698519933585440', 'Sky High', 2003, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Drama', 'Ryuhei Kitamura', 'Isao Kiriyama, Ryuichi Takatsu', 'Yumiko Shaku, Takao Osawa, Shosuke Tanihara, Naho Toda, Hiromasa Taguchi, Aya Okamoto, Maiko Yamada, Yuka Itaya', 'R', 'A serial-murderer is on the loose who just so happens to also be removing the hearts of his victims and taking them with him. His victims however, are not merely random humans as thought by the police. They are in fact, the past and present guardians of the gateway of the afterlife.On the day he is to be married, Detective Kanzaki, who happens to be on the case, discovers that his fiancé Mina has been murdered with her heart also missing. He also learns that the killers are Kudo, a geneticist, and his evil secretary Rei. The two are trying to obtain six hearts from the guardians so that they may call forth a horde of demons from the Gate of Rage and have their every desire granted. Only problem is, once they open the gate the entire world will be covered in darkness.', 'A serial-murderer is on the loose who just so happens to also be removing the hearts of his victims and taking them with him. His victims however, are not merely random humans as thought by the police. They are in fact, the past and present guardians of the gateway of the afterlife.On the day he is to be married, Detective Kanzaki, who happens to be on the case, discovers that his fiancé Mina has been murdered with her heart also missing. He also learns that the killers are Kudo, a geneticist, and his evil secretary Rei. The two are trying to obtain six hearts from the guardians so that they may call forth a horde of demons from the Gate of Rage and have their every desire granted. Only problem is, once they open the gate the entire world will be covered in darkness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zpyHnfykViMlE0x5gREq0X2yqc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5846'),
  ('705623850554421561', 'Sky High', 2005, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Mike Mitchell, Shelly Johnson', 'Bob Schooley, Mark McCorkle, Paul Hernandez', 'Michael Angarano, Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Kurt Russell, Kelly Preston, Danielle Panabaker, Bruce Campbell, Lynda Carter, Kevin Heffernan', 'PG', 'Set in a world where superheroes are commonly known and accepted, young Will Stronghold, the son of the Commander and Jetstream, tries to find a balance between being a normal teenager and an extraordinary being.', 'Set in a world where superheroes are commonly known and accepted, young Will Stronghold, the son of the Commander and Jetstream, tries to find a balance between being a normal teenager and an extraordinary being.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBB0XNMwvYvWpo67EcxQqKMoMKf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11459'),
  ('233653713312086658', 'Sky High', 2020, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Daniel Calparsoro, Josu Inchaustegui', 'Jorge Guerricaechevarría', 'Miguel Herrán, Carolina Yuste, Asia Ortega, Luis Tosar, Fernando Cayo, Richard Holmes, Patricia Vico, César Mateo', 'NR', 'A commentary on Spanish society dressed as a thriller about the misadventures of a gang of young petty criminals after the real estate crash.', 'A commentary on Spanish society dressed as a thriller about the misadventures of a gang of young petty criminals after the real estate crash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUT5Fa1TskzkTmATpYGiW49PTEg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:651589'),
  ('377709335490455182', 'Sky Hook', 2000, 'Drama, War', 'Ljubiša Samardžić', 'Đorđe Milosavljević, Srđan Koljević', 'Nebojša Glogovac, Ana Sofrenović, Nikola Kojo, Ivan Jevtović, Dragan Bjelogrlić, Milena Dravić, Katarina Žutić, Nikola Đuričko', null, 'Belgrade during the height of the war Yugoslavia in 1999. Kaja struggles with daily destruction and the constant threat of being drafted, but also with his impending divorce from his wife Tijana, who wants to emigrate with their son.', 'Belgrade during the height of the war Yugoslavia in 1999. Kaja struggles with daily destruction and the constant threat of being drafted, but also with his impending divorce from his wife Tijana, who wants to emigrate with their son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mwBdKiwlxGiYT38SzO4Zp4kGGZw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110366'),
  ('875069556078706420', 'Sky Hunter', 2017, 'Action', 'Jerry Lee', 'Dong Qun', 'Jerry Lee, Fan Bingbing, Wang Qianyuan, David Blazejko, Li Jiahang, Leon Lee, Guo Mingyu, Ye Liu', null, 'An elite group of Chinese pilots must take part in a dangerous mission to thwart a terrorist plot and resolve a hostage situation.', 'An elite group of Chinese pilots must take part in a dangerous mission to thwart a terrorist plot and resolve a hostage situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kgs4nTRhvI4ZV8M1gxxQalzoYZi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:478826'),
  ('1015088914198801139', 'Sky of Love', 2007, 'Romance, Drama', 'Natsuki Imai, Hideo Yamamoto', 'Mutsuki Watanabe', 'Yui Aragaki, Haruma Miura, Keisuke Koide, Karina, Asami Usuda, Aoi Nakamura, Haru, Ryuji Yamamoto', null, 'Mika is a fresh high school student who starts texting a mysterious boy. She is shocked when he reveals who he is - Hiro, a delinquent attending her school. What she doesn''t know is that Hiro isn''t as bad as he seems.', 'Mika is a fresh high school student who starts texting a mysterious boy. She is shocked when he reveals who he is - Hiro, a delinquent attending her school. What she doesn''t know is that Hiro isn''t as bad as he seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6BprkiklQdGkXcQutRKxYNBlpe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40713'),
  ('347892807115526670', 'Sky on Fire', 2016, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Royce Lam, Ringo Lam Ling-Tung, Choi Man-Lung', 'Ringo Lam Ling-Tung, Hiroshi Fukazawa, Shen Shi-Qi', 'Daniel Wu, Zhang Ruoyun, Zhang Jingchu, Joseph Chang, Amber Kuo Tsai-Chieh, Fan Kuang-yao, Ba Tu, Li Haitao', null, 'The chief security officer at a top-secret medical facility finds himself caught in an explosive battle when a young thief and his accomplices steal a groundbreaking curative medicine. After discovering the true origins of the medicine, the officer must decide who he can trust to protect the cure from falling into the wrong hands, and prevent an all-out war from bringing the city to its knees.', 'The chief security officer at a top-secret medical facility finds himself caught in an explosive battle when a young thief and his accomplices steal a groundbreaking curative medicine. After discovering the true origins of the medicine, the officer must decide who he can trust to protect the cure from falling into the wrong hands, and prevent an all-out war from bringing the city to its knees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmxWh9e7y2pvhnCZNaSzW5NpT3R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427433'),
  ('451485259052117209', 'Sky Pirates', 1986, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Action', 'Colin Eggleston, John Powditch, Stuart Wood', 'Peter Herbert', 'John Hargreaves, Max Phipps, Bill Hunter, Simon Chilvers, Meredith Phillips, Tommy Dysart, Peter Cummins, Alex Scott', null, 'Air force Lieutenant Harris starts for a flight to Boa Boa, on board Reverend Mitchell with a box containing a part of a top-secret extraterrestrial key. They get lost in a supernatural storm and find themselves after an emergency landing in kind of a Bermuda triangle, 5,000 miles off their course. Home again, no one believes Harris'' story, and his crew suspiciously denies it too. Harris is thrown in jail, but manages to escape. Together with Mitchell''s daughter he seeks the lost part of the key and its secret.', 'Air force Lieutenant Harris starts for a flight to Boa Boa, on board Reverend Mitchell with a box containing a part of a top-secret extraterrestrial key. They get lost in a supernatural storm and find themselves after an emergency landing in kind of a Bermuda triangle, 5,000 miles off their course. Home again, no one believes Harris'' story, and his crew suspiciously denies it too. Harris is thrown in jail, but manages to escape. Together with Mitchell''s daughter he seeks the lost part of the key and its secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tn3AodfQXPETFGk78tg9EvbT778.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86298'),
  ('223793959503254988', 'Sky Riders', 1976, 'Action, Adventure', 'Douglas Hickox, Greg MacGillivray, Ousama Rawi', 'Jack DeWitt, Stanley Mann, Garry Michael White', 'James Coburn, Susannah York, Robert Culp, Charles Aznavour, Harry Andrews, John Beck, Zouzou, Kenneth Griffith', 'PG', 'When an industrialist''s wife and kids are kidnapped by terrorists in Greece, the woman''s ex-husband comes to the rescue with a plan involving hang gliders.', 'When an industrialist''s wife and kids are kidnapped by terrorists in Greece, the woman''s ex-husband comes to the rescue with a plan involving hang gliders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEzWDNm8IkyJvCiaAQBxYhGzk9F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42551'),
  ('1076832522378119341', 'Sky Scrappers', 1928, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Walt Disney', null, null, null, '''Sky Scrappers'' finds three characters -- Oswald, a Big Pete-style bully and a Minnie-ish female character -- all engaged in knockabout humour on a building site.', '''Sky Scrappers'' finds three characters -- Oswald, a Big Pete-style bully and a Minnie-ish female character -- all engaged in knockabout humour on a building site.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNYuw1sDbYKkhoGu4toeG5VfI1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190029'),
  ('455852498959280509', 'Sky Sharks', 2020, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Marc Fehse, Olaf Markmann, Marco J. Riedl', 'Marc Fehse, Carsten Fehse, A.D. Morel', 'Barbara Nedeljakova, Eva Habermann, Michaela Schaffrath, Micaela Schäfer, Tony Todd, Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, Naomi Grossman, Amanda Bearse', 'R', 'A team of Arctic geologists stumble across an abandoned laboratory in which the Nazis developed an incredible and brutal secret weapon during the final months of WW2. Deep in the ice, they accidentally awake a deadly army of flying zombie sharks ridden by genetically mutated, undead super-humans, who are unleashed into the skies, wreaking their bloodthirsty revenge on any aircraft that takes to the air. An elite task force is assembled to take on this deadly threat and stop the Sky Sharks from conquering the air, but as time runs out, the task force realises they will have to fight fire with fire, and the stage is set for the greatest flying super-mutant zombie shark air battle the world has ever seen....', 'A team of Arctic geologists stumble across an abandoned laboratory in which the Nazis developed an incredible and brutal secret weapon during the final months of WW2. Deep in the ice, they accidentally awake a deadly army of flying zombie sharks ridden by genetically mutated, undead super-humans, who are unleashed into the skies, wreaking their bloodthirsty revenge on any aircraft that takes to the air. An elite task force is assembled to take on this deadly threat and stop the Sky Sharks from conquering the air, but as time runs out, the task force realises they will have to fight fire with fire, and the stage is set for the greatest flying super-mutant zombie shark air battle the world has ever seen....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihkbceq6vQlEVaIvHTu2tM6z0Do.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320846'),
  ('151228208234237797', 'Sky Trooper', 1942, 'Animation', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash, Billy Bletcher', 'NR', 'Donald is stuck on KP at an air training base. Sergeant Pete gives him a huge pile of potatoes to peel first, then gives him some tests: close your eyes and touch fingers, pin the tail on the airplane. He finally gets sent aloft, only to discover it''s a parachute jump. Eventually, both Donald and Pete end up falling with no chutes and a bomb.', 'Donald is stuck on KP at an air training base. Sergeant Pete gives him a huge pile of potatoes to peel first, then gives him some tests: close your eyes and touch fingers, pin the tail on the airplane. He finally gets sent aloft, only to discover it''s a parachute jump. Eventually, both Donald and Pete end up falling with no chutes and a bomb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQY9t7q4nqQVtZ3cQTMBTlvlP1f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64695'),
  ('262593291216276051', 'Sky West and Crooked', 1966, 'Drama, Romance', 'John Mills', 'Mary Hayley Bell, John Prebble', 'Hayley Mills, Ian McShane, Annette Crosbie, Laurence Naismith, Geoffrey Bayldon, Pauline Jameson, Norman Bird, Juney Ellis', null, 'A young, lonely, emotionally challenged teenage girl finds solace in burying dead animals after the sudden traumatic death of a childhood friend 10 years earlier.', 'A young, lonely, emotionally challenged teenage girl finds solace in burying dead animals after the sudden traumatic death of a childhood friend 10 years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2roGi2BGSBE91cDcP3SxxeZyp2v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192990'),
  ('155955707947680780', 'Sky Without Stars', 1955, 'Drama, Romance', 'Helmut Käutner, Kurt Hasse', 'Helmut Käutner', 'Eva Kotthaus, Erik Schumann, Rainer Stang, Erich Ponto, Lucie Höflich, Georg Thomalla, Gustav Knuth, Camilla Spira', null, 'Anna is a factory worker in East Germany, but her five-year-old son Jochen lives with his grandparents in the West. Anna wants him to live with her, so she abducts him. Along the way she meets Carl, who helps her cross the border, and they fall in love.', 'Anna is a factory worker in East Germany, but her five-year-old son Jochen lives with his grandparents in the West. Anna wants him to live with her, so she abducts him. Along the way she meets Carl, who helps her cross the border, and they fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ah0wP1nPu12bmTnrWQQaUO7bXlX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113095'),
  ('366457529933598082', 'Skybound', 2017, 'Action, Thriller', 'Alex Tavakoli', 'Alex Tavakoli', 'Scarlett Hefner, Gavin Stenhouse, Rick Cosnett, Tyler Fayose, Carla Carolina Pimentel, Morten Suurballe, Lars Walther', null, 'Five friends on a small airplane mysteriously lose their radio connection on a trip from New York to LA. As they continue their flight, they''re forced to assume that a major disaster happened on the ground. They discover a stowaway, Erik, who urges them not to land at any cost. Before they run out of fuel, they must find out the truth.', 'Five friends on a small airplane mysteriously lose their radio connection on a trip from New York to LA. As they continue their flight, they''re forced to assume that a major disaster happened on the ground. They discover a stowaway, Erik, who urges them not to land at any cost. Before they run out of fuel, they must find out the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6Hhs4XnJfwPGrZ51klFw5XK2Xz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472921'),
  ('1042615420083389138', 'Skyfall', 2012, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Sam Mendes, Tufan Şimşekcan, Roger Deakins', 'Robert Wade, Neal Purvis, John Logan', 'Daniel Craig, Judi Dench, Javier Bardem, Ralph Fiennes, Naomie Harris, Bérénice Marlohe, Albert Finney, Ben Whishaw', 'PG-13', 'When Bond''s latest assignment goes gravely wrong, agents around the world are exposed and MI6 headquarters is attacked. While M faces challenges to her authority and position from Gareth Mallory, the new Chairman of the Intelligence and Security Committee, it''s up to Bond, aided only by field agent Eve, to locate the mastermind behind the attack.', 'When Bond''s latest assignment goes gravely wrong, agents around the world are exposed and MI6 headquarters is attacked. While M faces challenges to her authority and position from Gareth Mallory, the new Chairman of the Intelligence and Security Committee, it''s up to Bond, aided only by field agent Eve, to locate the mastermind behind the attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d0IVecFQvsGdSbnMAHqiYsNYaJT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37724'),
  ('77379942685843106', 'Skyfire', 2019, 'Action, Adventure', 'Simon West, Alan Caudillo', 'Bu Wei, Sidney King', 'Wang Xueqi, Hannah Quinlivan, Shawn Dou, Jason Isaacs, Shi Liang, Alice Rietveld, Ji Lingchen, Yiqing Li', 'PG-13', 'Tianhuo Island is as beautiful as a paradise. It almost makes people forget that it is located in the "Ring of Fire" the world-famous Pacific Rim volcanic belt. The volcano erupts, and the fates of the people on the island are entangled.', 'Tianhuo Island is as beautiful as a paradise. It almost makes people forget that it is located in the "Ring of Fire" the world-famous Pacific Rim volcanic belt. The volcano erupts, and the fates of the people on the island are entangled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDf8M1yMwvBVe8VtOKxCpOog8CF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:604872'),
