  ('76337039846957489', 'Skyscraper', 1996, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Raymond Martino, Adeeb K. Samhat, Maurice K. McGuire', 'William Applegate Jr., Joseph John Barmettler', 'Anna Nicole Smith, Richard Steinmetz, Charles M. Huber, Jonathan Fuller, Branko Cikatic, Calvin Levels, Deirdre Haj, Lee de Broux', 'R', 'A helicopter charter turns deadly when the pilot finds that she is on a building held by terrorists. It is up to her and her husband to save the hostages.', 'A helicopter charter turns deadly when the pilot finds that she is on a building held by terrorists. It is up to her and her husband to save the hostages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3bovjQgkXryuo5dyegS0ImEzfz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42911'),
