  ('83426506735935119', 'Skyscraper Live', 2026, 'Adventure, Documentary', 'Joe DeMaio, Brett Lowell', null, 'Alex Honnold, Elle Duncan, Emily Harrington, Mark Rober, Sanni McCandless, Colby Lopez, Pete Woods', 'PG', 'No ropes. No fear. Free solo legend Alex Honnold risks it all in a high-stakes, live ascent of one of the world''s tallest skyscrapers in Taipei, Taiwan.', 'No ropes. No fear. Free solo legend Alex Honnold risks it all in a high-stakes, live ascent of one of the world''s tallest skyscrapers in Taipei, Taiwan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbURquxQUJXFfeqpjzmHekRmyqb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1599090'),
  ('217382878371100239', 'Skyscraper Souls', 1932, 'Drama, Romance', 'Edgar Selwyn', null, 'Warren William, Maureen O''Sullivan, Gregory Ratoff, Anita Page, Norman Foster, Verree Teasdale, George Barbier, Jean Hersholt', 'NR', 'After bank president David Dwight makes a vast loan to himself to build a remarkable skyscraper, his board questions the propriety of the loan. Despite the devotion of longtime mistress Sarah, the ruthless David, while seeking bank mergers to protect his building, tries to seduce Sarah''s secretary, Lynn. David then agrees to a plot by a bank board member to inflate his bank''s stock and sell short — just before the market crashes.', 'After bank president David Dwight makes a vast loan to himself to build a remarkable skyscraper, his board questions the propriety of the loan. Despite the devotion of longtime mistress Sarah, the ruthless David, while seeking bank mergers to protect his building, tries to seduce Sarah''s secretary, Lynn. David then agrees to a plot by a bank board member to inflate his bank''s stock and sell short — just before the market crashes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2z5AmWdzlJbKfTVtMHUsHM0aQW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72997'),
  ('835915382720627253', 'Skyscraper Symphony', 1929, 'Documentary', 'Robert Florey', null, null, null, 'A montage of the skyscrapers of Manhattan opens with a succession of stationary views of the upper portions of numerous buildings. This is followed by a wide variety of fluid shots, which also begin to show more and more of the surrounding city, in addition to the skyscrapers themselves.', 'A montage of the skyscrapers of Manhattan opens with a succession of stationary views of the upper portions of numerous buildings. This is followed by a wide variety of fluid shots, which also begin to show more and more of the surrounding city, in addition to the skyscrapers themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eiBkaxR5psPXrZtX25ZabRaMrON.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190305'),
  ('227443822971115224', 'Skywalkers: A Love Story', 2024, 'Documentary, Romance, Thriller', 'Jeff Zimbalist, Maria Bukhonina, Pablo Rojas Castillo', 'Jeff Zimbalist', 'Angela Nikolau, Ivan Beerkus', 'R', 'Two real-life daredevils test the limits of their love and trust by illegally scaling one of the world''s tallest buildings to perform an acrobatic stunt.', 'Two real-life daredevils test the limits of their love and trust by illegally scaling one of the world''s tallest buildings to perform an acrobatic stunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kD23EdSc8DnZVos4woQps0a7rJ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1214488'),
