  ('298339100179751166', 'Slave Girls', 1967, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Michael Carreras, Michael Reed', 'Michael Carreras', 'Martine Beswick, Edina Ronay, Michael Latimer, Stephanie Randall, Carol White, Alexandra Stevenson, Yvonne Horner, Sydney Bromley', null, 'Leader of a tribe of amazon women, Queen Kari, has vanquished a rival tribe and rules them with savage ruthlessness and cruel arrogance. A hunter stumbles onto the enclave and falls for one of the slaves, so unleashing the anger and envy of the possessive, sadistic Queen.', 'Leader of a tribe of amazon women, Queen Kari, has vanquished a rival tribe and rules them with savage ruthlessness and cruel arrogance. A hunter stumbles onto the enclave and falls for one of the slaves, so unleashing the anger and envy of the possessive, sadistic Queen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6onVgaC7pehJpAVGj0U5u6EbjC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39308'),
  ('1077835574821591057', 'Slave Girls from Beyond Infinity', 1987, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Ken Dixon, Thomas L. Callaway, Kenneth H. Wiatrak', 'Ken Dixon', 'Elizabeth Kaitan, Cindy Beal, Don Scribner, Brinke Stevens, Carl Horner, Kirk Graves, Randolph Roehbling, Bud Graves', 'R', 'In the future, two slaves in a distant galaxy escape prison and crash-land on a strange planet. They meet Zed, whose hospitality attempts to hide the fact they are to be hunted for sport. Armed only with knives and their wits, the girls must battle their way across the jungle to a hidden arms cache before Zed catches and kills them.', 'In the future, two slaves in a distant galaxy escape prison and crash-land on a strange planet. They meet Zed, whose hospitality attempts to hide the fact they are to be hunted for sport. Armed only with knives and their wits, the girls must battle their way across the jungle to a hidden arms cache before Zed catches and kills them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPgKg7hBJNrZ9Iu105ztJKo7r1i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27462'),
  ('1038009666153402649', 'Slave of the Cannibal God', 1978, 'Adventure, Horror', 'Sergio Martino, Giancarlo Ferrando', 'Sergio Martino, Cesare Frugoni', 'Ursula Andress, Stacy Keach, Claudio Cassinelli, Antonio Marsina, Franco Fantasia, Lanfranco Spinola, Carlo Longhi, Luigina Rocchi', 'R', 'A woman and her brother fly to New Guinea to look for a lost expedition, led by her husband, which has vanished in the great jungle.', 'A woman and her brother fly to New Guinea to look for a lost expedition, led by her husband, which has vanished in the great jungle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9l5LRfNkWzxzNOFRJt7E5PYDO90.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39973'),
  ('1015948218562667906', 'Slaves', 1977, 'Action, Thriller, Mystery', 'Jesús Franco', 'Erwin C. Dietrich', 'Lina Romay, Martine Stedil, Vítor Mendes, Esther Moser, Peggy Markoff, Aida Vargas, Jesús Franco, Raymond Hardy', null, 'A brothel owner is questioned in the disappearance of the daughter of a wealthy man after she is still not returned, or told of her possible whereabouts, after the $5,000,000 ransom was paid.', 'A brothel owner is questioned in the disappearance of the daughter of a wealthy man after she is still not returned, or told of her possible whereabouts, after the $5,000,000 ransom was paid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aN6Fxu8w0T1yphZVWQgiadFV2kr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196184'),
  ('911381503596638355', 'Slaves of New York', 1989, 'Drama', 'James Ivory, Tony Pierce-Roberts, Richard Hawley', 'Tama Janowitz', 'Bernadette Peters, Chris Sarandon, Mary Beth Hurt, Madeleine Potter, Adam Coleman Howard, Charles McCaughan, Mercedes Ruehl, Joe Leeway', 'R', 'Meet the denizens of New York City: artists, prostitutes, saints, and seers. All are aspiring toward either fame or oblivion while hoping for love and acceptance. Instead they find high rent, faithless partners, and dead-end careers.', 'Meet the denizens of New York City: artists, prostitutes, saints, and seers. All are aspiring toward either fame or oblivion while hoping for love and acceptance. Instead they find high rent, faithless partners, and dead-end careers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dftp493orT07ITbw77UgVlHz4ox.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49788'),
  ('1069449580901754880', 'Slaves to the Underground', 1997, 'Comedy, Music, Drama', 'Kristine Peterson, Zoran Hochstätter', 'Bill Cody', 'Molly Gross, Jason Bortz, Marisa Ryan, Natacha La Ferriere, Bob Neuwirth, Claudia Rossi, Bill Johns', null, 'The grunge girl band "No Exits" is just about to get a record deal. At this time Jimmy is appearing again, the former boy-friend of the band guitarist Shelly. She had left him because his friend had raped her. But he doesn''t know that - up to now. Shelly has fallen in love with the band singer Suzy in the meantime. But she still loves Jimmy, too. So she moves to him again, what Suzy doesn''t like that all. Especially because she is becoming a feminist.', 'The grunge girl band "No Exits" is just about to get a record deal. At this time Jimmy is appearing again, the former boy-friend of the band guitarist Shelly. She had left him because his friend had raped her. But he doesn''t know that - up to now. Shelly has fallen in love with the band singer Suzy in the meantime. But she still loves Jimmy, too. So she moves to him again, what Suzy doesn''t like that all. Especially because she is becoming a feminist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/auTfHdzTCLTqRsA3BTDGFwFn6EZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59939'),
  ('301298097303169088', 'Slaxx', 2020, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Elza Kephart, Maxime Giroux, Steve Asselin', 'Elza Kephart, Patricia Gomez Zlatar', 'Romane Denis, Brett Donahue, Sehar Bhojani, Kenny Wong, Tianna Nori, Jessica B. Hill, Erica Anderson, Hanneke Talbot', null, 'When a possessed pair of jeans begins to kill the staff of a trendy clothing store, it is up to Libby, an idealistic young salesclerk, to stop its bloody rampage.', 'When a possessed pair of jeans begins to kill the staff of a trendy clothing store, it is up to Libby, an idealistic young salesclerk, to stop its bloody rampage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Ef5cStkpOlOawApzzgdpIr0r8M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:605133'),
  ('213892104334414090', 'Slayer', 2006, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Kevin VanHook, Matt Steinauer', 'Kevin VanHook', 'Casper Van Dien, Tony Plana, Kevin Grevioux, Jennifer O''Dell, Alexis Cruz, Joyce Giraud, Ray Park, Danny Trejo', null, 'An elite commando squad led by longtime soldier buddies Hawk and Grives run afoul of lethal and powerful vampires in a South American rain forest. Grieves gets turned into a vampire and becomes leader of a savage roving herd. Moreover, Hawk has to rescue his scientist ex-wife Dr. Laurie Williams from the bloodsuckers'' evil clutches.', 'An elite commando squad led by longtime soldier buddies Hawk and Grives run afoul of lethal and powerful vampires in a South American rain forest. Grieves gets turned into a vampire and becomes leader of a savage roving herd. Moreover, Hawk has to rescue his scientist ex-wife Dr. Laurie Williams from the bloodsuckers'' evil clutches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQAolA5HbYTpuexCU1xKmecCb34.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65823'),
  ('882513598426062348', 'Slayers', 2022, 'Horror, Comedy, Fantasy', 'K. Asher Levin, Owen Levelle, Mykel Salazar', 'Zack Imbrogno, K. Asher Levin', 'Thomas Jane, Abigail Breslin, Malin Åkerman, Kara Hayward, Lydia Hearst, Adam Ambruso, Ashley Reyes, Julia Sandström', 'R', 'A group of superstar influencers are drawn to a reclusive billionaire''s mansion only to find themselves trapped in the lair of an evil vampire. The only way out is to be saved by a famous online gamer and an old school vampire hunter.', 'A group of superstar influencers are drawn to a reclusive billionaire''s mansion only to find themselves trapped in the lair of an evil vampire. The only way out is to be saved by a famous online gamer and an old school vampire hunter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1dgNc7FB5RMm6w4D6S0UpZhsUbW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:888097'),
  ('688191831861346165', 'Slayers Gorgeous', 1998, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Kouji Aso, Katsuyoshi Kobayashi, Katsuyuki Ohtaki', 'Hajime Kanzaka', 'Megumi Hayashibara, Maria Kawamura, Akira Kamiya, Junpei Takiguchi, Kaneto Shiozawa, Kyoko Hikami, Asako Dodo, Hiroshi Naka', null, 'Lina Inverse and her sidekick Naga the Serpent are happily enjoying lunch when the entire town ducks under cover before an invasion of Marlene Culvert and her legion of bloodthirsty dragons. The cause of the invasion? Marlene is in a feud with her father, the king, over her allowance. Lina leaps into action to defend the village against Marlene, her tetrad knights and her dragons, but her dependable Dragon Slave spell fails her. Right when she thinks she has won, the real battle has just begun.', 'Lina Inverse and her sidekick Naga the Serpent are happily enjoying lunch when the entire town ducks under cover before an invasion of Marlene Culvert and her legion of bloodthirsty dragons. The cause of the invasion? Marlene is in a feud with her father, the king, over her allowance. Lina leaps into action to defend the village against Marlene, her tetrad knights and her dragons, but her dependable Dragon Slave spell fails her. Right when she thinks she has won, the real battle has just begun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJWFXtqQl0DU0r5cAqM2DCNFtOF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41365'),
  ('817307711010080779', 'Slayers Great', 1997, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Hiroshi Watanabe, Katsuyuki Ootaki, Katsuyoshi Kobayashi', null, 'Megumi Hayashibara, Maria Kawamura, Kikuko Inoue, Takehito Koyasu, Norio Wakamoto, Kaneto Shiozawa, Shigezô Sasaoka, Minoru Inaba', null, 'All Laia Einburg wants for her golem-making father Galia and her equally ambitious brother Huey is to end a long running feud. But her world gets turned upside down when short-stature Lina Inverse and overly endowed Naga the Serpent save Laia from a rampaging golem. A grateful, but smitten, Galia asks Lina to be a model for his work. Not to be outdone, Huey makes a similar request to Naga. The results are towering remote-controlled golems in the image of our favorite sorceresses! Huey gets all the proportions right, but Galia''s taste is just weird. Adding insult to injury, Galia turns Lina into a magical battery pack! Officially, Lords Haizen and Granion commissioned these golems for a contest to determine the ruler of the city of Stoner. But the lords are secretly planning to use the golems as prototypes for an army of conquest! Can Lina and Naga save the city from tyranny?', 'All Laia Einburg wants for her golem-making father Galia and her equally ambitious brother Huey is to end a long running feud. But her world gets turned upside down when short-stature Lina Inverse and overly endowed Naga the Serpent save Laia from a rampaging golem. A grateful, but smitten, Galia asks Lina to be a model for his work. Not to be outdone, Huey makes a similar request to Naga. The results are towering remote-controlled golems in the image of our favorite sorceresses! Huey gets all the proportions right, but Galia''s taste is just weird. Adding insult to injury, Galia turns Lina into a magical battery pack! Officially, Lords Haizen and Granion commissioned these golems for a contest to determine the ruler of the city of Stoner. But the lords are secretly planning to use the golems as prototypes for an army of conquest! Can Lina and Naga save the city from tyranny?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aMoC3UJ2QLqJj8MOGsoNhthdMtm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125510'),
  ('1033801593524545427', 'Slayers Premium', 2001, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Junichi Sato, Kouichi Shimomura, Tetsuya Kumagai', 'Junichi Sato', 'Megumi Hayashibara, Yasunori Matsumoto, Hikaru Midorikawa, Akira Ishida, Maria Kawamura, Takahiro Sakurai, Isamu Tanonaka, Yuri Shiratori', 'PG', 'Lina and Gourry visited the town in a certain beach. In that town, a mysterious incident which is that the person who had eaten the octopus was not able to speak the languages other than the octopus language happened frequently. And, Gourry who does not know the incident eats slices of raw octopus, and he cannot speak words other than the octopus language. Ameria and Zelgadiss who came there by chance are involved in the trouble, too and the fight with the clan of the octopus which lives in the beach starts.', 'Lina and Gourry visited the town in a certain beach. In that town, a mysterious incident which is that the person who had eaten the octopus was not able to speak the languages other than the octopus language happened frequently. And, Gourry who does not know the incident eats slices of raw octopus, and he cannot speak words other than the octopus language. Ameria and Zelgadiss who came there by chance are involved in the trouble, too and the fight with the clan of the octopus which lives in the beach starts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lwCdytw5DlyKvAThPYZChT1oad7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125513'),
  ('424763818258250924', 'Slayers Return', 1996, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Katsuyuki Ootaki, Hiroshi Watanabe, Yoshinobu Yamakawa', null, 'Megumi Hayashibara, Maria Kawamura, Akiko Hiramatsu, Akio Otsuka, Chafurin, Minoru Inaba, Maya Okamoto, Kenji Utsumi', null, 'Lina Inverse and Naga the White Serpent are back! What begins as a routine bandit-stomping turns into the adventure of a lifetime involving magical golems, an ancient Elven weapon and even someone bent on destroying the world. It''s a predicament only Lina and Naga could get themselves in to.', 'Lina Inverse and Naga the White Serpent are back! What begins as a routine bandit-stomping turns into the adventure of a lifetime involving magical golems, an ancient Elven weapon and even someone bent on destroying the world. It''s a predicament only Lina and Naga could get themselves in to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNQx9YD4nxpcWvriVm1paIxbMwB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125521'),
  ('638725672603314048', 'Slayers: The Motion Picture', 1995, 'Animation, Fantasy, Comedy, Adventure', 'Hiroshi Watanabe, Kazuo Yamazaki, Takahiro Yoshimatsu', 'Kazuo Yamazaki', 'Megumi Hayashibara, Maria Kawamura, Chafurin, Keiji Fujiwara, Tessyo Genda, Daisuke Gori, Kazuhiko Kishino, Osamu Saka', null, 'Plagued by a recurring dream,​ master thief and sorceress Lina Inverse discovers ancient evil and lovers cruelly parted.​ Dragged into a vortex of time,​ she must fight to restore history to its proper course.​ But what will she do when the fearsome power of the Dragon Slave spell fails her as she tries to change the past and save the future!', 'Plagued by a recurring dream,​ master thief and sorceress Lina Inverse discovers ancient evil and lovers cruelly parted.​ Dragged into a vortex of time,​ she must fight to restore history to its proper course.​ But what will she do when the fearsome power of the Dragon Slave spell fails her as she tries to change the past and save the future!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVW5kWOp97tu8UQ48XeKbgfNFY2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35105'),
  ('779976115896979074', 'SLC Punk', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime, Music', 'James Merendino, Greg Littlewood, Matias Alvarez', 'James Merendino', 'Matthew Lillard, Michael A. Goorjian, Annabeth Gish, Jennifer Lien, Christopher McDonald, Devon Sawa, Jason Segel, Adam Pascal', 'R', 'Two former geeks become 1980s punks, then party and go to concerts while deciding what to do with their lives.', 'Two former geeks become 1980s punks, then party and go to concerts while deciding what to do with their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7u3IZPuIOPjICi55K7cJgzV3e3B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6396'),
  ('1096488194135945820', 'Sledgehammer', 1983, 'Horror, Thriller', 'David A. Prior, Salim Kimaz', 'David A. Prior', 'Ted Prior, Linda McGill, John Eastman, Janine Scheer, Tim Aguilar, Sandy Brooke, Stephen Wright, Michael Shanahan', null, 'A young boy murders his mother and her lover with a hammer. Ten years later, a wave of teenage murders plagues the same area.', 'A young boy murders his mother and her lover with a hammer. Ten years later, a wave of teenage murders plagues the same area.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ut7uswc6mg0SYlPjD4nbRZ8AlZ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5751'),
  ('1070734809403205201', 'Sleep', 1964, 'Documentary', 'Andy Warhol', null, 'John Giorno', null, 'Footage of John Giorno sleeping for five hours.', 'Footage of John Giorno sleeping for five hours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wdycadfJt5PLhTmWPLZpOVK45ur.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256222'),
  ('6661275459607056', 'Sleep', 2020, 'Horror', 'Michael Venus, Marius von Felbert', 'Thomas Friedrich, Michael Venus', 'Gro Swantje Kohlhof, Sandra Hüller, August Schmölzer, Marion Kracht, Agata Buzek, Max Hubacher, Martina Schöne-Radunski, Katharina Behrens', null, 'Mona’s days are filled with concern for her mother, a woman broken by her belief that her nightmares are real. In search of answers, Mona arrives in a village where she encounters an old family curse in a strange hotel.', 'Mona’s days are filled with concern for her mother, a woman broken by her belief that her nightmares are real. In search of answers, Mona arrives in a village where she encounters an old family curse in a strange hotel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/flaGeWKGxklavxORPZB8RBPw2oy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:663993'),
  ('695713958738487868', 'Sleep', 2023, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jason Yu, Lee Hyung-seob, Kim Tae-soo', 'Jason Yu', 'Jung Yu-mi, Lee Sun-kyun, Kim Guk-hee, Lee Kyung-jin, Yoon Kyung-ho, Kim Keum-soon, Kim Jun, Lee Dong-chan', null, 'A pregnant wife who becomes worried about her husband’s sleeping habits. What starts out as some light sleep-talking soon escalates to unexpectedly grotesque behaviour. They consult a sleep clinic without success and as his nightmarish behaviour escalates, they desperately seek help from a shaman.', 'A pregnant wife who becomes worried about her husband’s sleeping habits. What starts out as some light sleep-talking soon escalates to unexpectedly grotesque behaviour. They consult a sleep clinic without success and as his nightmarish behaviour escalates, they desperately seek help from a shaman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4d90lpmSTLoCP9tkBU7QAQOhh0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:964592'),
  ('309456448505251302', 'Sleep Dealer', 2008, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Alex Rivera, Lisa Rinzler', 'David Riker, Alex Rivera', 'Leonor Varela, Jacob Vargas, Luis Fernando Peña, Metztli Adamina, José Concepción Macías, Tenoch Huerta Mejía, Giovanna Zacarías, Gregg Lucas', null, 'Set in a near-future, militarized world marked by closed borders, virtual labor and a global digital network that joins minds and experiences, three strangers risk their lives to connect with each other and break the barriers of technology.', 'Set in a near-future, militarized world marked by closed borders, virtual labor and a global digital network that joins minds and experiences, three strangers risk their lives to connect with each other and break the barriers of technology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kFXQ4oMJkXAWjyo7Tr5GrLjmk61.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20764'),
  ('689253670340845831', 'Sleep Tight', 2011, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Pablo Rosso, Jaume Balagueró, Teresa Gefaell', 'Alberto Marini', 'Luis Tosar, Marta Etura, Alberto San Juan, Petra Martínez, Iris Almeida Molina, Carlos Lasarte, Amparo Fernández, Roger Morilla', null, 'César, an unhappy concierge, maintains a peculiar relationship with the very diverse inhabitants of the upper-class apartment building where he works in Barcelona.', 'César, an unhappy concierge, maintains a peculiar relationship with the very diverse inhabitants of the upper-class apartment building where he works in Barcelona.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i44Mr6t3reXt7z28OMCPZTllRfr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77495'),
  ('156603447294572127', 'Sleep with Me', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Rory Kelly, Andrzej Sekula', 'Roger Hedden, Neal Jimenez, Michael Steinberg', 'Meg Tilly, Eric Stoltz, Craig Sheffer, Lewis Arquette, Todd Field, Susan Taylor, Tegan West, Dean Cameron', 'R', 'Six different writers wrote a scene each of this romantic comedy featuring the marriage and turbulent relationship of Joseph and Sarah, with Joseph''s best friend Frank trying hard to cope with letting the love of his life marry his best friend.', 'Six different writers wrote a scene each of this romantic comedy featuring the marriage and turbulent relationship of Joseph and Sarah, with Joseph''s best friend Frank trying hard to cope with letting the love of his life marry his best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gDmoa5nCDpOnwyePTHTAND3GmFW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19361'),
  ('1048874157296311170', 'Sleep with Your Eyes Open', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nele Wohlatz, Roman Kasseroller', 'Pío Longo, Nele Wohlatz', 'Chen Xiao Xin, Wang Shin-hong, Liao Kai Ro, Nahuel Pérez Biscayart, Lu Yang Zong', null, 'A coastal city in Brazil. Kai arrives from Taiwan for holidays with a broken heart. A broken air conditioner sends her into Fu Ang’s umbrella store. He could become a friend, but the rainy season doesn''t arrive and his shop disappears. While looking for Fu Ang, Kai discovers the story of Xiaoxin and a group of Chinese workers in a posh skyscraper. Kai finds herself strangely mirrored in Xiaoxin’s tale.', 'A coastal city in Brazil. Kai arrives from Taiwan for holidays with a broken heart. A broken air conditioner sends her into Fu Ang’s umbrella store. He could become a friend, but the rainy season doesn''t arrive and his shop disappears. While looking for Fu Ang, Kai discovers the story of Xiaoxin and a group of Chinese workers in a posh skyscraper. Kai finds herself strangely mirrored in Xiaoxin’s tale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wgcymEXE78Pr3l9KqiBwanO8o2Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1234602'),
  ('483129011775293907', 'Sleep, My Love', 1948, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Douglas Sirk, Joseph A. Valentine, Clarence Eurist', 'St. Clair McKelway, Leo Rosten', 'Claudette Colbert, Robert Cummings, Don Ameche, Rita Johnson, George Coulouris, Queenie Smith, Ralph Morgan, Keye Luke', 'NR', 'A woman wakes up in the middle of the night on board a train, but she can''t remember how she got there. Danger and suspense ensue.', 'A woman wakes up in the middle of the night on board a train, but she can''t remember how she got there. Danger and suspense ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9frXdBO5Z8gP0YwNHNt3DhKavBt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74525'),
  ('475442554336352223', 'Sleepaway Camp', 1983, 'Horror', 'Robert Hiltzik, Mitchell Wood, Benjamin Davis', 'Robert Hiltzik', 'Mike Kellin, Katherine Kamhi, Paul DeAngelo, Jonathan Tiersten, Felissa Rose, Karen Fields, Christopher Collet, Desiree Gould', 'R', 'Years after a terrible boating accident, Angela is sent to Camp Arawak where a series of bizarre and violent "accidents" begin to claim the lives of various campers.', 'Years after a terrible boating accident, Angela is sent to Camp Arawak where a series of bizarre and violent "accidents" begin to claim the lives of various campers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZ7KjSyHjP4ula5ybiXuQcDvZLg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13567'),
  ('1141988638537216694', 'Sleepaway Camp II: Unhappy Campers', 1988, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Michael A. Simpson, Bill Mills, Jerry Pece', 'Michael Hitchcock, Robert Hiltzik', 'Pamela Springsteen, Renée Estevez, Tony Higgins, Valerie Hartman, Brian Patrick Clarke, Walter Gotell, Susan Marie Snyder, Kendall Bean', 'R', 'Angela Baker escapes from a mental hospital and surfaces at a summer camp as a counselor who lectures her teenage charges on proper moral behavior. Those teens who break her strict rules -- from the camp chatterbox or a sex-obsessed girl to the boys who are peeping Toms -- are murdered by the impostor in various gruesome ways. As more campers go missing, intrepid counselor Molly begins to piece together the truth.', 'Angela Baker escapes from a mental hospital and surfaces at a summer camp as a counselor who lectures her teenage charges on proper moral behavior. Those teens who break her strict rules -- from the camp chatterbox or a sex-obsessed girl to the boys who are peeping Toms -- are murdered by the impostor in various gruesome ways. As more campers go missing, intrepid counselor Molly begins to piece together the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gupBz1S1TCxH75qW4qoqjpeEgQ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34311'),
  ('549629855391184092', 'Sleepaway Camp III: Teenage Wasteland', 1989, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Michael A. Simpson, Bill Mills, Jerry Pece', 'Michael Hitchcock', 'Pamela Springsteen, Tracy Griffith, Michael J. Pollard, Kyle Holman, Sandra Dorsey, Kim Wall, Haynes Brooke, Daryl Wilcher', 'R', 'Psychotic Angela is itching to do what she does best: slaughter dozens of teenage campers. As luck would have it, the previous site of her murders has been renamed and converted into an experimental summer camp meant to bring together privileged and lower-class teens. On the day the youths are boarding the buses to camp, Angela runs over a potential camper with a garbage truck and assumes her identity. Once she has infiltrated the camp, the real terror begins.', 'Psychotic Angela is itching to do what she does best: slaughter dozens of teenage campers. As luck would have it, the previous site of her murders has been renamed and converted into an experimental summer camp meant to bring together privileged and lower-class teens. On the day the youths are boarding the buses to camp, Angela runs over a potential camper with a garbage truck and assumes her identity. Once she has infiltrated the camp, the real terror begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qladM9OMuGWfj2hdoj8NBpScLg9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34312'),
  ('691352907998368637', 'Sleeper', 1973, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Woody Allen, David M. Walsh, Henry J. Lange Jr.', 'Marshall Brickman, Woody Allen', 'Woody Allen, Diane Keaton, John Beck, Mary Gregory, Brian Avery, Don Keefer, Mews Small, Peter Hobbs', 'PG', 'Miles Monroe, a clarinet-playing health food store proprietor, is revived out of cryostasis 200 years into a future world in order to help rebels fight an oppressive government regime.', 'Miles Monroe, a clarinet-playing health food store proprietor, is revived out of cryostasis 200 years into a future world in order to help rebels fight an oppressive government regime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/YTYSziZZP5aXt5CDvdEMwKDzme.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11561'),
  ('942566235632114818', 'Sleepers', 1996, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Michael Ballhaus, Barry Levinson, Joseph P. Reidy', 'Barry Levinson', 'Kevin Bacon, Robert De Niro, Dustin Hoffman, Bruno Kirby, Jason Patric, Brad Pitt, Minnie Driver, Brad Renfro', 'R', 'Two gangsters seek revenge on the state jail worker who during their stay at a youth prison sexually abused them. A sensational court hearing takes place to charge him for the crimes.', 'Two gangsters seek revenge on the state jail worker who during their stay at a youth prison sexually abused them. A sensational court hearing takes place to charge him for the crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUpiEk2EojS9ZEXb3nIQonQCYYF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:819'),
  ('602429819868945100', 'Sleepers West', 1941, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Eugene Forde, J. Peverell Marley', 'Stanley Rauh, Lou Breslow', 'Lloyd Nolan, Lynn Bari, Mary Beth Hughes, Louis Jean Heydt, Edward Brophy, Don Costello, Ben Carter, Donald Douglas', null, 'Private eye Mike Shayne encounters a large amount of trouble while attempting to guard a murder witness.', 'Private eye Mike Shayne encounters a large amount of trouble while attempting to guard a murder witness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZVQB4mLYOEok3OEF8yl72rN1em.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106239'),
  ('345587297250807148', 'Sleeping Beauties', 2017, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Dean McKendrick, Scott Webster, Terrance Ryker', 'Suzanne Cabot', 'Sarah Hunter, Pristine Edge, William F. Bryant, Aria Alexander, Andrew Espinoza Long, Ted Newsom, Julia Alfaro', 'PG-13', 'Awakened from a curse after 400 years, Sleeping Beauty (Sarah Hunter) marvels at the wonders of the new century. She falls in love with a famous architect who is working to restore the castle she once lived in, but finds there are enemies plotting against her. Giving in to her long pent-up sexual desires, Beauty cannot resist the lustful advances of both men and women and after 400 years, she''s ready to explore everything and everyone!', 'Awakened from a curse after 400 years, Sleeping Beauty (Sarah Hunter) marvels at the wonders of the new century. She falls in love with a famous architect who is working to restore the castle she once lived in, but finds there are enemies plotting against her. Giving in to her long pent-up sexual desires, Beauty cannot resist the lustful advances of both men and women and after 400 years, she''s ready to explore everything and everyone!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/asvkeRwacvjvoUtlGc715tUQlzB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458354'),
  ('20620356474895443', 'Sleeping Beauty', 1959, 'Fantasy, Animation, Romance, Family', 'Clyde Geronimi', 'Erdman Penner', 'Mary Costa, Bill Shirley, Eleanor Audley, Verna Felton, Barbara Luddy, Barbara Jo Allen, Taylor Holmes, Bill Thompson', 'G', 'Cursed to die by the evil fairy Maleficent when she was a baby, Princess Aurora is sent into hiding under protection from three good fairies. As she grows up far away, Maleficent becomes increasingly determined to seal the princess''s fate.', 'Cursed to die by the evil fairy Maleficent when she was a baby, Princess Aurora is sent into hiding under protection from three good fairies. As she grows up far away, Maleficent becomes increasingly determined to seal the princess''s fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3pxoMDDxp10c1smgbDzW4bwlzq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10882'),
  ('499359391986091955', 'Sleeping Beauty', 1987, 'Family, Fantasy', 'David Irving', 'Michael Berz', 'Tahnee Welch, Kenny Baker, Morgan Fairchild, David Holliday, Nicholas Clay, Jonny Phillips, Sylvia Miles, Jane Wiedlin', null, 'Feature-length, live-action musical version of the classic fairy tale by Charles Perrault.', 'Feature-length, live-action musical version of the classic fairy tale by Charles Perrault.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaIJMVA8RffAHQif4CruOUcmC4q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71750'),
  ('201300586676200891', 'Sleeping Beauty', 1990, 'Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Stanislav Párnický, Laco Kraus', 'Jana Kákošová', 'Dana Dinková, Gedeon Burkhard, Judy Winter, Jozef Adamovič, Milena Dvorská, Pavol Mikulík, Karel Heřmánek, Zdena Studenková', null, 'A beautiful princess born in a faraway kingdom is destined by a terrible curse to prick her finger on the spindle of a spinning wheel and fall into a deep sleep that can only be awakened by true love''s first kiss.', 'A beautiful princess born in a faraway kingdom is destined by a terrible curse to prick her finger on the spindle of a spinning wheel and fall into a deep sleep that can only be awakened by true love''s first kiss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jRjxyxQMLraZwOeBqnjzL8KeZE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315397'),
  ('736825478695824450', 'Sleeping Beauty', 1995, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Toshiyuki Hiruma, Takashi Masunaga, Shigeo Koshi', 'Lawrence H. Hartstein', 'Stevie Vallance, Kathleen Barr, Ian James Corlett, Garry Chalk, Ellen Kennedy, Andrea Libman, Tony Ail, Nathan Aswell', null, 'In a faraway kingdom, the king and queen had desired a child of their very own for a long time and when their wish finally came true, they announced a grand celebration at the palace. All of the fairies from the kingdom were invited and immediately named as godmothers for their new child, whose name was Felicity, which means "happiness".', 'In a faraway kingdom, the king and queen had desired a child of their very own for a long time and when their wish finally came true, they announced a grand celebration at the palace. All of the fairies from the kingdom were invited and immediately named as godmothers for their new child, whose name was Felicity, which means "happiness".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pF8IOYJW1icNkYcKDlVrF4Y8D3u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20172'),
  ('21729839511398527', 'Sleeping Beauty', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Julia Leigh, Geoffrey Simpson, Breeze Callahan', 'Julia Leigh', 'Emily Browning, Rachael Blake, Ewen Leslie, Peter Carroll, Chris Haywood, Hugh Keays-Byrne, Tammy Macintosh, Eden Falk', 'R', 'A haunting erotic fairytale about Lucy, a young University student drawn into a mysterious hidden world of beauty and desire.', 'A haunting erotic fairytale about Lucy, a young University student drawn into a mysterious hidden world of beauty and desire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1Lx8iRsml1JnPBY0qgn6IN5FQg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64586'),
  ('279535406691320407', 'Sleeping Beauty', 2014, 'Fantasy, Adventure', 'Casper Van Dien, Ben Demaree', 'Casper Van Dien, R. Dessertine', 'Michael York, Finn Jones, Grace Van Dien, Casper Van Dien, Catherine Oxenberg, Olivia D''Abo, Christina Wolfe, Dylan Vox', 'PG-13', 'When a young Prince and his trusted aid learn of a beautiful Princess''s cursed eternal slumber, they embark on a journey to rescue her. They must battle an evil queen and legions of undead monsters before she will be free.', 'When a young Prince and his trusted aid learn of a beautiful Princess''s cursed eternal slumber, they embark on a journey to rescue her. They must battle an evil queen and legions of undead monsters before she will be free.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2wDDPBysxe8vZ79yZx2n5yYr4V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:275318'),
  ('243633305652392476', 'Sleeping Beauty', 2017, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Thomas Favel, Adolfo Arrieta', 'Adolfo Arrieta', 'Niels Schneider, Agathe Bonitzer, Mathieu Amalric, Tatiana Verstraeten, Serge Bozon, Ingrid Caven, Nathalie Trafford, Andy Gillet', null, 'In the kingdom of Letonia, the young prince Égon spends his nights playing the drums. During the day, he only has one thing on his mind: finding Sleeping Beauty in the kingdom of Kentz and breaking the spell over her. But his father, the king, doesn’t believe in fairy tales, and is completely opposed to Égon’s dream. It’s Maggie Jerkins, an archeologist from Unesco, who will provide Egon with the opportunity to follow his heart.', 'In the kingdom of Letonia, the young prince Égon spends his nights playing the drums. During the day, he only has one thing on his mind: finding Sleeping Beauty in the kingdom of Kentz and breaking the spell over her. But his father, the king, doesn’t believe in fairy tales, and is completely opposed to Égon’s dream. It’s Maggie Jerkins, an archeologist from Unesco, who will provide Egon with the opportunity to follow his heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsploSkmWnYBDcVXWCEyWMl0AmY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422218'),
  ('344202866537138319', 'Sleeping Beauty Next Door', 2026, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'John Lyde', 'Melanie Stone', 'Aubrey Reynolds, Jake Stormoen, Casey Elliott, Adam Johnson, Shannon Engemann', 'G', 'Sydney has a rare condition that makes her collapse when emotions surge-especially love. When charming neighbor Taylor captures her heart, she must stay conscious long enough to make their dream romance real.', 'Sydney has a rare condition that makes her collapse when emotions surge-especially love. When charming neighbor Taylor captures her heart, she must stay conscious long enough to make their dream romance real.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fc%2Fplex%2Fc5bfcd63-d78e-4dac-84aa-70daf67da3c6.jpg', 'plex:movie:sleeping-beauty-next-door'),
  ('210707065914094915', 'Sleeping Betty', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Claude Cloutier', null, null, null, 'Princess Betty sleeps in a narcoleptic stupor. The king appeals to his subjects to wake her, and several respond: Uncle Henry VIII, Aunt Victoria, an emotional alien, a cool witch and a handsome prince. This worthy Prince Charles lookalike has to leave his royal suburb to save the princess, but will Betty be wakened with just a kiss?', 'Princess Betty sleeps in a narcoleptic stupor. The king appeals to his subjects to wake her, and several respond: Uncle Henry VIII, Aunt Victoria, an emotional alien, a cool witch and a handsome prince. This worthy Prince Charles lookalike has to leave his royal suburb to save the princess, but will Betty be wakened with just a kiss?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p74c7wlQpXOXJfUFBsiJgiF0Ew6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80142'),
  ('386286622906157077', 'Sleeping Dogs', 1977, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Roger Donaldson, Michael Seresin, Tom Binns', 'Ian Mune, Arthur Baysting', 'Sam Neill, Warren Oates, Ian Mune, Ian Watkin, William Johnson, Davina Whitehouse, Nevan Rowe, Clyde Scott', 'NR', 'Recluse Smith is drawn into a revolutionary struggle between guerrillas and right-wingers in New Zealand. Implicated in a murder and framed as a revolutionary conspirator, Smith tries to maintain an attitude of non-violence while caught between warring factions.', 'Recluse Smith is drawn into a revolutionary struggle between guerrillas and right-wingers in New Zealand. Implicated in a murder and framed as a revolutionary conspirator, Smith tries to maintain an attitude of non-violence while caught between warring factions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1gKAfqLMvz1uH3HQmz9HdJ9DBw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37582'),
  ('155560674678498589', 'Sleeping Dogs', 2024, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Adam Cooper, Ben Nott', 'Adam Cooper, Bill Collage', 'Russell Crowe, Karen Gillan, Marton Csokas, Tommy Flanagan, Thomas M. Wright, Harry Greenwood, Pacharo Mzembe, Lynn Gilmartin', 'R', 'Roy Freeman, an ex-homicide detective with a fractured memory, is forced to revisit a case he can''t remember. As a man''s life hangs in the balance on death row, Freeman must piece together the brutal evidence from a decade-old murder investigation, uncovering a sinister web of buried secrets and betrayals linking to his past. With only instincts to trust, he faces a chilling truth - sometimes, it''s best to let sleeping dogs lie.', 'Roy Freeman, an ex-homicide detective with a fractured memory, is forced to revisit a case he can''t remember. As a man''s life hangs in the balance on death row, Freeman must piece together the brutal evidence from a decade-old murder investigation, uncovering a sinister web of buried secrets and betrayals linking to his past. With only instincts to trust, he faces a chilling truth - sometimes, it''s best to let sleeping dogs lie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5DwQhh1HvTo7edaOeMX49NUyZqy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:978592'),
  ('850369395687204596', 'Sleeping Dogs Lie', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Bobcat Goldthwait, Ian S. Takahashi', 'Bobcat Goldthwait', 'Melinda Page Hamilton, Bryce Johnson, Geoff Pierson, Colby French, Jack Plotnick, Brian Posehn, Morgan Murphy, Rebecca Avery', 'R', 'A recently engaged woman''s life is thrown into turmoil after confessing to her fiancé that she once experimented with bestiality.', 'A recently engaged woman''s life is thrown into turmoil after confessing to her fiancé that she once experimented with bestiality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJpRHWsYu67BXIduUYLv5CXxPhc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43673'),
  ('830191704832002045', 'Sleeping Fist', 1979, 'Action, Comedy', 'Teddy Yip Wing-Cho, Chik Ngai-Hung, Huang Ha', 'Chang Hsin-Yi', 'Bryan Leung Kar-Yan, Simon Yuen Siu-Tien, Law Hon, Eddy Ko Hung, Ou Li-Bao, Au-Yeung Ling-Lung, I Lung Huang, Sun Lan', 'NR', 'A plainclothes policeman, Chin Tai Ba, is seriously wounded in a fight with some ruffians but is helped to safety by a young wiseguy, Cub. Here he is taught the art of Sleeping Fist by Cub''s master Chung Yiu, and the trio march to the Shang Wei martial arts school to take revenge on the thugs. However, in a last desperate attempt to get even, the gang call on Eagle Claw master Kao to sort out the snoozers.', 'A plainclothes policeman, Chin Tai Ba, is seriously wounded in a fight with some ruffians but is helped to safety by a young wiseguy, Cub. Here he is taught the art of Sleeping Fist by Cub''s master Chung Yiu, and the trio march to the Shang Wei martial arts school to take revenge on the thugs. However, in a last desperate attempt to get even, the gang call on Eagle Claw master Kao to sort out the snoozers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eg8c2IDOtV2lyuxhPDw5NzAKfKg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71598'),
  ('789210464909693322', 'Sleeping Forest', 2014, 'TV Movie, Mystery, Crime', 'Nobuhiro Doi', null, 'Hiroshi Abe, Satomi Ishihara, Haruka Kinami, Terunosuke Takezai, Shuntarô Miyao, Yamato Mashiko, Eiko Otani, Kei Otozuki', null, 'A man is found dead in a office of Takayanagi Ballet Company. The suspect is a female dancer at the ballet company. The Takayanagi Ballet Company insists that the incident is a self defense case, but after an investigation there''s doubts in that claim. Then, the director of the Takayanagi Ballet Company is poisoned to death. Are the cases related?', 'A man is found dead in a office of Takayanagi Ballet Company. The suspect is a female dancer at the ballet company. The Takayanagi Ballet Company insists that the incident is a self defense case, but after an investigation there''s doubts in that claim. Then, the director of the Takayanagi Ballet Company is poisoned to death. Are the cases related?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjsFnWD3bAZUN4yLtmqR4agvQC6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297905'),
  ('905113744274948121', 'Sleeping Princess', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Çağan Irmak', 'Çağan Irmak', 'Çağlar Çorumlu, Sevinç Erbulak, Genco Erkal, Alican Yücesoy, Şevval Başpınar, Ayşenil Şamlıoğlu, Funda Şirinkal, Baran Ayhan', null, 'Çağan Irmak''s delightful new film is a fairy tale for the waking hour. Aziz works as a clerk in a library and lives in his own quiet and peaceful little world. Then one day he discovers that he has new neighbours: Seçil, the owner of the new opened local beauty shop and her 10 year-old daughter Gizem. Life for Aziz becomes much brighter and livelier but then something unexpected happens and darkness descends once again. A whole new set of events is set in motion as a bunch of memorable characters join together to try to change the course of fate. From the Diary of Aziz: There are those who say that fate cannot be changed, for if it could, it would not be fate. So be it. How hopeless we would feel if we had to live in a world where nothing could change. Don''t you think so? It might just be that there will come a day when you will realize that something bad that happened to you happened for a reason and caused something better to come about. You never know.', 'Çağan Irmak''s delightful new film is a fairy tale for the waking hour. Aziz works as a clerk in a library and lives in his own quiet and peaceful little world. Then one day he discovers that he has new neighbours: Seçil, the owner of the new opened local beauty shop and her 10 year-old daughter Gizem. Life for Aziz becomes much brighter and livelier but then something unexpected happens and darkness descends once again. A whole new set of events is set in motion as a bunch of memorable characters join together to try to change the course of fate. From the Diary of Aziz: There are those who say that fate cannot be changed, for if it could, it would not be fate. So be it. How hopeless we would feel if we had to live in a world where nothing could change. Don''t you think so? It might just be that there will come a day when you will realize that something bad that happened to you happened for a reason and caused something better to come about. You never know.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1R6CJluB8qJitRogMMck8lkk7xX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50423'),
  ('760927809213807718', 'Sleeping Princess', 2024, 'Romance, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Julio Constantini, Renata Martins, Cláudio Boeckel', 'Bruno Garotti, Marcelo Saback', 'Pietra Quintela, Maisa Silva, Guilherme Cabral, Lívia Silva, Patrícia França, Juliana Knust, Leopoldo Rodriguez, Cláudio Mendes', null, 'A sheltered teenager discovers she''s actually a princess from another country — and she could be in grave danger. Based on Paula Pimenta''s novel.', 'A sheltered teenager discovers she''s actually a princess from another country — and she could be in grave danger. Based on Paula Pimenta''s novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2snH1Itt1Zs20KFLyIFqPOkyJaV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1131279'),
  ('399208317610522988', 'Sleeping Sickness', 2011, 'Drama', 'Ulrich Köhler, Patrick Orth', 'Ulrich Köhler', 'Pierre Bokma, Jean-Christophe Folly, Jenny Schily, Hippolyte Girardot, Maria Elise Miller, Sava Lolov, Francis Noukiatchom, Ali Mvondo Roland', null, 'Ebbo and Vera Velten have spent the better part of the past twenty years living in different African countries. Ebbo is the manager of a sleeping sickness programme. His work is fulfilling. Vera, however, feels increasingly lost in Yaounde’s ex-pat community. She can’t bear the separation from her 14-year-old daughter, Helen, who is attending boarding school in Germany. Ebbo must give up his life in Africa or he risks losing the woman he loves. But his fear of returning to a land now remote to him increases with each passing day. Years later. Alex Nzila, a young French doctor of Congolese origin, travels to Cameroon to evaluate a development project. It’s been a long time since he set foot on this continent, but, instead of finding new prospects, he encounters a destructive, lost man. Like a phantom, Ebbo slips away from his evaluator.', 'Ebbo and Vera Velten have spent the better part of the past twenty years living in different African countries. Ebbo is the manager of a sleeping sickness programme. His work is fulfilling. Vera, however, feels increasingly lost in Yaounde’s ex-pat community. She can’t bear the separation from her 14-year-old daughter, Helen, who is attending boarding school in Germany. Ebbo must give up his life in Africa or he risks losing the woman he loves. But his fear of returning to a land now remote to him increases with each passing day. Years later. Alex Nzila, a young French doctor of Congolese origin, travels to Cameroon to evaluate a development project. It’s been a long time since he set foot on this continent, but, instead of finding new prospects, he encounters a destructive, lost man. Like a phantom, Ebbo slips away from his evaluator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7mgpizL8cnCTWJu23xq8irJ2WfI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70768'),
  ('128779142877138185', 'Sleeping with Danger', 2020, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Thomas M. Harting, David Weaver', 'Richard Blaney, Gregory Small', 'Elisabeth Röhm, Antonio Cupo, Leslie Hendrix, Alison Araya, Mike Dopud, Christie Burke', null, 'Inspired by Ann Rule’s true crime collection Mortal Danger and Other True Cases. Paul Carter was like a knight in shining armor when he met flight attendant Grace Tanner and swept her into a passionate love affair. But her dream man quickly became her nightmare as his jealous rage ultimately led to a brutal attack. Incredibly, Grace was able to escape and go into hiding. Fearing for her life and the safety of other women Paul might seduce, Grace works with the police to bring Paul to justice.', 'Inspired by Ann Rule’s true crime collection Mortal Danger and Other True Cases. Paul Carter was like a knight in shining armor when he met flight attendant Grace Tanner and swept her into a passionate love affair. But her dream man quickly became her nightmare as his jealous rage ultimately led to a brutal attack. Incredibly, Grace was able to escape and go into hiding. Fearing for her life and the safety of other women Paul might seduce, Grace works with the police to bring Paul to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78FSyBCA8BVAK3FsO1s6mTanRz7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:729269'),
  ('111341758266213504', 'Sleeping With My Student', 2019, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Alexander Yellen, Tom Shell', 'Michael Perronne', 'Gina Holden, Jessica Belkin, Mitchell Hoog, David Lipper, Gerald Webb, Novi Brown, Jordan Monaghan, Annie Marie Young', 'NR', 'New school headmaster and single mother Kathy discovers her vacation fling with charming 18-year-old Ian was no accident when he transfers to her school targeting Kathy and her teenage daughter Bree in a deadly scheme. Ian wants revenge as he believes Kathy is responsible for splitting up his family ultimately leading to his father''s death. Kathy will need to uncover Ian''s motives quickly if she hopes to protect herself and Bree from his dangerous threats.', 'New school headmaster and single mother Kathy discovers her vacation fling with charming 18-year-old Ian was no accident when he transfers to her school targeting Kathy and her teenage daughter Bree in a deadly scheme. Ian wants revenge as he believes Kathy is responsible for splitting up his family ultimately leading to his father''s death. Kathy will need to uncover Ian''s motives quickly if she hopes to protect herself and Bree from his dangerous threats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1odTBUPDBlQrwX1Jo3QLLCvShdF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:644682'),
  ('1114649082446528259', 'Sleeping with Other People', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Leslye Headland, Ben Kutchins', 'Leslye Headland', 'Jason Sudeikis, Alison Brie, Adam Scott, Jason Mantzoukas, Natasha Lyonne, Adam Brody, Amanda Peet, Katherine Waterston', 'R', 'Can two serial cheaters get a second chance at love? After a one-night stand in college, New Yorkers Lainey and Jake meet by chance twelve years later and discover they each have the same problem: because of their monogamy-challenged ways, neither can maintain a relationship. Determined to stay friends despite their mutual attraction, they make a pact to keep it platonic, a deal that proves easier said than done.', 'Can two serial cheaters get a second chance at love? After a one-night stand in college, New Yorkers Lainey and Jake meet by chance twelve years later and discover they each have the same problem: because of their monogamy-challenged ways, neither can maintain a relationship. Determined to stay friends despite their mutual attraction, they make a pact to keep it platonic, a deal that proves easier said than done.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thYomS3wTYDTRZaM98ADMfBiDxm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288036'),
  ('385083870425919296', 'Sleeping with the Devil', 1997, 'Drama', 'William A. Graham, Robert Steadman, George Fortmuller', 'Ellen Weston', 'Tim Matheson, Shannen Doherty, Bonnie Bartlett, Steve Eastin, David Bowe, Kate McNeil, Richard Bekins, Michael Bryan French', null, 'Professional nurse Rebecca Dubrovich is swept off her feet by charming millionaire Dick Strang, and the two begin a passionate romance. Only when it is too late does Rebecca discover that Strang has a very dark side...', 'Professional nurse Rebecca Dubrovich is swept off her feet by charming millionaire Dick Strang, and the two begin a passionate romance. Only when it is too late does Rebecca discover that Strang has a very dark side...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ycZ4OOlP25Gw4ylg2MCRvCr1SkU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260019'),
  ('47168255044371770', 'Sleeping with the Enemy', 1991, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Joseph Ruben, John Lindley, Michael E. Steele', 'Ronald Bass', 'Julia Roberts, Patrick Bergin, Kevin Anderson, Elizabeth Lawrence, Kyle Secor, Tony Abatemarco, Claudette Nevins, Marita Geraghty', 'R', 'A young woman fakes her own death in an attempt to escape her nightmarish marriage, but discovers it is impossible to elude her controlling husband.', 'A young woman fakes her own death in an attempt to escape her nightmarish marriage, but discovers it is impossible to elude her controlling husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zaUkndJP8IClB1gMsbw13PoVeLS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7442'),
  ('433278049681774895', 'Sleepless', 1957, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tolba Radwan, Salah Abu Seif, Abdel Halim Nasr', 'ElSayed Bedir', 'Faten Hamama, Yehia Chahine, Omar Sharif, Mariam Fakhr Eddine, Hind Rostom, Emad Hamdy, Rushdy Abaza, Rafeaa ElShal', null, 'Spoiled rich girl Nadia gets jealous after finding out her father''s plan to remarry. She tries to break them apart, spreading lies about her new mother-in-law and getting involved with a man twice her age.', 'Spoiled rich girl Nadia gets jealous after finding out her father''s plan to remarry. She tries to break them apart, spreading lies about her new mother-in-law and getting involved with a man twice her age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OMFmh9Np25sH3yfA3yRn0vs7zV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258768'),
  ('1067336929519182893', 'Sleepless', 2001, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Dario Argento, Marzio Casa, Riccardo Cannone', 'Carlo Lucarelli, Franco Ferrini, Dario Argento', 'Max von Sydow, Stefano Dionisi, Chiara Caselli, Gabriele Lavia, Rossella Falk, Paolo Maria Scalondro, Roberto Zibetti, Roberto Accornero', 'R', 'An elderly and retired police detective and a young amateur sleuth team up to find a serial killer whom has resumed a killing spree in Turin, Italy after a 17-year hiatus.', 'An elderly and retired police detective and a young amateur sleuth team up to find a serial killer whom has resumed a killing spree in Turin, Italy after a 17-year hiatus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihD09Yz6sIhwGHDq0Bo1IZaIeAC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39436'),
  ('295834508479148625', 'Sleepless', 2017, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Mihai Malaimare Jr., Chris Debenedetto, Jeff Imada', 'Andrea Berloff', 'Jamie Foxx, Michelle Monaghan, Dermot Mulroney, Scoot McNairy, David Harbour, T.I., Gabrielle Union, Octavius J. Johnson', 'R', 'Undercover Las Vegas police officer Vincent Downs, who has a lot of enemies, is caught in a high stakes web of corrupt cops and the mob-controlled casino underground. When a heist goes wrong, a crew of homicidal gangsters kidnap Downs’ teenage son T. In one sleepless night, Downs will have to rescue his son, evade an internal affairs investigation, and bring the kidnappers to justice.', 'Undercover Las Vegas police officer Vincent Downs, who has a lot of enemies, is caught in a high stakes web of corrupt cops and the mob-controlled casino underground. When a heist goes wrong, a crew of homicidal gangsters kidnap Downs’ teenage son T. In one sleepless night, Downs will have to rescue his son, evade an internal affairs investigation, and bring the kidnappers to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9WkUSY33MDPGmz0vtzbsfaxTHVa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324542'),
  ('159771250565683013', 'Sleepless Beauty', 2020, 'Horror', 'Pavel Khvaleev, Eugenia Mustafina, Pavel Khvaleev', 'Aleksandra Khvaleeva', 'Polina Davydova, Evgeniy Gagarin, Andrey Tereshenko, Sergey Topkov, Veronika Blokhina, Aleksandr Zilberkant, Alevtina Scherbakova, Viktor Aleshko', null, 'A young woman, Mila, is kidnapped by a mysterious and dangerous organization known as Recreation. Forced to stay awake and under constant surveillance, Mila must fight for control of her own mind.', 'A young woman, Mila, is kidnapped by a mysterious and dangerous organization known as Recreation. Forced to stay awake and under constant surveillance, Mila must fight for control of her own mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/61NiqfO7i5eUBQANHuaqUoBMy1S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:677135'),
  ('475353974175262858', 'Sleepless City', 2025, 'Drama', 'Rui Poças, Guillermo Galoe, Charlie Almagro Casado', 'Victor Alonso-Berbel, Guillermo Galoe, Inbar Horesh', 'Antonio Fernández Gabarre, Bilal Sedraoui, Jesús Fernández Silva, Felisa Romero Molina, Pura Salazar, Francisca Jiménez, Luis Bértolo', null, 'La Cañada Real, on the outskirts of Madrid, is one of the largest illegal shanty towns in Europe. Tonino, a 15-year-old Roma boy, has always lived here with his family. With his best friend Bilal, they film the world around them using a mobile phone, inspired by the gypsy legends he hears at home. But everything falls apart when a notice of imminent eviction arrives at his home and he discovers that his best friend is leaving La Cañada for good. Tonino finds himself torn between the dream of a new life and his attachment to his family and roots.', 'La Cañada Real, on the outskirts of Madrid, is one of the largest illegal shanty towns in Europe. Tonino, a 15-year-old Roma boy, has always lived here with his family. With his best friend Bilal, they film the world around them using a mobile phone, inspired by the gypsy legends he hears at home. But everything falls apart when a notice of imminent eviction arrives at his home and he discovers that his best friend is leaving La Cañada for good. Tonino finds himself torn between the dream of a new life and his attachment to his family and roots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2JNUcLimAYEhbHKLuRQ44LJJO1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1313032'),
  ('469100075150907837', 'Sleepless in Madrid', 1998, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Chus Gutiérrez', 'Juan Flahn, Fernando León de Aranoa, Chus Gutiérrez', 'Cristina Marcos, Candela Peña, Ernesto Alterio, María Pujalte, Ginés García Millán, Fele Martínez, Saturnino García, Celia Ballester', null, 'Eva, Alba y Juan are the protagonist of the story. Eva gives birth to Marina, Alba has just been left by her boyfriend. And Juan is happily married. Their paths intersect one night and their lifes will change forever.', 'Eva, Alba y Juan are the protagonist of the story. Eva gives birth to Marina, Alba has just been left by her boyfriend. And Juan is happily married. Their paths intersect one night and their lifes will change forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obWDxomGXl0SQnvJXcsTyOxLCXp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102680'),
  ('356892370442044182', 'Sleepless in Seattle', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Nora Ephron, Sven Nykvist, Suzan Wexler', 'David S. Ward, Jeff Arch, Nora Ephron', 'Meg Ryan, Tom Hanks, Ross Malinger, Bill Pullman, Rosie O''Donnell, Barbara Garrick, Rob Reiner, Gaby Hoffmann', 'PG', 'After the death of his mother, a young boy calls a radio station in an attempt to set his father up on a date. Across the country, an engaged woman becomes convinced that they belong together, despite their never having met. Will their paths collide despite the odds?', 'After the death of his mother, a young boy calls a radio station in an attempt to set his father up on a date. Across the country, an engaged woman becomes convinced that they belong together, despite their never having met. Will their paths collide despite the odds?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAXfku1u1uaLGh4cUmK0ESf1pPu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:858'),
  ('927321803343211859', 'Sleepless Night', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Frédéric Jardin, Tom Stern, Hubert Barbin', 'Frédéric Jardin, Nicolas Saada', 'Tomer Sisley, Serge Riaboukine, Julien Boisselier, JoeyStarr, Laurent Stocker, Birol Ünel, Lizzie Brocheré, Samy Seghir', 'NR', 'Vincent, a police officer, and his partner Manuel steal a large amount of cocaine from José Marciano, a ruthless crime lord who is quick to seek revenge, endangering Vincent''s life, career and family.', 'Vincent, a police officer, and his partner Manuel steal a large amount of cocaine from José Marciano, a ruthless crime lord who is quick to seek revenge, endangering Vincent''s life, career and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tuqivhp6bF6hEqrBtTBi1QYX9dP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79070'),
  ('235457039581237017', 'Sleepless Nights', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hani Khalifa, Thaer Younis, Ahmed Abd El Aziz', 'Tamer Habib', 'Khaled Abol Naga, Gehan Fadel, Ahmed Helmy, Hanan Turk, Sherif Mounir, Ola Ghanem, Fathy Abdel Wahab, Mona Zaki', null, 'A social romance that portrays the lives of 4 married couples who are friends. As they gather to celebrate the birthday of the daughter of one of them, their fundamental differences and their unstable marriages come to the surface as the men decide to leave for Alexandria.', 'A social romance that portrays the lives of 4 married couples who are friends. As they gather to celebrate the birthday of the daughter of one of them, their fundamental differences and their unstable marriages come to the surface as the men decide to leave for Alexandria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHQvOAjDLI2lESp2mtsbZkC0k85.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136857'),
  ('255869126680392992', 'Sleepless Town', 1998, 'Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Lee Chi-Ngai, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai', 'Lee Chi-Ngai', 'Takeshi Kaneshiro, Mirai Yamamoto, Kippei Shiina, Lung Sihung, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Kathy Chow Hoi-Mei, Seijun Suzuki, Tomorowo Taguchi', null, 'Kenichi is a half-Japanese, half-Chinese man of the underworld. You can sell him anything except children''s organs. His domain is in Kabukicho, a gangland controlled by various Shanghai gangs intent on taking control. His former partner-in-crime, Fu-Chun, is rumored to have returned to Kabukicho, having fled years earlier after killing the number two of gangland boss, Yuan. Yuan wants to get even and attempts to do so by using Kenichi.', 'Kenichi is a half-Japanese, half-Chinese man of the underworld. You can sell him anything except children''s organs. His domain is in Kabukicho, a gangland controlled by various Shanghai gangs intent on taking control. His former partner-in-crime, Fu-Chun, is rumored to have returned to Kabukicho, having fled years earlier after killing the number two of gangland boss, Yuan. Yuan wants to get even and attempts to do so by using Kenichi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJpj7Nx9ZvVZbKbduF9iQfKs8Jq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68913'),
  ('818142071190004683', 'Sleepover', 2004, 'Family, Comedy', 'James L. Carter, Joe Nussbaum, Trey Batchelor', 'Elisa Bell', 'Alexa PenaVega, Mika Boorem, Jane Lynch, Sam Huntington, Sara Paxton, Brie Larson, Scout Taylor-Compton, Douglas Smith', 'PG', 'As their first year of high school looms ahead, best friends Julie, Hannah, Yancy and Farrah have one last summer sleepover. Little do they know they''re about to embark on the adventure of a lifetime. Desperate to shed their nerdy status, they take part in a night-long scavenger hunt that pits them against their popular archrivals. Everything under the sun goes on -- from taking Yancy''s father''s car to sneaking into nightclubs!', 'As their first year of high school looms ahead, best friends Julie, Hannah, Yancy and Farrah have one last summer sleepover. Little do they know they''re about to embark on the adventure of a lifetime. Desperate to shed their nerdy status, they take part in a night-long scavenger hunt that pits them against their popular archrivals. Everything under the sun goes on -- from taking Yancy''s father''s car to sneaking into nightclubs!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p9CyHjVFCQfjhLfn9Xo0WPpYHQr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9893'),
  ('1060943790799652391', 'Sleepstalker', 1995, 'Horror', 'Turi Meyer', 'Alfredo Septién, Turi Meyer', 'Michael Harris, Jay Underwood, Kathryn Morris, Michael D. Roberts, Marc McClure, Caryn Richman, William Lucking, Angel Ashley', 'R', 'Seventeen years after slaughtering all but one member of a family, a vicious serial killer known only as "The Sandman" awaits execution. But first, his jailers allow a minister to visit the killer to give him last rites, unaware that the minister is a voodoo priest and an ally of the condemned prisoner. The priest places a hex on the Sandman so that when he is executed, his soul migrates into a new body made of sand. To sever his ties with his former life and achieve absolute power, the sandman must find and kill a man named Griffin, the sole survivor of the last family murdered by the killer', 'Seventeen years after slaughtering all but one member of a family, a vicious serial killer known only as "The Sandman" awaits execution. But first, his jailers allow a minister to visit the killer to give him last rites, unaware that the minister is a voodoo priest and an ally of the condemned prisoner. The priest places a hex on the Sandman so that when he is executed, his soul migrates into a new body made of sand. To sever his ties with his former life and achieve absolute power, the sandman must find and kill a man named Griffin, the sole survivor of the last family murdered by the killer', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83WJgnTubYzCY4eAP9x9r9XoRdJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98640'),
  ('456158788438684914', 'Sleepwalk', 1986, 'Fantasy, Drama, Mystery', 'Sara Driver, Frank Prinzi', 'Lorenzo Mans, Sara Driver', 'Suzanne Fletcher, Ann Magnuson, Dexter Lee, Stephen Chen, Tony Todd, Richard Boes, Ако, Harvey Perr', null, 'When Nicole, a young copy-shop employee, is hired to translate an ancient Chinese manuscript, she soon finds that the document has strange powers that little by little begin to exert an eerie influence over her life.', 'When Nicole, a young copy-shop employee, is hired to translate an ancient Chinese manuscript, she soon finds that the document has strange powers that little by little begin to exert an eerie influence over her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62SrmxsWg3lRIIVvGV0yiAD3Hzt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97640'),
  ('590229042477398172', 'Sleepwalk with Me', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Mike Birbiglia, Adam Beckman, Seth Barrish', 'Ira Glass, Mike Birbiglia, Joe Birbiglia', 'Mike Birbiglia, Lauren Ambrose, James Rebhorn, Carol Kane, Cristin Milioti, Aya Cash, Marylouise Burke, Loudon Wainwright III', 'PG-13', 'A burgeoning stand-up comedian struggles with the stress of a stalled career, a stale relationship, and the wild spurts of severe sleepwalking he is desperate to ignore.', 'A burgeoning stand-up comedian struggles with the stress of a stalled career, a stale relationship, and the wild spurts of severe sleepwalking he is desperate to ignore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vs2wxfMrV48VWKTGbsYstIWrwI1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84340'),
  ('1128426617535544730', 'Sleepwalker', 1984, 'Horror', 'Saxon Logan, Nick Beeks-Sanders', 'Saxon Logan, John Varnom, Michael Keenan', 'Joanna David, Nickolas Grace, Heather Page, Bill Douglas, Fulton Mackay, Michael Medwin, Raymond Huntley', null, 'Saxon Logan''s extraordinary 49 minute featurette pitches four people into a class war situation with a vicious sting in the tale.', 'Saxon Logan''s extraordinary 49 minute featurette pitches four people into a class war situation with a vicious sting in the tale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAN6gajQSTbX1LZxsG1DAczDCCe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214629'),
  ('585704098046388549', 'Sleepwalker', 2000, 'Mystery, Horror, Thriller', 'Johannes Runeborg, Håkan Holmberg', 'Johan Brännström', 'Ralph Carlsson, Tuva Novotny, Ewa Carlsson, Anders Palm, Donald Högberg, Fredrik Hammar, Mats Rudal, Sylvia Rauan', null, 'Ulrik Hansson is 45 years old and lives a secure life in a Swedish residential district together with his wife Monika and their two children. He''s got a well-paid job as an architect and builds a new detached house which the family will move to. Everything is just great. He thinks. One morning he wakes up and shockingly discovers that they''re gone. The whole family...', 'Ulrik Hansson is 45 years old and lives a secure life in a Swedish residential district together with his wife Monika and their two children. He''s got a well-paid job as an architect and builds a new detached house which the family will move to. Everything is just great. He thinks. One morning he wakes up and shockingly discovers that they''re gone. The whole family...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odbnNGlaiCT7KerGG3jQ1XLsZ0T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22470'),
  ('355000218570815493', 'Sleepwalker', 2017, 'Thriller', 'Elliott Lester, Pieter Vermeer', 'Jack Olsen', 'Ahna O''Reilly, Richard Armitage, Izabella Scorupco, Haley Joel Osment, Emma Fitzpatrick, Adam O''Byrne, Kevin Zegers, Rachel Melvin', null, 'A young woman seeks help from a sleep clinic for her insomnia, but soon deals with her entire life being turned upside down.', 'A young woman seeks help from a sleep clinic for her insomnia, but soon deals with her entire life being turned upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvLsMp60r6aiY01cxwM2XZz1AHq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345680'),
  ('148447278889701867', 'Sleepwalker', 2026, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Brandon Auman, Marcus Friedlander, Graham Lynch, Phillip Rush, Alexis Taylor', 'Brandon Auman', 'Hayden Panettiere, Justin Chatwin, Beverly D''Angelo, Mischa Barton, Lori Tan Chinn', null, 'A grieving mother is haunted by the tragic loss of her daughter in a car accident that left her abusive husband in a coma. Plagued by haunting visions, she grapples with the blurred lines between reality and nightmare.', 'A grieving mother is haunted by the tragic loss of her daughter in a car accident that left her abusive husband in a coma. Plagued by haunting visions, she grapples with the blurred lines between reality and nightmare.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F4%2Fgracenote%2F471d5ac01703257dbbc4a526be804a26.jpg', 'plex:movie:sleepwalker-2026-1'),
  ('332741964016254295', 'Sleepwalkers', 1992, 'Horror, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Mick Garris, Don Buchsbaum, Richard Stenta', 'Stephen King', 'Brian Krause, Mädchen Amick, Alice Krige, Jim Haynie, Cindy Pickett, Ron Perlman, Lyman Ward, Dan Martin', 'R', 'Charles Brady and his mother, Mary, are the last of a dying breed whose needs are not of this world. They are Sleepwalkers - able to stay alive only by feeding on the life-force of the innocent, but destined to roam the earth, avoiding discovery while searching for their next victim. That search takes them to the sleepy little town of Travis, Indiana, where beautiful teenager Tanya Robertson is about to become an unwilling pawn in their nightmarish fight for survival.', 'Charles Brady and his mother, Mary, are the last of a dying breed whose needs are not of this world. They are Sleepwalkers - able to stay alive only by feeding on the life-force of the innocent, but destined to roam the earth, avoiding discovery while searching for their next victim. That search takes them to the sleepy little town of Travis, Indiana, where beautiful teenager Tanya Robertson is about to become an unwilling pawn in their nightmarish fight for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iiwplv5pET2HgMog6otunohIiSr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11428'),
  ('365964119715789329', 'Sleepwalking', 2008, 'Drama', 'William Maher, Juan Ruiz Anchía', 'Zac Stanford', 'Nick Stahl, AnnaSophia Robb, Charlize Theron, Woody Harrelson, Dennis Hopper, Deborra-Lee Furness, Callum Keith Rennie, Amy Matysio', 'R', 'When her boyfriend is arrested for marijuana possession, Joleen Reedy and her 11-year-old daughter, Tara, take refuge with Joleen''s aimless brother, James. Joleen soon runs off with a truck driver, and James is unable to meet his responsibilities. After Child Protective Services takes possession of Tara, James abducts her from a foster home, and the two travel from California to Utah, where his abusive father lives.', 'When her boyfriend is arrested for marijuana possession, Joleen Reedy and her 11-year-old daughter, Tara, take refuge with Joleen''s aimless brother, James. Joleen soon runs off with a truck driver, and James is unable to meet his responsibilities. After Child Protective Services takes possession of Tara, James abducts her from a foster home, and the two travel from California to Utah, where his abusive father lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQ2YMtrzHBEVNW6fGwd45DzmHOG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14349'),
  ('630726992270734719', 'Sleepy Eyes of Death 1: The Chinese Jade', 1963, 'Action', 'Tokuzō Tanaka, Chikashi Makiura, Shigeru Doi', 'Seiji Hoshikawa', 'Raizō Ichikawa, Tamao Nakamura, Shinobu Araki, Saburo Date, Jun Fujikawa, Gen Kimura, Katsuhiko Kobayashi, Hideo Kuroki', null, 'Nemuri Kyoshiro, a youthful and cynical ronin with unparalleled skill, is approached by both sides in a game of corruption, ambition, and double crosses. The leader of the Kaga clan, who thinks he has killed his smuggling partner, fears that the shogunate will discover his illegal activities. He learns of evidence that will prove his guilt. Meanwhile, his partner is not dead, and, assisted by a master of Shorenji boxing, is looking for revenge and for his loot. The Kaga leader sends the beautiful Chisa to enlist Nemuri''s aid. The unexpected happens: the hard-bitten Nemuri falls in love. Can he protect her, topple the criminals, and avoid the boxer''s deadly skill?', 'Nemuri Kyoshiro, a youthful and cynical ronin with unparalleled skill, is approached by both sides in a game of corruption, ambition, and double crosses. The leader of the Kaga clan, who thinks he has killed his smuggling partner, fears that the shogunate will discover his illegal activities. He learns of evidence that will prove his guilt. Meanwhile, his partner is not dead, and, assisted by a master of Shorenji boxing, is looking for revenge and for his loot. The Kaga leader sends the beautiful Chisa to enlist Nemuri''s aid. The unexpected happens: the hard-bitten Nemuri falls in love. Can he protect her, topple the criminals, and avoid the boxer''s deadly skill?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3BTCXeEvnEctly0Yztb09zClAR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96195'),
  ('1000197685551452801', 'Sleepy Eyes of Death 12: Castle Menagerie', 1969, 'Drama, Action', 'Kazuo Ikehiro, Senkichirō Takeda', 'Ichirō Miyagawa', 'Raizō Ichikawa, Shiho Fujimura, Yukiji Asaoka, Shinjirō Ehara, Naoko Kubo, Machiko Hasegawa, Kayo Matsuo, Hideko Yoshida', null, 'Just when you think Kyoshiro''s life can''t get any stranger, someone starts running around raping and murdering, and leaving notes proudly proclaiming that he did it. Tracking down the real culprit will take him along a twisted trail that involves the Shogun''s harem, hidden Christians, and positively pregnant politics!', 'Just when you think Kyoshiro''s life can''t get any stranger, someone starts running around raping and murdering, and leaving notes proudly proclaiming that he did it. Tracking down the real culprit will take him along a twisted trail that involves the Shogun''s harem, hidden Christians, and positively pregnant politics!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rourkX1mQjIId09RDi6yJok4mWS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241186'),
  ('741560270423189030', 'Sleepy Eyes of Death 2: Sword of Adventure', 1964, 'Action', 'Kenji Misumi, Chikashi Makiura, Toshikata Tomoeda', 'Seiji Hoshikawa', 'Raizō Ichikawa, Kōichi Aihara, San''emon Arashi, Okuzan Asao, Jun Fujikawa, Shiho Fujimura, Hajime Koshikawa, Yutaro Gomi', null, 'Wandering samurai Nemuri Kyoshiro (Raizô Ichikawa) finds a bulls-eye on his back after befriending the shogunate''s tightfisted financial adviser, Asahina, who''s earned the wrath of the shogun''s self-indulgent daughter for cutting off her allowance. The enraged princess promptly hatches a scheme to have Asahina bumped off -- along with his protector, Kyoshiro. Shiho Fujimura also stars in this installment of the enormously popular film series.', 'Wandering samurai Nemuri Kyoshiro (Raizô Ichikawa) finds a bulls-eye on his back after befriending the shogunate''s tightfisted financial adviser, Asahina, who''s earned the wrath of the shogun''s self-indulgent daughter for cutting off her allowance. The enraged princess promptly hatches a scheme to have Asahina bumped off -- along with his protector, Kyoshiro. Shiho Fujimura also stars in this installment of the enormously popular film series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tIXyPvsur6C8QJUq7WztCV8XZ9q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96250'),
  ('419408553053522014', 'Sleepy Eyes of Death 4: Sword of Seduction', 1964, 'Action', 'Kazuo Ikehiro, Chikashi Makiura', 'Seiji Hoshikawa', 'Raizō Ichikawa, Michiko Ai, Akira Amemiya, Shinjirō Asano, Saburo Date, Hajime Koshikawa, Jun Fujikawa, Shiho Fujimura', null, 'A fugitive christian "saint" (female, of course!) and a sadistic drug-addled princess both have their eye on Kyoshiro. The fact that a bunch of ruthless smugglers also want him dead is the least of his problems!', 'A fugitive christian "saint" (female, of course!) and a sadistic drug-addled princess both have their eye on Kyoshiro. The fact that a bunch of ruthless smugglers also want him dead is the least of his problems!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jiODUkP6X4V6hpVt4MXmyQuHuc4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131435'),
  ('505398201193589480', 'Sleepy Hollow', 1999, 'Fantasy, Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Tim Burton, Emmanuel Lubezki, Christopher Newman', 'Andrew Kevin Walker', 'Johnny Depp, Christina Ricci, Miranda Richardson, Michael Gambon, Casper Van Dien, Jeffrey Jones, Richard Griffiths, Ian McDiarmid', null, 'Skeptical young detective Ichabod Crane gets transferred to the hamlet of Sleepy Hollow, New York, where he is tasked with investigating the decapitations of three people – murders the townsfolk attribute to a legendary specter, The Headless Horseman.', 'Skeptical young detective Ichabod Crane gets transferred to the hamlet of Sleepy Hollow, New York, where he is tasked with investigating the decapitations of three people – murders the townsfolk attribute to a legendary specter, The Headless Horseman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1GuK965FLJxqUw9fd1pmvjbFAlv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2668'),
  ('106439928999044995', 'Sleepy Hollow: Behind the Legend', 2000, 'Documentary', 'Toby Reisz, Alec Ceschi', 'William Rus', 'Peter Cullen, Tim Burton, Johnny Depp, Danny Elfman, Michael Gambon, Nick Gillard, Michael Gough, Richard Griffiths', null, 'A behind the scenes look at the making of Sleepy Hollow.', 'A behind the scenes look at the making of Sleepy Hollow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mY5wyEJtWbnoFZEQinuegQw60Zl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:637105'),
  ('302585234552912082', 'Sleepy Time Donald', 1947, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash, Gloria Blondell', 'NR', 'Donald Duck would never believe it, but he suffers from sleepwalking. In this blessed innocent state he makes a nightly call at Daisy''s, as if it were the time of their romantic appointment; knowing one should not wake or contradict a sleepwalker, she plays along, but finds it increasingly difficult to follow Donald and prevent him coming to harm when he ignorantly strolls the most dangerous places, such as the lion''s cage in the zoo, including impossible ones, such as up a wall and even upside down. When she finally gets Donald safely in bed, he wakes up and thinks, seeing her sneak out, she''s the sleepwalker.', 'Donald Duck would never believe it, but he suffers from sleepwalking. In this blessed innocent state he makes a nightly call at Daisy''s, as if it were the time of their romantic appointment; knowing one should not wake or contradict a sleepwalker, she plays along, but finds it increasingly difficult to follow Donald and prevent him coming to harm when he ignorantly strolls the most dangerous places, such as the lion''s cage in the zoo, including impossible ones, such as up a wall and even upside down. When she finally gets Donald safely in bed, he wakes up and thinks, seeing her sneak out, she''s the sleepwalker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FDweNidUgvlZ58OAJUpyGCcJbR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67169'),
  ('339781589338576745', 'Sleepy-Time Tom', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Lillian Randolph, Daws Butler, Paul Frees', null, 'Tom has been out late carousing with his chums. When he gets home, Mammy won''t take any excuses, and insists he stay awake; Jerry, overhearing, thus tries a number of schemes to get Tom to sleep.', 'Tom has been out late carousing with his chums. When he gets home, Mammy won''t take any excuses, and insists he stay awake; Jerry, overhearing, thus tries a number of schemes to get Tom to sleep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkGr5QrxigLh6c3d2YXPnYongd4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79253'),
  ('187175133258306291', 'Sleight', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller, Action, Science Fiction', 'J.D. Dillard, Ed Wu', 'J.D. Dillard, Alex Theurer', 'Jacob Latimore, Seychelle Gabriel, Storm Reid, Sasheer Zamata, Dulé Hill, Cameron Esposito, Michael Villar, Brandon Johnson', 'R', 'A young street magician is left to take care of his little sister after his mother''s passing and turns to drug dealing in the Los Angeles party scene to keep a roof over their heads. When he gets into trouble with his supplier, his sister is kidnapped and he is forced to rely on both his sleight of hand and brilliant mind to save her.', 'A young street magician is left to take care of his little sister after his mother''s passing and turns to drug dealing in the Los Angeles party scene to keep a roof over their heads. When he gets into trouble with his supplier, his sister is kidnapped and he is forced to rely on both his sleight of hand and brilliant mind to save her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLk7yoWxK4S0xkV24YWoPKbIsbf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347882'),
  ('352242454366269632', 'Slender Man', 2018, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Tom Davies, Jacki O''Brien, Scooter Perrotta', 'David Birke', 'Joey King, Julia Goldani Telles, Jaz Sinclair, Annalise Basso, Alex Fitzalan, Taylor Richardson, Javier Botet, Jessica Blank', 'PG-13', 'In a small town in Massachusetts, four high school girls perform a ritual in an attempt to debunk the lore of Slender Man. When one of the girls goes mysteriously missing, they begin to suspect that she is, in fact, his latest victim.', 'In a small town in Massachusetts, four high school girls perform a ritual in an attempt to debunk the lore of Slender Man. When one of the girls goes mysteriously missing, they begin to suspect that she is, in fact, his latest victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/huSncs4RyvQDBmHjBBYHSBYJbSJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:439015'),
  ('559692207372242283', 'Sleuth', 2007, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Kenneth Branagh, Haris Zambarloukos', 'Harold Pinter', 'Michael Caine, Jude Law, Harold Pinter, Carmel O''Sullivan, Kenneth Branagh', 'R', 'Locked in a high-tech English manor, bound in a deadly duel of wits, Andrew Wyke and Milo Tindle come together as English gentlemen to discuss the matter of Wyke''s wife: the woman both are sleeping with.', 'Locked in a high-tech English manor, bound in a deadly duel of wits, Andrew Wyke and Milo Tindle come together as English gentlemen to discuss the matter of Wyke''s wife: the woman both are sleeping with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y70r13kOHp7pcYToG25uwMYm562.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4520'),
  ('735889975623683976', 'Slice', 2009, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Thanachart Boonla, Kongkiat Khomsiri, Kongkiat Khomsiri', 'Kongkiat Khomsiri', 'Chatchai Plengpanich, Arak Amornsupasiri, Jessica Pasaphan, Sonthaya Chitmanee, Sikarin Polyong, Atthaphan Phunsawat, Boonsong Nakphoo, Pattarakun haynes', null, 'A serial killer is on the loose. There have been gruesome murders, with victims being ghastly dismembered and their severed body parts dumped in various locations. As the bodies keep piling up, the police remain in the dark without a single clue.', 'A serial killer is on the loose. There have been gruesome murders, with victims being ghastly dismembered and their severed body parts dumped in various locations. As the bodies keep piling up, the police remain in the dark without a single clue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSBnLRdCLvrjoZlmffNSRtG543t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57309'),
  ('168988126505290894', 'Slice', 2018, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Anthony E. Cabral, Stephanie E. Clemons, Austin Vesely', 'Austin Vesely', 'Chance the Rapper, Zazie Beetz, Katherine Cunningham, Will Brill, Rae Gray, Chris Parnell, Paul Scheer, Joe Keery', 'R', 'In a spooky small town, when a slew of pizza delivery boys are slain on the job, two daring survivors set out to catch the culprits behind the cryptic crime spree.', 'In a spooky small town, when a slew of pizza delivery boys are slain on the job, two daring survivors set out to catch the culprits behind the cryptic crime spree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bznkSqWqj43DhzHrbLehsr6ncb0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347392'),
  ('1010644353318166385', 'Slice of Life', 2002, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Patrick Timsit', null, 'José Garcia, Patrick Timsit, Marianne Denicourt, Elise Tielrooy, Natacha Lindinger, Gérard Rinaldi, Alice Béat', null, 'Pierre has four months left to live if he does not find a new liver. His only hope is a transplant from his brother, Paul. But Pierre hates Paul and has refused to see him for the past ten years. They are different in every aspect : their way of life, their tastes. Nevertheless, Marie, Pierre''s fiancee, is determined to reconcile the two men. A love-hate relationship develops, disrupting the trio, recomposing the couples and even going so far as to change their personalities. After a few too many drinks and a bit of fooling around, the settling of scores between the two brothers will come to a surprising end.', 'Pierre has four months left to live if he does not find a new liver. His only hope is a transplant from his brother, Paul. But Pierre hates Paul and has refused to see him for the past ten years. They are different in every aspect : their way of life, their tastes. Nevertheless, Marie, Pierre''s fiancee, is determined to reconcile the two men. A love-hate relationship develops, disrupting the trio, recomposing the couples and even going so far as to change their personalities. After a few too many drinks and a bit of fooling around, the settling of scores between the two brothers will come to a surprising end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wq9Umi5eWkP2eTIqsTQXrhM69P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60297'),
  ('149776851922623043', 'Slices of Life', 1985, 'Comedy', 'François Leterrier', 'Gérard Lauzier', 'Anémone, Laura Antonelli, Josiane Balasko, Michel Boujenah, Marie-Anne Chazel, Christian Clavier, Michel Galabru, Roland Giraud', null, 'A series of humorous sketches on life: "A Night to Remember", "Summit Showdown", and "A Book? That''s personal!"', 'A series of humorous sketches on life: "A Night to Remember", "Summit Showdown", and "A Book? That''s personal!"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31qpyCcKCCxES1ksn2MUHZ4fPkk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79762'),
  ('901736916002954188', 'Slick Hare', 1947, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Dave Barry, Arthur Q. Bryan', 'NR', 'Humphrey Bogart visits the Mocrumbo Restaurant. He orders fried rabbit and Elmer Fudd has twenty minutes to serve it.', 'Humphrey Bogart visits the Mocrumbo Restaurant. He orders fried rabbit and Elmer Fudd has twenty minutes to serve it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oRm9Q9j8EEXTiWt5k3YHZ1aHmIL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100349'),
  ('506862212154633445', 'Slicked-up Pup', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Daws Butler', 'G', 'Spike has just washed his pup. Tom and Jerry''s chase knocks him into a mud puddle. Spike makes Tom clean him up again and promise to keep him clean which of course is Jerry''s opening to get Tom in trouble.', 'Spike has just washed his pup. Tom and Jerry''s chase knocks him into a mud puddle. Spike makes Tom clean him up again and promise to keep him clean which of course is Jerry''s opening to get Tom in trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2JVKsc5htQxuZTAY6OZTbuFQuS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79256'),
  ('356790588813778652', 'Slide Donald Slide', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Baseball fan and would be-star Donald Duck enjoys listening to a World Series game on the radio and ''playing'' the part of his favorite star Casey in his own yard. Unfortunately a melomanic apis melifera (Latin for honeybee) is as avid to listen on the same radio to a mellifluous symphony and play the director theatrically, waving a match as baton, instead of fertilizing his garden flowers. Donald first just turns the switch, then hides it, but the bee dials inside, so he tries to chase it, but is scared by the sting. The battle for channel choice gets worse, and vindictive.', 'Baseball fan and would be-star Donald Duck enjoys listening to a World Series game on the radio and ''playing'' the part of his favorite star Casey in his own yard. Unfortunately a melomanic apis melifera (Latin for honeybee) is as avid to listen on the same radio to a mellifluous symphony and play the director theatrically, waving a match as baton, instead of fertilizing his garden flowers. Donald first just turns the switch, then hides it, but the bee dials inside, so he tries to chase it, but is scared by the sting. The battle for channel choice gets worse, and vindictive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVceVx3CkMhWCGeUi9g6lHgc0HI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67170'),
  ('690792265921232900', 'Sliding Doors', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Remi Adefarasin, Richard Whelan, Peter Howitt', 'Peter Howitt', 'Gwyneth Paltrow, John Hannah, John Lynch, Jeanne Tripplehorn, Zara Turner, Douglas McFerran, Paul Brightwell, Nina Young', 'PG-13', 'Helen, a London ad executive, is fired from her job and rushes out to catch a train, but, as she runs down, her life suddenly splits off. In one version she catches the train; in the second, she misses it. Her whole life changes in that one second, and the rest of the film depicts what happens in each scenario.', 'Helen, a London ad executive, is fired from her job and rushes out to catch a train, but, as she runs down, her life suddenly splits off. In one version she catches the train; in the second, she misses it. Her whole life changes in that one second, and the rest of the film depicts what happens in each scenario.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s8VOVTywXZIIHqdEjkCZziH0ebq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10215'),
  ('510625156585782947', 'Slightly Out of Tune', 2008, 'Drama', 'Walter Lima Jr., Juliana Alves, Daniel Lentini', 'Suzana Macedo', 'Rodrigo Santoro, Cláudia Abreu, Selton Mello, Alessandra Negrini, Ângelo Paes Leme, Jair Oliveira, André Moraes, Vanessa Gerbelli', null, 'A group of friends come of age during the political turmoil that plagued Brazil in the 1960''s and 70''s. Together, these musicians form a band called "Os Desafinados" and become a part of the groundbreaking Brazilian musical movement called Bossa Nova', 'A group of friends come of age during the political turmoil that plagued Brazil in the 1960''s and 70''s. Together, these musicians form a band called "Os Desafinados" and become a part of the groundbreaking Brazilian musical movement called Bossa Nova', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eaxtPesOxtpSus8WCxSumxFeB0Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54378'),
  ('288311295790417681', 'Slightly Scarlet', 1956, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'John Alton, Allan Dwan', 'Robert Blees', 'John Payne, Rhonda Fleming, Arlene Dahl, Kent Taylor, Ted de Corsia, Lance Fuller, Buddy Baer, Ellen Corby', 'NR', 'Kleptomaniac Dorothy Lyons is paroled from prison into the custody of her sister June, secretary to "reform" politician Frank Jansen. Ben Grace, associate of crime boss Sol "Solly" Caspar, sees this as a way to smear Jansen''s campaign. Seductive Dorothy will do anything to get what she wants, which includes having a good time with Ben-- whom June is now in love with.', 'Kleptomaniac Dorothy Lyons is paroled from prison into the custody of her sister June, secretary to "reform" politician Frank Jansen. Ben Grace, associate of crime boss Sol "Solly" Caspar, sees this as a way to smear Jansen''s campaign. Seductive Dorothy will do anything to get what she wants, which includes having a good time with Ben-- whom June is now in love with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYULWjzDauzpHUSHeX3Hxb8sU85.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25506'),
  ('935789726826932018', 'Slim Susie', 2003, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Mats Olofson, Ulf Malmros', 'Ulf Malmros, Petteri Nuottimäki', 'Tuva Novotny, Jonas Rimeika, Björn A. Ling, Kjell Bergqvist, Lotta Tejle, Malin Morgan, Michael Nyqvist, Lena Dahlman', null, 'When Erik, a Stockholm urbanite, learns that his beauty-queen sister, Susie, is missing, he goes to their country roots to look for her. But after talking to the eccentric locals -- including a shy video store clerk and a corrupt police officer -- Erik finds a woman who is not at all like the girl he left behind. Award-winning director Ulf Malmros helms this black comedy infused with hipster flair.', 'When Erik, a Stockholm urbanite, learns that his beauty-queen sister, Susie, is missing, he goes to their country roots to look for her. But after talking to the eccentric locals -- including a shy video store clerk and a corrupt police officer -- Erik finds a woman who is not at all like the girl he left behind. Award-winning director Ulf Malmros helms this black comedy infused with hipster flair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ND3jFeBkQnKzQLOPxVs30VdPj2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11466'),
  ('1008811725614767566', 'Slime City', 1988, 'Horror, Drama, Fantasy', 'Greg Lamberson, Peter Clark', 'Greg Lamberson', 'Robert C. Sabin, Mary Huner, T.J. Merrick, Dennis Embry, Dick Biel, Jane Doniger Reibel, Bunny Levine, Allen Lewis Rickman', null, 'A student moves into a run-down building in New York City. His bizarre neighbors make a concoction in their apartment they call wine, but when he takes some of it, he turns into a deformed, murderous monster.', 'A student moves into a run-down building in New York City. His bizarre neighbors make a concoction in their apartment they call wine, but when he takes some of it, he turns into a deformed, murderous monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjqGqhMdH2wdwVWbxo1WKdo7Ydd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27548'),
  ('111552778478975676', 'Slimtime', 2010, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Bertrand Avril, Pierre Chomarat, David Dangin', null, null, null, 'While his wife is undergoing slimming treatment, Andre goes on a discovery tour of this very unusual center.', 'While his wife is undergoing slimming treatment, Andre goes on a discovery tour of this very unusual center.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ljedI6H8M7ztnFGl3BBikU02Ejp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209921'),
  ('430367047778223458', 'Sling Blade', 1996, 'Drama', 'Billy Bob Thornton, Barry Markowitz, W.M. Halle', 'Billy Bob Thornton', 'Billy Bob Thornton, Dwight Yoakam, J.T. Walsh, John Ritter, Lucas Black, Natalie Canerday, James Hampton, Robert Duvall', 'R', 'Karl Childers, a mentally disabled man, has been in the custody of the state mental hospital since the age of 12 for killing his mother and her lover. Although thoroughly institutionalized, he is deemed fit to be released into the outside world.', 'Karl Childers, a mentally disabled man, has been in the custody of the state mental hospital since the age of 12 for killing his mother and her lover. Although thoroughly institutionalized, he is deemed fit to be released into the outside world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ivBIBd1LNaozcmytZUyE1yIXZms.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12498'),
  ('374742571868777462', 'Slingshot', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Mikael Håfström, Pär M. Ekberg, Csilla György', 'Nathan Parker, R. Scott Adams', 'Casey Affleck, Laurence Fishburne, Emily Beecham, Tomer Capone, David Morrissey, Charlotta Lövgren, Mark Ebulue, Nikolett Barabas', 'R', 'An elite trio of astronauts aboard a years-long, possibly compromised mission to Saturn''s moon Titan, gears up for a highly dangerous slingshot manoeuvre that will either catapult them to Titan or into deep space.', 'An elite trio of astronauts aboard a years-long, possibly compromised mission to Saturn''s moon Titan, gears up for a highly dangerous slingshot manoeuvre that will either catapult them to Titan or into deep space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6cCBe7DQOn9OFdFJ0eyVwSC8hR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:916728'),
  ('587923679283086635', 'Slipknot: Disasterpieces', 2002, 'Music, Documentary', 'Matthew Amos', null, 'Sid Wilson, Corey Taylor, Joey Jordison, Paul Gray, Chris Fehn, Jim Root, Craig Jones, Shawn Crahan', null, 'Slipknot performs live at the London Arena, summer 2002, in support of their Iowa album.', 'Slipknot performs live at the London Arena, summer 2002, in support of their Iowa album.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/chcZTl6Mjgusu1WdQOnFFXpdN7V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21416'),
  ('670577626733600354', 'Slipknot: Welcome to our Neighborhood', 1999, 'Music', 'Thomas Mignone', null, 'Corey Taylor, Sid Wilson, Joey Jordison, Chris Fehn, Paul Gray, Jim Root, Shawn Crahan, Mick Thomson', 'NR', 'Welcome to Our Neighborhood is the first video album by American heavy metal band Slipknot. It was released on November 9, 1999 by Roadrunner Records and later reissued in DVD format on November 18, 2003. Characterized as a band''s home video, it features a mixture of live performances footage of the songs "Surfacing", "Wait and Bleed", and "Scissors", interviews, and music video of "Spit It Out". Additional concept imagery and interview footage is included on the film, while the DVD version features more bonus material.', 'Welcome to Our Neighborhood is the first video album by American heavy metal band Slipknot. It was released on November 9, 1999 by Roadrunner Records and later reissued in DVD format on November 18, 2003. Characterized as a band''s home video, it features a mixture of live performances footage of the songs "Surfacing", "Wait and Bleed", and "Scissors", interviews, and music video of "Spit It Out". Additional concept imagery and interview footage is included on the film, while the DVD version features more bonus material.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJNqRRMLe0Yr0sme5X8SNOA35bF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62964'),
  ('1093226292989759677', 'Slippery Jim', 1909, 'Crime, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Segundo de Chomón', null, null, null, 'Pickpock is behind bars. But more elusive than Arsène Lupin, no chain resists him and he plays with policemen like a cat with mice. After having masterfully taken them for a ride, having brought them down to an effigy, he rolls them up and throws them out the window. But the policemen come back to life and the chase goes on. Pickpock, caught a second time, locked up behind heavy bars, finds a new way of escaping and imprisoning in turn the policemen.', 'Pickpock is behind bars. But more elusive than Arsène Lupin, no chain resists him and he plays with policemen like a cat with mice. After having masterfully taken them for a ride, having brought them down to an effigy, he rolls them up and throws them out the window. But the policemen come back to life and the chase goes on. Pickpock, caught a second time, locked up behind heavy bars, finds a new way of escaping and imprisoning in turn the policemen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abo1Xs3JIV6HOztdUM2Icuoss7Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194074'),
  ('1098587862056617956', 'Slippery Silks', 1936, 'Comedy', 'Jack White', 'Ewart Adamson', 'Curly Howard, Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Vernon Dent, Loretta Andrews, Gail Arnold, Beatrice Blinn, Symona Boniface', 'NR', 'The Stooges are carpenters who inherit a fancy dress boutique. They put on a fashion show with dresses they''ve designed based on furniture. During the show the owner of a antique box the stooges wrecked shows up and a wild cream puff fight ensues.', 'The Stooges are carpenters who inherit a fancy dress boutique. They put on a fashion show with dresses they''ve designed based on furniture. During the show the owner of a antique box the stooges wrecked shows up and a wild cream puff fight ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Oby29eau4nnMcGrMLbB80ISYnq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115820'),
  ('851074461297681426', 'Slipping Wives', 1927, 'Comedy', 'Fred Guiol', null, 'Priscilla Dean, Herbert Rawlinson, Oliver Hardy, Stan Laurel, Albert Conti', null, 'Neglected by her husband, our heroine decides to make him jealous by getting the handyman to play a literary genius at a party and flirt with her.', 'Neglected by her husband, our heroine decides to make him jealous by getting the handyman to play a literary genius at a party and flirt with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hl0iPp1IB5kSloUmWCmV7OnqaOb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50904'),
  ('228734670366039494', 'Slipstream', 1989, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Steven Lisberger, Malcolm Stone, Ricky Eyres', 'Tony Kayden', 'Mark Hamill, Kitty Aldridge, Bob Peck, Bill Paxton, Eleanor David, Robbie Coltrane, Ben Kingsley, F. Murray Abraham', 'PG-13', 'In the near future, where Earth has been devastated by man''s pollution and giant winds rule the planet, bounty hunter Matt kidnaps a murderer out of the hands of two police officers, planning to get the bounty himself.', 'In the near future, where Earth has been devastated by man''s pollution and giant winds rule the planet, bounty hunter Matt kidnaps a murderer out of the hands of two police officers, planning to get the bounty himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vdheFSJHXDr2Z7F4mJHJkQt8I3N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22379'),
  ('584696450977182365', 'Slipstream', 2005, 'Science Fiction', 'David van Eyssen, Sönke Hansen', 'Phillip Badger', 'Sean Astin, Ivana Miličević, Vinnie Jones, Grant Swanby, Hakeem Kae-Kazim, Kevin Otto, Sean Higgs, Tamsin MacCarthy', 'R', 'A scientist plots a bank robbery based around his newest invention -- a time travel gadget that will send its user 10 minutes into the past. Everything goes according to plan, until he encounters a group of thieves who''ve planned their heist for the same day.', 'A scientist plots a bank robbery based around his newest invention -- a time travel gadget that will send its user 10 minutes into the past. Everything goes according to plan, until he encounters a group of thieves who''ve planned their heist for the same day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vCHjdhP2gmHaEJycpqeA0LYiwj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24029'),
  ('980436727790704085', 'Slipstream', 2007, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Anthony Hopkins, Dante Spinotti', 'Anthony Hopkins', 'Anthony Hopkins, Stella Arroyave, Lana Antonova, Lindsay Barth, Michael Clarke Duncan, S. Epatha Merkerson, John Turturro, Christian Slater', 'R', 'Aging screenwriter Felix Bonhoeffer has lived his life in two states of existence: in reality and his own interior world. While working on a murder mystery script, and unaware that his brain is on the verge of implosion, Felix is baffled when his characters start to appear in his life, and vice versa.', 'Aging screenwriter Felix Bonhoeffer has lived his life in two states of existence: in reality and his own interior world. While working on a murder mystery script, and unaware that his brain is on the verge of implosion, Felix is baffled when his characters start to appear in his life, and vice versa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1JPCrC9lVM2Nx1oY0CEXHO3eAY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18633'),
  ('813209518944713834', 'Slither', 1973, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Doug Morrison, Les Sheldon, László Kovács', 'W.D. Richter', 'James Caan, Peter Boyle, Sally Kellerman, Louise Lasser, Allen Garfield, Richard B. Shull, Alex Rocco, Seamon Glass', null, 'While searching for a small fortune of embezzled money, an ex-con, a small-time bandleader, his doting wife and a kooky drifter find themselves being followed. Their chase takes them to trailer camps, bingo halls, laundromats and ultimately, a showdown with a group of unconventional bad guys.', 'While searching for a small fortune of embezzled money, an ex-con, a small-time bandleader, his doting wife and a kooky drifter find themselves being followed. Their chase takes them to trailer camps, bingo halls, laundromats and ultimately, a showdown with a group of unconventional bad guys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBQkChjEWiMna5Qsay7EDDdfUL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87417'),
  ('880841193794238968', 'Slither', 2006, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'James Gunn, Gregory Middleton, Karin Behrenz', 'James Gunn', 'Nathan Fillion, Michael Rooker, Elizabeth Banks, Gregg Henry, Tania Saulnier, Don Thompson, Brenda James, Jennifer Copping', 'R', 'A small town is taken over by an alien plague, turning residents into zombies and all forms of mutant monsters.', 'A small town is taken over by an alien plague, turning residents into zombies and all forms of mutant monsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNlJvCY3Pz7SE09Lf4G7uPs5XFZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9035'),
  ('251290523225821285', 'Sliver', 1993, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Phillip Noyce, Vilmos Zsigmond, David R. Ellis', 'Joe Eszterhas', 'Sharon Stone, William Baldwin, Tom Berenger, Polly Walker, Colleen Camp, Amanda Foreman, Martin Landau, CCH Pounder', 'R', 'A woman moves into a Manhattan apartment, where she learns that the previous tenant''s life ended under mysterious circumstances.', 'A woman moves into a Manhattan apartment, where she learns that the previous tenant''s life ended under mysterious circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7PC2e2KqDkIfOoJx9iXJJez99d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:867'),
  ('1096606347140593323', 'Sloane', 1985, 'Action', 'Daniel A. Rosenthal, Richard Belding', null, 'Robert Resnick, Debra Blee, Ann Milhench, Victor Ordoñez, Raul Aragon', null, 'The story opens with Richard Thursby''s murder and the abduction of his wife, Janice. Former cop and martial arts expert, Philip Sloane, is retained by family and flies to Manila in search of clues. He''s joined by an old friend, Pete Saimi, and Thursby''s sister, Cynthia in an adveture which includes a worldwide religious cult, Chinese overlord, a brothel and cave-dwelling cannibal pygmies. Must be seen to be believed!', 'The story opens with Richard Thursby''s murder and the abduction of his wife, Janice. Former cop and martial arts expert, Philip Sloane, is retained by family and flies to Manila in search of clues. He''s joined by an old friend, Pete Saimi, and Thursby''s sister, Cynthia in an adveture which includes a worldwide religious cult, Chinese overlord, a brothel and cave-dwelling cannibal pygmies. Must be seen to be believed!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nix7t1eFpstKQuP6wsKi7BfF0QS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107351'),
  ('921965835462235622', 'Slogan', 1969, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Pierre Grimblat, Claude Beausoleil', 'Melvin Van Peebles, Francis Girod, Pierre Grimblat', 'Serge Gainsbourg, Jane Birkin, Andréa Parisy, Daniel Gélin, Henri-Jacques Huet, Juliet Berto, Gilles Millnaire, James Mitchell', null, 'Commercial director Serge Faberge is having an affair with Evelyne, the 18 year old fiancee of friend Hugh. His own pregnant wife Francoise usually does not mind his dalliances, until he actually walks out on her and their newborn baby to move in with Evelyne. The shoe is on the other foot when dashing stuntman Dado catches Evelyne''s eye in Venice.', 'Commercial director Serge Faberge is having an affair with Evelyne, the 18 year old fiancee of friend Hugh. His own pregnant wife Francoise usually does not mind his dalliances, until he actually walks out on her and their newborn baby to move in with Evelyne. The shoe is on the other foot when dashing stuntman Dado catches Evelyne''s eye in Venice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7yp8QFmNWXSztYeVdq9QcohRLFC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71002'),
  ('992498011322408041', 'Sloppy Sunday', 2026, 'Short, Crime, Drama', 'Christoff Leblanc, Michael Blouin Shea', 'Christoff Leblanc', 'Kris Salvi, Ali Dusinberre, Nick Iammatteo, Stephen Sarrasin, Marquese Johnson', 'R', 'After calling it quits with her former pimp, a young prostitute thinks of a way to earn some quick money to leave town.', 'After calling it quits with her former pimp, a young prostitute thinks of a way to earn some quick money to leave town.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FiWYZm1dIC6IP18nvsYg6gClXE2W.jpg', 'plex:movie:sloppy-sunday'),
  ('95674897342852043', 'Slotherhouse', 2023, 'Horror, Comedy, Thriller', 'Bradley Fowler, Mark David, Matthew Goodhue', 'Bradley Fowler', 'Lisa Ambalavanar, Sydney Craven, Andrew Horton, Bianca Beckles-Rose, Olivia Rouyre, Tiff Stevenson, Sutter Nolan, Milica Vrzić', 'PG-13', 'Emily Young, a senior, wants to be elected as her sorority''s president. She adopts a cute sloth, thinking it can become the new mascot and help her win, until a string of fatalities implicate the sloth as the main suspect in the murders.', 'Emily Young, a senior, wants to be elected as her sorority''s president. She adopts a cute sloth, thinking it can become the new mascot and help her win, until a string of fatalities implicate the sloth as the main suspect in the murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMsOOdI43XC06vr4uCqpJ2hyfd7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1040892'),
  ('1020313816398883348', 'Slovenian Girl', 2009, 'Drama', 'Damjan Kozole, Aleš Belak', 'Damjan Kozole, Matevž Luzar, Ognjen Sviličić', 'Nina Ivanišin, Peter Musevski, Primož Pirnat, Maruša Kink, Uroš Fürst, Dejan Spasič, Aljoša Kovačič, Andrej Murenc', null, 'Aleksandra is a student from Krško, a small town in Slovenia. She has a plan to conquer the world. Working as a prostitute, her life is heading to where she wants it, but an accidental death has her wrestling with new feelings of fear, loneliness, confusion and responsibility', 'Aleksandra is a student from Krško, a small town in Slovenia. She has a plan to conquer the world. Working as a prostitute, her life is heading to where she wants it, but an accidental death has her wrestling with new feelings of fear, loneliness, confusion and responsibility', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcknyawJdopmWlZYoZyXgPP9Okj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34989'),
  ('231588662852781724', 'Slow', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marija Pakrijauskaite, Asta Rizgelienė, Lukas Lukoševičius', 'Marija Kavtaradzė', 'Greta Grinevičiūtė, Kęstutis Cicėnas, Gediminas Rimeika, Giedrė Nalivaikaitė, Dominyka Kriseiunaite, Kamile Griusyte, Titas Bartusevicius, Mante Songinaite', null, 'Dancer Elena and sign language interpreter Dovydas meet and form a beautiful bond. As they dive into a new relationship, they must navigate how to build their own kind of intimacy.', 'Dancer Elena and sign language interpreter Dovydas meet and form a beautiful bond. As they dive into a new relationship, they must navigate how to build their own kind of intimacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebw1ZX5agO9dVf3OGY2nrwHm4pc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058642'),
  ('411278251187298946', 'Slow Bob in the Lower Dimensions', 1991, 'Animation, Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie, Fantasy', 'Henry Selick', 'Henry Selick', 'Mark Steger, Hannah Sim', null, 'Nightmarish pilot about Robert Potemkin, a man with deformed back, who lives in the attic of his family''s house. One night, his siamese sisters plan a prank on him, but sentient lizards send him to a parallel world to save photo-people.', 'Nightmarish pilot about Robert Potemkin, a man with deformed back, who lives in the attic of his family''s house. One night, his siamese sisters plan a prank on him, but sentient lizards send him to a parallel world to save photo-people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jyJsGfuDQOSOBVosCk9TbS4MES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268228'),
  ('1024613187013527854', 'Slow Burn', 1986, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Tim Suhrstedt, Matthew Chapman', 'Matthew Chapman', 'Eric Roberts, Beverly D''Angelo, Dennis Lipscomb, Raymond J. Barry, Anne Schedeen, Emily Longstreth, Henry Gibson, Dan Hedaya', 'NR', 'Jacob Asch is hired by Gerald McMurty to find his ex-wife Laine and their son in Palm Springs. Jacob finds Laine and a teenager named Donnie who may or may not be Gerald''s son. He also finds an intricate web of deceit and betrayal that begin to lead to death. He takes it upon himself to unravel the mystery and find out who is killing people and why.', 'Jacob Asch is hired by Gerald McMurty to find his ex-wife Laine and their son in Palm Springs. Jacob finds Laine and a teenager named Donnie who may or may not be Gerald''s son. He also finds an intricate web of deceit and betrayal that begin to lead to death. He takes it upon himself to unravel the mystery and find out who is killing people and why.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1F3cD9NDSAxD2ym37AeQnIlZGd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144835'),
  ('1130346101961282334', 'Slow Burn', 2000, 'Adventure, Thriller', 'Mark Vicente, Christian Ford', 'Roger Soffer, Christian Ford', 'Minnie Driver, Josh Brolin, James Spader, Stuart Wilson, Jennifer Ann Evans, Nicole Fellows, Caprice Benedetti, Chris Mulkey', 'R', 'A woman''s lifelong pursuit of lost family diamonds is interrupted by the appearance of two escaped convicts.', 'A woman''s lifelong pursuit of lost family diamonds is interrupted by the appearance of two escaped convicts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPfW52tBjVhgR8GJOshYG8hHxRu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158431'),
  ('762089226519990482', 'Slow Burn', 2005, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Wayne Beach, Wally Pfister', 'Wayne Beach', 'Ray Liotta, LL Cool J, Mekhi Phifer, Jolene Blalock, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Taye Diggs, Bruce McGill, Fisher Stevens', 'R', 'A district attorney is involved in a 24-hour showdown with a gang leader and is, at the same time, being manipulated by an attractive assistant district attorney and a cryptic stranger.', 'A district attorney is involved in a 24-hour showdown with a gang leader and is, at the same time, being manipulated by an attractive assistant district attorney and a cryptic stranger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ho43ENDjPpkuMZvBsGTV1STFFik.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18777'),
  ('1121749544388877955', 'Slow Learners', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Sheena M. Joyce, Don Argott, Chase Bowman', 'Heather Maidat', 'Adam Pally, Sarah Burns, Reid Scott, Catherine Reitman, Mary Grill, Kate Flannery, Marceline Hugot, Kevin Dunn', 'NR', 'High school guidance counselor Jeff and his platonic friend and co-worker Anne are responsible, well intentioned, kind… and boring. They frustratingly watch on as their peers find love and companionship, while they continue to fail in spectacular fashion when it comes to romance. As they reach their loneliness breaking point, they make a pact to forgo their familiar, vanilla personas in exchange for their unexplored, confident alter egos. They wave goodbye to Jeff’s awkward all-male book club and Anne’s flailing attempts to catch the eye of Jeff’s sexy neighbor Max, and say hello to raucous summer nights filled with booze, dancing, and sex. Naturally things don’t exactly go according to plan.', 'High school guidance counselor Jeff and his platonic friend and co-worker Anne are responsible, well intentioned, kind… and boring. They frustratingly watch on as their peers find love and companionship, while they continue to fail in spectacular fashion when it comes to romance. As they reach their loneliness breaking point, they make a pact to forgo their familiar, vanilla personas in exchange for their unexplored, confident alter egos. They wave goodbye to Jeff’s awkward all-male book club and Anne’s flailing attempts to catch the eye of Jeff’s sexy neighbor Max, and say hello to raucous summer nights filled with booze, dancing, and sex. Naturally things don’t exactly go according to plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDxDSABzncDluXgqCQjjMjYej96.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333287'),
  ('538716056940327962', 'Slow Train', 2025, 'TV Movie', 'Nobuhiro Doi, Nobuhiro Doi', 'Akiko Nogi', 'Takako Matsu, Mikako Tabe, Tori Matsuzaka, Gen Hoshino, Joo Jong-hyuk, Lily Franky, Arata Iura, Yuki Kura', null, 'Set in Kamakura and Busan. The Shibuyas who live in Kamakura lost their grandmother and parents in an accident. On the 23rd anniversary of the death, Tsuko suddenly reveals her plan of moving to Busan to Yoko and Ushio, so the three siblings find themselves at the crossroads of their lives.', 'Set in Kamakura and Busan. The Shibuyas who live in Kamakura lost their grandmother and parents in an accident. On the 23rd anniversary of the death, Tsuko suddenly reveals her plan of moving to Busan to Yoko and Ushio, so the three siblings find themselves at the crossroads of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42zqF55QiK7cgZs446Ay65C3hXA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1377514'),
  ('786244328122474196', 'Slow Video', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kim Yeong-tak, Kim Gi-tae, Lee Hae-won', 'Kim Yeong-tak', 'Cha Tae-hyun, Nam Sang-mi, Oh Dal-su, Jin Kyung, Lee Hwa-Kyum, Ko Chang-seok, Park Myung-shin, Kim Kang-hyun', null, 'Jang-bu was an ordinary boy except his special talent; To see every moving thing like a slow motion video. As friends teased him by calling ‘monster eyes’, he decided to stick at home and not to go out. Television has been his only friend. Time passes by, and now grown-up Jang-bu works at the CCTV control center which is the best job for him. When he sees people’s life through camera, he feels he’s sharing their ordinary life that he’s never had. This new job opens his heart to the world and Jang-bu starts to make some friends out of the control center. With his dear friends he receives sense of himself and finally decides to propose a girl that he loved for long from CCTV…', 'Jang-bu was an ordinary boy except his special talent; To see every moving thing like a slow motion video. As friends teased him by calling ‘monster eyes’, he decided to stick at home and not to go out. Television has been his only friend. Time passes by, and now grown-up Jang-bu works at the CCTV control center which is the best job for him. When he sees people’s life through camera, he feels he’s sharing their ordinary life that he’s never had. This new job opens his heart to the world and Jang-bu starts to make some friends out of the control center. With his dear friends he receives sense of himself and finally decides to propose a girl that he loved for long from CCTV…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zPxNyV7jpoJWYiXNFQqrXPtcJCJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299244'),
  ('557733764272656815', 'Slow West', 2015, 'Western, Drama, Adventure, Romance, Thriller', 'John Maclean, Robbie Ryan, Andy Cole', 'John Maclean', 'Michael Fassbender, Kodi Smit-McPhee, Ben Mendelsohn, Caren Pistorius, Rory McCann, Eddie Campbell, Brooke Williams, Alex Macqueen', 'R', 'In the Old West, a 17-year-old Scottish boy teams up with a mysterious gunman to find the woman with whom he is infatuated.', 'In the Old West, a 17-year-old Scottish boy teams up with a mysterious gunman to find the woman with whom he is infatuated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3PmbRZvf5KpNbapSjn8b0CpD6a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223485'),
  ('1043761222465326081', 'SLR', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Lertsiri Boonmee, Wuttichai Wongnoppadon, Pramett Chankrasse', 'Lertsiri Boonmee, Wuttichai Wongnoppadon, Nophand Boonyai', 'Korapat Kirdpan, Cherprang Areekul, Sadanont Durongkhaweroj, Nophand Boonyai, Pinthip Orachorn, Duangjai Hiransri, Sarawut Krawnamyen, Sunon Wachirawarakarn', null, 'A photography major assigned to take pictures with a mysterious camera causes catastrophic consequences to the subjects captured by its lens.', 'A photography major assigned to take pictures with a mysterious camera causes catastrophic consequences to the subjects captured by its lens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mHQDLK9DZ5lULet8GhXYumd85p7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:947514'),
  ('123570963273667358', 'Slugs', 1988, 'Horror', 'Juan Piquer Simón, Julio Bragado Darman', 'José Antonio Escrivá, Juan Piquer Simón', 'Michael Garfield, Kim Terry, Philip MacHale, Alicia Moro, Santiago Álvarez, Concha Cuetos, Emilio Linder, Manuel de Blas', 'R', 'People are dying mysteriously and gruesomely, and nobody has a clue what the cause is. Only health worker Mike Brady has a possible solution, but his theory of killer slugs is laughed at by the authorities. Only when the body count begins to rise and a slug expert from England begins snooping around does it begin to look like Mike had the right idea after all.', 'People are dying mysteriously and gruesomely, and nobody has a clue what the cause is. Only health worker Mike Brady has a possible solution, but his theory of killer slugs is laughed at by the authorities. Only when the body count begins to rise and a slug expert from England begins snooping around does it begin to look like Mike had the right idea after all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkUYI3fy8d2Z613UwaGcofmT4p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28452'),
  ('52256522397903171', 'Slugs', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Michael Glawogger, Wolfgang Thaler', 'Michael Glawogger, Michael Ostrowski', 'Raimund Wallisch, Michael Ostrowski, Pia Hierzegger, Iva Lukic, Sophia Laggner, Georg Friedrich, Mike Supancic, Brigitte Kren', null, 'Three loser-type ex-students who earn too little money and don´t get laid as much as they want, try to change that by producing a home made porn movie starring themselves. They loan money from a pimp and begin casting the girls. When filming starts they find out that sex in front of the camera is hard work. Also you should know how to work a video camera. Frustration, relationship problems and cabin fever culminate in a dope induced garden orgy. But is it a film?', 'Three loser-type ex-students who earn too little money and don´t get laid as much as they want, try to change that by producing a home made porn movie starring themselves. They loan money from a pimp and begin casting the girls. When filming starts they find out that sex in front of the camera is hard work. Also you should know how to work a video camera. Frustration, relationship problems and cabin fever culminate in a dope induced garden orgy. But is it a film?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSXpYRYg4L0XFNQtg66W8keVqbu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20193'),
  ('1010952861596686595', 'SlugTerra: Return of the Elementals', 2014, 'Family, Animation, Adventure', 'Steve Sacks, Daniel DeSerranno, Behzad Mansoori-Dara', null, 'Shannon Chan-Kent, Andrew Francis, Brian Dobson, Mark Oliver, Lee Tockar, Sam Vincent', null, 'A new member has joined Eli and the Shane Gang! Junjie, once the protector of the Eastern Caverns, is a master of the slugslinging art of Slug Fu! But even with the power of five slingers, the Shane Gang find themselves in over their heads as they race across The 99 Caverns in search of the Legendary Elemental Slugs. The five Elementals are ancient slugs of great power, and the forbearers of all slugs found in SlugTerra today. In the wrong hands, they could bring Slugterra to the brink of destruction. So when an evil alliance starts hunting down the Elementals, Eli and his friends — old and new — take off in pursuit of the greatest threat their world has ever faced!', 'A new member has joined Eli and the Shane Gang! Junjie, once the protector of the Eastern Caverns, is a master of the slugslinging art of Slug Fu! But even with the power of five slingers, the Shane Gang find themselves in over their heads as they race across The 99 Caverns in search of the Legendary Elemental Slugs. The five Elementals are ancient slugs of great power, and the forbearers of all slugs found in SlugTerra today. In the wrong hands, they could bring Slugterra to the brink of destruction. So when an evil alliance starts hunting down the Elementals, Eli and his friends — old and new — take off in pursuit of the greatest threat their world has ever faced!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ApN2lteDsoIU5dDHJXeqVD13vpd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283564'),
  ('1143585284516555744', 'Slumber', 2017, 'Horror', 'Jonathan Hopkins', 'Richard Hobley, Jonathan Hopkins', 'Maggie Q, Will Kemp, Sylvester McCoy, Sam Troughton, Kristen Bush, Adam Lazarus, Susan Fordham, Charlie Bond', 'R', 'A sleep doctor tries to protect a family from a demon that feeds on people in their nightmares.', 'A sleep doctor tries to protect a family from a demon that feeds on people in their nightmares.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYbShpy94q0kbr2wqlZ0KmpcQy7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463602'),
  ('958028446324671337', 'Slumber Party Massacre', 2021, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Danishka Esterhazy, Cathy Poole, Tash Montlake', 'Suzanne Keilly', 'Hannah Gonera, Frances Sholto-Douglas, Mila Rayne, Alex McGregor, Reze-Tiana Wessels, Rob van Vuuren, Jennifer Steyn, Schelaine Bennett', null, 'Dana, daughter of the only survivor of a massacre in 1993, is going on a weekend trip with her friends. After their car breaks down in the very same town where her mother once fought the Driller Killer, Dana and her friends must come face-to-face with the man who has haunted her mother’s life for the past 30 years.', 'Dana, daughter of the only survivor of a massacre in 1993, is going on a weekend trip with her friends. After their car breaks down in the very same town where her mother once fought the Driller Killer, Dana and her friends must come face-to-face with the man who has haunted her mother’s life for the past 30 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEXyvykmnhoOhrmmUoaELEOhryV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:818543'),
  ('829219455312368914', 'Slumber Party Massacre II', 1987, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Deborah Brock, Thomas L. Callaway, Don Daniel', 'Deborah Brock', 'Crystal Bernard, Jennifer Rhodes, Kimberly McArthur, Patrick Lowe, Juliette Cummins, Heidi Kozak, Cindy Eilbacher, Atanas Ilitch', 'R', 'Courtney is tormented by dreams of the infamous Driller Killer returning to wreak havoc... only to find that the murderous monster is reincarnated as an evil rocker.', 'Courtney is tormented by dreams of the infamous Driller Killer returning to wreak havoc... only to find that the murderous monster is reincarnated as an evil rocker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1j7gCi3g2puzqyn7A2rPntHqjx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27764'),
  ('962584327834991625', 'Slumber Party Massacre III', 1990, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Sally Mattison, Jürgen Baum, Chris Edmonds', 'Catherine Cyran', 'Keely Christian, Brittain Frye, Michael Harris, David Greenlee, Brandi Burkett, Hope Marie Carlton, Maria Claire, Maria Ford', 'R', 'After a hard day of volleyball at the beach, a teen whose parents are away decides to have a slumber party with her girlfriends. Their boyfriends predictably show up to scare them, but a stranger from the beach is also seen lurking around the house. Soon the group begins experiencing an attrition problem.', 'After a hard day of volleyball at the beach, a teen whose parents are away decides to have a slumber party with her girlfriends. Their boyfriends predictably show up to scare them, but a stranger from the beach is also seen lurking around the house. Soon the group begins experiencing an attrition problem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rtwbZi9dIs9pcTi2pQFtLxUUonB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27767'),
  ('191235945184897651', 'Slumberland', 2022, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Jo Willems, Denise Chamian, Francis Lawrence', 'David Guion, Michael Handelman', 'Marlow Barkley, Jason Momoa, Chris O''Dowd, Kyle Chandler, Weruche Opia, India de Beaufort, Humberly González, Cameron Nicoll', 'PG', 'A young girl discovers a secret map to the dreamworld of Slumberland, and with the help of an eccentric outlaw, she traverses dreams and flees nightmares, with the hope that she will be able to see her late father again.', 'A young girl discovers a secret map to the dreamworld of Slumberland, and with the help of an eccentric outlaw, she traverses dreams and flees nightmares, with the hope that she will be able to see her late father again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCgBLNAFC4XDZ4DiyQ80PIJdSHU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:668461'),
