  ('473640998534521338', 'Slumming', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Glawogger, Hanuš Polak jr.', 'Michael Glawogger, Barbara Albert', 'Paulus Manker, August Diehl, Michael Ostrowski, Pia Hierzegger, Maria Bill, Martina Zinner, Brigitte Kren, Loretta Pflaum', null, 'Two yuppies play mean pranks on those around them until one joke has unexpected consequences.', 'Two yuppies play mean pranks on those around them until one joke has unexpected consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dP0dqoihTAyUGlyLAn5igttR0b6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76853'),
