  ('294042729054729659', 'Slut in a Good Way', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sophie Lorain, Marc Larose, Alexis Durand-Brault', 'Catherine Léger', 'Marguerite Bouchard, Rose Adam, Romane Denis, Alex Godbout, Anthony Therrien, Vassili Schneider, Marylou Belugou, Claudia Bouvette', null, 'Three 17-year-old girlfriends get a job at the Toy Depot for the holiday season and become smitten with the guys who work alongside them.', 'Three 17-year-old girlfriends get a job at the Toy Depot for the holiday season and become smitten with the guys who work alongside them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vchKNivcrFGN1FDRb1jqwn8VdWd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497931'),
  ('700460553185290122', 'Sly', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Andrew Shankweiler, Bryan Gentry, Graham Willoughby', null, 'Sylvester Stallone, Arnold Schwarzenegger, Frank Stallone Jr., Quentin Tarantino, Talia Shire, Henry Winkler, John Herzfeld, Wesley Morris', 'R', 'His love of film began as an escape from a rocky childhood. From underdog to Hollywood legend, Sylvester Stallone tells his story in this documentary.', 'His love of film began as an escape from a rocky childhood. From underdog to Hollywood legend, Sylvester Stallone tells his story in this documentary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1utWajLPvv1R9ZwkD98s2ZEngS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1146302'),
  ('418122865082889500', 'Slyth: The Hunt Saga', 2023, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, Romance', 'Panjapong Kongkanoy, Decha Srimantra', 'Panjapong Kongkanoy, Nattapot Potchumnean', 'Luke Ishikawa Plowden, Mookda Narinrak, Peemapol Panichtamrong, Supakchaya Sukbaiyen, Patpasit Na Songkhla, Kritsanapong Soonthornchatchawet, Pasut Banyam, Antoine Pinto', null, 'After a deadly forest fire sweeps the earth and fills the air with pollutants, society is on the brink of collapse and riddled with disease. The only hope seems to be in a legend come to life: that of the Slyth, a reptilian species that can disguise themselves as humans and possesses blood that can cure disease. The hunt is on.', 'After a deadly forest fire sweeps the earth and fills the air with pollutants, society is on the brink of collapse and riddled with disease. The only hope seems to be in a legend come to life: that of the Slyth, a reptilian species that can disguise themselves as humans and possesses blood that can cure disease. The hunt is on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6muOqoxmcR1AzHhiKaPUfvvpCIq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1072589'),
  ('768257746328345216', 'Smack Dab Kakha', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Victor Shamirov, Dmitriy Kasyan, Semen Yakovlev', 'Victor Shamirov, Artem Karokozyan', 'Artem Karokozyan, Artyom Kalaydzhan, Marina Kaletskaya, Lyudmila Artemeva, Michael Poghosian, Nana Mushtakova, Milena Tskhovreba-Agranovich, Tamara Turava', null, 'Kakha fell for the beautiful Sophia, but in order to get to her heart, he needed to overtake the brand new BMW Ruslan on his “penny” and score a friendship with Sergo. What will Kakh choose - love or friendship?', 'Kakha fell for the beautiful Sophia, but in order to get to her heart, he needed to overtake the brand new BMW Ruslan on his “penny” and score a friendship with Sergo. What will Kakh choose - love or friendship?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HN50rKZvPkHeUmjLi2fmbjcGz2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:679694'),
  ('484783896128086476', 'Small Apartments', 2012, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Jonas Åkerlund, Pär M. Ekberg, Kamil Korus', 'Chris Millis', 'Matt Lucas, Juno Temple, James Caan, Dolph Lundgren, Billy Crystal, Peter Stormare, DJ Qualls, Johnny Knoxville', 'R', 'When a clumsy deadbeat accidentally kills his landlord, he must do everything in his power to hide the body, only to find that the distractions of lust, the death of his beloved brother, and a crew of misfit characters force him on a journey where a fortune awaits him.', 'When a clumsy deadbeat accidentally kills his landlord, he must do everything in his power to hide the body, only to find that the distractions of lust, the death of his beloved brother, and a crew of misfit characters force him on a journey where a fortune awaits him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7j98OiCC6v0gOXJ9VF5t2kV169.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95755'),
  ('743201837912397312', 'Small Body', 2022, 'Drama', 'Laura Samani, Mitja Ličen, Marcella Libonati', 'Marco Borromei, Laura Samani, Elisa Dondi', 'Celeste Cescutti, Ondina Quadri, Marco Geromin, Giacomina Dereani, Anna Pia Bernardis, Angelo Mattiussi, Luca Sera, Teresa Cappellari', null, 'A young woman in early-1900s Italy searches for a mystical sanctuary where her stillborn child can be brought back to life long enough to be baptized.', 'A young woman in early-1900s Italy searches for a mystical sanctuary where her stillborn child can be brought back to life long enough to be baptized.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1JvPuYJ2cUs1nnoLHFvnww2MJq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:837745'),
  ('620933712872319366', 'Small Change', 1976, 'Comedy, Drama', 'François Truffaut, Suzanne Schiffman, Pierre-William Glenn', 'François Truffaut, Suzanne Schiffman', 'Jean-François Stévenin, Virginie Thévenet, Chantal Mercier, Tania Torrens, Nicole Félix, Philippe Goldman, Bruno de Stabenrath, Georges Desmouceaux', 'PG', 'The lives of a motherless young man, who''s just starting to find interest in women, and his physically abused, poverty stricken friend, are mixed with more or less innocent childhood experiences and challenges most their age experience.', 'The lives of a motherless young man, who''s just starting to find interest in women, and his physically abused, poverty stricken friend, are mixed with more or less innocent childhood experiences and challenges most their age experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBOkXZ2RsL2BO6NlrFgR9yT7J4I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1660'),
  ('434370932797317548', 'Small Country: An African Childhood', 2020, 'Drama', 'Antoine Sanier, Eric Barbier', 'Eric Barbier', 'Jean-Paul Rouve, Isabelle Kabano, Djibril Vancoppenolle, Delya de Medina, Veronika Varga, Tao Monladja, Ruben Ruhanamilindi, Brian Gakwavu', null, 'Gabriel, aged 10, lives in a comfortable ex-pat neighborhood in Burundi, his ‘small country’. Gabriel is a normal kid, happy, carefree and having adventures with his friends and little sister. Then in 1993, tensions in neighboring Rwanda spill over, threatening his family and his innocence.', 'Gabriel, aged 10, lives in a comfortable ex-pat neighborhood in Burundi, his ‘small country’. Gabriel is a normal kid, happy, carefree and having adventures with his friends and little sister. Then in 1993, tensions in neighboring Rwanda spill over, threatening his family and his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4QRNAoorNTsp46Gf977xcDGh6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:611808'),
  ('1021696747201986000', 'Small Crimes', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy, Thriller, Crime', 'E.L. Katz, Andrew Wheeler', 'E.L. Katz, Macon Blair', 'Nikolaj Coster-Waldau, Robert Forster, Jacki Weaver, Molly Parker, Gary Cole, Macon Blair, Michael Kinney, Daniela Sandiford', null, 'A disgraced former cop, fresh off a six-year prison sentence for attempted murder, returns home looking for redemption but winds up trapped in the mess he left behind.', 'A disgraced former cop, fresh off a six-year prison sentence for attempted murder, returns home looking for redemption but winds up trapped in the mess he left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7jmLmrs0pLlDU4GI6ItaJeqlET.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411405'),
  ('605505930313360092', 'Small Cuts', 2003, 'Drama', 'Pascal Bonitzer, William Lubtchansky', 'Pascal Bonitzer', 'Daniel Auteuil, Kristin Scott Thomas, Pascale Bussières, Ludivine Sagnier, Jean Yanne, Catherine Mouchet, Hanns Zischler, Emmanuelle Devos', null, 'Bruno, a communist newspaper journalist, is suffering a mid-life crisis. Torn between his wife Gaëlle and his young girlfriend Nathalie, his political beliefs battered by the wind of history, Bruno seems to have lost his bearings.', 'Bruno, a communist newspaper journalist, is suffering a mid-life crisis. Torn between his wife Gaëlle and his young girlfriend Nathalie, his political beliefs battered by the wind of history, Bruno seems to have lost his bearings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBZCR3RA7iih9XU1aSuiyu2AfPs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47499'),
  ('103607114223401840', 'Small Deaths', 1996, 'Drama', 'Lynne Ramsay, Lynne Ramsay, Alwin H. Küchler', 'Lynne Ramsay', 'James Ramsay, Lynne Ramsay Jr., Anne McLean, Genna Gillan, Jodie McCartney, Thomas Mullen, Ryan Rafferty, Billy Fitzpatrick', null, 'Based on personal memories and experiences of childhood, set in and around a Glasgow housing scheme. A triptych of moments of reflection and loss in one girl''s childhood and adolescence.', 'Based on personal memories and experiences of childhood, set in and around a Glasgow housing scheme. A triptych of moments of reflection and loss in one girl''s childhood and adolescence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/omKRrrKnkghLxiML7YFKJ7ACmHE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49489'),
  ('363793007855972212', 'Small Engine Repair', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Matt Mitchell, John Pollono, Jessie Roland', 'John Pollono', 'Jon Bernthal, Shea Whigham, Jordana Spiro, John Pollono, Ciara Bravo, Spencer House, Jennifer Pollono, Joshua Bitton', 'R', 'The seemingly casual reunion of three old friends at an out-of-the-way repair shop masks a hidden agenda fuelled by the arrival of a privileged young yuppie.', 'The seemingly casual reunion of three old friends at an out-of-the-way repair shop masks a hidden agenda fuelled by the arrival of a privileged young yuppie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xYm5fZXT0DNuGRUHdkQJ1puNYH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665896'),
  ('415117927941254601', 'Small Faces', 1996, 'Drama', 'Gillies MacKinnon, John de Borman', 'Billy MacKinnon, Gillies MacKinnon', 'Iain Robertson, Joseph McFadden, Steven Duffy, Laura Fraser, Garry Sweeney, Clare Higgins, Kevin McKidd, Mark McConnochie', 'R', 'Three teenage brothers, gang-member Bobby, troubled mama''s boy Alan and self-assured prankster Lex, reside in a downtrodden section of Glasgow, Scotland, circa 1968. But while Bobby and Alan are beginning to experience the power of raging hormones, the story focuses on Lex, who begins a downward spiral after he accidentally shoots the leader of Bobby''s gang. Lex''s cockiness and immaturity unfortunately prevent him from understanding the effect his subsequent crimes will have on both himself, and on those around him.', 'Three teenage brothers, gang-member Bobby, troubled mama''s boy Alan and self-assured prankster Lex, reside in a downtrodden section of Glasgow, Scotland, circa 1968. But while Bobby and Alan are beginning to experience the power of raging hormones, the story focuses on Lex, who begins a downward spiral after he accidentally shoots the leader of Bobby''s gang. Lex''s cockiness and immaturity unfortunately prevent him from understanding the effect his subsequent crimes will have on both himself, and on those around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pYFtU8vFj86TY435w99aK5fNjzl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42758'),
  ('707303616538049614', 'Small Fry', 2011, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Angus MacLane', 'Angus MacLane', 'Tom Hanks, Tim Allen, Joan Cusack, Estelle Harris, Wallace Shawn, John Ratzenberger, Teddy Newton, Angus MacLane', 'G', 'A fast food restaurant mini variant of Buzz forcibly switches places with the real Buzz and his friends have to deal with the obnoxious impostor.', 'A fast food restaurant mini variant of Buzz forcibly switches places with the real Buzz and his friends have to deal with the obnoxious impostor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8siICxMft0JSWZDq9YrXh5U5PZx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82424'),
  ('115596453917598010', 'Small Local Trains', 1960, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jean Bastia, Louis Manella, Jacques Klein', 'Guy Lionel, Pascal Bastia, Jean Bastia', 'Jean Richard, Roger Pierre, Louis de Funès, Nicky Valor, Danièle Lebrun, Annick Tanguy, Robert Rollis, Max Desrau', null, 'Émile Durand, an insecticide manufacturer, is appalled to learn that his son Gérard has fallen in love with Suzy, the daughter of a travelling theatre company. Realising his father will never favour the union, Gérard joins the company on their next tour. In an attempt to heal the rift, Durand’s wife goes after Gérard and ends up performing in their next play…', 'Émile Durand, an insecticide manufacturer, is appalled to learn that his son Gérard has fallen in love with Suzy, the daughter of a travelling theatre company. Realising his father will never favour the union, Gérard joins the company on their next tour. In an attempt to heal the rift, Durand’s wife goes after Gérard and ends up performing in their next play…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9r0tiSug9415gsqkhWiP6Otx1H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79878'),
  ('108438459050038144', 'Small Sacrifices', 1989, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'David Greene, Ron Orieux', null, 'Farrah Fawcett, Ryan O''Neal, Gordon Clapp, John Shea, Emily Perkins, Christopher Caravalho, Jayne Eastwood, Garry Chalk', null, 'A peculiar and disturbing case catches the attention of the police when a young mother and her children, all severely injured, show up in a hospital''s emergency room.', 'A peculiar and disturbing case catches the attention of the police when a young mother and her children, all severely injured, show up in a hospital''s emergency room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJlk8LUQiM1ymKAMNxf3giTgZoU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65575'),
