  ('752987883982053871', 'Small Talk', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Huang Hui-chen', 'Huang Hui-chen', 'Huang Hui-chen', null, 'In the table that symbolizes the value of traditional women, a woman who wants to break free from her family must face her daughter.', 'In the table that symbolizes the value of traditional women, a woman who wants to break free from her family must face her daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9eET1Yrykf3kY87wXXMIvUeYsAM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425046'),
  ('75263494186454946', 'Small Things Like These', 2024, 'Drama', 'Tanya Rosen, Daire Glynn, Frank van den Eeden', 'Enda Walsh', 'Cillian Murphy, Emily Watson, Michelle Fairley, Eileen Walsh, Zara Devlin, Clare Dunne, Helen Behan, Ella Cannon', 'PG-13', 'In 1985, while working as a coal merchant to support his family, Bill Furlong discovers disturbing secrets kept by the local convent and uncovers truths of his own; forcing him to confront his past and the complicit silence of a small Irish town controlled by the Catholic Church.', 'In 1985, while working as a coal merchant to support his family, Bill Furlong discovers disturbing secrets kept by the local convent and uncovers truths of his own; forcing him to confront his past and the complicit silence of a small Irish town controlled by the Catholic Church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdcO38cbWFg002nXg5QYtk7Tz4L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1102493'),
  ('226244412768834068', 'Small things of unquantifiable value', 1999, 'Drama', 'Arnaldo Catinari, Luca Miniero, Paolo Genovese', 'Paolo Genovese, Luca Miniero', 'Fabrizia Sacchi, Gianni Ferreri', null, 'A police officer records an unusual deposition from a young woman: all her dreams have been stolen.', 'A police officer records an unusual deposition from a young woman: all her dreams have been stolen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZkV2d5xrnF0wOJN6skPlJKD4o3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:519766'),
  ('903043406911566237', 'Small Time', 1996, 'Drama', 'Shane Meadows, Helene Whitehall', 'Shane Meadows', 'Shane Meadows, Mat Hand, Gena Kawecka, Dena Smiles, Jimmy Hynd, Leon Lammond, Tim Cunningham, Domonic Dillon', null, 'Follows a gang of small time crooks in an English town. Malc is in danger of losing his girlfriend Kate if he doesn''t spend more time at home and the gang leader Jumbo looks like he is about to lose control.', 'Follows a gang of small time crooks in an English town. Malc is in danger of losing his girlfriend Kate if he doesn''t spend more time at home and the gang leader Jumbo looks like he is about to lose control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbb7Ops8fNFu0yhaEe3uyjzrAiX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49501'),
  ('76191643082793316', 'Small Time Crooks', 2000, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Woody Allen, Zhao Fei, Richard Patrick', 'Woody Allen', 'Woody Allen, Tracey Ullman, Michael Rapaport, Tony Darrow, Jon Lovitz, Hugh Grant, Elaine May, Sam Josepher', 'PG', 'A loser of a crook and his wife strike it rich when a botched bank job''s cover business becomes a spectacular success.', 'A loser of a crook and his wife strike it rich when a botched bank job''s cover business becomes a spectacular success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eIJRFZFDmh0xXPlKt3WwN5fiSLe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10569'),
  ('1125101405939404393', 'Small Town Christmas', 2018, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Maclain Nelson', null, 'Kristoffer Polaha, Ashley Newbrough, Ryan McDonell, Nhi Do, Debs Howard, Bailey Skodje, Lucia Walters, Veronika Hadravá', null, 'Author Nell Phillips’ first book has become a surprise best-seller of the Christmas season. Nell’s last stop on a nationwide book tour takes her to the town of Springdale, the hometown of Emmett Turner, a young man she met over five years ago while both were junior copy editors at a New York publishing company. Nell was hurt when Emmett stood her up for a dinner date and then disappeared from New York without any explanation. As Nell is quick to admit, Emmett’s colorful, nostalgic anecdotes about Springdale inspired her to write this book that is shaping her life and especially this holiday season.', 'Author Nell Phillips’ first book has become a surprise best-seller of the Christmas season. Nell’s last stop on a nationwide book tour takes her to the town of Springdale, the hometown of Emmett Turner, a young man she met over five years ago while both were junior copy editors at a New York publishing company. Nell was hurt when Emmett stood her up for a dinner date and then disappeared from New York without any explanation. As Nell is quick to admit, Emmett’s colorful, nostalgic anecdotes about Springdale inspired her to write this book that is shaping her life and especially this holiday season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ofOSade5htAKST44j1q8oXqOFv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:555277'),
  ('258517375360542422', 'Small Town Crime', 2018, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Eshom Nelms, Ian Nelms, Johnny Derango', 'Eshom Nelms, Ian Nelms', 'John Hawkes, Anthony Anderson, Octavia Spencer, Robert Forster, Clifton Collins Jr., Michael Vartan, Caity Lotz, James Lafferty', 'R', 'Mike Kendall, a disgraced ex-cop, is fighting a losing battle with the bottle. When he finds a woman left for dead at the side of a road, Kendall turns private eye to track down her killers, taking one last shot at redemption.', 'Mike Kendall, a disgraced ex-cop, is fighting a losing battle with the bottle. When he finds a woman left for dead at the side of a road, Kendall turns private eye to track down her killers, taking one last shot at redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/scaazdj3prZ5H9YyKYqPM47GulO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412000'),
  ('100534212080817846', 'Small Town Folk', 2007, 'Horror', 'Peter Stanley-Ward', 'Dan Palmer', 'Chris R. Wright, Warwick Davis, Dan Palmer, Simon Stanley-Ward, Greg Martin, Hannah Flint, Howard Lew Lewis, Jon Nicholas', null, 'High above the tiny hamlet of Grockleton stands Beesley Manor, home to the ominous Landlord and his...shall we say, genetically ambiguent...minions, including Pooch, a cross-eyed marksman, and Dobbin, who likes to drink gasoline. The Landlord keeps a watchful eye over his domain, brutally dispatching any strangers who enter - except for females he needs to (involuntarily) sire a Beesley heir...When three unsuspecting travelers arrive, the Landlord plans to make two of them his trophies and the other his bride...unless they can beat him at his own game.', 'High above the tiny hamlet of Grockleton stands Beesley Manor, home to the ominous Landlord and his...shall we say, genetically ambiguent...minions, including Pooch, a cross-eyed marksman, and Dobbin, who likes to drink gasoline. The Landlord keeps a watchful eye over his domain, brutally dispatching any strangers who enter - except for females he needs to (involuntarily) sire a Beesley heir...When three unsuspecting travelers arrive, the Landlord plans to make two of them his trophies and the other his bride...unless they can beat him at his own game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qkWuQnWlopK9FdEiVAK4vJBAuMJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48675'),
  ('157279140957010420', 'Small Town Gay Bar', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Malcolm Ingram, Jonathon Cliff', null, 'Bill Curtis, Rick Gladish, Jim Bishop, Jack McCrory, Cindy Sartin, Geoff Kates, Debbie Shutawk, Martha Weaver', null, 'The story of community in the Deep South that is forced to deal with the struggles of ignorance, hypocrisy and oppression.', 'The story of community in the Deep South that is forced to deal with the struggles of ignorance, hypocrisy and oppression.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pmtStF3fFKohqL1uteBkIDSd2no.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48288'),
  ('816551936080627954', 'Small Town Girl', 1936, 'Comedy, Romance', 'William A. Wellman, Charles Rosher', 'Frances Goodrich, Albert Hackett, John Lee Mahin', 'Janet Gaynor, Robert Taylor, Binnie Barnes, Andy Devine, Lewis Stone, Elizabeth Patterson, Frank Craven, James Stewart', 'NR', 'Kay is a girl living in a small rural town whose life is just too dull and repetitious to bear. One night, she meets young, handsome, and rich Bob Dakin, who asks her for directions while drunk and then proceeds to take her out on a night on the town. Kay likes the stranger, and when the drunken Bob decides that they should get married, Kay hesitates little before consenting. The morning after the affair, Bob, once sober, regrets his mistake. His strict and upright parents, however, insist that the young couple pretend marriage for 6 months before divorcing, in order to avoid bad publicity. Bob resents Kay for standing in the way of him and his fiancée, Priscilla, but Kay still hopes that he''d have a change of heart.', 'Kay is a girl living in a small rural town whose life is just too dull and repetitious to bear. One night, she meets young, handsome, and rich Bob Dakin, who asks her for directions while drunk and then proceeds to take her out on a night on the town. Kay likes the stranger, and when the drunken Bob decides that they should get married, Kay hesitates little before consenting. The morning after the affair, Bob, once sober, regrets his mistake. His strict and upright parents, however, insist that the young couple pretend marriage for 6 months before divorcing, in order to avoid bad publicity. Bob resents Kay for standing in the way of him and his fiancée, Priscilla, but Kay still hopes that he''d have a change of heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gsrdNXfeYXj2DY6Df30XZkLM7Tz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109900'),
  ('499601654999990680', 'Small Town Girl', 1953, 'Music, Romance', 'László Kardos, Joseph Ruttenberg', 'Dorothy Cooper, Dorothy Kingsley', 'Jane Powell, Farley Granger, Ann Miller, S.Z. Sakall, Robert Keith, Bobby Van, Billie Burke, Fay Wray', 'NR', 'Rick Belrow Livingston, in love with Broadway star Lisa, is sentenced to 30 days in jail for speeding through a small town. He persuades the judge''s daughter Cindy to let him leave for one night, so that he can visit Lisa on her birthday. After that he goes on the town with Cindy and she falls in love with him. But Dr. Schemmer wants his son to become her husband.', 'Rick Belrow Livingston, in love with Broadway star Lisa, is sentenced to 30 days in jail for speeding through a small town. He persuades the judge''s daughter Cindy to let him leave for one night, so that he can visit Lisa on her birthday. After that he goes on the town with Cindy and she falls in love with him. But Dr. Schemmer wants his son to become her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2KyIFTkImRboZBmBGro2D3gKINM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111625'),
  ('575297714245761953', 'Small Town Killers', 2017, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Ole Bornedal, Linda Wassberg, Dan Laustsen', 'Ole Bornedal', 'Nicolas Bro, Ulrich Thomsen, Mia Lyhne, Lene Maria Christensen, Søren Malling, Birthe Neumann, Ole Thestrup, Gwen Taylor', null, 'The two tradesmen Ib and Edward are tired of their lifeless marriages and dream of living the good life from the stash of money they''ve earned moonlighting for years. After a huge fight with their wives the two men get drunk and hire a Russian contract killer to do a hit on their spouses. But they have badly underestimated their wives, and this becomes the start of an absurd journey where Ib and Edward to their own horror end at the top of a kill list.', 'The two tradesmen Ib and Edward are tired of their lifeless marriages and dream of living the good life from the stash of money they''ve earned moonlighting for years. After a huge fight with their wives the two men get drunk and hire a Russian contract killer to do a hit on their spouses. But they have badly underestimated their wives, and this becomes the start of an absurd journey where Ib and Edward to their own horror end at the top of a kill list.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mWMb0cLiuSofPLguY43S93BJq2Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425716'),
  ('194540000281690084', 'Small Town Murder Songs', 2010, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Ed Gass-Donnelly, Brendan Steacy', 'Ed Gass-Donnelly', 'Peter Stormare, Martha Plimpton, Jill Hennessy, Ari Cohen, Jackie Burroughs, Stephen Eric McIntyre, Alexandria Benoit, Aaron Poole', 'R', 'A modern, gothic tale of crime and redemption about an aging police officer from a small Ontario Mennonite town who hides a violent past until a local murder upsets the calm of his newly reformed life.', 'A modern, gothic tale of crime and redemption about an aging police officer from a small Ontario Mennonite town who hides a violent past until a local murder upsets the calm of his newly reformed life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGXjm0ikB4cZXiEU47UKxDfbNFI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69794'),
  ('592236557044745059', 'Small World', 2010, 'Drama', 'Bruno Chiche, Valérie Othnin-Girard, Thomas Hardmeier', 'Bruno Chiche', 'Gérard Depardieu, Alexandra Maria Lara, Niels Arestrup, Nathalie Baye, Yannick Renier, Françoise Fabian, Féodor Atkine, Olivier Claverie', null, 'Conrad Lang, a handyman in a rich family - he has been raised like a brother with Thomas, who has the same age -, accidentally puts fire to the big holiday house he keeps. He returns to the town he grew up in, to the family home, where Philippe, Thomas''s son, and Simone are getting married. Conrad''s frequent memory loss and behavioural problems rapidly reveal a neurological disease (Alzheimer''s is suggested by doctor Cohen when he examens Elvira) which leads Elvira, Thomas''s stepmother, to install Conrad in a guesthouse on the property, with the help of a nurse. When Conrad looses more and more his landmarks in present and past, memories of his youth come back to surface. They intrigue Simone, since these memories do not entirely fit together with the official family history...', 'Conrad Lang, a handyman in a rich family - he has been raised like a brother with Thomas, who has the same age -, accidentally puts fire to the big holiday house he keeps. He returns to the town he grew up in, to the family home, where Philippe, Thomas''s son, and Simone are getting married. Conrad''s frequent memory loss and behavioural problems rapidly reveal a neurological disease (Alzheimer''s is suggested by doctor Cohen when he examens Elvira) which leads Elvira, Thomas''s stepmother, to install Conrad in a guesthouse on the property, with the help of a nurse. When Conrad looses more and more his landmarks in present and past, memories of his youth come back to surface. They intrigue Simone, since these memories do not entirely fit together with the official family history...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tfNRiVFQ39hLheSlGrlmyhBXtTY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59112'),
  ('397814882296802458', 'Small World', 2021, 'Crime, Action, Drama', 'Patryk Vega, Norbert Modrzejewski', 'Olaf Olszewski, Patryk Vega', 'Piotr Adamczyk, Enrique Arce, Aleksey Serebryakov, Julia Wieniawa, Philip Lenkowsky, Marieta Żukowska, Jacek Grygorowicz, Adrian Kłos', null, 'After disappearing from a small Polish town, a mother discovers her 4-year old daughter, Ola, has been abducted by the Russian Mafia. In pursuit of her daughter, she is stopped for speeding by a police officer, Robert Goc. His intervention results in the escape of the kidnappers across the Eastern border. Feeling guilt for failing to prevent the abduction, Robert becomes engaged in an international investigation to find the missing girl.', 'After disappearing from a small Polish town, a mother discovers her 4-year old daughter, Ola, has been abducted by the Russian Mafia. In pursuit of her daughter, she is stopped for speeding by a police officer, Robert Goc. His intervention results in the escape of the kidnappers across the Eastern border. Feeling guilt for failing to prevent the abduction, Robert becomes engaged in an international investigation to find the missing girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wcXTkwCo0fw2mPqssyZFpYZDyjB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:851976'),
  ('620408780386884420', 'Small, Slow But Steady', 2022, 'Drama', 'Yuta Tsukinaga, Sho Miyake, Takashi Matsuo', 'Masaaki Sakai, Sho Miyake', 'Yukino Kishii, Tomokazu Miura, Masaki Miura, Shinichiro Matsuura, Himi Sato, Hiroko Nakajima, Nobuko Sendo, Nana Nakahara', null, 'Keiko surprises everyone when she overcomes adversity to win her first two boxing fights. But when an unexpected incident threatens the closure of her gym, she is pushed further than she thought possible.', 'Keiko surprises everyone when she overcomes adversity to win her first two boxing fights. But when an unexpected incident threatens the closure of her gym, she is pushed further than she thought possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIsth8GstyIznK0TMiWP6pVdxA2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:928730'),
  ('1139840138035964235', 'Smallfoot', 2018, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Animation, Fantasy', 'Karey Kirkpatrick, Jason Reisig', 'Eyal Podell, Jonathon E. Stewart, Sergio Pablos', 'Channing Tatum, James Corden, Zendaya, Common, LeBron James, Danny DeVito, Gina Rodriguez, Yara Shahidi', 'PG', 'A bright young yeti finds something he thought didn''t exist—a human. News of this “smallfoot” throws the simple yeti community into an uproar over what else might be out there in the big world beyond their snowy village.', 'A bright young yeti finds something he thought didn''t exist—a human. News of this “smallfoot” throws the simple yeti community into an uproar over what else might be out there in the big world beyond their snowy village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfaiO7QgpcvR8XDOMokWLRfKeTE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446894'),
  ('931496484013549084', 'Smalltown, Italy', 2005, 'Drama', 'Stefano Mordini, Italo Petriccione', 'Stefano Mordini, Silvia Barbiera', 'Valentina Cervi, Stefano Accorsi, Adele Ferruzzi, Lorenzo Zanetti, Luisa Pasello, Miro Landoni, Ivan Franěk', null, 'A mentally unstable woman loses her daughter''s custody to her mother. Things get even more complicated when her husband has a car accident and befriends a Czech mechanic, bringing the man into their dysfunctional home.', 'A mentally unstable woman loses her daughter''s custody to her mother. Things get even more complicated when her husband has a car accident and befriends a Czech mechanic, bringing the man into their dysfunctional home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMyiOkOAPtj6DM84NRkkVs8A8LX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63275'),
  ('805199223086781869', 'Smaragda - I Got Thick Skin and I Can''t Jump', 2026, 'Drama', 'Emilios Avraam, Giorgos Rahmatoulin, Peter Stephanou', 'Emilios Avraam', 'Niovi Charalampous, Eleni Sidera, Fivos Papakostas, Paris Erotokritou, Patrick Myles', null, 'Smaragda, 46, amid failed relationships and a stagnant career, ponders her legacy. She becomes a kids entertainer at a tourist resort and embraces social media, facing both fame and backlash, as she embarks on a journey of self-discovery.', 'Smaragda, 46, amid failed relationships and a stagnant career, ponders her legacy. She becomes a kids entertainer at a tourist resort and embraces social media, facing both fame and backlash, as she embarks on a journey of self-discovery.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FyFzuzOwDbAIBAdkmhRoZsC7OZEe.jpg', 'plex:movie:smaragda-i-got-thick-skin-and-i-cant-jump'),
  ('1063772282321445158', 'Smart Ass', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kim Chapiron, Crystel Fournier, Gigi Akoka', 'Kim Chapiron, Noé Debré', 'Thomas Blumenthal, Alice Isaaz, Jean-Baptiste Lafarge, Karim Ait M''Hand, Marine Sainsily, Marianne Denicourt, Bruno Abraham-Kremer, Xavier de Rosnay', null, 'Kelly, Dan and Louis are students at a prestigious business school, destined to become tomorrow''s elite. The industrious trio are determined to start putting their education into practise from the off in an attempt to make as much money as they can from their fellow students. Working on the theory that relationships between the sexes can be regulated by market principles, they begin to inflate the popularity of certain individuals artificially, by hiring beautiful and sexy off-campus women as their dates for exclusive and riotous college parties. However their perfect business model soon spirals out of control as their moneymaking scheme takes off in a big way across campus.', 'Kelly, Dan and Louis are students at a prestigious business school, destined to become tomorrow''s elite. The industrious trio are determined to start putting their education into practise from the off in an attempt to make as much money as they can from their fellow students. Working on the theory that relationships between the sexes can be regulated by market principles, they begin to inflate the popularity of certain individuals artificially, by hiring beautiful and sexy off-campus women as their dates for exclusive and riotous college parties. However their perfect business model soon spirals out of control as their moneymaking scheme takes off in a big way across campus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b8DvyG3ueUcxEkyIB2i2vnnBiHu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253687'),
  ('376698697981756358', 'Smart Blonde', 1937, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Frank McDonald, Warren Lynch', 'Don Ryan, Kenneth Gamet', 'Glenda Farrell, Barton MacLane, Wini Shaw, Addison Richards, Robert Paige, Craig Reynolds, Charlotte Wynters, Jane Wyman', null, 'Ambitious reporter Torchy Blane guides her policeman boyfriend to correctly pinpoint who shot the man she was interviewing.', 'Ambitious reporter Torchy Blane guides her policeman boyfriend to correctly pinpoint who shot the man she was interviewing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64so4wlOh1T1HnDhtybADisPAG7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88972'),
  ('710289586082489675', 'Smart Girls Don''t Talk', 1948, 'Drama', 'Richard L. Bare, Ted D. McCord', 'William Sackheim', 'Virginia Mayo, Bruce Bennett, Robert Hutton, Tom D''Andrea, Richard Rober, Helen Westcott, Richard Benedict, Ben Welden', 'NR', 'A society woman gets involved with a gangster only to find he has hidden plans.', 'A society woman gets involved with a gangster only to find he has hidden plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7BDNXnMAJPyegBZ6QBhe14pybAx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65213'),
  ('147272535762801425', 'Smart House', 1999, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'LeVar Burton, Jonathan West', 'Stu Krieger, William Hudson', 'Katey Sagal, Ryan Merriman, Katie Volding, Kevin Kilner, Jessica Steen, Emilio Borelli, Paul Linke, Jason Lansing', 'G', 'Ben Cooper and his family are struggling to get a grip on household chores, school and work. So when Ben sees that a Smart House is being given away, he enters the competition as often as he can, until they eventually win the house (named Pat). After moving in, Pat''s personality radically begins to change, turning the Coopers against her.', 'Ben Cooper and his family are struggling to get a grip on household chores, school and work. So when Ben sees that a Smart House is being given away, he enters the competition as often as he can, until they eventually win the house (named Pat). After moving in, Pat''s personality radically begins to change, turning the Coopers against her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t9QsaGkvHCt5A2IEv8jN1TkPPfo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35215'),
  ('95340104339044101', 'Smart Money', 1931, 'Crime, Drama', 'Alfred E. Green, Robert Kurrle, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Lucien Hubbard, John Bright, Joseph Jackson', 'Edward G. Robinson, James Cagney, Evalyn Knapp, Ralf Harolde, Noel Francis, Margaret Livingston, Maurice Black, Billy House', 'NR', 'Two brothers'' trip to the big city to do a little gambling results in a fateful turn of events.', 'Two brothers'' trip to the big city to do a little gambling results in a fateful turn of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2KnQNZSnle6xxAF1K846byLZ63J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17966'),
  ('21256891477021459', 'Smart People', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Noam Murro, Toby Irwin', 'Mark Poirier', 'Dennis Quaid, Sarah Jessica Parker, Thomas Haden Church, Elliot Page, Ashton Holmes, Christine Lahti, Camille Mana, David Denman', 'R', 'Professor Lawrence Wetherhold might be imperiously brilliant, monumentally self-possessed and an intellectual giant -- but when it comes to solving the conundrums of love and family, he''s as downright flummoxed as the next guy.', 'Professor Lawrence Wetherhold might be imperiously brilliant, monumentally self-possessed and an intellectual giant -- but when it comes to solving the conundrums of love and family, he''s as downright flummoxed as the next guy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igIl4RKxOEYvhQGKCvM6vCRMiVm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12890'),
  ('1150188680287553398', 'Smarty Cat', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Daws Butler, Jerry Mann', 'NR', 'Nobody''s home, so Tom invites his alley cat friends in to look at home movies (clips from earlier cartoons where Tom gets the drop on Spike). While they''re showing them, Spike sneaks in.', 'Nobody''s home, so Tom invites his alley cat friends in to look at home movies (clips from earlier cartoons where Tom gets the drop on Spike). While they''re showing them, Spike sneaks in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xei3FbcWKSP25pHiGKOK7V7iwIN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79263'),
  ('950999926389131524', 'Smash and Grab', 2019, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Brian Larsen, Farhez Rayani, Farhez Rayani', 'Brian Larsen', 'Kenny Pickett', 'PG', 'After years of toiling away inside the engine room of a towering locomotive, two antiquated robots will risk everything for freedom and for each other.', 'After years of toiling away inside the engine room of a towering locomotive, two antiquated robots will risk everything for freedom and for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsDQdjuGAhj6JrmCKVBFTUBeIrb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532952'),
  ('605587408397947797', 'Smash Cut', 2009, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Lee Demarbre, Warren Dean Fulton, Eszter Kertesz', 'Ian Driscoll', 'Sasha Grey, Jesse Buck, David Hess, Michael Berryman, Ray Sager, Jennilee Murray, Michael Dubue, Herschell Gordon Lewis', null, 'Television news celebrity April Carson turns to the services of private investigator Isaac Beaumonde to seek her missing sister, a stripper known as Gigi Spot. Carson assumes a role in a horror movie in the process, eventually learning that the movie''s director, Able Whitman, is not only the culprit, but that he has rendered her sister''s body into props for the production.', 'Television news celebrity April Carson turns to the services of private investigator Isaac Beaumonde to seek her missing sister, a stripper known as Gigi Spot. Carson assumes a role in a horror movie in the process, eventually learning that the movie''s director, Able Whitman, is not only the culprit, but that he has rendered her sister''s body into props for the production.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uvPMUcCz0D0MJCtkaOAwFTm1CgR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22335'),
  ('745241664054991021', 'Smash Palace', 1981, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Roger Donaldson, Graeme Cowley', 'Roger Donaldson, Peter Hansard, Bruno Lawrence', 'Bruno Lawrence, Anna Maria Monticelli, Greer Robson, Keith Aberdein, Desmond Kelly, Lynne Robson, Margaret Umbers, Bryan Johnson', null, 'Al Shaw''s life revolves around motor racing and his back country junkyard, the "Smash Palace". His French wife, Jacqui, doesn''t appreciate the lack of attention due to Al''s obsession with cars. When Al finds her in the arms of another man, he takes his daughter, Georgie and heads for the bush, desperately hoping to hold on to the only family he has left.', 'Al Shaw''s life revolves around motor racing and his back country junkyard, the "Smash Palace". His French wife, Jacqui, doesn''t appreciate the lack of attention due to Al''s obsession with cars. When Al finds her in the arms of another man, he takes his daughter, Georgie and heads for the bush, desperately hoping to hold on to the only family he has left.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84u6i9r8jsqTYVG6SRd0CvlaoP6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33310'),
  ('123332312039149622', 'Smash-Up: The Story of a Woman', 1947, 'Drama', 'Stuart Heisler, Stanley Cortez, Charles Felstead', 'John Howard Lawson', 'Susan Hayward, Lee Bowman, Marsha Hunt, Eddie Albert, Carl Esmond, Carleton Young, Charles D. Brown, Janet Murdoch', 'NR', 'A nightclub singer uses alcohol in excess to sooth her painful life.', 'A nightclub singer uses alcohol in excess to sooth her painful life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNTmxsWoDz6tQwEtTI266FFK5pj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48994'),
  ('454777900895891765', 'Smashed', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'James Ponsoldt, Tobias Datum, Rico Savage', 'Susan Burke, James Ponsoldt', 'Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Aaron Paul, Octavia Spencer, Nick Offerman, Megan Mullally, Mary Kay Place, Kyle Gallner, Mackenzie Davis', 'R', 'Kate and Charlie like to have a good time. Their marriage thrives on a shared fondness for music, laughter… and getting smashed. When Kate’s partying spirals into hard-core asocial behavior, compromising her job as an elementary schoolteacher, something’s got to give. But change isn’t exactly a cakewalk. Sobriety means she will have to confront the lies she’s been spinning at work, her troubling relationship with her mother, and the nature of her bond with Charlie.', 'Kate and Charlie like to have a good time. Their marriage thrives on a shared fondness for music, laughter… and getting smashed. When Kate’s partying spirals into hard-core asocial behavior, compromising her job as an elementary schoolteacher, something’s got to give. But change isn’t exactly a cakewalk. Sobriety means she will have to confront the lies she’s been spinning at work, her troubling relationship with her mother, and the nature of her bond with Charlie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4b2k3bB5C6AC9s3FFZhjZw7rB1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84341'),
  ('271619164458688659', 'Smashing the 0-Line', 1960, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Seijun Suzuki, Shigeyoshi Mine, Toshitaro Nakao', 'Yasuro Yokoyama', 'Hiroyuki Nagato, Yuji Odaka, Mayumi Shimizu, Sanae Nakahara, Shoichi Ozawa, Yuzo Kiura, Emiko Azuma, Kaku Takashina', null, 'Katiri is a reporter so ambitiously amoral that he’ll sell out anyone—including his partner and the drug dealer he’s sleeping with—to get a scoop. But what happens when an even more ruthless female gang boss kidnaps his sister?', 'Katiri is a reporter so ambitiously amoral that he’ll sell out anyone—including his partner and the drug dealer he’s sleeping with—to get a scoop. But what happens when an even more ruthless female gang boss kidnaps his sister?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AllPHu35amgM0iApYnd6Bys20TY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367428'),
  ('614336035327777542', 'Smashing Time', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Desmond Davis', 'George Melly', 'Rita Tushingham, Lynn Redgrave, Michael York, Anna Quayle, Irene Handl, Ian Carmichael, Jeremy Lloyd, Toni Palmer', null, 'Two young women arrive in London to make it big in show business, and become corrupted by money and fame in the process.', 'Two young women arrive in London to make it big in show business, and become corrupted by money and fame in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSDdaaNPcKWOOJ7nliC0eWxbhrE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110479'),
  ('763594413011397910', 'Smic, Smac, Smoc', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Claude Lelouch, Jean Collomb', 'Pierre Uytterhoeven, Claude Lelouch', 'Catherine Allégret, Charles Gérard, Amidou, Jean Collomb, Francis Lai, Claude Pinoteau, Claude Lelouch, Charles Gérard', null, 'Charles, Jean and Amidou are workmen at the La Ciotat shipyards and live in the same construction facility. One day, Amidou leaves them to marry Catherine, a salesgirl. The trouble for Charles and Jean is that going to their friend''s wedding means buying new clothes, which is problematic given their low income Moreover, they are determined to make this day an unforgettable one, despite their lack of money. Will they be able achieve their aim?', 'Charles, Jean and Amidou are workmen at the La Ciotat shipyards and live in the same construction facility. One day, Amidou leaves them to marry Catherine, a salesgirl. The trouble for Charles and Jean is that going to their friend''s wedding means buying new clothes, which is problematic given their low income Moreover, they are determined to make this day an unforgettable one, despite their lack of money. Will they be able achieve their aim?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9aLWvAvpt6xntS8cCfHpt7N12kz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436927'),
  ('680238605902390153', 'Smile', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Michael Ritchie, Conrad Hall', 'Jerry Belson', 'Bruce Dern, Barbara Feldon, Michael Kidd, Geoffrey Lewis, Nicholas Pryor, Joan Prather, Denise Nickerson, Melanie Griffith', 'PG', 'It''s time again for California''s "Young American Miss" beauty pageant, the biggest event of the year for Big Bob Freelander and Brenda DiCarlo, who give their all to put on a successful pageant. But Brenda is having marital difficulties and Bob''s son is up to some mischief. Could this year''s pageant be in jeopardy?', 'It''s time again for California''s "Young American Miss" beauty pageant, the biggest event of the year for Big Bob Freelander and Brenda DiCarlo, who give their all to put on a successful pageant. But Brenda is having marital difficulties and Bob''s son is up to some mischief. Could this year''s pageant be in jeopardy?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vyeOUnl9A0RaLft6JL0tyMfBhsA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42264'),
  ('251661189833482289', 'Smile', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Francesco Gasperoni, Gianni Marras, Laura Ugolini', 'Francesco Gasperoni', 'Armand Assante, Giorgia Massetti, Harriet MacMasters-Green, Antonio Cupo, Manuela Zanier, Mourad Zaoui, Robert Capelli Jr., Tara Haggiag', 'NR', 'A carefree summer vacation turns into an inescapable terror trap for a group of young students who buy a vintage instant camera from a mysterious local shop owner...', 'A carefree summer vacation turns into an inescapable terror trap for a group of young students who buy a vintage instant camera from a mysterious local shop owner...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Hk4ubepZZNwlNEbyYt2ejzCvr5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49690'),
  ('738126360426449900', 'Smile', 2022, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Parker Finn, Charlie Sarroff, Ryan Palmer', 'Parker Finn', 'Sosie Bacon, Kyle Gallner, Jessie T. Usher, Robin Weigert, Caitlin Stasey, Kal Penn, Rob Morgan, Gillian Zinser', 'R', 'After witnessing a bizarre, traumatic incident involving a patient, Dr. Rose Cotter starts experiencing frightening occurrences that she can''t explain.', 'After witnessing a bizarre, traumatic incident involving a patient, Dr. Rose Cotter starts experiencing frightening occurrences that she can''t explain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aPqcQwu4VGEewPhagWNncDbJ9Xp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:882598'),
  ('648224764357677809', 'Smile 2', 2024, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Parker Finn, Charlie Sarroff, Ivan J. Fonseca', 'Parker Finn', 'Naomi Scott, Rosemarie DeWitt, Lukas Gage, Miles Gutierrez-Riley, Peter Jacobson, Ray Nicholson, Dylan Gelula, Raúl Castillo', 'R', 'About to embark on a new world tour, global pop sensation Skye Riley begins experiencing increasingly terrifying and inexplicable events. Overwhelmed by the escalating horrors and the pressures of fame, Skye is forced to face her dark past to regain control of her life before it spirals out of control.', 'About to embark on a new world tour, global pop sensation Skye Riley begins experiencing increasingly terrifying and inexplicable events. Overwhelmed by the escalating horrors and the pressures of fame, Skye is forced to face her dark past to regain control of her life before it spirals out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ht8Uv9QPv9y7K0RvUyJIaXOZTfd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1100782'),
  ('1094666888565431916', 'Smile at Last', 1985, 'Drama, Family', 'Leida Laius, Ly Pulk, Arvo Iho', 'Marina Sheptunova', 'Monika Raide, Hendrik Toompere, Tauri Tallermaa, Katrin Tamleht, Kerttu Aaving, Edith-Helen Kuusk, Siiri Sisask, Janika Kalmus', null, '16-year-old Mari, raised without a mother by a drunkard father, is put in an orphanage which she immediately, though unsuccessfully, tries to flee from. The sensitive Mari finds it hard to adapt to the coarse manners and brutal games amongst the children. Only gradually does she develop a sense for the similarly difficult fates of her fellow sufferers, who have long forgotten how to cry. She even falls in love for the first time, not with her self-appointed “protector” Tauri, but with the rough-mannered Robi.', '16-year-old Mari, raised without a mother by a drunkard father, is put in an orphanage which she immediately, though unsuccessfully, tries to flee from. The sensitive Mari finds it hard to adapt to the coarse manners and brutal games amongst the children. Only gradually does she develop a sense for the similarly difficult fates of her fellow sufferers, who have long forgotten how to cry. She even falls in love for the first time, not with her self-appointed “protector” Tauri, but with the rough-mannered Robi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sTcV3zBRBrxYddJPCxwDTWCtaEd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280219'),
  ('911312179790337646', 'Smile Before Death', 1972, 'Crime, Horror, Mystery', 'Silvio Amadio, Silvano Ippoliti', 'Franz, Francesco Di Dio', 'Jenny Tamburi, Silvano Tranquilli, Rosalba Neri, Hiram Keller, Dana Ghia, Zora Gheorgieva, Luigi Antonio Guerra, Fabio Garriba', null, 'After the death of her mother under strange circumstances, a teenage girl quickly begins to suspect that her recently widowed stepfather may be involved.', 'After the death of her mother under strange circumstances, a teenage girl quickly begins to suspect that her recently widowed stepfather may be involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/roSK8nBVpvgpNPQ0cCNIj23FQG4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105113'),
  ('770760761450367975', 'Smile Precure! The Movie: Big Mismatch in a Picture Book!', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Action, Adventure, Family', 'Kenji Takahashi, Narumi Kuroda', 'Shouji Yonemura', 'Misato Fukuen, Asami Tano, Hisako Kanemoto, Marina Inoue, Chinami Nishimura, Megumi Hayashibara, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Ikue Otani', null, 'The movie transports the Precure into a world inside a picture book, where they are guided by Niko, a mysterious inhabitant of the picture book world.', 'The movie transports the Precure into a world inside a picture book, where they are guided by Niko, a mysterious inhabitant of the picture book world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dR7ITgav26onfb2KPjIYnKqjG0J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179883'),
  ('850793795278799008', 'Smile, Darn Ya, Smile!', 1931, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Rudolf Ising', null, 'Rudolf Ising', null, 'A streetcar conductor, Foxy has adventures with a would-be passenger hippo, a cow blocking the tracks, and a runaway train while Foxy, his passengers, and some hobos sing the title song.', 'A streetcar conductor, Foxy has adventures with a would-be passenger hippo, a cow blocking the tracks, and a runaway train while Foxy, his passengers, and some hobos sing the title song.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2BnaDbbOoJYZzVtUDBeL4vbzeYL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150489'),
  ('105490521608176646', 'Smiles of a Summer Night', 1955, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ingmar Bergman, Gunnar Fischer, Lennart Olsson', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Gunnar Björnstrand, Ulla Jacobsson, Eva Dahlbeck, Harriet Andersson, Margit Carlqvist, Jarl Kulle, Åke Fridell, Björn Bjelfvenstam', 'NR', 'Early in the 20th century, middle-aged lawyer Fredrik Egerman and his young wife, Anne, have still not consummated their marriage, while Fredrik''s son finds himself increasingly attracted to his new stepmother. To make matters worse, Fredrik''s old flame Desiree makes a public bet that she can seduce him at a romantic weekend retreat where four couples convene, swapping partners and pairing off in unexpected ways.', 'Early in the 20th century, middle-aged lawyer Fredrik Egerman and his young wife, Anne, have still not consummated their marriage, while Fredrik''s son finds himself increasingly attracted to his new stepmother. To make matters worse, Fredrik''s old flame Desiree makes a public bet that she can seduce him at a romantic weekend retreat where four couples convene, swapping partners and pairing off in unexpected ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKeV8lKz8k9DDBCw6MJ9MkhvhqF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11700'),
  ('819919790905985048', 'Smiley', 2012, 'Horror', 'Michael J. Gallagher, Nicola B. Marsh', 'Glasgow Phillips, Michael J. Gallagher', 'Caitlin Gerard, Melanie Papalia, Shane Dawson, Andrew James Allen, Liza Weil, Roger Bart, Keith David, Toby Turner', 'R', 'After learning of an urban legend in which a demented serial killer named SMILEY can be summoned through the internet, mentally fragile Ashley must decide whether she is losing her mind or becoming Smiley''s next victim.', 'After learning of an urban legend in which a demented serial killer named SMILEY can be summoned through the internet, mentally fragile Ashley must decide whether she is losing her mind or becoming Smiley''s next victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rO8jANmASmul1tWi53mudn1V9IA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119278'),
  ('137781910147303345', 'Smiley Face', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Gregg Araki, Shawn Kim, Amy Armstrong', 'Dylan Haggerty', 'Anna Faris, John Krasinski, Adam Brody, Jane Lynch, Roscoe Lee Browne, Danny Masterson, Brian Posehn, Danny Trejo', 'R', 'Jane, a struggling but perpetually stoned actress, has a busy day ahead. She has several important tasks on her list, including buying more marijuana. Even though she already has a good start on the day''s planned drug use, she eats her roommate''s pot-laced cupcakes and embarks on a series of misadventures all over Los Angeles.', 'Jane, a struggling but perpetually stoned actress, has a busy day ahead. She has several important tasks on her list, including buying more marijuana. Even though she already has a good start on the day''s planned drug use, she eats her roommate''s pot-laced cupcakes and embarks on a series of misadventures all over Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGQZGujjw8S6NKs5C8nugsMtol.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13168'),
  ('537063894963186859', 'Smiley Face Killers', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Stephen Shimek, Samson Haveland, Jan Wielski', 'Bret Easton Ellis', 'Ronen Rubinstein, Mia Serafino, Crispin Glover, Amadeus Serafini, Ashley Rickards, Garrett Coffey, Cody Simpson, Daniel Covin', 'R', 'Handsome young soccer player Jake Graham believes he is going insane, unable to shake the feeling of being stalked by something, by someone.', 'Handsome young soccer player Jake Graham believes he is going insane, unable to shake the feeling of being stalked by something, by someone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6mX91NNNKdFrHxAA7WX7kM8m6T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:718416'),
  ('770510456956771405', 'Smilin'' Through', 1932, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sidney Franklin, Douglas Shearer, Lee Garmes', 'Ernest Vajda, Claudine West', 'Norma Shearer, Fredric March, Leslie Howard, O. P. Heggie, Ralph Forbes, Beryl Mercer, Margaret Seddon, Forrester Harvey', null, 'On the day of his wedding, Sir John Carteret''s fiancée, Moonyeen, is killed by a jealous rival named Jeremy, leaving him emotionally devastated. Carteret spends three decades in seclusion, mostly communing with the spirit of Moonyeen, until he learns that her niece, Kathleen, has become an orphan. He adopts and raises the child as his own but is alarmed when, as a young woman, she falls in love with the son of Moonyeen''s murderer.', 'On the day of his wedding, Sir John Carteret''s fiancée, Moonyeen, is killed by a jealous rival named Jeremy, leaving him emotionally devastated. Carteret spends three decades in seclusion, mostly communing with the spirit of Moonyeen, until he learns that her niece, Kathleen, has become an orphan. He adopts and raises the child as his own but is alarmed when, as a young woman, she falls in love with the son of Moonyeen''s murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aq0rbICU0lGFQlCYMLJwV0iolPv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84303'),
  ('1110586031300508440', 'Smiling Eyes', 1977, 'Family, Drama, Comedy', 'Ertem Eğilmez, Hüseyin Özşahin', 'Sadık Şendil', 'Münir Özkul, Adile Naşit, Halit Akçatepe, Müjde Ar, Itır Esen, Şener Şen, Ayşen Gruda, Mahmut Hekimoğlu', null, 'A couple who dreamed of having a son had five daughters in a row. When girls reach the age of marriage, there are moments that make them laugh and sometimes make them sad.', 'A couple who dreamed of having a son had five daughters in a row. When girls reach the age of marriage, there are moments that make them laugh and sometimes make them sad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p9rr1TO9soC5VWCUAoSMAbP0CF6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65010'),
  ('887695242648128148', 'Smiling Fish & Goat On Fire', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kevin Jordan, Frederick Iannone, Polo Meadowbrook', 'Kevin Jordan, Derick Martini, Steven Martini', 'Derick Martini, Bill Henderson, Steven Martini, Christa Miller, Amy Hathaway, Rosemarie Addeo, Nicole Rae, Heather Jae Marie', null, 'Two brothers share a house in LA''s Fairfax district: Tony''s a feckless actor, Chris is an accountant. Both are in relationships on rocky ground. As these emotions swirl, Tony meets his US Postal Service letter carrier, a single mom named Kathy who''s come to LA from Wyoming with her daughter, a budding actress. Chris meets Anna, an Italian beauty working in the States for a few months wrangling animals on movie sets. Chris also befriends Clive, an aging and crusty man whose longing for his recently-deceased wife is a portrait of true love. Can Clive''s example help Chris sort out his love life, and can Tony grow up enough to see the possibilities with Kathy and her daughter?', 'Two brothers share a house in LA''s Fairfax district: Tony''s a feckless actor, Chris is an accountant. Both are in relationships on rocky ground. As these emotions swirl, Tony meets his US Postal Service letter carrier, a single mom named Kathy who''s come to LA from Wyoming with her daughter, a budding actress. Chris meets Anna, an Italian beauty working in the States for a few months wrangling animals on movie sets. Chris also befriends Clive, an aging and crusty man whose longing for his recently-deceased wife is a portrait of true love. Can Clive''s example help Chris sort out his love life, and can Tony grow up enough to see the possibilities with Kathy and her daughter?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGCNG3Md9t0Zvhksr27aqXa1AI9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125537'),
  ('823753600071716386', 'Smilla''s Sense of Snow', 1997, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Bille August, Jörgen Persson, Arthur Wooster', 'Ann Biderman', 'Julia Ormond, Gabriel Byrne, Richard Harris, Jim Broadbent, Tom Wilkinson, Robert Loggia, Vanessa Redgrave, Bob Peck', null, 'Smilla Jaspersen attempts to understand the death of a small boy who falls from the roof of her apartment building. Suspecting wrongdoing, Smilla uncovers a trail of clues leading towards a secretive corporation that has made several mysterious expeditions to Greenland.', 'Smilla Jaspersen attempts to understand the death of a small boy who falls from the roof of her apartment building. Suspecting wrongdoing, Smilla uncovers a trail of clues leading towards a secretive corporation that has made several mysterious expeditions to Greenland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2BwL0fKCaNRXfqMsu2uvFFS7dZX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9311'),
  ('97240673575350940', 'Smith!', 1969, 'Drama, Family, Western', 'Michael O''Herlihy', 'Louis Pelletier', 'Glenn Ford, Nancy Olson, Dean Jagger, Keenan Wynn, Warren Oates, Chief Dan George, Frank Ramírez, John Randolph', 'G', 'When the Indian Jimmyboy is accused of murder of a white man, he flees onto the ranch of Smith, who''s well known for his tolerance for Indians, since he was raised by the old Indian Antoine. Smith helps Jimmyboy against the mean Sheriff and promises to speak for him in court, thus persuading him to surrender himself to the police.', 'When the Indian Jimmyboy is accused of murder of a white man, he flees onto the ranch of Smith, who''s well known for his tolerance for Indians, since he was raised by the old Indian Antoine. Smith helps Jimmyboy against the mean Sheriff and promises to speak for him in court, thus persuading him to surrender himself to the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzYe4LHgqjvwSomOrTUZqIoQp2e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132074'),
  ('1132736313087208210', 'Smithereens', 1982, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Susan Seidelman, Chirine El Khadem, Anthony Coren', 'Ron Nyswaner, Peter Askin', 'Susan Berman, Brad Rijn, Richard Hell, Nada Despotovich, Roger Jett, Kitty Summerall, Joni Ruth White, D.J. O''Neill', 'R', 'A narcissistic runaway engages in a number of parasitic relationships amongst members of New York''s waning punk scene.', 'A narcissistic runaway engages in a number of parasitic relationships amongst members of New York''s waning punk scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jp29gfdiP7AxtjqzlzyaztFORMF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94066'),
  ('728531396168813800', 'Smitten Kitten', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Paul Frees', 'NR', 'Tom''s in love again, and Jerry''s devil conscience reminds him of times this has happened in the past (which, of course, we see, in the form of clips from earlier shorts), and how that''s been nothing but trouble for Jerry.', 'Tom''s in love again, and Jerry''s devil conscience reminds him of times this has happened in the past (which, of course, we see, in the form of clips from earlier shorts), and how that''s been nothing but trouble for Jerry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQxhaFax0LJoSaGAhvvobLZcqEe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46862'),
  ('491774704465742622', 'Smoke', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Adam Holender, Wayne Wang, Todd Pfeiffer', 'Paul Auster', 'Harvey Keitel, William Hurt, Stockard Channing, Harold Perrineau, Forest Whitaker, Giancarlo Esposito, José Zúñiga, Stephen Gevedon', 'R', 'Writer Paul Benjamin is nearly hit by a bus when he leaves Auggie Wren''s smoke shop. Stranger Rashid Cole saves his life, and soon middle-aged Paul tells homeless Rashid that he wouldn''t mind a short-term housemate. Still grieving over his wife''s murder, Paul is moved by both Rashid''s quest to reconnect with his father and Auggie''s discovery that a woman who might be his daughter is about to give birth.', 'Writer Paul Benjamin is nearly hit by a bus when he leaves Auggie Wren''s smoke shop. Stranger Rashid Cole saves his life, and soon middle-aged Paul tells homeless Rashid that he wouldn''t mind a short-term housemate. Still grieving over his wife''s murder, Paul is moved by both Rashid''s quest to reconnect with his father and Auggie''s discovery that a woman who might be his daughter is about to give birth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WMUaTQaj2dQrhsPI3Px0OR9eTF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10149'),
  ('768949460183136569', 'Smoke & Mirrors', 2016, 'History, Thriller', 'Álex Catalán, Alberto Rodríguez', 'Rafael Cobos, Alberto Rodríguez', 'Eduard Fernández, Carlos Santos, Jose Coronado, Marta Etura, Itziar Atienza, Christian Stamm, Craig Stevenson, Luis Callejo', null, 'A tale of cheats and impostors, taking its inspiration from true facts and from one of the most intriguing characters of recent decades: the spy Francisco Paesa.', 'A tale of cheats and impostors, taking its inspiration from true facts and from one of the most intriguing characters of recent decades: the spy Francisco Paesa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zzUMz6XnEEbYvkDPrBORdcDYQ62.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361777'),
  ('412950127757213050', 'Smoke Gets in Your Eyes', 2009, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Anna Muylaert, Jacob Solitrenick, Josmar Bueno Júnior', 'Anna Muylaert', 'Glória Pires, Paulo Miklos, Marisa Orth, Dani Nefussi, Alessandra Colasanti, Paula Pretta, Antônio Abujamra, Lourenço Mutarelli', null, 'In São Paulo, Brazil, the lonely 40-something guitar teacher Baby lives a tedious life in a low middle-class apartment. She is addicted to her only companions: cigarettes. Baby has a constant conflict with her two sisters, over a couch she inherited from their deceased aunt. When Max, a restaurant musician, moves to the next door apartment, Baby has a crush on him and sees a chance to have a life again. Soon they start having a love affair, and Baby decides to quit smoking. However, her abstinence will be tough to deal with, when she notices Max still misses his ex-wife.', 'In São Paulo, Brazil, the lonely 40-something guitar teacher Baby lives a tedious life in a low middle-class apartment. She is addicted to her only companions: cigarettes. Baby has a constant conflict with her two sisters, over a couch she inherited from their deceased aunt. When Max, a restaurant musician, moves to the next door apartment, Baby has a crush on him and sees a chance to have a life again. Soon they start having a love affair, and Baby decides to quit smoking. However, her abstinence will be tough to deal with, when she notices Max still misses his ex-wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwDuoGlZyyTwySPGs5ojhim2jXI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81055'),
  ('561994331380750362', 'Smoke Over London', 1966, 'Comedy', 'Alberto Sordi, Vana Caruso, Benito Frattari', 'Alberto Sordi, Sergio Amidei', 'Alberto Sordi, Fiona Lewis, Amy Dalby, Alfredo Marchetti, Clara Bindi, Michael Trubshawe, Caroline Munro, Massimo Ungaretti', null, 'Dante Fontana is an antique dealer from Perugia infatuated with the culture of the British upper classes. His wife and relatives mock him and snub him, seeing him as a silly daydreamer doing no serious work. Unfussed, Dante plans a vacation to London to learn more about the culture he so admires. However, once in London, he struggles to fit in, is awkward, often makes mistakes betraying his Italian origins, attracting the scorn of the British upper classes he would like to impress.', 'Dante Fontana is an antique dealer from Perugia infatuated with the culture of the British upper classes. His wife and relatives mock him and snub him, seeing him as a silly daydreamer doing no serious work. Unfussed, Dante plans a vacation to London to learn more about the culture he so admires. However, once in London, he struggles to fit in, is awkward, often makes mistakes betraying his Italian origins, attracting the scorn of the British upper classes he would like to impress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3IJlwXWVnDm4fbVfYMrfJ9iYqLn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61214'),
  ('1040558148475731019', 'Smoke Sauna Sisterhood', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Anna Hints, Ants Tammik', 'Anna Hints', 'Kadi Kivilo, Maria Meresaar, Elsa Saks, Marianne Liiv, Eva Kübar, Liis Kuresoo, Eda Veeroja, Maria Aasa', null, 'Women share their innermost secrets and intimate experiences inside an Estonian smoke sauna. Cleansing their bodies and baring their souls, they embrace the healing power of sisterhood.', 'Women share their innermost secrets and intimate experiences inside an Estonian smoke sauna. Cleansing their bodies and baring their souls, they embrace the healing power of sisterhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uUs4e9S0Z5VaVgZH25wnEzKC5ty.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058688'),
  ('125995454347008981', 'Smoke Signal', 1955, 'Western', 'Jerry Hopper, Clifford Stine, Joseph E. Kenney', 'George F. Slavin, George W. George', 'Dana Andrews, Piper Laurie, Rex Reason, William Talman, Milburn Stone, Douglas Spencer, Gordon Jones, William Schallert', 'NR', 'Capt. Harper''s cavalry patrol returns to the fort to find it besieged by Ute Indians. The apparent cause is the recapture of Army traitor Brett Halliday, who deserted to the Utes in a previous war; but Brett has a different story. With capture imminent, the only chance for the surviving men (and one woman) is to boat down a wild, uncharted river, where Harper and Halliday must pull together, like it or not.', 'Capt. Harper''s cavalry patrol returns to the fort to find it besieged by Ute Indians. The apparent cause is the recapture of Army traitor Brett Halliday, who deserted to the Utes in a previous war; but Brett has a different story. With capture imminent, the only chance for the surviving men (and one woman) is to boat down a wild, uncharted river, where Harper and Halliday must pull together, like it or not.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xeWj1DLgTYs149SjJKhdJx4K8Ch.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136226'),
  ('939302246438162990', 'Smoke Signals', 1998, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Chris Eyre, Brian Capener', 'Sherman Alexie', 'Adam Beach, Evan Adams, Irene Bedard, Gary Farmer, Tantoo Cardinal, Cody Lightning, Simon Baker, Monique Mojica', 'PG-13', 'Young Native American man Thomas is a nerd in his reservation, wearing oversize glasses and telling everyone stories no-one wants to hear. His parents died in a fire in 1976, and Thomas was saved by Arnold. Arnold soon left his family, and Victor hasn''t seen his father for 10 years. When Victor hears Arnold has died, Thomas offers him funding for the trip to get Arnold''s remains.', 'Young Native American man Thomas is a nerd in his reservation, wearing oversize glasses and telling everyone stories no-one wants to hear. His parents died in a fire in 1976, and Thomas was saved by Arnold. Arnold soon left his family, and Victor hasn''t seen his father for 10 years. When Victor hears Arnold has died, Thomas offers him funding for the trip to get Arnold''s remains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZ6smtO2cEm3nxVhWscYfKS0mYX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20862'),
  ('462534670430338414', 'Smoke Signals', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Steeven Petitteville, Antoine Raimbault, Laure Cochener', 'Antoine Raimbault, Marc Syrigas', 'Bouli Lanners, Thomas VDB, Céleste Brunnquell, Wim Willaert, Lisa Karlström, Klaus Schreiber, Maurizio Marchetti, Joaquim de Almeida', null, '2012, John Dalli, the European Commissioner for Health, is accused of corruption and influence peddling related to the tobacco industry. French Member of the European Parliament José Bové, maverick politician and prominent figure of the environmental party, suspects a setup by the tobacco manufacturer Swedish Match, potentially involving the President of the European Commission, José Barroso. Standing alone against all odds, he decides to investigate and unravel this story, which shook the foundations of the entire European institutions.', '2012, John Dalli, the European Commissioner for Health, is accused of corruption and influence peddling related to the tobacco industry. French Member of the European Parliament José Bové, maverick politician and prominent figure of the environmental party, suspects a setup by the tobacco manufacturer Swedish Match, potentially involving the President of the European Commission, José Barroso. Standing alone against all odds, he decides to investigate and unravel this story, which shook the foundations of the entire European institutions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3AdYe9YfmdwDFtnapMGxXoHh4uq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001028'),
  ('584847151481731789', 'Smokey and the Bandit', 1977, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Hal Needham, Bobby Byrne, Alan Gibbs', 'James Lee Barrett, Charles Shyer, Alan Mandell', 'Burt Reynolds, Sally Field, Jerry Reed, Jackie Gleason, Mike Henry, Paul Williams, Pat McCormick, Linda McClure', 'PG', 'A race car driver tries to transport an illegal beer shipment from Texas to Atlanta in under 28 hours, picking up a reluctant bride-to-be on the way.', 'A race car driver tries to transport an illegal beer shipment from Texas to Atlanta in under 28 hours, picking up a reluctant bride-to-be on the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dI1Z427FPoicySnXmzwlEUX0RX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11006'),
  ('1148856796564089604', 'Smokey and the Bandit II', 1980, 'Action, Comedy', 'Hal Needham, Michael C. Butler, Dick Ziker', 'Jerry Belson, Brock Yates', 'Burt Reynolds, Jackie Gleason, Jerry Reed, Sally Field, Dom DeLuise, Mike Henry, Paul Williams, Pat McCormick', 'PG', 'The Bandit goes on another cross-country run, transporting an elephant from Florida to Texas. And, once again, Sheriff Buford T. Justice is on his tail.', 'The Bandit goes on another cross-country run, transporting an elephant from Florida to Texas. And, once again, Sheriff Buford T. Justice is on his tail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYNZM1xdhOH6NybMcX9E1LPOl3l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12705'),
  ('107222312061887354', 'Smokey and the Bandit Part 3', 1983, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'James Pergola, Dick Lowry, Ron Bozman', 'Stuart Birnbaum, David Dashev', 'Jackie Gleason, Paul Williams, Pat McCormick, Jerry Reed, Mike Henry, Colleen Camp, Faith Minton, Burt Reynolds', 'PG', 'The Enos duo convince Cletus, aka The Bandit, to come out of hiding and help them promote their new restaurant. With a little coaxing, he agrees, producing an almost-creaky Trigger as his mode of transport. But his nemesis, Sheriff Buford T. Justice, is on the hunt, forcing Cletus and Trigger to hit the road. Can they steer clear of the vengeful sheriff?', 'The Enos duo convince Cletus, aka The Bandit, to come out of hiding and help them promote their new restaurant. With a little coaxing, he agrees, producing an almost-creaky Trigger as his mode of transport. But his nemesis, Sheriff Buford T. Justice, is on the hunt, forcing Cletus and Trigger to hit the road. Can they steer clear of the vengeful sheriff?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ec6qP3Mn2u2XUqHnkxoZYbM33iF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15120'),
  ('403563780044869796', 'Smokin'' Aces', 2006, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Mauro Fiore, Joe Carnahan, James LaRocca', 'Joe Carnahan', 'Ryan Reynolds, Andy Garcia, Martin Henderson, Chris Pine, Ray Liotta, Alicia Keys, Common, Taraji P. Henson', 'R', 'When a Las Vegas performer-turned-snitch named Buddy Israel decides to turn state''s evidence and testify against the mob, it seems that a whole lot of people would like to make sure he''s no longer breathing.', 'When a Las Vegas performer-turned-snitch named Buddy Israel decides to turn state''s evidence and testify against the mob, it seems that a whole lot of people would like to make sure he''s no longer breathing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrdnN8WqvyOt8Bnl3hgWcZD6ZyM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7516'),
  ('869617066974480921', 'Smokin'' Aces 2: Assassins'' Ball', 2010, 'Action, Comedy', 'P.J. Pesce, David Geddes, Kit Marlatt', 'Olatunde Osunsanmi, Olumide Odebunmi, Tom Abrams', 'Tom Berenger, Clayne Crawford, Tommy Flanagan, Maury Sterling, Martha Higareda, Christopher Michael Holley, Ernie Hudson, Michael Parks', 'R', 'Walter Weed is an unassuming desk jockey at the FBI when the Bureau uncovers a plot to assassinate him. A team of degenerate, psychotic assassins dispatched by mystery man Hal Leuco to win a huge bounty includes a resourceful beauty who has a unique method of killing her prey, a power-tool wielding psychopath and a deadly master of disguise.', 'Walter Weed is an unassuming desk jockey at the FBI when the Bureau uncovers a plot to assassinate him. A team of degenerate, psychotic assassins dispatched by mystery man Hal Leuco to win a huge bounty includes a resourceful beauty who has a unique method of killing her prey, a power-tool wielding psychopath and a deadly master of disguise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4t8mSYKtaXGvaro48ci0ZMzVvbe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29564'),
