  ('579948125364030556', 'Smoking / No Smoking', 1993, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Alain Resnais, Renato Berta, Olivier Trémolet', 'Jean-Pierre Bacri, Agnès Jaoui', 'Sabine Azéma, Pierre Arditi, Peter Hudson', null, 'The story presents a series of characters in a small Yorkshire village played by two actors who offer us several versions of their lives depending on whether or not they lit a cigarette at a certain point in time.', 'The story presents a series of characters in a small Yorkshire village played by two actors who offer us several versions of their lives depending on whether or not they lit a cigarette at a certain point in time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Les5XLYn5FbQtevZmLkKSQBRU5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61560'),
  ('614615977146295678', 'Smoking Causes Coughing', 2022, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Quentin Dupieux, Quentin Dupieux, Alexandra Denni', 'Quentin Dupieux', 'Gilles Lellouche, Vincent Lacoste, Anaïs Demoustier, Jean-Pascal Zadi, Oulaya Amamra, Alain Chabat, David Marsais, Julia Faure', 'NR', 'After a devastating battle against a diabolical turtle, a team of five avengers — known as the "Tobacco Force" — is sent on a mandatory retreat to strengthen their decaying group cohesion, where they share scary stories the film depicts. Their storytelling sojourn goes wonderfully well until Lézardin, Emperor of Evil, decides to annihilate planet Earth.', 'After a devastating battle against a diabolical turtle, a team of five avengers — known as the "Tobacco Force" — is sent on a mandatory retreat to strengthen their decaying group cohesion, where they share scary stories the film depicts. Their storytelling sojourn goes wonderfully well until Lézardin, Emperor of Evil, decides to annihilate planet Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7aYwL5VEzGkBvww9YFYKBPGBbRt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:872709'),
  ('1724197287655399', 'Smoking Room', 2002, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Roger Gual, Julio D. Wallovits, Cobi Migliora', null, 'Eduard Fernández, Antonio Dechent, Francesc Garrido, Francesc Orella, Juan Diego, Manuel Morón, Chete Lera, Ulises Dumont', null, 'The Spanish branch of an American company is obliged to enforce the ban on smoking in their offices. From now on, those who want to smoke during working hours must do so in the street. Ramirez, one of the employees of this small office composed mainly of men, decides to begin collecting signatures against what he considers unfair. What Ramirez intends is to be use an unoccupied office as smoking room', 'The Spanish branch of an American company is obliged to enforce the ban on smoking in their offices. From now on, those who want to smoke during working hours must do so in the street. Ramirez, one of the employees of this small office composed mainly of men, decides to begin collecting signatures against what he considers unfair. What Ramirez intends is to be use an unoccupied office as smoking room', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqduTbF3maagTJOjY3eEselptYT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115524'),
  ('1110143267763362524', 'Smolensk', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Michał Pakulski, Zbigniew Malecki, Antoni Krauze', 'Antoni Krauze, Maciej Pawlicki, Marcin Wolski', 'Beata Fido, Aldona Struzik, Lech Łotocki, Halina Łabonarska, Dominika Figurska, Maciej Góraj, Ewa Dałkowska, Marek Probosz', null, 'Inspired by true events of 2010 Polish Air Force Tu-154 crash in Smolensk, the film tells the partially fictional story of crash and various people affected by the tragedy. The protagonist is a journalist Nina, who refuses to accept the official version of the story and pursues her own independent investigation.', 'Inspired by true events of 2010 Polish Air Force Tu-154 crash in Smolensk, the film tells the partially fictional story of crash and various people affected by the tragedy. The protagonist is a journalist Nina, who refuses to accept the official version of the story and pursues her own independent investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIlyfBc6ceYUearJYBjyCHjdUZj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415861'),
