  ('611804846794541', 'Smooth Talk', 1985, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Joyce Chopra, James Glennon', 'Tom Cole', 'Laura Dern, Treat Williams, Mary Kay Place, Levon Helm, Elizabeth Berridge, Margaret Welsh, Sara Inglis, William Ragsdale', 'PG-13', 'Connie, the fifteen-year-old black sheep of her family, finds her summertime idyll of beach trips, mall hangouts, and innocent flirtations shattered by an encounter with a mysterious stranger.', 'Connie, the fifteen-year-old black sheep of her family, finds her summertime idyll of beach trips, mall hangouts, and innocent flirtations shattered by an encounter with a mysterious stranger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPfGFKRXD0sVOGhwjxPHadTa8Y1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33766'),
  ('281962694440926595', 'Smorgasbord', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Jerry Lewis, Gerald Perry Finnerman, Bob Bender', 'Bill Richmond, Jerry Lewis', 'Jerry Lewis, Milton Berle, Sammy Davis Jr., Herb Edelman, Foster Brooks, Zane Buzby, Dick Butkus, Francine York', 'PG', 'Warren Nefron is a hopeless klutz who has some of the worst luck in the world: when he tries to end it all with a foolproof suicide plan, he still manages to mess it up. In desperation, he goes to a psychiatrist to see if there is some way for him to end his troubles.', 'Warren Nefron is a hopeless klutz who has some of the worst luck in the world: when he tries to end it all with a foolproof suicide plan, he still manages to mess it up. In desperation, he goes to a psychiatrist to see if there is some way for him to end his troubles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9jXNTMkJJpT4pzD1ly38cedWSgC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36818'),
