  ('863486310098067147', 'Smothered', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Rafki Hidayat, Kevin Rahardjo, Ical Tanjung', 'Joko Anwar, Rafki Hidayat, Aline Djayasukmana', 'Rio Dewanto, Faradina Mufti, Vonny Anggraini, Jordan Omar, Sulthan Hamonangan, Gambit Saifullah, Nova Eliza, Tony Merle', null, 'After surviving an accident, Alif, a micro-painting artist, is told by his doctor that his memory hasn’t fully recovered. When a woman claiming to be his mother comes to visit, Alif begins to sense something is wrong—he doesn’t recognize her face, and he suspects she might not be his mother.', 'After surviving an accident, Alif, a micro-painting artist, is told by his doctor that his memory hasn’t fully recovered. When a woman claiming to be his mother comes to visit, Alif begins to sense something is wrong—he doesn’t recognize her face, and he suspects she might not be his mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qX69jou3zFKjdyp4b4tAK0jGfD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1393334'),
  ('299496237324198769', 'SMS', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Gabriel Julien-Laferrière, Axel Cosnefroy', 'Laurent Bénégui, Gabriel Julien-Laferrière', 'Guillaume de Tonquédec, Géraldine Pailhas, Anne Marivin, Franck Dubosc, Philippe Lefebvre, Julien Boisselier, Timothé Vom Dorp, Naidra Ayadi', null, 'At 9:00, Laurent receives a worrying text message. 9:01, his mobile''s stolen. 9:30, his son disappears. 10:00, his house burns down. 10:15, his wife leaves him. 10:30, his company goes bankrupt. 11:00, he''s in custody. The day''s got off to a bad start.', 'At 9:00, Laurent receives a worrying text message. 9:01, his mobile''s stolen. 9:30, his son disappears. 10:00, his house burns down. 10:15, his wife leaves him. 10:30, his company goes bankrupt. 11:00, he''s in custody. The day''s got off to a bad start.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RuyKF82XKJgkT8skG7ZdvfM9Kw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279047'),
