  ('238356218098744235', 'Snake', 2018, 'Adventure, Horror', 'Lin Zhenzhao', 'Lin Zhenzhao', 'Huang Kai-Lun, Xi Meili, Yang Yong, Naomen Eerdeni, Tang Xin, An Junqi, Zheng Yue', null, 'In order to save his ill daughter, a biology teacher joins a group of scientists who are searching for a plant called ''the fruit of life'' deep in a hidden jungle. However, what they discover is far beyond what they ever imagined', 'In order to save his ill daughter, a biology teacher joins a group of scientists who are searching for a plant called ''the fruit of life'' deep in a hidden jungle. However, what they discover is far beyond what they ever imagined', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJaVskIfMEcmsdjxFDjgYUbU2Gj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573668'),
  ('674912986306161435', 'Snake & Crane Arts of Shaolin', 1978, 'Action, Drama', 'Chen Chi-Hwa, Chan Chung-Yuen', 'Chang Hsin-Yi', 'Jackie Chan, Nora Miao, Kim Chung-ran, Lee Yeong-Guk, Lau Nga-Ying, Miao Tian, Lee Man-Tai, Chin Kang', null, 'Jackie Chan stars as the young warrior Hsu Yiu Fong. Hsu has been entrusted with the book of the "Art of the Snake and Crane," after the mysterious disappearance of the eight Shaolin Masters who had written it. He must fight off numerous clans who are all attempting to steal the book from him, to find out the true reason for the disappearance of the Shaolin Masters.', 'Jackie Chan stars as the young warrior Hsu Yiu Fong. Hsu has been entrusted with the book of the "Art of the Snake and Crane," after the mysterious disappearance of the eight Shaolin Masters who had written it. He must fight off numerous clans who are all attempting to steal the book from him, to find out the true reason for the disappearance of the Shaolin Masters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4okXfWfTdnZESaEkBeFnAJrTmI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35170'),
  ('918062462164395027', 'Snake 5: Monster City', 2026, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller, Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Lin Zhenzhao', 'Niu Huan', 'Zhang Aoyue, Liang Songqing, Bao Bei''er, Xing Yu, Jiang Chao', null, 'After escaping prison during a monster attack, convict Wu Chuan must navigate a city overrun by prehistoric creatures and lead a desperate fight to save his trapped mother and stop an ancient beast from destroying the city.', 'After escaping prison during a monster attack, convict Wu Chuan must navigate a city overrun by prehistoric creatures and lead a desperate fight to save his trapped mother and stop an ancient beast from destroying the city.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F14dUHcbNL7xpbLynNABkwApQyTW.jpg', 'plex:movie:snakes-5'),
  ('1062541241650736842', 'Snake Dick', 2020, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'David Mahmoudieh', 'David Mahmoudieh', 'Poppy Drayton, Sierra Pond, Micah Fitzgerald, Ross Francis', null, 'Jill has the snake, Julie has the flute. Alone they have nothing. But together they have a secret weapon to fight the dark forces.', 'Jill has the snake, Julie has the flute. Alone they have nothing. But together they have a secret weapon to fight the dark forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5azFXdO44jVSxrLXDK9NS3Dh12.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:741380'),
  ('18494611606568765', 'Snake Eater', 1989, 'Action, Thriller', 'George Erschbamer, Glen MacPherson', 'Michael Paseornek, John Dunning', 'Lorenzo Lamas, Josie Bell, Ronnie Hawkins, Ben DiGregorio, Ron Palillo, Mowava Pryor, Sandra Brown, Michael Ballew', 'R', 'The Snake Eaters are an elite division of the Marines especially trained for search and destroy missions. This actioner chronicles the exploits of one of them who has become a cop. Known as a tough loner, he returns to find the band of backwoods bad-guys who killed his parents and abducted his sister.', 'The Snake Eaters are an elite division of the Marines especially trained for search and destroy missions. This actioner chronicles the exploits of one of them who has become a cop. Known as a tough loner, he returns to find the band of backwoods bad-guys who killed his parents and abducted his sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8FJHgOzztxVsoe773f9yerMxf06.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71200'),
