  ('316545592697622441', 'Snake Eater III: His Law', 1992, 'Action', 'George Erschbamer', 'W. Glenn Duncan', 'Lorenzo Lamas, Minor Mustain, Tracey Cook, Una Kay, Tracey Hway, Holly Chester, Matt Birman, Scott Bigelow', 'R', 'A Vietnam vet named soldier is hired to find a biker gang called Hell''s Fury, which kidnapped, drugged, and raped a young girl, and exact revenge.', 'A Vietnam vet named soldier is hired to find a biker gang called Hell''s Fury, which kidnapped, drugged, and raped a young girl, and exact revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJ8gdLi5rXi3C1gbt227H0gaWk1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71202'),
  ('318658192448037234', 'Snake Eyes', 1998, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Stephen H. Burum, Brian De Palma, David Hamburger', 'David Koepp', 'Nicolas Cage, Gary Sinise, Carla Gugino, John Heard, Stan Shaw, Kevin Dunn, Michael Rispoli, Joel Fabiani', 'R', 'All bets are off when shady homicide cop Rick Santoro witnesses a murder during a boxing match. Determined to solve the crime, he quickly learns that his search for answers will only uncover yet more questions in an ever-widening web of conspiracy, intrigue, and danger.', 'All bets are off when shady homicide cop Rick Santoro witnesses a murder during a boxing match. Determined to solve the crime, he quickly learns that his search for answers will only uncover yet more questions in an ever-widening web of conspiracy, intrigue, and danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gsh9mQKRrr4M90XC9Rr0wxefc9u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8688'),
  ('934472522315994305', 'Snake Eyes: G.I. Joe Origins', 2021, 'Action, Adventure', 'Bojan Bazelli, Michael Diner, John R. Saunders', 'Evan Spiliotopoulos, Anna Waterhouse, Joe Shrapnel', 'Henry Golding, Andrew Koji, Haruka Abe, Úrsula Corberó, Samara Weaving, Takehiro Hira, Eri Ishida, Iko Uwais', 'PG-13', 'After saving the life of their heir apparent, tenacious loner Snake Eyes is welcomed into an ancient Japanese clan called the Arashikage where he is taught the ways of the ninja warrior. But, when secrets from his past are revealed, Snake Eyes'' honor and allegiance will be tested – even if that means losing the trust of those closest to him.', 'After saving the life of their heir apparent, tenacious loner Snake Eyes is welcomed into an ancient Japanese clan called the Arashikage where he is taught the ways of the ninja warrior. But, when secrets from his past are revealed, Snake Eyes'' honor and allegiance will be tested – even if that means losing the trust of those closest to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uIXF0sQGXOxQhbaEaKOi2VYlIL0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568620'),
  ('137636999071946303', 'Snake Hotel', 2023, 'Horror', 'Charles Solly, Sam Ebdon', 'Charles Solly', 'Kelly Rian Sanson, Natasha Tosini, Jase Rivers, Chrissie Wunna, Lila Lasso, Danielle Scott, Jamie Littlewood, James Solly', null, 'A group of female inmates wanting to shorten their prison sentences take part in a hellish game of cat and mouse with a giant mutated snake.', 'A group of female inmates wanting to shorten their prison sentences take part in a hellish game of cat and mouse with a giant mutated snake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VFzkPOygrZ2dFgMJuoFYE6Eocv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:996503'),
  ('326797212898037098', 'Snake in the Eagle''s Shadow', 1978, 'Action, Comedy', 'Yuen Woo-Ping, Raymond Chang', 'Yuen Woo-Ping, Ng See-Yuen, Hsiao Lung', 'Jackie Chan, Simon Yuen Siu-Tien, Hwang Jang-Lee, Dean Shek Tin, Roy Horan, Fung Hak-On, Charlie Chan Yiu-Lam, Tino Wong', 'PG', 'Everyone abuses and humiliates a downtrodden orphan until he befriends an old man, who turns out to be the last master of the snake fist fighting style. Jackie becomes the old man''s student and finds himself in battle with the master of the eagle''s claw style, who has vowed to destroy the snake fist clan.', 'Everyone abuses and humiliates a downtrodden orphan until he befriends an old man, who turns out to be the last master of the snake fist fighting style. Jackie becomes the old man''s student and finds himself in battle with the master of the eagle''s claw style, who has vowed to destroy the snake fist clan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oCt4990zVSNILSU0Q6DStmdbpIA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11537'),
  ('1149114433283839004', 'Snake Island Python', 2022, 'Drama, Horror', 'Li Zhiwen', 'Li Tianliang', 'Liu Wei, Cen Ming, Liu Xuefan, Muzi Li, Xie Wenxuan', null, 'A group of people searching for a magical tree in a mysterious jungle, find they are not alone. Something is watching them, waiting for the perfect moment to strike.', 'A group of people searching for a magical tree in a mysterious jungle, find they are not alone. Something is watching them, waiting for the perfect moment to strike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMHp99JBmf1VaryXMVsv5WmPT2N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:942951'),
  ('526036947686358327', 'Snakehead', 2021, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Evan Leong', 'Evan Leong', 'Shuya Chang, Jade Wu, Devon Diep, Sung Kang, Celia Au, Perry Yung, Jamie Choi, Richie Ng', 'NR', 'Sister Tse is brought to New York by a Snakehead, a human smuggler. Although she is indebted to the crime family responsible for her transport, her survival instincts help her gain favor with the matriarch, and she rises quickly in the ranks. Soon Tse must reconcile her success with her real reason for coming to America—to find the child that was taken from her. In the end, Sister Tse must draw on the strength she found in transforming her victimhood into power.', 'Sister Tse is brought to New York by a Snakehead, a human smuggler. Although she is indebted to the crime family responsible for her transport, her survival instincts help her gain favor with the matriarch, and she rises quickly in the ranks. Soon Tse must reconcile her success with her real reason for coming to America—to find the child that was taken from her. In the end, Sister Tse must draw on the strength she found in transforming her victimhood into power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4EbeUgW9V5X4fabqWejxSZa4wtC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:835961'),
  ('92994930325616261', 'Snakehead Terror', 2004, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Paul Ziller, Mark Dobrescu', 'Anthony L. Greene', 'Bruce Boxleitner, Carol Alt, Chelan Simmons, Juliana Wimbles, Ryan McDonell, Chad Krowchuk, Matthew MacCaull, William B. Davis', null, 'A small town, desperate to recover from hard economic times, is under threat when voracious Snakehead fish mutate and survive previous lake chemical poisonings. The fish transform from pests to predators when human growth hormones are dumped into the local lake in the hopes of reviving the local fishing industry. Thriving on the hormones, the Snakehead fish grow to monstrous proportions, devouring everything within reach. Capable of moving and eating on land, they are forced to leave the now barren lake in a desperate search for food - animal, vegetable or human.', 'A small town, desperate to recover from hard economic times, is under threat when voracious Snakehead fish mutate and survive previous lake chemical poisonings. The fish transform from pests to predators when human growth hormones are dumped into the local lake in the hopes of reviving the local fishing industry. Thriving on the hormones, the Snakehead fish grow to monstrous proportions, devouring everything within reach. Capable of moving and eating on land, they are forced to leave the now barren lake in a desperate search for food - animal, vegetable or human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pyiyftwx05BIsx2pephTuadHEnX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37947'),
  ('443900018110687657', 'SnakeMan', 2005, 'Horror, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Allan A. Goldstein, Eric Moynier', 'Declan O''Brien, Allan A. Goldstein', 'Stephen Baldwin, Jayne Heitmeyer, Shelly Varod, Larry Day, Gary Hudson, Ross McCall, Phil Miler, Gideon Rosa', null, 'An object is found that points to the secret of eternal youth so a research team is sent to find the fountain only to find it is protected by a giant snake', 'An object is found that points to the secret of eternal youth so a research team is sent to find the fountain only to find it is protected by a giant snake', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCTSH7SY3yxDJQ8FcW6piQc1jIK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69075'),
  ('629512448020991774', 'Snakes and Earrings', 2008, 'Romance, Thriller, Crime', 'Yukio Ninagawa, Osamu Fujiishi, Toshihisa Yamada', 'Yukio Ninagawa, Takuya Miyawaki', 'Yuriko Yoshitaka, Kengo Kora, Arata Iura, Yû Abiru, Sonim, Yuko Imai, Shūto Ayabe, Hidekazu Ichinose', null, 'While alone in a nightclub, straight-laced Lui meets sensitive but troubled punk kid Ama. Mesmerized by his split tongue, she becomes obsessed with body modification and soon wants the same treatment. After Ama''s heavily-tattooed friend Shiba pierces her tongue, Lui finds herself inexorably drawn to both men – and to her growing list of desires, she now adds a tattoo.', 'While alone in a nightclub, straight-laced Lui meets sensitive but troubled punk kid Ama. Mesmerized by his split tongue, she becomes obsessed with body modification and soon wants the same treatment. After Ama''s heavily-tattooed friend Shiba pierces her tongue, Lui finds herself inexorably drawn to both men – and to her growing list of desires, she now adds a tattoo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ys874V8V2YUQFPakMQRnXbIwZAX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38551'),
  ('937061485895128826', 'Snakes and Ladders', 1965, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Manuel Summers, Francisco Fraile, Francisco Ariza', 'Pilar Miró, Manuel Summers', 'Sonia Bruno, María Massip, José Antonio Amor, Julieta Serrano, Paco Valladares, Juan Luis Galiardo, Ángel Luis Álvarez, Carolina Fraile', null, 'Jose Antonio Amor co-stars with Sonia Bruno and Maria Blanco in this comedy drama about a married man with three children. When his family leaves on vacation, the man has an affair with a pretty office worker. The relationship between the two develops slowly before they end up in bed together. Speeded up shots are used effectively to illustrate the thoughts of the characters. Technical aspects and performances are fine and overshadow some uneven editing.', 'Jose Antonio Amor co-stars with Sonia Bruno and Maria Blanco in this comedy drama about a married man with three children. When his family leaves on vacation, the man has an affair with a pretty office worker. The relationship between the two develops slowly before they end up in bed together. Speeded up shots are used effectively to illustrate the thoughts of the characters. Technical aspects and performances are fine and overshadow some uneven editing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aFhC4lutZ5LquUI9uYbUQ6Y9Tma.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198809'),
  ('833453607270248632', 'Snakes and Ladders', 1980, 'Mystery', 'Raúl Ruiz, Serge Brodsky', 'Jean-Loup Rivière, Raúl Ruiz', 'Pascal Bonitzer, Jean-Loup Rivière', null, 'A man awakens to find himself immersed in a real-life scenario of a board game with an ever expanding cartography.', 'A man awakens to find himself immersed in a real-life scenario of a board game with an ever expanding cartography.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIs9SiO04jBrrhjWfuu9a02xO0N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200905'),
  ('196043496084378530', 'Snakes and Ladders 2: Children''s Games', 2025, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tarek Al-Aryan, Ahmed Tarek Bayoumi, Alia Faraj', 'Ahmed Hosny', 'Amr Youssef, Asmaa Galal, Dhafer L''Abidine, Maged Elmasry, Hatim Salah, Fadwa Abed, Aya Selim, Heba Abdel Aziz', null, 'Ahmed meets Malak, and their relationship quickly evolves from mere admiration to mutual love. Each seeks to impress the other with their personality and actions, hoping their love story lasts forever and withstands all challenges.', 'Ahmed meets Malak, and their relationship quickly evolves from mere admiration to mutual love. Each seeks to impress the other with their personality and actions, hoping their love story lasts forever and withstands all challenges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f93YifnOBJxKX3ViMDbcJZlFgv6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1421671'),
  ('524452455760043921', 'Snakes on a Plane', 2006, 'Action, Thriller, Adventure, Crime, Horror', 'David R. Ellis, Adrian Diepold, Freddie Hice', 'John Heffernan, Sebastian Gutierrez', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Julianna Margulies, Nathan Phillips, Kenan Thompson, Rachel Blanchard, Flex Alexander, Keith Dallas, Sunny Mabrey', 'R', 'FBI agent Neville Flynn boards a flight from Honolulu, Hawaii to Los Angeles, escorting a key witness to testify against a mob boss at an upcoming trial. An on-board assassin releases a crate full of hundreds of deadly venomous snakes in an attempt to eliminate the witness. Flynn and a host of frightened passengers and crew must band together to survive the slithery threat.', 'FBI agent Neville Flynn boards a flight from Honolulu, Hawaii to Los Angeles, escorting a key witness to testify against a mob boss at an upcoming trial. An on-board assassin releases a crate full of hundreds of deadly venomous snakes in an attempt to eliminate the witness. Flynn and a host of frightened passengers and crew must band together to survive the slithery threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0ynvZ89tV1t8MAL9FmeQELfXH0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326'),
  ('30748536922229430', 'Snakes on a Train', 2006, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Peter Mervis, Zack Richard, Mark Atkins', 'Eric Forsberg', 'A.J. Castro, Julia Ruiz, Giovanni Bejarano, Al Galvez, Amelia Jackson-Gray, Shannon Gayle, Stephen A.F. Day, Isaac Wade', 'PG-13', 'Under a powerful Mayan curse, snakes are hatched inside a young woman, slowly devouring her from within. Her only chance for survival is a powerful shaman who lives across the border. With only hours to live, she jumps on a train headed for Los Angeles. Unfortunately for the passengers aboard, they are now trapped, soon to be victims of these flesh-eating vipers.', 'Under a powerful Mayan curse, snakes are hatched inside a young woman, slowly devouring her from within. Her only chance for survival is a powerful shaman who lives across the border. With only hours to live, she jumps on a train headed for Los Angeles. Unfortunately for the passengers aboard, they are now trapped, soon to be victims of these flesh-eating vipers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzNOdGwtMMq8NKBjxkd2yG59NJV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35710'),
  ('491387062963830472', 'Snapdragon', 1993, 'Romance, Thriller, Mystery', 'Worth Keeter, James Mathers, Peggy Hughes', 'Terri Treas, Gene Church', 'Steven Bauer, Chelsea Field, Pamela Anderson, Matt McCoy, Kenneth Tigar, Larry Manetti, Rance Howard, Gloria LeRoy', 'R', 'An erotic amnesiac lures a police psychologist into a world of lust and danger.', 'An erotic amnesiac lures a police psychologist into a world of lust and danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6BRHL9vjzDpQWDRxaefkOJliLKn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41128'),
  ('740362067624060625', 'Snapshot', 1979, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Simon Wincer, Vincent Monton, Tim Burstall', 'Chris de Roche, Everett De Roche', 'Chantal Contouri, Robert Bruning, Sigrid Thornton, Hugh Keays-Byrne, Denise Drysdale, Vincent Gil, Jon Sidney, Jacqui Gordon', 'R', 'A young hairdresser enters into the modeling world while fearing retaliation from her puritanical mother and stalker ex-boyfriend.', 'A young hairdresser enters into the modeling world while fearing retaliation from her puritanical mother and stalker ex-boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTUgwV245xy6Hz6fbz4aTNZRbvY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86283'),
  ('192809794500615178', 'Snatch', 2000, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Guy Ritchie, Tim Maurice-Jones, David Reid', 'Guy Ritchie', 'Jason Statham, Alan Ford, Stephen Graham, Brad Pitt, Dennis Farina, Robbie Gee, Lennie James, Benicio del Toro', 'R', 'Unscrupulous boxing promoters, violent bookies, a Russian gangster, incompetent amateur robbers, and supposedly Jewish jewellers fight to track down a priceless stolen diamond.', 'Unscrupulous boxing promoters, violent bookies, a Russian gangster, incompetent amateur robbers, and supposedly Jewish jewellers fight to track down a priceless stolen diamond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJZoAHq1SLDdWjeNGtlHAnGpmFV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107'),
  ('397948451895167804', 'Snatched', 2017, 'Action, Comedy', 'Jonathan Levine, Florian Ballhaus, Deanna Stadler', 'Katie Dippold', 'Amy Schumer, Goldie Hawn, Tom Bateman, Christopher Meloni, Wanda Sykes, Ike Barinholtz, Óscar Jaenada, Randall Park', 'R', 'When her boyfriend dumps Emily, a spontaneous woman in her 30s, she persuades her ultra-cautious mom to accompany her on a vacation to Ecuador. When these two very different women are trapped on this wild journey, their bond as mother and daughter is tested and strengthened while they attempt to navigate the jungle and escape.', 'When her boyfriend dumps Emily, a spontaneous woman in her 30s, she persuades her ultra-cautious mom to accompany her on a vacation to Ecuador. When these two very different women are trapped on this wild journey, their bond as mother and daughter is tested and strengthened while they attempt to navigate the jungle and escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gsleO1KultziWltEAngAEZkxQhf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:373569'),
  ('417663733531584385', 'Snatchers', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Comedy', 'Benji Kleiman, Stephen Cedars, Nate Hurtsellers', 'Scott Yacyshyn, Stephen Cedars, Benji Kleiman', 'Mary Nepi, Gabrielle Elyse, Austin Fryberger, J.J. Nolan, Nick Gomez, Ashley Argota, Amy Landecker, Rich Fulcher', null, 'After status-obsessed teen Sara has sex for the first time, she wakes up the next day nine months pregnant-with an alien.', 'After status-obsessed teen Sara has sex for the first time, she wakes up the next day nine months pregnant-with an alien.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8PcCffhPbHqPjCQOYJCB5bnHRTV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:580632'),
  ('317516420281307219', 'Sneakerella', 2022, 'Music, Comedy, Family', 'Mohammad Ghorbankarimi, Leah Daniels-Butler, MK Morris', 'Tamara Chestna, George O. Gore II, Mindy Stern', 'Chosen Jacobs, Lexi Underwood, Kolton Stewart, Devyn Nekoda, Robyn Alomar, John Salley, Yvonne Senat Jones, Ryan Wilson', 'G', 'When El, an aspiring sneaker designer from Queens, meets Kira King, the fiercely independent daughter of legendary basketball star and sneaker tycoon Darius King, sparks fly as the two bond over their mutual affinity for sneakers. With a little nudge from his best friend and a sprinkle of Fairy Godfather magic, El finds the courage to use his talent to pursue his dream of becoming a ‘legit’ sneaker designer in the industry.', 'When El, an aspiring sneaker designer from Queens, meets Kira King, the fiercely independent daughter of legendary basketball star and sneaker tycoon Darius King, sparks fly as the two bond over their mutual affinity for sneakers. With a little nudge from his best friend and a sprinkle of Fairy Godfather magic, El finds the courage to use his talent to pursue his dream of becoming a ‘legit’ sneaker designer in the industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJ07f8DTdeWnCKCwDzB4htLXKBN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:756187'),
  ('1106117581328159214', 'Sneakers', 1992, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Phil Alden Robinson, John Lindley, William M. Elvin', 'Walter F. Parkes, Lawrence Lasker, Phil Alden Robinson', 'Robert Redford, Sidney Poitier, David Strathairn, Dan Aykroyd, River Phoenix, Ben Kingsley, Denise Dowse, Timothy Busfield', 'PG-13', 'When shadowy U.S. intelligence agents blackmail a reformed computer hacker and his eccentric team of security experts into stealing a code-breaking ''black box'' from a Soviet-funded genius, they uncover a bigger conspiracy. Now, he and his ''sneakers'' must save themselves and the world economy by retrieving the box from their blackmailers.', 'When shadowy U.S. intelligence agents blackmail a reformed computer hacker and his eccentric team of security experts into stealing a code-breaking ''black box'' from a Soviet-funded genius, they uncover a bigger conspiracy. Now, he and his ''sneakers'' must save themselves and the world economy by retrieving the box from their blackmailers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2pIGwCvpZEpBuMb55YBl6A04Jv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2322'),
  ('851849218945431461', 'Sneaks', 2025, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Animation', 'Rob Edwards, Christopher Jenkins', 'Rob Edwards', 'Anthony Mackie, Martin Lawrence, Swae Lee, Young Miko, Chloe Bailey, Macy Gray, Ella Mai, Mustard', 'PG', 'Ty, a misguided, one-of-a-kind designer sneaker, doesn’t know life outside the comforts of his velvet-lined shoebox. After his sister is stolen by a shady collector, Ty must venture into New York City to find and rescue her. In his adventure, Ty meets a ragtag group of footwear friends from all walks of life who help him find the courage to step outside of his shoebox and find his sole-mate.', 'Ty, a misguided, one-of-a-kind designer sneaker, doesn’t know life outside the comforts of his velvet-lined shoebox. After his sister is stolen by a shady collector, Ty must venture into New York City to find and rescue her. In his adventure, Ty meets a ragtag group of footwear friends from all walks of life who help him find the courage to step outside of his shoebox and find his sole-mate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3SipvmtH9VOyLmII9JLs34qFfil.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1084153'),
  ('685362630177946628', 'Sniper', 1993, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Luis Llosa, Bill Butler, David Joyce', 'Michael Frost Beckner, Crash Leyland', 'Tom Berenger, Billy Zane, J.T. Walsh, Aden Young, Kenneth Radley, Reynaldo Arenas, Gary Swanson, Hank Garrett', 'R', 'Tough guy Thomas Beckett is a US Marine working in the Panamanian jungle. His job is to seek out rebels and remove them using his sniper skills. Beckett is notorious for losing his partners on such missions. This time he''s accompanied by crack marksman Richard Miller.', 'Tough guy Thomas Beckett is a US Marine working in the Panamanian jungle. His job is to seek out rebels and remove them using his sniper skills. Beckett is notorious for losing his partners on such missions. This time he''s accompanied by crack marksman Richard Miller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ayYsC7Jp2BxhCLWghOBWzZlO4FI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9545'),
  ('127262212513227291', 'Sniper', 2020, 'War, Action', 'Huang Zhaosheng', null, 'Ren Tianye, Shi Zhi, Emile Amro, Ivan Kotik, Maksim Khabarov', null, 'The Tiger Security Team of the Storm Security Company is responsible for security and rescue work. Luo Xinglie is punished for accidentally injuring a hostage during a rescue mission. He gets reduced to a security officer and gets no reward for the mission. At this time, the Tiger Team receives a new mission, hired by the International Peace Foundation, to escort a truck full of water purifiers and a large number of crop seeds to the villages of Sakiya for civilian assistance. However, due to the invasion of the non-government organization in Sakya, some areas are in war. The team is likely to encounter fighting, and the unknown danger is gradually approaching.', 'The Tiger Security Team of the Storm Security Company is responsible for security and rescue work. Luo Xinglie is punished for accidentally injuring a hostage during a rescue mission. He gets reduced to a security officer and gets no reward for the mission. At this time, the Tiger Team receives a new mission, hired by the International Peace Foundation, to escort a truck full of water purifiers and a large number of crop seeds to the villages of Sakiya for civilian assistance. However, due to the invasion of the non-government organization in Sakya, some areas are in war. The team is likely to encounter fighting, and the unknown danger is gradually approaching.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJ4Npo2BXaWS5GJGgYcQ8DSORZZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680765'),
  ('356781217378846251', 'Sniper 2', 2002, 'Action', 'Craig R. Baxley, David Connell, Zsuzsa Grubán', 'Ron Mita, Jim McClain', 'Tom Berenger, Bokeem Woodbine, Dan Butler, Linden Ashby, Marozsán Erika, Tamás Puskás, Can Togay, Barna Illyés', 'R', 'A former Marine sniper is lured back in on a top-secret mission to take out a rogue general accused of running a stealth operation of hit-and-run ethnic cleansing missions in an area known as "No Man''s Land."', 'A former Marine sniper is lured back in on a top-secret mission to take out a rogue general accused of running a stealth operation of hit-and-run ethnic cleansing missions in an area known as "No Man''s Land."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z03X84vKeVSjabMPJE0fQYxYiMp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14245'),
  ('532944087399723240', 'Sniper 3', 2005, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'P.J. Pesce, Michael Bonvillain, Nanlika Thanasannont', 'J.S. Cardone, Ross Helford', 'Tom Berenger, Byron Mann, Denis Arndt, John Doman, Troy Winbush, Jeannetta Arnette, William Duffy, Nophand Boonyai', 'R', 'Having taken out warlords, drug kingpins and international assassins, Thomas Beckett must now face the ultimate enemy, his best friend Paul Finnegan.', 'Having taken out warlords, drug kingpins and international assassins, Thomas Beckett must now face the ultimate enemy, his best friend Paul Finnegan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUOUOGL3aqKJ7IyBRYvmZQmsmr9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14247'),
  ('1083161938008626573', 'Sniper: Assassin''s End', 2020, 'Action', 'Patrick Weir, Daniella Bonan, Glen B.D. Pelzer', 'Oliver Thompson', 'Chad Michael Collins, Sayaka Akimoto, Ryan Robbins, Lochlyn Munro, Emily Tennant, Michael Jonsson, Vincent Gale, Tom Berenger', 'R', 'Special Ops sniper Brandon Beckett is set up as the primary suspect for the murder of a foreign dignitary on the eve of signing a high-profile trade agreement with the United States. Narrowly escaping death, Beckett realizes that there may be a dark operative working within the government, and partners with the only person whom he can trust: his father, legendary sniper Sgt. Thomas Beckett. Both Becketts are on the run from the CIA, Russian mercenaries, and a yakuza-trained assassin with sniper skills that rival both legendary sharpshooters.', 'Special Ops sniper Brandon Beckett is set up as the primary suspect for the murder of a foreign dignitary on the eve of signing a high-profile trade agreement with the United States. Narrowly escaping death, Beckett realizes that there may be a dark operative working within the government, and partners with the only person whom he can trust: his father, legendary sniper Sgt. Thomas Beckett. Both Becketts are on the run from the CIA, Russian mercenaries, and a yakuza-trained assassin with sniper skills that rival both legendary sharpshooters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AiymaaYeAl9ZBoyUz2tz4k2XaKv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:702936'),
  ('420060593442843498', 'Sniper: G.R.I.T. - Global Response & Intelligence Team', 2023, 'Action, Thriller', 'Oliver Thompson, Doug Schwartz, Richard Stanley Jan Harris', 'Oliver Thompson', 'Chad Michael Collins, Ryan Robbins, Luna Fujimoto, Josh Brener, Dennis Haysbert, Toshiji Takeshima, Matthew Sim, Paul Kissaun', 'R', 'When an international terrorist cult threatens global political stability and kidnaps a fellow agent, Ace Sniper Brandon Beckett and the newly-formed Global Response & Intelligence Team – or G.R.I.T. – led by Colonel Stone must travel across the world to Malta, infiltrate the cult, and take out its leader to free Lady Death and stop the global threat.', 'When an international terrorist cult threatens global political stability and kidnaps a fellow agent, Ace Sniper Brandon Beckett and the newly-formed Global Response & Intelligence Team – or G.R.I.T. – led by Colonel Stone must travel across the world to Malta, infiltrate the cult, and take out its leader to free Lady Death and stop the global threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xpdM0RDM6lWgtLsYVb1XpYmNxzd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1171541'),
  ('166166223986627419', 'Sniper: Ghost Shooter', 2016, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Stanimir Stamatov, Don Michael Paul, Martin Chichov', 'Chris Hauty', 'Chad Michael Collins, Billy Zane, Nick Gomez, Ravil Isyanov, Stephanie Vogt, Navid Negahban, Presciliana Esparolini, Ene Frost', 'R', 'Elite snipers Brandon Beckett and Richard Miller are fighting extremists in the Middle East when the Colonel gives them a new mission: to protect a gas pipeline stretching from the Republic of Georgia to Western Europe from extremists eager to make a political statement. But when skirmishes with the enemy lead to U.S. snipers being killed by a ghost shooter who locks into their exact location, a security breach is suspected. Fingers are pointed and battle lines are drawn, all leading up to an explosive climax.', 'Elite snipers Brandon Beckett and Richard Miller are fighting extremists in the Middle East when the Colonel gives them a new mission: to protect a gas pipeline stretching from the Republic of Georgia to Western Europe from extremists eager to make a political statement. But when skirmishes with the enemy lead to U.S. snipers being killed by a ghost shooter who locks into their exact location, a security breach is suspected. Fingers are pointed and battle lines are drawn, all leading up to an explosive climax.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92YFviTZnjA6rj2jADoA2gmsjsz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407375'),
  ('713963032888229725', 'Sniper: Legacy', 2014, 'Thriller, Action', 'Don Michael Paul, Martin Chichov, Alexander Krumov', 'Don Michael Paul, John Fasano', 'Tom Berenger, Chad Michael Collins, Doug Allen, Dominic Mafham, Mercedes Mason, Mark Lewis Jones, Nestor Serrano, Dennis Haysbert', 'R', 'A rogue gunman is assassinating high-ranking military officers one by one. When Gunnery Sgt. Brandon Beckett is informed his father, legendary shooter Thomas Beckett has been killed, Brandon springs into action to take out the perpetrator.', 'A rogue gunman is assassinating high-ranking military officers one by one. When Gunnery Sgt. Brandon Beckett is informed his father, legendary shooter Thomas Beckett has been killed, Brandon springs into action to take out the perpetrator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9L1t3vRaZRU1Fa0kolfQGiTCnQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290729'),
  ('206121082925628261', 'Sniper: No Nation', 2026, 'Action, Thriller', 'Trevor Calverley, Brendan Barnes, Bonnie Lee Bouman', 'Sean Wathen', 'Chad Michael Collins, Ryan Robbins, Manuel Rodriguez-Saenz, Josh Brener, Tom Berenger, Sizo Mahlangu, Masasa Mbangeni, Jason K. Ralph', 'R', 'Brandon Beckett and Agent Zero lead a rescue mission in Venezuela when their friends are taken hostage.', 'Brandon Beckett and Agent Zero lead a rescue mission in Venezuela when their friends are taken hostage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlimwHMelt9PRdgFhS5bWJWPrjr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1641319'),
  ('224256186682535825', 'Sniper: Reloaded', 2011, 'War, Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Claudio Fäh, Corry Turner, Lorenzo Senatore', 'John Fasano', 'Chad Michael Collins, Richard Sammel, Annabel Wright, Billy Zane, Justin Strydom, Hlomla Dandala, Conrad Kemp, Kayla Privett', 'R', 'Marine Sgt. Brandon Beckett, son of the U.S. Marine Corps'' deadliest sniper, Thomas Beckett, must turn to his father''s former protégé (Billy Zane) to track down and kill a mysterious sniper before he kills his next target.', 'Marine Sgt. Brandon Beckett, son of the U.S. Marine Corps'' deadliest sniper, Thomas Beckett, must turn to his father''s former protégé (Billy Zane) to track down and kill a mysterious sniper before he kills his next target.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2Clr2vyzNSptarbVzzdpJozWFg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58767'),
  ('385218114648509198', 'Sniper: Rogue Mission', 2022, 'Action, Thriller, Mystery', 'Oliver Thompson, Paul Suderman, Jason Bohn', 'Oliver Thompson', 'Chad Michael Collins, Ryan Robbins, Sayaka Akimoto, Brendan Sexton III, Josh Brener, Dennis Haysbert, Jocelyn Hudon, David MacInnis', 'R', 'When a crooked federal agent is involved in a human sex trafficking ring, Sniper and CIA Rookie Brandon Beckett goes rogue, teaming up with his former allies Homeland Security Agent Zero and assassin Lady Death to uncover the corrupt agent and take down the criminal organization.', 'When a crooked federal agent is involved in a human sex trafficking ring, Sniper and CIA Rookie Brandon Beckett goes rogue, teaming up with his former allies Homeland Security Agent Zero and assassin Lady Death to uncover the corrupt agent and take down the criminal organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wUkXarFUJqLlq6Zl69OYUnneNi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:997120'),
  ('622245254942415845', 'Sniper: Special Ops', 2016, 'Action, War', 'Fred Olen Ray, Stuart Brereton, Christopher Ray', 'Fred Olen Ray', 'Steven Seagal, Tim Abell, Rob Szatkowski, Dale Dye, Charlene Amoia, Jason-Shane Scott, Daniel Booko, Anthony Batarse', null, 'A Special Ops military Force, led by expert sniper Sergeant Jake Chandler, are sent to a remote Afghan village to extract an American congressman being held by the Taliban.', 'A Special Ops military Force, led by expert sniper Sergeant Jake Chandler, are sent to a remote Afghan village to extract an American congressman being held by the Taliban.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgE31g7hqV9UVJKqz3LCwm5oDb8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394223'),
  ('3252695191174643', 'Sniper: The Last Stand', 2025, 'Action, Thriller', 'Danishka Esterhazy, Trevor Calverley, Jason Knight', 'Sean Wathen', 'Chad Michael Collins, Ryan Robbins, Sharon Taylor, Manuel Rodriguez-Saenz, Vusi Kunene, Sizo Mahlangu, Noxolo Dlamini, Arnold Vosloo', 'R', 'To stop an arms dealer from unleashing a deadly superweapon, Ace sniper Brandon Beckett and Agent Zero are deployed to Costa Verde to lead a group of elite soldiers against an unrelenting militia. Taking an untested sniper under his wing, Beckett faces his newest challenge: giving orders instead of receiving them. With both time and ammo running low in a race to save humanity, the team must overcome all odds just to survive.', 'To stop an arms dealer from unleashing a deadly superweapon, Ace sniper Brandon Beckett and Agent Zero are deployed to Costa Verde to lead a group of elite soldiers against an unrelenting militia. Taking an untested sniper under his wing, Beckett faces his newest challenge: giving orders instead of receiving them. With both time and ammo running low in a race to save humanity, the team must overcome all odds just to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/TVvIyCsFCmLk9MRLbAZi4X8f32.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1410082'),
  ('359042434954151566', 'Sniper: The White Raven', 2022, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Marian Bushan', 'Mykola Voronin, Marian Bushan', 'Pavlo Aldoshyn, Maryna Koshkina, Andrii Mostrenko, Roman Semysal, Roman Yasinovskyi, Oleh Shulha, Yehor Kozlov, Yevhen Chernykov', 'R', 'Mykola is an eccentric pacifist who wants to be useful to humanity. When the war begins in Donbas, Mykola’s naive world is collapsing as the militants kill his pregnant wife and burn his home to the ground. Recovered, he makes a cardinal decision and gets enlisted in a sniper company. Having met his wife’s killers, he emotionally breaks down and arranges “sniper terror” for the enemy.', 'Mykola is an eccentric pacifist who wants to be useful to humanity. When the war begins in Donbas, Mykola’s naive world is collapsing as the militants kill his pregnant wife and burn his home to the ground. Recovered, he makes a cardinal decision and gets enlisted in a sniper company. Having met his wife’s killers, he emotionally breaks down and arranges “sniper terror” for the enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/295gZzTXMvuiIG0U19h4M44PXxI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:966220'),
  ('3612671894344206', 'Sniper: Ultimate Kill', 2017, 'Action', 'Claudio Fäh, Ross W. Clarkson, Carl Goldstein', 'Chris Hauty', 'Chad Michael Collins, Danay García, Joe Lando, Billy Zane, Tom Berenger, Pedro José Pallares, Jaime Correa, Lucho Velasco', 'R', 'For the first time, Brandon Beckett, Richard Miller and Sgt. Thomas Beckett join forces in Colombia to take down a brutal drug cartel. When a deadly sniper with advanced, never-before-seen weaponry targets local Special Agent Kate Estrada, our elite team is in for the ultimate battle in this explosive, game-changing action thriller.', 'For the first time, Brandon Beckett, Richard Miller and Sgt. Thomas Beckett join forces in Colombia to take down a brutal drug cartel. When a deadly sniper with advanced, never-before-seen weaponry targets local Special Agent Kate Estrada, our elite team is in for the ultimate battle in this explosive, game-changing action thriller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdahBLqWeEuDsM4fCBrXw8oCNRm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464889'),
  ('1036216632283541481', 'Snipers', 2022, 'Drama, War', 'Zhao Xiaoding, Zhang Mo, Zhang Yimou', 'Chen Yu', 'Zhang Yi, Zhang Yu, Chen Yongsheng, Jonathan Kos-Read, Kevin Lee, Scotty Cox, Liu Yitie, Huang Yan', null, 'The story of sharpshooter Zhang Taofang, a young army recruit who at age 22 sets a record during the Korean War by reportedly killing or wounding 214 American soldiers with 435 shots in just 32 days.', 'The story of sharpshooter Zhang Taofang, a young army recruit who at age 22 sets a record during the Korean War by reportedly killing or wounding 214 American soldiers with 435 shots in just 32 days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2m3NvM7Skz3rcNmhJ8lU33SRJEg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:799288'),
  ('669882308851111259', 'Snitch', 2013, 'Thriller, Drama, Action', 'Ric Roman Waugh, Dana Gonzales, Walter Gasparovic', 'Ric Roman Waugh, Justin Haythe', 'Dwayne Johnson, Barry Pepper, Susan Sarandon, Benjamin Bratt, Michael Kenneth Williams, Melina Kanakaredes, Nadine Velazquez, David Harbour', 'PG-13', 'Construction company owner John Matthews learns that his estranged son, Jason, has been arrested for drug trafficking. Facing an unjust prison sentence for a first time offender courtesy of mandatory minimum sentence laws, Jason has nothing to offer for leniency in good conscience. Desperately, John convinces the DEA and the opportunistic DA Joanne Keeghan to let him go undercover to help make arrests big enough to free his son in return. With the unwitting help of an ex-con employee, John enters the narcotics underworld where every move could be his last in an operation that will demand all his resources, wits and courage to survive.', 'Construction company owner John Matthews learns that his estranged son, Jason, has been arrested for drug trafficking. Facing an unjust prison sentence for a first time offender courtesy of mandatory minimum sentence laws, Jason has nothing to offer for leniency in good conscience. Desperately, John convinces the DEA and the opportunistic DA Joanne Keeghan to let him go undercover to help make arrests big enough to free his son in return. With the unwitting help of an ex-con employee, John enters the narcotics underworld where every move could be his last in an operation that will demand all his resources, wits and courage to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1suKSCm8gVUIIOh4MgtWAtzkMe4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134411'),
  ('719685288884726830', 'Snoop Dogg''s F*cn Around Comedy Special', 2022, 'Documentary, Comedy, Music', 'Ryan Polito', null, 'Snoop Dogg, Katt Williams, Mike Epps, DeRay Davis, DJ Pooh, Melanie Comarcho, Guy Torry, Donnell Rawlings', null, 'Snoop Dogg hosts a night of music and stand-up as he welcomes his friends — including legendary comedians Katt Williams and Mike Epps — to the stage.', 'Snoop Dogg hosts a night of music and stand-up as he welcomes his friends — including legendary comedians Katt Williams and Mike Epps — to the stage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQalMMwpAP31ptuy2IZihooXD4w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:985075'),
  ('291428741627902124', 'Snoop Dogg''s Hood of Horror', 2006, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Stacy Title, Claudio Rocha', 'Chris Kobin, Jonathan McHugh', 'Snoop Dogg, Daniella Alonso, Anson Mount, Hawthorne James, Irina Voronina, Noel Gugliemi, Danny Trejo, Gabriel Pimentel', 'R', 'A hip hop horror anthology of three tales of terror told by the Hound of Hell (Snoop Dogg) that revolve around the residents of an inner-city neighborhood whose actions determine where they will go in the afterlife.', 'A hip hop horror anthology of three tales of terror told by the Hound of Hell (Snoop Dogg) that revolve around the residents of an inner-city neighborhood whose actions determine where they will go in the afterlife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/98abrZgWTnGP0noaY2Cli7SNhVb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15423'),
  ('548157045155734897', 'Snoopy Presents: A Summer Musical', 2025, 'Animation, Family, Music, Comedy', 'Erik Wiese', 'Craig Schulz, Bryan Schulz, Cornelius Uliano', 'Etienne Kellici, Hattie Kragten, Terry McGurrin, Jayd Deroché, Isabella Leo, Lexi Perri, Wyatt White, Caleb Bellavance', 'G', 'Music and glee fill the air as Charlie Brown and the gang head off to summer camp. First-timer Sally doesn''t get what all the hype is about. But when the camp may be forced to close, they team up to save it so more kids can make their own special memories.', 'Music and glee fill the air as Charlie Brown and the gang head off to summer camp. First-timer Sally doesn''t get what all the hype is about. But when the camp may be forced to close, they team up to save it so more kids can make their own special memories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kK1ugxST3tCJZjZEO37sLb4Yot5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1484453'),
  ('863192076457530362', 'Snoopy Presents: For Auld Lang Syne', 2021, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Clay Kaytis', 'Alex Galatis, Clay Kaytis, Scott Montgomery', 'Etienne Kellici, Isabella Leo, Wyatt White, Terry McGurrin, Rob Tinkler, Lexi Perri, Hattie Kragten, Holly Gorski', 'G', 'After finding out her grandmother won''t be visiting for Christmas, Lucy decides to cheer herself up by throwing the ultimate New Year''s Eve party. Meanwhile, Charlie Brown tries to fulfill one of his resolutions before the clock strikes midnight.', 'After finding out her grandmother won''t be visiting for Christmas, Lucy decides to cheer herself up by throwing the ultimate New Year''s Eve party. Meanwhile, Charlie Brown tries to fulfill one of his resolutions before the clock strikes midnight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0ONYt2cw0vPEnZIoOHq1Ki7Ifm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:881211'),
  ('1003048375065191979', 'Snoopy Presents: It''s the Small Things, Charlie Brown', 2022, 'Animation, Family', 'Raymond S. Persi', null, 'Tyler James Nathan, Terry McGurrin, Hattie Kragten, Rob Tinkler, Lexi Perri, Isabella Leo, Wyatt White, Holly Gorski', 'G', 'Charlie Brown is determined to win the big baseball game. But things turn into a fiasco right before the matchup, when Sally bonds with a little flower on the pitcher''s mound and vows to protect it at all costs.', 'Charlie Brown is determined to win the big baseball game. But things turn into a fiasco right before the matchup, when Sally bonds with a little flower on the pitcher''s mound and vows to protect it at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEJGBnZa9PnCXSTrcQGEqK9Y9yr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:949580'),
  ('837476325324008007', 'Snoopy Presents: Lucy''s School', 2022, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Raymond S. Persi, Justin Smith, Johnny Cochrane', 'Craig Schulz, Cornelius Uliano, Bryan Schulz', 'Etienne Kellici, Isabella Leo, Wyatt White, Terry McGurrin, Rob Tinkler, Lexi Perri, Holly Gorski, Caleb Bellavance', 'G', 'The Peanuts gang is nervous about going to a new school, so Lucy starts her own. She soon learns that teaching is tougher than she thought—and that change can be a good thing.', 'The Peanuts gang is nervous about going to a new school, so Lucy starts her own. She soon learns that teaching is tougher than she thought—and that change can be a good thing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJgiZrEIH3LKEwiZjWmpWDPETrT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:975490'),
  ('462172044518383809', 'Snoopy Presents: One-of-a-Kind Marcie', 2023, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Justin Smith, Ricky Laity, Raymond S. Persi', 'Betsy Walters', 'Arianna McDonald, Lexi Perri, Etienne Kellici, Antonina Battrick, Isabella Leo, Wyatt White, Caleb Bellavance, Lucien Duncan-Reid', 'G', 'Quiet, kindhearted introvert Marcie has lots of brilliant ideas to help her friends achieve goals and solve problems. But when the world takes notice and the spotlight lands on her, sharing those ideas becomes a challenge.', 'Quiet, kindhearted introvert Marcie has lots of brilliant ideas to help her friends achieve goals and solve problems. But when the world takes notice and the spotlight lands on her, sharing those ideas becomes a challenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFDPyo6mdooNcHvgy17gz1GEjg4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1128604'),
  ('190856744616946471', 'Snoopy Presents: Welcome Home, Franklin', 2024, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Kaitlyn Sutherland, Justin Smith, Ricky Laity', null, 'Caleb Bellavance, Etienne Kellici, Isabella Leo, Wyatt White, Lexi Perri, Hattie Kragten, Arianna McDonald, Lucien Duncan-Reid', 'G', 'Franklin is new to town and hoping to make friends, but his usual tactics don''t work on the Peanuts gang. When the Soap Box Derby arrives, he''s sure it''s a chance to impress new pals and teams up with the only other unpartnered kid: Charlie Brown.', 'Franklin is new to town and hoping to make friends, but his usual tactics don''t work on the Peanuts gang. When the Soap Box Derby arrives, he''s sure it''s a chance to impress new pals and teams up with the only other unpartnered kid: Charlie Brown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pjIrYzc31kHTySiovHAt0o3qDc2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1128606'),
  ('296555549616843335', 'Snoopy, Come Home', 1972, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Drama, Comedy', 'Bill Melendez', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Chad Webber, Bill Melendez, Robin Kohn, Stephen Shea, David Carey, Hilary Momberger-Powers, Johanna Baer, Linda Ercoli', 'G', 'When Snoopy receives a letter from his original owner Lila, he goes to visit her in the hospital while Charlie Brown and the gang are on the lookout for him. Suddenly, Snoopy feels that he must go live with Lila, but must say goodbye to all his friends. In his adventure to the hospital, he encounters numerous "No Dogs Allowed" signs, an annoying little girl who desires to keep him, and more!', 'When Snoopy receives a letter from his original owner Lila, he goes to visit her in the hospital while Charlie Brown and the gang are on the lookout for him. Suddenly, Snoopy feels that he must go live with Lila, but must say goodbye to all his friends. In his adventure to the hospital, he encounters numerous "No Dogs Allowed" signs, an annoying little girl who desires to keep him, and more!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vGYhYtoXkpjXTZ7KLQMJehwfLG0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15242'),
  ('812960579131577403', 'Snoopy: The Musical', 1988, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Music, TV Movie', 'Sam Jaimes, Desiree Goyette', 'Warren Lockhart, Michael L. Grace, Arthur Whitelaw', 'Tiffany Billings, Kristie Baker, Cam Clarke, Sean Collins, Ami Foster, Jeremy Miller, Bill Melendez', 'NR', 'The animated adaption of the second stage musical based on the "Peanuts" comics strip, focusing on Snoopy.', 'The animated adaption of the second stage musical based on the "Peanuts" comics strip, focusing on Snoopy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2yWCJkXkd9NWs68aYUiyf9ppiFJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103782'),
  ('299401395292736478', 'Snoopy''s Getting Married, Charlie Brown', 1985, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Nick Vasu, Bill Melendez', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Danny Colby, Fergie, Gini Holtzman, Keri Houlihan, Brett Johnson, Brad Kesten, Dawnn D. Leary, Bill Melendez', null, 'After Snoopy displays his usual level of courage and runs away from his sentry duty, he happens to run into a beautiful female. Smitten, he decides to marry her. Now, the gang, and Snoopy''s brother, Spike, want to help in an affair that has the usual complications', 'After Snoopy displays his usual level of courage and runs away from his sentry duty, he happens to run into a beautiful female. Smitten, he decides to marry her. Now, the gang, and Snoopy''s brother, Spike, want to help in an affair that has the usual complications', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sY8VkKcn1CCcEhcbiEVHrI6YEye.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40481'),
  ('455785397760259815', 'Snoopy''s Reunion', 1991, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Sam Jaimes', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Philip Shafran, Josh Keaton, Kaitlyn Walker, Laurel Page, Steve Stoliar, Megan Parlen, Bill Melendez', null, 'Sensing that his canine companion is a bit down in the mouth, Charlie Brown organizes a Daisy Hill Puppy Farm reunion for Snoopy and his seven siblings in this animated special based on the Charles M. Schulz comic strip. While Charlie Brown is dismayed to see that the bucolic farm has disappeared in a sea of urban sprawl, Snoopy and gang are simply delighted to be in one another''s company. Pulling out their instruments, they jam on the sidewalk.', 'Sensing that his canine companion is a bit down in the mouth, Charlie Brown organizes a Daisy Hill Puppy Farm reunion for Snoopy and his seven siblings in this animated special based on the Charles M. Schulz comic strip. While Charlie Brown is dismayed to see that the bucolic farm has disappeared in a sea of urban sprawl, Snoopy and gang are simply delighted to be in one another''s company. Pulling out their instruments, they jam on the sidewalk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MpS8l7n10jP1V3f9kz7HVuveqH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69770'),
  ('667378911406277875', 'Snotty Boy', 2022, 'Animation', 'Marcus H. Rosenmüller, Santiago López Jover', 'Martin Ambrosch', 'Markus Freistätter, Gerti Drassl, Mario Canedo, Roland Düringer, Erwin Steinhauer, Katharina Straßer, Adele Neuhauser, Susi Stach', null, '1960''s Siegheilkirchen, a small town in the Austrian hinterland is steeped in reactionary and ultra-Catholic attitudes. The son of a hard-working innkeeper and his wife, called Snotty Boy by all and sundry, is at odds with the narrow-minded confines of his home town. But his unstoppable talent for drawing gives him an outlet for his discontent.', '1960''s Siegheilkirchen, a small town in the Austrian hinterland is steeped in reactionary and ultra-Catholic attitudes. The son of a hard-working innkeeper and his wife, called Snotty Boy by all and sundry, is at odds with the narrow-minded confines of his home town. But his unstoppable talent for drawing gives him an outlet for his discontent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tqJyMn7iMboUXBsaglgitBfLbmx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:831728'),
  ('362160275516073273', 'Snow', 1963, 'Documentary', 'Geoffrey Jones, Wolfgang Suschitzky, Jack Morrison', null, null, null, 'Comprising train and track footage quickly shot just before a heavy winter''s snowfall was melting, the multi-award-winning classic that emerged from the cutting-room compresses British Rail''s dedication to blizzard-battling into a thrilling eight-minute montage cut to music. Tough-as-boots workers struggling to keep the line clear are counterpointed with passengers'' buffet-car comforts.', 'Comprising train and track footage quickly shot just before a heavy winter''s snowfall was melting, the multi-award-winning classic that emerged from the cutting-room compresses British Rail''s dedication to blizzard-battling into a thrilling eight-minute montage cut to music. Tough-as-boots workers struggling to keep the line clear are counterpointed with passengers'' buffet-car comforts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tV1seZm1PhEOdqkCB0RfeYwTNb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243278'),
  ('978700757841533214', 'Snow', 1981, 'Drama, Crime', 'Juliet Berto, Jean-Henri Roger, Luis Garcia Amoros', 'Marc Villard, Marc Villard', 'Juliet Berto, Jean-François Stévenin, Robert Liensol, Patrick Chesnais, Jean-François Balmer, Paul Le Person, Frédérique Jamet, Dominique Maurin', null, 'Anita is a barmaid at the center of a community of street preachers, prostitutes, dealers and users. When a beloved friend (and young drug dealer) is caught by narcotics agents, Anita takes it upon herself to score for his struggling clients.', 'Anita is a barmaid at the center of a community of street preachers, prostitutes, dealers and users. When a beloved friend (and young drug dealer) is caught by narcotics agents, Anita takes it upon herself to score for his struggling clients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Boh8l2p34LMeHUHDE6pYygTVQ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198497'),
  ('177987550221564261', 'Snow', 2004, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Alex Zamm, Jim Westenbrink', 'Rich Burns', 'Tom Cavanagh, Ashley Williams, Patrick Fabian, Bobb''e J. Thompson, Jackie Burroughs, Leslie Carlson, Karen Robinson, Adam Greydon Reid', 'PG', 'Nick Snowden is reluctantly taking over the family business and with only three days before the big night, one of Nick''s younger reindeer is stolen from the North Pole and taken to a zoo.', 'Nick Snowden is reluctantly taking over the family business and with only three days before the big night, one of Nick''s younger reindeer is stolen from the North Pole and taken to a zoo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLJhBJrjXg5z0G9D3kGd3RG76kG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50332'),
  ('900972343656306377', 'Snow', 2017, 'Drama', 'Emre Erdoğdu, Egemen Sahin', 'Emre Erdoğdu', 'Hazar Ergüçlü, Ozan Uygun, Halil Babür, Doğaç Yıldız, Nazlı Bulum, Arsevi Özkurt, Erhan Sefaci, Fulya Aksular', null, 'Müzeyyen is a 22-year-old high school senior living in Antalya who spends most of her time with a posse of misfits. She lives a drug-fuelled, highly troubled life outside the norms of society. When her long-lost brother Ali decides to visit her during winter break, everyone''s life is tested, each with different consequences.', 'Müzeyyen is a 22-year-old high school senior living in Antalya who spends most of her time with a posse of misfits. She lives a drug-fuelled, highly troubled life outside the norms of society. When her long-lost brother Ali decides to visit her during winter break, everyone''s life is tested, each with different consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ja1QKM3m9LRT5GqCqxQFjCFskPg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504318'),
  ('727549104057656207', 'Snow 2: Brain Freeze', 2009, 'Family, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Mark Rosman', 'Rich Burns', 'Tom Cavanagh, Ashley Williams, Lynley Hall, Janelle Cooper, Viv Leacock, Hal Williams, Chantal Perron, Patrick Fabian', null, 'When Nick gets amnesia, it''s up to Sandy and Buddy the reindeer to save him and Christmas.', 'When Nick gets amnesia, it''s up to Sandy and Buddy the reindeer to save him and Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Rnn2bXZZmUOyD80alueT0KoBWs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51836'),
  ('726147481119458636', 'Snow and the Bear', 2022, 'Drama', 'Selcen Ergun, Florent Herry', 'Selcen Ergun, Yeşim Aslan', 'Merve Dizdar, Saygın Soysal, Asiye Dinçsoy, Erkan Bektaş, Derya Pınar Ak, Onur Gürçay, Mehmet Küçük, Muttalip Müjdeci', null, 'A young nurse starts a new assignment in a small isolated village in the farthest reaches of Turkey, a place that seems asleep in an endless winter. A thick layer of snow covers the souls as well as the lands. But under the snow, unspeakable secrets hibernate.', 'A young nurse starts a new assignment in a small isolated village in the farthest reaches of Turkey, a place that seems asleep in an endless winter. A thick layer of snow covers the souls as well as the lands. But under the snow, unspeakable secrets hibernate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f7N22qZ18hrX3F8OEoJbdbR78pE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1008393'),
  ('367317781354681740', 'Snow Angels', 2007, 'Drama, Romance, Crime', 'David Gordon Green, Tim Orr', 'David Gordon Green', 'Kate Beckinsale, Sam Rockwell, Michael Angarano, Jeannetta Arnette, Griffin Dunne, Nicky Katt, Tom Noonan, Connor Paolo', 'R', 'Waitress Annie has separated from her suicidal alcoholic husband, Glenn. Glenn has become an evangelical Christian, but his erratic attempts at getting back into Annie''s life have alarmed her. High school student Arthur works at Annie''s restaurant, growing closer to a new kid in town, Lila, after class. When Glenn and Annie''s daughter go missing, the whole town searches for her, as he increasingly spirals out of control.', 'Waitress Annie has separated from her suicidal alcoholic husband, Glenn. Glenn has become an evangelical Christian, but his erratic attempts at getting back into Annie''s life have alarmed her. High school student Arthur works at Annie''s restaurant, growing closer to a new kid in town, Lila, after class. When Glenn and Annie''s daughter go missing, the whole town searches for her, as he increasingly spirals out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKtht1ezc31mH1cBIHoDPmScnk9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14054'),
  ('228924427476634833', 'Snow Bride', 2013, 'Romance, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Bert Kish, Brooks Ludwick', 'Tracy Andreen', 'Katrina Law, Patricia Richardson, Susie Abromeit, Jordan Belfi, Robert Curtis Brown, Bobby Campo, Tom Lenk, Dana Barron', 'G', 'When a reporter encounters the eldest son of a famous political family at a mountain retreat, she winds up pretending to be his girlfriend over Christmas so he can save face with his family. Should she secretly expose newsworthy scoops about the famous family in order to save her job, or trust that she''s falling in love for real? Stars Patricia Richardson and Katrina Law.', 'When a reporter encounters the eldest son of a famous political family at a mountain retreat, she winds up pretending to be his girlfriend over Christmas so he can save face with his family. Should she secretly expose newsworthy scoops about the famous family in order to save her job, or trust that she''s falling in love for real? Stars Patricia Richardson and Katrina Law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QiRWSeBSY2LJxpTXfN5QeyJoLX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235662'),
  ('1092415943481374777', 'Snow Buddies', 2008, 'Family, Adventure', 'Robert Vince, Kamal Derkaoui, Geoff Anderson', 'Robert Vince, Anna McRoberts', 'Skyler Gisondo, Josh Flitter, Liliana Mumy, Henry Hodges, Jimmy Bennett, Dylan Sprouse, Cainan Wiebe, Lise Simms', 'G', 'Dylan Sprouse, Jim Belushi and Kris Kristofferson lend their voices to this family-friendly tale about a feisty pack of golden retriever puppies that embarks on an Alaskan adventure. When they find themselves stranded in the northern wilderness, the canine offspring of famed sports star Air Bud team up with an experienced sled dog and a husky pup, who teach them the importance of working together.', 'Dylan Sprouse, Jim Belushi and Kris Kristofferson lend their voices to this family-friendly tale about a feisty pack of golden retriever puppies that embarks on an Alaskan adventure. When they find themselves stranded in the northern wilderness, the canine offspring of famed sports star Air Bud team up with an experienced sled dog and a husky pup, who teach them the importance of working together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7eOFi6eVxbbVmkDg0f1lYsUO4O2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14059'),
  ('904749281872679145', 'Snow Business', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet', 'NR', 'Sylvester Cat and Tweety Bird are snowbound in a mountain cabin, and though Tweety has lots of bird seed, Sylvester will starve unless he can cook the unsuspecting Tweety. Meanwhile, a starving mouse thinks Sylvester is edible.', 'Sylvester Cat and Tweety Bird are snowbound in a mountain cabin, and though Tweety has lots of bird seed, Sylvester will starve unless he can cook the unsuspecting Tweety. Meanwhile, a starving mouse thinks Sylvester is edible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfUVEZcb9yqbAHr3V2MrBmx4bLN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163036'),
  ('614341568761590327', 'Snow Cake', 2006, 'Romance, Drama', 'Marc Evans, Steve Cosens', 'Angela Pell', 'Alan Rickman, Sigourney Weaver, Carrie-Anne Moss, Emily Hampshire, James Allodi, Janet van de Graaf, Julie Stewart, Selina Cadell', 'NR', 'A drama focused on the friendship between a high-functioning autistic woman and a man who is traumatized after a fatal car accident.', 'A drama focused on the friendship between a high-functioning autistic woman and a man who is traumatized after a fatal car accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzKNKUqaDu9JCUmjhuoDd8KQBBs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313'),
  ('900622594938444896', 'Snow Country', 1957, 'Drama, Romance', 'Shirō Toyoda, Jun Yasumoto, Tsutomu Nakamura', 'Toshio Yasumi', 'Ryō Ikebe, Keiko Kishi, Kaoru Yachigusa, Akira Kubo, Haruo Tanaka, Akira Nakamura, Chieko Naniwa, Jun Tatara', null, 'It''s a man''s world. Shimamura, an artist, comes to this snowbound town to rejuvenate himself. He connects with Komako, a geisha he met on a previous trip, and it seems like love. She''s the foster daughter of a local family, almost engaged to the family''s son Yukio, now dying of consumption. He''s tended by his sister Yuko who''s angry at Komako for abandoning her brother. Shimamura returns to Tokyo but promises he will be back soon. In anticipation of his return, Komako breaks with her patron and her family loses their home. Complications arise when Shimamura doesn''t come back as promised. Then Komako discovers that he and Yuko knew each other in Tokyo. Can Komako escape destiny?', 'It''s a man''s world. Shimamura, an artist, comes to this snowbound town to rejuvenate himself. He connects with Komako, a geisha he met on a previous trip, and it seems like love. She''s the foster daughter of a local family, almost engaged to the family''s son Yukio, now dying of consumption. He''s tended by his sister Yuko who''s angry at Komako for abandoning her brother. Shimamura returns to Tokyo but promises he will be back soon. In anticipation of his return, Komako breaks with her patron and her family loses their home. Complications arise when Shimamura doesn''t come back as promised. Then Komako discovers that he and Yuko knew each other in Tokyo. Can Komako escape destiny?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3JFWuexED1L4kbq0ajPbSSkZfu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118691'),
  ('988509153952572730', 'Snow Country', 1965, 'Drama', 'Hideo Ōba, Tōichirō Narushima', 'Ryōsuke Saitō', 'Shima Iwashita, Mariko Kaga, Isao Kimura, Tamotsu Hayakawa, Shinichi Yanagisawa, Sadako Sawamura, Kaneko Iwasaki, Chieko Naniwa', null, 'This movie is based on an immortal literary work "The Snow Country," a story about a life of geisha Komako who lives in a region with heavy snowfalls.', 'This movie is based on an immortal literary work "The Snow Country," a story about a life of geisha Komako who lives in a region with heavy snowfalls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEeI5sFbaF70HRjwWtQGyNN0Ixv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407299'),
  ('911270503577190366', 'Snow Day', 2000, 'Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Chris Koch, Robbie Greenberg, Tom Glass', 'Will McRobb, Chris Viscardi', 'Mark Webber, Schuyler Fisk, Zena Grey, Chris Elliott, Chevy Chase, Jean Smart, Emmanuelle Chriqui, Iggy Pop', 'PG', 'When an entire town in upstate New York is closed down by an unexpected snowfall, a "snow day" begins when a group of elementary school kids, led by Natalie Brandston, try to ensure that the schools stay closed by stopping a mechanical snowplow driver by trying to hijack his plow truck. Meanwhile, Natalie''s big brother Hal is using this day to try to win the affections of Claire Bonner, the most popular girl in his high school, while Hal and Natalie''s father Tom, a TV meteorologist, faces off against a rival meteorologist for weather coverage of the day''s events.', 'When an entire town in upstate New York is closed down by an unexpected snowfall, a "snow day" begins when a group of elementary school kids, led by Natalie Brandston, try to ensure that the schools stay closed by stopping a mechanical snowplow driver by trying to hijack his plow truck. Meanwhile, Natalie''s big brother Hal is using this day to try to win the affections of Claire Bonner, the most popular girl in his high school, while Hal and Natalie''s father Tom, a TV meteorologist, faces off against a rival meteorologist for weather coverage of the day''s events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myTnHKy178rrd1oUG3GkEvc641G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15489'),
  ('241115026723429897', 'Snow Day', 2022, 'TV Movie, Family, Comedy, Music', 'Michael Lembeck, Thomas M. Harting, Jesse Griffiths', 'Will McRobb, Chris Viscardi', 'Ky Baldwin, Michaela Russell, Fabi Aguirre, Shelby Simmons, Myles Erlick, Jerry Trainor, Monique Jasmine Paul, Lilly Bartlam', null, 'A pair of siblings make the most of a school snow day, while trying to avoid their nemesis, the Snowplowman.', 'A pair of siblings make the most of a school snow day, while trying to avoid their nemesis, the Snowplowman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnwf2DyI41EkWvJnOLfWV6DFRNW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1032412'),
  ('410143116077925667', 'Snow Devils', 1967, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Antonio Margheriti, Riccardo Pallottini', 'Ivan Reiner, Bill Finger, Charles Sinclair', 'Giacomo Rossi Stuart, Ombretta Colli, Renato Baldini, Wilbert Bradley, Enzo Fiermonte, Halina Zalewska, Goffredo Unger, Isarco Ravaioli', 'G', 'A heroic expedition braves snow-whipped precipices and discovers the dreaded humanoids. But wait – these are extraterrestrial yetis who zipped in from outer space to conquer Earth by melting the polar ice caps with high-energy proton fields. Will mankind be global-warmed into surrender?', 'A heroic expedition braves snow-whipped precipices and discovers the dreaded humanoids. But wait – these are extraterrestrial yetis who zipped in from outer space to conquer Earth by melting the polar ice caps with high-energy proton fields. Will mankind be global-warmed into surrender?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mELeig8FzX2PcLlMx1R7SWEf8B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28538'),
  ('792566546091218750', 'Snow Dogs', 2002, 'Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Brian Levant, Thomas E. Ackerman', 'Michael Goldberg, Mark Gibson, Jim Kouf', 'Cuba Gooding Jr., James Coburn, Sisqó, Nichelle Nichols, M. Emmet Walsh, Graham Greene, Brian Doyle-Murray, Joanna Bacalso', 'PG', 'When a Miami dentist inherits a team of sled dogs, he''s got to learn the trade or lose his pack to a crusty mountain man.', 'When a Miami dentist inherits a team of sled dogs, he''s got to learn the trade or lose his pack to a crusty mountain man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DDC6z1XyLSiNLzKw1pXcYeAOJ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11888'),
  ('580713213845700803', 'Snow Excuse', 1966, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Speedy Gonzales, living in the snowy mountains, is freezing and decides to steal firewood from Daffy Duck after he rejects him borowing some of his. Daffy does everything in his power to stop him.', 'Speedy Gonzales, living in the snowy mountains, is freezing and decides to steal firewood from Daffy Duck after he rejects him borowing some of his. Daffy does everything in his power to stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j34FKJNARAAYb1R0hY8Y6xjfddj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234324'),
  ('959638712827779309', 'Snow Falling on Cedars', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Scott Hicks, William Arnold, Robert Richardson', 'Scott Hicks, Ronald Bass', 'Ethan Hawke, Youki Kudoh, Reeve Carney, Anne Suzuki, Rick Yune, Max von Sydow, James Rebhorn, James Cromwell', 'PG-13', 'In the 1950s, a Japanese-American fisherman is suspected of killing his neighbour at sea. For Ishmael, a local reporter, the trial strikes a deep emotional chord when he finds his ex-lover is linked to the case. As he investigates the killing, he uncovers some startling clues that lead him to a shocking discovery.', 'In the 1950s, a Japanese-American fisherman is suspected of killing his neighbour at sea. For Ishmael, a local reporter, the trial strikes a deep emotional chord when he finds his ex-lover is linked to the case. As he investigates the killing, he uncovers some startling clues that lead him to a shocking discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h1CujbeKvwkR6LMr4jVuMM0C94X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10219'),
  ('601317552913997419', 'Snow Falls', 2023, 'Horror', 'Michael Dean Greenwood, Colton Tran', 'Luke Genton', 'Victoria Moroles, Johnny Berchtold, Colton Tran, Anna Grace Barlow, Jonathan Bennett, James Gaisford, Patrick Fabian', 'R', 'After a winter storm strands five friends in a remote cabin with no power and little food, disorientation slowly claims their sanity as each of them succumbs to a fear that the snow itself may be contaminated or somehow evil.', 'After a winter storm strands five friends in a remote cabin with no power and little food, disorientation slowly claims their sanity as each of them succumbs to a fear that the snow itself may be contaminated or somehow evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ueZUfAa98hAsxWOp9Zv3JIRuNkS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:737853'),
  ('1008591377295769553', 'Snow Flower and the Secret Fan', 2011, 'Drama, History', 'Wayne Wang, Richard Wong', 'Angela Workman, Ronald Bass, Michael Ray', 'Li Bingbing, Gianna Jun, Hugh Jackman, Vivian Wu, Jiang Wu, Russell Wong, Coco Chiang Yi, Fang Zhoubo', 'PG-13', 'A story set in 19th century China and centered on the lifelong friendship between two girls who develop their own secret code as a way to contend with the rigid cultural norms imposed on women.', 'A story set in 19th century China and centered on the lifelong friendship between two girls who develop their own secret code as a way to contend with the rigid cultural norms imposed on women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhhlq19I9BjcfmGLZc7SzHQULo0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58882'),
  ('31522572750175017', 'Snow In Sea Breeze', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kim Jeong-kwon, Kim Yong-hoon', 'Kim Jeong-kwon', 'Park Hae-jin, Lee Young-ah, Song Jae-hee, Jeon Moo-song, Song Chae-rin', null, 'On a snowy night, little Seon-mi is diagnosed with hemopoietic dysplasia. Years pass and Seon-mi, who has now become an adult, has overcome her pain and is adjusting to the adult world. Having decided to use her talent to become a perfumer, she travels to many different places to collect various scents and spices to help people with their inner pains. She meets Sang-woo at an aquarium and is strongly drawn to his scent which reminds her of her father.', 'On a snowy night, little Seon-mi is diagnosed with hemopoietic dysplasia. Years pass and Seon-mi, who has now become an adult, has overcome her pain and is adjusting to the adult world. Having decided to use her talent to become a perfumer, she travels to many different places to collect various scents and spices to help people with their inner pains. She meets Sang-woo at an aquarium and is strongly drawn to his scent which reminds her of her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7K7pw1twTUNpeuuAm9ac6tbbLDM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348230'),
  ('445920330174064530', 'Snow Job', 1965, 'Thriller, Comedy', 'Luciano Salce, Alfio Contini, Emilio P. Miraglia', 'Castellano, Pipolo', 'Vittorio Gassman, Adolfo Celi, Daniela Bianchi, Beba Lončar, Lobna Abdel Aziz, Emma Danieli, Corrado Olmi, Isabella Biagini', null, 'Lucio sees his holiday on the Italian Alps interrupted when he is suddenly and unwillingly involved in an International plot involving fake dollar bills.', 'Lucio sees his holiday on the Italian Alps interrupted when he is suddenly and unwillingly involved in an International plot involving fake dollar bills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mITJ3Kry7xV7ZZO4bYdFYvkmlhk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280979'),
  ('702787354310312265', 'Snow on The Blades', 2014, 'History, Action, Drama', 'Setsuro Wakamatsu, Tokushō Kikumura', 'Hironobu Takamatsu, Yasuo Hasegawa, Kenzaburô Iida', 'Kiichi Nakai, Hiroshi Abe, Kichiemon Nakamura II, Hirosue Ryoko, Masahiro Takashima, Sei Matobu, Eisaku Yoshida, Youichiro Omi', null, 'At Sakurada Gate in 1860, the shogun’s chief minister and his retinue of bodyguards are ambushed and annihilated. Bearing the responsibility and shame for this failure is Shimura Kingo, master swordsman and chief of the guard. Forbidden to take his own life in atonement, he is instead tasked with hunting down the remaining assassins; however, fate intervenes and now only one is left. Devoted to his late lord and his duty, he relentlessly pursues the sole remaining assassin for the next thirteen years. But times are changing in Japan and the way of the sword has become outlawed. What does this mean for Kingo?', 'At Sakurada Gate in 1860, the shogun’s chief minister and his retinue of bodyguards are ambushed and annihilated. Bearing the responsibility and shame for this failure is Shimura Kingo, master swordsman and chief of the guard. Forbidden to take his own life in atonement, he is instead tasked with hunting down the remaining assassins; however, fate intervenes and now only one is left. Devoted to his late lord and his duty, he relentlessly pursues the sole remaining assassin for the next thirteen years. But times are changing in Japan and the way of the sword has become outlawed. What does this mean for Kingo?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kgrqonjpLZtH0GvLZupyiOialWC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295715'),
  ('594823144514502379', 'Snow Pirates', 2015, 'History, Drama', 'Faruk Hacihafizoglu', 'Faruk Hacihafizoglu', 'Yakup Özgür Kurtaal, Ömer Uluç, Taha Tegin Özdemir', null, 'Set in 1981, the movie tells the story of Kars after the 1980 coup d''état. At that time, the region was covered in snow for months, and in addition to the many problems brought about by the coup, it was impossible to find coal. Coal was a blessing that only privileged people and some state institutions could access. Serhat, Gürbüz and İbo, three close friends, start looking for coal instead of playing games during the report card holiday following the coup. Their struggle for heating, one of their most basic needs, will turn into a story of solidarity that will shape their childhood.', 'Set in 1981, the movie tells the story of Kars after the 1980 coup d''état. At that time, the region was covered in snow for months, and in addition to the many problems brought about by the coup, it was impossible to find coal. Coal was a blessing that only privileged people and some state institutions could access. Serhat, Gürbüz and İbo, three close friends, start looking for coal instead of playing games during the report card holiday following the coup. Their struggle for heating, one of their most basic needs, will turn into a story of solidarity that will shape their childhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMu2tO5T7ApVmyXWM2U7M9ugdeM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338050'),
  ('841567820033091351', 'Snow Queen', 2002, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'David Wu, Gregory Middleton, Leann Harvey', 'Simon Moore', 'Bridget Fonda, Jeremy Guilbaut, Chelsea Hobbs, Robert Wisden, Wanda Cannon, Meghan Black, Jennifer Clement, Kira Clavell', 'PG', 'Since a bitter winter storm stole the life of Gerda''s mother, she and her father have sadly continued to run the remote hotel they call home. Lonely and isolated, Gerda''s only joy is Kai, the handsome bellboy. A mysterious guest with an icy stare arrives at the hotel one night, wrapped in fur and diamonds. By daybreak, the "Snow Queen" has vanished with Kai! Gerda embarks on a journey of morphing seasons, fantastical creatures, and long-frozen mysteries in a desperate quest to find her stolen love.', 'Since a bitter winter storm stole the life of Gerda''s mother, she and her father have sadly continued to run the remote hotel they call home. Lonely and isolated, Gerda''s only joy is Kai, the handsome bellboy. A mysterious guest with an icy stare arrives at the hotel one night, wrapped in fur and diamonds. By daybreak, the "Snow Queen" has vanished with Kai! Gerda embarks on a journey of morphing seasons, fantastical creatures, and long-frozen mysteries in a desperate quest to find her stolen love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qufo7G0OTQs1hMtO7B5axnCdm4E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16174'),
  ('920710807579839212', 'Snow Steam Iron', 2017, 'Drama, Crime', 'Zack Snyder, Zack Snyder', 'Zack Snyder', 'Samantha Win, Victoria Jacobsen, Jen Sung, Kristin VanOvan, Wayne Dalglish, Ross Kohnstam, Jim Rowe, Eli Snyder', null, '“Snow gently falls on the blood-stained streets of a seedy out-of-time New York City. Steam envelopes the nightmare unfolding within its narrow alleys. Iron is the will of the one who would dare to resist… fight… survive.”', '“Snow gently falls on the blood-stained streets of a seedy out-of-time New York City. Steam envelopes the nightmare unfolding within its narrow alleys. Iron is the will of the one who would dare to resist… fight… survive.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUZC6c3iTsES5D5QSEZs6Db8ISm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:476673'),
  ('491946500625261945', 'Snow Trail', 1947, 'Drama, Crime', 'Senkichi Taniguchi, Junichi Segawa, Hitoshi Usami', 'Akira Kurosawa', 'Toshirō Mifune, Takashi Shimura, Setsuko Wakayama, Akitake Kōno, Yoshio Kosugi, Kokuten Kōdō, Taizō Fukami, Eizaburô Sakauchi', null, 'Three bank robbers, Eijima, Nojiri, and Takasugi, flee the police and escape into the mountains. At an inn high in the Japanese Alps, Eijima and Nojiri encounter a young woman and her father, as well as Honda, a mountaineer. The inn folk do not realize their guests are wanted criminals and the visitors are treated with great kindness. Honda volunteers to lead them over the mountains, but Eijima''s paranoia endangers all of them as they make the perilous trip.', 'Three bank robbers, Eijima, Nojiri, and Takasugi, flee the police and escape into the mountains. At an inn high in the Japanese Alps, Eijima and Nojiri encounter a young woman and her father, as well as Honda, a mountaineer. The inn folk do not realize their guests are wanted criminals and the visitors are treated with great kindness. Honda volunteers to lead them over the mountains, but Eijima''s paranoia endangers all of them as they make the perilous trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/70Pzxhp69KWVlIlfBCB4gSBAKQL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127112'),
  ('255076763359358382', 'Snow White', 1961, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Gottfried Kolditz, Erwin Anders, Gerda Eggers-Ebert', 'Günter Kaltofen', 'Doris Weikow, Marianne Christina Schilling, Wolf-Dieter Panse, Harry Hindemith, Steffie Spira, Fred Delmare, Heinz Scholz, Willi Scholz', null, 'Hated by her jealous and bloodthirsty stepmother, Snow White flees a murder attempt and seeks shelter in the woods with seven kindly dwarfs. Feeling she is safe from harm, Snow White welcomes the disguised queen into her home...with fatal consequences.', 'Hated by her jealous and bloodthirsty stepmother, Snow White flees a murder attempt and seeks shelter in the woods with seven kindly dwarfs. Feeling she is safe from harm, Snow White welcomes the disguised queen into her home...with fatal consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUbc9IiD2uzLXJ2C2ijlC09s3Bq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13308'),
  ('786697258220857734', 'Snow White', 1987, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Michael Berz, Amnon Salomon', 'Michael Berz', 'Diana Rigg, Sarah Patterson, Nicola Stapleton, Billy Barty, Mike Edmonds, Ricardo Gil, Malcolm Dixon, Gary Friedkin', 'PG', 'A prince, seeking the greatest treasure, stumbles upon seven little men guarding a coffin. They tell him the story of Snow White, a beautiful princess who was forced to run away from home after her jealous stepmother tried to have her killed. When she realizes that the girl is still alive and living with the dwarfs, she sets out to destroy her only rival once and for all.', 'A prince, seeking the greatest treasure, stumbles upon seven little men guarding a coffin. They tell him the story of Snow White, a beautiful princess who was forced to run away from home after her jealous stepmother tried to have her killed. When she realizes that the girl is still alive and living with the dwarfs, she sets out to destroy her only rival once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7ICLYTRHdyERwOC29pd9FqZD3H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59075'),
  ('1052267060172362096', 'Snow White', 1990, 'Music, Family, Animation, Fantasy', 'Diane Eskenazi', null, 'Pat Musick, Jim Cummings, Rob Paulsen', 'G', 'Enter the spellbinding realm of a pretty young princess, a scheming queen and seven funny little fellows with very big hearts in this brilliantly animated retelling of the timeless fairy take classic.', 'Enter the spellbinding realm of a pretty young princess, a scheming queen and seven funny little fellows with very big hearts in this brilliantly animated retelling of the timeless fairy take classic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0Npt5BQk7L81TminE6ll02NsCg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359921'),
  ('235521060955236181', 'Snow White', 1995, 'Animation, Drama, Family, Fantasy, Music, Romance', 'Toshiyuki Hiruma, Takashi Masunaga, Masanori Miura', null, 'Venus Terzo, Kathleen Barr, Michael Donovan, Ian James Corlett, Philip Maurice Hayes, Scott McNeil, Terry Klassen, Andrea Libman', null, 'A young princess named Snow White is sent away from her palace to live in the woods due to the jealousy of her stepmother.', 'A young princess named Snow White is sent away from her palace to live in the woods due to the jealousy of her stepmother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYiSyqi584AW9eKHPVYzME3cNTv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116743'),
  ('758965006690445775', 'Snow White', 2001, 'Adventure, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Caroline Thompson, Jon Joffin, Bonnie Benwick', null, 'Miranda Richardson, Tom Irwin, Vera Farmiga, Kristin Kreuk, Clancy Brown, Vincent Schiavelli, José Zúñiga, Michael J. Anderson', 'PG', 'Snow White''s mother dies during childbirth, leaving baby Snow and father John for dead on an icy field, who then receives a visit from one of Satan''s representatives, granting him three wishes.', 'Snow White''s mother dies during childbirth, leaving baby Snow and father John for dead on an icy field, who then receives a visit from one of Satan''s representatives, granting him three wishes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIjplbyfFDbHsN7ZK40klO5nnUw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32593'),
  ('292252675118833631', 'Snow White', 2005, 'Drama', 'Samir Jamal Al Din, Michael Saxer, Andreas Hutter', null, 'Julie Fournier, Carlos Leal, Zoé Mikuleczky, Stefan Gubser, Xaver Hutter, Sunnyi Melles, Benedict Freitag, Tony Harrisson', null, 'The life of 20-year-old Nico from upper class Zurich is all party, sex and drugs when she meets Paco, the front man of a rap band. She finds herself drawn to his independent, creative and profound way of life, so different from her own. With naiveté and infinite self-confidence, she tries to adopt his lifestyle - without anticipating the consequences.', 'The life of 20-year-old Nico from upper class Zurich is all party, sex and drugs when she meets Paco, the front man of a rap band. She finds herself drawn to his independent, creative and profound way of life, so different from her own. With naiveté and infinite self-confidence, she tries to adopt his lifestyle - without anticipating the consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gig1yOIhv6WLULwvKmUzxwlQPhA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10151'),
  ('918548827359344894', 'Snow White', 2025, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Mandy Walker, Ben Howarth, Marc Webb', 'Erin Cressida Wilson', 'Rachel Zegler, Emilia Faucher, Gal Gadot, Andrew Burnap, Andrew Barth Feldman, Jeremy Swift, Jason Kravits, Martin Klebba', 'PG', 'Following the benevolent King''s disappearance, the Evil Queen dominated the once fair land with a cruel streak. Princess Snow White flees the castle when the Queen, in her jealousy over Snow White''s inner beauty, tries to kill her. Deep into the dark woods, she stumbles upon seven magical dwarves and a young bandit named Jonathan. Together, they strive to survive the Queen''s relentless pursuit and aspire to take back the kingdom.', 'Following the benevolent King''s disappearance, the Evil Queen dominated the once fair land with a cruel streak. Princess Snow White flees the castle when the Queen, in her jealousy over Snow White''s inner beauty, tries to kill her. Deep into the dark woods, she stumbles upon seven magical dwarves and a young bandit named Jonathan. Together, they strive to survive the Queen''s relentless pursuit and aspire to take back the kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oLxWocqheC8XbXbxqJ3x422j9PW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447273'),
  ('638682928549125243', 'Snow White and 7 Wise Men', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Mario Bianchi, Umberto Galeassi', 'Nino Marino, Luigi Petrini', 'Michela Miti, Franco Bracardi, Aldo Sambrell, Gianfranco D''Angelo, Oreste Lionello, Gianni Magni, Damianne Saint-Clair, Serena Bennato', null, 'The king and the queen conceive Snow White during a sexual relationship in the snow.', 'The king and the queen conceive Snow White during a sexual relationship in the snow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMiM9Zg9JuNy9k1Q7wsyEpwTSQR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222517'),
  ('827509666021151038', 'Snow White and Her 7 Lovers', 1980, 'Adventure', 'Ismael Rodríguez', null, 'Sasha Montenegro, Eric del Castillo, Noé Murayama, Rafael Inclán, Eduardo de la Peña, Luis Manuel Pelayo, Carlos Riquelme, Héctor Suárez', null, 'An undercover policewoman tracks seven escaped convicts to the deserted island where they''ve set up a camp.', 'An undercover policewoman tracks seven escaped convicts to the deserted island where they''ve set up a camp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zypZHfBdnBPuHfNfUbQT5stGKRT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372753'),
  ('96490116343960909', 'Snow White and Russian Red', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Xawery Żuławski, Marcin Nowak, Marian Prokop', 'Xawery Żuławski', 'Borys Szyc, Roma Gąsiorowska, Maria Strzelecka, Sonia Bohosiewicz, Magdalena Czerwińska, Michał Czernecki, Anna Prus, Dorota Masłowska', null, 'An aggressive thug has problems with his girlfriend. Over the course of several chaotic days he walks around the hood, takes drugs and confronts himself with other women.', 'An aggressive thug has problems with his girlfriend. Over the course of several chaotic days he walks around the hood, takes drugs and confronts himself with other women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/crexBWmgSnwHIIVomVMoF9PiY27.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36415'),
  ('688545212011556925', 'Snow White and the Huntsman', 2012, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Drama', 'Rupert Sanders, Cedric Nicolas-Troyan, Greig Fraser', 'Evan Daugherty, John Lee Hancock, Hossein Amini', 'Kristen Stewart, Chris Hemsworth, Charlize Theron, Sam Claflin, Ian McShane, Ray Winstone, Nick Frost, Noah Huntley', 'PG-13', 'After the Evil Queen marries the King, she performs a violent coup in which the King is murdered and his daughter, Snow White, is taken captive. Almost a decade later, a grown Snow White is still in the clutches of the Queen. In order to obtain immortality, The Evil Queen needs the heart of Snow White. After Snow escapes the castle, the Queen sends the Huntsman to find her in the Dark Forest.', 'After the Evil Queen marries the King, she performs a violent coup in which the King is murdered and his daughter, Snow White, is taken captive. Almost a decade later, a grown Snow White is still in the clutches of the Queen. In order to obtain immortality, The Evil Queen needs the heart of Snow White. After Snow escapes the castle, the Queen sends the Huntsman to find her in the Dark Forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HUa5kRubYbnAD5UVpnhTGGgMTW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58595'),
  ('1028803311242914096', 'Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs', 1938, 'Fantasy, Animation, Family', 'David Hand, John Hubley, Ford Beebe', 'Ted Sears, Richard Creedon, Otto Englander', 'Adriana Caselotti, Lucille La Verne, Harry Stockwell, Roy Atwell, Pinto Colvig, Otis Harlan, Scotty Mattraw, Billy Gilbert', 'G', 'A beautiful girl, Snow White, takes refuge in the forest in the house of seven dwarfs to hide from her stepmother, the wicked Queen. The Queen is jealous because she wants to be known as "the fairest in the land," and Snow White''s beauty surpasses her own.', 'A beautiful girl, Snow White, takes refuge in the forest in the house of seven dwarfs to hide from her stepmother, the wicked Queen. The Queen is jealous because she wants to be known as "the fairest in the land," and Snow White''s beauty surpasses her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3VAHfuNb6Z7UiW12iYKANSPBl8m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408'),
  ('441495248024299298', 'Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs', 1955, 'Romance, Family, Fantasy', 'Erich Kobler, Wolf Schwan, Ulrich Schonger', 'Konrad Lustig, Walter Oehmichen', 'Elke Arendt, Addi Adametz, Niels Clausnitzer, Dietrich Thoms, Renate Eichholz, Zita Hitz, Erwin Platzer, Ruth von Zerboni', null, 'Snow White''s mother, the Queen dies when she is born. Her father, the King, remarries a beautiful but vain lady. The new Queen has a magic mirror that she asks every day, who is the fairest one of all? When it answers Snow White, the Queen is furious. Will handsome Prince Charming and the Seven Dwarfs be able to save Snow White from the wicked Queen''s wrath?', 'Snow White''s mother, the Queen dies when she is born. Her father, the King, remarries a beautiful but vain lady. The new Queen has a magic mirror that she asks every day, who is the fairest one of all? When it answers Snow White, the Queen is furious. Will handsome Prince Charming and the Seven Dwarfs be able to save Snow White from the wicked Queen''s wrath?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kioQ1xylyy6ExnlVPn9Nb2tdmqa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132777'),
  ('436326746851273073', 'Snow White and the Three Stooges', 1961, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'Walter Lang, Frank Tashlin, Eli Dunn', 'Noel Langley, Elwood Ullman, Charles Wick', 'Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Joe DeRita, Edson Stroll, Carol Heiss, Patricia Medina, Guy Rolfe, Michael David Lally', 'NR', 'Once upon a time, in the kingdom of Fortunia, a noble king and his lovely young queen lack but one blessing to make their joy complete. The queen gives birth to a daughter named Snow White, but dies soon after. The king mourns her, but in time, he remarries because of the pleading of his people. His new queen is a beautiful, but evil woman who soon becomes jealous of Snow White''s beauty.', 'Once upon a time, in the kingdom of Fortunia, a noble king and his lovely young queen lack but one blessing to make their joy complete. The queen gives birth to a daughter named Snow White, but dies soon after. The king mourns her, but in time, he remarries because of the pleading of his people. His new queen is a beautiful, but evil woman who soon becomes jealous of Snow White''s beauty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kL6N5WKOTWKPbyPzwrDnt30b9lM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30126'),
  ('588961985706212354', 'Snow White: A Tale of Terror', 1997, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Michael Cohn, Mike Southon, Josef Feinermann', 'Tom Szollosi, Deborah Serra', 'Sigourney Weaver, Sam Neill, Monica Keena, Gil Bellows, Brian Glover, David Conrad, Anthony Brophy, Andrew Tiernan', 'R', 'When young Lili''s mother dies in childbirth, her father remarries Lady Claudia, a woman ruled by an evil mirror with the power to make her queen of all living things. After escaping an attempt on her life, Lili finds herself lost in a dark forest, where living happily ever after seems unlikely.', 'When young Lili''s mother dies in childbirth, her father remarries Lady Claudia, a woman ruled by an evil mirror with the power to make her queen of all living things. After escaping an attempt on her life, Lili finds herself lost in a dark forest, where living happily ever after seems unlikely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qoFccaw3SVzIFLRWAacFE3cyiig.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9092'),
  ('1118734084496359993', 'Snow White: The Sequel', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Picha', 'Tony Hendra, Picha', 'Cécile de France, Marie Vincent, Jean-Claude Donda, Jean-Paul Rouve, Gérard Surugue, Benoît Allemane, Marc Alfos, François Barbin', null, 'Prince Charming was supposed to live long and happily with Snow White after kissing her back to life. However the jealous ''good'' fairy decides that she and the prince were meant to be, only the start of a whole series of perversions of various fairy tale characters'' traditional good nature.', 'Prince Charming was supposed to live long and happily with Snow White after kissing her back to life. However the jealous ''good'' fairy decides that she and the prince were meant to be, only the start of a whole series of perversions of various fairy tale characters'' traditional good nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cc6uAFYlACAye0C5hJBSWtuhwB5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52559'),
  ('619187220791706492', 'Snow-White', 1933, 'Animation, Fantasy, Comedy, Music', 'Roland Crandall, Dave Fleischer', null, 'Mae Questel, Cab Calloway', null, 'Trouble starts when the queen''s magic mirror says Betty Boop is fairest.', 'Trouble starts when the queen''s magic mirror says Betty Boop is fairest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zc2dE51FEJ5owav8jwVdXlOBrGX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127409'),
  ('510338516513657297', 'Snow-White and Rose-Red', 1979, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Siegfried Hartmann, Siegfried Mogel', 'Siegfried Hartmann, Margot Beichler', 'Julie Jurištová, Katrin Martin, Pavel Trávníček, Bodo Wolf, Hans-Peter Minetti, Erik S. Klein, Johannes Wieke, Annemone Haase', null, 'In an enchanted forest, the princely brothers Michael and Andreas get lost and are transformed, by a mountain spirit who jealously guards his underground treasure, into animals until the unlikely event of sincere love from a human. The only persons who may be able to give such love are the local commoner sisters Snow-white and Rose-red, who are kind and helpful by nature and stand to harvest unimagined rewards.', 'In an enchanted forest, the princely brothers Michael and Andreas get lost and are transformed, by a mountain spirit who jealously guards his underground treasure, into animals until the unlikely event of sincere love from a human. The only persons who may be able to give such love are the local commoner sisters Snow-white and Rose-red, who are kind and helpful by nature and stand to harvest unimagined rewards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heJ6XaGvntRbtqdMacL1YaVgW70.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13305'),
  ('879667633664495116', 'Snowball', 1995, 'Adventure, Family', 'Maurizio Nichetti, Cristiano Pogany', null, 'Paolo Villaggio, Alessandro Haber, Leo Gullotta, Monica Bellucci, Anna Falchi, Fabiano Vagnarelli, Luis Molteni, Federico Pacifici', null, 'Snowball, a dolphin, gets into trouble when it swallows a bottle with the records of pension payments owed to Billy Bolla, an aged cruise ship entertainer. If the performer cannot quickly catch Snowball and induce him to produce the papers, he will have no retirement.', 'Snowball, a dolphin, gets into trouble when it swallows a bottle with the records of pension payments owed to Billy Bolla, an aged cruise ship entertainer. If the performer cannot quickly catch Snowball and induce him to produce the papers, he will have no retirement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qi1GiFrojWslcIxJBVTkZJXN0qP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167637'),
  ('777012015266706103', 'Snowball Express', 1972, 'Comedy, Family', 'Norman Tokar', 'Don Tait', 'Dean Jones, Nancy Olson, Harry Morgan, Keenan Wynn, Johnny Whitaker, Michael McGreevey, George Lindsey, Kathleen Cody', 'G', 'When John Baxter inherits a ski resort in the Rocky Mountains, he quits his job in New York and moves the family west to run it. Only to find that the place is a wreck. But together they decide to try to fix it up and run it. But Martin Ridgeway, who wants the property, does everything he can to ensure it will fail.', 'When John Baxter inherits a ski resort in the Rocky Mountains, he quits his job in New York and moves the family west to run it. Only to find that the place is a wreck. But together they decide to try to fix it up and run it. But Martin Ridgeway, who wants the property, does everything he can to ensure it will fail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aApbK10fRmHWCEJtnMFfIeTAayl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32140'),
  ('677521434125829473', 'Snowball Fight', 1897, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Louis Lumière', null, null, null, 'Wintertime in Lyon. About a dozen people, men and women, are having a snowball fight in the middle of a tree-lined street. The cyclist coming along the road becomes the target of opportunity. He falls off his bicycle. He''s not hurt, but he rides back the way he came, as the fight continues.', 'Wintertime in Lyon. About a dozen people, men and women, are having a snowball fight in the middle of a tree-lined street. The cyclist coming along the road becomes the target of opportunity. He falls off his bicycle. He''s not hurt, but he rides back the way he came, as the fight continues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ivopBfMhBn4YQbpBvW99RzwXnUd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144391'),
  ('107315852392960935', 'Snowbeast', 1977, 'Horror', 'Herb Wallerstein, Frank Stanley', 'Joseph Stefano', 'Bo Svenson, Sylvia Sidney, Yvette Mimieux, Robert Logan, Clint Walker, Thomas Babson, Annie McEnroe, Victor Raider-Wexler', 'NR', 'A skier and his wife visit a friend''s ski resort during a man beast''s rampage, and must hide from the impending danger.', 'A skier and his wife visit a friend''s ski resort during a man beast''s rampage, and must hide from the impending danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8myZtBJiucZag5yVSCKrfexKIH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49353'),
  ('352541044933160910', 'Snowboard Academy', 1997, 'Comedy', 'John Shepphird, Bruno Philip', 'James Salisko, Rudy Rupak', 'Jim Varney, Corey Haim, Brigitte Nielsen, Joe Flaherty, Andreas Apergis, Paul Hopkins, David DiSalvio, George Spiridakis', 'PG', 'A wacky free-for-all comedy about the riotous rivalry between snobby skiers and knuckle-dragging snowboarders.', 'A wacky free-for-all comedy about the riotous rivalry between snobby skiers and knuckle-dragging snowboarders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTQxsQWKHlxRtd8rJPaqz0x9rj0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29083'),
  ('351723321951275282', 'Snowboarder', 2003, 'Crime, Drama', 'Olias Barco, Damien Morisot', 'Paolo Rota, Olias Barco, Julien Sax', 'Nicolas Duvauchelle, Grégoire Colin, Juliette Goudot, Jean-Philippe Écoffey, Camille de Sablet, Clara Morgane, Mélanie Laurent, Thierry Lhermitte', null, 'Gaspard, un jeune snowboarder talentueux mais peu ambitieux, vit et travaille à l''Alpe d''Huez, dans le magasin de surf de Beshop, un ancien entraîneur professionnel qui l''héberge et l''entraîne en échange de quelques travaux. Mais le rêve de Gaspard, c''est de devenir snowboarder professionnel, tout comme Josh Atterssen, champion charismatique mais imprévisible. Sa vie bascule lorsque ce dernier lui propose de l''entraîner lui-même à Gstaad, en Suisse, et de rejoindre son team. Naïf, n''ayant pas assez confiance en lui, Gaspard accepte l''offre et quitte Beshop sans état d''âme pour retrouver Josh. Une fois à Gstaad, la vie lui semble soudain plus belle et facile. Mais le peu recommandable Josh a un tout autre projet pour lui...', 'Gaspard, un jeune snowboarder talentueux mais peu ambitieux, vit et travaille à l''Alpe d''Huez, dans le magasin de surf de Beshop, un ancien entraîneur professionnel qui l''héberge et l''entraîne en échange de quelques travaux. Mais le rêve de Gaspard, c''est de devenir snowboarder professionnel, tout comme Josh Atterssen, champion charismatique mais imprévisible. Sa vie bascule lorsque ce dernier lui propose de l''entraîner lui-même à Gstaad, en Suisse, et de rejoindre son team. Naïf, n''ayant pas assez confiance en lui, Gaspard accepte l''offre et quitte Beshop sans état d''âme pour retrouver Josh. Une fois à Gstaad, la vie lui semble soudain plus belle et facile. Mais le peu recommandable Josh a un tout autre projet pour lui...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lmwx8yNNU51956OOuiOflvlPKwY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61817'),
  ('1076511881608032801', 'Snowbody Loves Me', 1964, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Maurice Noble', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Waif mouse Jerry, encrusted with snow, peers through a warmly lit window at Tom asleep by the fire in a room full of cheese.', 'Waif mouse Jerry, encrusted with snow, peers through a warmly lit window at Tom asleep by the fire in a room full of cheese.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwNhK0t3vBU8SQn2jR9OwMixJ2V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223035'),
  ('579259366114023595', 'Snowbound: The Jim and Jennifer Stolpa Story', 1994, 'Drama', 'Christian Duguay, Peter F. Woeste, Mike Rohl', 'Jonathan Rintels', 'Neil Patrick Harris, Kelli Williams, Richard Ian Cox, Duncan Fraser, Susan Clark, Michael Gross, Andrew Airlie, Shannon Beaty', null, 'A San Francisco couple (Neil Patrick Harris, Kelli Williams) and their infant son are stranded in the snow-covered Nevada wilderness.', 'A San Francisco couple (Neil Patrick Harris, Kelli Williams) and their infant son are stranded in the snow-covered Nevada wilderness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sLHfBvejZAqRQtQAaptHjKEaGEG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144540'),
  ('1063683823104629859', 'Snowden', 2016, 'Drama, History, Crime, Thriller', 'Oliver Stone, Adam O''Neill, Ben Smith', 'Oliver Stone, Kieran Fitzgerald', 'Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Shailene Woodley, Melissa Leo, Zachary Quinto, Tom Wilkinson, Scott Eastwood, Timothy Olyphant, Ben Schnetzer', 'R', 'CIA employee Edward Snowden leaks thousands of classified documents to the press.', 'CIA employee Edward Snowden leaks thousands of classified documents to the press.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yfK7zxNL63VWfluFuoUaJj5PdNw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:302401'),
  ('20317738415696398', 'Snowdrops and Aces', 1983, 'Comedy, Family', 'Karel Smyczek, Richard Valenta, Zdeněk Tyc', 'Radek John, Ivo Pelant', 'Václav Kopta, Jan Antonín Duchoslav, Michal Suchánek, Radoslav Brzobohatý, Veronika Freimanová, Valentina Thielová, Eva Jeníčková, Pavel Marek', null, 'A quarter century after the release of the original film, this sequel brings us a drama about platonic love, life retrospective and memories. Former schoolmates meet again in the mountains and it turns out they have not changed much. Even though so many years have passed, we can still see the souls of boys and girls we know from the teenage comedy Snowdrops and Aces; kids who participated in that legendary skiing course. Its nostalgic humour gives the film a bitter-sweet touch. Thawing Out follows the lives of the main heroes during a period of great changes. How did they manage to escape the traps and what scars have they suffered? Where did they want to go, how far have they got and what is still in front of them?', 'A quarter century after the release of the original film, this sequel brings us a drama about platonic love, life retrospective and memories. Former schoolmates meet again in the mountains and it turns out they have not changed much. Even though so many years have passed, we can still see the souls of boys and girls we know from the teenage comedy Snowdrops and Aces; kids who participated in that legendary skiing course. Its nostalgic humour gives the film a bitter-sweet touch. Thawing Out follows the lives of the main heroes during a period of great changes. How did they manage to escape the traps and what scars have they suffered? Where did they want to go, how far have they got and what is still in front of them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3KSG00dOSGzAahQNtBs26rZ1pj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25907'),
  ('154800976264473064', 'Snowed in for Christmas', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Jason Bourque, Justin Sebastian', 'Starlett Hill', 'Kayla Wallace, Jeremy Guilbaut, Brendan J. Rowland, Meghan K. Lees, Juliette Habicht, Cassidy Slingsby, Dave Kenneth MacKinnon, Laura Yenga', 'G', 'Kaley, a young Au Pair, finds herself unable to return home for the holidays when a snowstorm derails her plans. In spite of her own disappointment she is determined to teach the girls she watches, alongside their charming Uncle, the magic of Christmas. Will this series of events lead to a perfect Christmas?', 'Kaley, a young Au Pair, finds herself unable to return home for the holidays when a snowstorm derails her plans. In spite of her own disappointment she is determined to teach the girls she watches, alongside their charming Uncle, the magic of Christmas. Will this series of events lead to a perfect Christmas?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3hKZBbf7K5tCqsgWKs5sk1r8Cz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:838184'),
  ('267201468027125714', 'Snowed Inn Christmas', 2017, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'David Franceschetti, Daniella Bonan, Bruce Cook', 'Carley Smale', 'Bethany Joy Lenz, Andrew W. Walker, John B. Lowe, Belinda Montgomery, Jackson Blake, Jefferson Brown, Yollanda Chimbarami, Stephanie Moroz', null, 'Jenna Hudson and Kevin Jenner are polar opposites working for the same online publication in New York City. With both having nowhere they want to be for Christmas, they volunteer for a special writing assignment. After a snowstorm forces their plane to land in none other than Santa Claus, Indiana, the two are placed in a Christmas Wonderland and the focus of their story shifts to saving the historic town inn run by Carol and Christopher Winters. As the two overcome their differences, they also rediscover the magic of Christmas. But with the inn''s fate in jeopardy and the return of someone from Jenna''s past, Carol and Christopher lend a helping hand to bring Jenna and Kevin together.', 'Jenna Hudson and Kevin Jenner are polar opposites working for the same online publication in New York City. With both having nowhere they want to be for Christmas, they volunteer for a special writing assignment. After a snowstorm forces their plane to land in none other than Santa Claus, Indiana, the two are placed in a Christmas Wonderland and the focus of their story shifts to saving the historic town inn run by Carol and Christopher Winters. As the two overcome their differences, they also rediscover the magic of Christmas. But with the inn''s fate in jeopardy and the return of someone from Jenna''s past, Carol and Christopher lend a helping hand to bring Jenna and Kevin together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1GdsUysHya4mdlcZ1ALlBJ3nyqb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492141'),
  ('942485434075048097', 'Snowflake', 2017, 'Action, Fantasy, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Adolfo J. Kolmerer, William James, Konstantin Freyer', 'Arend Remmers', 'Reza Brojerdi, Erkan Acar, Xenia Assenza, David Masterson, Alexander Schubert, Judith Hoersch, Adrian Topol, Antonio Wannek', 'PG-13', 'Hunting down the murderer of their families in an anarchic Berlin of the near future, the outlaws Tan and Javid find themselves trapped in the wicked fairytale of a mysterious screenplay that entangles them in a vicious circle of revenge – apparently all written by a clueless dentist.', 'Hunting down the murderer of their families in an anarchic Berlin of the near future, the outlaws Tan and Javid find themselves trapped in the wicked fairytale of a mysterious screenplay that entangles them in a vicious circle of revenge – apparently all written by a clueless dentist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmcNlnRLm1e3hwrQRr8b1L4myKx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371042'),
  ('639469715590404536', 'Snowglobe', 2007, 'TV Movie, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Ron Lagomarsino, Derick V. Underschultz', 'Garrett Frawley, Brian Turner', 'Christina Milian, Josh Cooke, Erin Karpluk, Lorraine Bracco, Luciana Carro, Ennis Esmer, Ron Canada, Matt Keeslar', null, 'A young woman discovers a Christmas-themed dreamworld inside a magical snowglobe. Angela loves Christmas more than anything. However, her family does not share her love for the holiday at all. When she is about to breakdown because of her family, she receives a snowglobe in the mail. When she opens up the snowglobe, she is transported into the world inside, where Christmas is the heart and soul for everyone who lives there. She discovers she can return to her world by going down a small path in the small forest at the edge of the village, and can return whenever she winds up the snowglobe. After a long set of visits to the globe, she accidentally gets trapped inside.', 'A young woman discovers a Christmas-themed dreamworld inside a magical snowglobe. Angela loves Christmas more than anything. However, her family does not share her love for the holiday at all. When she is about to breakdown because of her family, she receives a snowglobe in the mail. When she opens up the snowglobe, she is transported into the world inside, where Christmas is the heart and soul for everyone who lives there. She discovers she can return to her world by going down a small path in the small forest at the edge of the village, and can return whenever she winds up the snowglobe. After a long set of visits to the globe, she accidentally gets trapped inside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8MCX4KlF8O3cdoSiX1jiUsyVXMp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68591'),
  ('1122173173496170125', 'Snowkissed', 2021, 'Romance, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Paul Suderman, Kerri Webster, Diana Kim', 'Kim Beyer-Johnson', 'Jen Lilley, Chris McNally, Rodrigo Beilfuss, Amy Groening, Jay Koensgen, Rachael McLaren, Michael Cunningham, Kevin McIntyre', 'G', 'A travel-averse journalist chases her dream assignment where she unwillingly finds herself mentoring a handsome B&B owner who wants to be a tour guide.', 'A travel-averse journalist chases her dream assignment where she unwillingly finds herself mentoring a handsome B&B owner who wants to be a tour guide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIuHSfaYy4LDhOcdW6LNf0EZGzR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:775622'),
  ('570199858562547452', 'Snowlidays', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Julien Roux, Joséphine de Meaux', 'Jean-Michel Ribes', 'Joséphine de Meaux, Grégoire Ludig, Gustave Kervern, Thomas Scimeca, Adèle Gillain, Alix Gavoille, Marie-Eve Musy, Magali Rosenzweig', null, 'Wanda''s life has gone awry since she had phlebitis. This mannequin legs is found unemployed. On a holiday in the mountains, she can not ski. Her husband does not understand her anymore. His children either. But her real problem is named: the ski instructor''s syndrome.', 'Wanda''s life has gone awry since she had phlebitis. This mannequin legs is found unemployed. On a holiday in the mountains, she can not ski. Her husband does not understand her anymore. His children either. But her real problem is named: the ski instructor''s syndrome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AZ3CnrgggoBpsnHzFIIyJ3tMUA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568401'),
  ('279669575489845374', 'Snowmageddon', 2011, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Sheldon Wilson, Neil Cervin, Kevin Speckmaier', 'Rudy Thauberger', 'David Cubitt, Laura Harris, Dylan Matzke, Magda Apanowicz, Jeffrey Ballard, Lorne Cardinal, Michael Hogan, Donavon Stinson', 'PG-13', 'An Alaskan town is in danger of destruction by a mystical snow globe that appears on a family''s doorstep, wrapped like a Christmas gift, and causes deadly "natural" disasters in their own town, while simultaneously occurring in the snow globe.', 'An Alaskan town is in danger of destruction by a mystical snow globe that appears on a family''s doorstep, wrapped like a Christmas gift, and causes deadly "natural" disasters in their own town, while simultaneously occurring in the snow globe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCToeT0GjHCEEIGA8n4tJFavYx6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81179'),
  ('651590802827775721', 'Snowman''s Land', 2010, 'Thriller, Comedy, Crime', 'Tomasz Thomson', 'Tomasz Thomson', 'Jürgen Rißmann, Thomas Wodianka, Reiner Schöne, Eva-Katrin Hermann, Waléra Kanischtscheff, Luc Feit, Detlef Bothe', null, 'When the wife of a crime boss is accidentally killed, the hit man who was hired to protect the remote house in which she was living tries to keep her death under wraps. Fearing vengeance from the gangster, he''s soon locked in a fight for survival.', 'When the wife of a crime boss is accidentally killed, the hit man who was hired to protect the remote house in which she was living tries to keep her death under wraps. Fearing vengeance from the gangster, he''s soon locked in a fight for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jR7GDA03M07MxZbOGbT0DOiZ2cT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62684'),
  ('407381339939112967', 'Snowpiercer', 2013, 'Action, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Bong Joon Ho, Hong Kyung-pyo, Jakub Dvorak', 'Bong Joon Ho, Kelly Masterson', 'Chris Evans, Song Kang-ho, Ed Harris, John Hurt, Tilda Swinton, Jamie Bell, Octavia Spencer, Ewen Bremner', 'R', 'In a future where a failed global-warming experiment kills off most life on the planet, a class system evolves aboard the Snowpiercer; a train that travels around the globe via a perpetual-motion engine.', 'In a future where a failed global-warming experiment kills off most life on the planet, a class system evolves aboard the Snowpiercer; a train that travels around the globe via a perpetual-motion engine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kw6YQudA0TMcNmGUGy5XIw7zbnV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110415'),
  ('696154029909578159', 'Snowroller', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Lasse Åberg, Peter Hald, Hanno-Heinz Fuchs', 'Lasse Åberg, Bo Jönsson', 'Lasse Åberg, Jon Skolmen, Cecilia Walton, Eva Millberg, Ingrid Wallin, Björn Granath, Erica Larsson, Oscar Franzén', null, 'Stig-Helmer takes another vacation with his norwegian friend Ole. This time it''s time for a skiing vacation in the Alps. Of course, Stig-Helmer has never learnt downhill skiing, but he attends a ski school. And together they manage to charm two women also on vacation.', 'Stig-Helmer takes another vacation with his norwegian friend Ole. This time it''s time for a skiing vacation in the Alps. Of course, Stig-Helmer has never learnt downhill skiing, but he attends a ski school. And together they manage to charm two women also on vacation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2EnsIGAfIJs7b083yZcw7SWtSgi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19181'),
  ('1130992428057323819', 'Snowtime!', 2015, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'François Brisson, Jean-François Pouliot', 'Normand Canac-Marquis', 'Mariloup Wolfe, Sophie Cadieux, Hélène Bourgeois Leclerc, Nicholas Savard-L''Herbier, Anne Casabonne, Catherine Trudeau, Gildor Roy, André Sauvé', 'PG', 'To amuse themselves during the winter school break, the kids in a small village decide to have a massive snowball fight. Luke and Sophie, both 11 years old, become the leaders of the opposing sides. Sophie and her cohort defend an elaborate snow fort against the assault of Luke’s horde. Whichever side occupies the fort at the end of the winter break, wins. But what starts out as pure youthful fun and enthusiasm deteriorates into a more serious conflict. Joy is restored when all the children decide to attack the fort rather than each other and happily destroy every last bit of the snow fort.', 'To amuse themselves during the winter school break, the kids in a small village decide to have a massive snowball fight. Luke and Sophie, both 11 years old, become the leaders of the opposing sides. Sophie and her cohort defend an elaborate snow fort against the assault of Luke’s horde. Whichever side occupies the fort at the end of the winter break, wins. But what starts out as pure youthful fun and enthusiasm deteriorates into a more serious conflict. Joy is restored when all the children decide to attack the fort rather than each other and happily destroy every last bit of the snow fort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dC1rjdwynUgeZIexSqOUGM3kNpX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366656'),
  ('625244689404046311', 'Snowtown', 2011, 'Crime, Drama', 'Justin Kurzel, Adam Arkapaw', 'Shaun Grant', 'Lucas Pittaway, Daniel Henshall, Louise Harris, Frank Cwertniak, Matthew Howard, Marcus Howard, Anthony Groves, Richard Green', null, 'Based on true events, 16 year-old Jamie falls in with his mother''s new boyfriend and his crowd of self-appointed neighborhood watchmen, a relationship that leads to a spree of torture and murder.', 'Based on true events, 16 year-old Jamie falls in with his mother''s new boyfriend and his crowd of self-appointed neighborhood watchmen, a relationship that leads to a spree of torture and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LW1vPLa8ueVwdOgR8w5xYkSQGv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67748'),
  ('531395771593695148', 'Snowy Road', 2015, 'Drama', 'Lee Na-jeong', 'Yu Bo-ra', 'Kim Hyang-gi, Kim Sae-ron, Kim Yeong-ok, Cho Soo-hyang, Seo Young-joo, Jang Young-nam, Lee Seung-yeon, Lee Hak-ju', null, 'Jong-bun, in her eighties, is one of the last surviving ''Comfort Women'' victims forced into sexual slavery by the Japanese Army during World War II. Back in 1944, at the end of the Japanese occupation in Korea, Jong-bun was a poor but energetic girl while Young-ae was the smart rich clerk''s daughter. One day, Jong-bun gets abducted and finds herself on a train for Manchuria. To her surprise, she also finds Young-ae on the train facing the same fate to become a comfort woman. Jong-bun and Young-ae help each other go through the living hell and as the war comes to an end, they finally escape from the comfort women camp, only to face two different paths of life. Decades later, Jong-bun helps out a teenaged girl who is disoriented in life, reminded of her own painful past.', 'Jong-bun, in her eighties, is one of the last surviving ''Comfort Women'' victims forced into sexual slavery by the Japanese Army during World War II. Back in 1944, at the end of the Japanese occupation in Korea, Jong-bun was a poor but energetic girl while Young-ae was the smart rich clerk''s daughter. One day, Jong-bun gets abducted and finds herself on a train for Manchuria. To her surprise, she also finds Young-ae on the train facing the same fate to become a comfort woman. Jong-bun and Young-ae help each other go through the living hell and as the war comes to an end, they finally escape from the comfort women camp, only to face two different paths of life. Decades later, Jong-bun helps out a teenaged girl who is disoriented in life, reminded of her own painful past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42J0JcA35twGeOSzqw9JJ65cxJ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:439928'),
  ('210439797120167955', 'Snuff', 1976, 'Horror', 'Roberta Findlay, Simon Nuchtern, Michael Findlay', 'Michael Findlay', 'Margarita Amuchástegui, Tina Austin, Ana Carro, Brian Cary, Liliana Fernández Blanco, Michael Findlay, Roberta Findlay, Alfredo Iglesias', 'R', 'The followers of a charismatic cult leader set out to murder a pregnant actress.', 'The followers of a charismatic cult leader set out to murder a pregnant actress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PWyhjQLPmXe4WyAyKoDd39F2O8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49673'),
  ('438185719550936580', 'Snuff 102', 2007, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Mariano Peralta, Sebastián Ciaros', 'Mariano Peralta', 'Yamila Greco, Eduardo Poli, Andrea Alfonso, Silvia Paz, Rodrigo Bianco, Nicolás Blanco, Salvador Haidar, Lucas Delgado', null, 'A young Argentinian reporter is writing an article about snuff films - which depict real torture, rape and murder of people. But seeking the films and those behind them might backfire. She herself is in danger of becoming one of the suffering.', 'A young Argentinian reporter is writing an article about snuff films - which depict real torture, rape and murder of people. But seeking the films and those behind them might backfire. She herself is in danger of becoming one of the suffering.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3NEZY3V4H1dRIq13sd0Wg2LvE9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428863'),
  ('1003759692959296708', 'Snuff Bottle Connection', 1977, 'Action', 'Lily Liu, Richard Tung Chin-Hu', 'Tue Liang-Tee', 'John Liu, Hwang Jang-Lee, Wong Yat-Lung, Yip Fei-Yang, Tsao Chien, Phillip Ko Fai, Hsu Hsia, Roy Horan', null, 'As China and Russia''s governments are talking peace, traitorous agents on both sides seek war. Enter John Liu as a special agent sent to identify who the Russian traitor is, and who his contact is within the walls of the Forbidden City.', 'As China and Russia''s governments are talking peace, traitorous agents on both sides seek war. Enter John Liu as a special agent sent to identify who the Russian traitor is, and who his contact is within the walls of the Forbidden City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mK9cjCwmxe6VV1tEkk9poA1ISvx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75839'),
  ('783770681434132118', 'Snuff Trap', 2004, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Bruno Mattei, Luigi Ciccarese', 'Bruno Mattei, Giovanni Paolucci', 'Carla Solaro, Gabriele Gori, Carlo Mucari, Federica Garuti, Anita Auer, Achille Brugnini, Alberto Ruocco, Valerio Alessandrini', null, 'Michelle lives in Paris with René, who is influential politicians. One morning as Michelle discovers that her 18-year-old daughter Lauren has not come home from a pub tonight. René does not want to involve the police, because he does not want a scandal that could affect his political career negative. They decide instead to hire a private investigator. It turns out that Lauren has been kidnapped to be used by a gang producing snuff. Detective withdraws from the case, however, because he fears for his life and Michelle decides to find their own daughter. The hunt goes by porn swamps in Paris, Amsterdam and Hamburg.', 'Michelle lives in Paris with René, who is influential politicians. One morning as Michelle discovers that her 18-year-old daughter Lauren has not come home from a pub tonight. René does not want to involve the police, because he does not want a scandal that could affect his political career negative. They decide instead to hire a private investigator. It turns out that Lauren has been kidnapped to be used by a gang producing snuff. Detective withdraws from the case, however, because he fears for his life and Michelle decides to find their own daughter. The hunt goes by porn swamps in Paris, Amsterdam and Hamburg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fuBgESO4XTOyxW3Jqq4zvQaEFaa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89223'),
  ('810110154816611938', 'Snuff-Movie', 2005, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Bernard Rose', 'Bernard Rose', 'Jeroen Krabbé, Lisa Enos, Teri Harrison, Alastair Mackenzie, Lyndsey Marshal, Hugo Myatt, Tedy Necula, Joe Reegan', 'R', 'Boris Arkadin is a horror film maker. His pregnant wife was brutally murdered by a Manson-like gang of hippy psychopaths during the 1960s. He becomes a virtual recluse - until years later he directs his own snuff inspired movies. He invites actors to take part in an audition at his country manor house - blurring the lines of what is real and what is fiction.', 'Boris Arkadin is a horror film maker. His pregnant wife was brutally murdered by a Manson-like gang of hippy psychopaths during the 1960s. He becomes a virtual recluse - until years later he directs his own snuff inspired movies. He invites actors to take part in an audition at his country manor house - blurring the lines of what is real and what is fiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nH4u0wP3R9t3G3hH4KFaGEErS4U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22619'),
  ('887599452815580569', 'So Big', 1953, 'Drama, Romance, Western', 'Robert Wise, Ellsworth Fredericks', 'John Twist', 'Jane Wyman, Sterling Hayden, Steve Forrest, Nancy Olson, Elisabeth Fraser, Martha Hyer, Roland Winters, Richard Beymer', 'NR', 'A girl of wealth comes to a Dutch community outside Chicago as a schoolteacher, and while there falls in love with a poor but big-hearted farmer.', 'A girl of wealth comes to a Dutch community outside Chicago as a schoolteacher, and while there falls in love with a poor but big-hearted farmer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3pfburUMlUBavlab2hnr4N7hDdz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68977'),
  ('770800150181403363', 'So Big!', 1932, 'Drama, Romance', 'William A. Wellman, Sidney Hickox', 'John Twist', 'Barbara Stanwyck, George Brent, Dickie Moore, Bette Davis, Mae Madison, Hardie Albright, Alan Hale, Earle Foxe', 'NR', 'A farmer''s widow takes on the land and her late husband''s tempestuous son.', 'A farmer''s widow takes on the land and her late husband''s tempestuous son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41SiOxy1lIRGVOQgL2tzsno0dhA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98536'),
  ('6536012440846229', 'So Can I', 1975, 'Family', 'Mostafa Hajji, Abbas Kiarostami', 'Abbas Kiarostami', 'Ahmad Kiarostami, Kamal Riahi', null, 'Two children watching animals move in an animated film try to imitate their gestures — until they see real birds fly and a real airplane take off.', 'Two children watching animals move in an animated film try to imitate their gestures — until they see real birds fly and a real airplane take off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sZCtlwWkYetgKLv7WlA49l5HS5H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377523'),
