  ('1079207117627686628', 'So Dark the Night', 1946, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Burnett Guffey, Joseph H. Lewis', 'Martin Berkeley, Dwight V. Babcock, Aubrey Wisberg', 'Steven Geray, Micheline Cheirel, Eugene Borden, Ann Codee, Egon Brecher, Helen Freeman, Theodore Gottlieb, Gregory Gaye', 'NR', 'Inspector Cassin, a renowned Paris detective, departs to the country for a much-needed break. There he falls in love with the innkeeper’s daughter, Nanette, who is already betrothed to a local farmer. On the evening of their engagement party, Nanette and the farmer both disappear. Cassin takes up the case immediately to discover what happened to them and who is responsible.', 'Inspector Cassin, a renowned Paris detective, departs to the country for a much-needed break. There he falls in love with the innkeeper’s daughter, Nanette, who is already betrothed to a local farmer. On the evening of their engagement party, Nanette and the farmer both disappear. Cassin takes up the case immediately to discover what happened to them and who is responsible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wqGngbTPCAUyKOZTwseWa61SBVn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40824'),
  ('712993393310289221', 'So Dear to My Heart', 1948, 'Drama, Family, Animation', 'Hamilton Luske, Harold D. Schuster, Winton C. Hoch', 'John Tucker Battle', 'Bobby Driscoll, Luana Patten, Beulah Bondi, Burl Ives, Harry Carey, Raymond Bond, Walter Soderling, Matt Willis', 'NR', 'The tale of Jeremiah Kincaid and his quest to raise his ''champion'' lamb, Danny. Jeremiah''s dream of showing Danny at the Pike County Fair must overcome the obstinate objections of his loving, yet strict, grandmother Granny. Jeremiah''s confidant, Uncle Hiram, is the boy''s steady ally.', 'The tale of Jeremiah Kincaid and his quest to raise his ''champion'' lamb, Danny. Jeremiah''s dream of showing Danny at the Pike County Fair must overcome the obstinate objections of his loving, yet strict, grandmother Granny. Jeremiah''s confidant, Uncle Hiram, is the boy''s steady ally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sWoOc4tkxlTf0i8YYia25sPRinY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29682'),
  ('547677264999646319', 'So ein Millionär hat''s schwer', 1958, 'Comedy', 'Géza von Cziffra', null, 'Peter Alexander, Germaine Damar, Heinz Erhardt, Loni Heuser, Wolfgang Wahl, Brigitte Mira, Ernst Waldbrunn, Fritz Eckhardt', null, 'Edward Collins wants nothing more than to live a modest life. But as a millionaire with a luxurious villa, chauffeur, and everything his heart desires, women are desperately after him. This time, however, Edward wants to play it safe and, together with his devoted butler, Alfons Heinz Erhardt, hatches a plan. The sweet waitress Ninette Germaine Damar, whom he meets by chance, tells Edward that he is completely penniless. Ninette promptly gets him a temporary job as a parking attendant. But that''s only when the complications really begin.', 'Edward Collins wants nothing more than to live a modest life. But as a millionaire with a luxurious villa, chauffeur, and everything his heart desires, women are desperately after him. This time, however, Edward wants to play it safe and, together with his devoted butler, Alfons Heinz Erhardt, hatches a plan. The sweet waitress Ninette Germaine Damar, whom he meets by chance, tells Edward that he is completely penniless. Ninette promptly gets him a temporary job as a parking attendant. But that''s only when the complications really begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ega7BKbEOBAoz0oQ5MlGsgqu9vE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72011'),
  ('801019440570925246', 'So Ends Our Night', 1941, 'War, Drama', 'John Cromwell, William H. Daniels', 'Talbot Jennings', 'Fredric March, Margaret Sullavan, Frances Dee, Glenn Ford, Anna Sten, Erich von Stroheim, Allan Brett, Joseph Cawthorn', null, 'An anti-Nazi refugee on the run and a young Jewish couple race across Europe trying to escape Hitler''s ever powerful influence.', 'An anti-Nazi refugee on the run and a young Jewish couple race across Europe trying to escape Hitler''s ever powerful influence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mcfquwORtst95ii7v61eeq0atT2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218305'),
  ('925484913183547329', 'So Evil My Love', 1948, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Lewis Allen, Mutz Greenbaum, Mark Evans', 'Leonard Spigelgass, Ronald Millar', 'Ray Milland, Ann Todd, Geraldine Fitzgerald, Leo G. Carroll, Raymond Huntley, Martita Hunt, Moira Lister, Raymond Lovell', null, 'In the late 19th century, on board a ship sailing from Jamaica to England, Olivia Harwood, a recent widow, takes on the task of caring for several malaria patients, including Mark Bellis, a mysterious and tormented painter.', 'In the late 19th century, on board a ship sailing from Jamaica to England, Olivia Harwood, a recent widow, takes on the task of caring for several malaria patients, including Mark Bellis, a mysterious and tormented painter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5deCTyYBJLf408jf411Q4fjqD6v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49502'),
  ('715672025183846000', 'So Far So Good', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Roan Johnson, Davide Manca', 'Roan Johnson', 'Alessio Vassallo, Paolo Cioni, Silvia D''Amico, Guglielmo Favilla, Melissa Anna Bartolini, Isabella Ragonese, Marco Teti, Paolo Giommarelli', null, 'It’s the last weekend together for three men and two women who for years have studied and lived in the same house in Pisa. University is over and each of them is about to embark on a new path: some will stay in Pisa, some will return home to their parents, and some will move to another city or even country. That protected period of their life in which infinite opportunities awaited them, is fading away – now is the time for decisions and responsibility: love or a well-paid job? Have a child or wait for better circumstances? Follow your dreams or be happy with whatever comes your way? Once thing is certain: their carefree university days are over and nothing will ever be the same again.', 'It’s the last weekend together for three men and two women who for years have studied and lived in the same house in Pisa. University is over and each of them is about to embark on a new path: some will stay in Pisa, some will return home to their parents, and some will move to another city or even country. That protected period of their life in which infinite opportunities awaited them, is fading away – now is the time for decisions and responsibility: love or a well-paid job? Have a child or wait for better circumstances? Follow your dreams or be happy with whatever comes your way? Once thing is certain: their carefree university days are over and nothing will ever be the same again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1dTSyV6ckzgwKD0vlZZ5pbpGdS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298702'),
  ('295103831825194033', 'So Fine', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Andrew Bergman, Michael Haley, James A. Contner', 'Andrew Bergman', 'Ryan O''Neal, Jack Warden, Mariangela Melato, Richard Kiel, Fred Gwynne, Mike Kellin, David Rounds, Angela Pietropinto', 'R', 'While trying to get his father out of a financial jam, a man comes up with an idea that turns into an unexpected overnight financial fashion success - the bottomless pants.', 'While trying to get his father out of a financial jam, a man comes up with an idea that turns into an unexpected overnight financial fashion success - the bottomless pants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lrFKJ1MksYFDeqik0Fyq61q4LcM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84735'),
  ('29890007175651851', 'So Happy Together', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Éric Toledano, Olivier Nakache, Rémy Chevrin', 'Olivier Nakache, Éric Toledano', 'Vincent Elbaz, Isabelle Carré, François-Xavier Demaison, Audrey Dana, Omar Sy, Joséphine de Meaux, Lionel Abelanski, Max Clavelly', null, 'Famille : Groupe de personnes réunies par des liens de parenté et un fort sentiment de solidarité morale et matérielle. Quand Alain a épousé Nathalie, il ne savait pas qu''il épouserait aussi sa famille. Ce samedi, comme toutes les semaines, ils sont invités à dîner chez son beau-frère, Jean-Pierre à Créteil. C''est vrai, Alain en a marre de ces dîners familiaux, mais il ne sait pas encore ce qui l''attend véritablement ce soir-là... Ni les jours qui suivent', 'Famille : Groupe de personnes réunies par des liens de parenté et un fort sentiment de solidarité morale et matérielle. Quand Alain a épousé Nathalie, il ne savait pas qu''il épouserait aussi sa famille. Ce samedi, comme toutes les semaines, ils sont invités à dîner chez son beau-frère, Jean-Pierre à Créteil. C''est vrai, Alain en a marre de ces dîners familiaux, mais il ne sait pas encore ce qui l''attend véritablement ce soir-là... Ni les jours qui suivent', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mR6ItN0WEGnpPmM3xFcgHkTypQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19268'),
  ('354476952726819785', 'So Hard to Forget', 2010, 'Drama', 'Heloísa Passos, Malu De Martino', 'José de Carvalho, Daniel Guimarães, Sílvia Lourenço', 'Ana Paula Arósio, Murilo Rosa, Natália Lage, Arieta Corrêa, Bianca Comparato, Pierre Baitelli, Regina Sampaio, Marília Medina', null, 'Julia is a 35-year-old English Literature teacher struggling with depression as she tries to get her life back together again after her long, intense love affair with Antonia. Feeling totally abandoned after she and her enigmatic girlfriend broke up, Julia is thrown into a desperate, painful process. Her life and her values have been tinged with unbearable melancholy and her life''s measure seems reduced to out-of-focus fragments of her memories. Her inner turmoil and conflicts hamper a process now made necessary - that of readapting to her new life. It is impossible for her to disguise her pain when she attempts to narrate emotions.', 'Julia is a 35-year-old English Literature teacher struggling with depression as she tries to get her life back together again after her long, intense love affair with Antonia. Feeling totally abandoned after she and her enigmatic girlfriend broke up, Julia is thrown into a desperate, painful process. Her life and her values have been tinged with unbearable melancholy and her life''s measure seems reduced to out-of-focus fragments of her memories. Her inner turmoil and conflicts hamper a process now made necessary - that of readapting to her new life. It is impossible for her to disguise her pain when she attempts to narrate emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Klv662eqPpXpxVSbSvMYsingNf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73976'),
  ('57600713323495338', 'So Help Me God', 2018, 'Documentary, Thriller, Crime', 'Jean Libon, Yves Hinant, Didier Hill-Derive', null, 'Anne Gruwez, David Derumier, Serge Graide, Marc Slavic, Eddy Wilmet', null, 'Some 20 years ago, two sex workers were murdered in an upper-class Brussels neighborhood. Celebrated Belgian magistrate Anne Gurwez decides to revisit this cold case, pouring over the evidence with the use of new technologies and tracking down then-suspects.', 'Some 20 years ago, two sex workers were murdered in an upper-class Brussels neighborhood. Celebrated Belgian magistrate Anne Gurwez decides to revisit this cold case, pouring over the evidence with the use of new technologies and tracking down then-suspects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYQQYf3gHtxvBmDA20RpPynWNxF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473325'),
  ('747422615659888216', 'So I Married an Axe Murderer', 1993, 'Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Thomas Schlamme, Julio Macat, Bud Davis', 'Robbie Fox', 'Mike Myers, Nancy Travis, Anthony LaPaglia, Amanda Plummer, Brenda Fricker, Matt Doherty, Charles Grodin, Phil Hartman', 'PG-13', 'Just after a bad breakup, Charlie MacKenzie falls for lovely butcher Harriet Michaels and introduces her to his parents. But, as voracious consumers of sensational tabloids, his parents soon come to suspect that Harriet is actually a notorious serial killer -- "Mrs. X" -- wanted in connection with a string of bizarre honeymoon killings. Thinking his parents foolish, Charlie proposes to Harriet. But while on his honeymoon with her, he begins to fear they were right.', 'Just after a bad breakup, Charlie MacKenzie falls for lovely butcher Harriet Michaels and introduces her to his parents. But, as voracious consumers of sensational tabloids, his parents soon come to suspect that Harriet is actually a notorious serial killer -- "Mrs. X" -- wanted in connection with a string of bizarre honeymoon killings. Thinking his parents foolish, Charlie proposes to Harriet. But while on his honeymoon with her, he begins to fear they were right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQlpQDKDADKlgqfMs1E191ofDJU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10442'),
  ('366361349018464218', 'So In Love', 1964, 'Music, Comedy', 'Ettore Maria Fizzarotti, Aldo Grimaldi, Stelvio Massi', 'Bruno Corbucci, Giovanni Grimaldi', 'Gianni Morandi, Laura Efrikian, Nino Taranto, Enrico Viarisio, Margaret Lee, Dolores Palumbo, Carlo Taranto, Gino Bramieri', null, 'During his military service, the young singer Gianni Traimonti falls in love with Carla, the marshal''s daughter.', 'During his military service, the young singer Gianni Traimonti falls in love with Carla, the marshal''s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/psIEe6STcQlzQ3inWqi6vT3DUFO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68056'),
  ('797880248371467380', 'So Is This', 1982, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Michael Snow', 'Michael Snow', null, null, 'English and French words flash individually over a black background.', 'English and French words flash individually over a black background.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akzK5ItRiyW4PwZpiYRiLELMHs0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136762'),
  ('334839020744706744', 'So Long at the Fair', 1950, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Antony Darnborough, Terence Fisher, Reginald H. Wyer', 'Hugh Mills, Anthony Thorne', 'Jean Simmons, Dirk Bogarde, David Tomlinson, Marcel Poncin, Cathleen Nesbitt, Honor Blackman, Zena Marshall, André Morell', 'NR', 'Vicky Barton and her brother Johnny travel from Naples to visit the 1889 Paris Exhibition. They both sleep in seperate rooms in their hotel. When the she gets up in the morning she finds her brother and his room have disappeared and no one will even acknowledge that he was ever there. Now Vicky must find out what exactly happened to her brother.', 'Vicky Barton and her brother Johnny travel from Naples to visit the 1889 Paris Exhibition. They both sleep in seperate rooms in their hotel. When the she gets up in the morning she finds her brother and his room have disappeared and no one will even acknowledge that he was ever there. Now Vicky must find out what exactly happened to her brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4UYl84foEkIXXdG6v4849XUzO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67411'),
  ('1062700434533965021', 'So Long Billie', 2020, 'Drama', 'Anna Falguères, John Shank, Florian Berutti', 'Anna Falguères, John Shank', 'Aliocha Schneider, Garance Marillier, Vincent Rottiers, Siham Laroussi, Auguste Wilhelm, Judith Williquet, Tino Azzopardo, Sarah Bertalmio', null, 'Victor and his little brother Jimmy manage to get by in an environment where their romantic misfortunes seem to be never-ending. But the arrival of Billie and her unbridled romanticism will shake both of the boys'' beliefs to the core.', 'Victor and his little brother Jimmy manage to get by in an environment where their romantic misfortunes seem to be never-ending. But the arrival of Billie and her unbridled romanticism will shake both of the boys'' beliefs to the core.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1pnz1tiHQjKgIDKSvpGWrh4hOx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:621731'),
  ('384747290623068785', 'So Long Daddy, See You in Hell', 2022, 'Drama', 'Christopher Roth, Lydia Richter', 'Jeanne Tremsal, Christopher Roth', 'Clemens Schick, Jana McKinnon, Leo Altaras, Hanns Zischler, Aenne Schwarz, Ina Paule Klink, Anne-Marie Lux, Stefanie Früchtenicht', null, 'Fourteen-year-old Jeanne has lived in a farm commune since she was two years old. Her mother and father live in city communes and rarely visit. This is one of the commandments given by Otto, who rules the commune: children are to grow up without parents. Knowing nothing else, Jeanne enjoys her outdoor life, surrounded by lots of other children, until she falls in love with 16-year-old Jean and her childhood paradise begins to fall apart.', 'Fourteen-year-old Jeanne has lived in a farm commune since she was two years old. Her mother and father live in city communes and rarely visit. This is one of the commandments given by Otto, who rules the commune: children are to grow up without parents. Knowing nothing else, Jeanne enjoys her outdoor life, surrounded by lots of other children, until she falls in love with 16-year-old Jean and her childhood paradise begins to fall apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2G4SaLZ09QojCaOROyXAMNtdoL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:979846'),
  ('292261113188077361', 'So Long Enthusiasm', 2017, 'Drama', 'Vladimir Durán, Julián Ledesma', 'Vladimir Durán, Sacha Amaral', 'Miranda Castiglione, Laila Maltz, Mariel Fernández, Martina Juncadella, Verónica Llinás, Vladimir Durán, Lucas Besasso, Rosario Bléfari', null, 'Ten-year-old Axel lives with his mother and three sisters in a flat in Buenos Aires. They’d be a perfectly normal family if only the mother weren''t imprisoned in one of the rooms.', 'Ten-year-old Axel lives with his mother and three sisters in a flat in Buenos Aires. They’d be a perfectly normal family if only the mother weren''t imprisoned in one of the rooms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQvk6rYFxHE6MXmwzf6fRlsYlQe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:439512'),
  ('848669416263009342', 'So Long Letty', 1929, 'Comedy, Music', 'Lloyd Bacon, James Van Trees, Louis Silvers', 'Robert Lord', 'Charlotte Greenwood, Claude Gillingwater, Grant Withers, Patsy Ruth Miller, Bert Roach, Marion Byron, Helen Foster, Hallam Cooley', null, 'Uncle Claude goes on vacation with his granddaughters and meets and dislikes boisterous Letty. When he finds nephew Tommy, he mistakes Grace for his wife, unaware that he is married to Letty. To get a check from Uncle Claude, the two couples switch spouses.', 'Uncle Claude goes on vacation with his granddaughters and meets and dislikes boisterous Letty. When he finds nephew Tommy, he mistakes Grace for his wife, unaware that he is married to Letty. To get a check from Uncle Claude, the two couples switch spouses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMV5jaSer2lxGFdAkQhBKvBok22.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130813'),
  ('624009314431632289', 'So Long Mr. Chumps', 1941, 'Comedy', 'Jules White', 'Clyde Bruckman, Felix Adler', 'Curly Howard, Larry Fine, Moe Howard, Dorothy Appleby, Bruce Bennett, Kit Guard, Bud Jamison, Sam Lufkin', 'NR', 'The stooges are street cleaners who find some valuable bonds and return them to their owner. The man is so grateful that he offers them a big reward if they can find an honest man with executive ability. Their search leads them to a woman who''s fiancée is honest, but he''s in jail. The boys decide to commit a crime so they can go behind bars to find him. In prison the boys locate the man and help him escape, only to find out that their benefactor is a con man and on the way himself to the slammer.', 'The stooges are street cleaners who find some valuable bonds and return them to their owner. The man is so grateful that he offers them a big reward if they can find an honest man with executive ability. Their search leads them to a woman who''s fiancée is honest, but he''s in jail. The boys decide to commit a crime so they can go behind bars to find him. In prison the boys locate the man and help him escape, only to find out that their benefactor is a con man and on the way himself to the slammer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8bhqhoutLfbkW3UnwMiIUmLaV1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115989'),
  ('412033531156394191', 'So Long, My Son', 2019, 'Drama', 'Wang Xiaoshuai, Kim Hyun-seok', 'Wang Xiaoshuai, Mei Ah', 'Wang Jingchun, Yong Mei, Qi Xi, Du Jiang, Ai Liya, Li Jingjing, Xu Cheng, Roy Wang', null, 'Two married couples adjust to the vast social and economic changes taking place in China from the 1980s to the present.', 'Two married couples adjust to the vast social and economic changes taking place in China from the 1980s to the present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGTDkdY7wFP2lIC0aqC1fjNIhhV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493899'),
  ('912292430574734545', 'So Long, Stooge', 1983, 'Drama, Crime', 'Claude Berri, Bruno Nuytten, Xavier Castano', 'Claude Berri, Alain Page', 'Coluche, Agnès Soral, Richard Anconina, Mahmoud Zemmouri, Philippe Léotard, Mohamed Ben Smail, Albert Dray, Annie Kerani', null, 'In the 18th Arrondissement of Paris, Lambert, an aloof garage manager working the night shift at a petrol station spends his time drinking on the job, content in his own company. One night, Bensoussan, a small-time drug pusher in dire straits falls in on a stolen moped pretending to need a spark plug. The two men develop an unlikely friendship.', 'In the 18th Arrondissement of Paris, Lambert, an aloof garage manager working the night shift at a petrol station spends his time drinking on the job, content in his own company. One night, Bensoussan, a small-time drug pusher in dire straits falls in on a stolen moped pretending to need a spark plug. The two men develop an unlikely friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1D9o6nZDPhB0utyahu5WiSlKMLl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58833'),
  ('364782517337765631', 'So Much for So Little', 1949, 'Documentary, Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', 'Chuck Jones, Friz Freleng', 'Mel Blanc, Frank Graham', 'NR', 'Little Johnny Jones, to be born in the next year, is shown growing to a ripe, healthy old age, thanks to the efforts of his local public health officers. But without them, he might be one of the 5% or so that dies in the first year. The price for the public health service: about 3 cents a week. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2005.', 'Little Johnny Jones, to be born in the next year, is shown growing to a ripe, healthy old age, thanks to the efforts of his local public health officers. But without them, he might be one of the 5% or so that dies in the first year. The price for the public health service: about 3 cents a week. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2005.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Ke6sP8LNRDxvJFPXo4ibYqHuuT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140693'),
  ('8256123509557578', 'So Much Love to Give', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Adriana Vior, Agostina Ravazzola, Paula Kosoy', 'Adrián Suar, Marcos Carnevale', 'Adrián Suar, Soledad Villamil, Gabriela Toscano, Alan Sabbagh, Darío Barassi, Magela Zanotta, Betiana Blum, Agustina Benavides', null, 'A bigamist with one family in Buenos Aires and the other in Mar del Plata sees his life turned upside down when his wives discover what he has hidden from them for so many years and unite to take revenge.', 'A bigamist with one family in Buenos Aires and the other in Mar del Plata sees his life turned upside down when his wives discover what he has hidden from them for so many years and unite to take revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSwCLbElGgz7HzWEHwnSfQtP2OC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661677'),
  ('994666724299411278', 'So Much Water', 2013, 'Drama', 'Ana Guevara, Leticia Jorge, María Secco', 'Ana Guevara, Leticia Jorge', 'Malú Chouza, Néstor Guzzini, Joaquín Castiglioni, Sofía Azambuya, Andrés Zunini, Romina Rocca, Valentino Muffolini', null, 'A family vacation is bogged down by unrelenting rain, as a teenage girl and her divorced father try to find common ground.', 'A family vacation is bogged down by unrelenting rain, as a teenage girl and her divorced father try to find common ground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85EBjY1iMGTIsVXdDGPhiVdrQuY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167935'),
  ('540675945558252545', 'So My Grandma''s a Lesbian!', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ángeles Reiné, José Luis Alcaine, Andrés Santana', 'Ángeles Reiné', 'Rosa María Sardà, Verónica Forqué, Ingrid García Jonsson, David Verdaguer, Candela Peña, Mónica López, Pol Monen, Álex O''Dogherty', 'NR', 'Eva, a young and promising Spanish lawyer based in Edinburgh, sees her wedding plans with the heir to an important and ultra-conservative Scottish family in jeopardy when she learns that her grandmother, Sofía, has decided to marry…', 'Eva, a young and promising Spanish lawyer based in Edinburgh, sees her wedding plans with the heir to an important and ultra-conservative Scottish family in jeopardy when she learns that her grandmother, Sofía, has decided to marry…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrAauv4Y3oPocyr3ZFY8TO2XhKB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587970'),
  ('805871059329503764', 'So Proudly We Hail', 1943, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Mark Sandrich, Charles Lang, Clem Jones', 'Allan Scott', 'Claudette Colbert, Paulette Goddard, Veronica Lake, George Reeves, Barbara Britton, Walter Abel, Sonny Tufts, Mary Servoss', 'NR', 'During the start of the Pacific campaign in World War II, Lieutenant Janet Davidson is the head of a group of U.S. military nurses who are trapped behind enemy lines in the Philippines. Davidson tries to keep up the spirits of her staff, which includes Lieutenants Joan O''Doul and Olivia D''Arcy. They all seek to maintain a sense of normal life, including dating, while under constant danger as they tend to wounded soldiers.', 'During the start of the Pacific campaign in World War II, Lieutenant Janet Davidson is the head of a group of U.S. military nurses who are trapped behind enemy lines in the Philippines. Davidson tries to keep up the spirits of her staff, which includes Lieutenants Joan O''Doul and Olivia D''Arcy. They all seek to maintain a sense of normal life, including dating, while under constant danger as they tend to wounded soldiers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1HELEee7lRd1ul37F4tQCRbGOiX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150778'),
  ('296058146176669729', 'So Sad About Gloria', 1973, 'Thriller, Horror, Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Harry Thomason, Robert Dracup, James W. Roberson', 'Marshall Riggan', 'Lori Saunders, Dean Jagger, Robert Ginnaven, Lou Hoffman, Seymour Trietman, Linda Wyse, Joe Barone, John Brown', null, 'A young woman just released from a mental hospital moves back in with her family. However, she is soon troubled by disturbing visions in which she commits a series of axe murders.', 'A young woman just released from a mental hospital moves back in with her family. However, she is soon troubled by disturbing visions in which she commits a series of axe murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/riNgbXWU4HQM9JxNjqJn4rkWkVE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105701'),
  ('791141624725309970', 'So Sweet, So Dead', 1972, 'Crime, Drama, Horror, Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'Roberto Bianchi Montero, Fausto Rossi', 'Italo Fasan', 'Farley Granger, Sylva Koscina, Silvano Tranquilli, Annabella Incontrera, Chris Avram, Sandro Pizzochero, Krista Nell, Angela Covello', 'R', 'A serial killer is on the loose. His victims are unfaithful wives and he always leaves compromising photographs at the crime scene.', 'A serial killer is on the loose. His victims are unfaithful wives and he always leaves compromising photographs at the crime scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/od9gwogLBdCF1lPInjn034Gmj9h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105114'),
  ('566940413280724125', 'So Sweet... So Perverse', 1969, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Umberto Lenzi, Guglielmo Mancori, Fulvio Barresi', 'Ernesto Gastaldi', 'Carroll Baker, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Erika Blanc, Horst Frank, Helga Liné, Ermelinda De Felice, Giovanni Di Benedetto, Irio Fantini', null, 'An industrialist''s affair with a troubled woman entangles him in a dangerous situation with her abusive boyfriend. His glamorous life spirals into unexpected peril.', 'An industrialist''s affair with a troubled woman entangles him in a dangerous situation with her abusive boyfriend. His glamorous life spirals into unexpected peril.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eE6iMygmNuMCyGZXbtvZLanN2PS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75958'),
  ('1100827096984879196', 'So This Is Harris!', 1933, 'Music, Comedy', 'Mark Sandrich', null, 'Phil Harris, Walter Catlett, Helen Collins, June Brewster, James Finlayson', 'NR', 'The film is a series of comical musical numbers and skits following Phil Harris around, starting with him performing at the Cocoanut Grove nightclub, which is listened to by Dorothy on the radio whose home-brewing husband Walter hates Harris. The action then moves to the country club where Walter unknowingly encounters Harris while being aggravated by his music. Walter then pretends to be Phil to meet a woman while Harris "entertains" her friend, Dorothy. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with Library of Congress Motion Picture, Broadcasting, and Recorded Sound Division, in 2012.', 'The film is a series of comical musical numbers and skits following Phil Harris around, starting with him performing at the Cocoanut Grove nightclub, which is listened to by Dorothy on the radio whose home-brewing husband Walter hates Harris. The action then moves to the country club where Walter unknowingly encounters Harris while being aggravated by his music. Walter then pretends to be Phil to meet a woman while Harris "entertains" her friend, Dorothy. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with Library of Congress Motion Picture, Broadcasting, and Recorded Sound Division, in 2012.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twrmZkTn0RWf4ALmKNwnoXGVguI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233638'),
  ('694696773863678236', 'So This Is Love', 1928, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Frank Capra, Ray June', 'Elmer Harris, Rex Taylor', 'Shirley Mason, William Collier Jr., Johnnie Walker, Ernie Adams, Carl Gerard, William H. Strauss, Jean Laverty', null, 'So This is Love? was another early Frank Capra production for fledgling Columbia Pictures. The hero, dress designer Jerry McGuire (William Collier Jr.), is tired of being considered a wimp. After business hours, Jerry secretly takes boxing lessons, enabling him to knock the stuffings out of his burly rival Spike Mullins (Johnnie Walker). Jerry''s newfound pugilistic skills wins him the affections of store clerk Hilda Jensen (Shirley Mason), who''s just car-razy about "cave men." Filmed in a fast three weeks, So This is Love? was completed before Frank Capra''s Matinee Idol but released afterward. Leading lady Shirley Mason was the sister of Viola Dana, who starred in Capra''s initial Columbia effort, That Certain Thing.', 'So This is Love? was another early Frank Capra production for fledgling Columbia Pictures. The hero, dress designer Jerry McGuire (William Collier Jr.), is tired of being considered a wimp. After business hours, Jerry secretly takes boxing lessons, enabling him to knock the stuffings out of his burly rival Spike Mullins (Johnnie Walker). Jerry''s newfound pugilistic skills wins him the affections of store clerk Hilda Jensen (Shirley Mason), who''s just car-razy about "cave men." Filmed in a fast three weeks, So This is Love? was completed before Frank Capra''s Matinee Idol but released afterward. Leading lady Shirley Mason was the sister of Viola Dana, who starred in Capra''s initial Columbia effort, That Certain Thing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3VI2Nu7aYzDzCXrFBbT6FjvqD4i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438413'),
  ('1000600702529449106', 'So This Is Paris', 1926, 'Comedy', 'Ernst Lubitsch, George Hippard, Ernst Laemmle', null, 'Monte Blue, Patsy Ruth Miller, Lilyan Tashman, George Beranger, Max Barwyn, Sidney D''Albrook, Dot Farley, Myrna Loy', 'NR', 'Paul and Suzanne Giraud are happily married and living in a quiet neighborhood. When Suzanne notices that their new neighbors are expressive dancers in revealing outfits, she demands Paul speak to them about their lack of morality. Paul discovers that the woman is Georgette Lalle, an old flame.', 'Paul and Suzanne Giraud are happily married and living in a quiet neighborhood. When Suzanne notices that their new neighbors are expressive dancers in revealing outfits, she demands Paul speak to them about their lack of morality. Paul discovers that the woman is Georgette Lalle, an old flame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVcYRrzmA95SIlPVd1RGGrd17XA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67319'),
  ('186484575997818045', 'So tutto di te', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Roberto Lipari', 'Roberto Lipari', 'Roberto Lipari, Leo Gullotta, Sergio Friscia, Roberta Riganò, Barbara Tabita, Massimo Cagnina, Andrea Pisani, Mario Biondi', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ruzAq8iqvTZo7os94AlROjrnxDH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1148714'),
  ('780383555184276758', 'So Undercover', 2012, 'Action, Comedy', 'Tom Vaughan, Denis Lenoir, Richard Cowan', 'Allan Loeb, Steven Pearl', 'Miley Cyrus, Jeremy Piven, Mike O''Malley, Joshua Bowman, Lauren McKnight, Kelly Osbourne, Eloise Mumford, Megan Park', 'PG-13', 'When the FBI hires her to go undercover at a college sorority, Molly Morris must transform herself from a tough, streetwise private investigator to a refined, sophisticated university girl to help protect the daughter of a one-time Mobster. With several suspects on her list, Molly unexpectedly discovers that not everyone is who they appear to be, including herself.', 'When the FBI hires her to go undercover at a college sorority, Molly Morris must transform herself from a tough, streetwise private investigator to a refined, sophisticated university girl to help protect the daughter of a one-time Mobster. With several suspects on her list, Molly unexpectedly discovers that not everyone is who they appear to be, including herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abR6e0FaWwwcEJEM4PY5VvjwBr1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93837'),
  ('1071308830159267179', 'So viel Zeit', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Philipp Kadelbach', 'Malte Welding', 'Jan Josef Liefers, Jürgen Vogel, Armin Rohde, Matthias Bundschuh, Jeanette Hain, Richy Müller, André Hennicke, Alwara Höfels', null, 'Five old friends have to prove themselves one last time. 30 years after the hopeful young band Bochums Steine have separated after a disastrous live performance, fatally ill Rainer tries to re-activate his old cronies', 'Five old friends have to prove themselves one last time. 30 years after the hopeful young band Bochums Steine have separated after a disastrous live performance, fatally ill Rainer tries to re-activate his old cronies', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jq5zDdfhBKkeQYyypOL221Nny1o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454681'),
  ('801631124186725000', 'So Well Remembered', 1947, 'Romance, Drama', 'Edward Dmytryk, Roy Goddard, Denis O''Dell', 'John Paxton', 'John Mills, Martha Scott, Patricia Roc, Trevor Howard, Richard Carlson, Reginald Tate, Beatrice Varley, Frederick Leister', null, 'A mill-owner''s ambitious daughter almost ruins her husband''s political career.', 'A mill-owner''s ambitious daughter almost ruins her husband''s political career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ijfEv3QBA5CYwhCa5bLYJ6qQ7d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254259'),
  ('630704976915762418', 'So You Think You''re Not Guilty', 1950, 'Comedy', 'Richard L. Bare, Allen G. Siegler', 'Richard L. Bare', 'George O''Hanlon, Phyllis Coates, Douglas Fowley, Don C. Harvey, Fred Kelsey, Kenner G. Kemp, Nolan Leary, Frank Marlowe', null, 'Joe McDoakes pleads "not guilty" to a traffic violation but is convicted anyway. Handling this setback in his usual manner, the two-dollar fine quickly pyramids to a 10-year jail sentence.', 'Joe McDoakes pleads "not guilty" to a traffic violation but is convicted anyway. Handling this setback in his usual manner, the two-dollar fine quickly pyramids to a 10-year jail sentence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dI6Piyk4V0JnKaEyHOyqRZ5Cfnh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150500'),
  ('932035345061942470', 'So You Want to Be a Detective', 1948, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Richard L. Bare, Wesley Anderson', 'Richard L. Bare', 'George O''Hanlon, Art Gilmore, Lila Leeds, Kit Guard', null, 'Joe McDoakes imagines himself as a private detective on a murder case. Throughout the film, he spars verbally with narrator Art Gilmore.', 'Joe McDoakes imagines himself as a private detective on a murder case. Throughout the film, he spars verbally with narrator Art Gilmore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPOuWO6A3BoHRQd6mHG6NFgTRTU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139726'),
  ('1118622814556885237', 'So Young', 2013, 'Romance, Drama', 'Vicky Zhao, Ran Li, Zhang Bowei', 'Qiang Li', 'Yang Zishan, Bao Bei''er, Maggie Jiang, Ryan Zheng, Han Geng, Jiao Gang, Mi Dan, Cui Wenlu', null, 'Although new friendships and new love await her, a college freshman discovers that university life is not as simple as she had hoped.', 'Although new friendships and new love await her, a college freshman discovers that university life is not as simple as she had hoped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6o4AfophJBHV9mC7w7eYXyMMnh1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191421'),
  ('486235346158831626', 'So Young 2: Never Gone', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Zhou Tuo Ru', 'Yu Pan, Zhou Tuo Ru', 'Kris Wu, Liu Yifei, Jin Shijia, Li Meng, Li Qin, Qiao Renliang, Chen Guo, Zhang Xiao''ang', null, 'A wealthy young man pursues a young woman of modest means, but circumstances often separate them as the years pass.', 'A wealthy young man pursues a young woman of modest means, but circumstances often separate them as the years pass.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6sFFzLjItKXdOQrSufN2Yh7cafd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:405755'),
  ('797746472844174007', 'So Young, So Bad', 1950, 'Drama', 'Bernard Vorhaus, Don Malkames, Edgar G. Ulmer', 'Jean Rouverol, Bernard Vorhaus', 'Paul Henreid, Catherine McLeod, Grace Coppin, Cecil Clovelly, Anne Francis, Rita Moreno, Anne Jackson, Enid Rudd', 'NR', 'Idealistic and naive Dr. Jason arrives at a school for delinquent girls and immediately begins to try to make a difference in the lives of some of the inmates. Oblivious to the sadistic treatment of the girls by the matrons, it takes a rebellious girl named Loretta to open his eyes. Assisted by a female staff member, Jason finally gets proof of the abuse and threatens the head of the school with exposure unless he is given full rein to run things.', 'Idealistic and naive Dr. Jason arrives at a school for delinquent girls and immediately begins to try to make a difference in the lives of some of the inmates. Oblivious to the sadistic treatment of the girls by the matrons, it takes a rebellious girl named Loretta to open his eyes. Assisted by a female staff member, Jason finally gets proof of the abuse and threatens the head of the school with exposure unless he is given full rein to run things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4qcuEXe0wA8m4vCVtaVym3b315g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47568'),
  ('83355273506956845', 'So Young, So Lovely, So Vicious...', 1975, 'Drama', 'Silvio Amadio, Antonio Maccoppi', 'Silvio Amadio', 'Gloria Guida, Dagmar Lassander, Silvano Tranquilli, Fred Robsahm, Dana Ghia, Rita Orlando, Flavio Sorrentino', null, 'Angela is not happy about her daddy''s choice for a new wife and does everything she can to destroy her stepmother-to-be.', 'Angela is not happy about her daddy''s choice for a new wife and does everything she can to destroy her stepmother-to-be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s26KnWNxzmQdy2nCw8TGmjBmP9D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81827'),
  ('776987366385255730', 'So, What''s Your Price?', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Olallo Rubio', null, null, null, '¿Y Tú, Cuánto Cuestas? (So, what''s your price?), it seems to be the constant over this excellent documentary work, performed by Olallo Rubio, a young Mexican director. The movie shows two faces of the same issue: the American influence in the Mexican culture. you will remain thinking after the movie ends. Everything has a price? Everybody has a price?, so, What''s your price?. Strong and ancient differences between two distant-neighbor countries are discussed under each opinion. Both Mexican and American-common persons give its particular point of view about the other, but also about themselves. Developed with a extremely low budget, but with inventive and imagination, this movie shows many of the key aspects in the Mexican-American relationship. However, the movie is not just a compilation of statistics, the producers manage to make it fun too. That''s one of it''s good points. But never the only one. Well developed, absolutely recommendable.', '¿Y Tú, Cuánto Cuestas? (So, what''s your price?), it seems to be the constant over this excellent documentary work, performed by Olallo Rubio, a young Mexican director. The movie shows two faces of the same issue: the American influence in the Mexican culture. you will remain thinking after the movie ends. Everything has a price? Everybody has a price?, so, What''s your price?. Strong and ancient differences between two distant-neighbor countries are discussed under each opinion. Both Mexican and American-common persons give its particular point of view about the other, but also about themselves. Developed with a extremely low budget, but with inventive and imagination, this movie shows many of the key aspects in the Mexican-American relationship. However, the movie is not just a compilation of statistics, the producers manage to make it fun too. That''s one of it''s good points. But never the only one. Well developed, absolutely recommendable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdjbqn7v8oSTvFbOoTEqbtGOkcA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112295'),
  ('1050713145078315484', 'So''s Your Aunt Emma!', 1942, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jean Yarbrough', 'Edmond Kelso, George Bricker', 'Zasu Pitts, Roger Pryor, Warren Hymer, Douglas Fowley, Gwen Kenyon, Elizabeth Russell, Tristram Coffin, Dick Elliott', 'NR', 'A dizzy old spinster gets involved in the boxing racket and gangland murders.', 'A dizzy old spinster gets involved in the boxing racket and gangland murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMciceyHl085szsSMUuSxDPJ7yl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158606'),
  ('1087424997334734332', 'Soaked in Bleach', 2015, 'Music, Drama, Documentary, Crime', 'Benjamin Statler, Ben Kutchins', 'Donnie Eichar, Richard Middleton, Benjamin Statler', 'Daniel Roebuck, Sarah Scott, August Emerson, Kurt Loder, Tyler Bryan, Julie Lancaster, Jerry Hauck, Steven Ellison', null, 'Twenty years ago, Kurt Cobain was found dead of an apparent gunshot wound to the head. The world was told it was a suicide, but evidence would lead many people to believe it might be otherwise. The film investigates the possibilities that exist that Kurt Cobain''s death might not have been a suicide, that the Seattle Police Department rushed their verdict, and the global media perpetuated lies and misinformation fed to them by Courtney Love that created the belief in many that Cobain killed himself—but when revealed to be lies—lead many to now question what happened.', 'Twenty years ago, Kurt Cobain was found dead of an apparent gunshot wound to the head. The world was told it was a suicide, but evidence would lead many people to believe it might be otherwise. The film investigates the possibilities that exist that Kurt Cobain''s death might not have been a suicide, that the Seattle Police Department rushed their verdict, and the global media perpetuated lies and misinformation fed to them by Courtney Love that created the belief in many that Cobain killed himself—but when revealed to be lies—lead many to now question what happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ScpSMDQvwi28Dro1xwSOcKCVln.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295595'),
  ('392513788140577870', 'Soap and Water', 1983, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Danilo Desideri, Carlo Verdone', 'Carlo Verdone, Franco Ferrini, Enrico Oldoini', 'Carlo Verdone, Natasha Hovey, Florinda Bolkan, Elena Fabrizi, Glenn Saxson, Michele Mirabella, Philip Dallas, Fabrizio Bracconeri', 'PG', 'A school janitor pretends to be a priest in order to give private lessons to a young top model.', 'A school janitor pretends to be a priest in order to give private lessons to a young top model.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yvT8NykVhVqJ06IIuB9KPJ0REmv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37777'),
  ('153541286188037969', 'Soap Bubbles', 1906, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'A magician blows some big bubbles and makes heads of women appear inside them.', 'A magician blows some big bubbles and makes heads of women appear inside them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8XhTtWd9vF94MBUBqddH4w2vZA9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196383'),
  ('95849999382434125', 'Soap Opera', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Federico Masiero, Alessandro Genovesi, Miguel Lombardi', 'Alessandro Genovesi', 'Fabio De Luigi, Ricky Memphis, Cristiana Capotondi, Chiara Francini, Diego Abatantuono, Ale, Franz, Elisa Sednaoui', null, 'When the kooky tenants of an apartment block experience a sudden and shocking situation, they let their private lives, past secrets and crazy passions intervene as the confessions and absurd twists come thick and fast. Previous lovers, wild accusations, a possible murder and more boil to the surface days before New Year’s Eve, but can they even make it until then?', 'When the kooky tenants of an apartment block experience a sudden and shocking situation, they let their private lives, past secrets and crazy passions intervene as the confessions and absurd twists come thick and fast. Previous lovers, wild accusations, a possible murder and more boil to the surface days before New Year’s Eve, but can they even make it until then?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l04OcbLztyJT4SFLqxdLSniiRr4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298722'),
  ('1088148637029909257', 'Soapdish', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Michael Hoffman, John Hockridge, Joseph J. Kontra', 'Robert Harling, Andrew Bergman', 'Sally Field, Kevin Kline, Robert Downey Jr., Cathy Moriarty, Teri Hatcher, Paul Johansson, Elisabeth Shue, Whoopi Goldberg', 'PG-13', 'Celeste Talbert is the star of the long-running soap opera "The Sun Also Sets." With the show''s ratings down, Celeste''s ruthlessly ambitious co-star, Montana Moorehead, and the show''s arrogant producer, David Seton Barnes, plot to aggravate her into leaving the show by bringing back her old flame, Jeffrey Anderson, and hiring her beautiful young niece, Lori Craven.', 'Celeste Talbert is the star of the long-running soap opera "The Sun Also Sets." With the show''s ratings down, Celeste''s ruthlessly ambitious co-star, Montana Moorehead, and the show''s arrogant producer, David Seton Barnes, plot to aggravate her into leaving the show by bringing back her old flame, Jeffrey Anderson, and hiring her beautiful young niece, Lori Craven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5Aagqf4odlE1PkLouHPOj63z8D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25562'),
  ('676857884824719335', 'Soar Into the Sun', 2012, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Kim Dong-won', 'Kim Dong-won', 'Rain, Yu Jun-sang, Shin Sae-kyeong, Kim Sung-su, Lee Ha-na, Lee Jong-suk, Oh Dal-su, Jung Kyung-ho', null, 'Tae-hun causes trouble for the his unit with his antics. He does not take much seriously until a dogfight leaves a pilot dead and another missing. Tae-hun and the other members of his unit launch a rescue mission to prevent a war from breaking out.', 'Tae-hun causes trouble for the his unit with his antics. He does not take much seriously until a dogfight leaves a pilot dead and another missing. Tae-hun and the other members of his unit launch a rescue mission to prevent a war from breaking out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wiKfRPoid8MJrrbH0VsrMxiMiSW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124294'),
  ('124328987408957945', 'Sobibor', 2018, 'War, Drama', 'Konstantin Khabenskiy, Kristina Kolytė, Ramūnas Greičius', 'Alexander Adabashyan', 'Konstantin Khabenskiy, Christopher Lambert, Michalina Olszańska, Felice Jankell, Mariya Kozhevnikova, Dainius Kazlauskas, Philippe Reinhardt, Maximilian Dirr', 'R', 'The film is based on a real story that happened in 1943 in the Sobibor concentration camp in German-occupied Poland. The main character of the movie is the Soviet-Jewish soldier Alexander Pechersky, who at that time was serving in the Red Army as a lieutenant. In October 1943, he was captured by the Nazis and deported to the Sobibor concentration camp, where Jews were being exterminated in gas chambers. But, in just 3 weeks, Alexander was able to plan an international uprising of prisoners from Poland and Western Europe. This uprising resulted in being the only successful one throughout the war, which led to the largest escape of prisoners from a Nazi concentration camp.', 'The film is based on a real story that happened in 1943 in the Sobibor concentration camp in German-occupied Poland. The main character of the movie is the Soviet-Jewish soldier Alexander Pechersky, who at that time was serving in the Red Army as a lieutenant. In October 1943, he was captured by the Nazis and deported to the Sobibor concentration camp, where Jews were being exterminated in gas chambers. But, in just 3 weeks, Alexander was able to plan an international uprising of prisoners from Poland and Western Europe. This uprising resulted in being the only successful one throughout the war, which led to the largest escape of prisoners from a Nazi concentration camp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnexT2if0lRTp8jsGSOY4JVAnnj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440626'),
  ('130851205086290910', 'Sobibor, October 14, 1943, 4 p.m.', 2001, 'Documentary', 'Caroline Champetier, Dominique Chapuis, Claude Lanzmann', 'Claude Lanzmann', 'Yehuda Lerner, Claude Lanzmann, Francine Kaufmann', null, 'Documentary interview with Yehuda Lerner, who at 17 participated in a prisoner revolt at the Nazi-run Sobibor extermination camp. Originally filmed for inclusion in Lanzmann''s 1985 documentary Shoah.', 'Documentary interview with Yehuda Lerner, who at 17 participated in a prisoner revolt at the Nazi-run Sobibor extermination camp. Originally filmed for inclusion in Lanzmann''s 1985 documentary Shoah.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eAo3m0DqajhM1JhmnjkNNZl6wKz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103695'),
  ('205103200921888721', 'Sobre ruedas - Rolling Elvis', 2017, 'Comedy, Family', 'Gustavo Torres Gil', null, 'Julián Andres Salcedo Rodriguez, Maria Dalmazzo, Santiago Olaya, Santiago Prieto, Álvaro Rodríguez, Claudia Cadavid, Juan David Galindo, Alison García', null, 'It''s 1985 and while the country is focused in the victories of the national cyclists in the Tour of France, life changes in the blink of an eye for Elvis Antonio, a 12 year old boy passionate for pro cycling, and now he must take a painful but hilarious journey that leads him to discover the biggest secret his family keeps.', 'It''s 1985 and while the country is focused in the victories of the national cyclists in the Tour of France, life changes in the blink of an eye for Elvis Antonio, a 12 year old boy passionate for pro cycling, and now he must take a painful but hilarious journey that leads him to discover the biggest secret his family keeps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJkNoFS9PPuNvGIo47Dx93M6tLR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:490793'),
  ('936843651288347583', 'Sobreviviendo mis XV', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Chava Cartas, Beto Casillas', 'Angélica Gudiño, Juan Carlos Garzón', 'Berenice Jonguitud, Verónica Bravo, Memo Villegas, Paco Luna, Farah Justiniani, Sofía Carrera, Luciana Vale, Carolina Anzures', 'PG-13', 'Quinceañeras, a magical age... except when your family wants to put you in a bulky dress and make you waltz in front of everyone, which is exactly what happens to Danae shortly after she transfers to a very proper private school. Now Danae has to manage to balance the demands of her family, those of her new friends and organize a cool, but traditional, but modern, but emotional, but aesthetic, but also grandmother-pleasing Quinceañera party... without dying in the process.', 'Quinceañeras, a magical age... except when your family wants to put you in a bulky dress and make you waltz in front of everyone, which is exactly what happens to Danae shortly after she transfers to a very proper private school. Now Danae has to manage to balance the demands of her family, those of her new friends and organize a cool, but traditional, but modern, but emotional, but aesthetic, but also grandmother-pleasing Quinceañera party... without dying in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kr50u2w3G5L7RqLf6frFliJqPrZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1172029'),
  ('2202334309819887', 'Soccer Days', 2003, 'Comedy', 'David Serrano, Álvaro Cortázar, Kiko de la Rica', 'David Serrano', 'Ernesto Alterio, Alberto San Juan, Natalia Verbeke, María Esteve, Fernando Tejero, Pere Ponce, Nathalie Poza, Secun de la Rosa', null, 'A comedic romp that celebrates the power of friendship to turn your life around, Dias de Futbol introduces us to Antonio, an ex-convict and amateur shrink who convinces his pals that the best way to overcome their midlife crises and lack of success with women is to reassemble their old soccer team and win something in life, even if only a local championship. Directed by David Serrano. Starring Alberto San Juan, Natalia Verbeke (Dot the I, Son of the Bride), Pere Ponce, and Fernando Tejero.', 'A comedic romp that celebrates the power of friendship to turn your life around, Dias de Futbol introduces us to Antonio, an ex-convict and amateur shrink who convinces his pals that the best way to overcome their midlife crises and lack of success with women is to reassemble their old soccer team and win something in life, even if only a local championship. Directed by David Serrano. Starring Alberto San Juan, Natalia Verbeke (Dot the I, Son of the Bride), Pere Ponce, and Fernando Tejero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qFkuNJWye1s1yyainngE04Oqvz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54148'),
  ('529328562151986453', 'Soccer Dog 2: European Cup', 2004, 'Family, Comedy', 'Sandy Tung, Duane ''DC'' Manwiller', 'John E. Deaver', 'Nick Moran, Jake Thomas, Lori Heuring, Scott Cleverdon, Orson Bean, Darren Keefe Reiher, Frank Simons, Jack McGee', null, 'Soccer Dog: European Cup opens with the titular hero, Kimble, escaping the clutches of an evil scientist, bent on performing animal experiments. Our plucky canine hero then falls into the hands of Zack (Jake Thomas), an American boy who''s been brought to Scotland after the death of his mother to be reunited with the father he never knew, Brian (Nick Moran). After a bumpy introduction, father and son eventually connect by playing soccer together, and when the unusually nimble Kimble storms onto the field one day, their lives change forever.', 'Soccer Dog: European Cup opens with the titular hero, Kimble, escaping the clutches of an evil scientist, bent on performing animal experiments. Our plucky canine hero then falls into the hands of Zack (Jake Thomas), an American boy who''s been brought to Scotland after the death of his mother to be reunited with the father he never knew, Brian (Nick Moran). After a bumpy introduction, father and son eventually connect by playing soccer together, and when the unusually nimble Kimble storms onto the field one day, their lives change forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dsYSelg2wqbT0ZpLg9THfMuLXUP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72977'),
  ('959355758748976106', 'Soccer Dog: The Movie', 1999, 'Comedy, Family', 'Tony Giglio, Christopher Duddy', 'Daniel Forman', 'James Marshall, Olivia D''Abo, Jeremy Foley, Sam McMurray, Billy Drago, Burton Gilliam, Kyle Gibson, Brocker Way', 'PG', 'A heart-warming comedy about the friendship between the new kid in town and a soccer-playing dog on the lam from the dog-catcher. It''s up to these two underdogs to win the PeeWee Soccer League championship game.', 'A heart-warming comedy about the friendship between the new kid in town and a soccer-playing dog on the lam from the dog-catcher. It''s up to these two underdogs to win the PeeWee Soccer League championship game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aipiU6YQlClnSkQlbSm7Wm7n7qc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32139'),
  ('395829020495460730', 'Soccer Mom', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Gregory McClatchy, Jeff Venditti, Todd Tucker', 'Frederick Ayeroff', 'Missi Pyle, Emily Osment, Ellery Sprayberry, Dylan Sprayberry, Elon Gold, Robert Cavanah, Cassie Scerbo, Jennifer Sciole', 'PG', 'A warm-hearted comedy about a compulsive soccer mom who masquerades as a famous Italian soccer star hired to coach her daughter''s floundering soccer team, then struggles frantically to keep her wacky charade going long enough to see the girls win their big tournament.', 'A warm-hearted comedy about a compulsive soccer mom who masquerades as a famous Italian soccer star hired to coach her daughter''s floundering soccer team, then struggles frantically to keep her wacky charade going long enough to see the girls win their big tournament.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKQhXoWStscF9Xmy5KQYYPkLt3B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25432'),
  ('632250677752963920', 'Soccer Poker', 1989, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Janusz Zaorski, Witold Adamek', 'Jan Purzycki', 'Janusz Gajos, Małgorzata Pieczyńska, Marian Opania, Mariusz Dmochowski, Jan Englert, Edward Linde-Lubaszenko, Olaf Lubaszenko, Mariusz Benoit', null, 'Laguna was once a great soccer player whose career was interrupted by an injury. He spent years climbing the ranks to become an international referee. He sees the prevailing arrangements, manipulations, and bribery around him. Now desperate, he decides to stage an extraordinary culmination of his career: he wants to create a so-called "miracle Sunday" by "printing" the final round of games - taking substantial bribes from the interested clubs and manipulating the matches so that the results align in the order he set up.', 'Laguna was once a great soccer player whose career was interrupted by an injury. He spent years climbing the ranks to become an international referee. He sees the prevailing arrangements, manipulations, and bribery around him. Now desperate, he decides to stage an extraordinary culmination of his career: he wants to create a so-called "miracle Sunday" by "printing" the final round of games - taking substantial bribes from the interested clubs and manipulating the matches so that the results align in the order he set up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9VmwZbiN0ZDmlTmW7tJfkFElCg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36399'),
  ('711493784017323369', 'Soccer Stories', 1997, 'Drama', 'Igor Jadue-Lillo, Andrés Wood, Pablo Vial', 'Andrés Wood, René Arcos', 'Daniel Muñoz, Fernando Gallardo, Boris Quercia, Néstor Cantillana, Rodolfo Pulgar, María Izquierdo, Elsa Poblete, Hector Avendaño', null, 'Three vignettes about the lives of young Chileans and their passions and frustrations over one of the century''s most important rituals: football.', 'Three vignettes about the lives of young Chileans and their passions and frustrations over one of the century''s most important rituals: football.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyKYkJfKjMNIbTow9p1lMw0HWby.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45180'),
  ('99352889579232640', 'Socha Na Tha', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Imtiaz Ali, Ravi Yadav, Sameer Khan', 'Imtiaz Ali', 'Abhay Deol, Ayesha Takia, Suresh Oberoi, Ayesha Jhulka, Rati Agnihotri, Sandhya Mridul, Raj Zutshi, Kamlesh Gill', null, 'Viren and Aditi refuse an arranged marriage and that creates a rift between their families. But when their friendship turns into love, it leads to chaos!', 'Viren and Aditi refuse an arranged marriage and that creates a rift between their families. But when their friendship turns into love, it leads to chaos!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HbdfX0FGnQUQ8WtGWY5zLZB4lH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21555'),
  ('926488064241190487', 'Social Animals', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Theresa Bennett', 'Theresa Bennett', 'Noël Wells, Josh Radnor, Aya Cash, Carly Chaikin, Fortune Feimster, Samira Wiley, Ryan Darbonne, Jon Silberg', 'R', 'Determined not to turn into her parents, or be drawn into any relationship longer than a one night stand, Zoe constantly struggles with her failing business and love life. Then she falls in love for the first time with Paul. But there''s one problem: Paul is married.', 'Determined not to turn into her parents, or be drawn into any relationship longer than a one night stand, Zoe constantly struggles with her failing business and love life. Then she falls in love for the first time with Paul. But there''s one problem: Paul is married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45QgvkuwZF8mffzDcK3wZSpNpA0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:506407'),
  ('917541880891405400', 'Social Genocide', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Fernando E. Solanas, Alejandro Fernández Mouján, Fernando E. Solanas', 'Fernando E. Solanas', 'Mick Jagger, Keith Richards, Ronnie Wood, Fernando E. Solanas, Carlos Saúl Menem', null, 'After the fall of the military dictatorship in 1983, successive democratic governments launched a series of reforms purporting to turn Argentina into the world''s most liberal and prosperous economy. Less than twenty years later, the Argentinians have lost literally everything: major national companies have been sold well below value to foreign corporations; the proceeds of privatizations have been diverted into the pockets of corrupt officials; revised labour laws have taken away all rights from employees; in a country that is traditionally an important exporter of foodstuffs, malnutrition is widespread; millions of people are unemployed and sinking into poverty; and their savings have disappeared in a final banking collapse. The film highlights numerous political, financial, social and judicial aspects that mark out Argentina''s road to ruin.', 'After the fall of the military dictatorship in 1983, successive democratic governments launched a series of reforms purporting to turn Argentina into the world''s most liberal and prosperous economy. Less than twenty years later, the Argentinians have lost literally everything: major national companies have been sold well below value to foreign corporations; the proceeds of privatizations have been diverted into the pockets of corrupt officials; revised labour laws have taken away all rights from employees; in a country that is traditionally an important exporter of foodstuffs, malnutrition is widespread; millions of people are unemployed and sinking into poverty; and their savings have disappeared in a final banking collapse. The film highlights numerous political, financial, social and judicial aspects that mark out Argentina''s road to ruin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g1RSkJbZsPzoaabp7VtCSi7lI9F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32547'),
  ('432536023529412960', 'Social Lion', 1954, 'Animation', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Paul Frees, Stan Freberg, James MacDonald, Alan Mowbray', 'NR', 'The lion is trapped by the safari and brought to New York, where he''s accidentally set free, but nobody is intimidated by him.', 'The lion is trapped by the safari and brought to New York, where he''s accidentally set free, but nobody is intimidated by him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vf1BVsbFQiTcL4XIsY5afDlvgDj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56015'),
  ('1044142150615782059', 'Social Nightmare', 2013, 'TV Movie, Drama, Mystery', 'Mark Quod, Steve Goldenberg, Richard J. Vialet', 'Delondra Williams, Keith Allan', 'Daryl Hannah, Kirsten Zien, Chloe Bridges, Brandon Mychal Smith, Brittania Carraway, Tim Russ, Rachel True, Keith Allan', null, 'A student''s chances of getting into a good college hang in the balance when inappropriate photos of her are posted on the Internet.', 'A student''s chances of getting into a good college hang in the balance when inappropriate photos of her are posted on the Internet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yn7vsny6qtXvbnPmW98ghluyLro.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236324'),
