  ('27758405671767397', 'Society', 1989, 'Comedy, Horror, Mystery', 'Brian Yuzna, Rick Fichter', 'Rick Fry, Woody Keith', 'Billy Warlock, Connie Danese, Ben Slack, Evan Richards, Patrice Jennings, Tim Bartell, Charles Lucia, Heidi Kozak', 'R', 'Bill Whitney is worried that he is different to his sister and parents. They mix with other upper-class people while Bill is more down to earth. Even his girlfriend seems a bit odd. All is revealed when Bill returns home to find a party in full swing.', 'Bill Whitney is worried that he is different to his sister and parents. They mix with other upper-class people while Bill is more down to earth. Even his girlfriend seems a bit odd. All is revealed when Bill returns home to find a party in full swing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Yg51sD6loLBYIlUcMDCO0bUGSh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22244'),
  ('1089828469573867844', 'Society Dog Show', 1939, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Bill Roberts', null, 'Walt Disney, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Rather out of place at a swanky dog show, Pluto flirts with Fifi, a dainty Pekingese. The judge orders Mickey and Pluto to leave, but when a fire breaks out Pluto rescues Fifi and is proclaimed a hero.', 'Rather out of place at a swanky dog show, Pluto flirts with Fifi, a dainty Pekingese. The judge orders Mickey and Pluto to leave, but when a fire breaks out Pluto rescues Fifi and is proclaimed a hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7OLMxaVRP23iJPC3Cr7bBh8GTZ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67171'),
  ('289179493202088193', 'Society Lawyer', 1939, 'Drama, Crime', 'Edwin L. Marin', 'Leon Gordon, Albert Hackett, Frances Goodrich', 'Walter Pidgeon, Virginia Bruce, Leo Carrillo, Eduardo Ciannelli, Lee Bowman, Frances Mercer, Ann Morriss, Herbert Mundin', null, 'Society lawyer Christopher Durant agrees to defend his friend Phil Siddall who was arrested for the murder of an ex-girlfriend. With the help of nightclub singer Pat Abbott and crime boss Tony Gazotti (a former client), Durant launches his own investigation of the murder in order to prove his friend''s innocence.', 'Society lawyer Christopher Durant agrees to defend his friend Phil Siddall who was arrested for the murder of an ex-girlfriend. With the help of nightclub singer Pat Abbott and crime boss Tony Gazotti (a former client), Durant launches his own investigation of the murder in order to prove his friend''s innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oh3EWWr9V3xxGvjxa8oxG6g4rUD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198143'),
  ('922672832951930003', 'Society of the Snow: Who Were We on the Mountain?', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Manuel Romo, David Arasa', 'Manuel Romo', 'J. A. Bayona, Sandra Hermida, Eduardo Strauch, Carlitos Páez, Nando Parrado, Teresita Vásquez, Roberto Canessa, Belén Atienza', 'PG-13', 'An in-depth look at the creative process behind "Society of the Snow," featuring cast, crew, director J.A. Bayona and even real-life survivors.', 'An in-depth look at the creative process behind "Society of the Snow," featuring cast, crew, director J.A. Bayona and even real-life survivors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHTQVdJHbPMvaOdzqlqBXFTctCp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1232289'),
  ('97121579298733169', 'Sociology Is a Martial Art', 2001, 'Documentary', 'Pierre Carles', 'Pierre Carles', 'Pierre Bourdieu, José Bové, Pierre Carles, Gary Reich, Loïc Wacquant', null, '"I often say sociology is a martial art, a means of self-defence. Basically, you use it to defend yourself, without having the right to use it for unfair attacks." (Pierre Bourdieu) The world has witnesses who speak out loud what others keep to themselves. They are neither gurus, nor masters, but those who consider that the city and the world can be thought out. The sociologist, Pierre Bourdieu is one such witness." Over a three- year period, Pierre Carles'' camera followed him through different situations: a short conversation with Günter Grass, a lively conference with the inhabitants of a working-class suburb, his relations with his students and colleagues and his plea that sociology be part of the life of the city. His thinking has a sort of familiarity, which means it is always within our reach. It is the thinking of a French intellectual who has chosen to think his times.', '"I often say sociology is a martial art, a means of self-defence. Basically, you use it to defend yourself, without having the right to use it for unfair attacks." (Pierre Bourdieu) The world has witnesses who speak out loud what others keep to themselves. They are neither gurus, nor masters, but those who consider that the city and the world can be thought out. The sociologist, Pierre Bourdieu is one such witness." Over a three- year period, Pierre Carles'' camera followed him through different situations: a short conversation with Günter Grass, a lively conference with the inhabitants of a working-class suburb, his relations with his students and colleagues and his plea that sociology be part of the life of the city. His thinking has a sort of familiarity, which means it is always within our reach. It is the thinking of a French intellectual who has chosen to think his times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvi2TSmbf6ZmVFEkhMR4uw7eSuP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37418'),
  ('725617674280434977', 'Socorro, Virei uma Garota!', 2019, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Cacala Carvana, Pedro Barbalho, Leandro Neri', 'Paulo Cursino', 'Thati Lopes, Victor Lamoglia, Leo Bahia, Manu Gavassi, Nelson Freitas, Vanessa Gerbelli, Felipe Adler, Lua Blanco', null, 'Júlio wanted to be the most popular person in school but ends up getting more than what he wished for.', 'Júlio wanted to be the most popular person in school but ends up getting more than what he wished for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4Vt2IKLYpCRvouqGNj4hbft4Vk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:605367'),
  ('263672597757312364', 'Socrates', 1971, 'Drama, History', 'Roberto Rossellini, Jorge Herrero', 'Marcella Mariani, Roberto Rossellini', 'Jean Sylvère, Anne Caprile, Giuseppe Mannajuolo, Ricardo Palacios, Antonio Medina', null, 'A false accusation leads the philosopher Socrates to trial and condemnation in 4th century BC Athens.', 'A false accusation leads the philosopher Socrates to trial and condemnation in 4th century BC Athens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bLcLMlnd5uYtgEcRks4bn9lyEVM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74778'),
  ('312203454983720849', 'Sócrates', 2018, 'Drama', 'Alexandre Moratto', 'Alexandre Moratto, Thayná Mantesso', 'Christian Malheiros, Tales Ordakji, Rosane Paulo, Caio Martinez Pacheco, Jayme Rodrigues, Priscila Ribeiro, Vanessa Marques Santana, Fátima Antonelli', 'NR', 'After his mother''s sudden death, Socrates, a 15-year-old living on the margins of São Paulo''s coast, must survive on his own while coming to terms with his grief.', 'After his mother''s sudden death, Socrates, a 15-year-old living on the margins of São Paulo''s coast, must survive on his own while coming to terms with his grief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzxABZCwwdpudBQKaqQRZbqU0oS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:544355'),
  ('578880958644340368', 'Soda Stereo: MTV Unplugged Comfort and music to fly', 1996, 'Music', 'Milton Lage', null, 'Gustavo Cerati, Charly Alberti, Zeta Bosio, Andrea Echeverri', null, 'The recording was not made exactly under the MTV Unplugged standards because the band was ''Plugged'', but includes a great Andrea Echeverri''s performance in the track «En la Ciudad de la Furia» and also they used samplers in 2 tracks: ''Cementerio Club'' from Luis Alberto Spinetta used on «Té para Tres» and ''Chrome Waves'' from the English band Ride used on «Un Misil en mi Placard»', 'The recording was not made exactly under the MTV Unplugged standards because the band was ''Plugged'', but includes a great Andrea Echeverri''s performance in the track «En la Ciudad de la Furia» and also they used samplers in 2 tracks: ''Cementerio Club'' from Luis Alberto Spinetta used on «Té para Tres» and ''Chrome Waves'' from the English band Ride used on «Un Misil en mi Placard»', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4y9eKh2DtHalwhJqdzNd2NkIvJh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125246'),
  ('1134857203505154073', 'SODA: le rêve américain', 2015, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Nath Dumont', 'Frank Bellocq', 'Kev Adams, Guy Lecluyse, Frank Bellocq, Laurence Oltuski, Chantal Garrigues, Alika Del Sol, Syrielle Mejias, William Lebghil', null, 'Everything is going wrong for Adam: he just failed his baccalaureate, his friends Slimane and Ludovic are about to go their separate ways, his girlfriend is leaving him for another guy, and his parents are constantly arguing. Sinking into despair, the young man regains hope when he discovers a contest where the winner gets a one-year visa to the United States—the place he should have gone on vacation if he had passed his exam.', 'Everything is going wrong for Adam: he just failed his baccalaureate, his friends Slimane and Ludovic are about to go their separate ways, his girlfriend is leaving him for another guy, and his parents are constantly arguing. Sinking into despair, the young man regains hope when he discovers a contest where the winner gets a one-year visa to the United States—the place he should have gone on vacation if he had passed his exam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2H28heYEwpaoI562CrHdvMmPQo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371029'),
  ('764334891259762974', 'Sodom and Gomorrah', 1922, 'Drama', 'Michael Curtiz, Franz Planer, Arthur Gottlein', 'Ladislaus Vajda, Michael Curtiz', 'Georg Reimers, Victor Varconi, Lucy Doraine, Erika von Wagner, Walter Slezak, Kurt Ehrle, Paul Askonas, Richard Berczeller', null, 'Exposed to bad influences since childhood, Mary, a young girl is pushed by her mother to approach an elderly banker by the name of Harber. After almost driving her fiancee to suicide and seducing his mentally-ill son, she realizes through a metaphorical dream the scope of her negligence. Sentenced to prison for incitement to murder Harber, she sees herself as a parallel figure to Lea, Lot''s wife in Sodom, where the Angel of the Lord warns the sinful citizens of the city of their impending doom. Lea oppresses the angel and eventually turns it over to the pagan priests when her sexual advances to it are rejected. In another dream sequence, Mary becomes the Queen of Syria, whose oppressed people turn against her and who, in turn, condemns a young man who loves her to death. Finally, her dream returns to the present time and when she awakens, she runs back to her former lover.', 'Exposed to bad influences since childhood, Mary, a young girl is pushed by her mother to approach an elderly banker by the name of Harber. After almost driving her fiancee to suicide and seducing his mentally-ill son, she realizes through a metaphorical dream the scope of her negligence. Sentenced to prison for incitement to murder Harber, she sees herself as a parallel figure to Lea, Lot''s wife in Sodom, where the Angel of the Lord warns the sinful citizens of the city of their impending doom. Lea oppresses the angel and eventually turns it over to the pagan priests when her sexual advances to it are rejected. In another dream sequence, Mary becomes the Queen of Syria, whose oppressed people turn against her and who, in turn, condemns a young man who loves her to death. Finally, her dream returns to the present time and when she awakens, she runs back to her former lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t67ZQp7G0bW0SfXeezS4iUWPQMG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130200'),
  ('155367876099765202', 'Sodom and Gomorrah', 1962, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'Robert Aldrich, Sergio Leone, Silvano Ippoliti', 'Giorgio Prosperi, Hugo Butler', 'Stewart Granger, Pier Angeli, Stanley Baker, Rossana Podestà, Rik Battaglia, Giacomo Rossi Stuart, Scilla Gabel, Anthony Steffen', null, 'Lot leads his people to a fertile valley adjacent to the cities of Sodom and Gomorrah, hotbeds of vice and corruption ruled by the merciless Queen Bera. When Lot orders a dam to be busted in order to prevent the destruction of the cities by the attacking Helamites, the queen, in gratitude, allows Lot''s people to settle in Sodom. Soon, however, the veneer of civilization begins crumbling as Lot and the Hebrews become corrupted by the Sodomites.', 'Lot leads his people to a fertile valley adjacent to the cities of Sodom and Gomorrah, hotbeds of vice and corruption ruled by the merciless Queen Bera. When Lot orders a dam to be busted in order to prevent the destruction of the cities by the attacking Helamites, the queen, in gratitude, allows Lot''s people to settle in Sodom. Soon, however, the veneer of civilization begins crumbling as Lot and the Hebrews become corrupted by the Sodomites.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbb0WRKvLA7SCrUxG4ZS0PQA27S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43011'),
  ('708054877300360158', 'Sodoma''s Ghost', 1988, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Lucio Fulci, Silvano Tessicini', 'Lucio Fulci, Carlo Alberto Alfieri', 'Claudio Aliotti, Maria Concetta Salieri, Robert Egon, Jessica Moore, Teresa Razzauti, Sebastian Harrison, Joseph Alan Johnson, Al Cliver', null, 'The spirits of Nazis who were killed by bombs while having an orgy return 50 years later to terrorize a group of six teens who stumble upon the house of their death site.', 'The spirits of Nazis who were killed by bombs while having an orgy return 50 years later to terrorize a group of six teens who stumble upon the house of their death site.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXKvwbeh2zuDHqynSlzi2myyfEa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47453'),
  ('1152420302649823354', 'Sofia', 2018, 'Drama', 'Meryem Benm''Barek-Aloïsi, Son Doan', 'Meryem Benm''Barek-Aloïsi', 'Maha Alemi, Lubna Azabal, Sarah Perles, Faouzi Bensaïdi, Hamza Khafif, Nadia Niazi, Fatima Herandi Raouya, Sara Elhamdi Elalaoui', null, 'Sofia, 20, lives with her parents in Casablanca. Suffering from pregnancy denial, she finds herself breaking the law by giving birth to a baby out of wedlock. The hospital gives her 24 hours to provide the father''s papers before informing the authorities…', 'Sofia, 20, lives with her parents in Casablanca. Suffering from pregnancy denial, she finds herself breaking the law by giving birth to a baby out of wedlock. The hospital gives her 24 hours to provide the father''s papers before informing the authorities…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v9UhfCyNc29znDK6delNhPvNReI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517963'),
  ('182886236260304023', 'Sofia and the Stubborn Man', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Andrés Burgos Vallejo, Hernando Sierra, Manuel Castañeda', 'Andrés Burgos Vallejo', 'Carmen Maura, Gustavo Angarita, Constanza Duque, Julián Arango, Carlos-Manuel Vesga, Jair Romero, Eva María González, Carolina López', null, 'An old lady lives in a quiet village in the Andes and has never seen the sea. For many years her husband has promised to take her to the Caribbean Sea, but the plans are always thwarted for different reasons.', 'An old lady lives in a quiet village in the Andes and has never seen the sea. For many years her husband has promised to take her to the Caribbean Sea, but the plans are always thwarted for different reasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wiPqw651cdhJBJ8tNhHTUQVvIAf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158782'),
  ('855938178966865692', 'Sofía Niño de Rivera: Exposed', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Raúl Campos, Jan Suter', 'Sofía Niño de Rivera', 'Sofía Niño de Rivera', null, 'Self-deprecating comic Sofía Niño de Rivera puts her sarcasm on full display in this stand-up special filmed live at Guadalajara''s Degollado Theater.', 'Self-deprecating comic Sofía Niño de Rivera puts her sarcasm on full display in this stand-up special filmed live at Guadalajara''s Degollado Theater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wPQVMCrwB40D9bRwmGvoL7fmeFu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403911'),
  ('1107293531941686270', 'Sofia the First: Once Upon a Princess', 2012, 'Animation, Family', 'Jamie Mitchell', 'Craig Gerber', 'Ariel Winter, Sara Ramirez, Jim Cummings, Travis Willingham, Jennifer Hale, Ashley Eckstein, Darcy Rose Byrnes, Tress MacNeille', 'G', 'Set in the storybook world of Enchancia, the music-filled movie follows Sofia, an average girl whose life suddenly changes when her mother marries the king and she is whisked off to live in a castle with her mom, new step-father, King Roland II, and step-siblings, Amber and James. Along the way this ordinary girl learns to navigate the extraordinary life of royalty, and in the process makes everyone around her feel special.', 'Set in the storybook world of Enchancia, the music-filled movie follows Sofia, an average girl whose life suddenly changes when her mother marries the king and she is whisked off to live in a castle with her mom, new step-father, King Roland II, and step-siblings, Amber and James. Along the way this ordinary girl learns to navigate the extraordinary life of royalty, and in the process makes everyone around her feel special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MGUoGtlOK646iHo8sJLyDSrpDC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144616'),
  ('14951610756967916', 'Sofia the First: The Floating Palace', 2013, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Jamie Mitchell, Larry Leichliter', 'Craig Gerber', 'Ariel Winter, Darcy Rose Byrnes, Zach Callison, Jodi Benson, Jim Cummings, Tim Gunn, Sara Ramirez, Jeff Bennett', 'G', 'After Sofia helps a little mermaid named Oona, Sofia''s amulet grants her the power to transform into a mermaid and visit her new friend''s underwater kingdom. But when Cedric (disguised as a seamonster) plots to steal Oona''s enchanted Mermaid Comb, danger surfaces for both worlds. With a little help from special guest, Princess Ariel, Sofia embarks on an adventure to rescue Oona and prevent a typhoon before it''s too late.', 'After Sofia helps a little mermaid named Oona, Sofia''s amulet grants her the power to transform into a mermaid and visit her new friend''s underwater kingdom. But when Cedric (disguised as a seamonster) plots to steal Oona''s enchanted Mermaid Comb, danger surfaces for both worlds. With a little help from special guest, Princess Ariel, Sofia embarks on an adventure to rescue Oona and prevent a typhoon before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3Hhgg4baysaL1c7GIZDhT351a8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266775'),
  ('835253006903762512', 'Sofia, the Possession', 2024, 'Horror', 'Guillermo Barreira Pérez, Federico Taus', 'Guillermo Barreira Pérez', 'Sara Jiménez, Ángela Arellano, Lara Boedo, Oti Manzano, Magdalena Brotto, Martina Pérez, Jorge Lucas, Eva Egido', null, 'My mother vanished inside the boarding school where she worked. Through a Ouija board, she told me to look for her. My name is Sofia. I''m 14 years old and I''m going to enroll at the boarding school to find the body of my mother.', 'My mother vanished inside the boarding school where she worked. Through a Ouija board, she told me to look for her. My name is Sofia. I''m 14 years old and I''m going to enroll at the boarding school to find the body of my mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYbd7M1dk2xadHd2WczQRmO28uJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1321952'),
  ('494660172035974190', 'Sofia''s Suspicion', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Imanol Uribe, Bruno Velasco, Alberto Larraya', 'Gemma Ventura', 'Álex González, Aura Garrido, Zoe Stein, Irina Bravo, Carla Pastor, Isabel Alonso, Claudia Taboada, Julia Piera', null, 'Daniel’s decision to travel to East Berlin in the middle of the Cold War to meet his birth mother turns out to be the biggest mistake of his life because, unbeknownst to him, he will become the essential piece of the KGB’s secret plan to set up their operations center in Francoist Spain, where his identical twin brother Klaus will play a key role, stealing his identity, his family and his entire life.', 'Daniel’s decision to travel to East Berlin in the middle of the Cold War to meet his birth mother turns out to be the biggest mistake of his life because, unbeknownst to him, he will become the essential piece of the KGB’s secret plan to set up their operations center in Francoist Spain, where his identical twin brother Klaus will play a key role, stealing his identity, his family and his entire life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9aBZKIaB5ehZrO64vEPnSr96UK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1520850'),
  ('412741168883727943', 'Soft & Quiet', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Beth de Araújo, Greta Zozula, Claudia Anahí Ramirez', 'Beth de Araújo', 'Stefanie Estes, Olivia Luccardi, Eleanore Pienta, Dana Millican, Melissa Paulo, Jon Beavers, Cissy Ly, Rebekah Wiggins', 'R', 'Taking place in real time, elementary school teacher Emily organizes a mixer of like-minded women, but an altercation between a woman from Emily’s past and the group leads to a volatile chain of events.', 'Taking place in real time, elementary school teacher Emily organizes a mixer of like-minded women, but an altercation between a woman from Emily’s past and the group leads to a volatile chain of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atNLWJm8KO44xeVGxG4LAByr5tm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:934131'),
  ('335907709599855835', 'Soft Air', 1997, 'Action, Thriller', 'Edy Saija, Roberto Romei, Claudio Masin', 'Patrizia Castagna, Marco Castagna', 'Massimo Franchi, Alessandro Mistichelli, Manuel Oliverio, Piero Calzeroni, Massimiliano Delgado, Johnny Messana, Fabrizio Ripesi, Gerardo Amato', null, 'A group of young men from the upper-middle class in modern-day Italy, bored from the activities of everyday life, participate to a simulated-war "Wargame" match played with Soft-Air gun replicas, only to find out that the opposing team is a group of foreign mercenaries on the loose that takes such occasions for training and gratuitously killing innocents.', 'A group of young men from the upper-middle class in modern-day Italy, bored from the activities of everyday life, participate to a simulated-war "Wargame" match played with Soft-Air gun replicas, only to find out that the opposing team is a group of foreign mercenaries on the loose that takes such occasions for training and gratuitously killing innocents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ivA7oBJaGxtAeLWGsaeTTgfieQ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:443399'),
  ('898177438566109089', 'Soft Beds, Hard Battles', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Roy Boulting, Gilbert Taylor', 'Leo Marks, Roy Boulting', 'Peter Sellers, Lila Kedrova, Curd Jürgens, Béatrice Romand, Jenny Hanley, Vernon Dobtcheff, Douglas Sheldon, Philip Madoc', 'R', 'In this comedy, set during the Nazi occupation of France, Peter Sellers plays most major male parts, so he stars in nearly every scene, always bumbling in inspector Clouseau-style.', 'In this comedy, set during the Nazi occupation of France, Peter Sellers plays most major male parts, so he stars in nearly every scene, always bumbling in inspector Clouseau-style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pTvLEynBj2HBSR7Q97UPobW4dmV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61810'),
  ('497196835397333036', 'Soft Shell Man', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'André Turpin, André Turpin', 'André Turpin', 'David La Haye, Isabelle Blais, Emmanuel Bilodeau, Chantal Giroux, Sophie Prégent, Vincent Bilodeau, Thai-Hoa Le, Nina Borcar', null, 'An emotionally immature underwater photographer returns home to an affair with his best friend''s deaf girlfriend and unresolved issues with the wife he left six months before.', 'An emotionally immature underwater photographer returns home to an affair with his best friend''s deaf girlfriend and unresolved issues with the wife he left six months before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5o3kNIHrTlWtj8X34e3MpPq7x3u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44793'),
  ('100067382441869752', 'Soft Top Hard Shoulder', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Stefan Schwartz, Henry Braham', 'Peter Capaldi', 'Peter Capaldi, Elaine Collins, Richard Wilson, Jeremy Northam, Frances Barber, Simon Callow, Phyllis Logan, Robert James', null, 'Eight years ago, Gavin, the artistic son of a Scots-Italian ice-cream dynasty, turned his back on Glasgow and moved south to London to make his name illustrating children''s books. Now, frustrated and broke, his Uncle Sal appears with an offer. Gavin''s father has sold the family business and to get his share of the proceeds, Gavin must return home for his father''s birthday party. Swayed by the money, he sets off north and picks up a hitchhiker with a secret. Their journey is difficult but ultimately rewarding.', 'Eight years ago, Gavin, the artistic son of a Scots-Italian ice-cream dynasty, turned his back on Glasgow and moved south to London to make his name illustrating children''s books. Now, frustrated and broke, his Uncle Sal appears with an offer. Gavin''s father has sold the family business and to get his share of the proceeds, Gavin must return home for his father''s birthday party. Swayed by the money, he sets off north and picks up a hitchhiker with a secret. Their journey is difficult but ultimately rewarding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5sXylBZThggb1PrXK0DO6dOLCb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202236'),
  ('508829405603990348', 'Softie', 2022, 'Drama', 'Jacques Girault, Samuel Theis', 'Samuel Theis', 'Aliocha Reinert, Antoine Reinartz, Izïa Higelin, Mélissa Olexa, Abdel Benchendikh, Jade Schwartz, Romande Esch, Meresia Litzenburger', null, 'Ten-year-old Johnny stands out from his family and his tough neighborhood in Eastern France. He''s sensitive, intelligent and interested in all kinds of things way beyond his years. With curiosity, he observes the ups and downs of his young single mother''s turbulent love life. Things change when a new teacher, fresh from the big city, takes over Johnny''s class. Mr. Adamski believes in Johnny and wants to open a new world to him. The sophisticated young teacher also intrigues the boy.', 'Ten-year-old Johnny stands out from his family and his tough neighborhood in Eastern France. He''s sensitive, intelligent and interested in all kinds of things way beyond his years. With curiosity, he observes the ups and downs of his young single mother''s turbulent love life. Things change when a new teacher, fresh from the big city, takes over Johnny''s class. Mr. Adamski believes in Johnny and wants to open a new world to him. The sophisticated young teacher also intrigues the boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUZmlHCjqxUQyts0RcoIfAI9HW7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661925'),
  ('117836701778070164', 'Sognando la California', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Giuseppe Maccari', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Vanzina', 'Massimo Boldi, Nino Frassica, Maurizio Ferrini, Antonello Fassari, Bo Derek, Francesca Reggiani, Renato Pareti, Roberto Della Casa', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ybq2uYJvXH7zkBmpHbJRWusquRn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65654'),
  ('1039363697257582172', 'Sohni Mahiwal', 1984, 'Romance, Drama, Action', 'Umesh Mehra, Latif Faiziyev', 'Umesh Mehra, Latif Faizav, Javed Siddiqui', 'Sunny Deol, Poonam Dhillon, Gulshan Grover, Tanuja Samarth, Shammi Kapoor, Pran Sikand, Rakesh Bedi, Zeenat Aman', null, 'Shahjada Ijjat Beg comes to India with his caravan and settles in a town in Gujrat. Here he falls in love with Sohani, who keeps a shop in metal pots. Ijjat Beg buys pot from her with whatever money he had and they were attracted to each other. Sohni dispensed with her servant and kept Ijjat Beg instead. This gave them more opportunity to meet. This was a scandal in the town and Sohni was perforce married to Rehaman who was slightly off his head. Sohni continued her meeting Ijjat Beg who went out fishing. When the atmosphere became to hot for them they jointly took a water grave for their love.', 'Shahjada Ijjat Beg comes to India with his caravan and settles in a town in Gujrat. Here he falls in love with Sohani, who keeps a shop in metal pots. Ijjat Beg buys pot from her with whatever money he had and they were attracted to each other. Sohni dispensed with her servant and kept Ijjat Beg instead. This gave them more opportunity to meet. This was a scandal in the town and Sohni was perforce married to Rehaman who was slightly off his head. Sohni continued her meeting Ijjat Beg who went out fishing. When the atmosphere became to hot for them they jointly took a water grave for their love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/koX9yh50Hq2zVsVpK0FYiijZAlk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216969'),
  ('986202094081585696', 'Soi Cowboy', 2008, 'Drama', 'Thomas Clay, Sayombhu Mukdeeprom', 'Thomas Clay', 'Nicolas Bro, Pimwalee Thampanyasan, Petch Mekoh, Somrak Khamsing, Art Supawatt Purdy, Natee Srimanta, Porntip Papanai', null, 'In order to avoid working in the red-light district of Bangkok, a Thai woman lives with an overweight expatriate. Their lives are uneventful and dull until a provincial mafia hitman arrives on the scene.', 'In order to avoid working in the red-light district of Bangkok, a Thai woman lives with an overweight expatriate. Their lives are uneventful and dull until a provincial mafia hitman arrives on the scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dMVnmiDSoffp9Gn5Z2NEFeRutbY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8934'),
  ('796382952228112283', 'SOL', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Vincent Gallot, Jézabel Marques', 'Jézabel Marques, Faïza Guène, Vincent Cappello', 'Chantal Lauby, Camille Chamoux, Giovanni Pucci, Serge Bagdassarian, Yannick Renier, Dominique MacAvoy, Jézabel Marques, Patrice Tépasso', null, 'Sol, a famous Argentine Tango performer, has lived in Buenos Aires for many years. Behind her excessive temper and her glowing smile, the Diva hides an injury from which she never really recovered: the loss of her only son, Raphaël.', 'Sol, a famous Argentine Tango performer, has lived in Buenos Aires for many years. Behind her excessive temper and her glowing smile, the Diva hides an injury from which she never really recovered: the loss of her only son, Raphaël.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHUWOpOK0OKXKveIoTbCrPqgwyM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613339'),
  ('378732663842249238', 'Sol Alegria', 2018, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Ivo Lopes Araújo, Tavinho Teixeira, Mariah Teixeira', 'Tavinho Teixeira', 'Mariah Teixeira, Joana Medeiros, Mauro Soares, Tavinho Teixeira, Everaldo Pontes, Ney Matogrosso, Vera Valdez, Leonardo Mouramateus', null, 'While the country is under the yoke of a military junta and corrupt priests preach the apocalypse, a lawless, eccentric family – a kind of Bonnie & Clyde with kids – trek through the Brazilian interior. Their first aim is to deliver a consignment of weapons to a group of militant nuns who have withdrawn to the jungle, living off the income from their cannabis plantation. As gay , bi, trans, the converts so organized to make revolution.', 'While the country is under the yoke of a military junta and corrupt priests preach the apocalypse, a lawless, eccentric family – a kind of Bonnie & Clyde with kids – trek through the Brazilian interior. Their first aim is to deliver a consignment of weapons to a group of militant nuns who have withdrawn to the jungle, living off the income from their cannabis plantation. As gay , bi, trans, the converts so organized to make revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xbEkZORp3RYzDWs1t6XHYWSTyeY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499517'),
  ('736179389385843975', 'Sol Levante', 2020, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Akira Saitoh, Hisashi Ezura', null, null, null, 'A young warrior and her familiar search for the sacred place said to fulfill wishes. It''s best not to anger the ancient guardians and spirits.', 'A young warrior and her familiar search for the sacred place said to fulfill wishes. It''s best not to anger the ancient guardians and spirits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pS1OpWvJAnSPytj7kDkxy9Y4pFf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:688900'),
  ('872664534035220007', 'Solace', 2015, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Irina Bryson, Afonso Poyart, Brendan Galvin', 'Ted Griffin, Sean Bailey', 'Anthony Hopkins, Jeffrey Dean Morgan, Abbie Cornish, Colin Farrell, Matt Gerald, Jose Pablo Cantillo, Marley Shelton, Xander Berkeley', 'R', 'A psychic doctor, John Clancy, works with an FBI special agent in search of a serial killer.', 'A psychic doctor, John Clancy, works with an FBI special agent in search of a serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbcXpZgem8kgr90RwIUNAbC2ite.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339527'),
  ('95470884862298848', 'Solange And The Living', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ina Mihalache', null, 'Ina Mihalache, Pierre Siankowski, Francis Van Litsenborgh, Christian Henrard, Charline Vanhoenacker', null, 'One day when Solange is studying the accumulated dust balls in her apartment, the doorbell rings. A delivery man claims to have a packet addressed to her. Solange is definite: it''s impossible. The misunderstanding intensifies, Solange collapses. When a doctor suggests that someone watch over her for the night, her landlord accepts to do so. But he''s called away on a mission and decides to find another watchman... A genuine human chain will then form so that Solange is not left alone because it seems that this relationship therapy is doing her good.', 'One day when Solange is studying the accumulated dust balls in her apartment, the doorbell rings. A delivery man claims to have a packet addressed to her. Solange is definite: it''s impossible. The misunderstanding intensifies, Solange collapses. When a doctor suggests that someone watch over her for the night, her landlord accepts to do so. But he''s called away on a mission and decides to find another watchman... A genuine human chain will then form so that Solange is not left alone because it seems that this relationship therapy is doing her good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ESqzscOTme13fTWZczZyzNoPm5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:386794'),
  ('1091009433389287979', 'Solanin', 2010, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Takahiro Miki, Ryuto Kondo, Hajime Gonno', 'Izumi Takahashi', 'Aoi Miyazaki, Kengo Kora, Kenta Kiritani, Ayumi Ito, Arata Iura, Yoichi Kondo, Kento Nagayama, Sayuri Iwata', null, 'Meiko and Taneda are a couple graduated from university two years ago. Unhappy with their lives, Meiko quits her job and encourages Taneda to have his band become professional.', 'Meiko and Taneda are a couple graduated from university two years ago. Unhappy with their lives, Meiko quits her job and encourages Taneda to have his band become professional.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bX7hbGKI1COCnv7nXxJSCG04jHR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45580'),
  ('698319578032186166', 'Solar Attack', 2006, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Paul Ziller', 'Michael Konyves, Miguel Tejada-Flores', 'Mark Dacascos, Louis Gossett Jr., Joanne Kelly, Kevin Jubinville, Stephen McHattie, Tim Post, Sugith Varughese, Bill Lake', null, 'When the sun''s increasing expulsions of plasma threaten to ignite methane in our atmosphere, international tensions rise while scientists race for a solution to avoid natural disaster.', 'When the sun''s increasing expulsions of plasma threaten to ignite methane in our atmosphere, international tensions rise while scientists race for a solution to avoid natural disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dL5hDlxU8BLf1oVdnl9Llb2uoI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34862'),
  ('1138770229164411603', 'Solar Crisis', 1992, 'Science Fiction', 'Russell Carpenter, Richard C. Sarafian, Michael-McCloud Thompson', 'Joe Gannon, Tedi Sarafian', 'Tim Matheson, Charlton Heston, Peter Boyle, Annabel Schofield, Corin Nemec, Tetsuya Bessho, Jack Palance, Dorian Harewood', 'PG-13', 'A huge solar flare is predicted to fry the Earth. Astronauts aboard the spaceship Helios must go to the Sun to drop a bomb equipped with an Artificial Intelligence and a Japanese pilot at the right time so the flare will point somewhere else.', 'A huge solar flare is predicted to fry the Earth. Astronauts aboard the spaceship Helios must go to the Sun to drop a bomb equipped with an Artificial Intelligence and a Japanese pilot at the right time so the flare will point somewhere else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Hbv6CPtv4ehgE60dXOYKmIrcV1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2102'),
  ('1118943091337305070', 'Solar Flare', 2008, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Fred Olen Ray, Theo Angell, Thomas Kuk', 'Ernest Fogelberg', 'Michelle Clunie, Tracey Gold, Chris Brochu, Ted Monte, Cliff DeYoung, Kasan Butcher, Michael De La Torre, David Purdham', null, 'A young math genius discovers a huge solar storm on the verge of destroying the Earth''s power grid and he must alert the world before a powerful businessman stops him.', 'A young math genius discovers a huge solar storm on the verge of destroying the Earth''s power grid and he must alert the world before a powerful businessman stops him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/309Yq0qAmIMDb20rMwoms3YD8kU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52697'),
  ('662059021226937282', 'Solarbabies', 1986, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Romance', 'Alan Johnson, Don Dossett, Terry Windell', 'Walon Green, D.A. Metrov', 'Richard Jordan, Jami Gertz, Jason Patric, Lukas Haas, James Le Gros, Claude Brooks, Peter DeLuise, Peter Kowanko', 'PG-13', 'In a future in which most water has disappeared from the Earth, we find a group of children, mostly teenagers, who are living at an orphanage, run by the despotic rulers of the new Earth. The group in question plays a hockey based game on roller skates and is quite good. It has given them a unity that transcends the attempts to bring them to heel by the government. Finding an orb of special power, they find it has unusual effects on them. They escape from the orphanage (on skates) and try to cross the wasteland looking for a place they can live free as the storm-troopers search for them and the orb.', 'In a future in which most water has disappeared from the Earth, we find a group of children, mostly teenagers, who are living at an orphanage, run by the despotic rulers of the new Earth. The group in question plays a hockey based game on roller skates and is quite good. It has given them a unity that transcends the attempts to bring them to heel by the government. Finding an orb of special power, they find it has unusual effects on them. They escape from the orphanage (on skates) and try to cross the wasteland looking for a place they can live free as the storm-troopers search for them and the orb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKNdxHrWTmG80WXdmLWM6YddZvP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36677'),
  ('198546328034283568', 'Solaris', 1968, 'TV Movie, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Lidiya Ishimbaeva, Boris Nirenburg', null, 'Vasili Lanovoy, Antonina Pilyus, Vladimir Etush, Viktor Zozulin, Vyacheslav Dugin, A. Katsynsky', null, 'Kris Kelvin joins the space station orbiting the planet Solaris, only to find its two crew members plagued by "phantoms," creations of Solaris. Kelvin is soon confronted with his own phantom, taking the shape of his dead wife Hari.', 'Kris Kelvin joins the space station orbiting the planet Solaris, only to find its two crew members plagued by "phantoms," creations of Solaris. Kelvin is soon confronted with his own phantom, taking the shape of his dead wife Hari.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8RUUNC6zyPWgbru30tJVnsi2Q6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321130'),
  ('545672563505199726', 'Solaris', 2002, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Steven Soderbergh, Steven Soderbergh, Sean Haworth', 'Steven Soderbergh', 'George Clooney, Natascha McElhone, Viola Davis, Jeremy Davies, Ulrich Tukur, Michael Ensign, John Cho, Morgan Rusler', 'PG-13', 'A troubled psychologist is sent to investigate the crew of an isolated research station orbiting a bizarre planet.', 'A troubled psychologist is sent to investigate the crew of an isolated research station orbiting a bizarre planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/drdrB1hEZmzFlK1xtW5HMxK3LUJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2103'),
  ('963760941154632341', 'Sold Out: A Threevening with Kevin Smith', 2008, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Zak Knutson, Joey Figueroa', 'Kevin Smith', 'Kevin Smith, Jennifer Schwalbach Smith, Harley Quinn Smith, Grace Smith', null, 'Kevin Smith brings his famous and "infamous" Q&amp;A back to his hometown of Red Bank, New Jersey for his 37th birthday.', 'Kevin Smith brings his famous and "infamous" Q&amp;A back to his hometown of Red Bank, New Jersey for his 37th birthday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zyekLr2fi4RCgmfwrZBU7qRunLZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17041'),
  ('626379962788337196', 'Soldati - 365 all''alba', 1987, 'Drama', 'Marco Risi, Giuseppe Bernardini, Mauro Cappelloni', 'Marco Risi, Marco Modugno, Furio Scarpelli', 'Claudio Amendola, Massimo Dapporto, Ivo Garrani, Claudio Botosso, Alessandro Benvenuti, Agostina Belli, Ugo Conti, Manlio Dovì', null, 'Claudio Scanna is a private in the Italian army: during his first night in a new military base he gets in a fight with senior recruits. Lieutenant Fili, Claudio''s commanding officer, is denied a promotion because his superiors discover he was absent without justification during the night of the fight. Fili blames Claudio and vows to make his remaining months in the service a living hell...', 'Claudio Scanna is a private in the Italian army: during his first night in a new military base he gets in a fight with senior recruits. Lieutenant Fili, Claudio''s commanding officer, is denied a promotion because his superiors discover he was absent without justification during the night of the fight. Fili blames Claudio and vows to make his remaining months in the service a living hell...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zTh5uRjtl3r0ulZSHMDujee6es5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61211'),
  ('1094922563658377651', 'Soldato Semplice', 2015, 'War, Drama, Comedy, History', 'Simone Zampagni, Paolo Cevoli, Chiara Di Giorgi', 'Paolo Cevoli', 'Paolo Cevoli, Antonio Orefice, Luca Lionello, Massimo De Lorenzo, Matteo Cremon, Toomas Kaldaru, Giuseppe Spata, Nicola Adobati', null, 'In 1917, Gino Montanari, an elementary school teacher from Romagna, was forced by the principal of his school to volunteer for the First World War because of his libertine and anti-interventionist behavior. With the threat of being expelled from all schools if he refused, Gino was reluctantly sent to the front in a small outpost in Valtellina, where as a heliographer he had to transmit Morse signals with sunlight. His life would be profoundly changed by his encounter with a young illiterate man, with the enemy, and with a series of individuals from various parts of Italy.', 'In 1917, Gino Montanari, an elementary school teacher from Romagna, was forced by the principal of his school to volunteer for the First World War because of his libertine and anti-interventionist behavior. With the threat of being expelled from all schools if he refused, Gino was reluctantly sent to the front in a small outpost in Valtellina, where as a heliographer he had to transmit Morse signals with sunlight. His life would be profoundly changed by his encounter with a young illiterate man, with the enemy, and with a series of individuals from various parts of Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vkVtSisfyX7ZSpyGu2UmsDPXjzR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333891'),
  ('1091494366894021234', 'Soldier', 1998, 'Science Fiction, Action, Drama', 'Paul W. S. Anderson, David Tattersall, Melanie J. Baker', 'David Webb Peoples', 'Kurt Russell, Jason Scott Lee, Jason Isaacs, Connie Nielsen, Sean Pertwee, Gary Busey, Michael Chiklis, Sara Paxton', 'R', 'Sergeant Todd is a veteran soldier for an elite group of the armed forces. After being defeated by a new breed of genetically engineered soldiers, he is dumped on a waste planet and left for dead. He soon interacts with a group of crash survivors who lead out a peaceful existence. The peace is broken as the new soldiers land on the planet to eliminate the colony, which Sergeant Todd must defend.', 'Sergeant Todd is a veteran soldier for an elite group of the armed forces. After being defeated by a new breed of genetically engineered soldiers, he is dumped on a waste planet and left for dead. He soon interacts with a group of crash survivors who lead out a peaceful existence. The peace is broken as the new soldiers land on the planet to eliminate the colony, which Sergeant Todd must defend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYy5m4nnjdlvB6dyGkP9ELZbUZz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9425'),
  ('580227876466594820', 'Soldier Blue', 1970, 'Western, Drama', 'Ralph Nelson, Robert B. Hauser, Mario Cisneros', 'John Gay', 'Candice Bergen, Peter Strauss, Donald Pleasence, John Anderson, Jorge Rivero, Dana Elcar, Bob Carraway, Martin West', 'R', 'After a cavalry group is massacred by the Cheyenne, only two survivors remain: Honus, a naive private devoted to his duty, and Cresta, a young woman who had lived with the Cheyenne two years and whose sympathies lie more with them than with the US government. Together, they must try to reach the cavalry''s main base camp. As they travel onward, Honus is torn between his growing affection for Cresta.', 'After a cavalry group is massacred by the Cheyenne, only two survivors remain: Honus, a naive private devoted to his duty, and Cresta, a young woman who had lived with the Cheyenne two years and whose sympathies lie more with them than with the US government. Together, they must try to reach the cavalry''s main base camp. As they travel onward, Honus is torn between his growing affection for Cresta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2fRfVQpdrjAhvxwytG0scOqdQOJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14384'),
  ('1053643423943902686', 'Soldier Boyz', 1995, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Louis Morneau, Mauro Fiore, Darren Aronofsky', 'Darryl Quarles', 'Michael Dudikoff, Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, Tyrin Turner, Jacqueline Obradors, Hillary Matthews, Nicole Hansen, David Barry Gray, Channon Roe', 'R', 'A group of prisoners are going to Vietnam to rescue the daughter of a V-I.P. The Ones who survive get their freedom back...but hell awaits them.', 'A group of prisoners are going to Vietnam to rescue the daughter of a V-I.P. The Ones who survive get their freedom back...but hell awaits them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8FhrAIxW1uqab1Km7GnWNq5MY91.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112938'),
  ('584998044331263688', 'Soldier In the Camp', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Mohamed Yassin, Ehab Mohamed Ali', 'Ahmed Abdallah', 'Mohamed Henedi, Lekaa El Khamisy, Maged El Kedwany, Salah Abdallah, Hanan ElTaweil, Hassan Hosny, Soliman Eid, Alaa Morsy', null, 'The Upper Egyptian Khader Hassanein joins the Central Security Forces, he accidentally meets Metwally Al-Zanati on the train, who tells him that he must take the revenge of his father who was killed 20 years ago. Khader realizes that he is the person who Metwally is meant to kill.', 'The Upper Egyptian Khader Hassanein joins the Central Security Forces, he accidentally meets Metwally Al-Zanati on the train, who tells him that he must take the revenge of his father who was killed 20 years ago. Khader realizes that he is the person who Metwally is meant to kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emABtj0t2LQw68d1xaKxDnsux5q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407717'),
  ('503463340688231675', 'Soldier in the Rain', 1963, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ralph Nelson, Philip H. Lathrop, Austen Jewell', 'Blake Edwards, Maurice Richlin', 'Jackie Gleason, Steve McQueen, Tuesday Weld, Tony Bill, Tom Poston, Ed Nelson, Lew Gallo, Rockne Tarkington', 'NR', 'Maxwell Slaughter is a kind, heavyset guy who has reached the rank of master sergeant in the army. Admired by handsome young Sgt. Eustis Clay, Slaughter forms a close bond with his peer. Clay hopes to convince Slaughter to join him in a business venture outside of the service, but, in the meantime, he introduces the older officer to the beautiful young Bobby Jo Pepperdine, inadvertently creating trouble for both men.', 'Maxwell Slaughter is a kind, heavyset guy who has reached the rank of master sergeant in the army. Admired by handsome young Sgt. Eustis Clay, Slaughter forms a close bond with his peer. Clay hopes to convince Slaughter to join him in a business venture outside of the service, but, in the meantime, he introduces the older officer to the beautiful young Bobby Jo Pepperdine, inadvertently creating trouble for both men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmJhxt93SGZrrLiaXU9C8Jtsubf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53336'),
  ('514024756054677816', 'Soldier of Fortune', 1955, 'Action, Romance, Adventure', 'Edward Dmytryk, Leo Tover', 'Ernest K. Gann', 'Clark Gable, Susan Hayward, Michael Rennie, Gene Barry, Tom Tully, Alexander D''Arcy, Anna Sten, Leo Gordon', 'NR', 'An American woman arrives in Hong Kong to unravel the mystery of her missing photographer husband. After getting nowhere with the authorities, she is led by some underground characters to an American soldier of fortune working in the area against the Communists. He promises to help find her husband.', 'An American woman arrives in Hong Kong to unravel the mystery of her missing photographer husband. After getting nowhere with the authorities, she is led by some underground characters to an American soldier of fortune working in the area against the Communists. He promises to help find her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hai46s11pk90zGE22ifFJefRb0S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44888'),
  ('989517931767726260', 'Soldier of Fortune', 1976, 'Action, Comedy', 'Pasquale Festa Campanile, Marcello Masciocchi, Neri Parenti', 'Castellano, Pipolo, Franco Verucci', 'Bud Spencer, Franco Agostini, Enzo Cannavale, Frédéric de Pasquale, Jacques Dufilho, Andréa Ferréol, Jacques Herlin, Angelo Infanti', null, 'Medieval soldier of fortune Ettore is traveling through Europe with his partners looking for a fight where they can earn some money. When they come across a Spanish castle under siege by the French army, Ettore bides his time to determine which side is the winning one. This is at first the French, but the treatment he receives from them is unpleasant enough to make him change his mind and turn to the Spanish side. Somehow, Ettore must rally the weakened Spanish troops to battle their enemy long enough for reinforcements to arrive.', 'Medieval soldier of fortune Ettore is traveling through Europe with his partners looking for a fight where they can earn some money. When they come across a Spanish castle under siege by the French army, Ettore bides his time to determine which side is the winning one. This is at first the French, but the treatment he receives from them is unpleasant enough to make him change his mind and turn to the Spanish side. Somehow, Ettore must rally the weakened Spanish troops to battle their enemy long enough for reinforcements to arrive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izvk5EXAcpCDKDGAJAmPMVph27v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11813'),
  ('817578762113553044', 'Soldier of Orange', 1977, 'Drama, Thriller, War', 'Jost Vacano, Paul Verhoeven, Hans Kemna', 'Paul Verhoeven, Gerard Soeteman, Kees Holierhoek', 'Rutger Hauer, Jeroen Krabbé, Lex van Delden, Derek de Lint, Huib Rooymans, Dolf de Vries, Eddy Habbema, Belinda Meuldijk', 'R', 'The lives of Erik Lanshof and five of his closest friends take different paths when the German army invades the Netherlands in 1940: fight and resistance, fear and resignation, collaboration and high treason.', 'The lives of Erik Lanshof and five of his closest friends take different paths when the German army invades the Netherlands in 1940: fight and resistance, fear and resignation, collaboration and high treason.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdlk0cz97i8Fyb1ZFpp9tokHxGD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:633'),
  ('987602593397745334', 'Soldier''s Girl', 2003, 'TV Movie, Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Frank Pierson, Paul Sarossy', 'Ron Nyswaner', 'Troy Garity, Lee Pace, Andre Braugher, Shawn Hatosy, Philip Eddolls, Merwin Mondesir, Dan Petronijevic, Mike Realba', 'R', 'This true story, which takes place in Fort Campbell, KY, tells the heart-wrenching story of the life and tragic death of soldier Barry Winchell. His love for Calpernia Addams, a transgender nightclub performer, was misunderstood by his fellow soldiers and eventually led to his murder.', 'This true story, which takes place in Fort Campbell, KY, tells the heart-wrenching story of the life and tragic death of soldier Barry Winchell. His love for Calpernia Addams, a transgender nightclub performer, was misunderstood by his fellow soldiers and eventually led to his murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogxl6v4fPdqsYUwI2HNNNC68BAG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32526'),
  ('528043309387221907', 'Soldiers of Fortune', 2012, 'Action, Adventure', 'Mariya Solovyova, Maksim Korostyshevsky', 'Alexandre Coscas, Joe Kelbley, Robert Crombie', 'Christian Slater, Colm Meaney, Ving Rhames, Sean Bean, Dominic Monaghan, James Cromwell, Charlie Bewley, Freddy Rodríguez', 'R', 'Wealthy thrill-seekers pay huge premiums to have themselves inserted into military adventures, only this time things don''t go exactly to plan.', 'Wealthy thrill-seekers pay huge premiums to have themselves inserted into military adventures, only this time things don''t go exactly to plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJ2sXMzTDID7FRZMXMO94pAMA7W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112304'),
  ('892701647783292783', 'Soldiers of Salamina', 2003, 'Drama, History, War', 'David Trueba, Javier Aguirresarobe', 'David Trueba', 'Ariadna Gil, Ramon Fontserè, Diego Luna, María Botto, Joan Dalmau, Luis Cuenca, Lluís Xavier Villanueva, Julio Manrique', null, 'Professor Lola Sánchez investigates the truth behind the events experienced by Rafael Sánchez Mazas, one of the founders of the Falange Española party, during the Spanish Civil War.', 'Professor Lola Sánchez investigates the truth behind the events experienced by Rafael Sánchez Mazas, one of the founders of the Falange Española party, during the Spanish Civil War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUrSL3dHnbsHWVRVExXgc5pDtlH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38086'),
  ('151843860867694129', 'Soldiers of the Damned', 2015, 'Horror, War, Action, Thriller', 'Mark Nuttall, James Martin', 'Nigel Horne', 'Gil Darnell, Miriam Cooke, Tom Sawyer, Nicky Bell, Jason Kennedy, Mark Fountain, Lucas Hansen, Matthew John Morley', null, 'WWII German soldiers take an occult scientist into a haunted forest in Romania, only to be confronted by their own ghosts.', 'WWII German soldiers take an occult scientist into a haunted forest in Romania, only to be confronted by their own ghosts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKjzk2nhrKQsUvwDKN76hdtJGYM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345287'),
  ('609245249438760316', 'Sole', 2019, 'Drama', 'Carlo Sironi, Gergely Pohárnok', 'Antonio Manca, Giulia Moriggi, Carlo Sironi', 'Sandra Drzymalska, Claudio Segaluscio, Bruno Buzzi, Barbara Ronchi, Vitaliano Trevisan, Marco Felli', null, 'Lena is seven months pregnant and she''s ready to sell the baby in her belly. Ermanno agrees to pretend to be the father. Fabio, the uncle of Ermanno, will pay them to buy the child that he and his wife Bianca cannot have. A fake adoption between relatives, a loophole to bypass the law in Italy. A world in which money is the only standard of value, the only thing that matters. Ermanno and Lena are two strangers that must pretend in public to be a couple and live together until the delivery. They are used to only thinking about themselves and they fight all the time. But living side by side they start becoming what they were only pretending to be.', 'Lena is seven months pregnant and she''s ready to sell the baby in her belly. Ermanno agrees to pretend to be the father. Fabio, the uncle of Ermanno, will pay them to buy the child that he and his wife Bianca cannot have. A fake adoption between relatives, a loophole to bypass the law in Italy. A world in which money is the only standard of value, the only thing that matters. Ermanno and Lena are two strangers that must pretend in public to be a couple and live together until the delivery. They are used to only thinking about themselves and they fight all the time. But living side by side they start becoming what they were only pretending to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6z26FcHI59WQG8VdaJEGdH1CbUT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582907'),
  ('940625784587538791', 'Sole Survivor', 1970, 'Drama, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Paul Stanley, James Crabe', 'Guerdon Trueblood', 'Vince Edwards, Richard Basehart, William Shatner, Lou Antonio, Lawrence P. Casey, Dennis Cooney, Brad David, Patrick Wayne', null, 'In 1960, the ruins of an American bomber were found in the Libyan desert, but the remains of the crew were never located. In Guerdon Trueblood''s teleplay, the ghosts of a bomber crew hang around their derelict plane, awaiting the day that their bones will be recovered and given a decent burial. The sole survivor, navigator Russell Hamner, has in the intervening 25 years become a General. He joins an investigation team that has come across the wreckage, while the ghosts, headed by Major Devlin, plot to expose Hamner as a coward who deserted his post and left his crew mates to die.', 'In 1960, the ruins of an American bomber were found in the Libyan desert, but the remains of the crew were never located. In Guerdon Trueblood''s teleplay, the ghosts of a bomber crew hang around their derelict plane, awaiting the day that their bones will be recovered and given a decent burial. The sole survivor, navigator Russell Hamner, has in the intervening 25 years become a General. He joins an investigation team that has come across the wreckage, while the ghosts, headed by Major Devlin, plot to expose Hamner as a coward who deserted his post and left his crew mates to die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuCUp9VxbVSvPkGSnvxWHGKwM7V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54588'),
  ('1014402387058627490', 'Sole Survivor', 1984, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Thom Eberhardt, Russell Carpenter', 'Thom Eberhardt', 'Anita Skinner, Kurt Johnson, Robin Davidson, Caren L. Larkey, Andrew Boyer, Daniel Bryan Cartwell, Brinke Stevens, Al Valletta', 'R', 'After inexplicably surviving a plane crash, TV station worker Denise tries to get on with her life. She soon learns that she was actually supposed to die in the crash. Death refuses to be cheated and starts sending its minions, people that have recently died, to collect her.', 'After inexplicably surviving a plane crash, TV station worker Denise tries to get on with her life. She soon learns that she was actually supposed to die in the crash. Death refuses to be cheated and starts sending its minions, people that have recently died, to collect her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4XU7MrjYrynL6IzFFXRjfLdyIMc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29611'),
  ('817587568689631158', 'Soledad', 2018, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Daniel Ortega, Agustina Macri', 'Paolo Logli, Martín Caparrós, Agustina Macri', 'Vera Spinetta, Marco Cocci, Giulio Maria Corso, Marco Leonardi, Francesco De Vito, Eleonora Giovanardi, Maurizio Lombardi, Giorgio Colangeli', null, 'Love and Anarchy is a dramatic love story based on true events. Two lovers immersed in a repressive political context. A government that portrays them as criminals and the people who regard them as anarchist heroes.', 'Love and Anarchy is a dramatic love story based on true events. Two lovers immersed in a repressive political context. A government that portrays them as criminals and the people who regard them as anarchist heroes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dlom3YFJhIxJX07i8ZQROW25sqo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:549871'),
  ('9819885300225866', 'Soleil', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Roger Hanin', 'Roger Hanin', 'Roger Hanin, Sophia Loren, Philippe Noiret, Roger Dumas, Michel Creton, Marianne Sägebrecht, Josiane Stoléru, Attica Guedj', null, 'During a happy evening, the famous professor Levy, one of the masters of cardiac surgery, collapses, struck by a heart attack. His whole life comes back to him, and in particular his childhood, enlightened by a loving and beloved mother.', 'During a happy evening, the famous professor Levy, one of the masters of cardiac surgery, collapses, struck by a heart attack. His whole life comes back to him, and in particular his childhood, enlightened by a loving and beloved mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6vluNfkD2OkmtMFR7nwdJoqv46r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212125'),
  ('1007168813827630381', 'Soleil O', 1973, 'Drama', 'Med Hondo, Jean-Claude Rahaga, François Catonné', 'Med Hondo', 'Robert Liensol, Théo Légitimus, Ambroise Mbia, Gabriel Glissant, Akonio Dolo, Greg Germain, Jean-Baptiste Tiémélé, Mabousso Lo', null, 'An educated native of Mauritania tries to find work in Paris but encounters difficulty because of his race.', 'An educated native of Mauritania tries to find work in Paris but encounters difficulty because of his race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7M2tN7WYcFbB15I3UcOmdM854uJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195841'),
  ('700020017115788261', 'Solid Serenade', 1946, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Buck Woods, William Hanna, Billy Bletcher, Jerry Mann', 'NR', 'Tom ties up Spike and sneaks into the courtyard of the glamorous Toodles Galore with his bass, hoping to woo her with his song, much to the annoyance of a sleeping Jerry.', 'Tom ties up Spike and sneaks into the courtyard of the glamorous Toodles Galore with his bass, hoping to woo her with his song, much to the annoyance of a sleeping Jerry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5TYLWhM7qKpgr42FPMGxPU3dgMx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39887'),
  ('690931508844841921', 'Solino', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Fatih Akin, Rainer Klausmann', 'Ruth Toma', 'Barnaby Metschurat, Moritz Bleibtreu, Gigi Savoia, Antonella Attili, Patrycia Ziolkowska, Hermann Lause, Lucas Gregorowicz, Tiziana Lodato', null, 'The movie portrays the story of an Italian family emigrated in Germany in the 1970s. Romano (Gigi Savoia), the father, decides to open a pizzeria which, by mutual decision with the wife Rosa (Antonella Attili), will call Solino, leaving his sons Gigi and Giancarlo to work there. A hostile relationship comes to life between the father and his sons, which will end up in the escape of the boys from family.', 'The movie portrays the story of an Italian family emigrated in Germany in the 1970s. Romano (Gigi Savoia), the father, decides to open a pizzeria which, by mutual decision with the wife Rosa (Antonella Attili), will call Solino, leaving his sons Gigi and Giancarlo to work there. A hostile relationship comes to life between the father and his sons, which will end up in the escape of the boys from family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFtE6RBMnZd2bXu7n8yy0jszdFB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11628'),
  ('520794038030813347', 'Solis', 2018, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Carl Strathie, Bart Sienkiewicz, Killian Menigot', 'Carl Strathie', 'Steven Ogg, Alice Lowe, Kate Coogan, Henry Douthwaite, Charlette Kilby, Sid Phoenix', null, 'Following an accident, an Engineer of an asteroid mining company endures the extreme limits – both physical and psychological – of human survival, trapped inside an escape pod as he helplessly idles towards the Sun.', 'Following an accident, an Engineer of an asteroid mining company endures the extreme limits – both physical and psychological – of human survival, trapped inside an escape pod as he helplessly idles towards the Sun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lea5bLww1ZwbNPRVk0RjB34xxVg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529646'),
  ('582561656969001491', 'Solitary', 2020, 'Science Fiction', 'Luke Armstrong, Jack Booth, Porl Matthews', 'Luke Armstrong', 'Johnny Sachon, Lottie Tolhurst, Brian Bovell, Connie Jenkins-Greig, Michael Condron, Raymond Bethley, Michael Absalom, Andre Pierre', null, 'A man wakes up inside a room to discover he''s a prisoner sent into space to form Earth''s first colony, and worse - his cell mate Alana is hell bent on destroying everything.', 'A man wakes up inside a room to discover he''s a prisoner sent into space to form Earth''s first colony, and worse - his cell mate Alana is hell bent on destroying everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ApwmbrMlsuOay5rXQA4Kbz7qJAl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:725273'),
  ('548987972772776802', 'Solitary Fragments', 2007, 'Drama', 'Jaime Rosales, Sara Bilbatúa', 'Enric Rufas, Jaime Rosales', 'Sonia Almarcha, Petra Martínez, Miriam Correa, Nuria Mencía, María Bazán, Jesús Cracio, Lluís Xavier Villanueva, José Luis Torrijo', null, 'Adela and her baby move to Madrid in search of a new start after a tough separation. Antonia is a shop owner with three adult daughters. The film is divided into five chapters revolving around their health, work, relationships and money.', 'Adela and her baby move to Madrid in search of a new start after a tough separation. Antonia is a shop owner with three adult daughters. The film is divided into five chapters revolving around their health, work, relationships and money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afryVkjl9PjzAx8dG12H68T1xIn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39489'),
  ('192640968084276538', 'Solitary Man', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'David Levien, Brian Koppelman, Steve Apicella', 'Brian Koppelman, David Levien', 'Michael Douglas, Susan Sarandon, Danny DeVito, Mary-Louise Parker, Jenna Fischer, Imogen Poots, Jesse Eisenberg, Richard Schiff', 'R', 'A car magnate watches his personal and professional life hit the skids because of his business and romantic indiscretions.', 'A car magnate watches his personal and professional life hit the skids because of his business and romantic indiscretions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Dpm8QDoL3w3ZOwVl6rgvjRWxrj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36691'),
  ('22996334924914010', 'Solo', 1970, 'Crime, Drama', 'Marcel Weiss, Jean-Pierre Mocky', 'Alain Moury, Jean-Pierre Mocky', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky, Sylvie Bréal, Anne Deleuze, Denis Le Guillou, René-Jean Chauffard, Marcel Pérès, Éric Burnelli, Alain Fourès', null, 'During an orgy, Some old and wealthy notables are being murdered by a small group of leftist young revolutionaries. Very soon the police are tracking down Virgile Cabral, the leader of the group. Meanwhile, Virgile''s brother and only relative, Vincent, a violinist (and a thief), comes back to Paris. They have not seen each other for three years. Vincent does not believe in the revolution. He only tries to live as he wishes to live. But by looking for his hunted down brother, he has no other choice than to be involved in a fight that is not his.', 'During an orgy, Some old and wealthy notables are being murdered by a small group of leftist young revolutionaries. Very soon the police are tracking down Virgile Cabral, the leader of the group. Meanwhile, Virgile''s brother and only relative, Vincent, a violinist (and a thief), comes back to Paris. They have not seen each other for three years. Vincent does not believe in the revolution. He only tries to live as he wishes to live. But by looking for his hunted down brother, he has no other choice than to be involved in a fight that is not his.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8700EKTT4SVsjPRwvprnVY485y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116048'),
  ('1031089882000321596', 'Solo', 1980, 'Drama, War', 'Konstantin Lopushansky, Anatoly Lapshov', 'Konstantin Lopushansky', 'Mykola Hrynko, Svetlana Smirnova, Viktor Gogolev, Lyudmila Arzhannikova, Olga Volkova, Valentina Smirnova, Nora Gryakalova, Kirill Gun', null, 'Lopushansky''s second film focuses on a few hours in the life of a soloist musician during the siege of Leningrad, in WWII. The Leningrad philharmonic is going to play Tchaikovsky''s 5th Symphony, which is to be broadcast to England. The soloist, like his fellow musicians, is weak and half-starved, and doubts whether he will be able to perform well enough.', 'Lopushansky''s second film focuses on a few hours in the life of a soloist musician during the siege of Leningrad, in WWII. The Leningrad philharmonic is going to play Tchaikovsky''s 5th Symphony, which is to be broadcast to England. The soloist, like his fellow musicians, is weak and half-starved, and doubts whether he will be able to perform well enough.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnDYmpYaDclS1bw2DSmTBN8pX5X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22114'),
  ('71757702445658492', 'Solo', 1996, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Norberto Barba, Christopher Walling', 'David L. Corley', 'Mario Van Peebles, Barry Corbin, William Sadler, Jaime Osorio Gómez, Demián Bichir, Seidy López, Abraham Verduzco, Joaquín Garrido', 'PG-13', 'An android fighting-machine is charged with destroying a small brigade of rebels in a Latin American war who are fighting to maintain their freedom and protect their village. Contrary to his programming, Peebles decides to stay and assist the rebels in their plight. Having gained this information, his "creators" develop a more powerful android to try and defeat him.', 'An android fighting-machine is charged with destroying a small brigade of rebels in a Latin American war who are fighting to maintain their freedom and protect their village. Contrary to his programming, Peebles decides to stay and assist the rebels in their plight. Having gained this information, his "creators" develop a more powerful android to try and defeat him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qqdpyYVnU5zY5KsTKCIp5gpZoV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29621'),
  ('727570682812332467', 'Solo', 2018, 'Thriller, Drama, Adventure', 'Hugo Stuven Casasnovas, Ángel Iguacel', 'Hugo Stuven Casasnovas, Santiago Lallana', 'Alain Hernández, Aura Garrido, Ben Temple, Leticia Etala, Alvaro Vizcaino', null, 'After falling off a cliff and suffering substantial injures, for 48 long hours a young surfer must face a merciless nature and his own physical and mental agony to try to survive.', 'After falling off a cliff and suffering substantial injures, for 48 long hours a young surfer must face a merciless nature and his own physical and mental agony to try to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67hdBNRmCeKYrEvBU5flH6aUt3G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518880'),
  ('742088589653480941', 'Solo', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sophie Dupuis, Mathieu Laverdière', 'Sophie Dupuis', 'Théodore Pellerin, Félix Maritaud, Alice Moreault, Anne-Marie Cadieux, Tommy Joubert, Vlad Alexis, Jean Marchand, Marc-André Leclair', null, 'Emerging Montreal drag queen Simon must deal with two impossible loves: a passionate, yet destructive affair with Olivier and a cold relationship with his mother, who''s just returned after fifteen years.', 'Emerging Montreal drag queen Simon must deal with two impossible loves: a passionate, yet destructive affair with Olivier and a cold relationship with his mother, who''s just returned after fifteen years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpARDBnmPKDgsTon2Sb6z4MXqmB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:952200'),
  ('1089724346203862453', 'Sólo con tu pareja', 1992, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Alfonso Cuarón, Emmanuel Lubezki, Enrique Arroyo', 'Alfonso Cuarón, Carlos Cuarón', 'Daniel Giménez Cacho, Claudia Ramírez, Luis de Icaza, Astrid Hadad, Dobrina Liubomirova, Isabel Benet, Luz María Jerez, Monserrat Ontiveros', null, 'Tomás Tomás is a young yuppie playboy with a string of discarded girlfriends. But when Silvia, the victim of one of his adventures, tries to get revenge by typing "positive" on his AIDS test, Tomás experiences for the first time the realities of love and death.', 'Tomás Tomás is a young yuppie playboy with a string of discarded girlfriends. But when Silvia, the victim of one of his adventures, tries to get revenge by typing "positive" on his AIDS test, Tomás experiences for the first time the realities of love and death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pprKQ637rH8ClRMS75VnRtUCiL9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49971'),
  ('277944843053570792', 'Solo Leveling -ReAwakening-', 2024, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Animation', 'Shunsuke Nakashige', null, 'Taito Ban, Genta Nakamura, Haruna Mikawa, Reina Ueda, Daisuke Hirakawa, Hiroki Touchi, Banjo Ginga, Makoto Furukawa', 'R', 'Over a decade after ''gates'' connecting worlds appeared, awakening ''hunters'' with superpowers, weakest hunter Sung Jinwoo encounters a double dungeon and accepts a mysterious quest, becoming the only one able to level up, changing his fate. A catch-up recap of the first season coupled with an exclusive sneak peek of the first two episodes of the highly anticipated second season in one momentous theatrical fan experience.', 'Over a decade after ''gates'' connecting worlds appeared, awakening ''hunters'' with superpowers, weakest hunter Sung Jinwoo encounters a double dungeon and accepts a mysterious quest, becoming the only one able to level up, changing his fate. A catch-up recap of the first season coupled with an exclusive sneak peek of the first two episodes of the highly anticipated second season in one momentous theatrical fan experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dblIFen0bNZAq8icJXHwrjfymDW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1357633'),
  ('137406561128259970', 'Solo mía', 2001, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Javier Balaguer, Juan Molina', 'Javier Balaguer, Álvaro García Mohedano', 'Sergi López, Paz Vega, Elvira Mínguez, Alberto Jiménez, María José Alfonso, Beatriz Bergamín, Asunción Balaguer, Ginés García Millán', null, 'A women meets a charming man and falls in love, they get married and start a family. As they age and have children, the man''s becomes violent and abusive.', 'A women meets a charming man and falls in love, they get married and start a family. As they age and have children, the man''s becomes violent and abusive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mObRNyGodg9NiRmVwe259H3JrU3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2435'),
  ('578404098292622047', 'Solo Mio', 2026, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Daniel Kinnane, Charles Kinnane, Jared Fadel', 'Kevin James, Patrick Kinnane, John Kinnane', 'Kevin James, Nicole Grimaudo, Kim Coates, Jonathan Roumie, Julie Ann Emery, Julee Cerda, Andrea Bocelli, Caterina Silva', 'PG', 'After Matt''s dreams of a picturesque Italian wedding are shattered when his fiancée leaves him at the altar, he embarks on his planned honeymoon across Italy alone, immersing himself in the country''s vibrant culture, food, and beauty, meeting Gia along the way.', 'After Matt''s dreams of a picturesque Italian wedding are shattered when his fiancée leaves him at the altar, he embarks on his planned honeymoon across Italy alone, immersing himself in the country''s vibrant culture, food, and beauty, meeting Gia along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/efSsZJaddeq0LOABZqpCXdMxv9P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1291335'),
  ('190670438610259141', 'Solo Somos Carne', 2022, 'Horror', 'Mako Graves', null, 'Alexis Herrera Alquijay, Victor Arroyo, Kiara Bennett, Andrés Pérez Bravo, Gabriela Carías, André Fong, Andrea López, Yessica Miranda', null, 'A regular day for Bans and Uzu, little did they know a series of events would bring them face to face with an alternate reality and their chance to confront Dixon, a disturbed psychopath with blood on his hands and demons in his mind.', 'A regular day for Bans and Uzu, little did they know a series of events would bring them face to face with an alternate reality and their chance to confront Dixon, a disturbed psychopath with blood on his hands and demons in his mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9eVqMhZEbq53VFbmRNqh3yzT0xM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1104191'),
  ('280946225697954403', 'Solo Sunny', 1980, 'Drama, Music', 'Konrad Wolf, Eberhard Geick, Wolfgang Kohlhaase', 'Wolfgang Kohlhaase, Konrad Wolf', 'Renate Krößner, Fred Düren, Ursula Braun, Heide Kipp, Dieter Montag, Alexander Lang, Klaus Brasch, Ulrich Anschütz', null, 'Sunny is the singer of band trying to establish itself in the music-scene of East-Berlin. They play regular gigs in small towns, but Sunny feels out of touch with the audience and her life as a whole. She begins a relationship with the amateur saxophonist and studied philosopher Ralph who writes her a very personal song - but his obsession with death and unfaithful lifestyle is not for her. After getting into a quarrel with a band member who harasses her and telling off a show-host she is thrown out of the band. Abandoned, she struggles to regain control over her life.', 'Sunny is the singer of band trying to establish itself in the music-scene of East-Berlin. They play regular gigs in small towns, but Sunny feels out of touch with the audience and her life as a whole. She begins a relationship with the amateur saxophonist and studied philosopher Ralph who writes her a very personal song - but his obsession with death and unfaithful lifestyle is not for her. After getting into a quarrel with a band member who harasses her and telling off a show-host she is thrown out of the band. Abandoned, she struggles to regain control over her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iULQFKitbtYb3T7IbGjGi49hZPZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1906'),
  ('421730517748105582', 'Solo: A Star Wars Story', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Thomas Bentley, Toby Hefferman, Bradford Young', 'Lawrence Kasdan, Jon Kasdan', 'Alden Ehrenreich, Joonas Suotamo, Woody Harrelson, Emilia Clarke, Donald Glover, Thandiwe Newton, Phoebe Waller-Bridge, Paul Bettany', 'PG-13', 'Through a series of daring escapades deep within a dark and dangerous criminal underworld, Han Solo meets his mighty future copilot Chewbacca and encounters the notorious gambler Lando Calrissian.', 'Through a series of daring escapades deep within a dark and dangerous criminal underworld, Han Solo meets his mighty future copilot Chewbacca and encounters the notorious gambler Lando Calrissian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oD6VEccFkorEBTEDXtpLAaz0Rl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348350'),
  ('223808346258909918', 'Soloalbum', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gregor Schnitzler, Gero Steffen, Basia Baumann', 'Jens-Frederik Otto', 'Matthias Schweighöfer, Nora Tschirner, Oliver Wnuk, Christian Näthe, Lisa Maria Potthoff, Matthias Matschke, Thorsten Feller, Julia Dietze', null, 'Ben is a young editor for a famous german music magazine in the mid 90''s. His life is falling apart after his girlfriend breaks up with him. From now on he decides to go solo...', 'Ben is a young editor for a famous german music magazine in the mid 90''s. His life is falling apart after his girlfriend breaks up with him. From now on he decides to go solo...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wFe3VnOK6q85PS7eNwHQcKPm8Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9295'),
  ('1061704677334097556', 'Solomon', 1997, 'Adventure, Drama, TV Movie', 'Roger Young, Raffaele Mertes', null, 'Ben Cross, Maria Grazia Cucinotta, Stefania Rocca, Vivica A. Fox, Anouk Aimée, Max von Sydow, Umberto Orsini, Richard Dillane', 'PG-13', 'David, now an old man, is still king of Israel. Among his sons, the ambitious Adonijah and the clever Solomon, fierce rivals, since both are prospective heirs to the throne and only one can be.', 'David, now an old man, is still king of Israel. Among his sons, the ambitious Adonijah and the clever Solomon, fierce rivals, since both are prospective heirs to the throne and only one can be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gBvQnYlLHqRBabf1OJwD01CSr0h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58430'),
  ('579616858882426352', 'Solomon & Gaenor', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Paul Morrison, Jonathan Hunter, Jon Williams', 'Paul Morrison', 'Ioan Gruffudd, Nia Roberts, Sue Jones-Davies, William Thomas, Mark Lewis Jones, Maureen Lipman, David Horovitch, Steffan Rhodri', 'R', 'A young Jew in 1911 Wales tries to make his living by selling fabrics door to door, but to do so he must hide his nationality. On one of his sales he meets and falls in love with a demure young woman with a strong-willed father and a Jew-hating brother. The two fall in love and she becomes pregnant, but only then does she learn of his ethnic background. When anti-Jewish riots break out, the two are forced to flee and become separated.', 'A young Jew in 1911 Wales tries to make his living by selling fabrics door to door, but to do so he must hide his nationality. On one of his sales he meets and falls in love with a demure young woman with a strong-willed father and a Jew-hating brother. The two fall in love and she becomes pregnant, but only then does she learn of his ethnic background. When anti-Jewish riots break out, the two are forced to flee and become separated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6gpjGinYKoJxZyMqXiOGRmDxLZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81517'),
  ('268132627025672126', 'Solomon and Sheba', 1959, 'History, Romance, War', 'King Vidor, Freddie Young, Joseph E. Kenney', 'Crane Wilbur', 'Yul Brynner, Gina Lollobrigida, George Sanders, Marisa Pavan, David Farrar, John Crawford, Finlay Currie, Harry Andrews', null, 'Near death, King David has a vision that his poet son, Solomon, should succeed him, rather than hot-headed Adonijah. Furious, Adonijah departs the court, swearing he will become king. Other rulers are concerned that Solomon''s benevolent rule and interest in monotheism will threaten their tyrannical, polytheistic kingdoms. The Queen of Sheba makes an agreement with the Egyptian pharaoh to corrupt Solomon for their mutual benefit.', 'Near death, King David has a vision that his poet son, Solomon, should succeed him, rather than hot-headed Adonijah. Furious, Adonijah departs the court, swearing he will become king. Other rulers are concerned that Solomon''s benevolent rule and interest in monotheism will threaten their tyrannical, polytheistic kingdoms. The Queen of Sheba makes an agreement with the Egyptian pharaoh to corrupt Solomon for their mutual benefit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQPLRT014vOADFyvh54TpXFyBPZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29996'),
  ('8142619691236994', 'Solomon Kane', 2009, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Dan Laustsen, MJ Bassett, Tim Wooster', 'MJ Bassett', 'James Purefoy, Pete Postlethwaite, Alice Krige, Mackenzie Crook, Max von Sydow, Jason Flemyng, Rachel Hurd-Wood, Mark O''Neal', 'R', 'A nomadic 16th century warrior, condemned to hell for his brutal past, seeks redemption by renouncing violence, but finds some things are worth burning for as he fights to free a young Puritan woman from the grip of evil.', 'A nomadic 16th century warrior, condemned to hell for his brutal past, seeks redemption by renouncing violence, but finds some things are worth burning for as he fights to free a young Puritan woman from the grip of evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwwVNuGRUBXcudG6wOKP9U60BzU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32985'),
