  ('883639290259285359', 'Solstorm', 2007, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Leif Lindblom', 'Jimmy Lagnefors', 'Izabella Scorupco, Mikael Persbrandt, Jakob Eklund, Krister Henriksson, Suzanne Reuter, Lena B. Eriksson, Maria Sundbom, Antti Reini', null, 'While in a party promoted by her chief and friend Måns Wenngren, the fiscal attorney, Rebecka Martinsson, receives a call from her former sister-in-law, Sanna Strandgård, telling that her brother and preacher Viktor was murdered, stabbed and with severed hands, and she would be arrested. Rebecka heads to her hometown Kiruna and defends Sanna, but the evidences found by the police in her house prove her guilty and she is arrested. While investigating the crime, Rebecka is haunted by her past and faces the bigoted and fanatic religious dwellers that worship the local church, and is more convinced of the innocence of Sanna.', 'While in a party promoted by her chief and friend Måns Wenngren, the fiscal attorney, Rebecka Martinsson, receives a call from her former sister-in-law, Sanna Strandgård, telling that her brother and preacher Viktor was murdered, stabbed and with severed hands, and she would be arrested. Rebecka heads to her hometown Kiruna and defends Sanna, but the evidences found by the police in her house prove her guilty and she is arrested. While investigating the crime, Rebecka is haunted by her past and faces the bigoted and fanatic religious dwellers that worship the local church, and is more convinced of the innocence of Sanna.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7t0VsozxqgvH9sbTCRWCyqJBUn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39903'),
  ('678928858509739188', 'Soltera, casada, viuda, divorciada 2', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Ani Alva Helfer, Pablo Desanzo', null, 'Gianella Neyra, Milene Vásquez, Patricia Portocarrero, Katia Condos, Rodrigo Palacios, Gabriela Velásquez', null, 'Four friends embark on a snowy getaway to help Lorena confront her fear of marriage. Now in different stages of life, they each seek to escape the struggles of their daily realities. But what begins as a lighthearted trip soon becomes a journey inward, one that reconnects them with their past selves and forces them to confront the childhood wounds that still weigh on them.', 'Four friends embark on a snowy getaway to help Lorena confront her fear of marriage. Now in different stages of life, they each seek to escape the struggles of their daily realities. But what begins as a lighthearted trip soon becomes a journey inward, one that reconnects them with their past selves and forces them to confront the childhood wounds that still weigh on them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vGti5pNo3qsAiZJHDo1ipxSmU5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1354314'),
