  ('188295173723274949', 'Some Beasts', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Eduardo Bunster, Jorge Riquelme Serrano', 'Nicolás Diodovich, Jorge Riquelme Serrano', 'Paulina García, Alfredo Castro, Andrew Bargsted, Gastón Salgado, Consuelo Carreño, Millaray Lobos, Nicolás Zárate', null, 'A family travels to a remote island in southern Chile. During the trip they try to convince the grandparents to support them financially to build a hotel in the place. Nicolás, the man who crossed them disappears, leaving the family trapped on the island, the smiles begin to disappear. With cold, without water and without certainties, tempers are diluted, exposing the tensions that each member of the family hides.', 'A family travels to a remote island in southern Chile. During the trip they try to convince the grandparents to support them financially to build a hotel in the place. Nicolás, the man who crossed them disappears, leaving the family trapped on the island, the smiles begin to disappear. With cold, without water and without certainties, tempers are diluted, exposing the tensions that each member of the family hides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLNrsXHvT1U24EQeVTCPwmsYKwu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574952'),
