  ('92569086844135316', 'Some Came Running', 1958, 'Drama, Romance', 'Vincente Minnelli, William H. Daniels, William McGarry', 'John Patrick, Arthur Sheekman', 'Frank Sinatra, Dean Martin, Shirley MacLaine, Martha Hyer, Arthur Kennedy, Nancy Gates, Leora Dana, Betty Lou Keim', 'NR', 'A former novelist returns to his small Midwest town after serving in the Army during WWII, to the chagrin of his social-climbing brother, and becomes close with an easy-going professional gambler and torn between two very different women.', 'A former novelist returns to his small Midwest town after serving in the Army during WWII, to the chagrin of his social-climbing brother, and becomes close with an easy-going professional gambler and torn between two very different women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFivW0sMerjzWmC6GI8axAfc5xy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38724'),
  ('479330717183521751', 'Some Folks Call It a Sling Blade', 1994, 'Drama, Thriller', 'George Hickenlooper, Kent L. Wakeford', 'Billy Bob Thornton', 'Billy Bob Thornton, Molly Ringwald, J.T. Walsh, Jefferson Mays, Suzanne Cryer, Abby Abernathy, Brent Briscoe, Otto Coelho', null, '25 years after committing a double murder, Karl Childers is going to be released from an institution for the criminally insane. A local reporter comes to talk to him, and listens in horror about his life leading up to the crime. This is the short film that inspired the full-length "Sling Blade".', '25 years after committing a double murder, Karl Childers is going to be released from an institution for the criminally insane. A local reporter comes to talk to him, and listens in horror about his life leading up to the crime. This is the short film that inspired the full-length "Sling Blade".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zP5jcbckIq4yWzGq6n2TkCPIGIC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27768'),
  ('653704443803178872', 'Some Freaks', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Ian McDonald', 'Ian McDonald', 'Lily Mae Harrington, Thomas Mann, Marin Ireland, Lachlan Buchanan, Ely Henry, Ryan Boudreau', null, 'A charming romance develops between a boy with one eye and an overweight girl, though when she loses weight after going to college, their relationship is tested in devastating ways they never dreamed would happen.', 'A charming romance develops between a boy with one eye and an overweight girl, though when she loses weight after going to college, their relationship is tested in devastating ways they never dreamed would happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3S6tJCLfJ1HcDPOU8JtXn5c0xx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402464'),
  ('892920166431920507', 'Some Girl', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Rory Kelly, Amy Vincent', 'Marissa Ribisi, Brie Shaffer', 'Marissa Ribisi, Juliette Lewis, Michael Rapaport, Giovanni Ribisi, Jeremy Sisto, Pamela Adlon, Trevor Goddard, Kristin Dattilo', 'R', 'Inexperienced in love and living in Los Angeles, aspiring actress Claire longs to find that special someone. Unfortunately, she couldn''t pick a more undeserving guy when she starts a relationship with womanizer Chad. Although her friend April warns her about him, it''s not as if April doesn''t have problems of her own -- namely a chronic inability to stay faithful to her longtime boyfriend, Neal.', 'Inexperienced in love and living in Los Angeles, aspiring actress Claire longs to find that special someone. Unfortunately, she couldn''t pick a more undeserving guy when she starts a relationship with womanizer Chad. Although her friend April warns her about him, it''s not as if April doesn''t have problems of her own -- namely a chronic inability to stay faithful to her longtime boyfriend, Neal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xeI6NXZyBaTGkMZIPAXK7ovTEOH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146373'),
  ('406135465012505866', 'Some Girl(s)', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Daisy von Scherler Mayer, Rachel Morrison', 'Neil LaBute', 'Adam Brody, Kristen Bell, Zoe Kazan, Mía Maestro, Jennifer Morrison, Emily Watson, Kathleen Christy, Laura Mann', 'NR', 'On the eve of his wedding, a successful writer travels around the country to meet up with ex-lovers in an attempt to make amends for his wrongdoings.', 'On the eve of his wedding, a successful writer travels around the country to meet up with ex-lovers in an attempt to make amends for his wrongdoings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozz4epRp9QMxZx8Uj5BQl8rhveb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172897'),
  ('252202093353676996', 'Some Girls', 1988, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Michael Hoffman, Ueli Steiger', 'Rupert Walters', 'Patrick Dempsey, Jennifer Connelly, Sheila Kelley, Lila Kedrova, Florinda Bolkan, Andre Gregory, Ashley Greenfield, Sanna Vraa', 'R', 'While on Christmas break, college student Michael journeys to Quebec City to spend time with his attractive girlfriend, Gabriella. Not long after he arrives, Gabriella breaks up with him, but her two equally gorgeous sisters waste no time showing romantic interest. In the meantime, Michael is left to deal with Gabriella''s eccentric grandmother and offbeat father, an academic who spends most of his time naked.', 'While on Christmas break, college student Michael journeys to Quebec City to spend time with his attractive girlfriend, Gabriella. Not long after he arrives, Gabriella breaks up with him, but her two equally gorgeous sisters waste no time showing romantic interest. In the meantime, Michael is left to deal with Gabriella''s eccentric grandmother and offbeat father, an academic who spends most of his time naked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZz3RKDstcniOSyo0yFr2DP9liB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31083'),
  ('434662212645486571', 'Some Girls Do', 1969, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Ernest Steward, Ralph Thomas, Simon Relph', 'David D. Osborn, Liz Charles-Williams', 'Richard Johnson, Daliah Lavi, Beba Lončar, James Villiers, Vanessa Howard, Maurice Denham, Robert Morley, Sydne Rome', 'R', 'A series of unexplainable accidents befall the people and companies responsible for developing the world''s first supersonic airliner. A British agent is sent to investigate and with the help of another agent uncovers a plot masterminded by Carl Petersen who stands to gain eight million pounds if the aircraft is not ready by a certain date.', 'A series of unexplainable accidents befall the people and companies responsible for developing the world''s first supersonic airliner. A British agent is sent to investigate and with the help of another agent uncovers a plot masterminded by Carl Petersen who stands to gain eight million pounds if the aircraft is not ready by a certain date.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJPkFpHNChAIXZKo7Gfo5i0RnhS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26181'),
  ('69988635932639739', 'Some Guy Who Kills People', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller, Comedy', 'Jack Perez, Shawn Maurer', 'Ryan Levin', 'Kevin Corrigan, Barry Bostwick, Karen Black, Leo Fitzpatrick, Ariel Gade, Eric Price, Lucy Davis, Lou Beatty Jr.', 'R', 'A former mental patient''s repressed anger reaches the boiling point, leading him to embark on a mission of revenge against the thugs who once subjected him to severe physical and mental trauma.', 'A former mental patient''s repressed anger reaches the boiling point, leading him to embark on a mission of revenge against the thugs who once subjected him to severe physical and mental trauma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3k8CeFdvTOiKaRCnXQ9I7WuazQi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80468'),
  ('85667019685035482', 'Some Kind of Beautiful', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tom Vaughan, Joe McDougall, Timothy Grant Engle', 'Matthew Newman', 'Pierce Brosnan, Jessica Alba, Salma Hayek Pinault, Duncan Joiner, Ben McKenzie, Malcolm McDowell, Merrin Dungey, Fred Melamed', 'R', 'By day, Richard Haig is a successful and well-respected English professor at renowned Trinity College in Cambridge. By night, Richard indulges his own romantic fantasies with a steady stream of beautiful undergraduates. But Richard has grown tired of the game and is looking for something more meaningful and lasting. So when Kate, Richard’s tanned, athletic, 25-year-old American girlfriend tells him that she is pregnant, Richard is thrilled. He looks forward to having a family of his own, being a father his children could be proud of, not some sex-fueled bobcat. There is only one problem. Richard’s not in love with Kate. Richard is in love with Kate’s sister, Olivia. He had been in love with her ever since he first saw her.', 'By day, Richard Haig is a successful and well-respected English professor at renowned Trinity College in Cambridge. By night, Richard indulges his own romantic fantasies with a steady stream of beautiful undergraduates. But Richard has grown tired of the game and is looking for something more meaningful and lasting. So when Kate, Richard’s tanned, athletic, 25-year-old American girlfriend tells him that she is pregnant, Richard is thrilled. He looks forward to having a family of his own, being a father his children could be proud of, not some sex-fueled bobcat. There is only one problem. Richard’s not in love with Kate. Richard is in love with Kate’s sister, Olivia. He had been in love with her ever since he first saw her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubuc8fRcT0I5lF4Q5P5lnyrZJJg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253344'),
  ('186659509333717029', 'Some Kind of Hate', 2015, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Adam Egypt Mortimer, Benji Bakshi, Daniel Ringey', 'Adam Egypt Mortimer, Brian DeLeeuw', 'Ronen Rubinstein, Sierra McCormick, Gracie Gillam, Lexi Atkins, Spencer Breslin, Noah Segan, Michael Polish, Maestro Harrell', null, 'When troubled teen Lincoln is subjected to severe bullying, he accidentally conjures the vengeful ghost of Moira Karp. Once a teenage girl pushed to suicide, Moira is now an unstoppable force on a mission of gruesome retribution. But when she goes too far, Lincoln must prevent her from spiraling out of control.', 'When troubled teen Lincoln is subjected to severe bullying, he accidentally conjures the vengeful ghost of Moira Karp. Once a teenage girl pushed to suicide, Moira is now an unstoppable force on a mission of gruesome retribution. But when she goes too far, Lincoln must prevent her from spiraling out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/61dDiDbYgs3dXRVomk976Lf5G7Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334028'),
  ('1139908013112320289', 'Some Kind of Heaven', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Lance Oppenheim, David Bolen', null, 'Dennis Dean, Lynn Henry, Anne Kincer, Reggie Kincer, Gary Schwartz, Barbara Stanton', null, 'Behind the gates of a palm-tree-lined fantasyland, three residents and one interloper at America’s largest retirement community strive to find happiness.', 'Behind the gates of a palm-tree-lined fantasyland, three residents and one interloper at America’s largest retirement community strive to find happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4L0OAHeo2B413QKK5HRiWMzdKUy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:638741'),
  ('180127982824739449', 'Some Kind of Hero', 1982, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Pressman, King Baggot', 'Robert Boris', 'Richard Pryor, Margot Kidder, Ray Sharkey, Ronny Cox, Lynne Moody, Olivia Cole, Paul Benjamin, David Adams', 'R', 'A Vietnam vet returns home from a prisoner of war camp and is greeted as a hero, but is quickly forgotten and soon discovers how tough survival is in his own country.', 'A Vietnam vet returns home from a prisoner of war camp and is greeted as a hero, but is quickly forgotten and soon discovers how tough survival is in his own country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TV2IIkGsRj3r1YzQtJ5BR6c3X0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37607'),
  ('617549702887590785', 'Some Kind of Wonderful', 1987, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Howard Deutch, Bryan Denegal, Jerry Ziesmer', 'John Hughes', 'Eric Stoltz, Mary Stuart Masterson, Lea Thompson, Chynna Phillips, Craig Sheffer, John Ashton, Elias Koteas, Maddie Corman', 'PG-13', 'Keith Nelson, an artsy high school outcast, tries to land a date with popular girl Amanda Jones with some help from his tomboy best friend, Watts. However, Watts realizes she likes Keith as more than just a friend and tries to convince him to stop pursuing Amanda. Matters are further complicated when Keith''s invitation draws the ire of Amanda''s rich yet snobby ex-boyfriend, Hardy Jenns, who makes plans to get even.', 'Keith Nelson, an artsy high school outcast, tries to land a date with popular girl Amanda Jones with some help from his tomboy best friend, Watts. However, Watts realizes she likes Keith as more than just a friend and tries to convince him to stop pursuing Amanda. Matters are further complicated when Keith''s invitation draws the ire of Amanda''s rich yet snobby ex-boyfriend, Hardy Jenns, who makes plans to get even.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6z6ZUrwbAJl9Nq43OY77O7iY80x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15143'),
  ('371327928013619062', 'Some Like It Hot', 1959, 'Comedy, Romance, Crime', 'Billy Wilder, Charles Lang, Sam Nelson', 'Billy Wilder, I. A. L. Diamond', 'Tony Curtis, Jack Lemmon, Marilyn Monroe, George Raft, Pat O''Brien, Joe E. Brown, Nehemiah Persoff, Joan Shawlee', 'NR', 'In Prohibition-era Chicago, musicians Joe and Jerry witness a mob hit, and flee the state in an all-female band disguised as Josephine and Daphne, but further complications set in.', 'In Prohibition-era Chicago, musicians Joe and Jerry witness a mob hit, and flee the state in an all-female band disguised as Josephine and Daphne, but further complications set in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVIKyTK13AvOGv7ICmJjK44DTzp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239'),
  ('660742745449670902', 'Some Like It Hot', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Dong Xu, Song Xiaofei', null, 'Xiao Yang, Yan Ni, Xiao Shenyang, Qiao Shan, Clara Lee, Deng Chao, Allen, Wang Xun', 'NR', 'After the unexpected death of his best friend, a man examines his life and finds it incredibly lonely. Inspired by an encounter with a beautiful and sexy model, he embarks with his three friends on what turns out to be a crazy (and slightly stupid) endeavor on a path towards fulfillment.', 'After the unexpected death of his best friend, a man examines his life and finds it incredibly lonely. Inspired by an encounter with a beautiful and sexy model, he embarks with his three friends on what turns out to be a crazy (and slightly stupid) endeavor on a path towards fulfillment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjSlDMCCnus3q5aFrPbYwBAm7nx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433605'),
  ('425709883993829428', 'Some Like It Rare', 2021, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Fabrice Eboué, Thomas Brémond, François-Xavier Decraene', 'Vincent Solignac, Fabrice Eboué', 'Fabrice Eboué, Marina Foïs, Virginie Hocq, Jean-François Cayrey, Lisa Do Couto Texeira, Victor Meutelet, Stéphane Soo Mongo, Nicolas Lumbreras', null, 'Sophie and Vincent’s small butcher shop is on the brink of bankruptcy and their marriage is falling apart. Their lives are turned upside down when Vincent accidentally kills a vegan activist who vandalized their shop. Overwhelmed and terrified of being accused of murder, their only solution is to get rid of the body by turning it into ham. To their surprise the ham is so popular that it may save their business… that is if they’re ready to keep “hunting"!', 'Sophie and Vincent’s small butcher shop is on the brink of bankruptcy and their marriage is falling apart. Their lives are turned upside down when Vincent accidentally kills a vegan activist who vandalized their shop. Overwhelmed and terrified of being accused of murder, their only solution is to get rid of the body by turning it into ham. To their surprise the ham is so popular that it may save their business… that is if they’re ready to keep “hunting"!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8phJ1JPAe0xSNBRwLyXE6KgKzX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:730769'),
  ('1141372196235147219', 'Some Like It Veiled', 2017, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Sou Abadi, Yves Angelo', 'Sou Abadi', 'Félix Moati, Camélia Jordana, William Lebghil, Anne Alvaro, Laurent Delbecque, Oscar Copp, Oussama Kheddam, Predrag ''Miki'' Manojlović', null, 'Armand and Leila, students at Science Po, are a young couple. They plan to go to New York to do their internship at the United Nations. But when Mahmoud, Leila''s big brother, returns from a long stay in Yemen, which radically transformed him, he is opposed to his sister''s love relationship and decides to remove him at any cost from Armand. To enter Mahmoud and see again Leila, Armand has no choice: he must slip the integral veil! The next day, a certain Scheherazade with a veiled face rings at the door of Leila, and she will not leave Mahmoud indifferent ...', 'Armand and Leila, students at Science Po, are a young couple. They plan to go to New York to do their internship at the United Nations. But when Mahmoud, Leila''s big brother, returns from a long stay in Yemen, which radically transformed him, he is opposed to his sister''s love relationship and decides to remove him at any cost from Armand. To enter Mahmoud and see again Leila, Armand has no choice: he must slip the integral veil! The next day, a certain Scheherazade with a veiled face rings at the door of Leila, and she will not leave Mahmoud indifferent ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLJKNSQTVvgz8ZJvCld5tdoV6CA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446039'),
  ('301538305088917750', 'Some Like It... Cold', 1960, 'Comedy', 'Jean Bastia', 'Guy Lionel', 'Louis de Funès, Francis Blanche, Pierre Dudan, Jean Richard, Robert Manuel, Mireille Perrey, Mario David, Mathilde Casadesus', null, 'The old Valmorin died 200 years ago. The notary tells the family about the inheritance: the one who is terminally ill will receive the money. They all try their luck with getting ill before the other so one family member pretends to be deaf, another pretends to have a terrible back ache and so on...', 'The old Valmorin died 200 years ago. The notary tells the family about the inheritance: the one who is terminally ill will receive the money. They all try their luck with getting ill before the other so one family member pretends to be deaf, another pretends to have a terrible back ache and so on...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCq6cuoESfGzBTjZo7cQ3QwIiap.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76280'),
  ('437567795162295167', 'Some Mother''s Son', 1996, 'Drama, History', 'Terry George, Geoffrey Simpson', 'Terry George, Jim Sheridan', 'Helen Mirren, Fionnula Flanagan, Aidan Gillen, David O''Hara, John Lynch, Tom Hollander, Tim Woodward, Ciarán Hinds', 'R', 'Based on the true story of the 1981 hunger strike in a British prison, in which IRA prisoner Bobby Sands led a protest against the treatment of IRA prisoners as criminals rather than as prisoners of war. The film focuses on the mothers of two of the strikers, and their struggle to save the lives of their sons.', 'Based on the true story of the 1981 hunger strike in a British prison, in which IRA prisoner Bobby Sands led a protest against the treatment of IRA prisoners as criminals rather than as prisoners of war. The film focuses on the mothers of two of the strikers, and their struggle to save the lives of their sons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ngy7zafrXEDCUOPfolcbFofMDmI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58102'),
  ('547573082242193895', 'Some Nudity Required', 1998, 'Documentary', 'Odette Springer, Johanna Demetrakas, Alain Betrancourt', 'Johanna Demetrakas, Ruth Wald, Odette Springer', 'Odette Springer, Maria Ford, Jim Wynorski, Roger Corman, Julie Strain, Fred Olen Ray, Samuel Z. Arkoff, Catherine Cyran', null, 'A woman working in the B movie industry begins examining the industry and the damaged, desperate people who work in it.', 'A woman working in the B movie industry begins examining the industry and the damaged, desperate people who work in it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/smAMOmgf7nTyttixWuqhp5WLSdX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107456'),
  ('587527978363093226', 'Some of My Best Friends Are...', 1971, 'Drama', 'Mervyn Nelson, Elliot Tuckerman, Dick Carballo', 'Mervyn Nelson', 'Tom Bade, David Baker, Paul Blake, Gary Campbell, Carleton Carpenter, Robert Christian, Candy Darling, Jeff David', 'R', 'Regulars gather at The Blue Jay, a gay bar in Manhattan''s Greenwich Village, to celebrate Christmas Eve 1971 with people they consider family.', 'Regulars gather at The Blue Jay, a gay bar in Manhattan''s Greenwich Village, to celebrate Christmas Eve 1971 with people they consider family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9HuIpKnq25cqOYyQKRbb4EughR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256418'),
  ('193221910957203536', 'Some Say No', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Giambattista Avellino', 'Giambattista Avellino, Fabio Bonifacci', 'Luca Argentero, Paola Cortellesi, Paolo Ruffini, Myriam Catania, Claudio Bigagli, Marco Bocci, Roberto Citran, Giorgio Albertazzi', null, 'Some Say No is a new Italian comedy with a very serious subject: the way the country''s society is corroded by favoritism that pushes inferior people to the top in virtually every field. In Florence, three thirty-somethings band together to wage their own war on the system. Each of them is a person of talent who has been pushed out by "favorites" or raccomandati, people who have muscled in on the promotions they ought to have gotten by pulling strings.', 'Some Say No is a new Italian comedy with a very serious subject: the way the country''s society is corroded by favoritism that pushes inferior people to the top in virtually every field. In Florence, three thirty-somethings band together to wage their own war on the system. Each of them is a person of talent who has been pushed out by "favorites" or raccomandati, people who have muscled in on the promotions they ought to have gotten by pulling strings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etdWDLTRKshgdUBCivHOvMudxeV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61940'),
  ('1086379836723745438', 'Some Shooting Stars', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Fabien Onteniente, Vincent Richard-Marquis, Stéphane Le Coz', 'Laurent Jaoui, Paul de Saint Sernin, Antonin Fourlon', 'Gérard Lanvin, Didier Bourdon, Isabelle Nanty, Kaaris, Mamadou Haïdara, Paul Deby, Shy''m, Amine Khemissa', null, 'These old friends now have to train the next football generation with the help of their own offsprings...', 'These old friends now have to train the next football generation with the help of their own offsprings...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePNu4AuhdisRLTxm8Hup8NUN6UJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:979473'),
  ('1061916251249303328', 'Some Time Later', 2018, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Carmela Martínez Oliart, Manel Martínez, Diego Betancor', 'José Luis Cuerda', 'Roberto Álamo, Blanca Suárez, Iñaki Ardanaz, Carlos Areces, María Ballesteros, Javier Bódalo, Andreu Buenafuente, María Caballero', null, 'Planet Earth, 9177. The remains of humankind live in a post-apocalyptic environment divided into only two social classes: the ruling king and the oligarchs who inhabit the Representative Building and the poor of the world who hardly survive in the slums built around it.', 'Planet Earth, 9177. The remains of humankind live in a post-apocalyptic environment divided into only two social classes: the ruling king and the oligarchs who inhabit the Representative Building and the poor of the world who hardly survive in the slums built around it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IMX8OZzL712HLaTUkDBvvHEsvZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:533981'),
  ('491344048270466159', 'Some tired boys', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Dinos Dimopoulos, Giorgos Arvanitis', 'Asimakis Gialamas, Costas Pretederis', 'Labros Konstadaras, Betty Arvaniti, Dionysis Papagiannopoulos, Nora Valsami, Melpo Zarokosta, Hronis Exarhakos, Maria Bonelou, Mitsi Konstadara', null, 'Dinos Diamantidis, a good-looking, 50 years old, man who lives with his sister, is running behind any attractive female. When he meets the twenty-year-old Korina he loses his mind as Korina pretends that she is in love with him. His secretary, Rita, who has been engaged for many years with him, takes action and, with the help of his doctor and a former employee, makes Dinos finally figure out what this girl really is.', 'Dinos Diamantidis, a good-looking, 50 years old, man who lives with his sister, is running behind any attractive female. When he meets the twenty-year-old Korina he loses his mind as Korina pretends that she is in love with him. His secretary, Rita, who has been engaged for many years with him, takes action and, with the help of his doctor and a former employee, makes Dinos finally figure out what this girl really is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wecmkIFbfxgYDadYkOemeFSHSZU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313869'),
  ('593469304303219935', 'Some Too Quiet Gentlemen', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Georges Lautner, Maurice Fellous', null, 'Jean Lefebvre, Michel Galabru, Henri Guybet, Charles Southwood, André Pousse, Bruno Pradal, Dani, Paul Préboist', null, 'The sleepy little village of Loubressac is well on its way to becoming a ghost town. To save the town, the local citizenry hatch a plan to attract tourists. To their horror, the plan misfires when a group of hippies are the first to move in. The hippies'' free and unconventional ways quickly upset the staid lives of the locals. Then one of the locals is found murdered, and suspicion inevitably falls on the newcomers. Eventually, the locals and the hippies join forces to solve the mystery, and in the course of their adventures learn to respect each others'' ways.', 'The sleepy little village of Loubressac is well on its way to becoming a ghost town. To save the town, the local citizenry hatch a plan to attract tourists. To their horror, the plan misfires when a group of hippies are the first to move in. The hippies'' free and unconventional ways quickly upset the staid lives of the locals. Then one of the locals is found murdered, and suspicion inevitably falls on the newcomers. Eventually, the locals and the hippies join forces to solve the mystery, and in the course of their adventures learn to respect each others'' ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avtZNUWVvY26D6zPTsAq1N1iQPV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78415'),
  ('893837389233580689', 'Some Velvet Morning', 2013, 'Drama', 'Neil LaBute, Rogier Stoffers', 'Neil LaBute', 'Stanley Tucci, Alice Eve', null, 'Fred arrives at the doorstep of his beautiful young mistress Velvet after four years apart, claiming to have finally left his wife. But when she rejects his attempts to rekindle their romance, his persistence evolves into obsession — and a dark history between the former lovers comes into focus.', 'Fred arrives at the doorstep of his beautiful young mistress Velvet after four years apart, claiming to have finally left his wife. But when she rejects his attempts to rekindle their romance, his persistence evolves into obsession — and a dark history between the former lovers comes into focus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/136WOppljPobT4M5RiaAkMjWuCn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174341'),
  ('303716343722665481', 'Some Voices', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Simon Cellan Jones, David Odd', 'Joe Penhall', 'Daniel Craig, David Morrissey, Kelly Macdonald, Julie Graham, Peter McDonald, Nicholas Palliser, Edward Tudor-Pole, Ashley Walters', null, 'Schizophrenic Ray tries to adjust to the outside world after being released from an institution.', 'Schizophrenic Ray tries to adjust to the outside world after being released from an institution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yOZNSgqnRmslKjr19WcLZ1BDvEr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83581'),
  ('1077185871037469303', 'Somebody I Used to Know', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Dave Franco, Brian Lannin, Mary Kerrigan', 'Alison Brie, Dave Franco', 'Alison Brie, Jay Ellis, Kiersey Clemons, Danny Pudi, Haley Joel Osment, Amy Sedaris, Julie Hagerty, Olga Merediz', 'R', 'On a trip to her hometown, workaholic Ally reminisces with her first love, Sean, and starts to question everything about the person she''s become. Things only get more confusing when she meets Sean''s fiancé, Cassidy, who reminds her of the person she used to be.', 'On a trip to her hometown, workaholic Ally reminisces with her first love, Sean, and starts to question everything about the person she''s become. Things only get more confusing when she meets Sean''s fiancé, Cassidy, who reminds her of the person she used to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovHxxphDgjyEpYriDoGoIHfrdZL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:869112'),
  ('1027929563346890042', 'Somebody Killed Her Husband', 1978, 'Mystery, Comedy, Crime', 'Ralf D. Bode, Alex Hapsas, Richard Hughes', 'Reginald Rose', 'Farrah Fawcett, Jeff Bridges, John Wood, Tammy Grimes, John Glover, Patricia Elliott, Mary McCarty, Laurence Guittard', 'PG', 'A woman''s husband is murdered and she and her lover must find the killer or stand accused of doing it themselves.', 'A woman''s husband is murdered and she and her lover must find the killer or stand accused of doing it themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MaxW1Cv1XwZ1mVw6KFsxHe4ynz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120520'),
  ('281574085499165102', 'Somebody to Love', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alexandre Rockwell, Robert D. Yeoman, Cas Donovan', 'Alexandre Rockwell, Sergei Bodrov', 'Harvey Keitel, Rosie Perez, Anthony Quinn, Steve Buscemi, Stanley Tucci, Michael DeLorenzo, Gerardo Mejía, Steven Randazzo', 'R', 'Mercedes is a taxi dancer who wants to be an actress. She''s involved with the married Harry, who considers himself a respected actor. Ernesto is in love with Mercedes, but he doesn''t dance or have money.', 'Mercedes is a taxi dancer who wants to be an actress. She''s involved with the married Harry, who considers himself a respected actor. Ernesto is in love with Mercedes, but he doesn''t dance or have money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ShSfdYCbDoPtgZpZ1MbkrexuIQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44535'),
  ('562475380089251319', 'Somebody to Love', 2025, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Paolo Genovese, Fabrizio Lucci, Giuseppe Curti', 'Francesco Piccolo, Isabella Aguilar, Lucia Calamaro', 'Edoardo Leo, Pilar Fogliati, Emanuela Fanelli, Maria Chiara Giannetta, Claudia Pandolfi, Vittoria Puccini, Marco Giallini, Maurizio Lastrico', null, 'How much do we really know about ourselves when we make a decision? What if there are multiple versions of our I within us, each with something to say?', 'How much do we really know about ourselves when we make a decision? What if there are multiple versions of our I within us, each with something to say?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0FOPkEflJN0nnyCvjENWZ116Mq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1312157'),
  ('286478571789785032', 'Somebody Up There Likes Me', 1956, 'Drama', 'Robert Wise, Robert Saunders, Joseph Ruttenberg', 'Ernest Lehman', 'Paul Newman, Pier Angeli, Everett Sloane, Eileen Heckart, Sal Mineo, Harold J. Stone, Joseph Buloff, Arch Johnson', 'NR', 'The story of boxer Rocky Graziano''s rise from juvenile delinquent to world champ.', 'The story of boxer Rocky Graziano''s rise from juvenile delinquent to world champ.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pyuqFqGJZuhFDAWCSCmRTdyJVQ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28000'),
  ('218772733643624966', 'Someday or One Day', 2022, 'Mystery, Romance, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Huang Tien-jen, Huang Tien-jen', 'Hermes Lu', 'Ko Chia-Yen, Greg Hsu, Patrick Shih, Jin Shijia, Berry Wen-i Kuo, Chang Kuang-chen, JC Lin, Chang Chia-hui', null, 'In 2009, 28-year-old Li Zi Wei and 17-year-old Huang Yu Xuan met each other. These are two innocent and unaffected lives that could each feel like marks from their past and present lives. However, they could not find sufficient proof to fill up the emptiness at the bottom of their hearts. An accident let them fall into another Mobius loop that had already happened countless times. Only then did they realize that in different times and spaces, they once had a deep, true love that had passed through countless timelines to search for each other with no regrets. But in that story, their deepest love came at the highest price. If they could start again, would they choose to meet by chance in ordinary life or be scarred by the memories etched in their heart and bones? Or perhaps they can choose to hurt and love all over again, betting on a different ending?', 'In 2009, 28-year-old Li Zi Wei and 17-year-old Huang Yu Xuan met each other. These are two innocent and unaffected lives that could each feel like marks from their past and present lives. However, they could not find sufficient proof to fill up the emptiness at the bottom of their hearts. An accident let them fall into another Mobius loop that had already happened countless times. Only then did they realize that in different times and spaces, they once had a deep, true love that had passed through countless timelines to search for each other with no regrets. But in that story, their deepest love came at the highest price. If they could start again, would they choose to meet by chance in ordinary life or be scarred by the memories etched in their heart and bones? Or perhaps they can choose to hurt and love all over again, betting on a different ending?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yixtZU2tcMhkhv7Uqdcaa2wLSlX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:804725'),
  ('890987964919835075', 'Someday This Pain Will Be Useful to You', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Scott Lazar, Barbara Maia, Jessica Hong', 'Roberto Faenza, Dahlia Heyman', 'Toby Regbo, Marcia Gay Harden, Peter Gallagher, Lucy Liu, Stephen Lang, Deborah Ann Woll, Ellen Burstyn, Aubrey Plaza', 'NR', 'Precocious yet sensitive teenager James has a deep perception of the world but no idea how to live in it. Finding no help from his divorced parents nor his older memoir-writing sister, he decides to reject the beliefs adults try to push on him, starting with the college career that is looming over his last summer in New York, and embarks instead on a search for wisdom through nontraditional means...', 'Precocious yet sensitive teenager James has a deep perception of the world but no idea how to live in it. Finding no help from his divorced parents nor his older memoir-writing sister, he decides to reject the beliefs adults try to push on him, starting with the college career that is looming over his last summer in New York, and embarks instead on a search for wisdom through nontraditional means...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibNxEHRsxZBBT82vu7iD3gsl67k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93676'),
  ('172501842966924826', 'Someday We''ll Tell Each Other Everything', 2023, 'Drama', 'Emily Atef, Armin Dierolf', 'Emily Atef, Daniela Krien', 'Marlene Burow, Felix Kramer, Cedric Eich, Silke Bodenbender, Christine Schorn, Victoria Mayer, Jördis Triebel, Tom Quaas', null, 'Set in a warm summer in 1990 in former East Germany, it follows a young woman who begins a relationship with a charismatic farmer who is twice her age.', 'Set in a warm summer in 1990 in former East Germany, it follows a young woman who begins a relationship with a charismatic farmer who is twice her age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tcpYiiLFXsFqFWkEbINwzDAXKL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1045205'),
  ('237615716814799785', 'Someday You''ll Find Her, Charlie Brown', 1981, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Nick Vasu, Phil Roman', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Grant Wehr, Jennifer Gaffin, Rocky Reilly, Melissa Strawmyer, Nicole Eggert, Bill Melendez', 'NR', 'After Charlie Brown spots a girl briefly shown in a sports event broadcasting, he is smitten enough to go in search of her with the help of Linus. Unfortunately in his search, he has his usual amount of luck. As Charlie Brown is watching a football game, he spots a girl in the stands that he immediately attaches himself to. When the game ends, he is desperate to find her, so he enlists Linus to help him and, because of his absolute nervousness, to do the talking for him. However, that move could wind up spelling doom for the love-starved Charlie Brown once they finally find her.', 'After Charlie Brown spots a girl briefly shown in a sports event broadcasting, he is smitten enough to go in search of her with the help of Linus. Unfortunately in his search, he has his usual amount of luck. As Charlie Brown is watching a football game, he spots a girl in the stands that he immediately attaches himself to. When the game ends, he is desperate to find her, so he enlists Linus to help him and, because of his absolute nervousness, to do the talking for him. However, that move could wind up spelling doom for the love-starved Charlie Brown once they finally find her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6LxfrW4qTPJm8P89bAPhzShO6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40482'),
  ('759918552825321966', 'Someone', 2016, 'Drama', 'Daisuke Miura, Daisuke Soma, Katsuhito Motegi', 'Daisuke Miura', 'Takeru Satoh, Masaki Suda, Kasumi Arimura, Fumi Nikaido, Masaki Okada, Takayuki Yamada, Kisetsu Fujiwara, Kayano Masuyama', null, '5 university students gather to exchange information on their job search activities. They encourage each other and post their thoughts & worries on Twitter, but behind that they have a lot on their minds. Takuto Ninomiya observes those around him. His roommate Kotaro Kamiya has a bright personality and communicates well with others. Mizuki Tanabe is Kotaro Kamiya’s ex-girlfriend. Takuto Ninomiya has feelings for his roommate''s ex-girlfriend. Rika Kobayakawa is determined to land a job. Takayoshi Miyamoto is critical of job-seeking activities, but he later tries to get a job.', '5 university students gather to exchange information on their job search activities. They encourage each other and post their thoughts & worries on Twitter, but behind that they have a lot on their minds. Takuto Ninomiya observes those around him. His roommate Kotaro Kamiya has a bright personality and communicates well with others. Mizuki Tanabe is Kotaro Kamiya’s ex-girlfriend. Takuto Ninomiya has feelings for his roommate''s ex-girlfriend. Rika Kobayakawa is determined to land a job. Takayoshi Miyamoto is critical of job-seeking activities, but he later tries to get a job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cuf8aq2ybTFutnssA4OZVsirRNK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409547'),
  ('160921632852006604', 'Someone Behind the Door', 1971, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Nicolas Gessner, Pierre Lhomme', 'Lorenzo Ventavoli', 'Charles Bronson, Anthony Perkins, Jill Ireland, Henri Garcin, Agathe Natanson, André Penvern, Denise Péronne, Carl Studer', null, 'A neurosurgeon with a cheating wife takes an amnesiac into his home and conditions him to believe that the cheating wife is his own and to take the "appropriate" action.', 'A neurosurgeon with a cheating wife takes an amnesiac into his home and conditions him to believe that the cheating wife is his own and to take the "appropriate" action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f061UCG07ns15qrmoG7hBKd8gKC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4679'),
  ('1017599260808775535', 'Someone Borrowed', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Cris D''amato, Cibele Santa Cruz, Fabio Góes', 'Luanna Guimarães', 'Caio Castro, Thati Lopes, Mariana Xavier, Patrícya Travassos, Danielle Winits, Polliana Aleixo, Fafá Rennó, Bruna Louise', null, 'To fulfill his mother’s dying wish and avoid being removed from her will, an inflexible bachelor hires an actress to play his fiancée.', 'To fulfill his mother’s dying wish and avoid being removed from her will, an inflexible bachelor hires an actress to play his fiancée.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6l6qR3JGf1WLJAwwYgIQPR5rLKz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1022206'),
  ('685612054135528942', 'Someone Great', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Autumn Eakin, Jennifer Kaytin Robinson', 'Jennifer Kaytin Robinson', 'Gina Rodriguez, Brittany Snow, DeWanda Wise, Peter Vack, RuPaul, LaKeith Stanfield, Alex Moffat, Rebecca Naomi Jones', 'R', 'An aspiring music journalist lands her dream job and is about to move to San Francisco when her boyfriend of nine years decides to call it quits. To nurse her broken heart, she and her two best friends spend one outrageous last adventure in New York City.', 'An aspiring music journalist lands her dream job and is about to move to San Francisco when her boyfriend of nine years decides to call it quits. To nurse her broken heart, she and her two best friends spend one outrageous last adventure in New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0nz5lIBXeUZChBNfwL08bLWQaU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515248'),
  ('872665714211994116', 'Someone I Loved', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Zabou Breitman', 'Zabou Breitman, Agnès de Sacy', 'Daniel Auteuil, Christiane Millet, Marie-Josée Croze, Olivia Ross, Florence Loiret Caille, Geneviève Mnich, Winston Ong, Antonin Chalon', null, 'One night, Pierre decides to reveal his painful secret to his daughter-in-law, who''s just been abandoned by her husband. Pierre''s secret is about his secret love to Mathilde, the woman he left to instead follow an easier path in life.', 'One night, Pierre decides to reveal his painful secret to his daughter-in-law, who''s just been abandoned by her husband. Pierre''s secret is about his secret love to Mathilde, the woman he left to instead follow an easier path in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uX2QSatxilNGJPX2iwIzLxjEJGi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17658'),
  ('1046900165986990065', 'Someone like It Cold...', 1963, 'Comedy, Music', 'Giorgos Petridis, Giannis Dalianidis, Pavlos Tasios', 'Giannis Dalianidis', 'Dinos Iliopoulos, Zoe Laskari, Rena Vlahopoulou, Martha Karagianni, Vagelis Voulgaridis, Hloi Liaskou, Kostas Voutsas, Giannis Vogiatzis', null, 'Lakis (Dinos Iliopoulos) has to make sure that his three sisters are married before he can marry his beloved Lela (Martha Karagianni). While at the beach, Eva (Zoe Laskari) and Maria (Hloi Liaskou) will meet Kleopas (Costas Voutsas) and Giorgos (Vagelis Voulgaridis) with whom they will start dating. But Rena (Rena Vlahopoulou) has a secret relationship with Thodoros (Giannis Vogiatzis) for 10 years.', 'Lakis (Dinos Iliopoulos) has to make sure that his three sisters are married before he can marry his beloved Lela (Martha Karagianni). While at the beach, Eva (Zoe Laskari) and Maria (Hloi Liaskou) will meet Kleopas (Costas Voutsas) and Giorgos (Vagelis Voulgaridis) with whom they will start dating. But Rena (Rena Vlahopoulou) has a secret relationship with Thodoros (Giannis Vogiatzis) for 10 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fGbYFzz0mNyOPlQipVYuJbOUFLD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266255'),
  ('720764133377795852', 'Someone Like You', 2024, 'Romance, Drama', 'Tyler Russell, Trevor K. Ball, Lance Johann', 'Tyler Russell, Karen Kingsbury', 'Sarah Fisher, Jake Allyn, Lynn Collins, Robyn Lively, Bart Johnson, Scott Reeves, Brandon Hirsch, Austin Robert Russell', 'PG', 'Shocking news hits after young architect Dawson loses his best friend London. In his heartbreak, Dawson is compelled to launch an impossible search for London’s secret sister, twins separated as embryos. But along the way, Dawson never planned to fall in love.', 'Shocking news hits after young architect Dawson loses his best friend London. In his heartbreak, Dawson is compelled to launch an impossible search for London’s secret sister, twins separated as embryos. But along the way, Dawson never planned to fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsvD0BjEQIIoh2PpE5X7VXmSrQO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1029330'),
  ('318682934711539272', 'Someone Like You...', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tony Goldwyn, Anthony B. Richmond, Nicole Burke', 'Elizabeth Chandler', 'Ashley Judd, Greg Kinnear, Hugh Jackman, Marisa Tomei, Ellen Barkin, Catherine Dent, Laura Regan, Peter Friedman', 'PG-13', 'Jane Goodale has everything going for her. She''s a producer on a popular daytime talk show, and is in a hot romance with the show''s dashing executive producer Ray. But when the relationship goes terribly awry, Jane begins an extensive study of the male animal, including her womanizing roommate Eddie. Jane puts her studies and romantic misadventure to use as a pseudonymous sex columnist -- and becomes a sensation.', 'Jane Goodale has everything going for her. She''s a producer on a popular daytime talk show, and is in a hot romance with the show''s dashing executive producer Ray. But when the relationship goes terribly awry, Jane begins an extensive study of the male animal, including her womanizing roommate Eddie. Jane puts her studies and romantic misadventure to use as a pseudonymous sex columnist -- and becomes a sensation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cMkJSl2TI4xe8lKNFduinafKpe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12658'),
  ('48531232316121732', 'Someone Marry Barry', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Rob Pearlstein, Mårten Tedin', 'Rob Pearlstein', 'Tyler Labine, Damon Wayans Jr., Lucy Punch, Hayes MacArthur, Amanda Lund, Frankie Shaw, Wyatt Oleff, Ginger Gonzaga', 'NR', 'A trio of friends scheme to find a wife for their socially inappropriate friend Barry, and end up finding a girl just like him.', 'A trio of friends scheme to find a wife for their socially inappropriate friend Barry, and end up finding a girl just like him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4fwVknJ86F6pAXWGOKItWABb1yp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249923'),
  ('529806293468148296', 'Someone Special', 2004, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Jang Jin, Park Se-moon, Park Yong-su', 'Jang Jin', 'Jung Jae-young, Lee Na-young, Im Ha-ryong, Jang Young-nam, Jeong Gyu-su, Kim Hye-na, Oh Seung-hyun, Park Mi-sook', null, 'A baseball player learns he has three months to live and drowns his sorrows at a bar, where the female bartender turns out to be a longtime admirer.', 'A baseball player learns he has three months to live and drowns his sorrows at a bar, where the female bartender turns out to be a longtime admirer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tdtVupk7ybysjcYaOf0zvuDnGm8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39784'),
  ('1138088659647511558', 'Someone to Love', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Henry Jaglom, Hanania Baer', 'Henry Jaglom', 'Henry Jaglom, Andrea Marcovicci, Michael Emil, Sally Kellerman, Oja Kodar, Stephen Bishop, David Frishberg, Orson Welles', null, 'A Hollywood film director assembles a group of friends and strangers for a social gathering on Valentines Day in a deserted movie theater where he interviews each one on their opinions on love and loneliness.', 'A Hollywood film director assembles a group of friends and strangers for a social gathering on Valentines Day in a deserted movie theater where he interviews each one on their opinions on love and loneliness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wfWdy7sL3AmLwhAVekpCA9b58S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214446'),
  ('171094970817226568', 'Someone to Talk To', 2016, 'Drama', 'Liu Yulin', 'Liu Zhenyun', 'Mao Hai, Li Qian, Fan Wei, Qi Xi, Yu Entai, Liu Bei', 'NR', 'An adaptation of Liu Zhenyun’s award-winning novel One Sentence Worth Ten Thousand, produced by Bill Kong. The novel, which won the Mao Dun Literature Prize after it was published in 2008, revolves around a divorced woman and her married younger brother and deals with loneliness and alienation in contemporary Chinese society. The film marks the feature debut of award-winning short filmmaker Liu Yulin, who is adapting her father’s work. A New York University film graduate, Liu’s short film Door God (2014) won a silver medal at the 41st Student Academy Awards and was selected by Cannes.', 'An adaptation of Liu Zhenyun’s award-winning novel One Sentence Worth Ten Thousand, produced by Bill Kong. The novel, which won the Mao Dun Literature Prize after it was published in 2008, revolves around a divorced woman and her married younger brother and deals with loneliness and alienation in contemporary Chinese society. The film marks the feature debut of award-winning short filmmaker Liu Yulin, who is adapting her father’s work. A New York University film graduate, Liu’s short film Door God (2014) won a silver medal at the 41st Student Academy Awards and was selected by Cannes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stHe4aLWwplT8k5FD8F6aFFrObn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422135'),
  ('560513061733453343', 'Someone to Watch Over Me', 1987, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Ridley Scott, Joseph P. Reidy, Steven Poster', 'David Seltzer, Danilo Bach, Howard Franklin', 'Tom Berenger, Mimi Rogers, Lorraine Bracco, Jerry Orbach, John Rubinstein, Andreas Katsulas, Tony DiBenedetto, James E. Moriarty', 'R', 'Claire Gregory, an upper class New York personality, witnesses a murder in a luxurious nightclub. Detective Mike Keegan, recently promoted, is assigned to protect her.', 'Claire Gregory, an upper class New York personality, witnesses a murder in a luxurious nightclub. Detective Mike Keegan, recently promoted, is assigned to protect her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Vqw29y8pkoHaVtwkQcQhBK9oTY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31650'),
  ('949655530384926784', 'Someone You Loved', 2023, 'Romance, Drama', 'Hyung Seul-woo', 'Hyung Seul-woo', 'Lee Dong-hwi, Jung Eun-chae, Kang Gil-woo, Jeong Da-eun, Ko Kyu-pil, Jong Ho, Kim Dong-hwan, Uhm Ha-neul', null, 'Two ex-lovers navigate their lives post-breakup — struggling to redefine their relationship, from partners to strangers and everything in between.', 'Two ex-lovers navigate their lives post-breakup — struggling to redefine their relationship, from partners to strangers and everything in between.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knWSQvl1Rb55sE3Rr2nLVZb0sdi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:870144'),
  ('471881044049244220', 'Someone, Somewhere', 2019, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Jean-François Fontanel, Cédric Klapisch, Élodie Tahtane', 'Santiago Amigorena, Cédric Klapisch', 'François Civil, Ana Girardot, Camille Cottin, François Berléand, Simon Abkarian, Eye Haïdara, Rebecca Marder, Pierre Niney', null, 'Rémy and Mélanie live next door to each other in Paris but have never met. The two thirty-year-old Parisians search for connections online, but never have much success. Falling deeper into loneliness and depression, both decide to start attending regular therapy. With the help of their therapists, they uncover the real roots of their issues, and find that the connection they were both searching for is much closer than they thought.', 'Rémy and Mélanie live next door to each other in Paris but have never met. The two thirty-year-old Parisians search for connections online, but never have much success. Falling deeper into loneliness and depression, both decide to start attending regular therapy. With the help of their therapists, they uncover the real roots of their issues, and find that the connection they were both searching for is much closer than they thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fvLIx12fkIbroJ6mPIFdOryfFzG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:583268'),
  ('358342555152170948', 'Someone''s Gaze', 2013, 'Animation, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Makoto Shinkai, Makoto Shinkai', 'Makoto Shinkai', 'Satomi Hanamura, Shinji Ogawa, Fumi Hirano', null, 'Aya Okamura has been working for two years and has begun living on her own for a job opportunity. With her mother working overseas as a doctor, her father is now living alone with the family''s longtime pet cat Mii-san. One night, Aya returns from a long day at work, and as she rests on her bed, she reminiscences about the times the family had together. She remembers the sadness she felt when her mom went overseas, and the solace she felt when her father brought home Mii-san to give her comfort. Then, she receives a phone call.', 'Aya Okamura has been working for two years and has begun living on her own for a job opportunity. With her mother working overseas as a doctor, her father is now living alone with the family''s longtime pet cat Mii-san. One night, Aya returns from a long day at work, and as she rests on her bed, she reminiscences about the times the family had together. She remembers the sadness she felt when her mom went overseas, and the solace she felt when her father brought home Mii-san to give her comfort. Then, she receives a phone call.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3T8LGmjoMktaiot49Pc8JFFyC6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222715'),
  ('570444182467994244', 'Someone''s Knocking at the Door', 2009, 'Horror, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Chad Ferrin, Niklas Larsson', 'Chad Ferrin, Rosie Roberts, Roham Ghodsi', 'Noah Segan, Andrea Bunker, Elina Madison, Ezra Buzzington, Jon Budinoff, Silvia Spross, Ricardo Gray, Timothy Muskatell', 'NR', 'Returning to the same medical school where they were test subjects years before, two twisted serial killers use brutal sex acts to kill off a group of med students.', 'Returning to the same medical school where they were test subjects years before, two twisted serial killers use brutal sex acts to kill off a group of med students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8PEfUf3Bhukxq4nngChhhzGptX2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74016'),
  ('684746535724030773', 'Someone''s Watching Me!', 1978, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie', 'John Carpenter, Robert B. Hauser', 'John Carpenter', 'Lauren Hutton, David Birney, Adrienne Barbeau, Len Lesser, Charles Cyphers, John Mahon, Grainger Hines, James Murtaugh', null, 'A young woman moves to a high-rise apartment building and soon begins to be tormented by an unknown stalker who seems to know her every move.', 'A young woman moves to a high-rise apartment building and soon begins to be tormented by an unknown stalker who seems to know her every move.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5pIEWzjnMMz7WgOcB6wVXayE0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31428'),
  ('469019912623679342', 'Somers Town', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Shane Meadows, Matt Randle, Cecilia Testa', null, 'Thomas Turgoose, Piotr Jagiello, Elisa Lasowski, Kate Dickie, Perry Benson, Ireneusz Czop, Huggy Leaver, Trevor Cooper', null, 'Two teenagers, both newcomers to London, forge an unlikely friendship over the course of a hot summer. Tomo is a runaway from Nottingham; Marek lives in the district of Somers Town, between King''s Cross and Euston stations, where his dad is working on a new rail link.', 'Two teenagers, both newcomers to London, forge an unlikely friendship over the course of a hot summer. Tomo is a runaway from Nottingham; Marek lives in the district of Somers Town, between King''s Cross and Euston stations, where his dad is working on a new rail link.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kr5B00hkWbdMTOe43coJZ1yVhI2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14298'),
  ('1012512326524524208', 'Somersault', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Cate Shortland, Carolyn Constantine, Robert Humphreys', 'Cate Shortland', 'Abbie Cornish, Sam Worthington, Lynette Curran, Erik Thomson, Nathaniel Dean, Diana Glenn, Olivia Pigeot, Damian de Montemas', 'NR', 'Australian teenager Heidi is left with little choice but to leave home after she''s caught red-handed with her mother''s boyfriend. With few options, Heidi ends up in Jindabyne, a tourist community. Upon meeting Joe at a bar, she pursues a relationship with him and tries to find something resembling a normal home life. Heidi makes small strides by getting a job and finding a place to stay, but her relationship with Joe must overcome more than its share of hurdles.', 'Australian teenager Heidi is left with little choice but to leave home after she''s caught red-handed with her mother''s boyfriend. With few options, Heidi ends up in Jindabyne, a tourist community. Upon meeting Joe at a bar, she pursues a relationship with him and tries to find something resembling a normal home life. Heidi makes small strides by getting a job and finding a place to stay, but her relationship with Joe must overcome more than its share of hurdles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hN6GnyLhamDrz2xAOqVZ4Fv6Lyo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16605'),
  ('184187180477227249', 'Somersault in a Coffin', 1996, 'Drama', 'Derviş Zaim, Mustafa Kuşçu', 'Derviş Zaim', 'Ahmet Uğurlu, Tuncel Kurtiz, Ayşen Aydemir, Derviş Zaim, Mahmut Benek, Barış Celiloğlu, Ahmet Çadırcı, Fuat Onan', null, 'Mahsun Supertitiz is an unemployed homeless man who steals cars at night so that he can sleep in a heated place during the winter. Mahsun lives in Rumelihisar, an old section of Istanbul, and makes ends meet by getting the local fishermen to help him. Mahsun loves the cars he robs, cleans and polishes them, and drives them through the streets of Rumelihisar during the daytime.', 'Mahsun Supertitiz is an unemployed homeless man who steals cars at night so that he can sleep in a heated place during the winter. Mahsun lives in Rumelihisar, an old section of Istanbul, and makes ends meet by getting the local fishermen to help him. Mahsun loves the cars he robs, cleans and polishes them, and drives them through the streets of Rumelihisar during the daytime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZFHPRHKyN8nXEsZJ6tqTUbACuZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83567'),
  ('23727394451080293', 'Something About Amelia', 1984, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Edward R. Brown, Randa Haines', 'William Hanley', 'Ted Danson, Glenn Close, Olivia Cole, Roxana Zal, Lane Smith, Jane Kaczmarek, Melissa Francis, Kevin Conway', 'PG', 'Counseling helps family deal with the discovery that their child was sexually abused by the closest relative.', 'Counseling helps family deal with the discovery that their child was sexually abused by the closest relative.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rFQYt86OYljyeNUQHpVgKVr2rd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158939'),
  ('982403186837720006', 'Something Beneath', 2007, 'TV Movie, Horror, Science Fiction, Action', 'David Winning, Brenton Spencer', 'Ethlie Ann Vare, Mark Mullin', 'Kevin Sorbo, Peter MacNeill, Natalie Brown, Brendan Beiser, Frank Adamson, Gordon Tanner, Brittany Scobie, Brett Donahue', null, 'When a mysterious black slime oozes up from the plumbing to infiltrate a new conference center, it causes attendees at an environmental convention who come in contact with it to have horrific hallucinations and nightmarish visions of past tragedies. Environmentalist priest Father Douglas Middleton must team up with conference coordinator Khali Spence to stop the slime -- or die trying.', 'When a mysterious black slime oozes up from the plumbing to infiltrate a new conference center, it causes attendees at an environmental convention who come in contact with it to have horrific hallucinations and nightmarish visions of past tragedies. Environmentalist priest Father Douglas Middleton must team up with conference coordinator Khali Spence to stop the slime -- or die trying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIRVCiuXOGNT90BPbNy8XTJCDXz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64806'),
  ('687614011871933158', 'Something Big', 1971, 'Western, Comedy', 'Andrew V. McLaglen, Harry Stradling Jr., Howard W. Koch', 'James Lee Barrett', 'Dean Martin, Brian Keith, Carol White, Honor Blackman, Ben Johnson, Albert Salmi, Don Knight, Joyce Van Patten', 'PG', 'Joe Baker has a dream. He wants to do ''something big.'' When he needs a Gatling gun to accomplish this, he seeks out a black marketeer. The price he wants for the gun? A woman! So Baker kidnaps a woman off of the stagecoach, only to find that she is the wife of the commandant of the local Cavalry detachment. Things get further complicated when a girl named Dover McBride shows up. She has come to force Baker to marry her and return east, as he promised to do four years earlier', 'Joe Baker has a dream. He wants to do ''something big.'' When he needs a Gatling gun to accomplish this, he seeks out a black marketeer. The price he wants for the gun? A woman! So Baker kidnaps a woman off of the stagecoach, only to find that she is the wife of the commandant of the local Cavalry detachment. Things get further complicated when a girl named Dover McBride shows up. She has come to force Baker to marry her and return east, as he promised to do four years earlier', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rsKawnj4soIbfogebmip8hp5C8y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196784'),
  ('144227069845150371', 'Something Blue', 2025, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Camilo Abadía, Andrés Guti Cortés', 'Carlos Marín', 'Tessa Ía, Ricardo Abarca, Ana María Estupiñán, Isabel Burr, Gerardo Oñate, Jerry Velazquez, Pedro Palacio, Marcela Agudelo', null, 'Lifelong friends Óscar and Eli find themselves in a messy situation after a drunken night leads to unexpected consequences. Forced to replace a ruined wedding dress, they embark on a chaotic journey filled with setbacks and awkward run-ins with their exes.', 'Lifelong friends Óscar and Eli find themselves in a messy situation after a drunken night leads to unexpected consequences. Forced to replace a ruined wedding dress, they embark on a chaotic journey filled with setbacks and awkward run-ins with their exes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tdqzzSDXeCZzCEzZKPLYQuTwFdG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1429786'),
  ('274857262824529736', 'Something Borrowed', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Luke Greenfield, Charles Minsky', 'Jennie Snyder Urman', 'Ginnifer Goodwin, Kate Hudson, Colin Egglesfield, John Krasinski, Steve Howey, Ashley Williams, Geoff Pierson, Jill Eikenberry', 'PG-13', 'Though Rachel is a successful attorney and a loyal, generous friend, she is still single. After one drink too many at her 30th-birthday celebration, Rachel unexpectedly falls into bed with her longtime crush, Dex -- who happens to be engaged to her best friend, Darcy. Ramifications of the liaison threaten to destroy the women''s lifelong friendship, while Ethan, Rachel''s confidant, harbors a potentially explosive secret of his own.', 'Though Rachel is a successful attorney and a loyal, generous friend, she is still single. After one drink too many at her 30th-birthday celebration, Rachel unexpectedly falls into bed with her longtime crush, Dex -- who happens to be engaged to her best friend, Darcy. Ramifications of the liaison threaten to destroy the women''s lifelong friendship, while Ethan, Rachel''s confidant, harbors a potentially explosive secret of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66VZu75VeLGc6tcAypqyGzWcPeN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49022'),
  ('658611175032977554', 'Something Creeping in the Dark', 1971, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Mario Colucci, Giuseppe Aquari', 'Mario Colucci', 'Farley Granger, Lucia Bosè, Giacomo Rossi Stuart, Stelvio Rosi, Mia Genberg, Gianni Medici, Angelo Francesco Lavagnino, Dino Fazio', null, 'A group of stranded travelers takes refuge in an old abandoned house, only to find out that they are not the only residents of the building.', 'A group of stranded travelers takes refuge in an old abandoned house, only to find out that they are not the only residents of the building.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8FCJywPR9Pfuu8Bvs6wakENa5u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105099'),
  ('865859847183640273', 'Something Different', 1963, 'Drama', 'Jiří Menzel, Mojmír Ticháček, Věra Chytilová', 'Věra Chytilová', 'Věra Uzelacová, Josef Langmiler, Jiří Kodet, Milivoj Uzelac, Jaroslava Matlochová, Luboš Ogoun, Vladimír Bosák, Eva Bosáková', null, 'In her first feature, Věra Chytilová uses a combination of documentary and fiction film techniques to tell two stories in counterpoint. The first follows Olympic champion gymnast Eva Bosáková, who contemplates retirement as she undergoes a gruelling training schedule; the second, a housewife who is unappreciated and ignored by her husband.', 'In her first feature, Věra Chytilová uses a combination of documentary and fiction film techniques to tell two stories in counterpoint. The first follows Olympic champion gymnast Eva Bosáková, who contemplates retirement as she undergoes a gruelling training schedule; the second, a housewife who is unappreciated and ignored by her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBKohra6KzHXo4Bxi83amaOrxPT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171295'),
  ('931616495919480911', 'Something Evil', 1972, 'TV Movie, Horror', 'Steven Spielberg, Jack Roe, Bill Butler', 'Robert Clouse', 'Sandy Dennis, Darren McGavin, Ralph Bellamy, Jeff Corey, Johnny Whitaker, John Rubinstein, David Knapp, Laurie Hagen', null, 'A young couple moves into a farmhouse in rural Pennsylvania. What they don''t know is that there is an unseen presence in the house, and that it wants to take possession of the wife.', 'A young couple moves into a farmhouse in rural Pennsylvania. What they don''t know is that there is an unseen presence in the house, and that it wants to take possession of the wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ztVrElyzawZPKx0gLURx54s3IHK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85483'),
  ('672844324567810906', 'Something Fishy', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Tonie Marshall', null, 'Anémone, Christine Boisson, Micheline Presle, Grégoire Colin, Bernard Verley, Michel Roux, Roland Bertin, Josiane Stoléru', null, 'A private eye finds that her professional and personal lives are beginning to intertwine in this French drama. Maxime Chabrier (Anémone) is a woman in her mid-40s who works as a private detective. Despite her chain smoking and sloppy appearance, Maxime is regarded as a skilled investigator by her colleagues and considered the best PI at her agency by her boss. While Maxime has romantic dalliances with both men and women, she hasn''t been involved in a long-term relationship since she left her husband 15 years ago. However, Maxime is hired to look into a case that suggests that her former husband has become involved with insurance fraud, which brings her into contact with her 17-year-old son Baptiste (Gregoire Colin) for the first time since the divorce. Just as Maxime is trying to mend fences with her son and find out what her ex has gotten himself into, she finds herself falling in love with Jacques (Michel Didym), an economist.', 'A private eye finds that her professional and personal lives are beginning to intertwine in this French drama. Maxime Chabrier (Anémone) is a woman in her mid-40s who works as a private detective. Despite her chain smoking and sloppy appearance, Maxime is regarded as a skilled investigator by her colleagues and considered the best PI at her agency by her boss. While Maxime has romantic dalliances with both men and women, she hasn''t been involved in a long-term relationship since she left her husband 15 years ago. However, Maxime is hired to look into a case that suggests that her former husband has become involved with insurance fraud, which brings her into contact with her 17-year-old son Baptiste (Gregoire Colin) for the first time since the divorce. Just as Maxime is trying to mend fences with her son and find out what her ex has gotten himself into, she finds herself falling in love with Jacques (Michel Didym), an economist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96wpi7AUu0LgE2Pdu4xwGXI7DOW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263304'),
  ('602145066458255388', 'Something for Everyone', 1970, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Hal Prince, Walter Lassally, Hans Brockmann', 'Hugh Wheeler', 'Michael York, Angela Lansbury, Anthony Higgins, Heidelinde Weis, Jane Carr, Eva Maria Meineke, Wolfried Lier, Klaus Havenstein', null, 'In post-war Austria, an opportunistic young man begins working as a footman to a widowed countess and uses his sexual talents to better his station in life.', 'In post-war Austria, an opportunistic young man begins working as a footman to a widowed countess and uses his sexual talents to better his station in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJwBSnDLtcIETEAwx1rrop3SIm1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150043'),
  ('25214458794384035', 'Something for the Boys', 1944, 'Comedy, Music', 'Lewis Seiler, Ernest Palmer', 'Robert Ellis, Helen Logan, Frank Gabrielson', 'Carmen Miranda, Michael O''Shea, Vivian Blaine, Phil Silvers, Sheila Ryan, Perry Como, Glenn Langan, Eddie Acuff', 'NR', 'The oddly-assorted Hart cousins: revue singer Blossom, con man Harry, and machinist Chiquita (who gets radio through her teeth!), inherit southern plantation Magnolia Manor, which alas proves to be a "termite trap" and tax liability. Fortunately, Sgt. Rocky Fulton from a nearby army camp appears with a plan to convert the place to a hotel for army wives; but to pay bills until then, they decide to put on a show. Of course, romantic and military complications intervene...', 'The oddly-assorted Hart cousins: revue singer Blossom, con man Harry, and machinist Chiquita (who gets radio through her teeth!), inherit southern plantation Magnolia Manor, which alas proves to be a "termite trap" and tax liability. Fortunately, Sgt. Rocky Fulton from a nearby army camp appears with a plan to convert the place to a hotel for army wives; but to pay bills until then, they decide to put on a show. Of course, romantic and military complications intervene...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Qdcv7P9HDuVBzoAFqcCZU4WKM4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193311'),
  ('818118205469772384', 'Something from Nothing: The Art of Rap', 2012, 'Documentary, Music', 'Andy Baybutt, Ice-T, Patrick J. Donnelly', null, 'Ice-T, Dr. Dre, Ice Cube, Snoop Dogg, Eminem, Afrika Bambaataa, Grandmaster Caz, Bun B', 'R', 'SOMETHING FROM NOTHING: THE ART OF RAP is a feature length performance documentary about the runaway juggernaut that is Rap music. At the wheel of this unstoppable beast is the film''s director and interviewer Ice-T. Taking us on a deeply personal journey Ice-T uncovers how this music of the street has grown to dominate the world. Along the way Ice-T meets a whole spectrum of Hip-Hop talent, from founders, to new faces, to the global superstars like Eminem, Dr Dre, Snoop Dogg and Kanye West. He exposes the roots and history of Rap and then, through meeting many of its most famous protagonists, studies the living mechanism of the music to reveal ''The Art Of Rap''. This extraordinary film features unique performances from the entire cast, without resorting to archive material, to build a fresh and surprising take on the phenomenon that is Rap.', 'SOMETHING FROM NOTHING: THE ART OF RAP is a feature length performance documentary about the runaway juggernaut that is Rap music. At the wheel of this unstoppable beast is the film''s director and interviewer Ice-T. Taking us on a deeply personal journey Ice-T uncovers how this music of the street has grown to dominate the world. Along the way Ice-T meets a whole spectrum of Hip-Hop talent, from founders, to new faces, to the global superstars like Eminem, Dr Dre, Snoop Dogg and Kanye West. He exposes the roots and history of Rap and then, through meeting many of its most famous protagonists, studies the living mechanism of the music to reveal ''The Art Of Rap''. This extraordinary film features unique performances from the entire cast, without resorting to archive material, to build a fresh and surprising take on the phenomenon that is Rap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXEZjHxxwaQqKnkE92paaXg5bV1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84342'),
  ('998188527685061904', 'Something from Tiffany''s', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Daryl Wein, Matthew Janssen, Anne Berger', 'Tamara Chestna', 'Zoey Deutch, Kendrick Sampson, Ray Nicholson, Leah Sava Jeffries, Shay Mitchell, Jojo T. Gibbs, Javicia Leslie, Chido Nwokocha', 'PG', 'One woman''s life is forever changed by an engagement ring meant for someone else.', 'One woman''s life is forever changed by an engagement ring meant for someone else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hzQV66zQHqWKRjLVphISNOqadIp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:916053'),
  ('109757077396749170', 'Something Has Happened', 1987, 'Documentary', 'István Borbás, Roy Andersson', 'Roy Andersson', 'Klas-Gösta Olsson, Anne Tubin, Lennart Björklund, Sandy Mansson', null, 'As the AIDS epidemic was spreading in 1987, the Swedish government commissioned Roy Andersson to make an educational film about the disease. In these twenty or so monotone scenes, Andersson criticizes the medical community for its dehumanizing and racist tendencies when researching HIV and AIDS.', 'As the AIDS epidemic was spreading in 1987, the Swedish government commissioned Roy Andersson to make an educational film about the disease. In these twenty or so monotone scenes, Andersson criticizes the medical community for its dehumanizing and racist tendencies when researching HIV and AIDS.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tfCmcAaluvvXGMS8sNvAnDpSTQP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96958'),
  ('531038053899436771', 'Something Hot', 1964, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Giannis Dalianidis, Markos Zervas', 'Giannis Dalianidis', 'Dinos Iliopoulos, Rena Vlahopoulou, Martha Karagianni, Hloi Liaskou, Elena Nathanail, Christos Negas, Kostas Voutsas, Hristos Tsaganeas', null, 'During an International Trade Fair at Thessaloniki, a mature woman, Rena (Martha Karagianni), goes there with her sister to convince her childhood friend Dinos (Dinos Iliopoulos) to have a "white wedding" so that she can inherit a large estate. Dinos though, does not accept because even though he is actually a womanizer he acts as a shy and modest man around people. Everyone there will meet a group of musicians and one of them will fall in love with the daughter of the strict manager of the company Dinos works for who is accompanied by Dinos. At some point, everyone goes to Athens where things get more complicated untill everyone finds his perfect match. In the end Rena gets her inheritance and all together they perform a musical play in a grand theater.', 'During an International Trade Fair at Thessaloniki, a mature woman, Rena (Martha Karagianni), goes there with her sister to convince her childhood friend Dinos (Dinos Iliopoulos) to have a "white wedding" so that she can inherit a large estate. Dinos though, does not accept because even though he is actually a womanizer he acts as a shy and modest man around people. Everyone there will meet a group of musicians and one of them will fall in love with the daughter of the strict manager of the company Dinos works for who is accompanied by Dinos. At some point, everyone goes to Athens where things get more complicated untill everyone finds his perfect match. In the end Rena gets her inheritance and all together they perform a musical play in a grand theater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7OvPaQbjjRYiVZBQpm2nEfkdjrb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266240'),
  ('809897080254727821', 'Something Huge', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Padial', 'Berto Romero, Carlo Padial', 'Berto Romero, Carolina Bang, Carlos Areces, Javier Botet, Miguel Noguera, Dídac Alcaraz, Toni Sevilla, Rubén Jiménez', null, 'Dani Tomás (Berto Romero) is a television screenwriter disillusioned and bored of his work. One day he receives unexpected news: for a legal error he must repeat eighth grade. Now, he returns to a world he already thought he had forgotten, living new experiences and experiencing a multitude of unexplained situations and hilarious events. But he will not be alone in this epic adventure, because he will have the help of the peculiar director of the school (Carlos Areces), a police officer (Antonio de la Torre, May God forgive us) and an enigmatic classmate (Carolina Bang).', 'Dani Tomás (Berto Romero) is a television screenwriter disillusioned and bored of his work. One day he receives unexpected news: for a legal error he must repeat eighth grade. Now, he returns to a world he already thought he had forgotten, living new experiences and experiencing a multitude of unexplained situations and hilarious events. But he will not be alone in this epic adventure, because he will have the help of the peculiar director of the school (Carlos Areces), a police officer (Antonio de la Torre, May God forgive us) and an enigmatic classmate (Carolina Bang).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ng4FPBMRGPQClTMBIRK0SZgjCag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395807'),
  ('874614708274588223', 'Something in the Air', 2002, 'Drama, Action', 'Helvécio Ratton, Guilherme Fiúza Zenha', null, 'Babu Santana, Adolfo Moura, Benjamim Abras, Edyr de Castro, Priscila Dias, Renata Otto, Tião D''Avila, Hamilton Borges Walê', null, 'Based on the true story of four friends who decide to install a communal pirate radio station called Rádio Favela in a shanty-town, to give voice to the outcasts'' complaints.', 'Based on the true story of four friends who decide to install a communal pirate radio station called Rádio Favela in a shanty-town, to give voice to the outcasts'' complaints.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUZBCwhGsOE2BZJGgpo7mdRQkq9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70748'),
  ('41353191345020949', 'Something in the Air', 2012, 'Romance, Drama', 'Olivier Assayas, Éric Gautier, Delphine Heude', 'Olivier Assayas', 'Clément Métayer, Lola Créton, Felix Armand, Carole Combes, Bobbi Salvör Menuez, Hugo Conzelmann, Martin Loizillon, André Marcon', 'NR', 'During the 1970s a student named Gilles gets entangled in contemporary political turmoils although he would rather just be a creative artist. While torn between his solidarity to his friends and his personal ambitions he falls in love with Christine.', 'During the 1970s a student named Gilles gets entangled in contemporary political turmoils although he would rather just be a creative artist. While torn between his solidarity to his friends and his personal ambitions he falls in love with Christine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNK5WkNlTyi6FbHMaCYYBCoKL88.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122089'),
  ('656807838079274664', 'Something in the Dirt', 2022, 'Comedy, Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Justin Benson, Aaron Moorhead, Aaron Moorhead', 'Justin Benson', 'Aaron Moorhead, Justin Benson, Sarah Adina Smith, Wanjiru M. Njendu, Issa López, Vinny Curran, Gille Klabin, C. Robert Cargill', 'R', 'When neighbors John and Levi witness supernatural events in their LA apartment building, they realize documenting the paranormal could inject some fame and fortune into their wasted lives.', 'When neighbors John and Levi witness supernatural events in their LA apartment building, they realize documenting the paranormal could inject some fame and fortune into their wasted lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0kUj5y1t6LDN9ssfYe7c1NVym1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:843621'),
  ('641841101017578487', 'Something in the Water', 2024, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Hayley Easton Street, Niels Reedtz Johansen', 'Cat Clarke', 'Hiftu Quasem, Natalie Mitson, Lauren Lyle, Nicole Rieko Setsuko, Ellouise Shakespeare-Hart, Gabriel Prevost, Chloe Marshall, Tashani Bent', 'R', 'After lesbian couple Meg and Kayla split following a traumatic homophobic incident, their three friends are intent on mending the rift during the wedding of Lizzie at a paradise resort. But a pre-wedding boat excursion turns to disaster and the wedding breakfast is likely to be the five girls!', 'After lesbian couple Meg and Kayla split following a traumatic homophobic incident, their three friends are intent on mending the rift during the wedding of Lizzie at a paradise resort. But a pre-wedding boat excursion turns to disaster and the wedding breakfast is likely to be the five girls!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1iWGGxHEwswZGvPSoMZlLFf0PNq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:804616'),
  ('920032646110093004', 'Something Is About to Happen', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Barbu Bălășoiu, Antonio Méndez Esparza, María Rodrigo', 'Antonio Méndez Esparza, Clara Roquet', 'Malena Alterio, Aitana Sánchez-Gijón, Rodrigo Poisón, José Luis Torrijo, Manuel de Blas, Mariona Ribas, Iñigo de la Iglesia, Mariano Llorente', null, 'After losing her job as a computer programmer, Lucía decides to become a cab driver.', 'After losing her job as a computer programmer, Lucía decides to become a cab driver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plNar0h9w9BYweIT84IohZFmoy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:828936'),
  ('345629781670286759', 'Something Like Happiness', 2005, 'Drama', 'Bohdan Sláma, Diviš Marek, Karel Bezděk', 'Bohdan Sláma', 'Tatiana Dyková, Pavel Liška, Anna Geislerová, Marek Daniel, Zuzana Kronerová, Simona Stašová, Bolek Polívka, Martin Huba', null, 'Over the course of a year, in a small town scarred and beaten down by industrialization, Tonda and Monika, friends since childhood, come to experience what life might be like if they could be with one another – which they seemingly can''t. Or can they?', 'Over the course of a year, in a small town scarred and beaten down by industrialization, Tonda and Monika, friends since childhood, come to experience what life might be like if they could be with one another – which they seemingly can''t. Or can they?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jthWhnwubYovcx7Sw1yAcM4Lkp1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33682'),
  ('280903412797378292', 'Something Like Summer', 2017, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'David Berry', 'Carlos Pedraza', 'Grant Davis, Davi Santos, Ben Baur, Ajiona Alexus, Jana Lee Hamblin, Ron Boyd, Tristan Decker, Madisyn Lane', null, 'Something Like Summer traces the tumultuous relationship of Ben and Tim, secret high school sweethearts who grow over the years into both adulthood enemies and complicated friends.', 'Something Like Summer traces the tumultuous relationship of Ben and Tim, secret high school sweethearts who grow over the years into both adulthood enemies and complicated friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shYMavWTiJoxMg1irMh9c2P1vpP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460437'),
  ('343840827049324401', 'Something Like That', 2017, 'Drama', 'Esmir Filho, Mariana Bastos', 'Esmir Filho, Mariana Bastos', 'Caroline Abras, André Antunes, Clemens Schick, Bruno Stierli, Jules Elting, Knut Berger, Bruno Guida, Lígia Cortez', null, 'Caio and Mari are two young people living in a relationship that goes beyond any definition. Over ten years, the plot transits between three striking moments where their desires conflict and their relationship is put to the test. The film, originated from the short film of the same name in 2006, proposes a reflection on sexuality, labels and how time constructs and transforms relationships.', 'Caio and Mari are two young people living in a relationship that goes beyond any definition. Over ten years, the plot transits between three striking moments where their desires conflict and their relationship is put to the test. The film, originated from the short film of the same name in 2006, proposes a reflection on sexuality, labels and how time constructs and transforms relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/930ugxRo99f8FtgaLKzLYdrYLmY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480941'),
  ('18126056245153872', 'Something New', 2006, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Sanaa Hamri, Shane Hurlbut', 'Kriss Turner', 'Sanaa Lathan, Simon Baker, Blair Underwood, Wendy Raquel Robinson, Taraji P. Henson, Golden Brooks, Mike Epps, Donald Faison', 'PG-13', 'Kenya McQueen thought she had it all: a successful career, good friends and family. There was just one thing she didn''t have under control: her love life. All that changes when she meets sexy, free-spirited Brian Kelly. But when her ideal man arrives on the scene, Kenya must decide between the relationship everyone expects and the romance no one expected.', 'Kenya McQueen thought she had it all: a successful career, good friends and family. There was just one thing she didn''t have under control: her love life. All that changes when she meets sexy, free-spirited Brian Kelly. But when her ideal man arrives on the scene, Kenya must decide between the relationship everyone expects and the romance no one expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lcwB60GqQaWUgUw1CCE5gm5XHI1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15363'),
  ('730378882324480065', 'Something New', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Francesca Polic Greco, Luca Padrini, Ilaria Schipa', 'Paola Cortellesi, Giulia Calenda, Cristina Comencini', 'Paola Cortellesi, Micaela Ramazzotti, Eduardo Valdarnini, Eleonora Danco, Chiara Scalise, Claudio Pallitto, Gerardo Bartoccini, Sasha Luca Donatelli', null, 'Lucia and Maria are two best friends, who have known each other from the beginning of their life, but have very different tastes and behaviors. Lucia is done with men, Maria, on the contrary, cannot be without one. One night, the perfect man shows up in Maria''s bed: handsome, sensible, mature and passionate.The next morning brings up misunderstandings and lies which make the two friends split up and take a break for themselves. Maybe that young man met by chance is really the one every woman is looking for, because with his simple theories he manages to paint the perfect picture of the two women''s lives.', 'Lucia and Maria are two best friends, who have known each other from the beginning of their life, but have very different tastes and behaviors. Lucia is done with men, Maria, on the contrary, cannot be without one. One night, the perfect man shows up in Maria''s bed: handsome, sensible, mature and passionate.The next morning brings up misunderstandings and lies which make the two friends split up and take a break for themselves. Maybe that young man met by chance is really the one every woman is looking for, because with his simple theories he manages to paint the perfect picture of the two women''s lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vawd5oE53FTqo7xm7x03SfWlzbj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418726'),
  ('789645119067039730', 'Something of Value', 1957, 'Drama, War', 'Richard Brooks, Russell Harlan', 'Richard Brooks', 'Rock Hudson, Dana Wynter, Sidney Poitier, Juano Hernández, William Marshall, Robert Beatty, Walter Fitzgerald, Michael Pate', 'NR', 'As Kenya''s Mau Mau uprising tears the country apart, former childhood friends Kimani (Sidney Poitier), a native, and Peter (Rock Hudson), a British colonist, find themselves on opposite sides of the struggle in this provocative drama. Though each is devoted to his cause, both wish for a more moderate path -- but their hopes for a peaceful resolution are thwarted by rage, colonial arrogance and escalating violence on both sides.', 'As Kenya''s Mau Mau uprising tears the country apart, former childhood friends Kimani (Sidney Poitier), a native, and Peter (Rock Hudson), a British colonist, find themselves on opposite sides of the struggle in this provocative drama. Though each is devoted to his cause, both wish for a more moderate path -- but their hopes for a peaceful resolution are thwarted by rage, colonial arrogance and escalating violence on both sides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jKkIiaaXosYTPtRPa9FaBYCqkd7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67521'),
  ('530825654813813408', 'Something Something… Unakkum Enakkum', 2006, 'Romance, Drama, Action', 'A. Venkatesh, Mohan Raja', 'M. S. Raju, Veeru Potla', 'Ravi Mohan, Trisha Krishnan, Prabhu, K. Bhagyaraj, Geetha, Richa Pallod, Manivannan, Santhanam', null, 'The story starts in a jail, where prisoner Muthupandi (Prabhu) is being interrogated by a police officer (Vijayakumar) about his past. Without hesitation, Muthupandi tells. Muthupandi is a son of the soil, a very hard working self-made man who dotes on his only sister Kavitha (Trisha Krishnan). Their mother died very early and it was Muthupandi who brought up Kavitha with a lot of love and affection. Kavitha’s best friend Lalitha (Richa Pallod), who is getting married, takes Kavitha to her house for the nuptial ceremony. As an emotional scene prior to this notes, this is the first time Kavitha has been away from her brother.', 'The story starts in a jail, where prisoner Muthupandi (Prabhu) is being interrogated by a police officer (Vijayakumar) about his past. Without hesitation, Muthupandi tells. Muthupandi is a son of the soil, a very hard working self-made man who dotes on his only sister Kavitha (Trisha Krishnan). Their mother died very early and it was Muthupandi who brought up Kavitha with a lot of love and affection. Kavitha’s best friend Lalitha (Richa Pallod), who is getting married, takes Kavitha to her house for the nuptial ceremony. As an emotional scene prior to this notes, this is the first time Kavitha has been away from her brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jBF95UVce5prCBVbBSRCApulrC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63815'),
  ('573288230305069404', 'Something the Lord Made', 2004, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Joseph Sargent, Donald M. Morgan', 'Peter Silverman, Robert Caswell', 'Alan Rickman, Yasiin Bey, Kyra Sedgwick, Gabrielle Union, Merritt Wever, Charles S. Dutton, Mary Stuart Masterson, Irene Ziegler', 'PG', 'A dramatization of the relationship between heart surgery pioneers Alfred Blalock and Vivien Thomas.', 'A dramatization of the relationship between heart surgery pioneers Alfred Blalock and Vivien Thomas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lk2wEO6Rt3mnZmfRTu8wvYiGPmp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20544'),
  ('736462779750352456', 'Something to Live for: The Alison Gertz Story', 1992, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Tom McLoughlin, David Fudge, Richard Peter Schroer', 'Deborah Joy LeVine', 'Molly Ringwald, Lee Grant, Perry King, Roxana Zal, George Coe, Christopher Meloni, Kim Myers, Peter Spears', null, 'An AIDS-stricken woman becomes a leader in the struggle to educate people about the disease and its prevention.', 'An AIDS-stricken woman becomes a leader in the struggle to educate people about the disease and its prevention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ovS9oXfoi3ZJCW9TJTRn0I6wXl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100626'),
  ('855851872719472950', 'Something to Remember Me By', 2005, 'Drama', 'Patricia Ferreira', 'Virginia Yagüe, Patricia Ferreira', 'Emma Vilarasau, Marta Etura, Fernando Fernán Gómez, Carlos Blanco, Roger Coma, Víctor Mosqueira, Mónica García, Marisa de Leza', null, 'Irene lives with Mateo, his father, and her son David, 22 years old. Living together is harmonious and happy, but there is a conflict: David, a brilliant student of architecture, has decided to go and live with his girlfriend Clara, a supermarket cashier. Despite its liberal way of thinking, Irene cannot understand such an unequal relationship. However, David finds in his grandfather the necessary complicity to carry out his plans. Mateo is a old and vital octogenarian despite his tough history: he was a child during the Spanish Civil War (1936-1939), and he lost his house and all his family. But none of that could finish with his energy and desire to live. One day, however, Mateo arrives with terrible news.', 'Irene lives with Mateo, his father, and her son David, 22 years old. Living together is harmonious and happy, but there is a conflict: David, a brilliant student of architecture, has decided to go and live with his girlfriend Clara, a supermarket cashier. Despite its liberal way of thinking, Irene cannot understand such an unequal relationship. However, David finds in his grandfather the necessary complicity to carry out his plans. Mateo is a old and vital octogenarian despite his tough history: he was a child during the Spanish Civil War (1936-1939), and he lost his house and all his family. But none of that could finish with his energy and desire to live. One day, however, Mateo arrives with terrible news.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfC7m0dlmugIVcPeF020pg2xCLF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101041'),
  ('572454337424266439', 'Something to Remind Me', 2002, 'Thriller, Drama, TV Movie', 'Christian Petzold, Hans Fromm', 'Christian Petzold', 'Nina Hoss, André Hennicke, Sven Pippig, Heinrich Schmieder, Kathrin Angerer, Henning Peker, Michael Gerber, Franziska Troegner', null, 'Middle-aged lawyer Thomas meets Leyla at the pool. After their paths keep crossing, he asks her out on a date. Somewhat to his surprise she agrees. The next morning Thomas awakes to find Leyla and his laptop, which contains vital case files, missing.', 'Middle-aged lawyer Thomas meets Leyla at the pool. After their paths keep crossing, he asks her out on a date. Somewhat to his surprise she agrees. The next morning Thomas awakes to find Leyla and his laptop, which contains vital case files, missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqK1qQGQ0h3SxxMTAcO31lslvUq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158144'),
  ('887599451851362529', 'Something to Sing About', 1937, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Victor Schertzinger, John Stumar', 'Austin Parker', 'James Cagney, Evelyn Daw, William Frawley, Mona Barrie, Gene Lockhart, Philip Ahn, Marek Windheim, Dwight Frye', 'NR', 'James Cagney has a rare chance to show his song-and-dance-man roots in this low-budget tale of a New York bandleader struggling with a Hollywood studio boss.', 'James Cagney has a rare chance to show his song-and-dance-man roots in this low-budget tale of a New York bandleader struggling with a Hollywood studio boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGnovhVbh3LuR3rkuTRhnagxJqk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76464'),
  ('219370748649682154', 'Something to Talk About', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lasse Hallström, Sven Nykvist', 'Callie Khouri', 'Julia Roberts, Dennis Quaid, Robert Duvall, Gena Rowlands, Kyra Sedgwick, Brett Cullen, Haley Aull, Muse Watson', 'R', 'Grace King Bichon, who is managing her father''s riding-stable, discovers that her husband Eddie is deceiving her with another woman. After confronting him in the middle of the night on the streets of their small home town, she decides to stay at her sister Emma Rae''s house for a while to make up her mind. Breaking out of her everyday life, she starts to question the authority of everyone.', 'Grace King Bichon, who is managing her father''s riding-stable, discovers that her husband Eddie is deceiving her with another woman. After confronting him in the middle of the night on the streets of their small home town, she decides to stay at her sister Emma Rae''s house for a while to make up her mind. Breaking out of her everyday life, she starts to question the authority of everyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a52KpsmvLNdTdmDzw1fUrJONpfH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18402'),
  ('692143669697479871', 'Something Useful', 2017, 'Drama', 'Pelin Esmer, Gökhan Tiryaki', 'Pelin Esmer, Barış Bıçakçı', 'Başak Köklükaya, Öykü Karayel, Yiğit Özşener, Ayşenil Şamlıoğlu, Berfu Öngören, Melih Düzenli, Sedat Kalkavan, Fatih Sevdi', null, 'A chance meeting on a train in the Turkish countryside leads two women to a journey that shows them the importance of setting a path for one''s life.', 'A chance meeting on a train in the Turkish countryside leads two women to a journey that shows them the importance of setting a path for one''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Rt5LimhHFGzWlKSp2bAjOVivFO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468274'),
  ('897915152543552328', 'Something Weird', 1967, 'Horror', 'Herschell Gordon Lewis', 'James F. Hurley', 'Tony McCabe, Elizabeth Wilkinson, William Brooker, Mudite Arums, Ted Heil, Lawrence J. Aberwood, Larry Wellington, Jeffrey Allen', 'NR', 'An accident victim makes a deal with a witch, in which he receives extraordinary ESP powers; he uses these powers to assist the police in solve crimes.', 'An accident victim makes a deal with a witch, in which he receives extraordinary ESP powers; he uses these powers to assist the police in solve crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/esIpCaMHD5Qpffbr40cuxOX0tw4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48221'),
  ('619314096501981951', 'Something Wicked This Way Comes', 1983, 'Fantasy, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jack Clayton, Stephen H. Burum', 'Ray Bradbury', 'Jason Robards, Jonathan Pryce, Diane Ladd, Royal Dano, Vidal Peterson, Shawn Carson, Mary Grace Canfield, Richard Davalos', 'PG', 'In a small American town, a diabolical circus arrives, granting wishes for the townsfolk, but twisted as only the esteemed Mr. Dark can make them. Can two young boys overcome the worst the devil himself can deal out?', 'In a small American town, a diabolical circus arrives, granting wishes for the townsfolk, but twisted as only the esteemed Mr. Dark can make them. Can two young boys overcome the worst the devil himself can deal out?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/94dMO6kAawyFUk0sCDGIjAnchED.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24808'),
  ('206000420973402278', 'Something Wild', 1961, 'Drama', 'Jim Di Gangi, Angelo Laiacona, Jack Garfein', 'Jack Garfein, Alex Karmel', 'Carroll Baker, Ralph Meeker, Mildred Dunnock, Jean Stapleton, Martin Kosleck, Charles Watts, Clifton James, George L. Smith', null, 'A young rape victim tries desperately to pick up the pieces of her life, only to find herself at the mercy of a would-be rescuer.', 'A young rape victim tries desperately to pick up the pieces of her life, only to find herself at the mercy of a would-be rescuer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j6j4LQKevC8YPBowUxrPbMAGJIg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82944'),
  ('1049387956181888435', 'Something Wild', 1986, 'Crime, Comedy, Romance', 'Jonathan Demme, Tak Fujimoto, Ron Bozman', 'E. Max Frye', 'Jeff Daniels, Melanie Griffith, Ray Liotta, George ''Red'' Schwartz, Margaret Colin, Leib Lensky, Tracey Walter, Maggie T.', 'R', 'A free-spirited woman "kidnaps" a yuppie for a weekend of adventure. But the fun quickly takes a dangerous turn when her ex-con husband shows up.', 'A free-spirited woman "kidnaps" a yuppie for a weekend of adventure. But the fun quickly takes a dangerous turn when her ex-con husband shows up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/344lhBozqFWKxBb4fp6azYQMLEy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11300'),
  ('1049807301011878388', 'Something''s Gotta Give', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Nancy Meyers, Michael Ballhaus', 'Nancy Meyers', 'Jack Nicholson, Diane Keaton, Keanu Reeves, Frances McDormand, Amanda Peet, Jon Favreau, Paul Michael Glaser, Rachel Ticotin', 'PG-13', 'When perpetually single, aging music industry exec Harry Sanborn, and his latest trophy girlfriend, Marin, arrive at her mother''s beach house in the Hamptons, they find that her mother, playwright Erica Barry, also plans to stay for the weekend. Erica is scandalized by the relationship and Harry''s sexist ways. But when Harry has a heart attack while there, and the doctor prescribes bedrest, his only option is to stay at the Barry home. Left in the care of Erica and his doctor, a love triangle starts to take shape.', 'When perpetually single, aging music industry exec Harry Sanborn, and his latest trophy girlfriend, Marin, arrive at her mother''s beach house in the Hamptons, they find that her mother, playwright Erica Barry, also plans to stay for the weekend. Erica is scandalized by the relationship and Harry''s sexist ways. But when Harry has a heart attack while there, and the doctor prescribes bedrest, his only option is to stay at the Barry home. Left in the care of Erica and his doctor, a love triangle starts to take shape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1cpdqe0SpiHzzbOLq9GDUUlZdSl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6964'),
  ('67311797985737036', 'Sometimes a Great Notion', 1971, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Paul Newman, Richard Moore, Michael D. Moore', 'John Gay', 'Paul Newman, Henry Fonda, Lee Remick, Michael Sarrazin, Richard Jaeckel, Linda Lawson, Cliff Potts, Sam Gilman', 'PG', 'Hank Stamper and his father, Henry, own and operate the family business by cutting and shipping logs in Oregon. The town is furious when they continue working despite the town going broke and the other loggers go on strike ordering the Stampers to stop, however Hank continues to push his family on cutting more trees. Hank''s wife wishes he would stop and hopes that they can spend more time together. When Hank''s half brother Leland comes to work for them, more trouble starts.', 'Hank Stamper and his father, Henry, own and operate the family business by cutting and shipping logs in Oregon. The town is furious when they continue working despite the town going broke and the other loggers go on strike ordering the Stampers to stop, however Hank continues to push his family on cutting more trees. Hank''s wife wishes he would stop and hopes that they can spend more time together. When Hank''s half brother Leland comes to work for them, more trouble starts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZSweQLYQR1J7oS3IRPk2XE5hRc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40083'),
  ('168608493812486744', 'Sometimes Always Never', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Richard Stoddard, Carl Hunter', 'Frank Cottrell Boyce', 'Bill Nighy, Sam Riley, Jenny Agutter, Alice Lowe, Tim McInnerny, Louis Healy, Ella-Grace Gregoire, Alexei Sayle', null, 'Alan is a stylish tailor with moves as sharp as his suits. He has spent years searching tirelessly for his missing son Michael who stormed out over a game of Scrabble. With a body to identify and his family torn apart, Alan must repair the relationship with his youngest son and solve the mystery of an online player who he thinks could be Michael, so he can finally move on and reunite his family.', 'Alan is a stylish tailor with moves as sharp as his suits. He has spent years searching tirelessly for his missing son Michael who stormed out over a game of Scrabble. With a body to identify and his family torn apart, Alan must repair the relationship with his youngest son and solve the mystery of an online player who he thinks could be Michael, so he can finally move on and reunite his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7tHjke4TIaFWuzg26FwsACHUUC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542714'),
  ('111107144613909047', 'Sometimes Aunt Martha Does Dreadful Things', 1971, 'Horror', 'Thomas Casey, Chris Martell', 'Thomas Casey', 'Wayne Crawford, Abe Zwick, Don Craig, Robin Hughes, Yanka Mann, Marty Cordova, Maggie Wood, Mike Mingoia', 'R', 'Two eccentric fugitives become roommates in Miami to avoid the law, while one dresses in drag as the other''s aunt, leading to deception and murder.', 'Two eccentric fugitives become roommates in Miami to avoid the law, while one dresses in drag as the other''s aunt, leading to deception and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQVad9fEqd1R6pccEdnwk2Uwmln.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104304'),
  ('287031359453439795', 'Sometimes I Think About Dying', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Rachel Lambert, Dustin Lane', 'Katy Wright-Mead, Kevin Armento, Stefanie Abel Horowitz', 'Daisy Ridley, Dave Merheje, Parvesh Cheena, Marcia DeBonis, Megan Stalter, Brittany O''Grady, Bree Elrod, Lauren Beveridge', 'PG-13', 'Fran likes to think about dying. It brings sensation to her quiet life. When she makes the new guy at work laugh, it leads to more: a date, a slice of pie, a conversation, a spark. The only thing standing in their way is Fran herself.', 'Fran likes to think about dying. It brings sensation to her quiet life. When she makes the new guy at work laugh, it leads to more: a date, a slice of pie, a conversation, a spark. The only thing standing in their way is Fran herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lp0dtmNtOW88A13GZjGoKZko7S8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:891933'),
  ('950407294971323454', 'Sometimes in April', 2005, 'Drama, History, War', 'Raoul Peck, Éric Guichard, David Insley', null, 'Idris Elba, Carole Karemera, Pamela Nomvete, Oris Erhuero, Fraser James, Abby Mukiibi Nkaaga, Cleophas Kabasita, Noah Emmerich', null, 'Two brothers are divided by marriage and fate during the 100 horrifying days of the 1994 Rwandan genocide.', 'Two brothers are divided by marriage and fate during the 100 horrifying days of the 1994 Rwandan genocide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDr1iXVPKSdzPMb1QeGwacEL9Vq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16374'),
