  ('343657153671840', 'Somewhere Amazing', 2015, 'Drama', 'Claudio Cofrancesco, Giorgia Cecere', 'Giorgia Cecere, Pierpaolo Pirone', 'Isabella Ragonese, Alessio Boni, Piera Degli Esposti, Paolo Sassanelli, Tatiana Lepore, Michele Griffo, Faysal Abbaoui, Teresa Acerbis', null, 'Asti, third millennium. Lucia, mother and wife on the verge of boredom, opens up to friendship with the immigrant Ahmed, looking for an escape from the routine.', 'Asti, third millennium. Lucia, mother and wife on the verge of boredom, opens up to friendship with the immigrant Ahmed, looking for an escape from the routine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGiCHlcqOOxnlkf41klLmzrnRgf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356461'),
