  ('650310917847579731', 'Son of Samson', 1960, 'Adventure, Action, Drama, Romance', 'Carlo Campogalliani, Mario Bava, Romolo Guerrieri', null, 'Mark Forest, Chelo Alonso, Vira Silenti, Angelo Zanolli, Federica Ranchi, Carlo Tamberlani, Nino Musco, Zvonimir Rogoz', null, 'Maciste travels to Egypt, where he leads a revolt against an evil queen. In Son of Samson, Maciste (Mark Forrest) -- scion of the famed muscleman -- travels to the Egyptian city of Tanis to checkmate villainous Queen Smedes (Chelo Alonso), who''s persecuting the citizenry.', 'Maciste travels to Egypt, where he leads a revolt against an evil queen. In Son of Samson, Maciste (Mark Forrest) -- scion of the famed muscleman -- travels to the Egyptian city of Tanis to checkmate villainous Queen Smedes (Chelo Alonso), who''s persecuting the citizenry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNFqjnajVrknI1MC8xzoP5H7i5M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206004'),
