  ('903737154974576553', 'Son of Sardaar 2', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Vijay Kumar Arora, Aseem Bajaj, Amit Singh Rajput', 'Jagdeep Singh Sidhu, Mohit Jain', 'Ajay Devgn, Mrunal Thakur, Ravi Kishan, Neeru Bajwa, Vindu Dara Singh, Mukul Dev, Sanjay Mishra, Deepak Dobriyal', null, 'Years after settling an epic family feud and surviving house arrest in Punjab, Jassi Singh Randhawa returns this time chasing love, not trouble. But when he lands in Scotland to win back his estranged wife, he stumbles into a hostage crisis, a mafia war and the most bizarre Sardaar wedding of the century.', 'Years after settling an epic family feud and surviving house arrest in Punjab, Jassi Singh Randhawa returns this time chasing love, not trouble. But when he lands in Scotland to win back his estranged wife, he stumbles into a hostage crisis, a mafia war and the most bizarre Sardaar wedding of the century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k47tmhqiUsmD6UoyoimHVQAjHx9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1311649'),
  ('573117513891862846', 'Son of Satyamurthy', 2015, 'Drama, Action, Comedy, Family', 'Trivikram Srinivas, Prasad Murella', 'Trivikram Srinivas', 'Allu Arjun, Samantha Ruth Prabhu, Upendra, Rajendra Prasad, Prakash Raj, Nithya Menen, Brahmanandam, M. S. Narayana', null, 'The son of a rich businessman struggles to save his father''s wealth after his demise. However, he faces many challenges when he becomes the sole breadwinner of his family.', 'The son of a rich businessman struggles to save his father''s wealth after his demise. However, he faces many challenges when he becomes the sole breadwinner of his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpLPTaZ6EpxCJIud39OLhAaq0p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333876'),
