  ('1100920216419626115', 'Son of the Bride', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Juan José Campanella, Valeria Pivato, Daniel Shulman', 'Fernando Castets, Juan José Campanella', 'Ricardo Darín, Héctor Alterio, Norma Aleandro, Eduardo Blanco, Natalia Verbeke, David Masajnik, Claudia Fontán, Atilio Pozzobón', 'R', 'At age 42, Rafael Belvedere is having a crisis. He lives in the shadow of his father, he feels guilty about rarely visiting his aging mother, his ex-wife says he doesn''t spend enough time with their daughter and he has yet to make a commitment to his girlfriend. At his lowest point, a minor heart attack reunites him with Juan Carlos, a childhood friend, who helps Rafael to reconstruct his past.', 'At age 42, Rafael Belvedere is having a crisis. He lives in the shadow of his father, he feels guilty about rarely visiting his aging mother, his ex-wife says he doesn''t spend enough time with their daughter and he has yet to make a commitment to his girlfriend. At his lowest point, a minor heart attack reunites him with Juan Carlos, a childhood friend, who helps Rafael to reconstruct his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zXInKuQ8FW18Ko8CtY9V30qhz1P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19460'),
