  ('320443226940714525', 'Son of the Nile', 1951, 'Drama', 'Youssef Chahine, Bruno Salfi', 'Youssef Chahine, Fattoh Nashaty, Nairuz Abdel Malek', 'Faten Hamama, Yehia Chahine, Shoukry Sarhan, Mahmoud El Meligy, Samiha Tawfiq, Ferdoos Mohamed, Omar Al-Hariri, Reyaad ElQasabgy', null, 'Hemaidah is a Farmer who hates country life. He hates working in fields and taking care of the animals in his farm. Though unsatisfied with her, he marries Zebeidah, a woman in the same village.', 'Hemaidah is a Farmer who hates country life. He hates working in fields and taking care of the animals in his farm. Though unsatisfied with her, he marries Zebeidah, a woman in the same village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xpPqo4IDKD9yJ480NZdMe0KikTY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199495'),
