  ('538936030897233965', 'Song at Midnight', 1937, 'Horror, Drama, Music, Romance', 'Weibang Ma-Xu, Yu Sheng-San, Xue Boqing', 'Weibang Ma-Xu', 'Chao Shi, Jin Shan, Hu Ping, Wenzhu Zhou, Menghe Gu, Xu Man-Li, Weiyi Wang, Chan Wan', null, 'In this Chinese version of The Phantom of the Opera, the mysterious Song Danping terrorizes the newly rebuilt opera house and its young star.', 'In this Chinese version of The Phantom of the Opera, the mysterious Song Danping terrorizes the newly rebuilt opera house and its young star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKEoGdWHDldZGnVrqLTujTw60h9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30992'),
  ('66681326420579347', 'Song Express', 2021, 'Comedy, Music', 'Fabrice Maruca, Pierre Aïm', 'Fabrice Maruca, Isabelle Lazard, Alexandre Charlot', 'Jérémy Lopez, Alice Pol, Artus, Clovis Cornillac, Chantal Neuwirth, Annie Grégorio, Frédéric Gorny, Olivier Bayart', null, 'Franck just had the most crazy and wonderful idea for a company that would finally get him and his friends proper jobs. As Uber delivers food, Amazon daily items, Song Express will deliver songs. To your friends, or your loved one, or yourself, anywhere you want. It is brilliant, it is foolish, it could work… For Franck, Jean-Claude, Sophie and José, Song Express becomes something more than just a professional challenge: it is the dream of a lifetime.', 'Franck just had the most crazy and wonderful idea for a company that would finally get him and his friends proper jobs. As Uber delivers food, Amazon daily items, Song Express will deliver songs. To your friends, or your loved one, or yourself, anywhere you want. It is brilliant, it is foolish, it could work… For Franck, Jean-Claude, Sophie and José, Song Express becomes something more than just a professional challenge: it is the dream of a lifetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNYYiZUu3OCFBY7f2ELiGAqDFC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:844043'),
  ('4448070806503536', 'Song for a Raggy Boy', 2003, 'Drama, History', 'Aisling Walsh, Peter Robertson', 'Kevin Byron Murphy, Patrick Galvin, Aisling Walsh', 'Aidan Quinn, Iain Glen, Marc Warren, Dudley Sutton, Alan Devlin, Stuart Graham, Bernard Manning, John Travers', null, 'William Franklin is a teacher who was born in Ireland and moved to the United States only to repatriate in 1939 after his leftist political views cause him to lose his job. Franklin becomes the first non-cleric instructor at St. Jude''s, a school for wayward boys run by Brother John, who is a firm believer in strong discipline.', 'William Franklin is a teacher who was born in Ireland and moved to the United States only to repatriate in 1939 after his leftist political views cause him to lose his job. Franklin becomes the first non-cleric instructor at St. Jude''s, a school for wayward boys run by Brother John, who is a firm believer in strong discipline.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rB1K3v5780GVH5KUGFadWi4w8Aw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49890'),
  ('797859059315890991', 'Song for Marion', 2012, 'Music, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Paul Andrew Williams, Carlos Catalán, Keith Slote', 'Paul Andrew Williams', 'Terence Stamp, Vanessa Redgrave, Gemma Arterton, Christopher Eccleston, Anne Reid, Ram John Holder, Barry Martin, Taru Devani', 'PG-13', 'Arthur is a grumpy pensioner who can''t understand why his wife Marion would want to embarrass herself singing silly songs with her unconventional local choir. But choir director Elizabeth sees something special in the reluctant Arthur and refuses to give up on him. As she coaxes him out of his shell, Arthur realizes that it is never too late to change.', 'Arthur is a grumpy pensioner who can''t understand why his wife Marion would want to embarrass herself singing silly songs with her unconventional local choir. But choir director Elizabeth sees something special in the reluctant Arthur and refuses to give up on him. As she coaxes him out of his shell, Arthur realizes that it is never too late to change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPsgQM36NxFGqINruFUceFYyyOd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127370'),
  ('55809478326212584', 'Song of Avignon', 1998, 'Documentary', 'Jonas Mekas', 'Jonas Mekas', 'Angus MacLise, Jonas Mekas', 'PG-13', 'Jonas Mekas reflects on a 1966 trip to Avignon that offered solace during a period of personal crisis. Combining diary texts read by Angus MacLise with images of place and memory, the film becomes a lyrical meditation on pain, survival, and the restorative power of reflection.', 'Jonas Mekas reflects on a 1966 trip to Avignon that offered solace during a period of personal crisis. Combining diary texts read by Angus MacLise with images of place and memory, the film becomes a lyrical meditation on pain, survival, and the restorative power of reflection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xOE68u0aRMLx9b2TTwgnVXCs2dv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280105'),
  ('705607946835903645', 'Song of Heroes', 1932, 'Documentary', 'Joris Ivens', null, null, null, 'The building of blast furnaces Magnitogorsk and the Kubas Basin by Komsomol, the Communist Union of youth, as part of Stalin’s first five-year plan.', 'The building of blast furnaces Magnitogorsk and the Kubas Basin by Komsomol, the Communist Union of youth, as part of Stalin’s first five-year plan.', null, 'tmdb:movie:159245'),
  ('1022550289135027946', 'Song of Love', 1950, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Jean Genet, Jacques Natteau', 'Jean Genet', 'Bravo, Jean Genet, Java, Coco Le Martiniquais, André Reybaz, Lucien Sénémaud', null, 'Two prisoners in complete isolation, separated by the thick brick walls, and desperately in need of human contact, devise a most unusual kind of communication.', 'Two prisoners in complete isolation, separated by the thick brick walls, and desperately in need of human contact, devise a most unusual kind of communication.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1kTX4ulq9GEZdtN1C6acMWZFk2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87561'),
  ('92835763367095540', 'Song of Silence', 2012, 'Drama', 'Chen Zhuo, Shi Yue', 'Yankui Sung, Haoyang Chen, Chen Zhuo', 'Yaning Ying, Bingbin Wu, Li Qiang, Yu Xuan', null, 'Jing lives with her mother and grandparents in a small fishing village in a southern Chinese province. Instead of going to school, the deaf-mute teenager spends her time on a fishing boat with her mentally handicapped uncle – until one day she gets (too) close to him. Mei, a city kid rock musician of the same age, travels from club to club with her guitar, dreaming of an independent life. When Jing goes to live in the city with her hardboiled police officer father Zhang, the two girls come together. Mei is Zhang’s lover. Despite an initial standoff, the three manage to open up and create an emotional tie that gives their lives new perspective. SONGS OF SILENCE tells in elegantly convoluted sequences of the meeting and separating of the three protagonists, each of which is isolated in their own way.', 'Jing lives with her mother and grandparents in a small fishing village in a southern Chinese province. Instead of going to school, the deaf-mute teenager spends her time on a fishing boat with her mentally handicapped uncle – until one day she gets (too) close to him. Mei, a city kid rock musician of the same age, travels from club to club with her guitar, dreaming of an independent life. When Jing goes to live in the city with her hardboiled police officer father Zhang, the two girls come together. Mei is Zhang’s lover. Despite an initial standoff, the three manage to open up and create an emotional tie that gives their lives new perspective. SONGS OF SILENCE tells in elegantly convoluted sequences of the meeting and separating of the three protagonists, each of which is isolated in their own way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0yDRmceFgqRoLioQ1IEGcB3MV2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130800'),
  ('1093811013411407963', 'Song of the Assassins', 2022, 'Drama, Action, Mystery', 'Han Guanhua, Daniel Lee, William Chan Wai-Lin', 'Daniel Lee', 'William Feng, Jin Chen, Hu Jun, Wang Qingxiang, Jack Kao, Ray Lui, Kenneth Tsang, Hugo Ng Doi-Yung', null, 'After completing his training, an elite young assassin embarks on his first mission and is quickly ensnared in an intricate plot laid by powerful people pulling strings from the shadows. Upon failing to complete the assignment, he is forced to go on the run—from the government and rival assassin groups alike—as he seeks to unmask the players behind the conspiracy.', 'After completing his training, an elite young assassin embarks on his first mission and is quickly ensnared in an intricate plot laid by powerful people pulling strings from the shadows. Upon failing to complete the assignment, he is forced to go on the run—from the government and rival assassin groups alike—as he seeks to unmask the players behind the conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eiegtcllHRlBkN9qcCQqj2dki0O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504071'),
  ('695957751205822448', 'Song of the Exile', 1990, 'Drama', 'Ann Hui, Zhiwen Zhong, David Chung', 'Wu Nien-jen', 'Maggie Cheung, Lu Hsiao-Fen, Waise Lee Chi-Hung, Tien Feng, Hsiao Hsiang, Chung Siu-Kwong, Tan Lang Jachi Tian, Tinlan Yang', null, 'Set in the early 1970s, it tells the story of a Chinese-Japanese student who returns to her native Hong Kong after graduating from a university in London. Once she arrives back home, she and her family begin to fight, largely due to cultural and societal conflicts between her mother and herself.', 'Set in the early 1970s, it tells the story of a Chinese-Japanese student who returns to her native Hong Kong after graduating from a university in London. Once she arrives back home, she and her family begin to fight, largely due to cultural and societal conflicts between her mother and herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKXsbhdVGrqDTtw5wD5Wln3ukoI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41822'),
  ('540260348549298579', 'Song of the Forest', 1961, 'Fantasy', 'Viktor Ivchenko, Oleksii Prokopenko, Mikhail Rotleyder', 'Viktor Ivchenko', 'Rayisa Nedashkivska, Volodymyr Sydorchuk, Petro Vesklyarov, Vladimir Rudin, Varvara Masliuchenko, Raisa Pyrozhenko, Ada Rohovtseva, Valery Kvitka', null, 'A young couple on the river bank leaf through Lesya Ukrainka''s book "Forest Song". Reading takes the young people to Polesia, where the drama takes place.', 'A young couple on the river bank leaf through Lesya Ukrainka''s book "Forest Song". Reading takes the young people to Polesia, where the drama takes place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bp18aj7BpvlNAlWVAy8qDxfY46c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195764'),
