  ('741276655864952387', 'Song of the South', 1946, 'Family, Animation', 'Harve Foster, Wilfred Jackson, Jack Atwood', 'Morton Grant, Maurice Rapf, Dalton S. Reymond', 'James Baskett, Ruth Warrick, Bobby Driscoll, Luana Patten, Lucile Watson, Hattie McDaniel, Erik Rolf, Glenn Leedy', 'G', 'Uncle Remus draws upon his tales of Br''er Rabbit to help little Johnny deal with his confusion over his parents'' separation as well as his new life on the plantation.', 'Uncle Remus draws upon his tales of Br''er Rabbit to help little Johnny deal with his confusion over his parents'' separation as well as his new life on the plantation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFlWpfcw8TCmZ88jw6e943vEbtu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13850'),
  ('248200747907133468', 'Song of the Thin Man', 1947, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Edward Buzzell, Charles Rosher', 'Steve Fisher, Nat Perrin', 'William Powell, Myrna Loy, Keenan Wynn, Dean Stockwell, Phillip Reed, Patricia Morison, Leon Ames, Gloria Grahame', 'NR', 'Society sleuths Nick and Nora Charles investigate a murder in a jazz club.', 'Society sleuths Nick and Nora Charles investigate a murder in a jazz club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlj6IQrYRtHAQdIY08gicGOBp49.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14595'),
  ('1052637048126124138', 'Song of Youth', 1962, 'Music, Comedy', 'Luis Lucia', null, 'Rocío Dúrcal, Julio Sanjuán, Margot Cottens, María Fernanda D''Ocón, Carlos Estrada, Helga Liné, Carmen de la Maza, Conchita Goyanes', null, 'A town in the Catalan coast hosts two luxury schools: one for boys, run by Don Cesar, a man of antiquated customs, and a female one, run by two nuns, with modern ideas about education. They try to convince D. Cesar that boys and girls should have a healthy friendship. A finding by the sea is the perfect opportunity for students to prove that beautiful human relationship.', 'A town in the Catalan coast hosts two luxury schools: one for boys, run by Don Cesar, a man of antiquated customs, and a female one, run by two nuns, with modern ideas about education. They try to convince D. Cesar that boys and girls should have a healthy friendship. A finding by the sea is the perfect opportunity for students to prove that beautiful human relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oR6lHkuoGh4jnV73mO4timL7qdG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77335'),
  ('33031103288127766', 'Song of Youth', 2019, 'Drama', 'Zhang Luan', 'Zhang Luan', 'Yu Qian, Tang Mengjia, Wang Guangyuan, Qin Mingyue, Xu Zili, Zhang Guoli, Wu Jing, Hu Jun', null, 'A story between school kids and the teacher in a high school happened in 1985 China.', 'A story between school kids and the teacher in a high school happened in 1985 China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96D6K36oAnqpQg1ZkeG8c9gXE3I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:588295'),
  ('1025157866247719639', 'Song One', 2014, 'Drama', 'Kate Barker-Froyland, John Guleserian, Bernard Telsey', 'Kate Barker-Froyland', 'Anne Hathaway, Johnny Flynn, Mary Steenburgen, Ben Rosenfield, Lola Kirke, Gideon Glick, Al Thompson, Jessamine Kelley', 'PG-13', 'Estranged from her family, Franny returns home when an accident leaves her brother comatose. Retracing his life as an aspiring musician, she tracks down his favorite musician, James Forester. Against the backdrop of Brooklyn’s music scene, Franny and James develop an unexpected relationship and face the realities of their lives.', 'Estranged from her family, Franny returns home when an accident leaves her brother comatose. Retracing his life as an aspiring musician, she tracks down his favorite musician, James Forester. Against the backdrop of Brooklyn’s music scene, Franny and James develop an unexpected relationship and face the realities of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6dSJIEMxZFvQ7XJy4sf9fR0p7f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244783'),
  ('890641759734954283', 'Song Sung Blue', 2025, 'Music, Romance, Drama', 'Craig Brewer, H.H. Cooper, Eric Calatayud', 'Craig Brewer, Greg Kohs', 'Hugh Jackman, Kate Hudson, Michael Imperioli, Fisher Stevens, Jim Belushi, Ella Anderson, King Princess, Mustafa Shakir', 'PG-13', 'Based on a true story, two down-on-their-luck musicians form a joyous Neil Diamond tribute band, proving it''s never too late to find love and follow your dreams.', 'Based on a true story, two down-on-their-luck musicians form a joyous Neil Diamond tribute band, proving it''s never too late to find love and follow your dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQzDdxI0F5z16qo2vzDoqdVMl4O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1371185'),
  ('452833842693747920', 'Song to Song', 2017, 'Romance, Drama', 'Madison Fisk, Terrence Malick, Emmanuel Lubezki', 'Terrence Malick', 'Michael Fassbender, Ryan Gosling, Rooney Mara, Natalie Portman, Cate Blanchett, Bérénice Marlohe, Holly Hunter, Val Kilmer', 'R', 'In this modern love story set against the Austin, Texas music scene, two entangled couples — struggling songwriters Faye and BV, and music mogul Cook and the waitress whom he ensnares — chase success through a rock ‘n’ roll landscape of seduction and betrayal.', 'In this modern love story set against the Austin, Texas music scene, two entangled couples — struggling songwriters Faye and BV, and music mogul Cook and the waitress whom he ensnares — chase success through a rock ‘n’ roll landscape of seduction and betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itmaNi14GyWguTOywZ0mMzyScW9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330947'),
  ('585524821935344909', 'Song Without a Name', 2020, 'Drama', 'Melina León, Inti Briones', 'Michael White, Melina León', 'Pamela Mendoza, Tommy Párraga, Lucio Rojas, Maykol Hernández, Ruth Armas, Lidia Quispe', 'NR', 'Peru, at the height of the political crisis of the 1980s. Georgina is a young woman from the Andes whose newborn daughter is stolen at a fake health clinic. Her desperate search for the child leads her to the headquarters of a major newspaper, where she meets Pedro Campos, a lonely journalist who takes on the investigation. Based on a true story.', 'Peru, at the height of the political crisis of the 1980s. Georgina is a young woman from the Andes whose newborn daughter is stolen at a fake health clinic. Her desperate search for the child leads her to the headquarters of a major newspaper, where she meets Pedro Campos, a lonely journalist who takes on the investigation. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dw7Gqz7ABdvFJUuNKICZCum2vEN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582925'),
  ('1013140388420970905', 'Song Without End', 1960, 'Drama, Romance', 'Charles Vidor, Carter DeHaven Jr., James Wong Howe', 'Oscar Millard', 'Dirk Bogarde, Capucine, Geneviève Page, Patricia Morison, Lyndon Brook, Alexander Davion, Lou Jacobi, Katherine Squire', null, 'The romantic story of Hungarian pianist Franz Liszt, whose scandalous love affair forced him to abandon his adoring audiences.', 'The romantic story of Hungarian pianist Franz Liszt, whose scandalous love affair forced him to abandon his adoring audiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DIMjewQUvPhSh2cJHJYLfmPQSv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129553'),
  ('414532145886402386', 'Song''e Napule', 2013, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Antonio Manetti, Francesca Amitrano, Marco Manetti', 'Antonio Manetti, Michelangelo La Neve, Marco Manetti', 'Giampaolo Morelli, Alessandro Roja, Serena Rossi, Paolo Sassanelli, Peppe Servillo, Antonio Pennarella, Juliet Esey Joseph, Carlo Buccirosso', null, 'The police send an unemployed classically-trained musician—under the cover of a trashy wedding singer—to infiltrate the entourage of an elusive Mafia boss.', 'The police send an unemployed classically-trained musician—under the cover of a trashy wedding singer—to infiltrate the entourage of an elusive Mafia boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tB2Re1GAgZLLaiQOS9nidCUHVDy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236368'),
  ('1001642664613909427', 'Songbird', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Jacques Jouffret, Marc Newland, Steven Hacker', 'Simon Boyes, Adam Mason', 'KJ Apa, Sofia Carson, Craig Robinson, Bradley Whitford, Peter Stormare, Elpidia Carrillo, Alexandra Daddario, Lia McHugh', 'PG-13', 'During a pandemic lockdown, Nico, a young man with rare immunity, must overcome martial law, murderous vigilantes and a powerful family to reunite with his love, Sara.', 'During a pandemic lockdown, Nico, a young man with rare immunity, must overcome martial law, murderous vigilantes and a powerful family to reunite with his love, Sara.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pm7pstYup0ZHpImjT0k6YyxGVkX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:721625'),
  ('895970149791913438', 'Songcatcher', 2001, 'Drama, Music', 'Enrique Chediak, Maggie Greenwald', 'Maggie Greenwald', 'Janet McTeer, Michael Goodwin, Gregory Russell Cook, Jane Adams, E. Katherine Kerr, Emmy Rossum, Pat Carroll, Stephanie Roth Haberle', 'PG-13', 'After being denied a promotion at the university where she teaches, Doctor Lily Penleric, a brilliant musicologist, impulsively visits her sister, who runs a struggling rural school in Appalachia. There she stumbles upon the discovery of her life - a treasure trove of ancient Scots-Irish ballads, songs that have been handed down from generation to generation, preserved intact by the seclusion of the mountains. With the goal of securing her promotion, Lily ventures into the most isolated areas of the mountains to collect the songs and finds herself increasingly enchanted.', 'After being denied a promotion at the university where she teaches, Doctor Lily Penleric, a brilliant musicologist, impulsively visits her sister, who runs a struggling rural school in Appalachia. There she stumbles upon the discovery of her life - a treasure trove of ancient Scots-Irish ballads, songs that have been handed down from generation to generation, preserved intact by the seclusion of the mountains. With the goal of securing her promotion, Lily ventures into the most isolated areas of the mountains to collect the songs and finds herself increasingly enchanted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpUSLY5BPi42rqO097tNF8e53Qm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62677'),
  ('336957977967698884', 'Songs', 2011, 'Documentary, Music', 'Eduardo Coutinho, Jacques Cheuiche, Carolina Benevides', 'Eduardo Coutinho', 'Sonia Regina do Nascimento, Déa Franco, Gilmar Altamiro, José Barbosa, Nilton Severino da Silva, Isabell Erdmann, Ózio Albino Santarém, José Lins Araújo', null, 'Simple, emotionally compelling documentary that delves into the songs that hold meaning in people''s lives. It is composed of 18 sessions where the director engages his subjects in conversation about the song they picked. The end product is deeply personal stories about music and its intimate connection to memory, love, loss, self-discovery, regret, death, and life.', 'Simple, emotionally compelling documentary that delves into the songs that hold meaning in people''s lives. It is composed of 18 sessions where the director engages his subjects in conversation about the song they picked. The end product is deeply personal stories about music and its intimate connection to memory, love, loss, self-discovery, regret, death, and life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8NGuEg3vPDzk0xNGn287lsI47KP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254527'),
  ('1806932680296636', 'Songs for After a War', 1976, 'Documentary, History, Music', 'Basilio Martín Patino, José Luis Alcaine', 'José Luis García Sánchez, Basilio Martín Patino', 'Francisco Franco, Philippe Pétain, Imperio Argentina, Lola Flores, José Isbert, Adolf Hitler, Manuel Azaña, Camilo José Cela', null, 'A particular reading of the hard years of famine, repression and censorship after the massacre of the Spanish Civil War (1936-39), through popular culture: songs, newspapers and magazines, movies and newsreels.', 'A particular reading of the hard years of famine, repression and censorship after the massacre of the Spanish Civil War (1936-39), through popular culture: songs, newspapers and magazines, movies and newsreels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v9dd5yGqc6MR81259FWKJK33CAT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256803'),
  ('944905910498821221', 'Songs from the Second Floor', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Roy Andersson, Jesper Klevenås, István Borbás', 'Roy Andersson', 'Lars Nordh, Stefan Larsson, Bengt C.W. Carlsson, Torbjörn Fahlström, Sten Andersson, Rolando Núñez, Lucio Vucina, Per Jörnelius', null, 'A monumental traffic jam serves as the backdrop for the lives of the inhabitants of a Swedish city.', 'A monumental traffic jam serves as the backdrop for the lives of the inhabitants of a Swedish city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMZieoxiQ1hb5zraZlhzcvU7MGN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34070'),
  ('1016278376574307467', 'Songs My Brothers Taught Me', 2015, 'Drama', 'Chloé Zhao, Joshua James Richards', 'Chloé Zhao', 'John Reddy, Jashaun St. John, Irene Bedard, Eléonore Hendricks, Taysha Fuller, Travis Lone Hill, Dakota Brown, Cat Clifford', 'NR', 'This complex portrait of modern-day life on the Pine Ridge Indian Reservation explores the bond between a brother and his younger sister, who find themselves on separate paths to rediscovering the meaning of home.', 'This complex portrait of modern-day life on the Pine Ridge Indian Reservation explores the bond between a brother and his younger sister, who find themselves on separate paths to rediscovering the meaning of home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DiiYoVGtNkvvM8mc5UMIalH7OC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308640'),
  ('683974312229929045', 'Songwriter', 1984, 'Drama, Music', 'Alan Rudolph, Matthew F. Leonetti, David McGiffert', 'Bud Shrake', 'Willie Nelson, Kris Kristofferson, Melinda Dillon, Rip Torn, Lesley Ann Warren, Mickey Raphael, Rhonda Dotson, Richard C. Sarafian', 'R', 'Doc Jenkins may be one of country music''s most beloved stars, but his private life is a wreck. He''s split up with his longtime partner, Blackie Buck, a country outlaw with a heart of gold. Doc''s singer-wife, Honey Carder, has thrown him out of the house. And now he''s gotten involved with a sleazy music manager, Rodeo Rocky, who''s out to steal his material. Teaming up with Blackie, Doc takes drastic measures to win back his family and reclaim his songs.', 'Doc Jenkins may be one of country music''s most beloved stars, but his private life is a wreck. He''s split up with his longtime partner, Blackie Buck, a country outlaw with a heart of gold. Doc''s singer-wife, Honey Carder, has thrown him out of the house. And now he''s gotten involved with a sleazy music manager, Rodeo Rocky, who''s out to steal his material. Teaming up with Blackie, Doc takes drastic measures to win back his family and reclaim his songs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Jbd381ByCj92kj5ZnC3CZ0CFPW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69722'),
  ('962348494107913561', 'Sonho de Arrocha', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy, Music, TV Movie', 'Marcos Alexandre, Wesley Rosa, Bruno Zambelli, Alessandra Pastore', 'Marcos Alexandre, Marcelo Lima', 'Gui Nery, Mônica Anjos, Clara Paixão Sales, Tiago Accioli, Tiago Querino', null, 'Sonho de Arrocha (2026) released on March 30, 2026 starring Gui Nery, Mônica Anjos, Clara Paixão Sales and directed by Marcos Alexandre. Get notified when Sonho de Arrocha is available to stream!', 'Sonho de Arrocha (2026) released on March 30, 2026 starring Gui Nery, Mônica Anjos, Clara Paixão Sales and directed by Marcos Alexandre. Get notified when Sonho de Arrocha is available to stream!', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F5JsQdqDJp89YOfaWLjpcSJKkQgd.jpg', 'plex:movie:sonho-de-arrocha-2026'),
  ('904627795588679786', 'Soni', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Ivan Ayr, David Bolen', 'Ivan Ayr, Kislay Kislay', 'Geetika Vidya, Saloni Batra, Vikas Shukla, Mohit Chauhan, Himanshu Kohli, Gauri Chakraborty, Mohinder Gujral, Upasya Goswami', null, 'Soni, a young policewoman in Delhi, and her superintendent, Kalpana, have collectively taken on a growing crisis of violent crimes against women. However, their alliance suffers a major setback when Soni is transferred out for alleged misconduct on duty.', 'Soni, a young policewoman in Delhi, and her superintendent, Kalpana, have collectively taken on a growing crisis of violent crimes against women. However, their alliance suffers a major setback when Soni is transferred out for alleged misconduct on duty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUczyiHIfi9kxme98T7yyIdyHFT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539036'),
  ('174041588234207167', 'Sonic Christmas Blast', 1996, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Blair Peters', 'Bruce Shelly, Reed Shelly', 'Jaleel White, Long John Baldry, Philip Maurice Hayes, Garry Chalk, Chris Turner, Eric Pospisil, Jay Brazeau, Tabitha St. Germain', null, 'Sonic the Hedgehog must stop the evil Dr. Robotnik from ruining Christmas after Santa Claus disappears.', 'Sonic the Hedgehog must stop the evil Dr. Robotnik from ruining Christmas after Santa Claus disappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dugRUjNPO0vullROtBSORBH3eBD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87442'),
  ('1036228782926469235', 'Sonic Drone Home', 2022, 'Action, Family, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'David Nelson, Hideki Okamura, Akira Sugano', 'Patrick Casey, Josh Miller', 'Ben Schwartz, Fred Tatasciore, Alicyn Packard, Aaron Landon', null, 'Sonic, Tails, and Knuckles encounter an abandoned Badnik drone which upgraded itself using parts from a junkyard, with the intention of conquering the world.', 'Sonic, Tails, and Knuckles encounter an abandoned Badnik drone which upgraded itself using parts from a junkyard, with the intention of conquering the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifc2YN7eZeHKwaoiT0Xn8LiJCFb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:979296'),
  ('1024302776193298278', 'Sonic the Hedgehog', 2020, 'Action, Science Fiction, Comedy, Family', 'David Arnold, Stephen F. Windon, Jeff Fowler', 'Josh Miller, Patrick Casey', 'Ben Schwartz, James Marsden, Tika Sumpter, Jim Carrey, Natasha Rothwell, Adam Pally, Neal McDonough, Lee Majdoub', 'PG', 'Powered with incredible speed, Sonic The Hedgehog embraces his new home on Earth. That is, until Sonic sparks the attention of super-uncool evil genius Dr. Robotnik. Now it’s super-villain vs. super-sonic in an all-out race across the globe to stop Robotnik from using Sonic’s unique power for world domination.', 'Powered with incredible speed, Sonic The Hedgehog embraces his new home on Earth. That is, until Sonic sparks the attention of super-uncool evil genius Dr. Robotnik. Now it’s super-villain vs. super-sonic in an all-out race across the globe to stop Robotnik from using Sonic’s unique power for world domination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQvJ5WPzZgYVDrxLX4R6cLJCEaQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454626'),
  ('183644051889645886', 'Sonic the Hedgehog 2', 2022, 'Action, Adventure, Family, Comedy', 'Brandon Trost, Thomas Ma, Don MacAulay', 'John Whittington, Patrick Casey, Josh Miller', 'Ben Schwartz, James Marsden, Tika Sumpter, Colleen O''Shaughnessey, Idris Elba, Jim Carrey, Natasha Rothwell, Adam Pally', 'PG', 'After settling in Green Hills, Sonic is eager to prove he has what it takes to be a true hero. His test comes when Dr. Robotnik returns, this time with a new partner, Knuckles, in search for an emerald that has the power to destroy civilizations. Sonic teams up with his own sidekick, Tails, and together they embark on a globe-trotting journey to find the emerald before it falls into the wrong hands.', 'After settling in Green Hills, Sonic is eager to prove he has what it takes to be a true hero. His test comes when Dr. Robotnik returns, this time with a new partner, Knuckles, in search for an emerald that has the power to destroy civilizations. Sonic teams up with his own sidekick, Tails, and together they embark on a globe-trotting journey to find the emerald before it falls into the wrong hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6DrHO1jr3qVrViUO6s6kFiAGM7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:675353'),
  ('970764419405655329', 'Sonic the Hedgehog 3', 2024, 'Action, Science Fiction, Comedy, Family', 'Jeff Fowler, Brandon Trost, Cody Gramstead', 'John Whittington, Josh Miller, Patrick Casey', 'Jim Carrey, Ben Schwartz, Keanu Reeves, Idris Elba, Colleen O''Shaughnessey, James Marsden, Tika Sumpter, Lee Majdoub', 'PG', 'Sonic, Knuckles, and Tails reunite against a powerful new adversary, Shadow, a mysterious villain with powers unlike anything they have faced before. With their abilities outmatched in every way, Team Sonic must seek out an unlikely alliance in hopes of stopping Shadow and protecting the planet.', 'Sonic, Knuckles, and Tails reunite against a powerful new adversary, Shadow, a mysterious villain with powers unlike anything they have faced before. With their abilities outmatched in every way, Team Sonic must seek out an unlikely alliance in hopes of stopping Shadow and protecting the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d8Ryb8AunYAuycVKDp5HpdWPKgC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:939243'),
  ('89936440931568773', 'Sonic the Hedgehog 4', 2027, 'Comedy, Action, Family, Science Fiction', 'Jeff Fowler, Brandon Trost, Jeremy Braben', 'Patrick Casey, Josh Miller, John Whittington', 'Ben Schwartz, Jim Carrey, Kristen Bell, Idris Elba, Keanu Reeves, James Marsden, Tika Sumpter, Ben Kingsley', null, 'The fourth installment in the Sonic the Hedgehog film franchise. Plot TBA.', 'The fourth installment in the Sonic the Hedgehog film franchise. Plot TBA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t8uoHBODkFlSQJRL6qc4IclUBlH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1401586'),
  ('755713348290624326', 'Sonic the Hedgehog: The Movie', 1996, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Kazunori Ikegami, Yuji Naka, Naoto Ohshima', 'Masashi Kubota', 'Masami Kikuchi, Hekiru Shiina, Junpei Takiguchi, Yasunori Matsumoto, Mika Kanai, Chafurin, Yuzuru Fujimoto, Akimitsu Takase', 'G', 'Sonic''s arch nemesis Dr. Robotnik has been banished from the Land of Darkness by an evil Metal Robotnik. The devious doctor tells Sonic that the Robot Generator has been sabotaged and will blow Planet Freedom to kingdom come. But it''s not until the President''s beautiful daughter Sara turns on the charm that Sonic springs into action.', 'Sonic''s arch nemesis Dr. Robotnik has been banished from the Land of Darkness by an evil Metal Robotnik. The devious doctor tells Sonic that the Robot Generator has been sabotaged and will blow Planet Freedom to kingdom come. But it''s not until the President''s beautiful daughter Sara turns on the charm that Sonic springs into action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHkpvJ7fjtxJNuDCyGZBHqYG05w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16355'),
  ('303567711332364244', 'Sonic: Night of the Werehog', 2008, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Horror', 'Takashi Nakashima', 'Takashi Nakashima', 'Jun''ichi Kanemaru, Jason Griffith, Ryoko Shiraishi, Anthony Salerno, Kevin Glenz, Ryan Drees, Momoko Ishikawa, Tomokazu Seki', null, 'One night of severe rain, Sonic and Chip come by an old mansion where they decide to take shelter. Whilst Sonic seems unfazed by the creepy surroundings, Chip is scared out of its wits. The mansion is inhabited by three scary - yet sweet - ghosts who like to play tricks on innocent visitors: A cute and girlish ghost who likes to collect photographs of her terrified guests. The remaining two boy ghosts compete for her attention by taking photographs of their scare victims. Their scariness is the key to popularity in the realm of ghosts. The boy ghosts are excited at the prospect of hunting their new and unusual guests, Sonic and Chip. Who will win the ultimate competition to her heart?', 'One night of severe rain, Sonic and Chip come by an old mansion where they decide to take shelter. Whilst Sonic seems unfazed by the creepy surroundings, Chip is scared out of its wits. The mansion is inhabited by three scary - yet sweet - ghosts who like to play tricks on innocent visitors: A cute and girlish ghost who likes to collect photographs of her terrified guests. The remaining two boy ghosts compete for her attention by taking photographs of their scare victims. Their scariness is the key to popularity in the realm of ghosts. The boy ghosts are excited at the prospect of hunting their new and unusual guests, Sonic and Chip. Who will win the ultimate competition to her heart?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8EpqInXBpIqtf7csOmHFsdEvIj3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57982'),
  ('524171176154423144', 'Sonnenallee', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Leander Haußmann, Suse Marquardt', 'Detlev Buck, Thomas Brussig, Leander Haußmann', 'Alexander Scheer, Alexander Beyer, Katharina Thalbach, Teresa Weißbach, Detlev Buck, Henry Hübchen, Ignaz Kirchner, Robert Stadlober', null, 'A group of kids grow up on the short, wrong (east) side of the Sonnenallee in Berlin, right next to one of the few border crossings between East and West reserved for German citizens. The antics of these kids, their families, of the "West German" friends and relatives who come to visit, and of the East German border guards, all serve to illustrate the absurdity of everyday life on the Sonnenallee, and therefore throughout the former East Germany.', 'A group of kids grow up on the short, wrong (east) side of the Sonnenallee in Berlin, right next to one of the few border crossings between East and West reserved for German citizens. The antics of these kids, their families, of the "West German" friends and relatives who come to visit, and of the East German border guards, all serve to illustrate the absurdity of everyday life on the Sonnenallee, and therefore throughout the former East Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkoK4EVQiIx60a65BoR2HGpiw8g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2241'),
  ('447873516013845411', 'Sonny', 2002, 'Crime, Drama', 'Nicolas Cage, Barry Markowitz, Mark Anthony Little', 'John Carlen', 'James Franco, Brenda Blethyn, Harry Dean Stanton, Mena Suvari, Nicolas Cage, Scott Caan, Seymour Cassel, Brenda Vaccaro', null, 'New Orleans, 1981. Sonny Phillips, just discharged from the Army, returns home. The only life he''s known is as a gigolo, working for his mother, but he wants to leave that behind. However, the job his Army buddy promised doesn''t materialize, and he can''t escape his past.', 'New Orleans, 1981. Sonny Phillips, just discharged from the Army, returns home. The only life he''s known is as a gigolo, working for his mother, but he wants to leave that behind. However, the job his Army buddy promised doesn''t materialize, and he can''t escape his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Btip4jrDAxbAuDkEyPq8OkLbZw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28028'),
  ('894120285507721497', 'Sonny and Jed', 1972, 'Western, Comedy', 'Sergio Corbucci, Luis Cuadrado, Ignazio Dolce', 'Mario Amendola, Sergio Corbucci, Adriano Bolzoni', 'Tomas Milian, Susan George, Telly Savalas, Eduardo Fajardo, Rosanna Yanni, Franco Giacobini, Herbert Fux, Werner Pochath', 'R', 'As thoroughly unlikeable a robber as ever walked the West, Joe nonetheless robs from the rich and gives to the poor. Not only is he a murderous, ill-tempered sort, he is bad-mannered, too. When beautiful Sonny decides he should be her man and teach her how to be a proper outlaw, sparks fly.', 'As thoroughly unlikeable a robber as ever walked the West, Joe nonetheless robs from the rich and gives to the poor. Not only is he a murderous, ill-tempered sort, he is bad-mannered, too. When beautiful Sonny decides he should be her man and teach her how to be a proper outlaw, sparks fly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gDEgAYXcd9YvwKnN83fiq2GIPvX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153386'),
  ('1050542266362275030', 'Sonny Boy', 1989, 'Drama, Action, Horror', 'Robert Martin Carroll, Roberto D''Ettorre Piazzoli', 'Graeme Whifler', 'David Carradine, Paul L. Smith, Brad Dourif, Conrad Janis, Sydney Lassick, Savina Geršak, Alexandra Powers, Steve Carlisle', null, 'A small-town car thief and his transgender wife come across an abandoned infant; they amputate his tongue and train him for a life in crime.', 'A small-town car thief and his transgender wife come across an abandoned infant; they amputate his tongue and train him for a life in crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZtbCfP1iXgR0jzoVatki0ru3E3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74343'),
  ('607713713306585126', 'Sonny Boy', 2011, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Maria Peters, Walther van den Ende', 'Pieter Van de Waterbeemd, Maria Peters', 'Ricky Koole, Sergio Hasselbaink, Marcel Hensema, Micha Hulshof, Gijs Blom, Ko Zandvliet, Gaite Jansen, Martijn Lakemeier', null, 'Waldemar Nods, a young man from Suriname, meets the older Dutch woman Rika van der Lans and they fall in love. In pre-WWII Netherlands they could not be more different. The one black, the other white, 17 years between them and on top of that Rika already has four children with another man. They love each other, but then Rika appears to be pregnant.', 'Waldemar Nods, a young man from Suriname, meets the older Dutch woman Rika van der Lans and they fall in love. In pre-WWII Netherlands they could not be more different. The one black, the other white, 17 years between them and on top of that Rika already has four children with another man. They love each other, but then Rika appears to be pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGv3oVnO03RoCLSCt4DVThbpO5q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59424'),
  ('199791660833603144', 'Sono solo fantasmi', 2019, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Christian De Sica, Andrea Arnone, Dario De Natale', 'Christian De Sica, Andrea Bassi, Luigi Di Capua', 'Christian De Sica, Carlo Buccirosso, Gianmarco Tognazzi, Leo Gullotta, Lucianna De Falco, Francesco Bruni, Valentina Martone, Graziella Marina', null, 'Thomas, a struggling former magician, and Carlo, a Neapolitan submissive to his Northern wife and father-in-law, are two half-brothers who reunite after years in Naples following the death of their father, Vittorio, an inveterate gambler and womanizer. They discover they have a third brother, Ugo, who appears a bit dim-witted but is actually a genius. The inheritance Thomas and Carlo covet disappears due to their father''s debts, and the three have a brilliant idea: to exploit Neapolitan superstition and credulity by becoming "ghostbusters." Just when their business seems to be unexpectedly successful, the spirit of their father, Vittorio, takes possession of Carlo''s body. Thomas and Carlo become convinced that ghosts really do exist. Meanwhile, the ghosts captured by the trio break free and go to awaken the ghost of a witch who threatens to destroy Naples. With their father''s help, the three brothers try to save the city.', 'Thomas, a struggling former magician, and Carlo, a Neapolitan submissive to his Northern wife and father-in-law, are two half-brothers who reunite after years in Naples following the death of their father, Vittorio, an inveterate gambler and womanizer. They discover they have a third brother, Ugo, who appears a bit dim-witted but is actually a genius. The inheritance Thomas and Carlo covet disappears due to their father''s debts, and the three have a brilliant idea: to exploit Neapolitan superstition and credulity by becoming "ghostbusters." Just when their business seems to be unexpectedly successful, the spirit of their father, Vittorio, takes possession of Carlo''s body. Thomas and Carlo become convinced that ghosts really do exist. Meanwhile, the ghosts captured by the trio break free and go to awaken the ghost of a witch who threatens to destroy Naples. With their father''s help, the three brothers try to save the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXOpQmTkcJfxldIawlynLzLwO4R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:607346'),
  ('308209745753361793', 'Sonora: The Devil’s Highway', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller, Western', 'Alejandro Springall', 'John Sayles', 'Joaquín Cosío, Giovanna Zacarías, Dolores Heredia, Harold Torres, Juan Manuel Bernal, Erando González, Carolina Molva, Jason Tobin', null, '1931, a year of nationalisms and excesses: The Chinese are expelled from Sonora; the US deports Mexicans and closes its borders. Twelve desperate people cross the Sonoran desert in a 1929 Chrysler, hoping to find peace in Baja California. As their sojourn exposes both the best and the worst of human nature, racism, greed, and paranoia prove as deadly as the merciless landscape around them.', '1931, a year of nationalisms and excesses: The Chinese are expelled from Sonora; the US deports Mexicans and closes its borders. Twelve desperate people cross the Sonoran desert in a 1929 Chrysler, hoping to find peace in Baja California. As their sojourn exposes both the best and the worst of human nature, racism, greed, and paranoia prove as deadly as the merciless landscape around them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BJ1sxznBXp3K5BSUMEbrmQ0j1o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553794'),
  ('41686582024629251', 'Sons', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Erik Richter Strand, Johan-Fredrik Bødtker', 'Erik Richter Strand, Thomas Torjussen', 'Nils Jørgen Kaalstad, Mikkel Bratt Silset, Henrik Mestad, Ingrid Bolsø Berdal, Fredrik Stenberg Ditlev-Simonsen, Edward Schultheiss, Marika Enstad, Joachim Rafaelsen', null, 'Trouble starts when Lars, a 25-year-old with few prospects for the future, discovers that an older man is fooling around with the teenage boys in his suburb. A terrible rage is triggered in Lars, and he embarks on a crusade to stop the abuser. But it soon spins out of control, and Lars'' actions end up endangering those he set out to protect.', 'Trouble starts when Lars, a 25-year-old with few prospects for the future, discovers that an older man is fooling around with the teenage boys in his suburb. A terrible rage is triggered in Lars, and he embarks on a crusade to stop the abuser. But it soon spins out of control, and Lars'' actions end up endangering those he set out to protect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIdHM36qjHNAVbtHBUfLlKEV3sY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43076'),
  ('830702087653747331', 'Sons', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Gustav Möller, Jasper Spanning, Ida Øversveen Gabrielsen', 'Gustav Möller, Emil Nygaard Albertsen', 'Sidse Babett Knudsen, Sebastian Bull Sarning, Dar Salim, Marina Bouras, Olaf Johannessen, Jacob Lohmann, Siir Tilif, Rami Zayat', null, 'Eva, an idealistic prison officer, is faced with the dilemma of her life when a young man from her past gets transferred to the prison where she works. Without revealing her secret, Eva asks to be moved to the young man’s ward – the toughest and most violent in the prison. Here begins an unsettling psychological thriller, where Eva’s sense of justice puts both her morality and future at stake.', 'Eva, an idealistic prison officer, is faced with the dilemma of her life when a young man from her past gets transferred to the prison where she works. Without revealing her secret, Eva asks to be moved to the young man’s ward – the toughest and most violent in the prison. Here begins an unsettling psychological thriller, where Eva’s sense of justice puts both her morality and future at stake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbNoiXJS3PW1u3geU3VcttBqi6C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1113120'),
  ('937771254043808069', 'Sons and Daughters', 2002, 'Drama', 'Marco Bechis', 'Marco Bechis, Lara Fremder, Caterina Giargia', 'Carlos Echeverría, Enrique Piñeyro, Stefania Sandrelli, Julia Sarano, Antonella Costa, Montserrat Alcoverro, Marco Bechis, Delia Cazeaux', null, 'We are in Argentina in 1977, a woman gives birth to twins. With the complicity of the midwife he manages to hide the child, second child. The first, a boy, is taken into custody by the regime''s guards. The scene moves to the Milan of today. The young Rosa contacts Javier and tries to convince him that they are twin brothers, separated at birth. Thus, the two begin a journey to rediscover their origins and their past. A bitter reality is ready to overwhelm them ...', 'We are in Argentina in 1977, a woman gives birth to twins. With the complicity of the midwife he manages to hide the child, second child. The first, a boy, is taken into custody by the regime''s guards. The scene moves to the Milan of today. The young Rosa contacts Javier and tries to convince him that they are twin brothers, separated at birth. Thus, the two begin a journey to rediscover their origins and their past. A bitter reality is ready to overwhelm them ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mgTR6dA2Yp2s1YD4LV97UDt0gnQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59858'),
