  ('211801733693728607', 'Sons of Ramses', 2023, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Clément Cogitore, Tatiana Vialle, Margaux Bail', 'Thomas Bidegain, Fanny Burdino, Camille Lugan', 'Karim Leklou, Malik Zidi, Elsa Wolliaston, Jawad Outouia, Elyes Dkhissi, Yilin Yang, Loubna Abidal, Ahmed Benaissa', null, 'Thirty-four year old Ramsès has established himself as a clairvoyant in La Goutte d’Or, Paris. A shrewd manipulator and something of a poet, he built a sound business consoling people. Elusive and dangerous youths, freshly arrived from the streets of Tangier, disrupt his business and the whole neighbourhood. Until the day Ramses has an actual vision.', 'Thirty-four year old Ramsès has established himself as a clairvoyant in La Goutte d’Or, Paris. A shrewd manipulator and something of a poet, he built a sound business consoling people. Elusive and dangerous youths, freshly arrived from the streets of Tangier, disrupt his business and the whole neighbourhood. Until the day Ramses has an actual vision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fiJZUFBjFBg1XfSg4CGZKWOCqE0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:928200'),
