  ('1008243924931507343', 'Soo', 2007, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Yōichi Sai', 'Lee Joon-il, Seung-hwan Lee, Zizak', 'Ji Jin-hee, Oh Man-seok, Kang Sung-yeon, Lee Ki-young, Cho Gyeong-hwan, Moon Sung-keun, Seo Myeong-seok, Kim Won-jin', null, 'Tae-soo tries to steal from a gang. The gang catches Tae-Soo''s brother, Tae-Jin, instead. The incident causes the brothers to separate. Tae-Soo becomes a mob fixer and an assassin. Tae-Jin becomes a police detective. When a call brings the brothers together, they get ready for brotherly bonding, but Tae-Jin gets killed. Tae-Soo decides to get revenge on his brother''s killer.', 'Tae-soo tries to steal from a gang. The gang catches Tae-Soo''s brother, Tae-Jin, instead. The incident causes the brothers to separate. Tae-Soo becomes a mob fixer and an assassin. Tae-Jin becomes a police detective. When a call brings the brothers together, they get ready for brotherly bonding, but Tae-Jin gets killed. Tae-Soo decides to get revenge on his brother''s killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4uN1J1RGlppK9j4IrCM0UycSG3Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52445'),
