  ('775173834992517055', 'Soorarai Pottru', 2020, 'Drama, Action', 'Sudha Kongara Prasad, Niketh Bommi, Keerthiswaran', 'Shalini Usha Devi, Sudha Kongara Prasad', 'Suriya, Aparna Balamurali, Paresh Rawal, Mohan Babu, Urvashi, Karunas, ''Poo'' Ram, Krishnakumar Balasubramanian', null, 'Nedumaaran Rajangam "Maara" sets out to make the common man fly and in the process takes on the world''s most capital intensive industry and several enemies who stand in his way.', 'Nedumaaran Rajangam "Maara" sets out to make the common man fly and in the process takes on the world''s most capital intensive industry and several enemies who stand in his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uimlxPCgAei8JfQUDFEUQLoyyh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:595228'),
