  ('865607085983713402', 'Sooryavansham', 1999, 'Action, Drama', 'E.V.V. Satyanarayana, Pranavanand, S. Gopala Reddy', 'E.V.V. Satyanarayana', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Soundarya, Anupam Kher, Mukesh Rishi, Shivaji Satham, Bindu Desai, Kader Khan, Rachana Banerjee', null, 'Thakur Bhanupratap, a well-respected village head, deems his youngest son Heera, a failure and treats him poorly. However, despite his father''s disappointment, Heera tries his best to make him proud.', 'Thakur Bhanupratap, a well-respected village head, deems his youngest son Heera, a failure and treats him poorly. However, despite his father''s disappointment, Heera tries his best to make him proud.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fI9cqF4scd7OfIJB5zmfeMxD2bg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194136'),
  ('503678467654534033', 'Sooryavanshi', 2021, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Jomon T. John, Rohit Shetty, Guru Randhawa', 'Farhad Samji', 'Akshay Kumar, Katrina Kaif, Javed Jaffrey, Kumud Mishra, Abhimanyu Singh, Nikitin Dheer, Jackie Shroff, Ajay Devgn', null, 'A fearless, faithful albeit slightly forgetful Mumbai cop, Veer Sooryavanshi, the chief of the Anti-Terrorism Squad in India pulls out all the stops and stunts to thwart a major conspiracy to attack his city.', 'A fearless, faithful albeit slightly forgetful Mumbai cop, Veer Sooryavanshi, the chief of the Anti-Terrorism Squad in India pulls out all the stops and stunts to thwart a major conspiracy to attack his city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgEc1Tn4iKvttPUzkMOUB4BNoXK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592508'),
  ('780940563781884811', 'Sophia Antipolis', 2018, 'Drama', 'Virgil Vernier, Simon Roca, Tom Harari', 'Virgil Vernier', 'Dewi Kunetz, Sandra Poitoux, Hugues Njiba-Mukuna, Bruck, Lilith Grasmug', null, 'Sophia Antipolis: a technopole on the French Riviera, a place where dreams should come true. But fear and despair lurk beneath the surface. Under a deceitful sun, five lives map out the haunting story of a young woman: Sophia.', 'Sophia Antipolis: a technopole on the French Riviera, a place where dreams should come true. But fear and despair lurk beneath the surface. Under a deceitful sun, five lives map out the haunting story of a young woman: Sophia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSiwLUV0vWHUDdON0k1SppgTgbM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537868'),
  ('344250087183465077', 'Sophia de Mello Breyner Andresen', 1972, 'Documentary', 'João César Monteiro, Abel Escoto, Jorge Silva Melo', 'João César Monteiro', 'Sophia de Mello Breyner Andresen', null, '“I think my film represents above all the proof to those who want to understand and accept it, that poetry can’t be filmed, that it is useless to try” - João César Monteiro', '“I think my film represents above all the proof to those who want to understand and accept it, that poetry can’t be filmed, that it is useless to try” - João César Monteiro', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPqJsih6UvBcilssXfQnimf9gX7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199336'),
  ('63782897073480475', 'Sophia Loren, a special destiny', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Julia Bracher', null, 'Sophia Loren, Carlo Ponti, Romilda Villani, Vittorio De Sica, Cary Grant, Ettore Scola, Marlon Brando, Charlie Chaplin', null, 'With a maddening sensuality, the unforgettable actress of the film "A Special Day" embodies the golden age of Italian cinema. From the suburbs of Naples to Hollywood, this biographical documentary looks back at the flamboyant career and destiny of Sophia Loren.', 'With a maddening sensuality, the unforgettable actress of the film "A Special Day" embodies the golden age of Italian cinema. From the suburbs of Naples to Hollywood, this biographical documentary looks back at the flamboyant career and destiny of Sophia Loren.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/urAFPa04nUqUBYKdYzcwnn3PeYc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656779'),
  ('713876283576430740', 'Sophia, der Tod und ich', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Charly Hübner, Martin Farkas', 'Lena May Graf', 'Dimitrij Schaad, Anna Maria Mühe, Marc Hosemann, Johanna Gastdorf, Carlo Ljubek, Lina Beckmann, Josef Ostendorf, Mateo Kanngießer', null, 'After a restless night, Reiner''s doorbell rings. In front of it stands Morten de Sarg, which is actually his death. To his amazement, he is unable to let Reiner die; instead, the doorbell rings again. Sophia has a date with her ex-boyfriend for his mother Lore''s birthday. Together they set out on a journey that ultimately leads them to Reiner''s seven-year-old son Johnny, whom he hasn''t seen for ages - all under the strict supervision of God and Archangel Michaela.', 'After a restless night, Reiner''s doorbell rings. In front of it stands Morten de Sarg, which is actually his death. To his amazement, he is unable to let Reiner die; instead, the doorbell rings again. Sophia has a date with her ex-boyfriend for his mother Lore''s birthday. Together they set out on a journey that ultimately leads them to Reiner''s seven-year-old son Johnny, whom he hasn''t seen for ages - all under the strict supervision of God and Archangel Michaela.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJ5uKcBlu8lQlzumSlcZa0aH5qq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1088202'),
  ('896704722318923537', 'Sophie Scholl: The Final Days', 2005, 'Drama, History', 'Martin Langer, Marc Rothemund', 'Fred Breinersdorfer', 'Julia Jentsch, Fabian Hinrichs, Alexander Held, Johanna Gastdorf, André Hennicke, Florian Stetter, Maximilian Brückner, Johannes Suhm', null, 'In 1943, as Hitler continues to wage war across Europe, a group of college students mount an underground resistance movement in Munich. Dedicated expressly to the downfall of the monolithic Third Reich war machine, they call themselves the White Rose. One of its few female members, Sophie Scholl is captured during a dangerous mission to distribute pamphlets on campus with her brother Hans. Unwavering in her convictions and loyalty to the White Rose, her cross-examination by the Gestapo quickly escalates into a searing test of wills as Scholl delivers a passionate call to freedom and personal responsibility.', 'In 1943, as Hitler continues to wage war across Europe, a group of college students mount an underground resistance movement in Munich. Dedicated expressly to the downfall of the monolithic Third Reich war machine, they call themselves the White Rose. One of its few female members, Sophie Scholl is captured during a dangerous mission to distribute pamphlets on campus with her brother Hans. Unwavering in her convictions and loyalty to the White Rose, her cross-examination by the Gestapo quickly escalates into a searing test of wills as Scholl delivers a passionate call to freedom and personal responsibility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aAbxubEzowWJNBWYG82wXcKuzZP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2117'),
  ('706163601371431861', 'Sophie''s Choice', 1982, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Alan J. Pakula, Néstor Almendros', 'Alan J. Pakula', 'Meryl Streep, Kevin Kline, Peter MacNicol, Rita Karin, Josh Mostel, Robin Bartlett, Eugene Lipinski, John Rothman', 'R', 'Stingo, a young writer, moves to Brooklyn in 1947 to begin work on his first novel. As he becomes friendly with Sophie and her lover Nathan, he learns that she is a Holocaust survivor. Flashbacks reveal her harrowing story, from pre-war prosperity to Auschwitz. In the present, Sophie and Nathan''s relationship increasingly unravels as Stingo grows closer to Sophie and Nathan''s fragile mental state becomes ever more apparent.', 'Stingo, a young writer, moves to Brooklyn in 1947 to begin work on his first novel. As he becomes friendly with Sophie and her lover Nathan, he learns that she is a Holocaust survivor. Flashbacks reveal her harrowing story, from pre-war prosperity to Auschwitz. In the present, Sophie and Nathan''s relationship increasingly unravels as Stingo grows closer to Sophie and Nathan''s fragile mental state becomes ever more apparent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZDPbPTFwuKgr5b9jixGFNYkGYt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15764'),
  ('424434867202342235', 'Sophie''s Misfortunes', 2016, 'Family, Comedy', 'Christophe Honoré, André Chemetoff', 'Gilles Taurand, Christophe Honoré', 'Golshifteh Farahani, Anaïs Demoustier, Muriel Robin, Caroline Grant, Céleste Carrale, Justine Morin, David Prat, Aélys Le Nevé', null, 'Sophie is far from being the model little girl one would like her to be, unlike her friends Camille and Madeleine. She always insists on having her own way, often getting into trouble, to the despair of one and all. But her mother is unbending and otherwise inclined. She will not let her get away with anything, and poor Sophie will often have to live with the consequences of her bad behaviour and learn her lesson.', 'Sophie is far from being the model little girl one would like her to be, unlike her friends Camille and Madeleine. She always insists on having her own way, often getting into trouble, to the despair of one and all. But her mother is unbending and otherwise inclined. She will not let her get away with anything, and poor Sophie will often have to live with the consequences of her bad behaviour and learn her lesson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKdmTKeKlEpLv4Z6BTxJWM6jFPy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369784'),
  ('200120823654214244', 'Sophie''s Revenge', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Eva Jin, Armando Salas', 'Eva Jin', 'Zhang Ziyi, Fan Bingbing, Peter Ho, So Ji-sub, Yao Chen, Ruby Lin, Wang Ji, Ai Wan', null, 'Dumped by her fiance just two months before their wedding, comic strip writer Sophie hatches an elaborate plan to get her Jeff back and punish the movie star, Joanna, who seduced him away. She finds herself a partner, Gordon, an ex-lover of Joanna''s. The two start on a comic adventure full of laughs and tears, aided by Sophie''s two best friends, Lucy and Lily. At the eve of her success, Sophie suddenly faced of having to chose between a repentant Jeff and Gordon who has fallen for her.', 'Dumped by her fiance just two months before their wedding, comic strip writer Sophie hatches an elaborate plan to get her Jeff back and punish the movie star, Joanna, who seduced him away. She finds herself a partner, Gordon, an ex-lover of Joanna''s. The two start on a comic adventure full of laughs and tears, aided by Sophie''s two best friends, Lucy and Lily. At the eve of her success, Sophie suddenly faced of having to chose between a repentant Jeff and Gordon who has fallen for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3EwvZJpDdRDc5hnhgvVtbbqZ0oh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24986'),
  ('356691608194620161', 'Sophie''s World', 1999, 'Fantasy, Drama, Family, Adventure, Action', 'Erik Gustavson, Kjell Vassdal', 'Petter Skavlan', 'Silje Storstein, Tomas von Brömssen, Andrine Sæther, Bjørn Floberg, Hans Alfredson, Nils Vogt, Minken Fosheim, Edda Trandum Grjotheim', null, 'One day fourteen-year-old Sophie Amundsen comes home from school to find in her mailbox two notes, with one question on each: "Who are you? and "Where does the world come from?', 'One day fourteen-year-old Sophie Amundsen comes home from school to find in her mailbox two notes, with one question on each: "Who are you? and "Where does the world come from?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRLqdK9JW9tbcyDLgGchrMkxVAS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41992'),
  ('442866536523953875', 'Sophiiiie!', 2003, 'Drama', 'Detlev Schneider, Michael Hofmann, Christopher Rowe', 'Michael Hofmann', 'Katharina Schüttler, Alexander Beyer, Robert Stadlober, Thomas Schüler, Boris Aljinovic, Martin Brambach, Traugott Buhre, Josef Ostendorf', null, 'The film starts in the early evening of a normal day: Sophie, a 20 year old girl, is pregnant and wanders through the night to get sure about her future life. Does she want to be a mother or do an abortion? Does she love her friend or not? Who is the father of her unborn baby? Trying to figure out what to do Sophie encounters many people, and in the morning she has come to a decision. But this is not the movie''s end...', 'The film starts in the early evening of a normal day: Sophie, a 20 year old girl, is pregnant and wanders through the night to get sure about her future life. Does she want to be a mother or do an abortion? Does she love her friend or not? Who is the father of her unborn baby? Trying to figure out what to do Sophie encounters many people, and in the morning she has come to a decision. But this is not the movie''s end...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/psVekaRsb3mmCzMvjEztmKicYTN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10749'),
  ('669545742206156917', 'SOPOR', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Tage Danielsson, Roland Sterner, Catti Edfeldt', 'Tage Danielsson', 'Brasse Brännström, Grynet Molvig, Lena Nyman, Tobias Goldman, Hjördis Petterson, Sven Lindberg, Allan Edwall, Margaretha Krook', null, 'One Monday morning, a thousand children leave the suburb of Farsta and go to Stockholm to occupy the Royal Castle. The children have formed a group called S.O.P.O.R. as a protest against the way adults treat them and have destroyed their future. They demand that the robots in the industry are replaced by humans to create job opportunities. They take the royal family as hostages.', 'One Monday morning, a thousand children leave the suburb of Farsta and go to Stockholm to occupy the Royal Castle. The children have formed a group called S.O.P.O.R. as a protest against the way adults treat them and have destroyed their future. They demand that the robots in the industry are replaced by humans to create job opportunities. They take the royal family as hostages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQKBJ2iqUD7tZmebGyBPzKAvdq8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135394'),
  ('1061330887294136257', 'Sopyonje', 1993, 'Drama', 'Im Kwon-taek, Cha Jung-nam, Kim Hong-joon', null, 'Oh Jung-hae, Kim Myung-gon, Kim Kyu-chul, Shin Sae-kil, Ahn Byeong-kyeong, Park Gil-su, Kim Ki-cheon, Choi Jong-won', null, 'A former pansori performer travels across South Korea in search of the student he studied with.', 'A former pansori performer travels across South Korea in search of the student he studied with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCejyq7oz1WudC8hJqauHlBCAFN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124315'),
  ('810046599504666907', 'Sor Citroen', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Pedro Lazaga Sabater, Juan Mariné, José Luis Pérez Tristán', 'Pedro Masó, Rafael J. Salvia', 'Gracita Morales, José Luis López Vázquez, Rafaela Aparicio, Juanjo Menéndez, Mari Carmen Prendes, Rafael Alonso, Andrés Mejuto, Antonio Ferrandis', null, 'Madrid, Spain. When a religious community running an orphanage buys a car, the vivacious and intrepid Sister Tomasa accepts the task of getting behind the wheel.', 'Madrid, Spain. When a religious community running an orphanage buys a car, the vivacious and intrepid Sister Tomasa accepts the task of getting behind the wheel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onCW28gMja6xGCJLwzbqJtxSUXH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98962'),
  ('810802861216995935', 'Sor Tequila', 1980, 'Comedy, Family', 'Rogelio A. González', null, 'Lucho Navarro, María Elena Velasco, Flor Trujillo, Raúl Ortiz, Jorge Lavat', null, 'La India María, who is really good at sports, becomes a nun and is always getting in trouble for wanting to help people.', 'La India María, who is really good at sports, becomes a nun and is always getting in trouble for wanting to help people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2zXIJ8ueRMQAWLHp1YvdhCa5Rsx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398487'),
  ('132004415392246572', 'Sor Ye-yé', 1968, 'Comedy, Music', 'Ramón Fernández, Jorge Stahl Jr.', 'Vicente Escrivá, José María Sánchez Silva', 'Hilda Aguirre, Manuel Gil, Enrique Guzmán, Sara García, Carmen Montejo, Lina Canalejas, José Gálvez, Ofelia Guilmáin', null, 'Maria is a young orphan who lives with her wealthy aunt. Maria sings in a cocktail bar with his friends, who form a rock band, and enjoy the night with them. One of his friends, Ernesto, is in love with her, though she does not seem to feel the same about him. In fact, multiple existential doubts and feel a strange emptiness in his life suddenly drive to enter a convent as a novice, breaking Ernestos'' heart. However, with her cheerlul character, open and rebellious, not appear to conform to life in the cloister, and especially have problems with the novices director , who often punished for trying to take the right path. In the convent, which also functions as children''s hospital, she meets a doctor with which it takes quite right for the contrast between his two characters, but his way with love and mutual respect.', 'Maria is a young orphan who lives with her wealthy aunt. Maria sings in a cocktail bar with his friends, who form a rock band, and enjoy the night with them. One of his friends, Ernesto, is in love with her, though she does not seem to feel the same about him. In fact, multiple existential doubts and feel a strange emptiness in his life suddenly drive to enter a convent as a novice, breaking Ernestos'' heart. However, with her cheerlul character, open and rebellious, not appear to conform to life in the cloister, and especially have problems with the novices director , who often punished for trying to take the right path. In the convent, which also functions as children''s hospital, she meets a doctor with which it takes quite right for the contrast between his two characters, but his way with love and mutual respect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/egoqV1SdxLn4jZtvK6hEcCfEOdO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81789'),
  ('80857055410195408', 'Sorcerer', 1977, 'Thriller, Adventure, Drama', 'William Friedkin, Dick Bush, John M. Stephens', 'Walon Green, William Friedkin', 'Roy Scheider, Bruno Cremer, Francisco Rabal, Amidou, Ramon Bieri, Peter Capell, Karl John, Friedrich von Ledebur', 'PG', 'Four men from different parts of the globe, all hiding from their pasts in the same remote South American town, agree to risk their lives transporting several cases of dynamite (which is so old that it is dripping unstable nitroglycerin) across dangerous jungle terrain.', 'Four men from different parts of the globe, all hiding from their pasts in the same remote South American town, agree to risk their lives transporting several cases of dynamite (which is so old that it is dripping unstable nitroglycerin) across dangerous jungle terrain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDQWVAxQPflZPrnXznfJZ2cyYxp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38985'),
  ('1082397890909752798', 'Sorceress', 1982, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Jack Hill, Álex Phillips Jr.', 'Jim Wynorski', 'Leigh Harris, Lynette Harris, Roberto Nelson, David Millbern, Bruno Rey, Ana De Sade, Roberto Ballesteros, Douglas Sandoval', 'R', 'Twin warrior sisters, raised in the wilderness and trained for battle, must survive a bizarre world of monsters, cultists, zombies, and barbarians as they prepare for a final showdown with the father who once tried to destroy them.', 'Twin warrior sisters, raised in the wilderness and trained for battle, must survive a bizarre world of monsters, cultists, zombies, and barbarians as they prepare for a final showdown with the father who once tried to destroy them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXbCl3j08WviEpapDr9HWd7mI4u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41889'),
  ('467380507707542982', 'Sorceress', 1995, 'Fantasy, Horror, Thriller', 'Gary Graver, Jim Wynorski, Fred Olen Ray', 'Mark Thomas McGee', 'Larry Poindexter, Linda Blair, Edward Albert, Julie Strain, Rochelle Swanson, Michael Parks, Lenny Juliano, Toni Naples', null, 'Two friends, who both work for the same high-priced, high-powered law firm, are both married to modern day witches. Erica, the wife of Larry, believes that he is being led astray by Carol, an old flame, who also works for the same law firm. Erica decides to act and one night after a torrid sex session Larry drifts off to sleep and begins to dream. Soon the dream turns into a nightmare of sex, violence, murder and death involving himself, his friends and colleagues from the law firm which appears to be frighteningly realistic...', 'Two friends, who both work for the same high-priced, high-powered law firm, are both married to modern day witches. Erica, the wife of Larry, believes that he is being led astray by Carol, an old flame, who also works for the same law firm. Erica decides to act and one night after a torrid sex session Larry drifts off to sleep and begins to dream. Soon the dream turns into a nightmare of sex, violence, murder and death involving himself, his friends and colleagues from the law firm which appears to be frighteningly realistic...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4yTPpffXf0WA33rgweZ1Y7PUe0L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28529'),
  ('455301587525704568', 'Sorceress II: The Temptress', 1997, 'Horror, Romance, Thriller', 'Richard Styles, Gary Graver, A. Brooks Medoff', 'Richard Styles', 'Julie Strain, Greg Wrangler, Sandahl Bergman, Julie K. Smith, Christian Noble, John Henry Richardson, Michael Jay, Jim Wynorski', 'R', 'In this sensual horror tale, Paul Stevens is transported to a mysterious world where he is surrounded by strange and beautiful women, led by Tara Coventry. Tara initiates Paul into their world of bizarre erotic rituals; however Tara and her minions are actually practitioners of black magic, who are trying to snare Paul''s soul through their sexual mischief. Will he realize the evil he has fallen into before it is too late?', 'In this sensual horror tale, Paul Stevens is transported to a mysterious world where he is surrounded by strange and beautiful women, led by Tara Coventry. Tara initiates Paul into their world of bizarre erotic rituals; however Tara and her minions are actually practitioners of black magic, who are trying to snare Paul''s soul through their sexual mischief. Will he realize the evil he has fallen into before it is too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqDX2ivwFnOkMCpBafJM3OTKbrB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28530'),
  ('944518623228215095', 'Sordid Lives', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Del Shores', 'Del Shores', 'Olivia Newton-John, Kirk Geiger, Beau Bridges, Bonnie Bedelia, Beth Grant, Leslie Jordan, Sarah Hunley, Ann Walker', 'R', 'As three generations of a family in a small Texas town gather for a funeral, we learn the hilarious, sad, trashy truth of their sordid lives.', 'As three generations of a family in a small Texas town gather for a funeral, we learn the hilarious, sad, trashy truth of their sordid lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ye41wOhpEeRjBiFV74BHrrCbwa8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19094'),
  ('300120681015076203', 'Sore: A Wife from the Future', 2025, 'Fantasy, Romance, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Yandy Laurens, Dimas Bagus Triatma Yoga, Abet Fahmi', 'Yandy Laurens', 'Sheila Dara Aisha, Dion Wiyoko, Goran Bogdan, Lara Nekić, Livio Badurina, Mathias Muchus, Maya Hasan, Borko Perić', null, 'A young man living alone in Croatia encounters a woman who claims to be his wife from the future, sent on a mission to help him correct his bad habits and improve his lifestyle.', 'A young man living alone in Croatia encounters a woman who claims to be his wife from the future, sent on a mission to help him correct his bad habits and improve his lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sDAvZaPFctekJhln1vXsy7X1BTr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1385536'),
  ('80161434259026373', 'Sorelle Mai', 2011, 'Drama', 'Marco Bellocchio, Marco Sgorbati, William Santero', 'Marco Bellocchio', 'Pier Giorgio Bellocchio, Elena Bellocchio, Donatella Finocchiaro, Letizia Bellocchio, Maria Luisa Bellocchio, Gianni Schicchi, Alba Rohrwacher', null, 'The film, a nostalgic fantasy documentary, depicts in six episodes a family story in Bobbio between 1999 and 2008. We discover the 5 years-old Elena being brought up by her aunts (Marco Bellocchio''s sisters) because her mother Sara is trying to succeed as an actress in Milan. Her uncle Giorgio has a difficult relationship with his sister and judges her for not taking care of her daughter. But as soon as Sara can afford it, she offers to take Elena with her, leaving the village and her aunts, perhaps for ever - while Giorgio, up to his eyeballs in debt, takes refuge in Bobbio. His sister will help him and sell a house.', 'The film, a nostalgic fantasy documentary, depicts in six episodes a family story in Bobbio between 1999 and 2008. We discover the 5 years-old Elena being brought up by her aunts (Marco Bellocchio''s sisters) because her mother Sara is trying to succeed as an actress in Milan. Her uncle Giorgio has a difficult relationship with his sister and judges her for not taking care of her daughter. But as soon as Sara can afford it, she offers to take Elena with her, leaving the village and her aunts, perhaps for ever - while Giorgio, up to his eyeballs in debt, takes refuge in Bobbio. His sister will help him and sell a house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6cpmZoAJyvDnbcTImeLS9NFpaa0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72057'),
  ('547962681885509308', 'Sörensen Catches Fire', 2023, 'TV Movie, Crime, Comedy', 'Bjarne Mädel, Matthias Schuart, Christoph Holsten', 'Sven Stricker', 'Bjarne Mädel, Katrin Wichmann, Leo Meier, Liv Clasvogt, Luise Heyer, Karoline Eichhorn, Michael Maertens, Joachim Meyerhoff', null, 'Inspector Sörensen has finally retreated to the Frisian province, but he still has to contend with his own inner demons. Loneliness, insomnia and inner restlessness plague him, and although he does everything he can to stop taking his medication for the anxiety disorder, he remains trapped in his psychological torment. One dark night he almost runs over a young, disturbed woman on the country road. She is malnourished, wears only a nightgown and is blind. After she finally reveals her identity to Sörensen, a web of murder, religious madness and well-kept secrets begins to unfold before him. Sörensen is overwhelmed, not only by the shocking situation, but also by his own demons, which are gaining power over him again. The villagers reject him, and as fear takes hold of him again, he will soon realize that it won''t just be a corpse.', 'Inspector Sörensen has finally retreated to the Frisian province, but he still has to contend with his own inner demons. Loneliness, insomnia and inner restlessness plague him, and although he does everything he can to stop taking his medication for the anxiety disorder, he remains trapped in his psychological torment. One dark night he almost runs over a young, disturbed woman on the country road. She is malnourished, wears only a nightgown and is blind. After she finally reveals her identity to Sörensen, a web of murder, religious madness and well-kept secrets begins to unfold before him. Sörensen is overwhelmed, not only by the shocking situation, but also by his own demons, which are gaining power over him again. The villagers reject him, and as fear takes hold of him again, he will soon realize that it won''t just be a corpse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lnHJ0zDd5T9wligWf2LrMAd1DPq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1185778'),
  ('884947581078977016', 'Sörensen''s Fear', 2020, 'Crime, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Bjarne Mädel, Kristian Leschner', 'Sven Stricker', 'Bjarne Mädel, Katrin Wichmann, Leo Meier, Matthias Brandt, Peter Kurth, Anne Ratte-Polle, Claude Heinrich, Yorck Dippe', null, 'Detective Chief Inspector Sörensen is anxious. More precisely, he suffers from a chronic anxiety disorder that makes life difficult for him. That is why he is moving from Hamburg to the Frisian village of Katenbüll, where he hopes for a more peaceful working life. But that is not how the cookie crumbles. The place is grey and bleak, it rains continuously, and the locals are not very enthusiastic in welcoming him. He also finds his new colleagues, Jenni Holstenbeck and Malte Schuster, somewhat suspect. And then things go from bad to worse. Mayor Hinrichs is found dead in his stables. Sörensen quickly realises that there is a lot of bad blood hidden behind the small town''s tranquil facade and some well-founded reasons for anxiety...', 'Detective Chief Inspector Sörensen is anxious. More precisely, he suffers from a chronic anxiety disorder that makes life difficult for him. That is why he is moving from Hamburg to the Frisian village of Katenbüll, where he hopes for a more peaceful working life. But that is not how the cookie crumbles. The place is grey and bleak, it rains continuously, and the locals are not very enthusiastic in welcoming him. He also finds his new colleagues, Jenni Holstenbeck and Malte Schuster, somewhat suspect. And then things go from bad to worse. Mayor Hinrichs is found dead in his stables. Sörensen quickly realises that there is a lot of bad blood hidden behind the small town''s tranquil facade and some well-founded reasons for anxiety...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9APuzYQ66dNIDUHdOJ6nXjMKZvs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:762426'),
  ('1086828584302620829', 'Sori: Voice from the Heart', 2016, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Lee Ho-jae, Ju Sung-lim, Choi Jong-ha', 'Lee Soyoung', 'Lee Sung-min, Shim Eun-kyung, Lee Hanee, Chae Soo-bin, Lee Hee-jun, Kim Won-hae, Ryu Jun-yeol, Jeon Kuk-hwan', null, 'While desperately searching for his missing daughter, Hae-kwan comes across an AI satellite robot that remembers sounds from all over the world. Rejuvenated by the robot''s abilities, Hae-kwan begins to track down his daughter''s voice. As they continue their journey, they form an unforgettable bond.', 'While desperately searching for his missing daughter, Hae-kwan comes across an AI satellite robot that remembers sounds from all over the world. Rejuvenated by the robot''s abilities, Hae-kwan begins to track down his daughter''s voice. As they continue their journey, they form an unforgettable bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssSm8ZpOdKffynphV0z2ENYUNwm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380254'),
  ('193158311121885044', 'Sorority Babes in the Slimeball Bowl-O-Rama', 1988, 'Comedy, Horror', 'David DeCoteau, Stephen Ashley Blake, Will Clark', 'Sergei Hasenecz', 'Linnea Quigley, Andras Jones, Robin Stille, Hal Havins, Brinke Stevens, Michelle Bauer, Kathi O''Brecht, Carla Baron', 'R', 'Out to steal a trophy from a local bowling alley, a group of college students accidentally unleash the imp -- a sadistic little spirit that creates demons and loves sexy women.', 'Out to steal a trophy from a local bowling alley, a group of college students accidentally unleash the imp -- a sadistic little spirit that creates demons and loves sexy women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2I7yv8T9rX1C1cBtJOrdOxoh7W3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27390'),
  ('584274652896826820', 'Sorority Boys', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Michael D. O''Shea, Wallace Wolodarsky', 'Joe Jarvis, Greg Coolidge', 'Barry Watson, Michael Rosenbaum, Harland Williams, Melissa Sagemiller, Tony Denman, Brad Beyer, Kathryn Stockwood, Heather Matarazzo', 'R', 'After being falsely accused of stealing the budget for their annual cocktail cruise, three very different fraternity brothers are kicked out of their dorm. In order to clear their name and to secure their future careers, the three dress up in drag and pledge the sorority next door where they learn a few valuable - and hilarious - lessons about themselves and the female species.', 'After being falsely accused of stealing the budget for their annual cocktail cruise, three very different fraternity brothers are kicked out of their dorm. In order to clear their name and to secure their future careers, the three dress up in drag and pledge the sorority next door where they learn a few valuable - and hilarious - lessons about themselves and the female species.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBhRjKi16T9R3GJepPwS6ARViBi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6020'),
  ('1124852555742167497', 'Sorority Girl', 1957, 'Drama', 'Roger Corman, Monroe P. Askins', 'Ed Waters', 'Susan Cabot, Dick Miller, Barboura Morris, June Kenney, Barbara Cowan, Fay Baker, Jeane Wood, Joan Lora', 'NR', 'An affluent, malevolent girl at an all-female boarding school torments her fellow pupils while navigating a contentious relationship with her mother, who controls her late father''s inheritance money.', 'An affluent, malevolent girl at an all-female boarding school torments her fellow pupils while navigating a contentious relationship with her mother, who controls her late father''s inheritance money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jevOrjLMHyM77J1frsbDVIDFGu6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85853'),
  ('924820597183787349', 'Sorority House Massacre', 1986, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Carol Frank, Marc Reshovsky, Bruce Carter', 'Carol Frank', 'Angela O''Neill, Wendy Martel, Pamela Ross, Nicole Rio, John C. Russell, Robert Axelrod, Marcus Vaughter, Vinnie Bilancio', 'R', 'Upon joining a sorority, Beth is plagued by nightmares of a knife-wielding killer, when her past comes back to haunt her.', 'Upon joining a sorority, Beth is plagued by nightmares of a knife-wielding killer, when her past comes back to haunt her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oU2i9iabbzBbDdKxv1PqQjoqSbw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40760'),
  ('446718653508141223', 'Sorority House Massacre II', 1990, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'J. E. Bash, Jim Wynorski, Jürgen Baum', 'J.B. Rogers, Mark Thomas McGee, Bob Sheridan', 'Gail Harris, Melissa Moore, Peter Spellos, Stacia Zhivago, Barbii, Dana Bentley, Jürgen Baum, Toni Naples', 'NR', 'Five college women buy the old Hokstedter place for their new sorority house. They got it cheap because of the bloody incidents from five years before. They decide to stay in it for the night so they can meet the movers in the morning, but begin to get the creeps when the weird neighbor Orville Ketchum starts poking around. Shortly after the women take showers and consult a Ouija board they begin experiencing an attrition problem.', 'Five college women buy the old Hokstedter place for their new sorority house. They got it cheap because of the bloody incidents from five years before. They decide to stay in it for the night so they can meet the movers in the morning, but begin to get the creeps when the weird neighbor Orville Ketchum starts poking around. Shortly after the women take showers and consult a Ouija board they begin experiencing an attrition problem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8x7CFIX8Xhbl4YfvnB3gGNH4RJJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40446'),
  ('135261917447809422', 'Sorority Row', 2009, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Stewart Hendler, Hal Olofsson, Greg Guzik', 'Josh Stolberg, Pete Goldfinger, Mark Rosman', 'Briana Evigan, Leah Pipes, Rumer Willis, Margo Harshman, Audrina Patridge, Julian Morris, Carrie Fisher, Jamie Chung', 'R', 'When five sorority girls inadvertently cause the murder of one of their sisters in a prank gone wrong, they agree to keep the matter to themselves and never speak of it again, so they can get on with their lives. This proves easier said than done, when after graduation a mysterious killer goes after the five of them and anyone who knows their secret.', 'When five sorority girls inadvertently cause the murder of one of their sisters in a prank gone wrong, they agree to keep the matter to themselves and never speak of it again, so they can get on with their lives. This proves easier said than done, when after graduation a mysterious killer goes after the five of them and anyone who knows their secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/voIQd9TDplumz9wInHwj6bRyHnu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26688'),
  ('700437886342244013', 'Sorority Wars', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'James Hayman, Neil Roach, Shamess Shute', 'M. A. Lovretta', 'Lucy Hale, Courtney Thorne-Smith, Amanda Schull, Phoebe Strole, Kristen Hager, Rob Mayes, Adrian Hough, Marie Avgeropoulos', null, 'Katie, a college freshman, has been groomed from birth to continue her mother’s legacy with the Deltas. When Katie decides to pledge another house instead, an all-out sorority war commences.', 'Katie, a college freshman, has been groomed from birth to continue her mother’s legacy with the Deltas. When Katie decides to pledge another house instead, an all-out sorority war commences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqK8pfdNgN6VwhgbaNYT6tl7hwG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46127'),
  ('905009303091930634', 'Sorrel Flower', 1967, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Action', 'Georges Lautner, Maurice Felllous, Henri Baum', null, 'Mireille Darc, Henri Garcin, Anouk Ferjac, Serge Sauvion, Paul Préboist, Amidou, André Pousse, Maurice Biraud', null, 'Catherine is left unmarried and pregnant when her mobster sweetheart is killed in this gangster comedy. With the help of another unmarried mother-to-be, Catherine goes looking for the stash of cash buried by her lover before his death. Soon other thugs and her suspicious neighbors are following their every move in an attempt to recover the lost loot...', 'Catherine is left unmarried and pregnant when her mobster sweetheart is killed in this gangster comedy. With the help of another unmarried mother-to-be, Catherine goes looking for the stash of cash buried by her lover before his death. Soon other thugs and her suspicious neighbors are following their every move in an attempt to recover the lost loot...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ni3IHcfpLZ9TVlCoCoZEfx0SAa5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67222'),
  ('508388626390622757', 'Sorry Angel', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jean-François Fontanel, Christophe Honoré, Rémy Chevrin', 'Christophe Honoré', 'Pierre Deladonchamps, Vincent Lacoste, Denis Podalydès, Adèle Wismes, Thomas Gonzales, Clément Métayer, Quentin Thébault, Tristan Farge', null, 'At once an intimate chronicle of a romance and a sprawling portrait of life in early 1990s France following the intertwining journeys of Jacques, a worldly Parisian writer, and Arthur, a curious, carefree and much-younger university student who is just beginning to live. Brought together by chance, the two men find themselves navigating a casual fling that gradually deepens into a tender, transformative bond.', 'At once an intimate chronicle of a romance and a sprawling portrait of life in early 1990s France following the intertwining journeys of Jacques, a worldly Parisian writer, and Arthur, a curious, carefree and much-younger university student who is just beginning to live. Brought together by chance, the two men find themselves navigating a casual fling that gradually deepens into a tender, transformative bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rBPRcBXwmJLsVlVutuWKnYOiWuL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:485189'),
  ('509300502662295591', 'Sorry Baby', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Feng Xiaogang', 'Tie Jun Bai, Wang Xiaozhu', 'Fu Biao, Ge You, Han Tongsheng, Jacklyn Wu Chien-Lien, Zhang Hanyu, He Bing, Wang Zhonglei, Sun Honglei', null, 'The film tells of the attempts made by a Beijing van driver to obtain his wage arrears from travel agency boss even to the point of kidnapping the latter''s Singaporean girlfriend (Jacklyn Wu).', 'The film tells of the attempts made by a Beijing van driver to obtain his wage arrears from travel agency boss even to the point of kidnapping the latter''s Singaporean girlfriend (Jacklyn Wu).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgAiaQT19Md94vLTtf1hPpwbNYv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77099'),
  ('436016899890437315', 'Sorry For Disturbance', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Khaled Marei, Ahmed Yousef', 'Ayman Bahgat Amar', 'Ahmed Helmy, Menna Shalabi, Dalal Abdelaziz, Mahmoud Hemida, Mohamed Sharaf, Ahmed Fouad Selim, Youssef Eid, Sami Maghouri', null, 'Hassan, a brilliant aviation engineer struggles with loneliness and depression while trying to design his very exceptional project.', 'Hassan, a brilliant aviation engineer struggles with loneliness and depression while trying to design his very exceptional project.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h16EVoqi5aG4P7g1J2LZSCtWryk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60700'),
  ('831568099465792429', 'Sorry for the Delay', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Massimo Troisi, Giuseppe Borrelli, Romano Albani', 'Anna Pavignano, Massimo Troisi', 'Massimo Troisi, Giuliana De Sio, Lello Arena, Lina Polito, Franco Acampora, Olimpia Di Maio, Luigi Uzzo, Nicola Esposito', null, 'Vincenzo, a 30 years old apathetic and lazy man who still lives with his mother, has no job and no desire to improve. He meets Anna and fell in love with her but to keep the relationship alive he has to learn to accept more responsibility.', 'Vincenzo, a 30 years old apathetic and lazy man who still lives with his mother, has no job and no desire to improve. He meets Anna and fell in love with her but to keep the relationship alive he has to learn to accept more responsibility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfjaHGdhXEauoz8JFSZjN0li0I7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56784'),
  ('652212596719620100', 'Sorry I Killed You', 2020, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Jon Artigo', null, 'Jonathan Bennett, Jennifer Blanc, Ben Kurland, Pete Gardner, Jon Artigo, Danielle Artigo, Barry Alexander, Matt Kohler', null, 'A serial killer''s detailed blueprints are thwarted when his would-be victims, co-workers on an office retreat, begin to turn on each other. He finds himself caught in between his own plans and the unplanned murders by the jealous, backstabbing co-workers he intends to kill.', 'A serial killer''s detailed blueprints are thwarted when his would-be victims, co-workers on an office retreat, begin to turn on each other. He finds himself caught in between his own plans and the unplanned murders by the jealous, backstabbing co-workers he intends to kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48ATBdXvyN4Am47PSvAoeYwJYmW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763820'),
  ('333482334971509366', 'Sorry If I Call You Love', 2014, 'Romance, Drama', 'Joaquín Llamas, David Omedes', 'Manuel Burque, Fran Araújo', 'Paloma Bloyd, Daniele Liotti, Irene Montalà, Andrea Duro, Cristina Brondo, Jan Cornet, Pablo Chiapella, Joel Bosqued', null, 'A successful, attractive, intelligent and brilliant advertising executive is longing to finally find emotional stability in his life, and decides to propose to his girlfriend. After she refuses his proposal, his life takes a turn when a new young lady enters his life.', 'A successful, attractive, intelligent and brilliant advertising executive is longing to finally find emotional stability in his life, and decides to propose to his girlfriend. After she refuses his proposal, his life takes a turn when a new young lady enters his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekvI7HVl0RcA4iaZOqNa8vqFwAN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261470'),
  ('510482220172407000', 'Sorry if I Love You', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Federico Moccia, Filippo Fassetta, Marcello Montarsi', 'Chiara Barzini, Luca Infascelli, Federico Moccia', 'Raoul Bova, Michela Quattrociocche, Francesca Ferrazzo, Beatrice Valente, Michelle Carpente, Francesco Apolloni, Luca Angeletti, Ignazio Oliva', null, 'Alex Belli is a 37 year old advertising executive whose fiancée Elena has just left him, and who is having difficulty at work trying to think of a good advertising campaign for a new Japanese product. Niki is a bubbly 17 year old student. She has three best friends with whom she shares all her problems, and an annoying ex-boyfriend Fabio who is set on getting her back, but Niki''s not interested. One day on his way to work, Alex collides with Niki on a city street. They soon begin a romance, despite their 20-year age gap.', 'Alex Belli is a 37 year old advertising executive whose fiancée Elena has just left him, and who is having difficulty at work trying to think of a good advertising campaign for a new Japanese product. Niki is a bubbly 17 year old student. She has three best friends with whom she shares all her problems, and an annoying ex-boyfriend Fabio who is set on getting her back, but Niki''s not interested. One day on his way to work, Alex collides with Niki on a city street. They soon begin a romance, despite their 20-year age gap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z395gVQdI8hKA9EVYOe7DYhTzhC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34494'),
  ('743603807000460112', 'Sorry if I Want to Marry You', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Federico Moccia, Carlo Paramidani, Marcello Montarsi', 'Federico Moccia, Chiara Barzini, Luca Infascelli', 'Raoul Bova, Michela Quattrociocche, Andrea Montovoli, Francesco Apolloni, Luca Angeletti, Ignazio Oliva, Francesca Antonelli, Rossella Infanti', null, 'Second part of the film "Sorry if I love you". Alex (Raoul Bova) and Niki (Michela Quattrociocche) are more in love than ever. They have just returned from the lighthouse on the island Blu where they have lived unforgettable days. Niki returns to see his friends, but a number of important changes in their lives will test the friendship of the girls. Alex also resume life with his old friends. All of them, Flavio, Enrico and Pietro, are no longer serene and safe husbands due to certain difficulties that have compromised their marriages.', 'Second part of the film "Sorry if I love you". Alex (Raoul Bova) and Niki (Michela Quattrociocche) are more in love than ever. They have just returned from the lighthouse on the island Blu where they have lived unforgettable days. Niki returns to see his friends, but a number of important changes in their lives will test the friendship of the girls. Alex also resume life with his old friends. All of them, Flavio, Enrico and Pietro, are no longer serene and safe husbands due to certain difficulties that have compromised their marriages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/756xiX5OZRTHSfRzbR9YouKi2C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41413'),
  ('134166755100809990', 'Sorry Safari', 1962, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure', 'Gene Deitch', null, 'Allen Swift', null, 'Tom joins his owner on a hunting safari in Kenya. Jerry has hidden himself in the Clint''s luggage, and Tom quickly sees him and attempts to get rid of him.', 'Tom joins his owner on a hunting safari in Kenya. Jerry has hidden himself in the Clint''s luggage, and Tom quickly sees him and attempts to get rid of him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKKawhgw9T8qYLYmrsY4BzvPzvd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223028'),
  ('41202185359545124', 'Sorry to Bother You', 2018, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Hilton Jamal Day, Brian Benson, Sam Purdy', 'Boots Riley', 'LaKeith Stanfield, Tessa Thompson, Jermaine Fowler, Omari Hardwick, Terry Crews, Kate Berlant, Michael X. Sommers, Danny Glover', 'R', 'In an alternate present-day version of Oakland, black telemarketer Cassius Green discovers a magical key to professional success – which propels him into a macabre universe.', 'In an alternate present-day version of Oakland, black telemarketer Cassius Green discovers a magical key to professional success – which propels him into a macabre universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/peTl1V04E9ppvhgvNmSX0r2ALqO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424781'),
  ('1083889499443814874', 'Sorry We Missed You', 2019, 'Drama', 'David Gilchrist, Zoe Robinson, Ken Loach', 'Paul Laverty', 'Kris Hitchen, Debbie Honeywood, Rhys Mcgowan, Katie Proctor, Ross Brewster, Charlie Richmond, Julian Ions, Sheila Dunkerley', null, 'Ricky and his family have been fighting an uphill struggle against debt since the 2008 financial crash. An opportunity to wrestle back some independence appears with a shiny new van and the chance to run a franchise as a self-employed delivery driver. It''s hard work, and his wife''s job as a carer is no easier. The family unit is strong but when both are pulled in different directions everything comes to breaking point.', 'Ricky and his family have been fighting an uphill struggle against debt since the 2008 financial crash. An opportunity to wrestle back some independence appears with a shiny new van and the chance to run a franchise as a self-employed delivery driver. It''s hard work, and his wife''s job as a carer is no easier. The family unit is strong but when both are pulled in different directions everything comes to breaking point.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNvlqNDnXH8aqBeiBxNNP0wWWO3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522369'),
  ('454055297584718749', 'Sorry, Baby', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Eva Victor, Mia Cioffi Henry, Tess Raih', 'Eva Victor', 'Eva Victor, Naomi Ackie, Louis Cancelmi, Kelly McCormack, Lucas Hedges, John Carroll Lynch, Hettienne Park, E.R. Fightmaster', 'R', 'Agnes feels stuck. Unlike her best friend, Lydie, who’s moved to New York and is now expecting a baby, Agnes still lives in the New England house they once shared as graduate students, now working as a professor at her alma mater. A ‘bad thing’ happened to Agnes a few years ago and, since then, despite her best efforts, life hasn’t gotten back on track.', 'Agnes feels stuck. Unlike her best friend, Lydie, who’s moved to New York and is now expecting a baby, Agnes still lives in the New England house they once shared as graduate students, now working as a professor at her alma mater. A ‘bad thing’ happened to Agnes a few years ago and, since then, despite her best efforts, life hasn’t gotten back on track.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8wZEQen5hDNRGzm4fY4sxWe5xe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1205515'),
  ('439327680566845132', 'Sorry, Charlie', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Vincent Ge, Colton Tran', 'Luke Genton', 'Colton Tran, Kathleen Kenny, Marisa Brown, Connor Brannigan, D''Arquoia Connor, Henri Douvry, Antoinette Gelmont, Zachariah Guin', null, 'A remote helpline volunteer is targeted by "The Gentleman," a stranger who lures women from their homes with a recording of a crying baby.', 'A remote helpline volunteer is targeted by "The Gentleman," a stranger who lures women from their homes with a recording of a crying baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FdlhzK976qK6tbmVre5eX1CGAt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1146148'),
  ('533487590104905762', 'Sorry, Wrong Number', 1948, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Anatole Litvak, Sol Polito, Richard McWhorter', 'Lucille Fletcher', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Burt Lancaster, Ann Richards, Wendell Corey, Harold Vermilyea, Ed Begley, Leif Erickson, William Conrad', 'NR', 'Leona Stevenson is confined to bed and uses her telephone to keep in contact with the outside world. One day she overhears a murder plot on the telephone and is desperate to find out who is the intended victim.', 'Leona Stevenson is confined to bed and uses her telephone to keep in contact with the outside world. One day she overhears a murder plot on the telephone and is desperate to find out who is the intended victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A39p8fEvucMFQXFmjp5Z8WepdsQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21635'),
  ('74631284813445266', 'Sortie d''une noce à l''église', 1897, null, 'Louis Lumière', null, null, null, 'A wedding party leave church in this Lumière brothers'' short film.', 'A wedding party leave church in this Lumière brothers'' short film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2OjhPrwZN3o5FFsASeUzlZPpsja.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268211'),
  ('226654789395773023', 'Sorum', 2001, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Yoon Jong-chan', 'Yoon Jong-chan', 'Kim Myung-min, Jang Jin-young, Jo An, Ki Joo-bong, Kim Ki-cheon, Lee Han-wi, Kim Joo-ryoung', null, 'A young man moves into a run-down apartment building and soon gets into a relationship with a neighbor. Both the characters and the building have traumatic histories, and over time the ghosts of their past come to light.', 'A young man moves into a run-down apartment building and soon gets into a relationship with a neighbor. Both the characters and the building have traumatic histories, and over time the ghosts of their past come to light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35SRY5NbciKKjqhLZ3edHW0QkVr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48192'),
  ('102615572965052947', 'Sosok Ketiga: Lintrik', 2025, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Fajar Nugros, Aditya Sasono, Ujel Bausad', 'Vidya T. Ariestya, Gerald Mamahit', 'Adinda Thomas, Aulia Sarah, Wafda Saifan Lubis, Atiqah Hasiholan, Nugie, Adzwa Aurell, Saputra Kori, Alifa Lubis', null, 'After six months of marriage, Andin begins to notice many oddities in her marriage. From the beginning, Uncle Bagyo suspected the marriage was rushed, and together with Amara—Andin''s younger sister who also inherited the mystical arts—he often noticed disturbing, odd signs. Their suspicions were proven correct when it was revealed that Ario, Andin''s husband, had been having a special relationship with Naura, a wealthy woman in their town who was trying to steal Ario completely from Andin using the Lintrik love spell, a dangerous mystical power that dragged Andin and her family into endless supernatural terror. What will happen to Andin and Ario''s marriage going forward?', 'After six months of marriage, Andin begins to notice many oddities in her marriage. From the beginning, Uncle Bagyo suspected the marriage was rushed, and together with Amara—Andin''s younger sister who also inherited the mystical arts—he often noticed disturbing, odd signs. Their suspicions were proven correct when it was revealed that Ario, Andin''s husband, had been having a special relationship with Naura, a wealthy woman in their town who was trying to steal Ario completely from Andin using the Lintrik love spell, a dangerous mystical power that dragged Andin and her family into endless supernatural terror. What will happen to Andin and Ario''s marriage going forward?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oVCHHviQsspqEu4FyT4nFbtvWNH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1440100'),
  ('967125634371278729', 'Sosyal Climbers', 2025, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Jason Paul Laxamana, Ammie Ruth Suarez, Tey Clamor', 'Jason Paul Laxamana, Jericho Aguado', 'Maris Racal, Anthony Jennings, Ricky Davao, Carmi Martin, Bart Guingona, Cheska Iñigo, Marissa Sanchez, Raquel Pareño', 'R', 'Stuck with a massive debt after falling for a scam, two wannabe socialites create elaborate fake identities to swindle the rich out of their money.', 'Stuck with a massive debt after falling for a scam, two wannabe socialites create elaborate fake identities to swindle the rich out of their money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cr6y0nWdfPb3yZT9Iz63zTE1dQE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1426142'),
  ('5709414673598740', 'Sosyete Şaban', 1985, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Kartal Tibet, Meral Bayer, Ahmet Sezerel', 'İhsan Yüce, Kemal Sunal, Kartal Tibet', 'Kemal Sunal, Perihan Savaş, Kenan Pars, İhsan Yüce, Sırrı Elitaş, Hayri Caner, Celal Yonat, Süleyman Turan', null, 'Country bumpkin Şaban Ağa has long dreamed of winning the heart of Peri, the high-society belle he plans to marry, though she doesn’t even know he exists. Spurned when Peri agrees to wed him for his money then flees back to city life, Şaban reinvents himself as the sophisticated Dilaver Bey to exact his sweet revenge.', 'Country bumpkin Şaban Ağa has long dreamed of winning the heart of Peri, the high-society belle he plans to marry, though she doesn’t even know he exists. Spurned when Peri agrees to wed him for his money then flees back to city life, Şaban reinvents himself as the sophisticated Dilaver Bey to exact his sweet revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPMnly3A27WFb4H19sP7RcbM0n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123601'),
  ('1025261128907332414', 'Sosyete Şakir', 1970, null, null, null, 'Tanju Gürsu, Sema Özcan, Ali Şen, Gülsüm Kamu, Altan Günbay, Hulusi Kentmen, Semih Sezerli', null, 'Sakir, a humble dolmuş (minibus) driver, falls in love with a nightclub singer and embarks on a charming and adventurous journey into her world of high society. Along the way, he navigates comedic misadventures and romantic entanglements.', 'Sakir, a humble dolmuş (minibus) driver, falls in love with a nightclub singer and embarks on a charming and adventurous journey into her world of high society. Along the way, he navigates comedic misadventures and romantic entanglements.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKBvt1wRjBFND7z6LobuGLsZKZJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:603879'),
  ('256116605910902480', 'Sotto una buona stella', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Verdone, Inti Carboni, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Maruska Albertazzi, Pasquale Plastino, Gabriele Pignotta', 'Carlo Verdone, Paola Cortellesi, Tea Falco, Lorenzo Richelmy, Fausto Maria Sciarappa, Eleonora Sergio, Stefano Ambrogi, Riccardo Flammini', null, 'A wealthy broker, Federico Picchioni, within two days forfeits his partner and work, finishing well to living with two children and granddaughter (abandoned by her father). He is, at this point, in the face of many difficulties of adjustment but finds comfort in the help of his neighbor.', 'A wealthy broker, Federico Picchioni, within two days forfeits his partner and work, finishing well to living with two children and granddaughter (abandoned by her father). He is, at this point, in the face of many difficulties of adjustment but finds comfort in the help of his neighbor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4JXtUrAKrfdiZa8dSZwuKWzTadS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255456'),
  ('883498546106255449', 'Souk Bazaar', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Muharrem Gülmez', null, 'Erdem Yener, Ayhan Taş, Elif Nur Kerkük, İlker Aksum, Emin Olcay, Doğa Konakoğlu, Deniz Oral, Muharrem Gülmez', null, 'Kahraman is a naive and right-minded guy. In a lovely Anatolian town, he earns a living as an attendant in a Turkish bath inherited from his great grandfathers. One day, a wealthy constructor named Tuncay wants to demolish the bath and the marketplace it is located in, and build a mall in their place. Barber Cemil, Kahraman''s enemy, convinces the craftsmen in the marketplace and collaborates with Tuncay to start the demolishment immediately. Kahraman does not want the marketplace he was born into to be demolished and he does not believe in the empty promises of Tuncay.', 'Kahraman is a naive and right-minded guy. In a lovely Anatolian town, he earns a living as an attendant in a Turkish bath inherited from his great grandfathers. One day, a wealthy constructor named Tuncay wants to demolish the bath and the marketplace it is located in, and build a mall in their place. Barber Cemil, Kahraman''s enemy, convinces the craftsmen in the marketplace and collaborates with Tuncay to start the demolishment immediately. Kahraman does not want the marketplace he was born into to be demolished and he does not believe in the empty promises of Tuncay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g07VHnvcUUnPE4T4lvZS5NHemKo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:327301'),
  ('1006028750007186788', 'Soul', 2013, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Chung Mong-hong, Chung Mong-hong, Ho Hsiao-hsuan', 'Chung Mong-hong', 'Jimmy Wang Yu, Joseph Chang, Vincent Liang, Chen Shiang-Chyi, Tou Tsung-hua, Leon Dai, King Shih-chieh, Jag Huang', null, 'Chuan, a quiet 30-year-old man working as a chef in a Japanese restaurant, collapses suddenly and is rushed to a hospital. His colleagues send him to his father, who resides in the mountains. While there, Chuan becomes immobile: he won’t speak, eat or even go to the toilet on his own. One day his father returns from work only to find Chuan sitting in the corner with his daughter lying dead in a pool of blood. In an unfamiliar, eerily calm voice, Chuan says, “I saw this body was empty, so I moved in.', 'Chuan, a quiet 30-year-old man working as a chef in a Japanese restaurant, collapses suddenly and is rushed to a hospital. His colleagues send him to his father, who resides in the mountains. While there, Chuan becomes immobile: he won’t speak, eat or even go to the toilet on his own. One day his father returns from work only to find Chuan sitting in the corner with his daughter lying dead in a pool of blood. In an unfamiliar, eerily calm voice, Chuan says, “I saw this body was empty, so I moved in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3RabfEN5c8khzxdF0pxMc3Csf87.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212839'),
  ('1021381498707967400', 'Soul', 2020, 'Animation, Family, Drama, Music, Fantasy', 'Pete Docter, Kemp Powers, Matt Aspbury', 'Pete Docter, Kemp Powers, Mike Jones', 'Jamie Foxx, Tina Fey, Graham Norton, Rachel House, Alice Braga, Richard Ayoade, Phylicia Rashād, Donnell Rawlings', 'PG', 'Joe Gardner is a middle school teacher with a love for jazz music. After a successful audition at the Half Note Club, he suddenly gets into an accident that separates his soul from his body and is transported to the You Seminar, a center in which souls develop and gain passions before being transported to a newborn child. Joe must enlist help from the other souls-in-training, like 22, a soul who has spent eons in the You Seminar, in order to get back to Earth.', 'Joe Gardner is a middle school teacher with a love for jazz music. After a successful audition at the Half Note Club, he suddenly gets into an accident that separates his soul from his body and is transported to the You Seminar, a center in which souls develop and gain passions before being transported to a newborn child. Joe must enlist help from the other souls-in-training, like 22, a soul who has spent eons in the You Seminar, in order to get back to Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jmppcaubzLF8wkXM36ganVISCo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:508442'),
  ('1073881230667167461', 'Soul Food', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Paul Elliott, George Tillman Jr.', 'George Tillman Jr.', 'Vanessa Williams, Vivica A. Fox, Nia Long, Michael Beach, Mekhi Phifer, Brandon Hammond, Jeffrey D. Sams, Gina Ravera', 'R', 'Traditional Sunday dinners at Mama Joe''s turn sour when sisters Teri, Bird and Maxine start bringing their problems to the dinner table in this ensemble comedy. When tragedy strikes, it''s up to grandson Ahmad to pull the family together and put the soul back into the family''s weekly gatherings.', 'Traditional Sunday dinners at Mama Joe''s turn sour when sisters Teri, Bird and Maxine start bringing their problems to the dinner table in this ensemble comedy. When tragedy strikes, it''s up to grandson Ahmad to pull the family together and put the soul back into the family''s weekly gatherings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97t6YjxjTpwQ439MJcPiPDrMAg0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29461'),
  ('493735541102260017', 'Soul Kitchen', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Fatih Akin, Rainer Klausmann', 'Fatih Akin, Adam Bousdoukos', 'Adam Bousdoukos, Moritz Bleibtreu, Pheline Roggan, Anna Bederke, Birol Ünel, Dorka Gryllus, Wotan Wilke Möhring, Lucas Gregorowicz', 'NR', 'In Hamburg, German-Greek chef Zinos unknowingly disturbs the peace in his locals-only restaurant by hiring a more talented chef.', 'In Hamburg, German-Greek chef Zinos unknowingly disturbs the peace in his locals-only restaurant by hiring a more talented chef.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Y2OQ7MFouzmVCMqqvZPLrzHF0F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31175'),
  ('446668780386525698', 'Soul Man', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Jeffrey Jur, Steve Miner, Josh King', 'Carol Black', 'C. Thomas Howell, Rae Dawn Chong, Arye Gross, James Earl Jones, Melora Hardin, Leslie Nielsen, Ann Walker, James B. Sikking', 'PG-13', 'A white prospective grad student''s affluent family won''t pay his way through law school, so he takes tanning pills to darken his skin in order to qualify for an African-American scholarship at Harvard. He soon gets more than he bargained for, as he begins to learn what life is really like for blacks in America.', 'A white prospective grad student''s affluent family won''t pay his way through law school, so he takes tanning pills to darken his skin in order to qualify for an African-American scholarship at Harvard. He soon gets more than he bargained for, as he begins to learn what life is really like for blacks in America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6jh6qiowC4QHePBgpy7Zrytbba.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12278'),
  ('722131840615910450', 'Soul Mate', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Paolo Carnera, Sergio Rubini', 'Sergio Rubini, Domenico Starnone', 'Valentina Cervi, Violante Placido, Michele Venitucci, Sergio Rubini, Dino Abbrescia, Alfredo Minenna, Gennaro Diana, Grazia Daddario', null, 'In a small Southern Italian village, young Tonino is engaged to Teresa, but secretly loves her cousin Maddalena—who reciprocates. After discovering it, Teresa seeks revenge and vows to divide them.', 'In a small Southern Italian village, young Tonino is engaged to Teresa, but secretly loves her cousin Maddalena—who reciprocates. After discovering it, Teresa seeks revenge and vows to divide them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vz2tTla3d2QrrfJSujQKML70Wgb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74660'),
  ('40731553367663550', 'Soul Mates', 2023, 'Drama', 'Georges Lechaptois, Bruno Bernard, André Téchiné', 'Cédric Anger, André Téchiné', 'Noémie Merlant, Benjamin Voisin, Audrey Dana, André Marcon, Mirindra Ramaroson, Alexis Loret, Stéphane Bak, Jean Fornerod', null, 'Lieutenant of the French forces engaged in Mali, David Faber is seriously burned during the explosion of his armored vehicle. Repatriated to France for intensive care, he must begin a long convalescence, under the worried but devoted gaze of his sister Jeanne. They meet again in the family house in the Alps, between mountains, lake and forests. Jeanne tries to reconnect her brother with the past, but David, who suffers from amnesia after the accident, does not seem to be interested in reconciling with the man he used to be.', 'Lieutenant of the French forces engaged in Mali, David Faber is seriously burned during the explosion of his armored vehicle. Repatriated to France for intensive care, he must begin a long convalescence, under the worried but devoted gaze of his sister Jeanne. They meet again in the family house in the Alps, between mountains, lake and forests. Jeanne tries to reconnect her brother with the past, but David, who suffers from amnesia after the accident, does not seem to be interested in reconciling with the man he used to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ex1NYmuPEucf9rqRpJvJp6S9G3r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:892509'),
  ('704129142419257749', 'Soul Men', 2008, 'Comedy, Music', 'Malcolm D. Lee, Matthew F. Leonetti, Donald Sparks', 'Matthew Stone, Robert Ramsey', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Bernie Mac, Sharon Leal, Adam Herschman, Sean Hayes, Affion Crockett, Jackie Long, Mike Epps', 'R', 'Two former backup soul singers, Louis and Floyd, have not spoken to each other in 20 years, and reluctantly agree to travel across the country together to a reunion concert to honor their recently-deceased lead singer. Cleo, a beautiful young woman who is believed to be Floyd''s daughter, accompanies them as a new singer.', 'Two former backup soul singers, Louis and Floyd, have not spoken to each other in 20 years, and reluctantly agree to travel across the country together to a reunion concert to honor their recently-deceased lead singer. Cleo, a beautiful young woman who is believed to be Floyd''s daughter, accompanies them as a new singer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewU8w8IPlAkauFutzSwYYFILiU8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14655'),
  ('878468330605913689', 'Soul Music', 1997, 'Fantasy, Animation, Comedy', 'Jean Flynn', null, 'Christopher Lee, Graham Crowden, Andy Hockley, Debra Gillett, Neil Morrissey, Bernard Wrigley, Bryan Pringle', null, 'The young druid Imp y Celyn comes to Ankh-Morpork to become a famous musician, but a new guitar from a mysterious shop possesses him with a new kind of music - the Music with Rocks In. To make matters worse, Death, saddened by the death of his adopted daughter, has gone away to try and forget, and his granddaughter Susan suddenly has the family duty passed on to her.', 'The young druid Imp y Celyn comes to Ankh-Morpork to become a famous musician, but a new guitar from a mysterious shop possesses him with a new kind of music - the Music with Rocks In. To make matters worse, Death, saddened by the death of his adopted daughter, has gone away to try and forget, and his granddaughter Susan suddenly has the family duty passed on to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnP9e1mfOaRNvwF2uq8SU9ouTby.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18560'),
  ('271997165003663220', 'Soul of Hero', 2019, 'Action', 'Orlando Pardo', 'Orlando Pardo', 'Jorge Armando Soto, Stephanie Abello, Tuto Patiño, Lincoln Palomeque, Linda Lucía Callejas, Tiberio Cruz, Roger Moreno, José Ferney Garcia Perez', null, 'A soldier will have a mission of rescuing his partner kidnapped in the Colombian jungle although he will miss a dating with a beautiful girl that is his partner''s sister.', 'A soldier will have a mission of rescuing his partner kidnapped in the Colombian jungle although he will miss a dating with a beautiful girl that is his partner''s sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Am3avSjCB9y7fmqwFY8qIatPpYi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:646332'),
  ('558319450659852507', 'Soul of the Cypress', 1921, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Dudley Murphy', null, 'Chase Harringdine', null, 'Influenced by California Pictorialist photography of the preceding decades, it was in its own day recognized as an avant-garde film, but nevertheless it secured successful commercial distribution.', 'Influenced by California Pictorialist photography of the preceding decades, it was in its own day recognized as an avant-garde film, but nevertheless it secured successful commercial distribution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zckVEUYJrmkUUXbmNxvcjCnVMD0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175473'),
  ('1114043593293199888', 'Soul of the Sword', 1978, 'Action', 'Hua Shan, Cheung Tak-Wai, Lin Chan-Wai', 'Chiu Kang-Chien, Lin Chan-Wai', 'Ti Lung, Lin Chen-Chi, Ku Feng, Yue Wing, Norman Tsui Siu-Keung, Lau Wai-Ling, Lily Li, Chan Shen', null, 'Ti Lung is the Nameless Swordsman bent on defeating the faceless King of Swords to claim the title, and the glory, for himself. Hordes of fighters lunge from the shadows to cut down the mysterious challenger. Even a cunning seductress takes a stab at him in a revealing bath house assassination. It is said that a man''s weapon reflects his utmost dreams, desires and fears. A warrior with no name and one motive has a soul as merciless as cold steel.', 'Ti Lung is the Nameless Swordsman bent on defeating the faceless King of Swords to claim the title, and the glory, for himself. Hordes of fighters lunge from the shadows to cut down the mysterious challenger. Even a cunning seductress takes a stab at him in a revealing bath house assassination. It is said that a man''s weapon reflects his utmost dreams, desires and fears. A warrior with no name and one motive has a soul as merciless as cold steel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5cztzyaFMEx5l4xoH1mPrEKJHu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106640'),
  ('856072646142320540', 'Soul on a String', 2016, 'Drama', 'Guo Daming, Zhang Yang', 'Zhang Yang, Tashi Dawa', 'Jinpa, Choenyi Tsering, 夏诺·扎西敦珠, 索朗尼玛, Genden Phuntsok, Sonam Wangmo', null, 'After discovering a sacred stone in the mouth of a deer he just killed, Taibei, a young lonesome Tibetan cowboy, embarks on a long and difficult mission: to bring it back to the holy mountain of Buddha’s handprint. His journey turns sour as an obstinate woman, Joan, and a psychic yet dumb elf, Pu, soon decide to join him. Not to mention the two violent brothers on his tale, who are on a revenge quest.', 'After discovering a sacred stone in the mouth of a deer he just killed, Taibei, a young lonesome Tibetan cowboy, embarks on a long and difficult mission: to bring it back to the holy mountain of Buddha’s handprint. His journey turns sour as an obstinate woman, Joan, and a psychic yet dumb elf, Pu, soon decide to join him. Not to mention the two violent brothers on his tale, who are on a revenge quest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfUBcNV7O3YA6pmWYcGxsSANYGJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412208'),
  ('301045885231065533', 'Soul on Fire', 2025, 'Drama', 'Sean McNamara, David Brookwell, Michael D. Gillis', 'Gregory Poirier', 'Joel Courtney, William H. Macy, James McCracken, John Corbett, Stephanie Szostak, Masey McLain, Stella Bratcher, Lucy Panozzo', 'PG', 'After a horrific accident leaves his body scarred, a young boy strives to live and show everyone what is possible with the help of his family, his faith, his community, his longtime idol''s kindness, and the entire city of St. Louis.', 'After a horrific accident leaves his body scarred, a young boy strives to live and show everyone what is possible with the help of his family, his faith, his community, his longtime idol''s kindness, and the entire city of St. Louis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUMmG3Q0JyAuSx9QpIiMFhI5zDo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1196791'),
  ('420164578540308633', 'Soul Plane', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Jessy Terrero, Jonathan Sela', 'Bo Zenga, Chuck Wilson', 'Kevin Hart, Tom Arnold, Method Man, Snoop Dogg, K.D. Aubert, Godfrey, Brian Hooks, D.L. Hughley', 'R', 'Following a ridiculously awful flight that leads to his pet''s death, Nashawn Wade files a lawsuit against the airline, and wins a multimillion-dollar settlement. Determined to create a better flying experience, Nashawn starts his own airline, one that caters to an African-American clientele. Going into business with a tricked-out plane piloted by the smooth Capt. Mack, the airline hits a snag when it has to deal with the family of Elvis Hunkee.', 'Following a ridiculously awful flight that leads to his pet''s death, Nashawn Wade files a lawsuit against the airline, and wins a multimillion-dollar settlement. Determined to create a better flying experience, Nashawn starts his own airline, one that caters to an African-American clientele. Going into business with a tricked-out plane piloted by the smooth Capt. Mack, the airline hits a snag when it has to deal with the family of Elvis Hunkee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5Rzb5JUwPinllWGYUYER3OV14F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12657'),
  ('832775517710724548', 'Soul Snatcher', 2020, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Chan Chi-Ying, Song Haolin, Yi Liqi', 'Li Huiyan, Ran Ping, Yang Weiwei', 'Chen Linong, Li Xian, Hani Kyzy, Pei Kuishan, Jiang Chao, Morning Chang, Li Xiaochuan, David Wang', null, 'The historical fantasy film basically revolves around the tale of an impoverished scholar and a fox demon in search of a magic pill. Chen Linong plays the guileless Wang Zijin, the scholar on the way to Beijing who inadvertently becomes fast friends with Li Xian’s fox demon Bai Shisan. Unbeknownst to him, the wily Bai Shisan actually has plans to use him to retrieve the magic pill that will turn him immortal.', 'The historical fantasy film basically revolves around the tale of an impoverished scholar and a fox demon in search of a magic pill. Chen Linong plays the guileless Wang Zijin, the scholar on the way to Beijing who inadvertently becomes fast friends with Li Xian’s fox demon Bai Shisan. Unbeknownst to him, the wily Bai Shisan actually has plans to use him to retrieve the magic pill that will turn him immortal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLAddEahTEL3yZ92zYPROTAv6Ao.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:755594'),
  ('346468825830650611', 'Soul Surfer', 2011, 'Family, Drama', 'Sean McNamara, Gregory J. Barnett, Joey Paul Jensen', 'Deborah Schwartz, Sean McNamara, Douglas Schwartz', 'AnnaSophia Robb, Helen Hunt, Dennis Quaid, Carrie Underwood, Kevin Sorbo, Ross Thomas, Chris Brochu, Lorraine Nicholson', 'PG', 'The true story of teen surfer Bethany Hamilton, who lost her arm in a shark attack and courageously overcame all odds to become a champion again, through her sheer determination and unwavering faith.', 'The true story of teen surfer Bethany Hamilton, who lost her arm in a shark attack and courageously overcame all odds to become a champion again, through her sheer determination and unwavering faith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvgRxrEupUFeJ0xzUExJo4dMXbL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43959'),
  ('904933143712280281', 'Soul Survivors', 2001, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Stephen Carpenter, Jon Mallard, Michael Kohnhorst', 'Stephen Carpenter', 'Melissa Sagemiller, Wes Bentley, Casey Affleck, Eliza Dushku, Angela Featherstone, Luke Wilson, Allen Hamilton, Ken Moreno', 'PG-13', 'A college freshman involved in a fatal car crash discovers she may not have survived after all when she becomes caught between the worlds of the living and the dead.', 'A college freshman involved in a fatal car crash discovers she may not have survived after all when she becomes caught between the worlds of the living and the dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWmHhtuEgX7oI0FuWR2oD08HRHD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14033'),
  ('625662512394953805', 'Soul Thieves', 2015, 'Horror', 'Juan Antonio de la Riva', 'Christopher Luna', 'Sofía Sisniega, Natasha Dupeyrón, Ana Sofía Durán, Juan Ángel Esparza, Luis Gatica, Javier Escobar, Arnulfo Reyes Sanchez, Jorge Luis Moreno', null, 'In 1815, during the Mexican Independence movement, a group of soldiers fighting for Spain take shelter at a ranch where a group of sisters support the other band, the insurgents who are fighting for freedom.', 'In 1815, during the Mexican Independence movement, a group of soldiers fighting for Spain take shelter at a ranch where a group of sisters support the other band, the insurgents who are fighting for freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5xJwhFzWxN9Z9f7VSESc6bitgh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374767'),
  ('445218187646777129', 'Soulbound', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Caio Sóh, Léo Rosa', 'Caio Sóh', 'Emílio Dantas, Remo Rocha, Palomma Duarte, Roberto Bomtempo, Jayme Matarazzo, Graziella Schmitt, Cláudio Lins, Lua Blanco', null, 'What if life blindsided destiny? What if happiness was found in the unlikeliest of places? When do we allow ourselves to embrace the new without fear of letting go of the past? Gil is a twenty year old young man that questions himself and the world. He is an orphan, raised by his aunt Leila and his uncle César. His lifestyle is fulfilled by his guitar, poetry and alcohol, generating a family war that causes Gil to run away from home causing him to leave behind all his belongings, security and the only love that he had till then, the love of his aunt Leila. With his guitar on his back, without a destiny, money or the support of friends, Gil meets Otávio, a music producer that will change his destiny forever.', 'What if life blindsided destiny? What if happiness was found in the unlikeliest of places? When do we allow ourselves to embrace the new without fear of letting go of the past? Gil is a twenty year old young man that questions himself and the world. He is an orphan, raised by his aunt Leila and his uncle César. His lifestyle is fulfilled by his guitar, poetry and alcohol, generating a family war that causes Gil to run away from home causing him to leave behind all his belongings, security and the only love that he had till then, the love of his aunt Leila. With his guitar on his back, without a destiny, money or the support of friends, Gil meets Otávio, a music producer that will change his destiny forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQExXfeVXA3AkZ87VZz8FeFcmMg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249131'),
  ('102125489083572453', 'Soulcatcher', 2023, 'Action, Thriller', 'Jagoda Dutkiewicz, Zuzanna Wiśniewska, Mikołaj Borowy', 'Daniel Markowicz', 'Piotr Witkowski, Jacek Koman, Jacek Poniedziałek, Mariusz Bonaszewski, Aleksandra Adamska, Vansh Luthra, Maciej Nawrocki, Sebastian Stankiewicz', 'R', 'A military contractor hired to seize a weapon that turns people into savage killers seeks revenge when his brother falls victim to the device.', 'A military contractor hired to seize a weapon that turns people into savage killers seeks revenge when his brother falls victim to the device.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1f9JSPjCfNftigEii1SDK1g2b3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1149381'),
  ('760331301856320035', 'Souleymane''s Story', 2024, 'Drama', 'Tristan Galand, Boris Lojkine, Vincent Prades', 'Boris Lojkine, Delphine Agut', 'Abou Sangare, Nina Meurisse, Alpha Oumar Sow, Emmanuel Yovanie, Younoussa Diallo, Ghislain Mahan, Mamadou Barry, Yaya Diallo', null, 'As he pedals through the streets of Paris to deliver meals, Souleymane recounts his story. In two days, he has to go through his asylum application interview, the key to obtaining papers, but Souleymane is not ready.', 'As he pedals through the streets of Paris to deliver meals, Souleymane recounts his story. In two days, he has to go through his asylum application interview, the key to obtaining papers, but Souleymane is not ready.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ns8tSpfBL63Y5Pi84C6Dzr3vlm4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1158996'),
  ('233475115783112060', 'Soulkeeper', 2001, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Fantasy, Action, Comedy', 'Darin Ferriola, Gerry Lively', 'Darin Ferriola', 'Rodney Rowland, Kevin Patrick Walls, Jaime Bergman, Karen Black, Ali Landry, Jack Donner, Brad Dourif, Debbie Gibson', null, 'Two thieves compete with a madman in their search for an ancient relic which can create an army of evil souls.', 'Two thieves compete with a madman in their search for an ancient relic which can create an army of evil souls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etmSPcaa7cCcc9djD2q9rHqe38W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63188'),
  ('118485657931850416', 'Soulless', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Roman Prygunov, Vladimir Kanareykin, Ivan Titov', 'Sergey Minaev, Denis Rodimin', 'Danila Kozlovsky, Artyom Mikhalkov, Mikhail Efremov, Artur Smolyaninov, Mariya Andreeva, Sergey Belogolovtsev, Mariya Kozhevnikova, Igor Voynarovskiy', null, 'It''s a story of 29-year-old top-manager Max who is really sure he is absolutely successful. All his life is around earning and spending money. But one day he meets a girl who is from another, real, world. And his own world starts to crash down.', 'It''s a story of 29-year-old top-manager Max who is really sure he is absolutely successful. All his life is around earning and spending money. But one day he meets a girl who is from another, real, world. And his own world starts to crash down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxP0iiDXJ7p675pZYcz0MBrHfXc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132759'),
  ('30856079432395326', 'Soulmate', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kang Gook-hyun, Kim Hyo-seong, Min Yong-keun', 'Min Yong-keun, Kang Hyun-joo', 'Kim Da-mi, Jeon So-nee, Byeon Woo-seok, Jang Hye-jin, Park Choong-seon, Kim Soo-hyung, Ryu Ji-an, Heo Ji-na', 'NR', 'When Mi-so and Ha-eun first meet in childhood, their lives become instantly intertwined, forming a bond surrounded by happiness and naivety. But as adulthood arrives, alone and together, they are forced to deal with sadness, anger, grief, growth, and most of all, love.', 'When Mi-so and Ha-eun first meet in childhood, their lives become instantly intertwined, forming a bond surrounded by happiness and naivety. But as adulthood arrives, alone and together, they are forced to deal with sadness, anger, grief, growth, and most of all, love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iL0jvWpSVW1uFn9aAoUh3UwzdYA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:617882'),
  ('899862087967832989', 'SoulMate', 2016, 'Romance, Drama', 'Yu Jing-pin, Derek Tsang Kwok-Cheung, Jake Pollock', 'Lam Wing-Sum, Wu Nan, Xu Yimeng', 'Zhou Dongyu, Ma Sichun, Toby Lee, Li Ping, Cai Gang, Meng Ting-yi, Cindy Yao, Li Haofang', null, 'The film spans two decades, as the story unfolds in a series of flashbacks that begin when Qiyue and Ansheng were just thirteen. The two became inseparable, until they met a boy who ended up tearing their lives apart.', 'The film spans two decades, as the story unfolds in a series of flashbacks that begin when Qiyue and Ansheng were just thirteen. The two became inseparable, until they met a boy who ended up tearing their lives apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVgKn7hV6nMNyE6WjFz1QTnLhtS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417419'),
  ('418608533281616654', 'Soulmates', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Timothy Armstrong', 'Alexandra Case, Stephanie Lynn', 'Stephanie Lynn, Alexandra Case, Mark Famiglietti, Zachary Spicer, Alice Barrett, Steven Hauck, Di Quon', null, 'Lifelong best friends, Sam and Jess, are each other’s everything. But when Jess meets a handsome out-of-stater, Landon, Sam begins to fear she’s being cast aside. To make matters worse, a massive corporation - who happens to be Landon’s employer - is threatening the small-town way of life they know and love in Vermont. In order to save her sisterhood and protect the town, Sam will pull out all the stops to keep both Jess’s relationship and the ominous company from developing any further.', 'Lifelong best friends, Sam and Jess, are each other’s everything. But when Jess meets a handsome out-of-stater, Landon, Sam begins to fear she’s being cast aside. To make matters worse, a massive corporation - who happens to be Landon’s employer - is threatening the small-town way of life they know and love in Vermont. In order to save her sisterhood and protect the town, Sam will pull out all the stops to keep both Jess’s relationship and the ominous company from developing any further.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdSphRgnSh8iUaY6YrxZ3PfYnEk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:879330'),
  ('1024125131405186011', 'Souls at Sea', 1937, 'Adventure', 'Henry Hathaway, Charles Lang, Merritt B. Gerstad', 'Dale Van Every, Grover Jones', 'Gary Cooper, George Raft, Frances Dee, Henry Wilcoxon, Harry Carey, Olympe Bradna, Robert Cummings, Porter Hall', 'NR', 'Michael ''Nuggin'' Taylor and Powdah save lives during a sea tragedy in this story about the slave trade on the high seas during 1842.', 'Michael ''Nuggin'' Taylor and Powdah save lives during a sea tragedy in this story about the slave trade on the high seas during 1842.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxZMfLgBQ9bdVg71U7vbXlmNtj6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43419'),
  ('843490462285747458', 'Souls for Sale', 1923, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Rupert Hughes, John J. Mescall', null, 'Eleanor Boardman, Frank Mayo, Richard Dix, Mae Busch, Barbara La Marr, Lew Cody, Forrest Robinson, Edith Yorke', 'NR', 'A young woman hits Hollywood, determined to become a star.', 'A young woman hits Hollywood, determined to become a star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cz3O6GkO14L64xukE4E50SvhlOk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91208'),
  ('606818779684000082', 'Souls on the Road', 1921, 'Drama', 'Minoru Murata, Bunjiro Mizutani', 'Kiyohiko Ushihara', 'Kaoru Osanai, Haruko Sawamura, Denmei Suzuki, Yuriko Hanabusa, Sotaro Okada, Minoru Murata, Kōmei Minami, Eiko Higashi', null, 'A small town boy dreams of being a famous fiddler; Meanwhile, two convicts escape from prison and hide in the woods.', 'A small town boy dreams of being a famous fiddler; Meanwhile, two convicts escape from prison and hide in the woods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQ3fXsaUMl63U92woE2MU4RBojF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147626'),
  ('674192610635272438', 'Soultaker', 1990, 'Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Michael Rissi, James Rosenthal', 'Vivian Schilling', 'Joe Estevez, Vivian Schilling, Gregg Thomsen, Robert Z''Dar, David "Shark" Fralick, Jean Reiner, Bob Grant, Chuck Williams', null, 'Four teenagers are killed in a car accident. Two of the teenagers refuse to go with "The Grim Reaper" and a race between life and death ensues!', 'Four teenagers are killed in a car accident. Two of the teenagers refuse to go with "The Grim Reaper" and a race between life and death ensues!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QE0p9zG2WSuB523dUnBsSsnm0i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31276'),
  ('60989738914352226', 'Sound and Fury', 1988, 'Drama', 'Jean-Claude Brisseau, Romain Winding', 'Jean-Claude Brisseau', 'Bruno Cremer, François Négret, Vincent Gasperitsch, Fabienne Babe, María Luisa García, Fejria Deliba, Thierry Helene, Sandrine Arnault', null, 'This drama depicts the misery of neglected children in big cities. 13 years old Bruno is of a good family, but since the death of his grandmother he spends most of his time alone, in a phantasy world, while his mother is away at work. But then he befriends the violent Jean-Roger, who''s from a severely disturbed family, where nobody cares what he''s doing. In school Jean-Roger drives their teacher into despair just for fun. To separate the two boys, she starts to stimulate Bruno''s interests by giving him extra lessons. When Jean-Roger fears loosing his one and only friend, he becomes even more aggressive.', 'This drama depicts the misery of neglected children in big cities. 13 years old Bruno is of a good family, but since the death of his grandmother he spends most of his time alone, in a phantasy world, while his mother is away at work. But then he befriends the violent Jean-Roger, who''s from a severely disturbed family, where nobody cares what he''s doing. In school Jean-Roger drives their teacher into despair just for fun. To separate the two boys, she starts to stimulate Bruno''s interests by giving him extra lessons. When Jean-Roger fears loosing his one and only friend, he becomes even more aggressive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCQ6NR6JJXBzbCubqiaWa7wyZJY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51228'),
  ('811065210483927530', 'Sound City', 2013, 'Music, Documentary', 'Kenny Stoff, Dave Grohl', 'Mark Monroe', 'Dave Grohl, Trent Reznor, Tom Petty, Mick Fleetwood, John Fogerty, Rivers Cuomo, Taylor Hawkins, Barry Manilow', 'NR', 'The history of Sound City and their huge recording device; exploring how digital change has allowed ''people that have no place'' in music to become stars. It follows former Nirvana drummer and Foo Fighter David Grohl as he attempts to resurrect the studio back to former glories.', 'The history of Sound City and their huge recording device; exploring how digital change has allowed ''people that have no place'' in music to become stars. It follows former Nirvana drummer and Foo Fighter David Grohl as he attempts to resurrect the studio back to former glories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgPJg7tVETVpjfrBMc4WLil8ltC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157117'),
  ('1123046369899099709', 'Sound Eroticism', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Péter Tímár, Sándor Kardos', 'Péter Tímár', 'Rajhona Ádám, Róbert Koltai, Németh Judit, Kristóf Kata, Péter Haumann, István Mikó', null, 'In the box factory standing in the middle of nowhere only women work, and they themselves only waste their time, as the unmarketable boxes pile up in the yards. The fireman in duty, who stores stolen gasoline in the inflammable plant, sets up cameras in the women''s locker room the sake of ''business''.', 'In the box factory standing in the middle of nowhere only women work, and they themselves only waste their time, as the unmarketable boxes pile up in the yards. The fireman in duty, who stores stolen gasoline in the inflammable plant, sets up cameras in the women''s locker room the sake of ''business''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKUm6jignIJascGYgXyLrxkD5rI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41060'),
  ('1000074805888612645', 'Sound of Falling', 2025, 'Drama', 'Mascha Schilinski, Oliver Grüttner, Fabian Gamper', 'Louise Peter, Mascha Schilinski', 'Luise Heyer, Lena Urzendowsky, Claudia Geisler-Bading, Lea Drinda, Hanna Heckt, Laeni Geiseler, Florian Geißelmann, Andreas Anke', 'NR', 'Four adolescent girls each spend their youth in the same farmhouse over the last century. Though separated by decades, resonances between their lives emerge: their desires and distress, secrets and truths, encounters with another’s gaze and defiant gaze in return.', 'Four adolescent girls each spend their youth in the same farmhouse over the last century. Though separated by decades, resonances between their lives emerge: their desires and distress, secrets and truths, encounters with another’s gaze and defiant gaze in return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mv2edAI0vmheVVcv4mIVW5X8GNP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1221061'),
  ('441922287004228213', 'Sound of Freedom', 2023, 'Action, Drama', 'Sandro Valdez, Gorka Gómez Andreu, Alonso Alvarez', 'Rod Barr, Alejandro Monteverde', 'Jim Caviezel, Mira Sorvino, Bill Camp, Gerardo Taracena, Kurt Fuller, José Zúñiga, Eduardo Verástegui, Scott Haze', 'PG-13', 'The story of Tim Ballard, a former US government agent, who quits his job in order to devote his life to rescuing children from global sex traffickers.', 'The story of Tim Ballard, a former US government agent, who quits his job in order to devote his life to rescuing children from global sex traffickers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qA5kPYZA7FkVvqcEfJRoOy4kpHg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:678512'),
  ('459337248828663465', 'Sound of Hope: The Story of Possum Trot', 2024, 'Drama', 'Joshua Weigel, Sean Patrick Kirby, Benji Bakshi', 'Rebekah Weigel, Joshua Weigel', 'Demetrius Grosse, Nika King, Elizabeth Mitchell, Diaana Babnicova, Carlos Aviles, Demián Castro, Joshua Weigel, Sarah Hudson', 'PG-13', 'Led by Donna and Reverend W.C. Martin, 22 families from a rural Black church in the small East Texas town of Possum Trot adopt 77 of the most difficult-to-place kids in the foster system and kickstart a movement in the process.', 'Led by Donna and Reverend W.C. Martin, 22 families from a rural Black church in the small East Texas town of Possum Trot adopt 77 of the most difficult-to-place kids in the foster system and kickstart a movement in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47kytyhKjdY2fwuYR15bBNUUFLb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1242526'),
  ('190576688180917798', 'Sound of Horror', 1967, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'José Antonio Nieves Conde, Manuel Berenguer', 'José Antonio Nieves Conde, Gregorio Sacristán, Sam X. Abarbanel', 'James Philbrook, Arturo Fernández, Soledad Miranda, José Bódalo, Ingrid Pitt, Antonio Casas, Lola Gaos, Francisco Piquer', null, 'When a group of isolated people in the Greek mountains set off a cave explosion, they are menaced by an invisible shrieking dinosaur that had been buried for eons', 'When a group of isolated people in the Greek mountains set off a cave explosion, they are menaced by an invisible shrieking dinosaur that had been buried for eons', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRoq2LMInSLcRE0jIdlV90yVfwW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83123'),
  ('123821708376743956', 'Sound of My Voice', 2011, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Zal Batmanglij, Rachel Morrison', 'Brit Marling, Zal Batmanglij', 'Brit Marling, Christopher Denham, Nicole Vicius, Davenia McFadden, Kandice Stroh, Richard Wharton, Christy Meyers, Constance Wu', 'R', 'A journalist and his girlfriend get pulled in while they investigate a cult whose leader claims to be from the future.', 'A journalist and his girlfriend get pulled in while they investigate a cult whose leader claims to be from the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6wStc532wuBrW2NZM3TicEWDmaL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86812'),
  ('238911894988968552', 'Sound of Noise', 2010, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Ola Simonsson, Charlotta Tengroth, Johannes Stjärne Nilsson', 'Johannes Stjärne Nilsson, Ola Simonsson', 'Bengt Nilsson, Sanna Persson, Magnus Börjeson, Marcus Haraldsson Boij, Johannes Björk, Fredrik Myhr, Anders Vestergård, Paula McManus', 'R', 'A tone-deaf cop works to track down a group of guerilla percussionists whose anarchic public performances are terrorizing the city.', 'A tone-deaf cop works to track down a group of guerilla percussionists whose anarchic public performances are terrorizing the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fD4WnzQH0YrvqXXon9RDTnOVPUw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48392'),
  ('76210173820978734', 'Sound of Silence', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Wan Li, Deng Xu, Chong Wang', '汤禹辰', 'Tan Jianci, Wang Ge, Lan Xiya, Wang Yanhui, Pan Binlong, Chi Peng, Li Jingjing, Fan Xiang', null, 'Lawyer Li Qi, driven by greed, becomes embroiled in a fraud case against deaf individuals, abandoning his deaf family background in pursuit of fame and fortune.', 'Lawyer Li Qi, driven by greed, becomes embroiled in a fraud case against deaf individuals, abandoning his deaf family background in pursuit of fame and fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6aKzErXjKJl2yaJ5mALN0jDVZhH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1466319'),
  ('81464784112183188', 'Sound of the Mountain', 1954, 'Drama', 'Mikio Naruse, Masanori Kakei, Masao Tamai', 'Yōko Mizuki', 'Setsuko Hara, So Yamamura, Ken Uehara, Yōko Sugi, Teruko Nagaoka, Yatsuko Tan''ami, Chieko Nakakita, Rieko Sumi', null, 'An ingratiating bride develops warm ties to her father-in-law while her cold husband blithely slights her for another woman.', 'An ingratiating bride develops warm ties to her father-in-law while her cold husband blithely slights her for another woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzdKn2Eo5rZCV3fzBjVdxAI0KM8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46492'),
  ('838398949655262215', 'Sound of the Sea', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Bigas Luna', 'Rafael Azcona', 'Jordi Mollà, Leonor Watling, Eduard Fernández, Sergio Caballero, Neus Agulló, Pep Cortés', null, 'A new literature teacher, Ulises, comes to a small town near the sea and falls in love with a young woman, Martina. This woman is loved by a rich businessman named Alberto but chooses Ulises. Soon after their marriage and the birth of their son, Ulises vanishes while fishing at sea. In the meanwhile Martina marries Alberto, but all is not what it seems...', 'A new literature teacher, Ulises, comes to a small town near the sea and falls in love with a young woman, Martina. This woman is loved by a rich businessman named Alberto but chooses Ulises. Soon after their marriage and the birth of their son, Ulises vanishes while fishing at sea. In the meanwhile Martina marries Alberto, but all is not what it seems...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WF4p8Z1QL0UYBB9bBotHysYXTo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62191'),
  ('650652396911298867', 'Sound of Violence', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller, Crime, Music', 'Daphne Qin Wu, Alex Noyer', 'Alex Noyer', 'Jasmin Savoy Brown, Lili Simmons, James Jagger, Tessa Munro, Brian Huskey, Dana L. Wilson, Wes McGee, Mataeo Mingo', null, 'As a child, the brutal murder of her family made Alexis regain her hearing along with synesthetic abilities. Now as an adult, she finds solace in the sounds of bodily harm. But when she’s told she might lose her hearing again, she escalates her gruesome sound experiments in a quest to compose her masterpiece.', 'As a child, the brutal murder of her family made Alexis regain her hearing along with synesthetic abilities. Now as an adult, she finds solace in the sounds of bodily harm. But when she’s told she might lose her hearing again, she escalates her gruesome sound experiments in a quest to compose her masterpiece.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i3umQVtEGpwPTYIkRm2QsDAlrv8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:766358'),
  ('1141938151944897731', 'Sound Test for Blackmail', 1929, 'Documentary', 'Alfred Hitchcock', null, 'Alfred Hitchcock, Anny Ondra', null, 'A brief sound test made during production of Blackmail (1929), featuring Alfred Hitchcock playfully teasing lead actress Anny Ondra as she struggles to respond on camera. Photographed by Jack E. Cox, the clip was shot to test the new sound recording system for what would become Hitchcock’s first talkie.', 'A brief sound test made during production of Blackmail (1929), featuring Alfred Hitchcock playfully teasing lead actress Anny Ondra as she struggles to respond on camera. Photographed by Jack E. Cox, the clip was shot to test the new sound recording system for what would become Hitchcock’s first talkie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bI3Kdy7iQnjVxK0TnORNvRAZcip.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319841'),
  ('416396344022274616', 'Sound! Euphonium the Movie – Our Promise: A Brand New Day', 2019, 'Animation, Drama', 'Hiroyuki Takahashi, Noriyuki Kitanohara, Kohei Okamura', 'Jukki Hanada', 'Tomoyo Kurosawa, Chika Anzai, Ayaka Asai, Ayaka Nanase, Haruki Ishiya, Kenjiro Tsuda, Conomi Fujimura, Minako Kotobuki', 'G', 'The next piece begins! Kumiko is now in her second year at Kitauji High School, and with a new year comes new problems. As if making it to Nationals wasn''t hard enough, Kumiko is tasked with mentoring the concert band''s troublesome first years – each with their own distinct personality and problems to solve. With Kumiko busy juggling both the concert band and her new role as senpai, how does her relationship with Shuuichi fit into the picture?', 'The next piece begins! Kumiko is now in her second year at Kitauji High School, and with a new year comes new problems. As if making it to Nationals wasn''t hard enough, Kumiko is tasked with mentoring the concert band''s troublesome first years – each with their own distinct personality and problems to solve. With Kumiko busy juggling both the concert band and her new role as senpai, how does her relationship with Shuuichi fit into the picture?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWXJ920KugmI0B1EfAg1OQlWP8Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528225'),
  ('834055227399315261', 'Sound! Euphonium The Movie: May the Melody Reach You!', 2017, 'Animation, Drama, Music', 'Naoko Yamada, Nobuaki Maruki, Naoko Yamada', 'Jukki Hanada', 'Ayaka Asai, Moe Toyota, Chika Anzai, Tomoyo Kurosawa, Minako Kotobuki, Kenjiro Tsuda, Yuichi Nakamura, Nao Toyama', null, 'Autumn is in the air as the Kitauji High School concert band prepares for the National Competition. The band hears troubling news that Asuka Tanaka, vice president of the club and one of the key euphonium players in the band, may quit! Asuka is beautiful and charismatic and everyone relies on her, but she also has a cool side and never reveals her true self. Kumiko doesn’t get along with Asuka initially, but her feelings change when she learns that Asuka may actually drop out. Asuka has feelings about the euphonium that she cannot tell anyone else…', 'Autumn is in the air as the Kitauji High School concert band prepares for the National Competition. The band hears troubling news that Asuka Tanaka, vice president of the club and one of the key euphonium players in the band, may quit! Asuka is beautiful and charismatic and everyone relies on her, but she also has a cool side and never reveals her true self. Kumiko doesn’t get along with Asuka initially, but her feelings change when she learns that Asuka may actually drop out. Asuka has feelings about the euphonium that she cannot tell anyone else…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lR2DNDslQES1mPOSuTZrqZRtZ2k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460400'),
  ('343128141273233517', 'Sound! Euphonium The Movie: Welcome to the Kitauji High School Concert Band', 2016, 'Animation, Drama, Music', 'Yoshiji Kigami, Shouko Ikeda, Naoko Yamada', 'Jukki Hanada', 'Tomoyo Kurosawa, Ayaka Asai, Moe Toyota, Chika Anzai, Kenjiro Tsuda, Miyuki Kobori, Conomi Fujimura, Minori Chihara', null, 'After swearing off music due to an incident at the middle school regional brass band competition, euphonist Kumiko Oumae enters high school, hoping for a fresh start. As fate would have it, she ends up surrounded by people with an interest in the brass band. Kumiko finds the motivation she needs to make music once more with the help of her bandmates, some old friends, some new. However, in the band itself, chaos reigns supreme. Despite their intention to qualify for the national band competition, as they currently are, just competing in the local festival will be a challenge—unless new band advisor Noboru Taki does something about it.', 'After swearing off music due to an incident at the middle school regional brass band competition, euphonist Kumiko Oumae enters high school, hoping for a fresh start. As fate would have it, she ends up surrounded by people with an interest in the brass band. Kumiko finds the motivation she needs to make music once more with the help of her bandmates, some old friends, some new. However, in the band itself, chaos reigns supreme. Despite their intention to qualify for the national band competition, as they currently are, just competing in the local festival will be a challenge—unless new band advisor Noboru Taki does something about it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZ8mXFsjaE0gSkNe8vtr8UxZA4Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374056'),
  ('648536772485782002', 'Sound! Euphonium: Ensemble Contest', 2023, 'Animation, Drama, Music', 'Tatsuya Ishihara, Kazumi Ikeda, Taichi Ogawa', 'Jukki Hanada', 'Tomoyo Kurosawa, Chika Anzai, Moe Toyota, Ayaka Asai, Ayaka Ohashi, Haruki Ishiya, Conomi Fujimura, Yuri Yamaoka', null, 'Awaiting new club leader Kumiko is the Ensemble Contest, and the school''s preliminary competition to determine the representative team to participate. Kumiko tries her best to make it to the preliminaries without incident, but the concert band club is so large that there seems to be no end to the problems. And as club leader, she finds herself busy consulting on all sorts of matters. While the other members are deciding on their teams, Kumiko herself hasn''t even decided which she will join...', 'Awaiting new club leader Kumiko is the Ensemble Contest, and the school''s preliminary competition to determine the representative team to participate. Kumiko tries her best to make it to the preliminaries without incident, but the concert band club is so large that there seems to be no end to the problems. And as club leader, she finds herself busy consulting on all sorts of matters. While the other members are deciding on their teams, Kumiko herself hasn''t even decided which she will join...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99YitBYi50vi5guPRuy5yAH1614.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1108306'),
  ('479763701453953155', 'Sounder', 1972, 'Drama', 'Martin Ritt, John A. Alonzo, Peter Wooley', 'Lonne Elder III', 'Cicely Tyson, Paul Winfield, Kevin Hooks, Taj Mahal, Janet MacLachlan, Carmen Mathews, James Best, Eric Hooks', 'G', 'The oldest son of a loving and strong family of black sharecroppers comes of age in the Depression-era South after his father is imprisoned for stealing food.', 'The oldest son of a loving and strong family of black sharecroppers comes of age in the Depression-era South after his father is imprisoned for stealing food.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWFcxsy4tbf0ZXYs9s7IUE0irzh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42489'),
  ('386173881827062426', 'Soundless', 2004, 'Thriller, Crime, Romance', 'Mennan Yapo, Torsten Lippstock', 'Lars-Olaf Beier', 'Joachim Król, Nadja Uhl, Christian Berkel, Rudolf Martin, Lisa Martinek, Peter Fitz, Wilhelm Manske, Gertraud Jesserer', null, 'Viktor, a methodical hit man, probably on his last job, has no plan for his retirement. He does not kill Nina, a woman sleeping beside his latest mark; then he follows her and rescues her from an attempted suicide. Nina is attracted to him, but also wants to know who he is. Her pursuit of his identity crosses the investigation of Lang, a brilliant police investigator who tries to inhabit the minds of the victims and the killer. Viktor''s employer also wants to kill Viktor and his contact, an aging arms dealer and family friend. Does Viktor have a future?', 'Viktor, a methodical hit man, probably on his last job, has no plan for his retirement. He does not kill Nina, a woman sleeping beside his latest mark; then he follows her and rescues her from an attempted suicide. Nina is attracted to him, but also wants to know who he is. Her pursuit of his identity crosses the investigation of Lang, a brilliant police investigator who tries to inhabit the minds of the victims and the killer. Viktor''s employer also wants to kill Viktor and his contact, an aging arms dealer and family friend. Does Viktor have a future?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hSPJiayIoPTUL8eq3cgwzAjZV7K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10458'),
  ('994142799806356673', 'Sounds from a Town I Love', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Woody Allen, Sam Hoffman', 'Woody Allen', 'Howard Spiegel, Olivia Hayman, Michael Emerson, Hazelle Goodman, Patti D''Arbanville, Bill Gerber, Kathleen Doyle, Tony Roberts', null, 'A montage of short scenes of New Yorkers talking on their cellphones, evoking snippets of conversation overheard in passing on the streets of Manhattan. Intended as a celebration of the people of New York City after the events of September 11, 2001.', 'A montage of short scenes of New Yorkers talking on their cellphones, evoking snippets of conversation overheard in passing on the streets of Manhattan. Intended as a celebration of the people of New York City after the events of September 11, 2001.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rfhnC66F2zF3Bl7ZykPZAYEFTd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48208'),
  ('764663968600324640', 'Sounds Like', 2006, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Brad Anderson', 'Brad Anderson', 'Chris Bauer, Laura Margolis, Nicholas Elia, Richard Kahan, Matty Finochio, Linnea Sharples, Blaine Anderson', null, 'Deeply affected by a personal tragedy, an office drone comes to realize his sense of hearing has taken on extraordinary capabilities that could drive him insane.', 'Deeply affected by a personal tragedy, an office drone comes to realize his sense of hearing has taken on extraordinary capabilities that could drive him insane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yuC7omVmSiVJiufD1gYPNJTduLE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289021'),
  ('237582622735306229', 'Sounds Like Love', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Juana Macías', 'Laura Sarmiento', 'María Valverde, Álex González, Elisabet Casanovas, Susana Abaitua, Miri Pérez-Cabrero, Eva Ugarte, Ignacio Montes, Artur Busquets', null, 'Fashion assistant Maca has just about got her life together after a devastating breakup, when Leo, the man who broke her heart returns. Seeking support from best friends, Adriana and Jime, all three will learn love can be complicated.', 'Fashion assistant Maca has just about got her life together after a devastating breakup, when Leo, the man who broke her heart returns. Seeking support from best friends, Adriana and Jime, all three will learn love can be complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYUdh9HsTHLd2GJUtAyKg3InlXs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776909'),
  ('415629268539786585', 'Sounds of Sand', 2007, 'Drama, War', 'Marion Hänsel, Walther van den Ende', 'Marion Hänsel', 'Issaka Sawadogo, Carole Karemera, Asma Nouman Aden, Saïd Abdallah Mohamed, Ahmed Ibrahim Mohamed, Emile Abossolo M''bo, Marco Prince, Moussa Assan', null, 'On the one hand, there’s the desert eating away at the land. The endless dry season, the lack of water. On the other there’s the threat of war. The village well has run dry. The livestock is dying. Trusting their instinct, most of the villagers leave and head south. Rahne, the only literate one, decides to head east with his three children and Mouna, his wife. A few sheep, some goats, and Chamelle, a dromedary, are their only riches. A tale of exodus, quest, hope and fatality.', 'On the one hand, there’s the desert eating away at the land. The endless dry season, the lack of water. On the other there’s the threat of war. The village well has run dry. The livestock is dying. Trusting their instinct, most of the villagers leave and head south. Rahne, the only literate one, decides to head east with his three children and Mouna, his wife. A few sheep, some goats, and Chamelle, a dromedary, are their only riches. A tale of exodus, quest, hope and fatality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8APPyLTJCPNSwusysGuPC52vXx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2197'),
  ('959620709073566057', 'Soundtrack to a Coup d''Etat', 2024, 'Documentary, History, Music', 'Johan Grimonprez', 'Johan Grimonprez', 'Patrice Lumumba, Louis Armstrong, Nikita Khrushchev, Dizzy Gillespie, Andrée Blouin, Abbey Lincoln, Max Roach, Malcolm X', 'NR', 'Jazz and decolonization are intertwined in a powerful narrative that recounts one of the tensest episodes of the Cold War.', 'Jazz and decolonization are intertwined in a powerful narrative that recounts one of the tensest episodes of the Cold War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZOB9UurVQjpdIp72L49pyd3anw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1214539'),
