  ('977538378379687834', 'Soup to Nuts', 1930, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Benjamin Stoloff, Joseph A. Valentine', 'Rube Goldberg, Lou Breslow', 'Ted Healy, Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Shemp Howard, Charles Winninger, Frances McCoy, George Bickel, Lucile Browne', 'NR', 'Mr. Schmidt''s costume store is bankrupt because he spends his time on Rube Goldberg-style inventions; the creditors send a young manager who falls for Schmidt''s niece Louise, but she''ll have none of him. Schmidt''s friends Ted, Queenie, and some goofy firemen try to help out; things come to a slapstick head when Louise needs rescuing from a fire.', 'Mr. Schmidt''s costume store is bankrupt because he spends his time on Rube Goldberg-style inventions; the creditors send a young manager who falls for Schmidt''s niece Louise, but she''ll have none of him. Schmidt''s friends Ted, Queenie, and some goofy firemen try to help out; things come to a slapstick head when Louise needs rescuing from a fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gq461CCWZva79qrgqkqTRryPg27.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50307'),
  ('964491182957324737', 'Soup''s On', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald''s nephews come to lunch filthy from playing outside. Donald sends them to wash up; when he finds they''ve done a half-hearted job, he sends them to bed without supper. They scheme to get food; Donald catches them, but falls off a cliff while chasing them. He''s OK, but temporarily out cold. The boys build a fake corpse and dress Donald up as an angel, and he buys it for a while.', 'Donald''s nephews come to lunch filthy from playing outside. Donald sends them to wash up; when he finds they''ve done a half-hearted job, he sends them to bed without supper. They scheme to get food; Donald catches them, but falls off a cliff while chasing them. He''s OK, but temporarily out cold. The boys build a fake corpse and dress Donald up as an angel, and he buys it for a while.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2YDxve4dxVrhir0iYUo0qIvlGZ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67172'),
  ('271275937197281367', 'Sour Apples', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan, Övünç Angun, Alper Baydar', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan, Farah Zeynep Abdullah, Songül Öden, Şükran Ovalı, Devrim Yakut, Şükrü Özyıldız, Fatih Artman, Ersin Korkut', null, 'In an eastern Turkish town, suitors knock on the door of the mayor and father of three beautiful daughters who choose to follow their own paths.', 'In an eastern Turkish town, suitors knock on the door of the mayor and father of three beautiful daughters who choose to follow their own paths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qeSM2hY8K3NEs0IeO5mHgQz6bap.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422991'),
  ('107895312239741308', 'Sour Grapes', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Larry David, Victor Hammer', 'Larry David', 'Steven Weber, Craig Bierko, Matt Keeslar, Karen Sillas, Viola Harris, Robyn Peterman, Orlando Jones, Richard Gant', 'R', 'The bond between cousins is tested when one wins a fortune with the other''s money at Atlantic City.', 'The bond between cousins is tested when one wins a fortune with the other''s money at Atlantic City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7WrCfoiMarjpARPtgkfEFslCsK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24560'),
  ('257298891927805541', 'Sour Grapes', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Lauriane Jussiau, Reuben Atlas, Jerry Rothwell', null, 'Rudy Kurniawan, Laurent Ponsot, Bill Koch, Arthur M. Sarkissian', null, 'Controversy erupts when an unassuming young man floods the American wine market with fake vintages valued in the millions, bamboozling the wine world elite, in this humorous and suspenseful tale of an ingenious con on the eve of the 2008 stock market crash.', 'Controversy erupts when an unassuming young man floods the American wine market with fake vintages valued in the millions, bamboozling the wine world elite, in this humorous and suspenseful tale of an ingenious con on the eve of the 2008 stock market crash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jLfS18TvzQ4IkpMXHIgWgS8kZW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396232'),
  ('215119242627996838', 'Source Code', 2011, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Duncan Jones, Don Burgess, Réal Capuano', 'Ben Ripley', 'Jake Gyllenhaal, Michelle Monaghan, Vera Farmiga, Jeffrey Wright, Michael Arden, Cas Anvar, Russell Peters, Brent Skagford', 'PG-13', 'When decorated soldier Captain Colter Stevens wakes up in the body of an unknown man, he discovers he''s part of a mission to find the bomber of a Chicago commuter train.', 'When decorated soldier Captain Colter Stevens wakes up in the body of an unknown man, he discovers he''s part of a mission to find the bomber of a Chicago commuter train.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTr0lvAzeQmUjgSgDEHTJpnrxTz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45612'),
  ('447431174894503706', 'Sources of Life', 2013, 'Drama', 'Carl-Friedrich Koschnick, Oskar Roehler', 'Oskar Roehler, Klaus Richter', 'Jürgen Vogel, Meret Becker, Moritz Bleibtreu, Lavinia Wilson, Kostja Ullmann, Sonja Kirchberger, Thomas Heinze, Margarita Broich', null, 'This is a family story that covers thirty years in the life of the Freytag family (narrated by the grandson, Robert). When his grandfather returns from Russia in 1949, he becomes part of the German "economic miracle" by producing garden gnomes. Klaus, Robert''s father, wants to become a writer. He marries Gisela who almost immediately gets pregnant with Robert - but the marriage doesn''t work. Both parents abandon the child, and Robert goes on living with both pairs of grand parents. While his father belongs to the 1968 generation that rebels against their fathers he falls in love with the neighbor''s''s daughter Laura.', 'This is a family story that covers thirty years in the life of the Freytag family (narrated by the grandson, Robert). When his grandfather returns from Russia in 1949, he becomes part of the German "economic miracle" by producing garden gnomes. Klaus, Robert''s father, wants to become a writer. He marries Gisela who almost immediately gets pregnant with Robert - but the marriage doesn''t work. Both parents abandon the child, and Robert goes on living with both pairs of grand parents. While his father belongs to the 1968 generation that rebels against their fathers he falls in love with the neighbor''s''s daughter Laura.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4rL4CQ48ZhuIqWg8ErjRN9zFwC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169609'),
  ('845349185178393474', 'Sous écrous', 2024, 'Action, Comedy', 'Hakim Bougheraba, Sonia Leval', 'Ali Bougheraba, Redouane Bougheraba, Hakim Bougheraba', 'Ichem Bougheraba, Arriles Amrani, Bernard Farcy, Redouane Bougheraba, Brahim Bouhlel, Moussa Maaskri, Lucille Guillaume, Teddy Ponceau', null, 'The daily lives of Sami and Nada. While Nada is the self-proclaimed "biggest hoodlum on the boardwalk", Sami is discovering the prison world for the first time. But in prison, no one is who they say they are, and it''s not long before the masks fall off', 'The daily lives of Sami and Nada. While Nada is the self-proclaimed "biggest hoodlum on the boardwalk", Sami is discovering the prison world for the first time. But in prison, no one is who they say they are, and it''s not long before the masks fall off', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uuZUh6aEcDy1BaJn4IbTWGdNE0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1279871'),
  ('793219662633330623', 'Sous le signe de Monte-Cristo', 1968, 'Adventure, History', 'André Hunebelle', null, 'Paul Barge, Claude Jade, Anny Duperey, Pierre Brasseur, Paul Le Person, Michel Auclair, Raymond Pellegrin, Jean Saudray', null, 'Edmond Dantès, who was active in the resistance against the Nazis, is accused for being a Nazi collaborator and is imprisoned in the fortress of Sisteron.', 'Edmond Dantès, who was active in the resistance against the Nazis, is accused for being a Nazi collaborator and is imprisoned in the fortress of Sisteron.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50itDVEFHQCZfdHSRO0MGaCvYST.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2389'),
  ('398496307276355958', 'South', 1999, 'Documentary', 'Chantal Akerman, Rémon Fromont', 'Chantal Akerman', null, null, 'Chantal Akerman investigates the American Deep South through the story of a lynching and grisly murder of an African-American man that took place in Texas in 1998.', 'Chantal Akerman investigates the American Deep South through the story of a lynching and grisly murder of an African-American man that took place in Texas in 1998.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8XsSPX8RLxlX1Ck9rUCpqYJd8wy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205980'),
  ('1109607918367092358', 'South Beach Academy', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Joe Esposito', 'Bill Milling', 'Al Lewis, James Hong, Keith Coulouris, Elizabeth Kaitan, Julie Lynn Cialini, Corey Feldman, Lorelei Leslie, Marcus Mueller', 'R', 'Brothers come to the aid of their uncle, who bet his Miami beach-sports school on a fixed volleyball game.', 'Brothers come to the aid of their uncle, who bet his Miami beach-sports school on a fixed volleyball game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbcmxg4T9yWSPNM8g0GK0ZKBu3t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134646'),
  ('946372687389160043', 'South Beach Love', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Damián Romay, Michael P. May, Steve Lasky', 'Andrea Canning', 'William Levy, Taylor Cole, Roberto Escobar, Steve Heinz, Justin Smith, Jessica Pacheco, Ariel Yasmine, Giselle Torres', 'G', 'From New York Times Bestselling Author Caridad Piñeiro comes a story about rival quinceañeras, glorious Cuban cooking, friendship, family ties – and romance', 'From New York Times Bestselling Author Caridad Piñeiro comes a story about rival quinceañeras, glorious Cuban cooking, friendship, family ties – and romance', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e0q1j4v9tyZUDCXTIteEcRtgOxT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:860267'),
  ('776829977863463589', 'South Central', 1992, 'Crime, Drama', 'Stephen Milburn Anderson, Charlie Lieberman', 'Stephen Milburn Anderson', 'Glenn Plummer, Byron Minns, Lexie Bigham, Vincent Craig Dupree, LaRita Shelby, Carl Lumbly, Vickilyn Reynolds, Kevin Best', 'R', 'During a 10-year sentence for murdering the leader of a rival South Central Los Angeles gang, Bobby Johnson finds religion and rehabilitation with the help of Muslim inmate Ali. Upon his release, Bobby returns home to find that his young son, Jimmie, has joined the Deuces, his old crew. Tensions rise as Bobby struggles to convince Jimmie to leave the gang that was his only family during the painful years his absent father spent behind bars.', 'During a 10-year sentence for murdering the leader of a rival South Central Los Angeles gang, Bobby Johnson finds religion and rehabilitation with the help of Muslim inmate Ali. Upon his release, Bobby returns home to find that his young son, Jimmie, has joined the Deuces, his old crew. Tensions rise as Bobby struggles to convince Jimmie to leave the gang that was his only family during the painful years his absent father spent behind bars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1kpCAxuEeUPe9Ep8r1VUYRfSVX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23196'),
  ('237411962283536197', 'South from Granada', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Fernando Colomo, José Luis Alcaine', 'Gerald Brenan, Jonathan Gathorne-Hardy', 'Matthew Goode, Verónica Sánchez, Antonio Resines, Guillermo Toledo, Ángela Molina, Laurence Fox, Jessica Kate Meyer, James Fleet', null, 'Brenan arrives at Yegen on foot, interrupting the funeral held for the daughter of the local cacique. He collapses from dysentery and soon learns that the local cacique, Don Fernando, is leaving for Granada with his wife. Brenan rents Fernando’s house for a year and soon enlists the services of María as housekeeper and cook and becomes friends with a local man named Paco. Brenan spends most of his time reading, walking, and trying to write poetry.His friends Dora Carrington, Lytton Strachey (who is ill), and Ralph Partridge visit for a couple of days. Brenan, who has been maintaining a correspondence with Carrington, learns during the visit that Partridge and Carrington are engaged. He is crushed, as he had been in love with Carrington.', 'Brenan arrives at Yegen on foot, interrupting the funeral held for the daughter of the local cacique. He collapses from dysentery and soon learns that the local cacique, Don Fernando, is leaving for Granada with his wife. Brenan rents Fernando’s house for a year and soon enlists the services of María as housekeeper and cook and becomes friends with a local man named Paco. Brenan spends most of his time reading, walking, and trying to write poetry.His friends Dora Carrington, Lytton Strachey (who is ill), and Ralph Partridge visit for a couple of days. Brenan, who has been maintaining a correspondence with Carrington, learns during the visit that Partridge and Carrington are engaged. He is crushed, as he had been in love with Carrington.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzDHSEt1T7MsI2fNwWJyRG7yAWS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80483'),
  ('1077273509545373945', 'South Is Nothing', 2013, 'Drama', 'Fabio Mollo', 'Fabio Mollo, Andrea Paolo Massara, Josella Porto', 'Miriam Karlkvist, Vinicio Marchioni, Valentina Lodovini, Francesco Colella, Giorgio Musumeci, Andrea Bellisario, Peppe Piromalli, Silvana Luppino', null, 'Set in a tiny seaside town, Fabio Mollo’s feature debut is a quietly evocative drama about a family’s attempts to cope with the loss of their son, and the impact of his absence on his teenaged sister Grazia.', 'Set in a tiny seaside town, Fabio Mollo’s feature debut is a quietly evocative drama about a family’s attempts to cope with the loss of their son, and the impact of his absence on his teenaged sister Grazia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkQ1fz0Z3iyQ293pqkTyGPX7Uwg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217425'),
  ('287576689098974103', 'South Kensington', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Claudio Zamarion', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Vanzina', 'Rupert Everett, Elle Macpherson, Enrico Brignano, Giampaolo Morelli, Naike Rivelli, Judith Godrèche, Max Pisu, Nunzia Schiano', null, 'A London aristocrat (Rupert Everett) rents out rooms in his posh estate to a pair of Italians who are wooing two wealthy British gals (Elle Macpherson, Judith Godrèche).', 'A London aristocrat (Rupert Everett) rents out rooms in his posh estate to a pair of Italians who are wooing two wealthy British gals (Elle Macpherson, Judith Godrèche).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxUNh9n9bFAWdwp7QtRdlxv8Ynw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74000'),
  ('343430509597991366', 'South of Heaven', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Matt Mitchell, Aharon Keshales', 'Aharon Keshales, Kai Mark, Navot Papushado', 'Jason Sudeikis, Evangeline Lilly, Mike Colter, Shea Whigham, Jeremy Bobb, Amaury Nolasco, Thaddeus J. Mixson, Michael Paré', 'R', 'Convicted felon Jimmy gets early parole after serving twelve years for armed robbery. Upon his release, he vows to give Annie, his childhood love, now dying from cancer, the best last year of her life – unfortunately it’s not that simple.', 'Convicted felon Jimmy gets early parole after serving twelve years for armed robbery. Upon his release, he vows to give Annie, his childhood love, now dying from cancer, the best last year of her life – unfortunately it’s not that simple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUdlWpnpNIWPIvXDnucLRjDHOvQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:645861'),
  ('63592717970097414', 'South of St. Louis', 1949, 'Western', 'Karl Freund, Lester D. Guthrie, Ray Enright', 'Zachary Gold, James R. Webb', 'Joel McCrea, Alexis Smith, Zachary Scott, Dorothy Malone, Douglas Kennedy, Alan Hale, Victor Jory, Bob Steele', 'NR', 'With the advent of the American Civil War, three partners in a ranch see how this is destroyed. Needing money, will join the Confederate troops, each for their particular motivations.', 'With the advent of the American Civil War, three partners in a ranch see how this is destroyed. Needing money, will join the Confederate troops, each for their particular motivations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYu99CYajML6epGjQWMufGLTGnU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201885'),
  ('479900042635578302', 'South of the Border', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Oliver Stone, Lucas Fuica, Albert Maysles', 'Mark Weisbrot, Tariq Ali', 'Oliver Stone, Hugo Chávez, Evo Morales, Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva, Cristina Fernández de Kirchner, Tariq Ali, Raúl Castro, Rafael Correa', null, 'A road trip across five countries to explore the social and political movements as well as the mainstream media''s misperception of South America while interviewing seven of its elected presidents.', 'A road trip across five countries to explore the social and political movements as well as the mainstream media''s misperception of South America while interviewing seven of its elected presidents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8JwbicUe7NsPk6azviHzUGpXT41.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47426'),
  ('623786586448209972', 'South Pacific', 1958, 'Music, Romance, War', 'Joshua Logan, Leon Shamroy, Ben Kadish', 'Paul Osborn', 'Rossano Brazzi, Mitzi Gaynor, John Kerr, Ray Walston, Juanita Hall, France Nuyen, Russ Brown, Jack Mullaney', null, 'Can a girl from Little Rock find happiness with a mature French planter she got to know one enchanted evening away from the military hospital where she is a nurse? Or should she just wash that man out of her hair? Bloody Mary is the philosopher of the island and it''s hard to believe she could be the mother of Liat who has captured the heart of Lt. Joseph Cable USMC. While waiting for action in the war in the South Pacific, sailors and nurses put on a musical comedy show. The war gets closer and the saga of Nellie Forbush and Emile de Becque becomes serious drama.', 'Can a girl from Little Rock find happiness with a mature French planter she got to know one enchanted evening away from the military hospital where she is a nurse? Or should she just wash that man out of her hair? Bloody Mary is the philosopher of the island and it''s hard to believe she could be the mother of Liat who has captured the heart of Lt. Joseph Cable USMC. While waiting for action in the war in the South Pacific, sailors and nurses put on a musical comedy show. The war gets closer and the saga of Nellie Forbush and Emile de Becque becomes serious drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYNltu2clFoRQGBz9BtZUTcCbUm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17352'),
  ('321288134141156744', 'South Park (Not Suitable for Children)', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Trey Parker', 'Trey Parker', 'Trey Parker, Matt Stone, April Stewart, Kimberly Brooks, Jessica Makinson, Christopher Borkovec, Betty Boogie Parker, Cleopatra Stone', 'R', 'After it''s discovered that a teacher at South Park Elementary has an OnlyFans page, Randy is compelled to take a closer look at the seedy underbelly of the world of online influencers.', 'After it''s discovered that a teacher at South Park Elementary has an OnlyFans page, Randy is compelled to take a closer look at the seedy underbelly of the world of online influencers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kN5H9EhUqDWBAsbnbt2XNhS7BFe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1219926'),
  ('638548266171943049', 'South Park the Streaming Wars', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Trey Parker, Andrew B. Rhoades', 'Trey Parker', 'Trey Parker, Matt Stone, April Stewart, Kimberly Brooks, Adrien Beard, Vernon Chatman', 'R', 'Cartman locks horns with his mom in a battle of wills while an epic conflict unfolds that threatens South Park’s very existence.', 'Cartman locks horns with his mom in a battle of wills while an epic conflict unfolds that threatens South Park’s very existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfgZJlKYg5xm6dBl05bOKhfunXb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:974691'),
  ('695652160824896476', 'South Park the Streaming Wars Part 2', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Trey Parker, Andrew B. Rhoades', 'Trey Parker', 'Trey Parker, Matt Stone, April Stewart, Kimberly Brooks, Adrien Beard, Neyla Cantu, Betty Boogie Parker', 'R', 'A drought has brought the town of South Park to the brink of disaster.', 'A drought has brought the town of South Park to the brink of disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rsfc5EVzWPtGcBiNKMXxDo2xvsQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:993729'),
  ('860411395065795396', 'South Park: Bigger, Longer & Uncut', 1999, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Trey Parker, Eric Stough, Nishira Fitzgerald', 'Trey Parker, Matt Stone, Pam Brady', 'Trey Parker, Matt Stone, Mary Kay Bergman, Isaac Hayes, Jesse Brant Howell, Anthony Cross-Thomas, Franchesca Clifford, Bruce Howell', 'R', 'In this feature film based on the hit animated series, the third graders of South Park sneak into an R-rated film by ultra-vulgar Canadian television personalities Terrance and Phillip, and emerge with expanded vocabularies that leave their parents and teachers scandalized. When outraged Americans try to censor the film, the controversy spirals into a call to wage war on Canada and Terrance and Phillip end up on death row, with the kids their only hope of rescue.', 'In this feature film based on the hit animated series, the third graders of South Park sneak into an R-rated film by ultra-vulgar Canadian television personalities Terrance and Phillip, and emerge with expanded vocabularies that leave their parents and teachers scandalized. When outraged Americans try to censor the film, the controversy spirals into a call to wage war on Canada and Terrance and Phillip end up on death row, with the kids their only hope of rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tS0PedvA2mFO9VCHYwQpaU1K36U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9473'),
  ('507142429097428288', 'South Park: Joining the Panderverse', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Trey Parker', 'Trey Parker', 'Trey Parker, Matt Stone, April Stewart, Kimberly Brooks, Mona Marshall, Adrien Beard, Janeshia Adams-Ginyard, Mo Ashley', 'R', 'Cartman''s deeply disturbing dreams portend the end of the life he knows and loves. Meanwhile, the adults in South Park are wrestling with their own life decisions, as the advent of AI is turning their world upside down.', 'Cartman''s deeply disturbing dreams portend the end of the life he knows and loves. Meanwhile, the adults in South Park are wrestling with their own life decisions, as the advent of AI is turning their world upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18IsRVfs5MkkTcqTGlUAnka6sCh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1190012'),
  ('913364436967466783', 'South Park: Post COVID', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Trey Parker, Andrew B. Rhoades, Gareth Taylor', 'Trey Parker', 'Trey Parker, Matt Stone, April Stewart, Mona Marshall, Kimberly Brooks, Adrien Beard, Delilah Kujala, Betty Boogie Parker', 'R', 'What happened to the children who lived through the Pandemic? Stan, Kyle, Cartman and Kenny survived but will never be the same Post Covid.', 'What happened to the children who lived through the Pandemic? Stan, Kyle, Cartman and Kenny survived but will never be the same Post Covid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abDxPtElhJnLnnJxgMqJ1N2H8yl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874299'),
  ('329961621954661775', 'South Park: Post COVID: The Return of COVID', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Trey Parker, Andrew B. Rhoades, Gareth Taylor', 'Trey Parker', 'Trey Parker, Matt Stone, April Stewart, Kimberly Brooks, Mona Marshall, Delilah Kujala, Betty Boogie Parker, Adrien Beard', 'R', 'If Stan, Kyle and Cartman could just work together, they could go back in time to make sure Covid never happened. But traveling back to the past seems to be the easy answer until they meet Victor Chaos.', 'If Stan, Kyle and Cartman could just work together, they could go back in time to make sure Covid never happened. But traveling back to the past seems to be the easy answer until they meet Victor Chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xD88mrJ8hsqYVqQ6kinNNGQLdg1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874300'),
  ('432892175369957949', 'South Park: The 25th Anniversary Concert', 2022, 'Music, Comedy, Documentary, TV Movie', 'Alex Coletti', null, 'Trey Parker, Matt Stone, Les Claypool, Larry LaLonde, Tim Alexander, Aaron Freeman, Michael Melchiondo Jr., Glenn McClelland', 'R', 'Trey Parker and Matt Stone celebrate South Park''s 25th anniversary with a concert in Colorado, featuring Primus and Ween.', 'Trey Parker and Matt Stone celebrate South Park''s 25th anniversary with a concert in Colorado, featuring Primus and Ween.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/awZ6LARNXh1hmZyn9XY6WMlkaR4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1012290'),
  ('712316930558598213', 'South Park: The End of Obesity', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Trey Parker', 'Trey Parker', 'Trey Parker, Matt Stone, April Stewart, Mona Marshall, Kimberly Brooks, Jessica Makinson, Vernon Chatman, Jennifer Howell', 'R', 'The advent of new weight loss drugs has a huge impact on everyone in South Park. When Cartman is denied access to the life-changing medicine, the kids jump into action.', 'The advent of new weight loss drugs has a huge impact on everyone in South Park. When Cartman is denied access to the life-changing medicine, the kids jump into action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxM1AIKBP83plf2buLR0cbGfvl2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1290938'),
  ('17381415836357595', 'South Sentinel', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Théo Madia, Laurent Brunet, Mathieu Gerault', 'Mathieu Gerault, Nicolas Silhol, Noé Debré', 'Niels Schneider, Sofian Khammes, India Hair, Denis Lavant, Thomas Daloz, Maryne Bertieaux, David Ayala, Marianne Pommier', null, 'The journey of Christian Lafayette, a French soldier who, in the aftermath of a murderous ambush in Afghanistan, has returned to France. Soon mixed up in trafficking opium with Mounir, his brother-in-arms who was wounded in the ambush, Lafayette, a foster child, and tormented war hero, chooses a new family and life – a criminal’s life. To escape this vicious circle of violence, Christian has to learn how to love.', 'The journey of Christian Lafayette, a French soldier who, in the aftermath of a murderous ambush in Afghanistan, has returned to France. Soon mixed up in trafficking opium with Mounir, his brother-in-arms who was wounded in the ambush, Lafayette, a foster child, and tormented war hero, chooses a new family and life – a criminal’s life. To escape this vicious circle of violence, Christian has to learn how to love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6i2m0NJpp9F7ZDEdc2iovISJumf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:893739'),
  ('316468661536113758', 'South Terminal', 2019, 'Drama', 'Rabah Ameur-Zaïmeche, Irina Lubtchansky, Camille Clément', 'Rabah Ameur-Zaïmeche', 'Ramzy Bedia, Amel Brahim-Djelloul, Slimane Dazi, Salim Ameur-Zaïmeche, Nabil Djedouani, Nacira Guénif-Souilamas, Marie Loustalot, Grégoire Pontécaille', null, 'In a Mediterranean country plunging into armed conflict, a doctor tries to do his duty against all odds, until the day his destiny is turned upside down…', 'In a Mediterranean country plunging into armed conflict, a doctor tries to do his duty against all odds, until the day his destiny is turned upside down…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5b8jjy8FoXuGx5tbjwwpQwvICIN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592776'),
  ('949612339011842227', 'South Wind', 2018, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Miloš Avramović', 'Petar Mihajlović, Miloš Avramović', 'Miloš Biković, Miodrag Radonjić, Dragan Bjelogrlić, Nebojša Glogovac, Miloš Timotijević, Jovana Stojiljković, Srđan ''Žika'' Todorović, Bogdan Diklić', null, 'A story about Petar Maraš, a Belgrade criminal in his late twenties, whose one reckless move causes an avalanche of events that will greatly affect the lives of those around him.', 'A story about Petar Maraš, a Belgrade criminal in his late twenties, whose one reckless move causes an avalanche of events that will greatly affect the lives of those around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pi5trlxslcIdlTZ8ZMhUtBIGQE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550518'),
  ('727026038527502346', 'Southbound', 2015, 'Fantasy, Thriller, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Roxanne Benjamin, David Bruckner, Patrick Horvath', 'Susan Burke, Roxanne Benjamin, Matt Bettinelli-Olpin', 'Fabianne Therese, Larry Fessenden, Kate Beahan, Zoe Cooper, Gerald Downey, Karla Droege, Dana Gould, Hassie Harrison', 'NR', 'The film contains five stories set on desolate stretches of a desert highway. Two men on the run from their past, a band on its way to a gig, a man struggling to get home, a brother in search of his long-lost sister and a family on vacation are forced to confront their worst fears and darkest secrets in these interwoven tales.', 'The film contains five stories set on desolate stretches of a desert highway. Two men on the run from their past, a band on its way to a gig, a man struggling to get home, a brother in search of his long-lost sister and a family on vacation are forced to confront their worst fears and darkest secrets in these interwoven tales.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHwarubiAKFdMt6MfM0TZ8mY8uO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354251'),
  ('614426088567745251', 'Southbound Duckling', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Red Coffey', 'NR', 'Jerry''s little duckling friend has packed his bag and is all set to fly south for the winter despite the book Jerry keeps showing him that points out that domestic ducks do not fly south, and despite his inability to fly at all.', 'Jerry''s little duckling friend has packed his bag and is all set to fly south for the winter despite the book Jerry keeps showing him that points out that domestic ducks do not fly south, and despite his inability to fly at all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGnVnhG4Vc6KRkb1zYB5hY6XSJ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84036'),
  ('41038161468319557', 'Southern Comfort', 1981, 'Thriller, Action', 'Andrew Laszlo, Walter Hill, Robert Roe', 'Walter Hill, David Giler, Michael Kane', 'Keith Carradine, Powers Boothe, Fred Ward, Franklyn Seales, T.K. Carter, Lewis Smith, Les Lannom, Peter Coyote', 'R', 'A squad of National Guards on an isolated weekend exercise in the Louisiana swamp must fight for their lives when they anger local Cajuns by stealing their canoes. Without live ammunition and in a strange country, their experience begins to mirror the Vietnam experience.', 'A squad of National Guards on an isolated weekend exercise in the Louisiana swamp must fight for their lives when they anger local Cajuns by stealing their canoes. Without live ammunition and in a strange country, their experience begins to mirror the Vietnam experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBPOcxiqc0PsG7Hz58JxSUN5BF0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12528'),
  ('432080869000924382', 'Southern Cross', 2015, 'Crime', 'Xiaosu Han, Andreas Thalhammer, Barbara Eder', 'Barbara Eder, Ivo Schneider', 'Andreas Lust, Franziska Weisz, Lukas Resetarits, Maria Urban, Harry Lampl, Michael Fuith, Oliver Rosskopf, Alexander Jagsch', null, 'After suffering a severe head injury on the job, criminal investigator Tommy Wehrschitz is being suspended – for his own good. In order to deal with the changes in his life he decides to go to southern Burgenland, to sell property he inherited from his estranged father. Barely arrived, Tommy is invited to see the circus, which is currently in the village, but the colorful spectacle is cut short when a flying knife misses its target and kills an audience member instead.', 'After suffering a severe head injury on the job, criminal investigator Tommy Wehrschitz is being suspended – for his own good. In order to deal with the changes in his life he decides to go to southern Burgenland, to sell property he inherited from his estranged father. Barely arrived, Tommy is invited to see the circus, which is currently in the village, but the colorful spectacle is cut short when a flying knife misses its target and kills an audience member instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sH9d8rYMavTys4voHbD6lvHNb3M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372412'),
  ('432928306180915985', 'Southern District', 2009, 'Drama', 'Juan Carlos Valdivia', null, 'Mariana Vargas, Ninón del Castillo, Pascual Loayza, Nicolás Fernández, Juan Pablo Koria', null, 'In La Paz -as opposed to many other cities- the rich live below, which is the Southern District. Life goes on without major mishaps in a large house surrounded by a beautiful garden. It is a wonderful world, a great bubble of comfort, where different personal spheres coexist: the mother, along with her three children and the Aymara inhabitants of the house. The drama surfaces slowly, without narrative ploys, observing day-to-day activities until internal and external forces make the bubble burst. The film relates the story of the final days of an upper-class family, at a time when the country is undergoing social changes.', 'In La Paz -as opposed to many other cities- the rich live below, which is the Southern District. Life goes on without major mishaps in a large house surrounded by a beautiful garden. It is a wonderful world, a great bubble of comfort, where different personal spheres coexist: the mother, along with her three children and the Aymara inhabitants of the house. The drama surfaces slowly, without narrative ploys, observing day-to-day activities until internal and external forces make the bubble burst. The film relates the story of the final days of an upper-class family, at a time when the country is undergoing social changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvevCZ91MXM5yQQlmeP5j4kRx9a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60708'),
  ('127806545593870960', 'Southern Fried Rabbit', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Bugs Bunny attempts to shake off Yosemite Sam (here, cast as a Civil War-era colonel), who is preventing him from crossing the Mason-Dixon Line.', 'Bugs Bunny attempts to shake off Yosemite Sam (here, cast as a Civil War-era colonel), who is preventing him from crossing the Mason-Dixon Line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nzFFsHqJMCusbv9gKD8v5k5O6fz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165869'),
  ('729678103011622584', 'Southie', 1998, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'John Shea', 'Jimmy Cummings, Dave McLaughlin, John Shea', 'Donnie Wahlberg, Rose McGowan, Anne Meara, Will Arnett, Amanda Peet, Lawrence Tierney, John Shea, Jimmy Cummings', 'R', 'South Boston Irish bad boy Danny Quinn returns back home from New York and gets stuck between his pals, who are supported by one Irish mafia clan, and his family, which are members of another.', 'South Boston Irish bad boy Danny Quinn returns back home from New York and gets stuck between his pals, who are supported by one Irish mafia clan, and his family, which are members of another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a67OFrGDa7KYkqPJNyqFgWmUKqI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55989'),
  ('925996959071728319', 'Southland Tales', 2007, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Comedy', 'Richard Kelly, Steven Poster, Priscilla Elliott', 'Richard Kelly', 'Dwayne Johnson, Seann William Scott, Sarah Michelle Gellar, Mandy Moore, Justin Timberlake, Miranda Richardson, Wallace Shawn, Bai Ling', 'R', 'Set in the futuristic landscape of Los Angeles on July 4, 2008, as it stands on the brink of social, economic and environmental disaster. Boxer Santaros is an action star who''s stricken with amnesia. His life intertwines with Krysta Now, an adult film star developing her own reality television project, and Ronald Taverner, a Hermosa Beach police officer who holds the key to a vast conspiracy.', 'Set in the futuristic landscape of Los Angeles on July 4, 2008, as it stands on the brink of social, economic and environmental disaster. Boxer Santaros is an action star who''s stricken with amnesia. His life intertwines with Krysta Now, an adult film star developing her own reality television project, and Ronald Taverner, a Hermosa Beach police officer who holds the key to a vast conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7dbIDQ80z4bxiDlAvxRwc5TI44C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4723'),
  ('15126792323789184', 'Southpaw', 2015, 'Action, Drama', 'Antoine Fuqua, Mauro Fiore', 'Kurt Sutter', 'Jake Gyllenhaal, Rachel McAdams, Forest Whitaker, Oona Laurence, 50 Cent, Skylan Brooks, Naomie Harris, Victor Ortiz', 'R', 'Billy "The Great" Hope, the reigning junior middleweight boxing champion, has an impressive career, a loving wife and daughter, and a lavish lifestyle. However, when tragedy strikes, Billy hits rock bottom, losing his family, his house and his manager. He soon finds an unlikely savior in Tick Willis, a former fighter who trains the city''s toughest amateur boxers. With his future on the line, Hope fights to reclaim the trust of those he loves the most.', 'Billy "The Great" Hope, the reigning junior middleweight boxing champion, has an impressive career, a loving wife and daughter, and a lavish lifestyle. However, when tragedy strikes, Billy hits rock bottom, losing his family, his house and his manager. He soon finds an unlikely savior in Tick Willis, a former fighter who trains the city''s toughest amateur boxers. With his future on the line, Hope fights to reclaim the trust of those he loves the most.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSQ49Fi3NVTqGGXILmxV2T2pdkG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:307081'),
  ('250786219057458697', 'Southside Kev', 2026, 'Drama', 'Jamel Furlow', 'Jamel Furlow', 'Nathan Lewis, Alpachino Howard, Naomi Taylor, Brandon Chastang, Shervon Miller', 'R', 'South-Side Kev follows a misguided teenager as he navigates the mean streets of South Jamaica Queens, struggling to find the balance between earning respect and maintaining his innocence.', 'South-Side Kev follows a misguided teenager as he navigates the mean streets of South Jamaica Queens, struggling to find the balance between earning respect and maintaining his innocence.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FbVH0Lk7qF1OWPTpSN5Q27YWTPhC.jpg', 'plex:movie:southside-kev'),
  ('1090321569408975208', 'Southside with You', 2016, 'Romance, Drama', 'Richard Tanne, Pat Scola', 'Richard Tanne', 'Parker Sawyers, Tika Sumpter, Vanessa Bell Calloway, Phillip Edward Van Lear, Deanna Reed-Foster, Jerod Haynes, Gabrielle Lott-Rogers, Taylar Fondren', 'PG-13', 'Chronicles a single day in the summer of 1989 when the future president of the United States, Barack Obama, wooed his future First Lady on an epic first date across Chicago''s South Side.', 'Chronicles a single day in the summer of 1989 when the future president of the United States, Barack Obama, wooed his future First Lady on an epic first date across Chicago''s South Side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fEbIZkufqHFMeSpwxH270txk5Ao.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:310888'),
  ('344298977934340096', 'Souvenir', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Bavo Defurne', 'Jacques Boon, Yves Verbraeken, Bavo Defurne', 'Isabelle Huppert, Kévin Azaïs, Johan Leysen, Benjamin Boutboul, Jan Hammenecker, Anne Brionne, Carlo Ferrante, Charles Loos', null, 'A former European song contest singer, fading away in a pâté factory, falls in love with a young, aspiring boxer. Together, they decide she should attempt a comeback.', 'A former European song contest singer, fading away in a pâté factory, falls in love with a young, aspiring boxer. Together, they decide she should attempt a comeback.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7CeTKALmIy0BmLalGNSPnpVxzY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408258'),
  ('777648810148832179', 'Souvenir', 2021, 'Drama', 'Armond Cohen, Sergio Armstrong', 'Ricardo Aguado', 'Paulina Gaitán, Marco Pérez, Yuriria del Valle, Roberto Sosa, Flavio Medina, Silvia Mariscal, Montserrat Marañon, Andrew Leland Rogers', null, 'The enigmatic Isabel decides to rent her belly to give birth to the baby of Sara and Joaquin, a possessive couple obsessed with the idea of starting a family.', 'The enigmatic Isabel decides to rent her belly to give birth to the baby of Sara and Joaquin, a possessive couple obsessed with the idea of starting a family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/33dxxU2Z6eQM6VU7QPN8lZM5o9a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585381'),
  ('584586238891625503', 'Sovereign', 2025, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Christian Swegal, Dustin Lane', 'Christian Swegal', 'Nick Offerman, Jacob Tremblay, Dennis Quaid, Kezia Dacosta, Terry J. Nelson, Bobby Gilchrist, Megan Mullally, Ruby Wolf', 'R', 'Struggling single father Jerry indoctrinates his son Joe into the sovereign citizen movement, teaching him that laws are mere illusions and freedom is something you take. But, as Jerry’s ideology consumes them, they are set on a collision course with a police chief who has spent his life upholding the rules that Jerry has spent his tearing down.', 'Struggling single father Jerry indoctrinates his son Joe into the sovereign citizen movement, teaching him that laws are mere illusions and freedom is something you take. But, as Jerry’s ideology consumes them, they are set on a collision course with a police chief who has spent his life upholding the rules that Jerry has spent his tearing down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWXUMfnMj4ioReprwsDZgt8sghK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1130022'),
  ('295893151474234704', 'Sovereign: Six Times São Paulo', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Carlos Nader, Rodrigo Menck, Luiz Miyasaka', 'Maurício Arruda', 'Nando Reis, Muricy Ramalho, Rogério Ceni', null, 'Tells the stories of six national soccer titles won by São Paulo Futebol Clube, from the point of view of the fans.', 'Tells the stories of six national soccer titles won by São Paulo Futebol Clube, from the point of view of the fans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYQaYH1Q59ORQ3lga0dSlPhOzEQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52550'),
  ('125693711713183678', 'Sovershenno seryozno', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Vyacheslav Leshchyov, Eldar Ryazanov, Leonid Kraynenkov', 'Eldar Ryazanov, Emil Braginskiy, Boris Laskin', 'Anatoliy Papanov, Sergei Filippov, Georgiy Kulikov, Pyotr Repnin, Pavel Tarasov, Igor Sretensky, Rostislav Plyatt, Georgi Georgiu', null, 'An interesting voyage through the Soviet television and film industry.', 'An interesting voyage through the Soviet television and film industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7VRF7XwfqabyFQTwBldzBmRocS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270908'),
  ('914924617590798890', 'Soviet Elegy', 1989, 'Documentary', 'Aleksandr Sokurov, Aleksandr Burov', 'Aleksandr Sokurov', 'Boris Yeltsin, Aleksandr Sokurov', null, 'In "The Soviet Elegy" the long train of photos of the Soviet leaders, dead or alive, stops at the portrait of Yeltsin. At the time of shooting Yeltsin had fallen down from the assembly of the Communist Party deities, and participated in the earthly life through connections of different kinds.', 'In "The Soviet Elegy" the long train of photos of the Soviet leaders, dead or alive, stops at the portrait of Yeltsin. At the time of shooting Yeltsin had fallen down from the assembly of the Communist Party deities, and participated in the earthly life through connections of different kinds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnJgOqSOt8Ug4KiBXVn6nsJkkaM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145911'),
  ('506645100431506856', 'Soviet Toys', 1924, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Dziga Vertov, Aleksandr Dorn', 'Dziga Vertov', null, null, 'The first animated movie made in the Soviet Union, it portrays a bloated caricature of a Capitalist devouring a massive heap of food and drink.', 'The first animated movie made in the Soviet Union, it portrays a bloated caricature of a Capitalist devouring a massive heap of food and drink.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bp7MjOHlaf2mVtr6t5Rb3hzvKAj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176407'),
  ('946412091469107377', 'Sow the Wind', 2020, 'Drama', 'Danilo Caputo, Christos Karamanis', 'Danilo Caputo, Milena Magnani', 'Yle Vianello, Feliciana Sibilano, Espedito Chionna', null, 'After years of absence, Nica returns to her native village. Her grandmother’s olive trees are threatened by a bug infestation. Against her father’s will, she fights to preserve the trees and maintain family traditions.', 'After years of absence, Nica returns to her native village. Her grandmother’s olive trees are threatened by a bug infestation. Against her father’s will, she fights to preserve the trees and maintain family traditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWhYfuXvchhjsXoji1j2qwx8eP6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665775'),
  ('918791707208848383', 'Soy de rancho', 2019, 'Drama, Action, Comedy', 'Jorge Román, Alonso O. Lara', 'Edén Echeverría', 'Alfredo Rios El Komander, Estrella Solís', null, 'Alfredo is a powerful man living in his ranch. When family business gets in trouble, his father sends him to the capital, where he meets Fabiola, who is drowning in family debt. Under the influence of her mother, Fabiola is forced to seduce Alfredo to get money out of him, but she needs to accept his invitation to the ranch. There, Alfredo discovers Fabiola''s true intentions and decides to teach her a lesson.', 'Alfredo is a powerful man living in his ranch. When family business gets in trouble, his father sends him to the capital, where he meets Fabiola, who is drowning in family debt. Under the influence of her mother, Fabiola is forced to seduce Alfredo to get money out of him, but she needs to accept his invitation to the ranch. There, Alfredo discovers Fabiola''s true intentions and decides to teach her a lesson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/duHSYYPHfxDdgmOjbKW0XIQaj7O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:663000'),
  ('761058014050200403', 'Soy inocente', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Pedro Flores Maldonado', 'Pedro Flores Maldonado, Yiddá Eslava', 'Yiddá Eslava, Mariella Zanetti, Yarlo Ruiz, Rodolfo Carrión, Edgar Vivar, Patricia Portocarrero, Pietro Sibille', null, 'Sofia leads an austere life as a housekeeper, wanting to save every penny to support her grandmother and siblings. A day like any other, she finds herself involved in a crime scene in a hotel room. She''s innocent, but her prints are everywhere.', 'Sofia leads an austere life as a housekeeper, wanting to save every penny to support her grandmother and siblings. A day like any other, she finds herself involved in a crime scene in a hotel room. She''s innocent, but her prints are everywhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qdgVuWwp0UBAnpRdbhoLkObatsV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1073736'),
  ('337343842996200788', 'Soy leyenda', 1967, 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Mario Gómez Martín, Jesús Ocaña, Anselmo Álvarez Afonso', 'Alfonso Núñez Flores, Mario Gómez Martín', 'Moisés Menéndez, Eliska Ramírez, José María Resel, Ricardo Palacios, Ana Castor', null, 'First the atomic war broke out, new machines were made, dead birds appeared. In 1999, a bacteriological warfare began, there were sandstorms and giant locust infestations; the human tissue was transformed and a new being, once legendary, now real, emerged: the vampire. Only Robert Neville, the last man on Earth, remains unpolluted, living in constant struggle with the new inhabitants of the planet.', 'First the atomic war broke out, new machines were made, dead birds appeared. In 1999, a bacteriological warfare began, there were sandstorms and giant locust infestations; the human tissue was transformed and a new being, once legendary, now real, emerged: the vampire. Only Robert Neville, the last man on Earth, remains unpolluted, living in constant struggle with the new inhabitants of the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVslABtSGk5S9I9oZhlVUwbPv1L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:506482'),
  ('580371852415077039', 'Soy Libre', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Laure Portier, Laure Portier', 'Laure Portier', 'Arnaud Gomez, Jacqueline Puygrenier', null, 'Arnaud is looking for his place in society. Soy Libre shows his insatiable desire for freedom on a nearly ten year long quest, which brings him from Northern France to Spain to Peru. A portrait of a little brother growing bigger and bigger, through the eyes of his elder sister.', 'Arnaud is looking for his place in society. Soy Libre shows his insatiable desire for freedom on a nearly ten year long quest, which brings him from Northern France to Spain to Peru. A portrait of a little brother growing bigger and bigger, through the eyes of his elder sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZOxowJqwsaPtTkCPWlv2ampZn7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:838897'),
  ('1082296802862329948', 'Soy Luna: Live Concert', 2017, 'Music, TV Movie', 'Diego Álvarez', null, 'Karol Sevilla, Ruggero Pasquarelli, Michael Ronda, Valentina Zenere, Carolina Kopelioff, Gastón Vietto, Agustín Bernasconi, Chiara Parravicini', null, '"Soy Luna: Live Concert" is an amazing musical show featuring original songs from the hit teen ''telenovela'' "Soy Luna".', '"Soy Luna: Live Concert" is an amazing musical show featuring original songs from the hit teen ''telenovela'' "Soy Luna".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMHzMd9YF4Q9mQmMaGmwab0fbaU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492644'),
  ('1111287747094686589', 'Soy Luna: The Last Concert', 2021, 'Music, Documentary', 'Carolina María García Fernández', null, 'Karol Sevilla, Ruggero Pasquarelli, Michael Ronda, Valentina Zenere, Gastón Vietto, Malena Ratner, Jorge López, Ana Jara Martínez', null, 'The "Soy Luna" cast bid farewell, live at the legendary Luna Park arena in Buenos Aires. All the intimacy backstage and a look back over the history of the series, from the first rehearsals, the shooting sessions and the tours, down to the final farewell of a series that has left its mark on millions of fans.', 'The "Soy Luna" cast bid farewell, live at the legendary Luna Park arena in Buenos Aires. All the intimacy backstage and a look back over the history of the series, from the first rehearsals, the shooting sessions and the tours, down to the final farewell of a series that has left its mark on millions of fans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKw7suet4zEZFOPul03qBEKriUV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:779783'),
  ('346721989125160995', 'Soy Nero', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Rafi Pitts, Christos Karamanis', 'Răzvan Rădulescu, Rafi Pitts', 'Johnny Ortiz, Rory Cochrane, Aml Ameen, Darrell Britt-Gibson, Michael Harney, Richie Stephens, Ian Casselberry, Khleo Thomas', 'R', 'The border fence between Mexico and the United States is part of their lives; Mexican youths use it as a volleyball net on the beach, holding their own kind of international matches with their opposite numbers on the other side. When Nero scales the metres-high metal bars we suspect that he has done this often before: because nothing is going to divert him from his dream of becoming a US citizen. He follows the traces of his older brother which lead him to Los Angeles and the mansions of the rich and famous where he gazes incredulously at this very different lifestyle with its pools and double garages that he soon hopes will be his. His only chance of quickly acquiring a green card, however, is by volunteering for military service. Before he knows it, Nero finds himself in the desert landscape of the war zones of the Middle East, fighting for his citizenship with a machine gun in his hand.', 'The border fence between Mexico and the United States is part of their lives; Mexican youths use it as a volleyball net on the beach, holding their own kind of international matches with their opposite numbers on the other side. When Nero scales the metres-high metal bars we suspect that he has done this often before: because nothing is going to divert him from his dream of becoming a US citizen. He follows the traces of his older brother which lead him to Los Angeles and the mansions of the rich and famous where he gazes incredulously at this very different lifestyle with its pools and double garages that he soon hopes will be his. His only chance of quickly acquiring a green card, however, is by volunteering for military service. Before he knows it, Nero finds himself in the desert landscape of the war zones of the Middle East, fighting for his citizenship with a machine gun in his hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNVdWGGoqAM50RYQi1Rhgvux8sl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378698'),
  ('225250986740163277', 'Soy tu fan: La película', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Mariana Chenillo', 'Dolores Fonzi, Constanza Novick, Laura Paredes', 'Ana Claudia Talancón, Martín Altomaro, Maya Zapata, Gonzalo García Vivanco, Johanna Murillo, Marcela Guirado, Camila Selser, Flor Eduarda Gurrola', null, 'In 2012, Charly leaves Nicolás minutes before getting married and moves to another country. Heartbroken, he writes to her a letter where predicts an unhappy life of complete solitude. Ten years later, fate brings them together again at the wedding of Rocío, her best friend, and Diego, her brother, where they will face that their love story is not over yet.', 'In 2012, Charly leaves Nicolás minutes before getting married and moves to another country. Heartbroken, he writes to her a letter where predicts an unhappy life of complete solitude. Ten years later, fate brings them together again at the wedding of Rocío, her best friend, and Diego, her brother, where they will face that their love story is not over yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3LhtnBhWrhJA7gIwtbwK299gSU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1002770'),
  ('1151105716333554797', 'Soy un prófugo', 1946, 'Comedy', 'Miguel M. Delgado, Jack Draper, Luis Abadié', 'Miguel M. Delgado', 'Cantinflas, Daniel Herrera, Emilia Guiú, Agustín Isunza, Carmelita González, Rafael Alcayde, José Elías Moreno, Ángel T. Sala', null, 'A janitor in a large bank is accused of pulling of a major heist. He is forced to become a fugitive while hunting for the real culprits.', 'A janitor in a large bank is accused of pulling of a major heist. He is forced to become a fugitive while hunting for the real culprits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DfDpe2ACfjTgd8LliG6FwJqUvY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82787'),
  ('816335236461908450', 'Soylent Green', 1973, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Richard Fleischer, Richard H. Kline, Wolfgang E. Marum', 'Stanley R. Greenberg', 'Charlton Heston, Leigh Taylor-Young, Chuck Connors, Joseph Cotten, Brock Peters, Paula Kelly, Edward G. Robinson, Stephen Young', 'PG', 'In the year 2022, overcrowding, pollution, and resource depletion have reduced society’s leaders to finding food for the teeming masses. The answer is Soylent Green.', 'In the year 2022, overcrowding, pollution, and resource depletion have reduced society’s leaders to finding food for the teeming masses. The answer is Soylent Green.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nbkShkOEXUoKVhaX0XG41wyBkq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12101'),
  ('822667585901071917', 'SP FX: The Empire Strikes Back', 1980, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Robert Guenette', 'Richard Schickel', 'Mark Hamill, Carrie Fisher, Anthony Daniels, Kenny Baker, Peter Mayhew, Alec Guinness, Frank Oz, Harrison Ford', 'G', 'Hosted by Mark Hamill, this revealing documentary offers behind-the-scenes glimpses into the amazing special effects that transformed George Lucas’ vision for Star Wars and The Empire Strikes Back into reality!', 'Hosted by Mark Hamill, this revealing documentary offers behind-the-scenes glimpses into the amazing special effects that transformed George Lucas’ vision for Star Wars and The Empire Strikes Back into reality!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hk8Ni7mnsBhqzWjHfVGYBUjHQg8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72803'),
  ('328461431850112294', 'SP: The Motion Picture', 2010, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Takafumi Hatano, Masayuki Yamamoto, Yuichi Tazawa', 'Kazuki Kaneshiro', 'Junichi Okada, Yoko Maki, Teruyuki Kagawa, Satoru Matsuo, Yū Kamio, Shinichi Tsutsumi, Toru Nomaguchi, Keisuke Horibe', null, 'At an event hall in Roppongi Hills, there is a charity event for landmine eradication. Kaoru does security with Security Police officers Soichiro Ogata, Eri Sasamoto, Takahumi Yamamoto and Mitsuo Ishida. Kaoru Inoue senses a threatening existence and starts to suffer a severe headache and becomes dizzy. When Kaoru was young, his parents were killed by terrorists and that incident has had an traumatic effect on Kaoru since.', 'At an event hall in Roppongi Hills, there is a charity event for landmine eradication. Kaoru does security with Security Police officers Soichiro Ogata, Eri Sasamoto, Takahumi Yamamoto and Mitsuo Ishida. Kaoru Inoue senses a threatening existence and starts to suffer a severe headache and becomes dizzy. When Kaoru was young, his parents were killed by terrorists and that incident has had an traumatic effect on Kaoru since.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1g4qz7eNNMFQFbnv04hS5KaIrml.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85215'),
  ('762346927187997560', 'SP: The Motion Picture II', 2011, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Takafumi Hatano, Masayuki Yamamoto, Masaya Takahashi', 'Kazuki Kaneshiro', 'Junichi Okada, Shinichi Tsutsumi, Teruyuki Kagawa, Yoko Maki, Kei Yamamoto, Satoru Matsuo, Yū Kamio, Toru Nomaguchi', null, 'After the attack on the Chief Cabinet Secretary, the next duty of the fourth office will be to guard the National Assembly building. In the midst of security, Ogata keeps Inoue away from the main conference hall and puts his well-thought-out plan into action, and the parliament building is controlled by SPs and terrorists who support the revolution. Inoue notices something strange and starts to fight against the terrorists to stop Ogata.', 'After the attack on the Chief Cabinet Secretary, the next duty of the fourth office will be to guard the National Assembly building. In the midst of security, Ogata keeps Inoue away from the main conference hall and puts his well-thought-out plan into action, and the parliament building is controlled by SPs and terrorists who support the revolution. Inoue notices something strange and starts to fight against the terrorists to stop Ogata.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kRgZr5FVJYqO1rxi8Vux8iIwQdy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364989'),
  ('738497679414456547', 'Spa', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Abrid Shine, Swaroop Philip, Jujin Mathews, Prajod Kalabhavan', 'Abrid Shine', 'Sujith Sadasivan, Madhu Balakrishnan, Ten Point, B. K. Harinarayanan, Santhosh Varma', null, 'Intertwined lives at La Paradise, an urban massage therapy centre, focus on Mathan''s struggle to separate love''s reality from its fictional ideals. Sharp social satire explores adult themes and human behavior.', 'Intertwined lives at La Paradise, an urban massage therapy centre, focus on Mathan''s struggle to separate love''s reality from its fictional ideals. Sharp social satire explores adult themes and human behavior.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FsZez7I5ctXVlOP73Js0G4cNgw16.jpg', 'plex:movie:spa-2026'),
  ('324570094737158431', 'Space Adventure Cobra: The Movie', 1982, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Osamu Dezaki, Hirokata Takahashi, Akio Sugino', 'Haruya Yamazaki, Buichi Terasawa', 'Shigeru Matsuzaki, Akiko Nakamura, Toshiko Fujita, Jun Fubuki, Yoshiko Sakakibara, Reiko Tajima, Gorō Mutsumi, Akira Kume', null, 'Cobra, a notorious space pirate, is enlisted by bounty hunter Jane to rescue her sister from the strange being known as Crystal Bowie, but then finds himself drawn into a complex struggle over the fate of a mysterious wandering planet.', 'Cobra, a notorious space pirate, is enlisted by bounty hunter Jane to rescue her sister from the strange being known as Crystal Bowie, but then finds himself drawn into a complex struggle over the fate of a mysterious wandering planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rv5fbmZV9oxyBg0nr3ZFHrClpFF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81850'),
  ('348991109856407315', 'Space Amoeba', 1970, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Horror', 'Ishirō Honda, Seiji Tani, Sadamasa Arikawa', 'Ei Ogawa', 'Akira Kubo, Yukiko Kobayashi, Atsuko Takahashi, Yoshio Tsuchiya, Tetsu Nakamura, Sachio Sakai, Kenji Sahara, Yū Fujiki', 'G', 'When a space probe crash-lands on a far-flung Pacific atoll, the craft''s alien stowaways decide to take over their new world one creature at a time. Soon, the parasitic life forms latch onto three indigenous critters -- a squid, a crab and a snapping turtle -- and transform them into colossal mutant monsters.', 'When a space probe crash-lands on a far-flung Pacific atoll, the craft''s alien stowaways decide to take over their new world one creature at a time. Soon, the parasitic life forms latch onto three indigenous critters -- a squid, a crab and a snapping turtle -- and transform them into colossal mutant monsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vktVrt9H9R1yXUBKRRi6QWRA7r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38221'),
  ('894098723605886726', 'Space Battleship Yamato', 1977, 'Action, Animation, Adventure, Science Fiction, Drama, Romance', 'Toshio Masuda, Takeshi Shirato, Toyoo Ashida', 'Keisuke Fujikawa, Eiichi Yamamoto, Yoshinobu Nishizaki', 'Gorō Naya, Kei Tomiyama, Shūsei Nakamura, Yoko Asagami, Ichiro Nagai, Taichiro Hirokawa, Takeshi Aono, Masatô Ibu', null, 'When vile aliens known as the Gamilons wreak nuclear havoc on Earth, a group of survivors refit the Japanese battleship Yamato for intergalactic travel and set off on a mission to retrieve a neutralizer that will eradicate the radiation from Earth''s atmosphere.', 'When vile aliens known as the Gamilons wreak nuclear havoc on Earth, a group of survivors refit the Japanese battleship Yamato for intergalactic travel and set off on a mission to retrieve a neutralizer that will eradicate the radiation from Earth''s atmosphere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkCjPG2ljGEXpIbKrw2Wt3bO1RS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48101'),
  ('199858019956651034', 'Space Battleship Yamato', 2010, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Takashi Yamazaki, Kōzō Shibazaki, Kiyoko Shibuya', 'Shimako Sato', 'Takuya Kimura, Meisa Kuroki, Toshiro Yanagiba, Naoto Ogata, Hiroyuki Ikeuchi, Shinichi Tsutsumi, Maiko, Reiko Takashima', null, 'In 2199, five years after the Gamilons began an invasion of Earth, the planet has been ravaged by the aliens'' bombs. The remnants of humanity have fled underground to escape the irradiated surface. One day, former pilot Susumu Kodai discovers a capsule sent from the planet Iscandar that tells of a device that can remove the radiation from the Earth''s surface. The Earth Defense Force rebuilds the battleship Yamato with a new type of propulsion system to make the 148,000 light year trip to Iscandar in hopes of saving the Earth. Within one year, the radiation will drive the rest of humanity to extinction.', 'In 2199, five years after the Gamilons began an invasion of Earth, the planet has been ravaged by the aliens'' bombs. The remnants of humanity have fled underground to escape the irradiated surface. One day, former pilot Susumu Kodai discovers a capsule sent from the planet Iscandar that tells of a device that can remove the radiation from the Earth''s surface. The Earth Defense Force rebuilds the battleship Yamato with a new type of propulsion system to make the 148,000 light year trip to Iscandar in hopes of saving the Earth. Within one year, the radiation will drive the rest of humanity to extinction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qlRJcIFiVwA6X58LOGNuMP1io2H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61984'),
  ('535134691366954624', 'Space Battleship Yamato 2199: Odyssey of the Celestial Ark', 2014, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Akio Takami, Yutaka Izubuchi, Nobuteru Yuuki', 'Leiji Matsumoto, Yoshinobu Nishizaki', 'Daisuke Ono, Houko Kuwashima, Eriko Nakamura, Kenichi Suzumura, Hochu Otsuka, Hiroshi Kamiya, Mugihito', null, '2199 AD. Yamato tried to leave behind the Large Magellanic Cloud galaxy, after receiving a "Cosmo Reverse System" at its destination, Iscandar. However, suddenly, it encounters a mysterious group at the edge of the Large Magellanic Cloud. The crew finds out that the group is called the "Gatlantis," and that its leader is the Gutaba expeditionary force commander who calls himself "Goran Dagaamu of Thunder." The commander demands that Yamato be handed over to him. Yamato, wanting to hurry to Earth, escapes the fray. However, Yamato is attacked by a devastating beam weapon called the "Flame Direct Attack Cannon" that can transcend space.', '2199 AD. Yamato tried to leave behind the Large Magellanic Cloud galaxy, after receiving a "Cosmo Reverse System" at its destination, Iscandar. However, suddenly, it encounters a mysterious group at the edge of the Large Magellanic Cloud. The crew finds out that the group is called the "Gatlantis," and that its leader is the Gutaba expeditionary force commander who calls himself "Goran Dagaamu of Thunder." The commander demands that Yamato be handed over to him. Yamato, wanting to hurry to Earth, escapes the fray. However, Yamato is attacked by a devastating beam weapon called the "Flame Direct Attack Cannon" that can transcend space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/of8soPaCpSTT4MeHlIOieaOidUa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267963'),
  ('176574025153185847', 'Space Battleship Yamato Resurrection', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Yoshinobu Nishizaki, Takeshi Shirato', 'Bull Ishihara, Atsuhiro Tomioka, Yoshinobu Nishizaki', 'Koichi Yamadera, Kentaro Ito, Daisuke Namikawa, Chafurin, Kenji Nojima, Toru Furuya, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Kappei Yamaguchi', null, 'In the year 2220 A.D., the Earth Federation launches a plan to evacuate Earth when discovering that a travelling black hole capable of destroying anything in its path is on course towards the solar system. As the people on Earth prepare to relocate to planet Amare, whose ruler offers refuge, the tyrants known as the "S.U.S. Empire" attack the first Earth evacuation fleet. After learning that his wife Capt. Yuki Mori-Kodai disappeared in the battle and that legendary space battleship Yamato has been fully rebuilt, Susumu Kodai accepts command of the ship as he intends to not only help humanity once again, but also find Yuki in the hope of helping his relationship with his daughter Miyuki, who puts the blame on him for her mother''s disappearance. But in order to fullfil the mission, the Yamato must go through battles against the SUS Empire, who intend to spoil humanity''s hopes of finding a new place to live in and turn Earth into energy for their own selfish needs.', 'In the year 2220 A.D., the Earth Federation launches a plan to evacuate Earth when discovering that a travelling black hole capable of destroying anything in its path is on course towards the solar system. As the people on Earth prepare to relocate to planet Amare, whose ruler offers refuge, the tyrants known as the "S.U.S. Empire" attack the first Earth evacuation fleet. After learning that his wife Capt. Yuki Mori-Kodai disappeared in the battle and that legendary space battleship Yamato has been fully rebuilt, Susumu Kodai accepts command of the ship as he intends to not only help humanity once again, but also find Yuki in the hope of helping his relationship with his daughter Miyuki, who puts the blame on him for her mother''s disappearance. But in order to fullfil the mission, the Yamato must go through battles against the SUS Empire, who intend to spoil humanity''s hopes of finding a new place to live in and turn Earth into energy for their own selfish needs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QytH31dKuRLAgxZBUK7Ke0dSju.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47556'),
  ('649329188451551967', 'Space Brothers', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yoshitaka Mori, Kimiyoshi Adachi', 'Mika Ohmori', 'Shun Oguri, Masaki Okada, Kumiko Aso, Yoshio Inoue, Shinichi Tsutsumi, Toru Masuoka, Aiko Morishita, Mitsuru Fukikoshi', null, 'When Mutta was 12-years-old and Hibito was 9-years-old the two brothers saw what they thought was an UFO flying towards the moon. They made a pact then to become astronauts and one day fly into space together. Fast forward to the year 2025. Older brother Mutta (Shun Oguri) works as for an automotive company and his younger brother Hibito works as an astronaut. Although Mutta failed to follow through on his childhood promise, after losing his job, he receives a phone call from Hibito which reignites his childhood dream of flying into outer space ...', 'When Mutta was 12-years-old and Hibito was 9-years-old the two brothers saw what they thought was an UFO flying towards the moon. They made a pact then to become astronauts and one day fly into space together. Fast forward to the year 2025. Older brother Mutta (Shun Oguri) works as for an automotive company and his younger brother Hibito works as an astronaut. Although Mutta failed to follow through on his childhood promise, after losing his job, he receives a phone call from Hibito which reignites his childhood dream of flying into outer space ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XFGzYlvUudhU6mqJC2vWZoHpCp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127535'),
  ('381397656081640175', 'Space Buddies', 2009, 'Comedy, Adventure, Family, Science Fiction', 'Robert Vince, Kamal Derkaoui', 'Anna McRoberts, Robert Vince', 'Josh Flitter, Skyler Gisondo, Field Cate, Liliana Mumy, Henry Hodges, Diedrich Bader, Jason Earles, Amy Sedaris', 'G', 'B-Dawg, Mudbud, Budderball, and all the rest of the Buddies are back, but this time, they''re setting their sights even higher -- as in, the moon! With the help of their new pals Spudnick (voiced by Jason Earles) and Gravity, these pooches are go for launch. But to pull off their moon landing and make it home safely, our canine heroes will have to summon all their bravery and imagination...', 'B-Dawg, Mudbud, Budderball, and all the rest of the Buddies are back, but this time, they''re setting their sights even higher -- as in, the moon! With the help of their new pals Spudnick (voiced by Jason Earles) and Gravity, these pooches are go for launch. But to pull off their moon landing and make it home safely, our canine heroes will have to summon all their bravery and imagination...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8C0u4EuisSRBa3Htr9kWUStkDnW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14749'),
  ('275662442414190505', 'Space Cadet', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Liz W. Garcia, John Inwood, Marc J. Wheeler', 'Liz W. Garcia', 'Emma Roberts, Tom Hopper, Poppy Liu, Gabrielle Union, Kuhoo Verma, Desi Lydic, Sebastián Yatra, Sam Robards', 'PG-13', 'Tiffany "Rex" Simpson has always dreamed of going to space, and her "doctored" application lands her in NASA''s ultra-competitive astronaut training program. In over her head, can this Florida girl rely on her quick wits, moxie and determination to get through training and into the cosmos before she blows her cover?', 'Tiffany "Rex" Simpson has always dreamed of going to space, and her "doctored" application lands her in NASA''s ultra-competitive astronaut training program. In over her head, can this Florida girl rely on her quick wits, moxie and determination to get through training and into the cosmos before she blows her cover?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QUOIldN6ShKj1LdLhO26a8QXND.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1019411'),
  ('1054920353003575845', 'Space Chimps', 2008, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Kirk DeMicco, Jericca Cleland', 'Kirk DeMicco, Robert Moreland', 'Andy Samberg, Cheryl Hines, Jeff Daniels, Patrick Warburton, Kristin Chenoweth, Kenan Thompson, Zack Shada, Carlos Alazraqui', 'G', 'When an unmanned space shuttle crashes on an uncharted planet, a trio of astronaut chimpanzees are launched by NASA into a wormhole to investigate.', 'When an unmanned space shuttle crashes on an uncharted planet, a trio of astronaut chimpanzees are launched by NASA into a wormhole to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecAKgzlt78OvEVpZURYYdSz8K5v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11802'),
  ('385628653363359271', 'Space Chimps 2: Zartog Strikes Back', 2010, 'Animation, Family', 'John H. Williams', 'Robert Moreland', 'Tom Kenny, Zack Shada, Patrick Warburton, Cheryl Hines, Carlos Alazraqui, Laura Bailey, John DiMaggio, Stanley Tucci', 'PG', 'Comet longs to be taken seriously as a full-fledged space chimp. He journeys to the fantastical Planet Malgor and bonds with the adorable alien Kilowatt, living out his ultimate fantasy. However, it''s time for Comet to prove himself when the feared alien ruler Zartog takes over Mission Control! Comet must show he has the right stuff, and join fellow chimps Ham, Luna and Titan, to save the day.', 'Comet longs to be taken seriously as a full-fledged space chimp. He journeys to the fantastical Planet Malgor and bonds with the adorable alien Kilowatt, living out his ultimate fantasy. However, it''s time for Comet to prove himself when the feared alien ruler Zartog takes over Mission Control! Comet must show he has the right stuff, and join fellow chimps Ham, Luna and Titan, to save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pgqlYFpZkoc9zATZ0n9PXJXHv49.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45662'),
  ('869946229200716695', 'Space Cowboys', 2000, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Clint Eastwood, Jack N. Green, Robert Lorenz', 'Howard Klausner, Ken Kaufman', 'Clint Eastwood, Tommy Lee Jones, Donald Sutherland, James Garner, James Cromwell, Marcia Gay Harden, William Devane, Loren Dean', 'PG-13', 'Frank Corvin, ‘Hawk’ Hawkins, Jerry O''Neill and ‘Tank’ Sullivan were hotdog members of Project Daedalus, the US Air Force''s test program for space travel, but their hopes were dashed in 1958 with the formation of NASA and the use of trained chimps. They blackmail their way into orbit when Russia''s mysterious ‘Ikon’ communications satellite''s orbit begins to degrade and threatens to crash to Earth.', 'Frank Corvin, ‘Hawk’ Hawkins, Jerry O''Neill and ‘Tank’ Sullivan were hotdog members of Project Daedalus, the US Air Force''s test program for space travel, but their hopes were dashed in 1958 with the formation of NASA and the use of trained chimps. They blackmail their way into orbit when Russia''s mysterious ‘Ikon’ communications satellite''s orbit begins to degrade and threatens to crash to Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPzt1bbA1sUDQOl6Vujmyz2hjLN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5551'),
  ('424783725377883572', 'Space Dogs', 2010, 'Family, Animation', 'Inna Evlannikova, Svyatoslav Ushakov', 'Alexandr Talal, John Chua, Vadim Sveshnikov', 'Anna Bolshova, Evgeny Mironov, Sergey Garmash, Aleksandr Bashirov, Elena Yakovleva, Ruslan Kuleshov, Sergey Yushkevich, Nikolay Smorchkov', null, 'Belka, the amazing flying dog is unexpectedly hurdled into the streets of Moscow when the rocket she is in malfunctions during one of her circus routines. Fortunately the crash leads her to meet a streetwise dog named Strelka and her irredeemable rat friend Venya. Together with other amusing friends found along the way, the three find themselves in a space program-training center where they get sent away in a rocket, leaving planet Earth...', 'Belka, the amazing flying dog is unexpectedly hurdled into the streets of Moscow when the rocket she is in malfunctions during one of her circus routines. Fortunately the crash leads her to meet a streetwise dog named Strelka and her irredeemable rat friend Venya. Together with other amusing friends found along the way, the three find themselves in a space program-training center where they get sent away in a rocket, leaving planet Earth...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zufutvJv0KjMmuw8ldWpPLzkomT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36696'),
  ('377545959359022466', 'Space Dogs', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Elsa Kremser, Yunus Roy Imer, Levin Peter', 'Elsa Kremser, Levin Peter', 'Aleksey Serebryakov', null, 'Laika, a stray dog, was the first living being to be sent into space and thus to a certain death. A legend says that she returned to Earth as a ghost and still roams the streets of Moscow alongside her free-drifting descendants. While shooting this film, the directors little by little realised that they knew the street dogs only as part of our human world; they have never looked at humans as a part of the dogs’ world.', 'Laika, a stray dog, was the first living being to be sent into space and thus to a certain death. A legend says that she returned to Earth as a ghost and still roams the streets of Moscow alongside her free-drifting descendants. While shooting this film, the directors little by little realised that they knew the street dogs only as part of our human world; they have never looked at humans as a part of the dogs’ world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fEEyn6IG3HvqtQvH3mL4YrYYCCt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616324'),
  ('165000337334333992', 'Space Is the Place', 1974, 'Science Fiction, Music', 'John Coney', 'Sun Ra, Joshua Smith', 'Sun Ra, Raymond Johnson, Christopher Brooks, Marshall Allen, June Tyson, Walter Burns, Morgan Upton, La Shaa Stallings', null, 'Sun Ra and his Solar Myth Arkestra return to Earth after several years in space. Ra proclaims himself "the alter-destiny", meets with inner-city youths and battles with the devil himself to save the black race.', 'Sun Ra and his Solar Myth Arkestra return to Earth after several years in space. Ra proclaims himself "the alter-destiny", meets with inner-city youths and battles with the devil himself to save the black race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yPhG0iBQpBObowErVrZLPZzTq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16203'),
  ('928248808401050491', 'Space Jam', 1996, 'Family, Animation, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Joe Pytka, Michael Chapman, Austin McCann', 'Herschel Weingrod, Leo Benvenuti, Steve Rudnick', 'Michael Jordan, Wayne Knight, Theresa Randle, Manner Washington, Eric Gordon, Penny Bae Bridges, Brandon Hammond, Larry Bird', 'PG', 'With their freedom on the line, the Looney Tunes seek the help of NBA superstar Michael Jordan to win a basketball game against a team of moronic aliens.', 'With their freedom on the line, the Looney Tunes seek the help of NBA superstar Michael Jordan to win a basketball game against a team of moronic aliens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RN5El3Pj2W4gpwgiAGLVfSJv2g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2300'),
  ('215791191768903226', 'Space Jam: A New Legacy', 2021, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Michael J. Moore, Rhys Summerhayes, Scott F. Johnston', 'Leo Benvenuti, Steve Rudnick, Timothy Harris', 'LeBron James, Don Cheadle, Cedric Joe, Jeff Bergman, Gabriel Iglesias, Zendaya, Eric Bauza, Candi Milo', 'PG', 'When LeBron and his young son Dom are trapped in a digital space by a rogue A.I., LeBron must get them home safe by leading Bugs, Lola Bunny and the whole gang of notoriously undisciplined Looney Tunes to victory over the A.I.''s digitized champions on the court. It''s Tunes versus Goons in the highest-stakes challenge of his life.', 'When LeBron and his young son Dom are trapped in a digital space by a rogue A.I., LeBron must get them home safe by leading Bugs, Lola Bunny and the whole gang of notoriously undisciplined Looney Tunes to victory over the A.I.''s digitized champions on the court. It''s Tunes versus Goons in the highest-stakes challenge of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mDACFTANR34u6lvucazoYiFJOp7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379686'),
  ('401450887523027956', 'Space Marines', 1996, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'John Weidner, Garett Griffin', 'Robert Moreland', 'Billy Wirth, Cady Huffman, John Pyper-Ferguson, Edward Albert, Michael Bailey Smith, T.J. Myers, Meg Foster, Blake Boyd', null, 'Space pirates, led by diabolical Colonel Fraser, take over a cargo ship carrying anti-matter explosive and an important official. Space marines, led by Captain Gray, must stop their evil plans.', 'Space pirates, led by diabolical Colonel Fraser, take over a cargo ship carrying anti-matter explosive and an important official. Space marines, led by Captain Gray, must stop their evil plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zve0cKASODqsMd76eqk47NZeayO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55456'),
  ('1149922853191868155', 'Space Master X-7', 1958, 'Science Fiction', 'Edward Bernds, Brydon Baker', 'George Worthing Yates, Daniel Mainwaring', 'Bill Williams, Lyn Thomas, Robert Ellis, Paul Frees, Rhoda Williams, Joan Barry, Carol Varga, Thomas Browne Henry', 'NR', 'A fungus dubbed "Blood Rust" from outer space threatens to destroy the Earth.', 'A fungus dubbed "Blood Rust" from outer space threatens to destroy the Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7oLHxoLoJrMiWpGnq1dv1gNQfNz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22430'),
  ('109992505038739313', 'Space Milkshake', 2012, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Armen Evrensel', 'Armen Evrensel', 'Billy Boyd, Kristin Kreuk, Amanda Tapping, Robin Dunne, George Takei, Amy Matysio, Barry Lane', null, 'Four low-ranking astronauts are stuck together on an orbital Sanitation Station after they bring a mysterious device aboard their ship and all life on Earth disappears. Little do they know they are about to come under attack by a mutating rubber duck named Gary, who wants to open a portal to his evil dimension and take over the Universe.', 'Four low-ranking astronauts are stuck together on an orbital Sanitation Station after they bring a mysterious device aboard their ship and all life on Earth disappears. Little do they know they are about to come under attack by a mutating rubber duck named Gary, who wants to open a portal to his evil dimension and take over the Universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6gzXQd8GUhqfwdHtE4hyTnPQ5t9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167948'),
  ('40094555413202634', 'Space Mutiny', 1988, 'Romance, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'David A. Prior, Vincent G. Cox, Neal Sundstrom', 'David Winters', 'Reb Brown, John Phillip Law, James Ryan, Cameron Mitchell, Cisse Cameron, Graham Clarke, Billy Second, Rufus Swart', null, 'A pilot is the only hope to stop the mutiny of a spacecraft by its security crew, who plot to sell the crew of the ship into slavery.', 'A pilot is the only hope to stop the mutiny of a spacecraft by its security crew, who plot to sell the crew of the ship into slavery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ziGqFxqpjpPgDYeenw8GtYctinD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32148'),
  ('1101608332053668403', 'Space Oddity', 2023, 'Comedy, Romance, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Kyra Sedgwick, Alar Kivilo', 'Rebecca Banner', 'Kyle Allen, Alexandra Shipp, Kevin Bacon, Carrie Preston, Madeline Brewer, Simon Helberg, Andrew Polk, Arden Myrin', 'PG-13', 'A space-obsessed man gets the opportunity of a lifetime thanks to a Mars colonization program but finds his plans compromised by his feelings for a woman who brings him down to Earth.', 'A space-obsessed man gets the opportunity of a lifetime thanks to a Mars colonization program but finds his plans compromised by his feelings for a woman who brings him down to Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/612ajBEu9bUEF3jic7r0PnjG5vP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:843889'),
  ('79346321753895259', 'Space Patrol', 2003, 'Science Fiction', 'Michael Braun, Theo Mezger', null, 'Dietmar Schönherr, Wolfgang Völz, Claus Holm, Eva Pflug, Benno Sterzenbach, Franz Schafheitlin, Charlotte Kerr, Reinhard Glemnitz', null, 'Orion commander Cliff Allister McLane, galactic war hero and unconventional daredevil in the service of the world government, is transferred with his crew to the space patrol. On top of that, Colonel Villa, head of the Galactic Security Service, provides him with the attractive agent Tamara Jagellovsk as a chaperone. From the very first patrol flight, the two Orion officers get into heated arguments. Tamara drives Cliff to despair with her Alpha Orders. When unknown beings from outer space, known as Frogs, attack Earth and the world government becomes bogged down in wrangling over jurisdiction, the fate of humanity lies in the hands of Cliff and Tamara. A supernova directed by exoterrists on Earth''s course is destroyed at the last minute when Orion is abandoned. However, the next wave of attacks by the Frogs comes with the support of terrestrial revolutionaries.', 'Orion commander Cliff Allister McLane, galactic war hero and unconventional daredevil in the service of the world government, is transferred with his crew to the space patrol. On top of that, Colonel Villa, head of the Galactic Security Service, provides him with the attractive agent Tamara Jagellovsk as a chaperone. From the very first patrol flight, the two Orion officers get into heated arguments. Tamara drives Cliff to despair with her Alpha Orders. When unknown beings from outer space, known as Frogs, attack Earth and the world government becomes bogged down in wrangling over jurisdiction, the fate of humanity lies in the hands of Cliff and Tamara. A supernova directed by exoterrists on Earth''s course is destroyed at the last minute when Orion is abandoned. However, the next wave of attacks by the Frogs comes with the support of terrestrial revolutionaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9g4TGl9zX8om6AicOjUmsqYHQ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65797'),
  ('209720274444247322', 'Space Pirate Captain Harlock', 2013, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Shinji Aramaki', 'Harutoshi Fukui, Kiyoto Takeuchi', 'Shun Oguri, Haruma Miura, Yu Aoi, Arata Furuta, Ayano Fukuda, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Maaya Sakamoto, Kiyoshi Kobayashi', 'PG-13', 'Space Pirate Captain Harlock and his fearless crew face off against the space invaders who seek to conquer the planet Earth.', 'Space Pirate Captain Harlock and his fearless crew face off against the space invaders who seek to conquer the planet Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mlHoTQLYsuzJJArO2fHS5rqnLqe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192577'),
  ('705637706077289897', 'Space Pirate Captain Harlock: Mystery Of The Arcadia', 1978, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Rintaro, Kazuo Komatsubara', 'Shozo Uehara', 'Chiyoko Kawashima, Akira Kamiya, Noriko Ohara, Makio Inoue, Hiroshi Otake, Akiko Tsuboi, Hidekatsu Shibata, Joji Yanami', null, 'The story on Arcadia''s mystery, on which the 13th television episode was based.', 'The story on Arcadia''s mystery, on which the 13th television episode was based.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7SUOXLW6pbVJXq7Pv925LnTHXaG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394253'),
  ('427871080240970859', 'Space Probe Taurus', 1965, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Robert Tobey, Leonard Katzman', 'Leonard Katzman', 'Francine York, James Brown, Baynes Barron, Russ Bender, John Willis, Bob Legionaire, James Macklin, Phyllis Selznick', null, 'In the year 2000, the spaceship Hope One sets off to find new galaxies for colonization. However, an encounter with an alien being and a swarm of meteorites sends the ship streaking off course into a sea of monsters on an uncharted world.', 'In the year 2000, the spaceship Hope One sets off to find new galaxies for colonization. However, an encounter with an alien being and a swarm of meteorites sends the ship streaking off course into a sea of monsters on an uncharted world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdmhi0QBrm401yrmaa3iHiecW60.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261597'),
  ('264082101613973418', 'Space Rage', 1985, 'Science Fiction, Western, Action', 'Conrad E. Palmisano', 'Jim Lenahan', 'Richard Farnsworth, Michael Paré, John Laughlin, Lee Purcell, Lewis van Bergen, William Windom, Frank Doubleday, Dennis Redfield', null, 'In this sci-fi/western film set two hundred years from now, a bank robber, Grange is captured and sentenced to the penal colony on the mining planet Proxima Centauri 3 where he meets bounty-hunter Walker, and the Colonel, a retired policeman from LA who was considered the best of his kind. Grange is a dangerous lunatic and Walker and the Colonel must team up to keep him from escaping.', 'In this sci-fi/western film set two hundred years from now, a bank robber, Grange is captured and sentenced to the penal colony on the mining planet Proxima Centauri 3 where he meets bounty-hunter Walker, and the Colonel, a retired policeman from LA who was considered the best of his kind. Grange is a dangerous lunatic and Walker and the Colonel must team up to keep him from escaping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v5WSAPNPSQu9kcOIAqFyEojPJYT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125981'),
  ('573943654418508779', 'Space Raiders', 1983, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Howard R. Cohen, Alec Hirschfeld', 'Howard R. Cohen', 'Vince Edwards, David Mendenhall, Drew Snyder, Patsy Pease, Thom Christopher, Luca Bercovici, Ray Stewart, George Dickerson', 'PG', 'A futuristic, sensitive tale of adventure and confrontation when a 10 year old boy is accidentally kidnapped by a spaceship filled with a motley crew of space pirates.', 'A futuristic, sensitive tale of adventure and confrontation when a 10 year old boy is accidentally kidnapped by a spaceship filled with a motley crew of space pirates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsGP4IhqHluCuRVSOs04fOniBq2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7269'),
  ('409144071266579305', 'Space Runaway Ideon: Be Invoked', 1982, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Action, War, Drama', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino, Osamu Sekita, Katsuyoshi Yatabe', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino', 'Yoku Shioya, Keiko Toda, Hideyuki Tanaka, Fuyumi Shiraishi, Yo Inoue, Eiko Yamada, Keiko Yokozawa, Rumiko Ukai', null, 'The epic conclusion to the Ideon saga, featuring what was meant to be the final 5 episodes of the TV series. The Solo Ship and its crew continue their intense battle with the Buff Clan leading to a final battle that will determine the fate of all life in the universe. This movie was the second part of a double feature along with "The Ideon: A Contact".', 'The epic conclusion to the Ideon saga, featuring what was meant to be the final 5 episodes of the TV series. The Solo Ship and its crew continue their intense battle with the Buff Clan leading to a final battle that will determine the fate of all life in the universe. This movie was the second part of a double feature along with "The Ideon: A Contact".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZAs1i3ZHKQFFSNIY8Yo5qdjfPd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67851'),
  ('655160775942249085', 'Space Runaway Ideon: Contact', 1982, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino, Ryoji Fujiwara, Toshifumi Takizawa', 'Sukehiro Tomita, Yuji Watanabe, Hiroyasu Yamaura', 'Yoko Asagami, Banjo Ginga, Koichi Hashimoto, Kazuo Hayashi, Kazuhiko Inoue, Takkô Ishimori, Seizo Kato, Shôjirô Kihara', null, 'A movie recap of the Space Runaway Ideon TV Series. Humanity''s pursuit of knowledge leads them to the planet Solo, where they find mysterious remains of a long dead alien civilization, including the 3 part super robot ''Ideon'', and a powerful warship. Using these, the Earthlings sent to investigate the ruins defend themselves in their constant conflicts against powerful aliens called the Buff Clan, who are in pursuit of ''Id'', the mysterious energy that powers the Ideon.', 'A movie recap of the Space Runaway Ideon TV Series. Humanity''s pursuit of knowledge leads them to the planet Solo, where they find mysterious remains of a long dead alien civilization, including the 3 part super robot ''Ideon'', and a powerful warship. Using these, the Earthlings sent to investigate the ruins defend themselves in their constant conflicts against powerful aliens called the Buff Clan, who are in pursuit of ''Id'', the mysterious energy that powers the Ideon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZcPLKfsHQ34SOfKSqaYHzEvCH7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67841'),
  ('908666801556900968', 'Space Squad: Space Sheriff Gavan VS Tokusou Sentai Dekaranger', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Shu G. Momose, Koichi Sakamoto, Koichi Sakamoto', 'Naruhisa Arakawa', 'Yuma Ishigaki, Ryuji Sainei, Tsuyoshi Hayashi, Yosuke Ito, Ayumi Kinoshita, Mika Kikuchi, Tomokazu Yoshida, Kenji Ohba', null, 'Space Squad: Space Sheriff Gavan VS Tokusou Sentai Dekaranger features the return of Yuma Ishigaki from 2012’s Space Sheriff Gavan: The Movie and the 2015 Space Sheriff Next Generation films. The first installment will join the two police-themed heroes as they face a massive space crime organization.', 'Space Squad: Space Sheriff Gavan VS Tokusou Sentai Dekaranger features the return of Yuma Ishigaki from 2012’s Space Sheriff Gavan: The Movie and the 2015 Space Sheriff Next Generation films. The first installment will join the two police-themed heroes as they face a massive space crime organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9sWAIRJwhdy2XzO9dlKFXtanJQq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434025'),
  ('546698695475310019', 'Space Station 3D', 2002, 'Documentary', 'Toni Myers, James Neihouse, James Neihouse', 'Toni Myers', 'Tom Cruise, James H. Newman, Jerry L. Ross, Robert D. Cabana, Koichi Wakata, Brian Duffy, Pamela Ann Melroy, Marc Garneau', 'NR', 'Some 220 miles above Earth lies the International Space Station, a one-of-a-kind outer space laboratory that 16 nations came together to build. Get a behind-the-scenes look at the making of this extraordinary structure in this spectacular IMAX film. Viewers will blast off from Florida''s Kennedy Space Center and the Baikonur Cosmodrome in Russia for this incredible journey -- IMAX''s first-ever space film. Tom Cruise narrates.', 'Some 220 miles above Earth lies the International Space Station, a one-of-a-kind outer space laboratory that 16 nations came together to build. Get a behind-the-scenes look at the making of this extraordinary structure in this spectacular IMAX film. Viewers will blast off from Florida''s Kennedy Space Center and the Baikonur Cosmodrome in Russia for this incredible journey -- IMAX''s first-ever space film. Tom Cruise narrates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WTMYkXYd1p9ObrrZmxBc179mUr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18221'),
  ('688655801202027672', 'Space Station 76', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Jack Plotnick, Robert Brinkmann', 'Jennifer Elise Cox, Jack Plotnick, Kali Rocha', 'Matt Bomer, Jerry O''Connell, Liv Tyler, Marisa Coughlan, Patrick Wilson, Kali Rocha, Kylie Rogers, Keir Dullea', 'R', 'A comedic drama about a group of people (and several robots) living on a space station in a 1970s-version of the future. When a new Assistant Captain arrives, she inadvertently ignites tensions among the crew, prompting them to confront their darkest secrets. Barely contained lust, jealousy, and anger all bubble to the surface, becoming just as dangerous as the asteroid that’s heading right for them.', 'A comedic drama about a group of people (and several robots) living on a space station in a 1970s-version of the future. When a new Assistant Captain arrives, she inadvertently ignites tensions among the crew, prompting them to confront their darkest secrets. Barely contained lust, jealousy, and anger all bubble to the surface, becoming just as dangerous as the asteroid that’s heading right for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cToUKM0dDUaLMW4Lgr3QXHlzqdM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253312'),
  ('368232433603571420', 'Space Sweepers', 2021, 'Drama, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Jo Gyeong-hun, Jo Sung-hee, Byun Bong-sun', 'Yoon Seung-min, Yoo-kang Seo-ae, Jo Sung-hee', 'Song Joong-ki, Kim Tae-ri, Yoo Hai-jin, Jin Sun-kyu, Richard Armitage, Kim Moo-yul, Park Ye-rin, Oh Ji-yul', 'R', 'When the crew of a space junk collector ship called The Victory discovers a humanoid robot named Dorothy that''s known to be a weapon of mass destruction, they get involved in a risky business deal which puts their lives at stake.', 'When the crew of a space junk collector ship called The Victory discovers a humanoid robot named Dorothy that''s known to be a weapon of mass destruction, they get involved in a risky business deal which puts their lives at stake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bmemsraCG1kIthY74NjDnnLRT2Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:581389'),
  ('327243769780747998', 'Space Thing', 1968, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Byron Mabe, David F. Friedman, Bill Davies', 'Cosmo Politan', 'Karla Conway, Steve Vincent, Merci Montello, Dan Martin, Fancher Fague, Cara Peters, Stan Isfloride, Bambi Allen', null, 'A man is in bed reading Sci-Fi mags, and his wife seduces him. He then falls asleep, and the rest is his dream. He is from an alternate world, and disguises himself as an alien, then boards their ship, to keep them from attacking his planet. The captain is a woman, who has two lesbian encounters with her crew, and whips one of them for trying to have sex with our hero. All of the women are anxious to seduce our hero, as the other two men on the ship are not very exciting. Our hero forces a landing on an asetroid (actually the outskirts of Palmdale, California) and everyone runs around topless and has sex. He then blows up the alien ship in the worst special effects explosion.', 'A man is in bed reading Sci-Fi mags, and his wife seduces him. He then falls asleep, and the rest is his dream. He is from an alternate world, and disguises himself as an alien, then boards their ship, to keep them from attacking his planet. The captain is a woman, who has two lesbian encounters with her crew, and whips one of them for trying to have sex with our hero. All of the women are anxious to seduce our hero, as the other two men on the ship are not very exciting. Our hero forces a landing on an asetroid (actually the outskirts of Palmdale, California) and everyone runs around topless and has sex. He then blows up the alien ship in the worst special effects explosion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQx5NRdM7aSHik54JFOtkV9ODV0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30563'),
  ('471493353541902561', 'Space Travelers', 2000, 'Fantasy, Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Katsuyuki Motohiro, Osamu Fujiishi', 'Yoshikazu Okada', 'Takeshi Kaneshiro, Eri Fukatsu, Masanobu Ando, Hiroyuki Ikeuchi, Masatoshi Hamada, Ken Watanabe, Toshio Kakei, Sawa Suzuki', null, 'Three bank robbers, who declare themselves to be Space Travelers, take six persons as hostages when they are surrounded by the police. Among the hostages, there is a terrorist with a hidden bomb. In order to escape, the robbers ask the hostages to pretend to be part of the gang. Surprisingly, the hostages soon enjoy doing so. On that strange day, the bank becomes a tropical paradise...', 'Three bank robbers, who declare themselves to be Space Travelers, take six persons as hostages when they are surrounded by the police. Among the hostages, there is a terrorist with a hidden bomb. In order to escape, the robbers ask the hostages to pretend to be part of the gang. Surprisingly, the hostages soon enjoy doing so. On that strange day, the bank becomes a tropical paradise...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssz2EoDOvaNw2mwC3iknpRT4Gzi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66749'),
  ('615237625073576546', 'Space Truckers', 1996, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Thriller, Adventure', 'Stuart Gordon, Mac Ahlberg, Roger Bowles', 'Ted Mann', 'Dennis Hopper, Stephen Dorff, Debi Mazar, Charles Dance, George Wendt, Shane Rimmer, Sandra Dickinson, Vernon Wells', 'PG-13', 'John Canyon is one of the last independent space transport entrepreneurs. Rough times force him to carry suspicious cargo to Earth without questions being asked. During the flight the cargo turns out to be a multitude of unstoppable killer robots.', 'John Canyon is one of the last independent space transport entrepreneurs. Rough times force him to carry suspicious cargo to Earth without questions being asked. During the flight the cargo turns out to be a multitude of unstoppable killer robots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0NNTJxBzAwC0wvqmBgD9pPiHnG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10690'),
  ('210931851616345709', 'Space Wars: Quest for the Deepstar', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Ben Stobber, Garo Setian, Michael Su', 'Joe Knetter', 'Michael Paré, Olivier Gruner, Sarah French, Tyler Gallant, Rachele Brooke Smith, Anahit Setian, Jed Rowen, Elise Muller', 'NR', 'A father and daughter team of space scavengers race against a band of evil mercenaries to reach a legendary lost freighter called the Deepstar. Along their trek through the universe, they encounter monsters, aliens, robots, and something even worse.', 'A father and daughter team of space scavengers race against a band of evil mercenaries to reach a legendary lost freighter called the Deepstar. Along their trek through the universe, they encounter monsters, aliens, robots, and something even worse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4BLXXsaavI3tgSNDd4upxsxc5O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:986210'),
  ('1036154316606725870', 'Space-Time Traveler - Time Stranger', 1986, 'Adventure, Animation, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Kinichi Ishikawa, Mori Masaki, Takuo Noda', 'Yoshio Takeuchi', 'Keiko Toda, Mitsuo Iwata, Takeshi Aono, Hiromi Murata, Makio Inoue, Tadashi Yokouchi, Ryo Horikawa, Osamu Saka', null, 'In the new Calendar Year of 392, in Neo-Tokyo, a young man, Agino Jiro, steals a time synchronization system and tries to escape to the past. The authorities give chase and damage his ship in the pursuit, forcing him to land in modern day Tokyo, Determined, he breaks into a van and attaches the device, recklessly kidnapping Nobucho, Shinichi, Teko and their teacher, Hokubei. Their initial resistance force lands them in Tokyo on March 9th 1945, during the US bombing campaign. Escaping again to the past the group eventually arrives at the Warring States period. There the future and the past collide as factions from Jiro''s era seek to alter their past at a pivotal moment at Honnoji.', 'In the new Calendar Year of 392, in Neo-Tokyo, a young man, Agino Jiro, steals a time synchronization system and tries to escape to the past. The authorities give chase and damage his ship in the pursuit, forcing him to land in modern day Tokyo, Determined, he breaks into a van and attaches the device, recklessly kidnapping Nobucho, Shinichi, Teko and their teacher, Hokubei. Their initial resistance force lands them in Tokyo on March 9th 1945, during the US bombing campaign. Escaping again to the past the group eventually arrives at the Warring States period. There the future and the past collide as factions from Jiro''s era seek to alter their past at a pivotal moment at Honnoji.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bu94JfZ7wdzi28Wmz0bFhHu1noU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112157'),
  ('657148942702648078', 'Space/Time', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller', 'Michael O''Halloran', 'Adam Harmer, Michael O''Halloran', 'Ashlee Lollback, Hugh Parker, Pacharo Mzembe, Haroon Jafarey-Hall, Shaun King, Craig Gaffney, Rob Horton, Sophia Emberson-Bain', 'NR', 'After a fatal test shuts down their project, a disgraced team of scientists enters the criminal underworld to rebuild a forbidden space-bending engine that could rescue humanity or annihilate it entirely.', 'After a fatal test shuts down their project, a disgraced team of scientists enters the criminal underworld to rebuild a forbidden space-bending engine that could rescue humanity or annihilate it entirely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uje1ecKMnNpZp0at5TxlvVgVXqI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434853'),
  ('141558921424984727', 'Spaceballs', 1987, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Mel Brooks, Nick McLean, Dan Kolsrud', 'Thomas Meehan, Ronny Graham, Mel Brooks', 'Mel Brooks, John Candy, Rick Moranis, Bill Pullman, Daphne Zuniga, Dick Van Patten, George Wyner, Michael Winslow', 'PG', 'When the nefarious Dark Helmet hatches a plan to snatch Princess Vespa and steal her planet''s air, space-bum-for-hire Lone Starr and his clueless sidekick fly to the rescue. Along the way, they meet Yogurt, who puts Lone Starr wise to the power of "The Schwartz." Can he master it in time to save the day?', 'When the nefarious Dark Helmet hatches a plan to snatch Princess Vespa and steal her planet''s air, space-bum-for-hire Lone Starr and his clueless sidekick fly to the rescue. Along the way, they meet Yogurt, who puts Lone Starr wise to the power of "The Schwartz." Can he master it in time to save the day?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNbaxEsnCyWBTfANVPHayujBsxp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:957'),
  ('555642377974342008', 'SpaceCamp', 1986, 'Family, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Harry Winer, William A. Fraker, Robert C. Jessup', 'Clifford Green, Casey T. Mitchell', 'Kate Capshaw, Lea Thompson, Kelly Preston, Larry B. Scott, Joaquin Phoenix, Tate Donovan, Tom Skerritt, Barry Primus', 'PG', 'Andie Bergstrom, an astronaut eagerly awaiting her first trip to space, runs a summer camp for teenagers with her NASA-employed husband, Zach. One night during an engine test, Andie and four teenage campers are accidentally shot into space. Together, the group -- which includes Kathryn, a pilot-in-training, and Tish, a ditz with a perfect memory -- must work together to operate the spacecraft and return home.', 'Andie Bergstrom, an astronaut eagerly awaiting her first trip to space, runs a summer camp for teenagers with her NASA-employed husband, Zach. One night during an engine test, Andie and four teenage campers are accidentally shot into space. Together, the group -- which includes Kathryn, a pilot-in-training, and Tish, a ditz with a perfect memory -- must work together to operate the spacecraft and return home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWw2yJHQxqATtXw4roPDVuoE9Xs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13766'),
  ('111109482827009516', 'Spaced Invaders', 1990, 'Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Patrick Read Johnson, James L. Carter', 'Patrick Read Johnson', 'Douglas Barr, Royal Dano, Ariana Richards, J.J. Anderson, Gregg Berger, Wayne Alexander, Fred Applegate, Patrika Darbo', 'PG', 'A crew of Martians overhears a radio broadcast of Orson Welles'' "War of the Worlds" coming from Earth, and, thinking the Martian fleet is attacking Earth, they land their broken-down ship in a backwater mid-American town. As luck would have it, they land on Halloween and get mistaken for trick-or-treaters. Comedy ensues as the Martians try to get taken seriously.', 'A crew of Martians overhears a radio broadcast of Orson Welles'' "War of the Worlds" coming from Earth, and, thinking the Martian fleet is attacking Earth, they land their broken-down ship in a backwater mid-American town. As luck would have it, they land on Halloween and get mistaken for trick-or-treaters. Comedy ensues as the Martians try to get taken seriously.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vchyoV7mnaUd46meVO81yolXH2D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34086'),
  ('213247070640856635', 'Spaced Out Bunny', 1980, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Phil Monroe', 'Chuck Jones', 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Bugs Bunny is abducted by Marvin the Martian and brought to Mars to be the companion to his pet abominable snowman Hugo, who will "hug him and squeeze him and call him George."', 'Bugs Bunny is abducted by Marvin the Martian and brought to Mars to be the companion to his pet abominable snowman Hugo, who will "hug him and squeeze him and call him George."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t66C3EVuwuMhGZCughXq2HC3RLL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102168'),
  ('303260574632667650', 'Spacehunter: Adventures in the Forbidden Zone', 1983, 'Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Hal Miles, Lamont Johnson, Frank Tidy', 'David Preston, Edith Rey, Daniel Goldberg', 'Peter Strauss, Molly Ringwald, Ernie Hudson, Andrea Marcovicci, Michael Ironside, Beeson Carroll, Hrant Alianak, Deborah Pratt', 'PG', 'On a distant planet inhabited by mutants, two bounty hunters race to rescue three Earth female captives from the clutches of an evil warlord.', 'On a distant planet inhabited by mutants, two bounty hunters race to rescue three Earth female captives from the clutches of an evil warlord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXIis8l0rqCThFHlhvELf31pSXz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26978'),
  ('247896286107479014', 'Spaceman', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Drama', 'Jakob Ihre, Chris Shriver, Katya Blumenberg', 'Colby Day', 'Adam Sandler, Paul Dano, Carey Mulligan, Kunal Nayyar, Isabella Rossellini, Lena Olin, Petr Papánek, Marian Roden', 'R', 'Six months into a solo mission, a lonely astronaut confronts the cracks in his marriage with help from a mysterious creature he discovers on his ship.', 'Six months into a solo mission, a lonely astronaut confronts the cracks in his marriage with help from a mysterious creature he discovers on his ship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f46WvKEsBn98WJbPJcO47ZoKn6B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:636706'),
  ('813593402267828138', 'Spaceship', 1983, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Bruce Kimmel, Vilis Lapenieks', 'Bruce Kimmel', 'Cindy Williams, Bruce Kimmel, Leslie Nielsen, Gerrit Graham, Patrick Macnee, Paul Brinegar, Cherie Steinkellner, Margaret Willock', 'PG', 'A farce satirizing extraterrestrial horror movies such as Alien. Alternate titles include "The Creature Wasn''t Nice" and "Naked Space" (1999 re-release trying to capitalize on Nielsen''s "Naked Gun" success).', 'A farce satirizing extraterrestrial horror movies such as Alien. Alternate titles include "The Creature Wasn''t Nice" and "Naked Space" (1999 re-release trying to capitalize on Nielsen''s "Naked Gun" success).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pihIOXhwXpvYPBeF8vnJqP8ROmX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36220'),
  ('1118789678728085047', 'Spaceship Earth', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Matt Wolf, Sam Wootton', null, 'John Allen, Tony Burgess, Kathelin Gray, Linda Leigh, Mark Nelson, Roy Walford', null, 'In 1991 a group of countercultural visionaries built an enormous replica of earth’s ecosystem called Biosphere 2. When eight “biospherians” lived sealed inside, they faced ecological calamities and cult accusations. Their epic adventure is a cautionary tale but also a testament to the power of small groups reimagining the world.', 'In 1991 a group of countercultural visionaries built an enormous replica of earth’s ecosystem called Biosphere 2. When eight “biospherians” lived sealed inside, they faced ecological calamities and cult accusations. Their epic adventure is a cautionary tale but also a testament to the power of small groups reimagining the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XVFKgCseqUmGCrXTw2I4jgeffi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653575'),
  ('532752143065159547', 'Spaceways', 1953, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Terence Fisher, Ivor Slaney, Reginald H. Wyer', 'Paul Tabori, Richard H. Landau', 'Howard Duff, Eva Bartok, Alan Wheatley, Philip Leaver, Michael Medwin, Andrew Osborn, Cecile Chevreau, Anthony Ireland', null, 'A rocket engineer, responsible for sending a satellite into space, is accused of committing the most extraordinary crime.', 'A rocket engineer, responsible for sending a satellite into space, is accused of committing the most extraordinary crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YURuMLcyYy0UsMosYyvZLHKqBE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76418'),
  ('629828732773354254', 'Spacy', 1981, null, 'Takashi Ito', null, null, null, '"His films are like a roller-coaster. His way of throwing the act of seeing into utter confusion is an attack on the eyes in their corporeal function, and to attack the eyes is to take on tile body itself as your opponent. The film makes you break out in sweat only by shooting a safe, peaceful gymnasium in the dark." (Koharu Kisaragi)', '"His films are like a roller-coaster. His way of throwing the act of seeing into utter confusion is an attack on the eyes in their corporeal function, and to attack the eyes is to take on tile body itself as your opponent. The film makes you break out in sweat only by shooting a safe, peaceful gymnasium in the dark." (Koharu Kisaragi)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXXohAiZO87KSFL7wGnPGfQFe0T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247556'),
  ('90948123082566678', 'Spadikam', 1995, 'Action, Drama', 'Bhadran, J. Williams, S. Kumar', 'Bhadran', 'Mohanlal, Thilakan, KPAC Lalitha, Rajan P Dev, Spadikam George, Urvashi, Chippy, V K Sreeraman', null, 'Chacko master, a school headmaster, is never happy with his son, Thomas, and always degrades him. However, having had enough of him, Thomas runs away from home only to return as a gangster after long.', 'Chacko master, a school headmaster, is never happy with his son, Thomas, and always degrades him. However, having had enough of him, Thomas runs away from home only to return as a gangster after long.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bDOwCzW2cIVtRgeVQKn5ZTzcFf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240179'),
  ('631583636558050150', 'Spaghetti at Midnight', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Sergio Martino, Marina Mattoli, Giulio Albonico', 'Sergio Martino', 'Barbara Bouchet, Lino Banfi, Alida Chelli, Teo Teocoli, Daniele Vargas, Ugo Bologna, Pippo Santonastaso, Umberto Amambrini', null, 'Savino La Gastra discovers his wife Celeste has a liaison with an architect: Andrea. Even if also Savino has a story with Elvira, a judge''s wife, he decides anyway to ask to a mobster to kill his wife. In the mean time Celeste is organizing a surprise party for Savino''s birthday, and that day things start to get complicated. First Savino kills accidentally the mafia killer in charge to kill Celeste; second his lover Elvira arrives to the party with the judge... not to mention the police and the mafia Don...', 'Savino La Gastra discovers his wife Celeste has a liaison with an architect: Andrea. Even if also Savino has a story with Elvira, a judge''s wife, he decides anyway to ask to a mobster to kill his wife. In the mean time Celeste is organizing a surprise party for Savino''s birthday, and that day things start to get complicated. First Savino kills accidentally the mafia killer in charge to kill Celeste; second his lover Elvira arrives to the party with the judge... not to mention the police and the mafia Don...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zR7TLDGpoFX5V02iWaT48R9Th3c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48283'),
  ('1039178358224472788', 'Spaghetti House', 1982, 'Drama', 'Giulio Paradisi, Giuliano Giustini, Ignazio Agosta', 'Giulio Paradisi, Nino Manfredi', 'Nino Manfredi, Rita Tushingham, Rudolph Walker, Leo Gullotta, Néstor Garay, Gino Pernice, Derek Martin, Renato Scarpa', null, 'Three black militants kidnap the waiters in an Italian restaurant in London. Soon the victims befriend their kidnappers.', 'Three black militants kidnap the waiters in an Italian restaurant in London. Soon the victims befriend their kidnappers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbJBCHmlmIZ1kjTzp1yoyBs1eyX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278739'),
  ('396305898173288842', 'Spain', 1905, 'Documentary', 'Alice Guy-Blaché, Anatole Thiberville', null, 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, 'This is a compilation of some of the films that Alice Guy filmed in Spain from mid-October to the end of November, 1905 (catalogue numbers 1371 to 1384) that were individually released in early 1906.', 'This is a compilation of some of the films that Alice Guy filmed in Spain from mid-October to the end of November, 1905 (catalogue numbers 1371 to 1384) that were individually released in early 1906.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDNrovOSntKwvQ0WOmRE8ROPPca.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119997'),
  ('306169245622926786', 'Spain: The First Globalization', 2021, 'Documentary, History', 'José Luis López-Linares, José Luis López-Linares, Cristina Moñivar', 'José Luis López-Linares', 'Antonio Valero, Rubén García Benito, Alicia Relinque, Abigail R. Horro, Luo Huiling, Carlos Martínez Shaw, Marcelo Gullo, Luis Ribot', null, 'A new reading of the historical period that began with the reign of the Catholic Monarchs (1479-1516) and the discovery of America (1492), as well as an analysis of its undeniable influence on the subsequent evolution of the history of Spain and the world.', 'A new reading of the historical period that began with the reign of the Catholic Monarchs (1479-1516) and the discovery of America (1492), as well as an analysis of its undeniable influence on the subsequent evolution of the history of Spain and the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKGE5EhmoJdSLVbtfRJ57lu8Xd0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:885654'),
  ('754629332251533972', 'Spanglish', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy', 'James L. Brooks, John Seale, Phil Pastuhov', 'James L. Brooks', 'Adam Sandler, Téa Leoni, Paz Vega, Cloris Leachman, Shelbie Bruce, Sarah Steele, Ian Hyland, Victoria Luna', 'PG-13', 'Mexican immigrant and single mother Flor Moreno finds housekeeping work with Deborah and John Clasky, a well-off couple with two children of their own. When Flor admits she can''t handle the schedule because of her daughter, Cristina, Deborah decides they should move into the Clasky home. Cultures clash and tensions run high as Flor and the Claskys struggle to share space while raising their children on their own, and very different, terms.', 'Mexican immigrant and single mother Flor Moreno finds housekeeping work with Deborah and John Clasky, a well-off couple with two children of their own. When Flor admits she can''t handle the schedule because of her daughter, Cristina, Deborah decides they should move into the Clasky home. Cultures clash and tensions run high as Flor and the Claskys struggle to share space while raising their children on their own, and very different, terms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3OTaBvjqzhRL53Q39fOoIYqxyO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2539'),
  ('690105918719310143', 'Spanish Affair', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Emilio Martínez Lázaro, Gonzalo F. Berridi, Paloma Molina', 'Borja Cobeaga, Diego San José', 'Clara Lago, Dani Rovira, Carmen Machi, Karra Elejalde, Alberto López, Alfonso Sánchez, Aitor Mazo, Abel Mora', null, 'Rafael, a Seville citizen who has never left the Spanish region of Andalucia, decides to leave his homeland to follow Amaia, a Basque girl unlike other women he has known.', 'Rafael, a Seville citizen who has never left the Spanish region of Andalucia, decides to leave his homeland to follow Amaia, a Basque girl unlike other women he has known.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUbn2Dy9qWWV8VnktvuGn9YiCRL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236737'),
  ('211974886544766291', 'Spanish Affair 2', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Emilio Martínez Lázaro, Paloma Molina, Juan Molina', 'Diego San José, Borja Cobeaga', 'Dani Rovira, Clara Lago, Berto Romero, Karra Elejalde, Carmen Machi, Rosa María Sardà, Alfonso Sánchez, Alberto López', 'PG-13', 'Amaia after breaking up with Rafa, falls in love with a Catalonian. Koldo, her father, goes to Sevilla to persuade Rafa to go to Catalonia and take Amaia''s heart back.', 'Amaia after breaking up with Rafa, falls in love with a Catalonian. Koldo, her father, goes to Sevilla to persuade Rafa to go to Catalonia and take Amaia''s heart back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qij5OgMFg2A9eRasFAHZSTWMCl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348537'),
  ('651730624178381127', 'Spanish Clair de Lune', 1909, 'Romance, Drama, Fantasy, Animation, Comedy', 'Émile Cohl, Étienne Arnaud', null, null, null, 'Two lovers perform a fandango dance. A jealous quarrel follows and the heart-broken swain decides to end it all. He throws himself from the window of his room, but instead of falling to his death, the anchor of a passing balloon intercepts his flight and he is taken high into the clouds. Laughing at his plight, the moon arouses the anger of the desperate lover and a battle between the two ensues.', 'Two lovers perform a fandango dance. A jealous quarrel follows and the heart-broken swain decides to end it all. He throws himself from the window of his room, but instead of falling to his death, the anchor of a passing balloon intercepts his flight and he is taken high into the clouds. Laughing at his plight, the moon arouses the anger of the desperate lover and a battle between the two ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jzj2gkxQNJvxYnQQuITvlzUKkeq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194063'),
  ('965884023826502955', 'Spanish Fly', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Bob Kellett, Chris Carreras, Jack Atcheler', 'Robert Ryerson', 'Leslie Phillips, Terry-Thomas, Graham Armitage, Nadiuska, Frank Thornton, Ramiro Oliveros, Sue Lloyd, Andrea Allan', 'R', 'British sex comedy. Sir Percy de Courcy accidentally turns some poor tasting wine into an aphrodisiac when his old school chum, Mike Scott arrives with a photographer and several gorgeous models.', 'British sex comedy. Sir Percy de Courcy accidentally turns some poor tasting wine into an aphrodisiac when his old school chum, Mike Scott arrives with a photographer and several gorgeous models.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7XYYehWnL3IpfOgPc4wme2mcAs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76512'),
  ('952891895569283831', 'Spanish Fury', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Francesc Betriu, Margarita Carmona, Ángel G. Gauna', 'José Luis García Sánchez, Francesc Betriu', 'Cassen, Mónica Randall, Carlos Ibarzábal, Ovidi Montllor, Rosa Gil, María Francia, Rosa Morata, Dolores Continente', null, 'Season 1973-1974. After fourteen years of drought, the FC Barcelona of Johan Cruyff is making a spectacular campaign. Sebastián, a great fan of soccer, decides then to join a Barça''s supporters club. There he will meet the daughter of his friend Amadeo, an attractive young woman who will not stop until Sebastián agrees to marry her. The couple will celebrate their wedding on the same day that Barça and Madrid compete for the League.', 'Season 1973-1974. After fourteen years of drought, the FC Barcelona of Johan Cruyff is making a spectacular campaign. Sebastián, a great fan of soccer, decides then to join a Barça''s supporters club. There he will meet the daughter of his friend Amadeo, an attractive young woman who will not stop until Sebastián agrees to marry her. The couple will celebrate their wedding on the same day that Barça and Madrid compete for the League.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1Mo8l7NhiTsjlAJjxnAFWWyYPc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445813'),
  ('39374825449839781', 'Spanish Movie', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Javier Ruiz Caldera, Óscar Faura', 'Paco Cabezas', 'Alexandra Jiménez, Silvia Abril, Carlos Areces, Laia Alda, Óscar Lara, Joaquín Reyes, Michelle Jenner, Joselito', null, 'Large doses of humor, ingenious nods to Spain''s most recent national cinema, an artistic cast highly linked to comedy and a high reserve of surprises constitute the ingredients of this crazy comedy: Spanish Movie.', 'Large doses of humor, ingenious nods to Spain''s most recent national cinema, an artistic cast highly linked to comedy and a high reserve of surprises constitute the ingredients of this crazy comedy: Spanish Movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uUW7KgUKBi83kU0tlBJLYwdY4ZR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35640'),
  ('56839618857185373', 'Spanish Western', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Alberto Esteban, Juan Carlos Gómez', 'Alberto Esteban', 'Ricardo Palacios, Francisco Arias, Placido Martínez, Paco Barrilado, Pepe Fonda, Emilia Pinos, Eugenio Martín, Pilar Velázquez', null, 'A vindication of the role of the technicians and artists who made spaghetti western genre possible, and a walk through the landscapes that made it possible to recreate in Spain, mainly in the desert of Almería, hundreds of adventures set in the remote American Far West.', 'A vindication of the role of the technicians and artists who made spaghetti western genre possible, and a walk through the landscapes that made it possible to recreate in Spain, mainly in the desert of Almería, hundreds of adventures set in the remote American Far West.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pmryi5NJAvWeFIfoPY6vos2YDew.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338797'),
  ('21761475880813008', 'Spanking the Monkey', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Mayers, David O. Russell', 'David O. Russell', 'Jeremy Davies, Alberta Watson, Benjamin Hendrickson, Carla Gallo, Matthew Puckett, Judette Jones, Zak Orth, Josh Philip Weinstein', null, 'Bright young student Raymond Aibelli is forced to sidetrack an important medical internship because his mother, Susan, is recovering from a broken leg. When he isn''t tasked with the most mundane aspects of Susan''s recuperation, Raymond finds distraction in a neighborhood girl, Toni Peck. But, as Susan begins relying on her son for both physical and emotional needs, Raymond starts developing disturbing and unwanted new yearnings.', 'Bright young student Raymond Aibelli is forced to sidetrack an important medical internship because his mother, Susan, is recovering from a broken leg. When he isn''t tasked with the most mundane aspects of Susan''s recuperation, Raymond finds distraction in a neighborhood girl, Toni Peck. But, as Susan begins relying on her son for both physical and emotional needs, Raymond starts developing disturbing and unwanted new yearnings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fuID31Ft8nWLcFRSQ7qZRlu49o7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17600'),
  ('472221045821709098', 'Spare Keys', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jeanne Aslan, Paul Saintillan, Alan Guichaoua', 'Agnès Feuvre', 'Céleste Brunnquell, Quentin Dolmaire, Chloé Mons, Megan Northam, François Négret, Anthony Sonigo, Ilan Schermann, Romane Bertrand', null, 'Nancy, East of France. Summertime. Seeking to escape her troublesome family environment, Sophie, 15, jumps at the chance to get the spare keys to her wealthy friend Jade''s house. While enjoying the spacious home she thought deserted for summer, she bumps into her friend''s older brother Stéphane, who, as fate would have it, was also planning on staying. But instead of chasing her out, Stéphane will choose to leave the door open as an invitation to a summer Sophie never expected.', 'Nancy, East of France. Summertime. Seeking to escape her troublesome family environment, Sophie, 15, jumps at the chance to get the spare keys to her wealthy friend Jade''s house. While enjoying the spacious home she thought deserted for summer, she bumps into her friend''s older brother Stéphane, who, as fate would have it, was also planning on staying. But instead of chasing her out, Stéphane will choose to leave the door open as an invitation to a summer Sophie never expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejjfhocSGjjieb2e3cvBhSO4HLO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1007685'),
  ('461530719641327104', 'Spare Parts', 1979, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Wolfgang Grasshoff, Rainer Erler, Helga Asenbaum', 'Rainer Erler', 'Jutta Speidel, Wolf Roth, Herbert Herrmann, Charlotte Kerr, Christoph Lindert, Bob Cunningham, Tedi Altice, Ben Zeller', null, 'Honeymooning couple Monica and Mike check into a motel in New Mexico. All seems normal until an ambulance pulls up and abducts Mike. Monica narrowly escapes and, with the help of truck driver Bill, discovers the awful secret of the motel and the ambulance service.', 'Honeymooning couple Monica and Mike check into a motel in New Mexico. All seems normal until an ambulance pulls up and abducts Mike. Monica narrowly escapes and, with the help of truck driver Bill, discovers the awful secret of the motel and the ambulance service.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2K5rmgTsNbXxAtaZHWsoQzK6AG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11819'),
  ('1011333291945709285', 'Spare Parts', 2015, 'Drama', 'Sean McNamara, Richard Wong', 'Elissa Matsueda', 'George López, Jamie Lee Curtis, Carlos PenaVega, Marisa Tomei, Alessandra Rosaldo, Alexa PenaVega, David Del Rio, Esai Morales', 'PG-13', 'With the help of their high school''s newest teacher, four Hispanic students form a robotics club. Although they have no experience, the youths set their sights on a national robotics contest. With $800 and parts scavenged from old cars, they build a robot and compete against reigning champion MIT. Along the way, the students learn not only how to build a robot but something far more important: how to forge bonds that will last a lifetime.', 'With the help of their high school''s newest teacher, four Hispanic students form a robotics club. Although they have no experience, the youths set their sights on a national robotics contest. With $800 and parts scavenged from old cars, they build a robot and compete against reigning champion MIT. Along the way, the students learn not only how to build a robot but something far more important: how to forge bonds that will last a lifetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2bMAt51027Pm3sjvfDuRXs9IHW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264337'),
  ('896167338352392178', 'Spare Parts', 2020, 'Horror, Action', 'Pasha Patriki, Andrew Thomas Hunt', 'David Murdoch, Svet Rouskov', 'Julian Richings, Michelle Argyris, Emily Alatalo, Kiriana Stanton, Ryan Allen, Kathryn Kohut, Erin Noble, Kayla Dumont', null, 'In a godforsaken bar in the middle of nowhere, an all-girl band – Ms. 45 – rips the stage apart with their punk spirit. But their performance impresses an enthusiastic fan who lures the girls into a trap, sedates them, and starts…customizing them. Slowly they begin to gain consciousness and, in total shock, realize their arms have all been replaced with axes and chainsaws to fight gladiator-style in a junkyard arena owned by a sadistic "emperor," forcing them into the battle of their lives with one prize in mind – their freedom.', 'In a godforsaken bar in the middle of nowhere, an all-girl band – Ms. 45 – rips the stage apart with their punk spirit. But their performance impresses an enthusiastic fan who lures the girls into a trap, sedates them, and starts…customizing them. Slowly they begin to gain consciousness and, in total shock, realize their arms have all been replaced with axes and chainsaws to fight gladiator-style in a junkyard arena owned by a sadistic "emperor," forcing them into the battle of their lives with one prize in mind – their freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0MFoalgfvG3ZI4JGwBvd6xuOV2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:716819'),
  ('426948596623669580', 'Spare the Rod', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, Bill Thompson, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Donald''s nephews are always playing instead of doing their chores. Donald is going to punish them, but the "voice of child psychology" convinces him to play along instead. This works well when they chop the wood to burn him at the stake. Meanwhile, however, a trio of Pygmy cannibals that escaped from the circus are out to do the very same thing to Donald with a cauldron of water.', 'Donald''s nephews are always playing instead of doing their chores. Donald is going to punish them, but the "voice of child psychology" convinces him to play along instead. This works well when they chop the wood to burn him at the stake. Meanwhile, however, a trio of Pygmy cannibals that escaped from the circus are out to do the very same thing to Donald with a cauldron of water.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSXnBbG9n6CVa3s7JL5glbeOFtN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67173'),
  ('1148042033520038487', 'Spare Time', 1939, 'Documentary', 'Humphrey Jennings, H.E. Fowle, D.V. Knight', null, 'Laurie Lee', null, 'Spare Time is a 1939 British film directed by Humphrey Jennings for the GPO Film Unit, and made for the 1939 New York World''s Fair. It is 15 minutes long and documents the leisure activities of workers in the coal, steel, and cotton industries in Sheffield, Bolton, Manchester and Pontypridd. Commentary is provided by Laurie Lee.', 'Spare Time is a 1939 British film directed by Humphrey Jennings for the GPO Film Unit, and made for the 1939 New York World''s Fair. It is 15 minutes long and documents the leisure activities of workers in the coal, steel, and cotton industries in Sheffield, Bolton, Manchester and Pontypridd. Commentary is provided by Laurie Lee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDKVEwktlle9f4Kd89lHSa9HnA3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208108'),
  ('575455195104729526', 'Spark: A Space Tail', 2016, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Aaron Woodley', 'Aaron Woodley', 'Jessica Biel, Hilary Swank, Susan Sarandon, Jace Norman, Patrick Stewart, Athena Karkanis, A.C. Peterson, Ivan Sherry', 'PG', 'Spark, a teenage monkey and his friends, Chunk and Vix, are on a mission to regain Planet Bana - a kingdom overtaken by the evil overlord Zhong.', 'Spark, a teenage monkey and his friends, Chunk and Vix, are on a mission to regain Planet Bana - a kingdom overtaken by the evil overlord Zhong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zj2KfykL4qvYCrbMv46Yd5vnYM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322487'),
  ('1133118936482537601', 'Sparkle', 1976, 'Drama, Music', 'Bruce Surtees, Sam O''Steen', 'Joel Schumacher', 'Philip Michael Thomas, Irene Cara, Lonette McKee, Dwan Smith, Mary Alice, Dorian Harewood, Tony King, Beatrice Winde', 'PG', 'Three sisters start out singing in their church choir in Harlem in the late 1950s and become a successful girl group in the 1960s.', 'Three sisters start out singing in their church choir in Harlem in the late 1950s and become a successful girl group in the 1960s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwXTLhIqjwRE073HJr94G3V3w4D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21554'),
  ('996565076671164423', 'Sparkle', 2012, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'Salim Akil, Anastas N. Michos', 'Mara Brock Akil', 'Jordin Sparks, Whitney Houston, Derek Luke, Mike Epps, Carmen Ejogo, Tika Sumpter, Omari Hardwick, Cee Lo Green', 'PG-13', 'Musical prodigy, Sparkle struggles to become a star while overcoming issues that are tearing her family apart. From an affluent Detroit area and daughter to a single mother, she tries to balance a new romance with music manager Stix while dealing with the unexpected challenges her new life will bring as she and her two sisters strive to become a dynamic singing group during the Motown-era.', 'Musical prodigy, Sparkle struggles to become a star while overcoming issues that are tearing her family apart. From an affluent Detroit area and daughter to a single mother, she tries to balance a new romance with music manager Stix while dealing with the unexpected challenges her new life will bring as she and her two sisters strive to become a dynamic singing group during the Motown-era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6LqVIhz0xxoFjiGjftDW69DbvNi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88036'),
  ('878429761820115299', 'Sparkling Cyanide', 1983, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Robert Michael Lewis, Ted Voigtlander', 'Sue Grafton', 'Anthony Andrews, Deborah Raffin, Pamela Bellwood, Nancy Marchand, Josef Sommer, David Huffman, Christine Belford, June Chadwick', 'NR', 'The beautiful but unfaithful wife of a successful lawyer meets her untimely end at their anniversary dinner. After a suicide note is found soon after her death, it seems more likely that she was murdered, as all the dinner guests had good reason to want her dead.', 'The beautiful but unfaithful wife of a successful lawyer meets her untimely end at their anniversary dinner. After a suicide note is found soon after her death, it seems more likely that she was murdered, as all the dinner guests had good reason to want her dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDpp8Id71HBaQ26dpJP5I4RBHx6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21129'),
  ('377054681033255173', 'Sparks', 2013, 'Action, Thriller', 'Christopher Folino, Josh Fritts, Todd Burrows', 'Christopher Folino', 'Chase Williamson, Ashley Bell, Clancy Brown, Jake Busey, William Katt, Marina Squerciati, Clint Howard, Scott Rinker', 'PG-13', 'A masked vigilante who discovers the dark side to heroism. Going after the nation''s most notorious super criminal leaves Sparks'' life and reputation in ruins.', 'A masked vigilante who discovers the dark side to heroism. Going after the nation''s most notorious super criminal leaves Sparks'' life and reputation in ruins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/59X0So2x1HGEGXr91kqe4YaMhW0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171776'),
  ('425664428968763907', 'Sparky''s Magic Piano', 1987, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Music', 'Lee Mishkin', 'Alan W. Livingston', 'Mel Blanc, Coral Browne, Tony Curtis, Cloris Leachman, Nancy Olson, Vincent Price', null, 'A boy becomes a virtuoso pianist, but when he gets too big-headed the piano decides to teach him a lesson.', 'A boy becomes a virtuoso pianist, but when he gets too big-headed the piano decides to teach him a lesson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1nLpkWsdTQBGAzXAHEDhb97H5u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370624'),
  ('124106566364239806', 'Sparring', 2017, 'Drama, Action', 'Samuel Jouy', 'Clément Roussier, Samuel Jouy, Jérémie Guez', 'Mathieu Kassovitz, Souleymane M''Baye, Billie Blain, Lyes Salem, Tomy Leconte, Ali Labidi, David Saracino, Olivia Merilahti', null, 'Steve Landry, an aging boxer with more losses than wins, accepts to become a sparring partner for an emerging champion in a last-ditch attempt to stay relevant.', 'Steve Landry, an aging boxer with more losses than wins, accepts to become a sparring partner for an emerging champion in a last-ditch attempt to stay relevant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpIifZTO4emo88pXcsgY6MYLDR4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467548'),
  ('125626668983355533', 'Sparrow', 1994, 'Drama', 'Franco Zeffirelli, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Franco Zeffirelli', 'Angela Bettis, Johnathon Schaech, Eva Alexander, Vanessa Redgrave, Sinéad Cusack, Valentina Cortese, John Castle, Frank Finlay', null, 'Catania, Sicilia 1854. A serious epidemic of cholera is hitting the region. Maria a 16 years old novice leaves her convent and returns her home to avoid contamination. Here she finds a difficult situation, in fact her stepmother and her half-sisters prevent Maria to live the normal life of a teenager. In their minds Maria is the promised "bride of God" and a regular life for her is inappropriate. Nino, her handsome neighbor, falls in love for Maria who isn''t indifferent to him. But when Maria comes back to her convent the way to become nun is compelled. Now Maria can understand Sister Agata, and realizes she became mad cause a lost and impossible love like the one between Maria and Nino.', 'Catania, Sicilia 1854. A serious epidemic of cholera is hitting the region. Maria a 16 years old novice leaves her convent and returns her home to avoid contamination. Here she finds a difficult situation, in fact her stepmother and her half-sisters prevent Maria to live the normal life of a teenager. In their minds Maria is the promised "bride of God" and a regular life for her is inappropriate. Nino, her handsome neighbor, falls in love for Maria who isn''t indifferent to him. But when Maria comes back to her convent the way to become nun is compelled. Now Maria can understand Sister Agata, and realizes she became mad cause a lost and impossible love like the one between Maria and Nino.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzSvttQV1lYA23BQh6UBMI7QGsg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63063'),
  ('1058030720135584001', 'Sparrow', 2008, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Cheng Siu-Keung, Johnnie To', 'Andrew Fung Chih-Chiang, John Chan Kin-Chung', 'Simon Yam, Kelly Lin Hsi-Lei, Gordon Lam Ka-Tung, Lo Hoi-Pang, Law Wing-Cheong, Kenneth Cheung Moon-Yuen, Lam Suet, Henry Lo', null, 'Kei is the experienced leader of a team of pickpockets — also known as "Sparrows" in HK slang. He enjoys a carefree lifestyle taking photos. One day a dashing beauty, Chun-Lei, suddenly appears in Kei''s viewfinder. Kei is mesmerized. But behind Chun-Lei''s attractive facade lies a mysterious past and a mission to set herself free.', 'Kei is the experienced leader of a team of pickpockets — also known as "Sparrows" in HK slang. He enjoys a carefree lifestyle taking photos. One day a dashing beauty, Chun-Lei, suddenly appears in Kei''s viewfinder. Kei is mesmerized. But behind Chun-Lei''s attractive facade lies a mysterious past and a mission to set herself free.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPA5QWpMtUXQHgKW9AdjhhgLlAX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7346'),
  ('333460177404311577', 'Sparrows', 1926, 'Drama', 'William Beaudine, Tom McNamara, Karl Struss', null, 'Mary Pickford, Roy Stewart, Mary Louise Miller, Gustav von Seyffertitz, Charlotte Mineau, Spec O''Donnell, Lloyd Whitlock, Billy Butts', 'NR', 'Molly, the eldest child of a group of orphans being used as slaves on a farm hidden deep in a swamp, must rescue the others when their cruel master decides that one of them will be disposed of.', 'Molly, the eldest child of a group of orphans being used as slaves on a farm hidden deep in a swamp, must rescue the others when their cruel master decides that one of them will be disposed of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZPfhlwZ9HIYViUCgoZusCszohT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73575'),
  ('752097621251783304', 'Sparrows Can''t Sing', 1963, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Joan Littlewood, Mutz Greenbaum, Desmond Dickinson', 'Stephen Lewis', 'James Booth, Barbara Windsor, Roy Kinnear, Avis Bunnage, Brian Murphy, George Sewell, Barbara Ferris, Griffith Davies', null, 'Charlie returns to the East End after two years at sea to find his house demolished and wife Maggie gone. Everyone else knows she is now shacked up with married bus driver Bert and a toddler, and they all watch with more than a little interest at the trail of mayhem Charlie leaves as he goes about sorting things out.', 'Charlie returns to the East End after two years at sea to find his house demolished and wife Maggie gone. Everyone else knows she is now shacked up with married bus driver Bert and a toddler, and they all watch with more than a little interest at the trail of mayhem Charlie leaves as he goes about sorting things out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijRayJtnOXxdBLnOY3jfSXs47Vf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88012'),
  ('735348255623246785', 'Sparta', 2022, 'Drama', 'Ulrich Seidl, Wolfgang Thaler, Serafin Spitzer', 'Ulrich Seidl, Veronika Franz', 'Georg Friedrich, Florentina Elena Pop, Hans-Michael Rehberg, Marius Ignat, Octavian-Nicolae Cocis, Ecaterina Gramaticu, Gianni Gramaticu, Geta Mariana Cira', null, 'Ewald moved to Romania years ago. Now in his 40s, he seeks a fresh start. Leaving his girlfriend, he moves to the hinterland. With young boys from the area, he transforms a decaying school into a fortress. The children enjoy a new, carefree existence. But the distrust of the villagers is soon awoken. And Ewald is forced to confront a truth he has long suppressed.', 'Ewald moved to Romania years ago. Now in his 40s, he seeks a fresh start. Leaving his girlfriend, he moves to the hinterland. With young boys from the area, he transforms a decaying school into a fortress. The children enjoy a new, carefree existence. But the distrust of the villagers is soon awoken. And Ewald is forced to confront a truth he has long suppressed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0PExppKz36CFlssNFhMvn8Pub9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:937633'),
  ('505737136322658421', 'Spartacus', 1960, 'History, War, Drama, Adventure', 'Stanley Kubrick, Russell Metty, Marshall Green', 'Calder Willingham', 'Kirk Douglas, Laurence Olivier, Jean Simmons, Charles Laughton, Peter Ustinov, John Gavin, Tony Curtis, Nina Foch', 'PG-13', 'The rebellious Thracian Spartacus, born and raised a slave, is sold to Gladiator trainer Batiatus. After weeks of being trained to kill for the arena, Spartacus turns on his owners and leads the other slaves in rebellion. As the rebels move from town to town, their numbers swell as escaped slaves join their ranks. Under the leadership of Spartacus, they make their way to southern Italy, where they will cross the sea and return to their homes.', 'The rebellious Thracian Spartacus, born and raised a slave, is sold to Gladiator trainer Batiatus. After weeks of being trained to kill for the arena, Spartacus turns on his owners and leads the other slaves in rebellion. As the rebels move from town to town, their numbers swell as escaped slaves join their ranks. Under the leadership of Spartacus, they make their way to southern Italy, where they will cross the sea and return to their homes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0Fgg1GyZgzokaiw2HFQv3oPaL2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:967'),
  ('976896897718887325', 'Spartacus', 2004, 'Action, Drama', 'Robert Dornhelm', null, 'Goran Višnjić, Alan Bates, Angus Macfadyen, Rhona Mitra, Ian McNeice, James Frain, Henry Simmons, Ben Cross', null, 'Sentenced to spend out the rest of his adult life laboring in the harsh deserts of Egypt, the Thracian slave Spartacus gets a new lease on life when he is purchased by the obese owner of a Roman gladiator school. Moved by the defiance of an Ethiopian warrior, Draba, Spartacus leads a slave uprising which threatens Rome''s status quo. As Spartacus gains sympathy within the Roman Senate, he also makes a powerful enemy in form of Marcus Lucinius Crassus, who makes it a matter of personal honor to crush the rebellion.', 'Sentenced to spend out the rest of his adult life laboring in the harsh deserts of Egypt, the Thracian slave Spartacus gets a new lease on life when he is purchased by the obese owner of a Roman gladiator school. Moved by the defiance of an Ethiopian warrior, Draba, Spartacus leads a slave uprising which threatens Rome''s status quo. As Spartacus gains sympathy within the Roman Senate, he also makes a powerful enemy in form of Marcus Lucinius Crassus, who makes it a matter of personal honor to crush the rebellion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4qDIb9K9qLxCVT8cKGt5YrF54Xb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32528'),
  ('1031880262250506133', 'Spartan', 2004, 'Mystery, Action, Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'David Mamet, Juan Ruiz Anchía, Ray Yamagata', 'David Mamet', 'Val Kilmer, Derek Luke, William H. Macy, Tia Texada, Ed O''Neill, Kristen Bell, Johnny Messner, Clark Gregg', 'R', 'U.S. government agent Scott is assigned to rescue the daughter of a high-ranking government official. As willing as he is to bend the rules to get things done, though, Scott is shocked to find that others are willing to go even further to protect a political career.', 'U.S. government agent Scott is assigned to rescue the daughter of a high-ranking government official. As willing as he is to bend the rules to get things done, though, Scott is shocked to find that others are willing to go even further to protect a political career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcdhS2g1d38NOoeh0PPAN2bLE7w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11169'),
  ('97981042526249775', 'Spasmo', 1974, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Umberto Lenzi, Guglielmo Mancori', 'Umberto Lenzi, Luisa Montagnana, Massimo Franciosa', 'Robert Hoffmann, Suzy Kendall, Ivan Rassimov, Adolfo Lastretti, Franco Silva, Mario Erpichini, Maria Pia Conte, Rosita Torosh', null, 'While walking along the beach, Christian and his girlfriend discover a mysterious woman washed ashore. The following day, Christian meets the woman again at a yacht party and soon finds himself entangled in a web of lust, intrigue and murder.', 'While walking along the beach, Christian and his girlfriend discover a mysterious woman washed ashore. The following day, Christian meets the woman again at a yacht party and soon finds himself entangled in a web of lust, intrigue and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ci9BT6Bgqop21fL0mYLlHbgar8U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94069'),
  ('638532132376219121', 'Spasms', 1983, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'William Fruet, Mark Irwin', 'William Fruet, Don Enright', 'Peter Fonda, Oliver Reed, Kerrie Keane, Al Waxman, Miguel Fernandes, Marilyn Lightstone, Angus MacInnes, Laurie Brown', 'R', 'A gigantic serpent is captured on a remote island and shipped to an American college for experimentation.', 'A gigantic serpent is captured on a remote island and shipped to an American college for experimentation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o11a36QWsdfOHkgO346EoalIzWQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98106'),
  ('599748083646956622', 'Spasti bessmertnogo', 2026, 'Action, Drama, History, Science Fiction, War', 'Pavel Ignatov, Ilya Melikhov', 'Alexandr Shevtsov', 'Igor Denisov, Sergey Kholmogorov, Alesya Pukhovaya', null, '20-year-old extreme sports blogger lives as if he''s immortal. But he finds himself trapped in mysterious time loop with no escape. Only soldier who died 80 years ago can save him, but only after young man from future helps soldier.', '20-year-old extreme sports blogger lives as if he''s immortal. But he finds himself trapped in mysterious time loop with no escape. Only soldier who died 80 years ago can save him, but only after young man from future helps soldier.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FvS8qvuA3mUXFtW0zRe4HgfaJcwH.jpg', 'plex:movie:spasti-bessmertnogo'),
  ('1038256416980729651', 'Spawn', 1997, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Guillermo Navarro, Mark A.Z. Dippé, Joseph P. Lucky', 'Alan B. McElroy', 'Michael Jai White, Martin Sheen, John Leguizamo, Theresa Randle, Nicol Williamson, D. B. Sweeney, Melinda Clarke, Miko Hughes', 'PG-13', 'After being murdered by corrupt colleagues in a covert government agency, Al Simmons makes a pact with the devil to be resurrected to see his beloved wife Wanda. In exchange for his return to Earth, Simmons agrees to lead Hell''s Army in the destruction of mankind.', 'After being murdered by corrupt colleagues in a covert government agency, Al Simmons makes a pact with the devil to be resurrected to see his beloved wife Wanda. In exchange for his return to Earth, Simmons agrees to lead Hell''s Army in the destruction of mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3svvunKXkhRvEKByGDua1Qu0otq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10336'),
  ('605126196120521995', 'Spawn of the North', 1938, 'Action, Romance, Adventure', 'Henry Hathaway, Charles Lang', 'Talbot Jennings, Jules Furthman', 'George Raft, Henry Fonda, John Barrymore, Dorothy Lamour, Akim Tamiroff, Louise Platt, Lynne Overman, Fuzzy Knight', null, 'Two Alaskan salmon fisherman find their friendship at risk when one aligns with Russian fish pirates and the other aligns with local vigilantes.', 'Two Alaskan salmon fisherman find their friendship at risk when one aligns with Russian fish pirates and the other aligns with local vigilantes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCoitaqpPEIIgJyDtXli5UnK3Bm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78092'),
  ('457055429753655689', 'Spawn of the Slithis', 1978, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Stephen Traxler, Robert Caramico', 'Stephen Traxler', 'Alan Blanchard, Judy Motulsky, J.C. Claire, Dennis Falt, Mello Alexandria, Win Condict, Rocky Fumarelli, John Hatfield', 'PG', 'A nuclear leak creates a mutant Slithis sea monster, which terrorizes the variety of pets, winos, and hippies who hang around Venice, California.', 'A nuclear leak creates a mutant Slithis sea monster, which terrorizes the variety of pets, winos, and hippies who hang around Venice, California.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kk2yyfgTA9qtBhtu7016jdeOzJP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83172'),
  ('232149396921980365', 'Speak', 2004, 'Drama', 'Jessica Sharzer, Daniel J. Shaw, Kathie Tull', 'Jessica Sharzer, Annie Young Frisbie', 'Kristen Stewart, Elizabeth Perkins, Steve Zahn, Michael Angarano, D. B. Sweeney, Hallee Hirsh, Robert John Burke, Allison Siko', 'PG-13', 'Freshman high-school student Melinda has refused to speak ever since she called the cops on a popular summer party. With her old friends snubbing her for being a rat, and her parents too busy to notice her troubles, she folds into herself, trying to hide her secret: that star senior Andy raped her at the party. But Melinda does manage to find solace in her art class headed by Mr. Freeman.', 'Freshman high-school student Melinda has refused to speak ever since she called the cops on a popular summer party. With her old friends snubbing her for being a rat, and her parents too busy to notice her troubles, she folds into herself, trying to hide her secret: that star senior Andy raped her at the party. But Melinda does manage to find solace in her art class headed by Mr. Freeman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oRjQJG2PziTl2bUvzUCFS16ncfj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15058'),
  ('14334651211214714', 'Speak Easily', 1932, 'Comedy', 'Edward Sedgwick, Harold Wenstrom', null, 'Buster Keaton, Jimmy Durante, Ruth Selwyn, Thelma Todd, Hedda Hopper, William Pawley, Sidney Toler, Lawrence Grant', null, 'A professor gets mixed up with chorus girls in a Broadway musical.', 'A professor gets mixed up with chorus girls in a Broadway musical.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWVjJr90gKkt50omskSlT3t0Emy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43131'),
  ('778501803756616577', 'Speak No Evil', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Christian Tafdrup, Erik Molberg Hansen, Paul Zomerhuis', 'Mads Tafdrup, Christian Tafdrup', 'Morten Burian, Sidsel Siem Koch, Fedja van Huêt, Karina Smulders, Liva Forsberg, Marius Damslev, Hichem Yacoubi, Lea Baastrup Rønne', 'NR', 'A Danish family visits a Dutch family they met on a holiday. What was supposed to be an idyllic weekend slowly starts unraveling as the Danes try to stay polite in the face of unpleasantness.', 'A Danish family visits a Dutch family they met on a holiday. What was supposed to be an idyllic weekend slowly starts unraveling as the Danes try to stay polite in the face of unpleasantness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukYuuFzPTumN1QNpQyz863bcNvr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:833339'),
  ('211481594474329245', 'Speak No Evil', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'James Watkins, Tim Maurice-Jones, Alexander Holt', 'James Watkins, Christian Tafdrup, Mads Tafdrup', 'James McAvoy, Mackenzie Davis, Scoot McNairy, Aisling Franciosi, Alix West Lefler, Dan Hough, Kris Hitchen, Motaz Malhees', 'R', 'When an American family is invited to spend the weekend at the idyllic country estate of a charming British family they befriended on vacation, what begins as a dream holiday soon warps into a snarled psychological nightmare.', 'When an American family is invited to spend the weekend at the idyllic country estate of a charming British family they befriended on vacation, what begins as a dream holiday soon warps into a snarled psychological nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dA4N6uWOnEMgbxXwFX7qX7adzs8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1114513'),
  ('241083287285192866', 'Speak Out', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jean-François Hensgens, Inès de la Bévière, Thomas Metairie', 'Jennifer Devoldère', 'José Garcia, Joachim Arseguel, Aure Atika, Claire Dumas, Cédric Vieira, Nicolas Roussiau, Annaïg Briand, Tom Meusnier', null, 'Colin, 14, enters a new school and he''s freaking out: how do you get by when, like him, you''re a stutterer? His meeting with Mr. Devarseau, a charismatic French teacher, will push him to face his fears and break out of his isolation. Now Colin has a group of friends and a project: to go on stage to play Cyrano in front of the whole school.', 'Colin, 14, enters a new school and he''s freaking out: how do you get by when, like him, you''re a stutterer? His meeting with Mr. Devarseau, a charismatic French teacher, will push him to face his fears and break out of his isolation. Now Colin has a group of friends and a project: to go on stage to play Cyrano in front of the whole school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/luAE07BbCpLCRww4Fqmd48CN2Al.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1154312'),
  ('353927490414630791', 'Speak Up', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Stéphane de Freitas, Ladj Ly', 'Stéphane de Freitas', 'Souleila Mahiddin, Eddy Moniot, Yacine Ait Khelifa, Leïla Alaouf, Ouanissa Bachraoui, Franck Bikpo, Thomas Dedessus Le Moutier, Houda Chnabri', null, 'Raise the voice, speak eloquently, construct and argue a discourse. Tools so necessary in life as exciting to build. In Paris, the date of Eloquentia, an oratory contest where young people —not exactly privileged— will measure their strength, is approaching.', 'Raise the voice, speak eloquently, construct and argue a discourse. Tools so necessary in life as exciting to build. In Paris, the date of Eloquentia, an oratory contest where young people —not exactly privileged— will measure their strength, is approaching.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6xznqPTxSgtRuED0YML7mr9bsh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452406'),
  ('133044270659131192', 'Speaking of Buñuel', 2000, 'Documentary', 'José Luis López-Linares, Javier Rioyo, José Luis López-Linares', 'Agustín Sánchez Vidal', 'Luis Buñuel, José Sancho, Silvia Pinal, Ángela Molina, Francisco Rabal, Carlos Saura, Michel Piccoli, Jean-Claude Carrière', null, 'Surrealist master Luis Buñuel is a towering figure in the world of cinema history, directing such groundbreaking works as Un Chien Andalou, Exterminating Angels, and That Obscure Object of Desire, yet his personal life was clouded in myth and paradox. Though sexually diffident, he frequently worked in the erotic drama genre; though personally quite conservative, his films are florid, flamboyant, and utterly bizarre.', 'Surrealist master Luis Buñuel is a towering figure in the world of cinema history, directing such groundbreaking works as Un Chien Andalou, Exterminating Angels, and That Obscure Object of Desire, yet his personal life was clouded in myth and paradox. Though sexually diffident, he frequently worked in the erotic drama genre; though personally quite conservative, his films are florid, flamboyant, and utterly bizarre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ufBuPr1SXOyNanbNiKkTm32kf2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73455'),
  ('981862364439244655', 'Speaking of Murder', 1957, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Gilles Grangier, Jacques Rouffio, Jacques Deray', 'Michel Audiard, Gilles Grangier', 'Jean Gabin, Annie Girardot, Lino Ventura, Paul Frankeur, Marcel Bozzuffi, Albert Dinan, Antonin Berval, Thomy Bourdelle', 'NR', 'Louis Bertain is the owner of a Paris garage which is the front for a robbery gang. He and his accomplices are careful to keep up a civic veneer by day, indulging in criminal activities only when "the red light is on" at night. This status quo is upset when one of the gang members becomes convinced that Louis'' younger brother is a police informer.', 'Louis Bertain is the owner of a Paris garage which is the front for a robbery gang. He and his accomplices are careful to keep up a civic veneer by day, indulging in criminal activities only when "the red light is on" at night. This status quo is upset when one of the gang members becomes convinced that Louis'' younger brother is a police informer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsIusD3HqxvGkTz8NXTgsod4vKk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58926'),
  ('499835843413551457', 'Speaking of Sex', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance', 'John McNaughton, Ralf D. Bode', 'Gary Tieche', 'James Spader, Lara Flynn Boyle, Bill Murray, Melora Walters, Megan Mullally, Nathaniel Arcand, Nick Offerman, Jay Mohr', null, 'A counselor, an expert on depression, and two attorneys try to help a couple who have marital problems.', 'A counselor, an expert on depression, and two attorneys try to help a couple who have marital problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oV6fwiOJKhf8vs5MnCSPeMc2U5i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16435'),
  ('505313496513448974', 'Speaking of the Devil', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Enzo Barboni, Alfio Contini, Enzo G. Castellari', 'Marco Barboni', 'Bud Spencer, Carol Alt, Thierry Lhermitte, Sharon Madden, Sean Arnold, Riccardo Pizzuti, Diamy Spencer, Ian Bannen', null, 'Bull Webster is a taxi driver with some work problems on his hands: the Spider Corporation, a giant financial holding company, has decided to buy out his taxi co-operative in order to make it go bankrupt and purchase its land at a low cost.', 'Bull Webster is a taxi driver with some work problems on his hands: the Spider Corporation, a giant financial holding company, has decided to buy out his taxi co-operative in order to make it go bankrupt and purchase its land at a low cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fM0MHqHn11rJhcNrIhkUF0GyR9o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11719'),
  ('112042784863537315', 'Speaking of the Weather', 1937, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Frank Tashlin', null, 'Mel Blanc, Billy Bletcher', 'NR', 'It''s midnight at the bookstore and all the book and magazine characters are coming to life. When a bulldog from an adventure book uses a Boswell Sisters-like performance by girls in a travel magazine as a distraction to rob a bank, he is chased, caught, and sentenced to, of course "Life" (the magazine). But there''s also a conveniently placed "Escape" magazine....', 'It''s midnight at the bookstore and all the book and magazine characters are coming to life. When a bulldog from an adventure book uses a Boswell Sisters-like performance by girls in a travel magazine as a distraction to rob a bank, he is chased, caught, and sentenced to, of course "Life" (the magazine). But there''s also a conveniently placed "Escape" magazine....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/us6RoUW1dzErncJvnK573cKLnhf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100353'),
