  ('187086934855922359', 'SPEC: Close Reincarnation', 2013, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Yukihiko Tsutsumi, Shigetomo Madarame, Kazuyuki Kawasato', null, 'Erika Toda, Ryo Kase, Raita Ryu, Kazuki Kitamura, Chiaki Kuriyama, Kasumi Arimura, Ryuji Sainei, Kazuyuki Matsuzawa', null, 'Mysteries are revealed like the words "Simple Plan," "Third Secret of Fatima" and also the mysterious white man which are all mentioned in the movie "SPEC: Heaven".', 'Mysteries are revealed like the words "Simple Plan," "Third Secret of Fatima" and also the mysterious white man which are all mentioned in the movie "SPEC: Heaven".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ivlkmY2Cw9mtJeHwYKWaCEI6rr2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286744'),
