  ('283282324829916633', 'SPEC: Heaven', 2012, 'Crime, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Yukihiko Tsutsumi, Tatsuya Shirashi, Shigetomo Madarame', 'Yumie Nishiogi', 'Erika Toda, Ryo Kase, Ryunosuke Kamiki, Chiaki Kuriyama, Saki Fukuda, Atsushi Ito, Takahiro Miura, Kippei Shiina', null, 'Saya Toma is a female detective with an IQ of 201. Takeru Sebumi is a career detective with a distinguished background. They work on cases by postulating the "SPEC" of the unknown criminals and then deduce the criminal''s unknown "SPEC" to make arrests. A mystery occurs when bodies are found on a cruiser in the ocean. Saya Toma and Ryo Kase of the Tokyo Metropolitan Police Department are brought in to solve the case.', 'Saya Toma is a female detective with an IQ of 201. Takeru Sebumi is a career detective with a distinguished background. They work on cases by postulating the "SPEC" of the unknown criminals and then deduce the criminal''s unknown "SPEC" to make arrests. A mystery occurs when bodies are found on a cruiser in the ocean. Saya Toma and Ryo Kase of the Tokyo Metropolitan Police Department are brought in to solve the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eTVEQcDuqlKQVzKEcIq7yLBemMb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137936'),
  ('848100156014796376', 'SPEC: Life', 2012, 'TV Movie, Crime, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Yukihiko Tsutsumi', 'Yumie Nishiogi', 'Erika Toda, Ryo Kase, Raita Ryu, Ryunosuke Kamiki, Saki Fukuda, Kazuki Kitamura, Kasumi Arimura, Tetsushi Tanaka', 'PG-13', 'Set one year after the fight between detectives Saya Toma, Takeru Sebumi, and Satoshi Chii. More confrontations ensues between the detectives at the Unidentified Crimes Unit of the Tokyo Metropolitan Police Department. Takeru Sebumi returns after taking a break due to his eye problems. Kenzo Ichiyanagi is appointed section chief, while Kotaro Nonomura is demoted. New member Shu Kikkawa joins the team.', 'Set one year after the fight between detectives Saya Toma, Takeru Sebumi, and Satoshi Chii. More confrontations ensues between the detectives at the Unidentified Crimes Unit of the Tokyo Metropolitan Police Department. Takeru Sebumi returns after taking a break due to his eye problems. Kenzo Ichiyanagi is appointed section chief, while Kotaro Nonomura is demoted. New member Shu Kikkawa joins the team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Z0lsab5JLyUu2k1tsUljM4Fbzv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345699'),
  ('511423770423789092', 'SPEC: Zero', 2013, 'TV Movie, Drama, Comedy, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Yukihiko Tsutsumi, Yuta Morokaji, Tatsuya Shirashi', 'Yumie Nishiogi', 'Erika Toda, Ryo Kase, Saki Fukuda, Yuu Tokui, Tetsushi Tanaka, Yu Shirota, Kohki Okada, Kazuyuki Matsuzawa', 'R', 'High school student Saya Toma lost her parents and younger brother in an airplane accident. Detective Akio Kondo came and told her "your family has a high possibility that they were killed by people who have spec." That was the first time she heard of "spec". 6 years later, Saya Toma, who has never forgotten what the Detective said, decides to become a detective. She returns to Japan after receiving training by the FBI in the United States. Saya Toma is assigned to work unsolved cases in the Public Security Bureau. Meanwhile, because of Satoshi Chii''s scheme, Juichi Ninomae considers Saya Toma his parents'' enemy and tries to push her to the edge. Satoshi Chii''s scheme has also caused Saya Toma and Juichi Ninomae to forget that they are brother and sister. The siblings are headed to a life-staking fight. A girl named Maho Ueno becomes involved in their fight. To protect Maho Ueno, Saya Toma uses "spec".', 'High school student Saya Toma lost her parents and younger brother in an airplane accident. Detective Akio Kondo came and told her "your family has a high possibility that they were killed by people who have spec." That was the first time she heard of "spec". 6 years later, Saya Toma, who has never forgotten what the Detective said, decides to become a detective. She returns to Japan after receiving training by the FBI in the United States. Saya Toma is assigned to work unsolved cases in the Public Security Bureau. Meanwhile, because of Satoshi Chii''s scheme, Juichi Ninomae considers Saya Toma his parents'' enemy and tries to push her to the edge. Satoshi Chii''s scheme has also caused Saya Toma and Juichi Ninomae to forget that they are brother and sister. The siblings are headed to a life-staking fight. A girl named Maho Ueno becomes involved in their fight. To protect Maho Ueno, Saya Toma uses "spec".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHSBVaU2K0tPLYtTMg07nGTHGOW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237439'),
  ('385755023648070575', 'Special', 2006, 'Drama, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Hal Haberman, Jeremy Passmore', 'Hal Haberman, Jeremy Passmore', 'Michael Rapaport, Paul Blackthorne, Josh Peck, Robert Baker, Jack Kehler, Alexandra Holden, Ian Bohen, Christopher Darga', 'R', 'A lonely metermaid has a psychotic reaction to his medication and becomes convinced he''s a superhero. A very select group of people in life are truly gifted. Special is a movie about everyone else.', 'A lonely metermaid has a psychotic reaction to his medication and becomes convinced he''s a superhero. A very select group of people in life are truly gifted. Special is a movie about everyone else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5oGxZ9Itu8buWnB15p6sri3zh9n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13856'),
  ('126425561994933406', 'Special 26', 2013, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Neeraj Pandey, Dharmendra Suresh Desai, Sachin Varma', 'Neeraj Pandey', 'Akshay Kumar, Anupam Kher, Manoj Bajpayee, Jimmy Shergill, Divya Dutta, Kajal Aggarwal, Rajesh Sharma, Kishore Kadam', 'NR', 'During the 1980s in India, a group of con artists rob businessmen and politicians by conducting fake raids, posing as officers of the CBI or Income Tax Department . They plan to execute their biggest con as a final job while a relentless cop is on their trail.', 'During the 1980s in India, a group of con artists rob businessmen and politicians by conducting fake raids, posing as officers of the CBI or Income Tax Department . They plan to execute their biggest con as a final job while a relentless cop is on their trail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOo6lOiZXO0zldPKsih9asKPWDo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165904'),
  ('560132004099655343', 'Special Actors', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Takeshi Sone, Shinichiro Ueda', 'Shinichiro Ueda', 'Kazuto Osawa, Hiroki Kono, Takuya Fuji, Ayu Kitaura, Yosuke Ueda, Yaeko Kiyose, Ayumi Nigo, Tatsuya Mitsuki', null, 'Kazuto has a lifelong dream of becoming an actor, but has been suffering from a special medical condition where he faints and collapses when he gets nervous. One day, he encounters his brother, Hiroki, who who he hasn’t seen for years. He invites Kazuto to a talent agency called ''Special Actors''.', 'Kazuto has a lifelong dream of becoming an actor, but has been suffering from a special medical condition where he faints and collapses when he gets nervous. One day, he encounters his brother, Hiroki, who who he hasn’t seen for years. He invites Kazuto to a talent agency called ''Special Actors''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRwEBYXiZkfKHhvMF5rb1JyCAwb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:648564'),
  ('632674560448478141', 'Special Agent', 1935, 'Drama, Crime', 'Sidney Hickox, William Keighley, Chuck Hansen', 'Laird Doyle, Abem Finkel', 'Bette Davis, George Brent, Ricardo Cortez, Jack La Rue, Henry O''Neill, Robert Strange, Joseph Crehan, J. Carrol Naish', 'NR', 'A reporter turned tax agent infiltrates a crime ring to catch a racketeer, working with the mobster''s bookkeeper. When she agrees to testify, an informant exposes them and she''s kidnapped.', 'A reporter turned tax agent infiltrates a crime ring to catch a racketeer, working with the mobster''s bookkeeper. When she agrees to testify, an informant exposes them and she''s kidnapped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uD6FlB0M6D8Y6yThbfRtOv2gUv5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52864'),
  ('401479313761641705', 'Special Agents', 2026, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Pedro Antônio, Pedro Faerstein', 'Fil Braz, Renato Fagundes, João Paulo Horta', 'Marcus Majella, Pedroca Monteiro, Dira Paes, Malu Valle, Chico Diaz', null, 'Two gay police officers infiltrate a prison to dismantle a dangerous gang.', 'Two gay police officers infiltrate a prison to dismantle a dangerous gang.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FlOnODWkmfV3PQDsBYrAdoL2SBT0.jpg', 'plex:movie:agentes-muito-especiais'),
  ('606371272355154260', 'Special Bulletin', 1983, 'TV Movie, Drama, Thriller', 'Edward Zwick, Carl Gibson', null, 'Ed Flanders, Kathryn Walker, Roxanne Hart, Christopher Allport, David Clennon, David Rasche, Rosalind Cash, Ebbe Roe Smith', null, 'An evening of TV programming is interrupted by breaking news: in Charleston, South Carolina, two Coast Guard personnel and two members of a local news team have been taken hostage by a group of terrorists who are seeking to destroy the triggers of all local nuclear devices. Moreover, the terrorists threaten to detonate their own device if their demands are not met.', 'An evening of TV programming is interrupted by breaking news: in Charleston, South Carolina, two Coast Guard personnel and two members of a local news team have been taken hostage by a group of terrorists who are seeking to destroy the triggers of all local nuclear devices. Moreover, the terrorists threaten to detonate their own device if their demands are not met.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRhDjn2xZNOILNYDQokIGtR63vc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69266'),
  ('1076844637431921140', 'Special Correspondents', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Frédéric Auburtin, Pierre Aïm', 'Jacques Labib, Simon Michaël', 'Gérard Lanvin, Gérard Jugnot, Omar Sy, Anne Marivin, Valérie Kaprisky, Serge Hazanavicius, Clément Koch, Bertrand Lacy', null, 'R2I, a famous news radio station, sends its best reporting duo to Iraq: Frank, journalist, and Poussin, sound engineer. Very quickly, millions of listeners follow their highly documented stories, reflecting the hot intensity of the fighting and the difficult survival of the population.', 'R2I, a famous news radio station, sends its best reporting duo to Iraq: Frank, journalist, and Poussin, sound engineer. Very quickly, millions of listeners follow their highly documented stories, reflecting the hot intensity of the fighting and the difficult survival of the population.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/idoQFaSz4yASIU8cVABqBZ0ubs7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20626'),
  ('636715969710740101', 'Special Correspondents', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Terry Stacey, Ricky Gervais', 'Ricky Gervais', 'Ricky Gervais, Eric Bana, Vera Farmiga, Kelly Macdonald, Benjamin Bratt, Raúl Castillo, America Ferrera, Meghan Heffern', 'PG-13', 'A radio journalist and his technician get in over their heads when they hatch a scheme to fake their own kidnapping during a rebel uprising in South America and hide out in New York instead.', 'A radio journalist and his technician get in over their heads when they hatch a scheme to fake their own kidnapping during a rebel uprising in South America and hide out in New York instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQPkqwW4qh5fKbSI8V12wc8ZMlJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:355008'),
  ('1119110157839817838', 'Special Delivery', 1976, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Paul Wendkos, Harry Stradling Jr., Gary Daigler', 'John Melson, James Edward Grant', 'Bo Svenson, Cybill Shepherd, Michael C. Gwynne, Jeff Goldblum, Robert Ito, Sorrell Booke, Gerrit Graham, Mel Scott', 'PG', 'A gang of thieves plan a daring bank robbery, making their escape across the rooftops of Los Angeles. The police are quickly called in, however, and only one of the robbers, Murdock, makes a clean getaway. Unfortunately, in order to do so, he is forced to dump the stolen cash into a mailbox, which he then finds is locked until midnight, forcing him to wait until the mailman makes his late night pickup. As he waits, he discovers that his hiding place has been observed by several other people, all of whom want a share of the loot.', 'A gang of thieves plan a daring bank robbery, making their escape across the rooftops of Los Angeles. The police are quickly called in, however, and only one of the robbers, Murdock, makes a clean getaway. Unfortunately, in order to do so, he is forced to dump the stolen cash into a mailbox, which he then finds is locked until midnight, forcing him to wait until the mailman makes his late night pickup. As he waits, he discovers that his hiding place has been observed by several other people, all of whom want a share of the loot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oD4RpgcFWOwTYWJIxsuapTUgPce.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122708'),
  ('1090015742930237043', 'Special Delivery', 1978, 'Animation, Comedy, Crime', 'John Weldon, Eunice Macaulay', null, 'Sandy Sanderson', null, 'A hapless husband neglects to clear the icy walk, which leads to the mailman slipping and breaking his neck. A comedy of errors results from his attempts to hide the body.', 'A hapless husband neglects to clear the icy walk, which leads to the mailman slipping and breaking his neck. A comedy of errors results from his attempts to hide the body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyvCTswc9Xueqeji15ijziEvYLz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48346'),
  ('902020150649162272', 'Special Delivery', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Jeanne Labrune, Christophe Pollock', 'Jeanne Labrune, Richard Debuisne', 'Sandrine Kiberlain, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Dominique Blanc, Mathieu Amalric, Jean-Claude Brialy, Maurice Bénichou, Dominique Besnehard, Gisèle Casadesus', null, 'An unexpected phone call from a certain Kirsch sets off a crisis between Catherine and Raphaël that will affect all those around them, be they close friends or casual acquaintances.', 'An unexpected phone call from a certain Kirsch sets off a crisis between Catherine and Raphaël that will affect all those around them, be they close friends or casual acquaintances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hveOWwCXauIxdGT79y5fDl1B2Nf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78278'),
  ('443158480188061905', 'Special Delivery', 2022, 'Action, Crime', 'Hong Jae-sik, Kim Jae-keun, Park Dae-min', 'Park Dong-hee, Kim Bong-seo, Park Dae-min', 'Park So-dam, Kim Eui-sung, Song Sae-byuk, Yeom Hye-ran, Jung Hyeon-jun, Yeon Woo-jin, Heo Dong-won, Han Hyun-min', null, 'A black-market cabbie drives criminals at breakneck speeds until she is left in charge of a fugitive''s son.', 'A black-market cabbie drives criminals at breakneck speeds until she is left in charge of a fugitive''s son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFUBAfMDlFOck29BEwS1awH5TB3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:606403'),
  ('1062094156148615854', 'Special Education', 1977, 'Drama', 'Goran Marković', 'Goran Marković, Miroslav Simić', 'Slavko Štimac, Bekim Fehmiu, Ljubiša Samardžić, Aleksandar Berček, Milivoje ''Mića'' Tomić, Cvijeta Mesić, Branislav Lečić, Ratko Tankosić', null, 'Educator and those educated in a home for juvenile delinquents in the same test: approach, take a peek into his soul to become a man. The story of a minor, neglected boys-offenders and their teachers who try to reject the old methods of rehabilitation.', 'Educator and those educated in a home for juvenile delinquents in the same test: approach, take a peek into his soul to become a man. The story of a minor, neglected boys-offenders and their teachers who try to reject the old methods of rehabilitation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUHmN9DJaMyfYdyxKXmo3GxxWil.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265686'),
  ('814915485964727415', 'Special Effects', 1984, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Larry Cohen, Jenny Fitzgibbons, Paul Glickman', 'Larry Cohen', 'Zoë Lund, Eric Bogosian, Brad Rijn, Kevin O''Connor, Bill Oland, H. Richard Greene, Steven Pudenz, Heidi Bassett', 'R', 'Reality and illusion collide as megalomaniacal filmmaker Chris Neville murders a young would-be actress, then sets about making a feature about the deed, casting the deceased''s clueless husband as the patsy, and finding a dead ringer to play the late actress.', 'Reality and illusion collide as megalomaniacal filmmaker Chris Neville murders a young would-be actress, then sets about making a feature about the deed, casting the deceased''s clueless husband as the patsy, and finding a dead ringer to play the late actress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRBQ1Qy18EbfVUeQXY6zckzHVup.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97975'),
  ('726446048798838248', 'Special Escort', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Maggie Peren', 'Maggie Peren', 'Florian Lukas, Gustav Peter Wöhler, Sebastian Bezzel, Kostja Ullmann, Herbert Knaup, Lisa Maria Potthoff, Nina Kronjäger, Adriana Altaras', null, 'The subject of male prostitution gets a distinctly zany and offbeat twist in Stellungswechsel (AKA Special Escort), Maggie Peren''s tale of five male underdogs who promulgate themselves as female escorts in the city of Munich. Of that group, we meet policeman Gy, in hot water with his insurance company and enduring the vicissitudes of an on-again, off-again romance with comely Daphne; twentysomething Lasse, who lives with his mom and is pathetically henpecked by her; Giselher, a chronically unemployed former manager; Frank, a philologist who spends his days as a house husband; and Olli, a deli proprietor whose business is rapidly going under. These five conjure up the wild idea of charging for liaisons with emotionally needy women, but the scheme doesn''t exactly go as planned - as none can even begin to anticipate the eccentricities or oddities of the female clients who turn up in response to their offer.', 'The subject of male prostitution gets a distinctly zany and offbeat twist in Stellungswechsel (AKA Special Escort), Maggie Peren''s tale of five male underdogs who promulgate themselves as female escorts in the city of Munich. Of that group, we meet policeman Gy, in hot water with his insurance company and enduring the vicissitudes of an on-again, off-again romance with comely Daphne; twentysomething Lasse, who lives with his mom and is pathetically henpecked by her; Giselher, a chronically unemployed former manager; Frank, a philologist who spends his days as a house husband; and Olli, a deli proprietor whose business is rapidly going under. These five conjure up the wild idea of charging for liaisons with emotionally needy women, but the scheme doesn''t exactly go as planned - as none can even begin to anticipate the eccentricities or oddities of the female clients who turn up in response to their offer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXOWwhhkQIXJKg6tqpF0i0p2PZx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13921'),
  ('615018271602859957', 'Special Features: Handsome', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Castellano, Pipolo, Danilo Desideri', 'Castellano', 'Adriano Celentano, Federica Moro, Gianni Bonagura, Giacomo Rosselli, Silvio Spaccesi, Michela Albanese, Nicola De Buono, Simona Mariani', null, 'Forty-something Mattia has every woman in town lusting after him. But every time a woman wants to get hitched, he drags out his ''daughter'' (actually the girl next door) to pass judgment on this woman.', 'Forty-something Mattia has every woman in town lusting after him. But every time a woman wants to get hitched, he drags out his ''daughter'' (actually the girl next door) to pass judgment on this woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgU5W3mqPT4JbhhkdMQLK4NyUA4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68275'),
  ('373017230078631601', 'Special Flight', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Fernand Melgar, Denis Jutzeler', 'Fernand Melgar', null, null, 'Switzerland still carries out special flights, where passengers, dressed in diapers and helmets, are chained to their seats for 40 hours at worst. They are accompanied by police officers and immigration officials. The passengers are flown to their native countries, where they haven''t set foot in in up to twenty years, and where their lives might be in danger. Children, wives and work are left behind in Switzerland. Near Geneva, in Frambois prison, live 25 illegal immigrants waiting for deportation. They are offered an opportunity to say goodbye to their families and return to their native countries on a regular flight, escorted by plain-clothes police officers. If they refuse this offer, the special flight is arranged fast and unexpectedly. The stories behind the locked cells are truly heartbreaking.', 'Switzerland still carries out special flights, where passengers, dressed in diapers and helmets, are chained to their seats for 40 hours at worst. They are accompanied by police officers and immigration officials. The passengers are flown to their native countries, where they haven''t set foot in in up to twenty years, and where their lives might be in danger. Children, wives and work are left behind in Switzerland. Near Geneva, in Frambois prison, live 25 illegal immigrants waiting for deportation. They are offered an opportunity to say goodbye to their families and return to their native countries on a regular flight, escorted by plain-clothes police officers. If they refuse this offer, the special flight is arranged fast and unexpectedly. The stories behind the locked cells are truly heartbreaking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ceGZouVBvB5mpvdtaXSXi1FIDUU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263253'),
  ('831855716594670709', 'Special Forces', 2011, 'Action, Drama, War', 'David Jankowski, Stéphane Rybojad', 'Stéphane Rybojad', 'Diane Kruger, Djimon Hounsou, Benoît Magimel, Denis Ménochet, Raphaël Personnaz, Alain Figlarz, Alain Alivon, Mehdi Nebbou', 'R', 'Afghanistan. War correspondent Elsa Casanova is taken hostage by the Taliban. Faced with her imminent execution, a Special Forces unit is dispatched to free her. In some of the world’s most breathtaking yet hostile landscapes, a relentless pursuit begins between her kidnappers who have no intention of letting their prey escape them and a group of soldiers who risk their lives in pursuit of their single aim – to bring her home alive. This strong, independent woman and these men of duty are thrown together and forced to confront situations of great danger that inextricably bind them – emotionally, violently and intimately.', 'Afghanistan. War correspondent Elsa Casanova is taken hostage by the Taliban. Faced with her imminent execution, a Special Forces unit is dispatched to free her. In some of the world’s most breathtaking yet hostile landscapes, a relentless pursuit begins between her kidnappers who have no intention of letting their prey escape them and a group of soldiers who risk their lives in pursuit of their single aim – to bring her home alive. This strong, independent woman and these men of duty are thrown together and forced to confront situations of great danger that inextricably bind them – emotionally, violently and intimately.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xpe9F3214mNrk8tnIqZvHSmIV1I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74513'),
  ('1123633071726272027', 'Special ID', 2013, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Clarence Ford, Peter Pau Tak-Hai, Kenny Lam Ping-Wah', 'Szeto Kam-Yuen, Wang Xiaozhu, Qin Shuang', 'Donnie Yen, Jing Tian, Andy On Chi-Kit, Ronald Cheng Chung-Kei, Nina Paw Hei-Ching, Collin Chou, Yang Zhigang, Terence Yin Chi-Wai', null, 'A career-long undercover Hong Kong cop is sent to Mainland China when his former protégé becomes the primary suspect in a murder.', 'A career-long undercover Hong Kong cop is sent to Mainland China when his former protégé becomes the primary suspect in a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1JmlCQWg1mdQTUMgJQsH7XHcXpA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222216'),
  ('412917058127061111', 'Special Mission Lady Chaplin', 1966, 'Crime, Adventure, Action', 'Alberto De Martino, Sergio Grieco, Federico G. Larraya', 'Giovanni Simonelli', 'Ken Clark, Daniela Bianchi, Helga Liné, Jacques Bergerac, Mabel Karr, Alfredo Mayo, Philippe Hersent, Ida Galli', null, 'Lady Chaplin is a beautiful woman, she is a fashion stylist and she owns an atelier in Paris. Zoltan is a rich American specialized in submarine researches. Dick Malloy is an American secret agent. What have the three in common? Perhaps a sunk American atomic submarine with sixteen missiles still on board? And why every other scene one, two, ten or more men are trying to kill Malloy in every conceivable way?', 'Lady Chaplin is a beautiful woman, she is a fashion stylist and she owns an atelier in Paris. Zoltan is a rich American specialized in submarine researches. Dick Malloy is an American secret agent. What have the three in common? Perhaps a sunk American atomic submarine with sixteen missiles still on board? And why every other scene one, two, ten or more men are trying to kill Malloy in every conceivable way?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rAb4LcW0vNDrk5fBvv6tax4OefA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200863'),
  ('424488389443879527', 'Special Section', 1975, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Costa-Gavras, Andréas Winding', 'Jorge Semprún, Costa-Gavras', 'Louis Seigner, Michael Lonsdale, Claude Piéplu, Pierre Dux, Heinz Bennent, Michel Galabru, Roland Bertin, Hans Richter', null, 'In Nazi-occupied France, a German officer is assassinated. The Germans demand justice, and the Vichy government is quick to capitulate. Unable to apprehend the actual culprits, Minister of Justice Joseph Barthélémy decides the execution of token Frenchmen will suffice, but the problem is finding judges and jurors eager to participate in a sham trial of innocent men. The solution is a Special Section, a court comprised of individuals handpicked for this exact purpose.', 'In Nazi-occupied France, a German officer is assassinated. The Germans demand justice, and the Vichy government is quick to capitulate. Unable to apprehend the actual culprits, Minister of Justice Joseph Barthélémy decides the execution of token Frenchmen will suffice, but the problem is finding judges and jurors eager to participate in a sham trial of innocent men. The solution is a Special Section, a court comprised of individuals handpicked for this exact purpose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRko0kzrm3Z3o7saQA9kFo4fVo7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79921'),
  ('449191921786032464', 'Special Treatment', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jeanne Labrune, Virginie Saint-Martin', 'Jeanne Labrune, Richard Debuisne', 'Isabelle Huppert, Bouli Lanners, Richard Debuisne, Valérie Dréville, Mathieu Carrière, Didier Bezace, Christophe Odent, Gilles Cohen', null, 'Drawing some intriguing parallels between the work of the prostitute and that of the psychiatrist-both have clients, both charge for sessions, both take on roles that serve the needs, psychological or otherwise, of those they serve, Jeanne Labrune''s drama stars Isabelle Huppert and Bouli Lanners as, respectively, Alice, a disaffected call girl and Xavier, a shrink with a crumbling domestic situation.', 'Drawing some intriguing parallels between the work of the prostitute and that of the psychiatrist-both have clients, both charge for sessions, both take on roles that serve the needs, psychological or otherwise, of those they serve, Jeanne Labrune''s drama stars Isabelle Huppert and Bouli Lanners as, respectively, Alice, a disaffected call girl and Xavier, a shrink with a crumbling domestic situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmiIMNEoyWxjJpLZAT1dzosGumo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56174'),
  ('893930973526645162', 'Special Unit - The First Murder', 2025, 'Crime, Drama, History', 'Christoffer Boe, Lasse Frank Johannessen, Rie Hedegaard', 'Christoffer Boe, Lasse Kyed Rasmussen', 'Alex Høgh Andersen, Mathilde Arcel Fock, Nicolaj Kopernikus, Katrine Greis-Rosenthal, Ask Berntsen, Kristian Halken, Mille Lehfeldt, Lars Ranthe', null, 'Denmark in 1927. The ambitious police officer Otto Himmelstrup leads the newly formed Special Unit, which is tasked with assisting local police in solving particularly difficult crimes. When a body is found in a burnt-out summer house in Esbjerg, Otto and his team begin to unravel an unusual murder mystery, revealing power struggles and corruption among the city’s elite. The closer the unit gets to the truth, the more dangerous it becomes. Soon, Otto finds himself not only battling powerful enemies but also confronting his own dark side in his quest to solve the case.', 'Denmark in 1927. The ambitious police officer Otto Himmelstrup leads the newly formed Special Unit, which is tasked with assisting local police in solving particularly difficult crimes. When a body is found in a burnt-out summer house in Esbjerg, Otto and his team begin to unravel an unusual murder mystery, revealing power struggles and corruption among the city’s elite. The closer the unit gets to the truth, the more dangerous it becomes. Soon, Otto finds himself not only battling powerful enemies but also confronting his own dark side in his quest to solve the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2V6dGTHGrq79U765qfnHYP7HFu0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1387190'),
  ('829560708840230268', 'Special When Lit', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Brett Sullivan', null, 'Roger Sharpe, Rick Stetta, Pat Lawlor, Steve Epstein, Sam Harvey, Tim Arnold, Lyman Sheats, John Broughton', 'G', 'What made more money than the entire American movie industry through the 50s and 60s? Pinball. Special When Lit rediscovers the lure of a lost pop icon. A product of the mechanical and electrical age, the American invention swept the world and defined cool. Now it is relegated to a nostalgic footnote deserving a better fate. Joining the fans, collectors, designers and champion players from across the globe who share a world many of us didn''t know still existed.', 'What made more money than the entire American movie industry through the 50s and 60s? Pinball. Special When Lit rediscovers the lure of a lost pop icon. A product of the mechanical and electrical age, the American invention swept the world and defined cool. Now it is relegated to a nostalgic footnote deserving a better fate. Joining the fans, collectors, designers and champion players from across the globe who share a world many of us didn''t know still existed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sktCnNudgEtuDUBVJyPY3HQ2p1O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66720'),
  ('967194088607759759', 'Species', 1995, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Action', 'Andrzej Bartkowiak, Roger Donaldson, Lauren E. Polizzi', 'Dennis Feldman', 'Natasha Henstridge, Ben Kingsley, Michael Madsen, Marg Helgenberger, Alfred Molina, Forest Whitaker, Michelle Williams, Jordan Lund', 'R', 'In 1993, the Search for Extra Terrestrial Intelligence Project receives a transmission detailing an alien DNA structure, along with instructions on how to splice it with human DNA. The result is Sil, a sensual but deadly creature who can change from a beautiful woman to an armour-plated killing machine in the blink of an eye.', 'In 1993, the Search for Extra Terrestrial Intelligence Project receives a transmission detailing an alien DNA structure, along with instructions on how to splice it with human DNA. The result is Sil, a sensual but deadly creature who can change from a beautiful woman to an armour-plated killing machine in the blink of an eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cT5wdyo8kT7dycqjrolJ2sHWkFx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9348'),
  ('589512985818896133', 'Species II', 1998, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Matthew F. Leonetti, Peter Medak, Shepherd Frankel', 'Chris Brancato', 'Michael Madsen, Natasha Henstridge, Marg Helgenberger, Mykelti Williamson, George Dzundza, James Cromwell, Sarah Wynter, Justin Lazard', 'R', 'Having just returned from a mission to Mars, Commander Ross isn''t exactly himself. He''s slowly becoming a terrifying alien entity with one goal -- to procreate with human women! When countless women suffer gruesome deaths after bearing half-alien offspring, scientist Laura Baker and hired assassin Press Lennox use Eve, a more tempered alien clone, to find Ross and his brood. Before long Eve escapes to mate with Ross.', 'Having just returned from a mission to Mars, Commander Ross isn''t exactly himself. He''s slowly becoming a terrifying alien entity with one goal -- to procreate with human women! When countless women suffer gruesome deaths after bearing half-alien offspring, scientist Laura Baker and hired assassin Press Lennox use Eve, a more tempered alien clone, to find Ross and his brood. Before long Eve escapes to mate with Ross.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LSBi0bHACZtIiVErUBQ2UXNYLA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10216'),
  ('633574154244066334', 'Species III', 2005, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Brad Turner, Patrick A. Duffy, Jim Vickers', 'Ben Ripley', 'Robin Dunne, Robert Knepper, Sunny Mabrey, Amelia Cooke, Christopher Neame, Patricia Bethune, Michael Warren, Natasha Henstridge', 'R', 'After she delivers her child in an ambulance, alien Eve is killed by a half-breed. Fortunately, Dr. Abbot scoops up the baby alien and escapes. In time, the baby grows into a gorgeous blonde named Sara and begins her quest to find a worthy mate. But Sara is also savage and leaves a trail of deaths in her wake. This carnage makes chemistry student Dean question whether to help her race or not.', 'After she delivers her child in an ambulance, alien Eve is killed by a half-breed. Fortunately, Dr. Abbot scoops up the baby alien and escapes. In time, the baby grows into a gorgeous blonde named Sara and begins her quest to find a worthy mate. But Sara is also savage and leaves a trail of deaths in her wake. This carnage makes chemistry student Dean question whether to help her race or not.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BelHo8qmaurZjPS9hipSQ79Rr6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9711'),
  ('698531129848767619', 'Species: The Awakening', 2007, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Nick Lyon, Jaime Reynoso, Frederic Henocque', 'Ben Ripley', 'Helena Mattsson, Ben Cross, Dominic Keating, Marlene Favela, Meagen Fay, Roger Cudney, Mauricio Martínez, Edy Arellano', 'NR', 'A scientist, Dr Hollander, takes his niece Miranda to Mexico in an attempt to reverse the effects of the alien DNA he used to create her. However the treatment goes horribly wrong, and sets Miranda on a killing spree as she sets out to find a mate.', 'A scientist, Dr Hollander, takes his niece Miranda to Mexico in an attempt to reverse the effects of the alien DNA he used to create her. However the treatment goes horribly wrong, and sets Miranda on a killing spree as she sets out to find a mate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wPsu2NM0eUpoqycgjjnRJIwxK13.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15212'),
  ('1086848568114892413', 'Speckles: The Tarbosaurus', 2012, 'Animation, Adventure', 'Han Sang-ho', 'Han Sang-ho', 'Lee Hyeong-seok, Shin Yong-woo, Koo Ja-hyoung', null, 'The story is set 70 million years ago, when dinosaurs ruled the Korean Peninsula the same way they ruled the rest of the earth. Spotty is a curious and playful Tarbosaurus child, and along with his mother and siblings, he lives happily in the forest. One day the cunning One-eye, an older Tyrannosaur looking for a new home, attacks Spotty’s herd and separates Spotty from his family. Alone, he befriends another lost girl Tarbosaur who becomes his friend and constant companion for two decades and the mother of his own children. But Spotty’s troubles with One-eye are not over, and revenge, death, fear, and sadness are all in Spotty’s future―as is happiness and hope.', 'The story is set 70 million years ago, when dinosaurs ruled the Korean Peninsula the same way they ruled the rest of the earth. Spotty is a curious and playful Tarbosaurus child, and along with his mother and siblings, he lives happily in the forest. One day the cunning One-eye, an older Tyrannosaur looking for a new home, attacks Spotty’s herd and separates Spotty from his family. Alone, he befriends another lost girl Tarbosaur who becomes his friend and constant companion for two decades and the mother of his own children. But Spotty’s troubles with One-eye are not over, and revenge, death, fear, and sadness are all in Spotty’s future―as is happiness and hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r29dVVn7eYgQAcq372DygsD9aOa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128475'),
  ('48120871333431519', 'Spectacular!', 2009, 'Drama, Music, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Robert Iscove, David Moxness', 'Jim Krieg', 'Nolan Gerard Funk, Tammin Sursok, Victoria Justice, Simon Curtis, Andrea Lewis, Harris Allan, Joel Ballard, Avan Jogia', null, 'A high school choir is fading in popularity, as it continues to lose most of its'' members one by one. A wannabe rock singer is convinced to join the choir, in hopes of winning the upcoming competition and cash prize.', 'A high school choir is fading in popularity, as it continues to lose most of its'' members one by one. A wannabe rock singer is convinced to join the choir, in hopes of winning the upcoming competition and cash prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kFHsKP8hPp4x3l1wH0EG1JGbtTs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18247'),
  ('79461010043877041', 'Spectator', 1970, 'Documentary', 'Frans Zwartjes', null, 'Christian Manders, Moniek Toebosch', null, 'Spectator is one of the early masterpieces by Zwartjes. The film explicitly shows one of Frans Zwartjes’ main themes: the relationship between husband and wife. It is a relationship that is strongly marked by power and domination, sexual attraction and repulsion. It manifests itself in humiliation and abuse (such Pentimento), but also in cool eroticism or natural physicality. Zwartjes’ goal is not to explain or designate this relationship. Rather it is the subject that Zwartjes uses to describe his world. In an article on Zwartjes, filmmaker and student George Schouten compares Zwartjes to the Italian writer Alberto Moravia. For both, sex is their way of dealing with reality. It is the subject by which they define their world. And for Zwartjes, it is also the subject with which he can display and develop his cinematic talent. (eyefilm.nl)', 'Spectator is one of the early masterpieces by Zwartjes. The film explicitly shows one of Frans Zwartjes’ main themes: the relationship between husband and wife. It is a relationship that is strongly marked by power and domination, sexual attraction and repulsion. It manifests itself in humiliation and abuse (such Pentimento), but also in cool eroticism or natural physicality. Zwartjes’ goal is not to explain or designate this relationship. Rather it is the subject that Zwartjes uses to describe his world. In an article on Zwartjes, filmmaker and student George Schouten compares Zwartjes to the Italian writer Alberto Moravia. For both, sex is their way of dealing with reality. It is the subject by which they define their world. And for Zwartjes, it is also the subject with which he can display and develop his cinematic talent. (eyefilm.nl)', null, 'tmdb:movie:125606'),
  ('198150665144180491', 'Specters', 1987, 'Horror', 'Marcello Avallone, Silvano Ippoliti, Vivalda Vigorelli', 'Andrea Purgatori, Dardano Sacchetti, Maurizio Tedesco', 'John R. Pepper, Trine Michelsen, Donald Pleasence, Massimo De Rossi, Riccardo De Torrebruna, Lavinia Grizi, Riccardo Parisio Perrotti, Giovanni Bilancia', null, 'A mysterious tomb is unearthed in the catacombs under Rome, the contents of which contain evidence of an ageless evil that may once have preyed on man.', 'A mysterious tomb is unearthed in the catacombs under Rome, the contents of which contain evidence of an ageless evil that may once have preyed on man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qyKGsp1ErnZFGcAIRQ0DzwhCaS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174754'),
