  ('534444725782273106', 'Speed Faster', 2026, 'Action, Thriller', 'Jason Park', 'Jason Park', 'Christopher Deon, Luke Dingess, Maria Mae Lopez, Jason Park', null, 'Ace and his elite street racers are forced into a dangerous mission by a shadowy group. After Four Amigos they work for the Church of Assassins on an impossible job, only to learn failure was always the plan. Betrayal and survival collide.', 'Ace and his elite street racers are forced into a dangerous mission by a shadowy group. After Four Amigos they work for the Church of Assassins on an impossible job, only to learn failure was always the plan. Betrayal and survival collide.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F2%2Fgracenote%2F277878d5f42e24468ed2198b614fc7bb.jpg', 'plex:movie:speed-faster'),
  ('1048487188439003231', 'Speed Kills', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Jodi Scurfield, Dharmesh Sharma, Andrzej Sekula', 'John Luessenhop, David Aaron Cohen', 'John Travolta, Katheryn Winnick, Jennifer Esposito, Matthew Modine, James Remar, Kellan Lutz, Moran Atias, Jordi Mollà', 'R', 'Speedboat racing champion and multimillionaire Ben Aronoff leads a double life that lands him in trouble with the law and drug lords.', 'Speedboat racing champion and multimillionaire Ben Aronoff leads a double life that lands him in trouble with the law and drug lords.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4p18CwxidvznZYMA6m4qv5FCvp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:466411'),
  ('8861719210494534', 'Speed Zone', 1989, 'Comedy, Action', 'Jim Drake, François Protat, Robert Saad', 'Michael Short', 'John Candy, Donna Dixon, Matt Frewer, Joe Flaherty, Tim Matheson, Mimi Kuzyk, Melody Anderson, Shari Belafonte', 'PG', 'An illegal race that takes place over the United States and nothing will stop this bunch of racers except for the occasional cop or a damsel in distress. Jackie Chan''s car is not in this one, but many new cars make up for that. Who will win? Who will crash? Who will not even finish? Sit down and buckle up for the ride of your life.', 'An illegal race that takes place over the United States and nothing will stop this bunch of racers except for the occasional cop or a damsel in distress. Jackie Chan''s car is not in this one, but many new cars make up for that. Who will win? Who will crash? Who will not even finish? Sit down and buckle up for the ride of your life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmAgnjrH7TlKjYUpS9NMGMlbkre.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12236'),
  ('1120826725803428234', 'Speed: In Search of Lost Time', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Florian Opitz', 'Florian Opitz', null, null, 'It’s a paradox. Never before in history we have worked more efficiently. Never before we have saved time with more sophisticated technologies. Anyway, nearly all of us are feeling an increasing pressure of time. It seems that the same technology that has been invented to make our life better and easier, is now enslaving us. Why?', 'It’s a paradox. Never before in history we have worked more efficiently. Never before we have saved time with more sophisticated technologies. Anyway, nearly all of us are feeling an increasing pressure of time. It seems that the same technology that has been invented to make our life better and easier, is now enslaving us. Why?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20H87GXZlc9C93OXuyiCm2cFvyl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135317'),
  ('433087864732541548', 'Speedway', 1968, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Norman Taurog, Dale Hutchinson, Joseph Ruttenberg', 'Phil Shuken', 'Elvis Presley, Nancy Sinatra, Bill Bixby, Gale Gordon, William Schallert, Victoria Paige Meyerink, Ross Hagen, Carl Ballantine', 'G', 'A race car driver tries to outrun the beautiful tax auditor out to settle his account.', 'A race car driver tries to outrun the beautiful tax auditor out to settle his account.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWjGauqY2NIdZOCi7KW9ZNpHBxV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18693'),
  ('1023689583348918342', 'Speedway Junky', 1999, 'Romance, Drama, Crime', 'Nickolas Perry, Steve Adcock', 'Nickolas Perry', 'Jesse Bradford, Jordan Brower, Jonathan Taylor Thomas, Daryl Hannah, Erik Alexander Gavica, Tiffani-Amber Thiessen, Patsy Kensit, Justin Urich', 'R', 'A naive drifter runs away from his army father in hopes of making it on the car racing circuit. In Las Vegas, he meets a young scam artist, who develops a crush on him. He is then introduced to a whole gang led by a young hustler. The racer-to-be then gets a lesson in the wild side, getting involved in one situation after another.', 'A naive drifter runs away from his army father in hopes of making it on the car racing circuit. In Las Vegas, he meets a young scam artist, who develops a crush on him. He is then introduced to a whole gang led by a young hustler. The racer-to-be then gets a lesson in the wild side, getting involved in one situation after another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZXKzRrrfXr8Ppt71rSuD2DEjCE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46727'),
  ('957258077478236834', 'Speedy', 1928, 'Comedy', 'Ted Wilde, Walter Lundin', null, 'Harold Lloyd, Ann Christy, Bert Woodruff, Babe Ruth, Byron Douglas, Brooks Benedict, Ernie Adams, James Bradbury Jr.', 'NR', 'A hapless young man living in New York City rallies to save his girlfriend''s grandfather''s horse-drawn trolley, the last in the city, from being put out of business by a railroad company.', 'A hapless young man living in New York City rallies to save his girlfriend''s grandfather''s horse-drawn trolley, the last in the city, from being put out of business by a railroad company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWhWaWCCIsnQDsFTAe98ap3R5y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22595'),
