  ('1106752108971833662', 'Spellbound', 2011, 'Horror, Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Hwang In-ho, Eo Jeong-il, Sohn Won-ho', 'Hwang In-ho', 'Son Ye-jin, Lee Min-ki, Park Cheol-min, Hwang Seung-eon, Kim Hyun-sook, Yoon Ji-min, Kim Soo-min, Um Tae-goo', 'PG-13', 'A magician meets a weird girl and offers her to work together in his magic show. It''s only until a year later that he starts to know her personally and develops a feeling towards her despite her own problems.', 'A magician meets a weird girl and offers her to work together in his magic show. It''s only until a year later that he starts to know her personally and develops a feeling towards her despite her own problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kiUh29bcQe66Mjs98O31vGwlUr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92499'),
