  ('1057480150622443095', 'Spencer''s Mountain', 1963, 'Drama, Family', 'Delmer Daves, Gil Kissel, Phil Rawlins', 'Delmer Daves', 'Henry Fonda, Maureen O''Hara, James MacArthur, Donald Crisp, Wally Cox, Mimsy Farmer, Virginia Gregg, Lillian Bronson', 'NR', 'Clay Spencer and his wife, Olivia, live in a small town deep in the mountains. When Clay isn''t busy drinking with his buddies or railing against the town minister, he''s building the house he''s always promised Olivia. He is overjoyed when he learns his eldest son will be the first Spencer to attend college, if he can resist the charms of a pretty local girl and rustle up the money for tuition.', 'Clay Spencer and his wife, Olivia, live in a small town deep in the mountains. When Clay isn''t busy drinking with his buddies or railing against the town minister, he''s building the house he''s always promised Olivia. He is overjoyed when he learns his eldest son will be the first Spencer to attend college, if he can resist the charms of a pretty local girl and rustle up the money for tuition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7vN9ZduHCI5mmFs3jfI0vJxxm3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44916'),
  ('850017265394860078', 'Spend the first of the month', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Sokrates Kapsaskis, Kostas Bakodimos', 'Alekos Sakellarios', 'Dimitris Papamichael, Anna Fonsou, Stavros Xenidis, Betty Arvaniti, Athinodoros Prousalis, Matina Karra, Petros Lohaitis, Ivonni Vladimirou', null, 'A debt collector persistently pursues a spendthrift young man who owes a lot of money to the company he works for. Although he finds her unbearable at first, he soon falls in love with her.', 'A debt collector persistently pursues a spendthrift young man who owes a lot of money to the company he works for. Although he finds her unbearable at first, he soon falls in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LDox0FW6Kvf40U2HYqFSnbe2Da.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576247'),
