  ('385581751764282729', 'Spider', 2019, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Julio Jorquera, Patricio Pereira, Roberto Matus', 'Andrés Wood, Guillermo Calderón', 'Mercedes Morán, Marcelo Alonso, María Valverde, Pedro Fontaine, Caio Blat, Néstor Cantillana, Felipe Armas, Gabriel Urzúa', null, 'Three friends are part of a fascist opposition group in the chaotic Chile of the early 70''s and together commit a political crime that changes the history of the country and incidentally involves them in a betrayal that separates them forever.', 'Three friends are part of a fascist opposition group in the chaotic Chile of the early 70''s and together commit a political crime that changes the history of the country and incidentally involves them in a betrayal that separates them forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xtytny3dRpIYdHsDMq7fTFRxHM6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589540'),
  ('717634604034346637', 'Spider', 2022, 'Horror', 'Desmon Heck, Ryan Brown', null, 'Novi Brown, Kali Roses, Jason Krotky, Desmon Heck, Ben Crowley, Jerod Meagher, Vanessa Conde, Alex Lederman', null, 'Desperate to win a man''s affections, Roshanda James uses murder and witchcraft to make herself appear as a beautiful seductress. No man can resist the Black Widow Spider.', 'Desperate to win a man''s affections, Roshanda James uses murder and witchcraft to make herself appear as a beautiful seductress. No man can resist the Black Widow Spider.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jireX9062do8ETnOxYcFcvse1fY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1002644'),
  ('536018412768653578', 'Spider Baby', 1967, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Jack Hill, Alfred Taylor, Bart Patton', 'Jack Hill', 'Lon Chaney Jr., Carol Ohmart, Quinn K. Redeker, Beverly Washburn, Jill Banner, Sid Haig, Mary Mitchel, Karl Schanzer', null, 'In a dilapidated rural mansion, the last generation of the degenerate, inbred Merrye family lives with the inherited curse of a disease that causes them to mentally regress from the age of 10 or so on as they physically develop. The family chauffeur looks out for them and covers up their indiscretions. Trouble comes when greedy distant relatives and their lawyer arrive to dispossess the family of its home.', 'In a dilapidated rural mansion, the last generation of the degenerate, inbred Merrye family lives with the inherited curse of a disease that causes them to mentally regress from the age of 10 or so on as they physically develop. The family chauffeur looks out for them and covers up their indiscretions. Trouble comes when greedy distant relatives and their lawyer arrive to dispossess the family of its home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pKKJsmTGt5MndLT8gBfl1pMp4fU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28504'),
  ('410750277750432743', 'Spider Forest', 2004, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery, Drama', 'Song Il-gon', 'Song Il-gon', 'Kam Woo-sung, Suh Jung, Kang Kyung-hun, Jang Hyun-sung, Cho Seong-ha, Son Byung-ho, Kim Hak-jun, Kim Hee-jung', null, 'TV Producer Kang Min enters Spider Forest for a documentary. He enters a cabin and discovers two brutally murdered bodies. One is his girlfriend Hwang Soo-Young and the other is his colleague Choi Jong-Pil. Kang Min also senses someone watching him and runs after that person into to the forest. He''s soon knocked unconscious. When he awakens again he continues his chase into a tunnel. Kang Min is then struck by a speeding car.', 'TV Producer Kang Min enters Spider Forest for a documentary. He enters a cabin and discovers two brutally murdered bodies. One is his girlfriend Hwang Soo-Young and the other is his colleague Choi Jong-Pil. Kang Min also senses someone watching him and runs after that person into to the forest. He''s soon knocked unconscious. When he awakens again he continues his chase into a tunnel. Kang Min is then struck by a speeding car.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jBEkJPSxwptnt2fjkrHQnqtc4WY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21781'),
  ('130366031257160147', 'Spider in the Web', 2019, 'Thriller', 'Eran Riklis, Richard Van Oosterhout, Eddy Stevesyns', 'Gidon Maron, Emmanuel Naccache', 'Monica Bellucci, Ben Kingsley, Filip Peeters, Hilde Van Mieghem, Makram J. Khoury, Marcel Hensema, Karl Ferlin, Itay Tiran', 'R', 'A young operative is sent on a mission to follow an older agent who''s behavior has come into question.', 'A young operative is sent on a mission to follow an older agent who''s behavior has come into question.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3io8GqRA8bAvASHcU4NJbBbrZor.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513413'),
  ('491807184971499107', 'Spider Lilies', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Zero Chou', 'Singing Chen', 'Rainie Yang, Isabella Leong Lok-Sze, Shen Jian-Hung, Jay Shih, Kris Shen, Li Hsiu, Michio Hayashida, Ivy Chen', null, 'When Jade, a web-cam girl, visits Takeko''s tattoo studio she becomes entranced with the image of the spider lily and with Takeko as well. In order to get closer to the object of her desire, Jade asks Takeko to give her the same lily tattoo, challenging Takeko''s monastic existence and opening up memories which threaten to tear the two women apart.', 'When Jade, a web-cam girl, visits Takeko''s tattoo studio she becomes entranced with the image of the spider lily and with Takeko as well. In order to get closer to the object of her desire, Jade asks Takeko to give her the same lily tattoo, challenging Takeko''s monastic existence and opening up memories which threaten to tear the two women apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAoEHYqsr90pQG6C9ORNPzKDP6d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43088'),
  ('90057404882028707', 'Spider-Ham: Caught in a Ham', 2019, 'Animation, Action, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Miguel Jiron', 'Miguel Jiron', 'John Mulaney, Aaron LaPlante', null, 'Spider-Ham: Caught in a Ham follows Spider-Ham as he faces off against bad guys, chows down on hot dogs, and makes plenty of food-based puns.', 'Spider-Ham: Caught in a Ham follows Spider-Ham as he faces off against bad guys, chows down on hot dogs, and makes plenty of food-based puns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCcuPPSGTohyg4YqPJornTwLL03.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:583055'),
  ('526080685072904793', 'Spider-Man', 1977, 'Science Fiction, Action, Crime', 'E.W. Swackhamer, Fred Jackman Jr., Barbara Bass', 'Alvin Boretz', 'Nicholas Hammond, David White, Michael Pataki, Hilly Hicks, Lisa Eilbacher, Dick Balduzzi, Jeff Donnell, Bob Hastings', null, 'When an extortionist threatens to force a multi-suicide unless a huge ransom is paid, only Peter Parker can stop him with his new powers as Spider-Man.', 'When an extortionist threatens to force a multi-suicide unless a huge ransom is paid, only Peter Parker can stop him with his new powers as Spider-Man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNxRHZ2cxVkNRtxgHuCtv7GY4JP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225914'),
  ('1084972002725020546', 'Spider-Man', 2002, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Don Burgess, Steve Arnold, Jeff Shiffman', 'David Koepp', 'Tobey Maguire, Willem Dafoe, Kirsten Dunst, James Franco, Cliff Robertson, Rosemary Harris, J.K. Simmons, Joe Manganiello', 'PG-13', 'After being bitten by a genetically altered spider at Oscorp, nerdy but endearing high school student Peter Parker is endowed with amazing powers to become the superhero known as Spider-Man.', 'After being bitten by a genetically altered spider at Oscorp, nerdy but endearing high school student Peter Parker is endowed with amazing powers to become the superhero known as Spider-Man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjdJntyBeEvqm9w97QGBdxPptzj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:557'),
  ('827716213964316743', 'Spider-Man 2', 2004, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Sam Raimi, Bill Pope, Eric Heffron', 'Alvin Sargent', 'Tobey Maguire, Kirsten Dunst, James Franco, Alfred Molina, Rosemary Harris, J.K. Simmons, Donna Murphy, Daniel Gillies', 'PG-13', 'Peter Parker is going through a major identity crisis. Burned out from being Spider-Man, he decides to shelve his superhero alter ego, which leaves the city suffering in the wake of carnage left by the evil Doc Ock. In the meantime, Parker still can''t act on his feelings for Mary Jane Watson, a girl he''s loved since childhood. A certain anger begins to brew in his best friend Harry Osborn as well...', 'Peter Parker is going through a major identity crisis. Burned out from being Spider-Man, he decides to shelve his superhero alter ego, which leaves the city suffering in the wake of carnage left by the evil Doc Ock. In the meantime, Parker still can''t act on his feelings for Mary Jane Watson, a girl he''s loved since childhood. A certain anger begins to brew in his best friend Harry Osborn as well...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eg8XHjA7jkM3ulBLnfGTczR9ytI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:558'),
  ('1115553240862937226', 'Spider-Man 2: Making the Amazing', 2004, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Documentary', 'Charles de Lauzirika', null, 'Sam Raimi, Tobey Maguire, Alfred Molina, Kirsten Dunst, J.K. Simmons, Bruce Campbell, Ted Raimi', null, 'A comprehensive 12-part documentary on the making of "Spider-Man 2," covering everything from pre-production to premiere.', 'A comprehensive 12-part documentary on the making of "Spider-Man 2," covering everything from pre-production to premiere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3oF3GbxSSQxO9rWjrUjwAFi1fSF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470035'),
  ('1106129450709386774', 'Spider-Man 3', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Sam Raimi, Bill Pope, Dan Bradley', 'Todd McFarlane', 'Tobey Maguire, Kirsten Dunst, James Franco, Thomas Haden Church, Topher Grace, Bryce Dallas Howard, Rosemary Harris, J.K. Simmons', 'PG-13', 'The seemingly invincible Spider-Man goes up against an all-new crop of villains—including the shape-shifting Sandman. While Spider-Man’s superpowers are altered by an alien organism, his alter ego, Peter Parker, deals with nemesis Eddie Brock and also gets caught up in a love triangle.', 'The seemingly invincible Spider-Man goes up against an all-new crop of villains—including the shape-shifting Sandman. While Spider-Man’s superpowers are altered by an alien organism, his alter ego, Peter Parker, deals with nemesis Eddie Brock and also gets caught up in a love triangle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qFmwhVUoUSXjkKRmca5yGDEXBIj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:559'),
  ('872387433701672196', 'Spider-Man Strikes Back', 1978, 'Action, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Ron Satlof, Jack Whitman', 'Robert Janes', 'Nicholas Hammond, Robert F. Simon, Michael Pataki, JoAnna Cameron, Robert Alda, Chip Fields, Randy Powell, Lawrence P. Casey', null, 'At the New York State University, one of Peter Parker''s tutors has accidentally given three students all the materials they need to create an atomic bomb. While Peter Parker tries to find out what''s happened, the police suspect him of the crime, and Peter has to deal with an attractive journalist determined to get an interview with Spider-Man. Then dastardly millionaire Mr. White shows up, and will stop at nothing to get his hands on the atomic bomb. Spider-Man must defeat this scheming villain and stop him blowing up the World Trade Centre.', 'At the New York State University, one of Peter Parker''s tutors has accidentally given three students all the materials they need to create an atomic bomb. While Peter Parker tries to find out what''s happened, the police suspect him of the crime, and Peter has to deal with an attractive journalist determined to get an interview with Spider-Man. Then dastardly millionaire Mr. White shows up, and will stop at nothing to get his hands on the atomic bomb. Spider-Man must defeat this scheming villain and stop him blowing up the World Trade Centre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mwRss4cA5m4fH6izoTwwPfF3ZOU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225925'),
  ('728912330850593950', 'Spider-Man: Across the Spider-Verse', 2023, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Kemp Powers, Justin K. Thompson, Joaquim Dos Santos', 'Phil Lord, Christopher Miller, David Callaham', 'Shameik Moore, Hailee Steinfeld, Brian Tyree Henry, Luna Lauren Vélez, Jake Johnson, Oscar Isaac, Jason Schwartzman, Issa Rae', 'PG', 'After reuniting with Gwen Stacy, Brooklyn’s full-time, friendly neighborhood Spider-Man is catapulted across the Multiverse, where he encounters the Spider Society, a team of Spider-People charged with protecting the Multiverse''s very existence. But when the heroes clash on how to handle a new threat, Miles finds himself pitted against the other Spiders and must set out on his own to save those he loves most.', 'After reuniting with Gwen Stacy, Brooklyn’s full-time, friendly neighborhood Spider-Man is catapulted across the Multiverse, where he encounters the Spider Society, a team of Spider-People charged with protecting the Multiverse''s very existence. But when the heroes clash on how to handle a new threat, Miles finds himself pitted against the other Spiders and must set out on his own to save those he loves most.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Vt6mWEReuy4Of61Lnj5Xj704m8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:569094'),
  ('804715098989741893', 'Spider-Man: All Roads Lead to No Way Home', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Tom Holland, Andrew Garfield, Tobey Maguire, Willem Dafoe, Alfred Molina, Jamie Foxx, Martin Starr, JB Smoove', 'NR', 'JB Smoove and Martin Starr host a celebration of 20 years of "Spider-Man" movies, from the Sam Raimi trilogy to Marc Webb''s movies and the trio from Jon Watts.', 'JB Smoove and Martin Starr host a celebration of 20 years of "Spider-Man" movies, from the Sam Raimi trilogy to Marc Webb''s movies and the trio from Jon Watts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2LLmI5wKIrWGAy9Of3yyWu7Szn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:961651'),
  ('814357572862495778', 'Spider-Man: Beyond the Spider-Verse', 2027, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Bob Persichetti, Justin K. Thompson, Alice Brooks', 'Christopher Miller, Phil Lord, David Callaham', 'Shameik Moore, Hailee Steinfeld, Brian Tyree Henry, Luna Lauren Vélez, Oscar Isaac, Jake Johnson, Jason Schwartzman, Issa Rae', null, 'Miles Morales is now a fugitive on the run from every other Spider in the multiverse, and Gwen and his other friends might not be enough to help him.', 'Miles Morales is now a fugitive on the run from every other Spider in the multiverse, and Gwen and his other friends might not be enough to help him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9PIhQqqI6Q4a5YjwMjxvzZcPJhf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:911916'),
  ('528975527590156653', 'Spider-Man: Brand New Day', 2026, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Destin Daniel Cretton, Peng Zhang, Brett Pawlak', 'Erik Sommers, Chris McKenna', 'Tom Holland, Zendaya, Sadie Sink, Jacob Batalon, Jon Bernthal, Tramell Tillman, Michael Mando, Mark Ruffalo', null, 'Four years have passed since the events of No Way Home, and Peter is now an adult living entirely alone, having voluntarily erased himself from the lives and memories of those he loves. Crime-fighting in a New York that no longer knows his name, he''s devoted himself entirely to protecting his city — a full-time Spider-Man — but as the demands on him intensify, the pressure sparks a surprising physical evolution that threatens his existence, even as a strange new pattern of crimes gives rise to one of the most powerful threats he has ever faced.', 'Four years have passed since the events of No Way Home, and Peter is now an adult living entirely alone, having voluntarily erased himself from the lives and memories of those he loves. Crime-fighting in a New York that no longer knows his name, he''s devoted himself entirely to protecting his city — a full-time Spider-Man — but as the demands on him intensify, the pressure sparks a surprising physical evolution that threatens his existence, even as a strange new pattern of crimes gives rise to one of the most powerful threats he has ever faced.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ucQ0QBXXQPSxeUmWfh4YQenIuB9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:969681'),
  ('883641984827857148', 'Spider-Man: Far From Home', 2019, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Riley Flanagan, George Cottle, Jon Watts', 'Chris McKenna', 'Tom Holland, Jake Gyllenhaal, Samuel L. Jackson, Marisa Tomei, Jon Favreau, Zendaya, Jacob Batalon, Tony Revolori', 'PG-13', 'Peter Parker and his friends go on a summer trip to Europe. However, they will hardly be able to rest - Peter will have to agree to help Nick Fury uncover the mystery of creatures that cause natural disasters and destruction throughout the continent.', 'Peter Parker and his friends go on a summer trip to Europe. However, they will hardly be able to rest - Peter will have to agree to help Nick Fury uncover the mystery of creatures that cause natural disasters and destruction throughout the continent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4q2NNj4S5dG2RLF9CpXsej7yXl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429617'),
  ('362899632442717071', 'Spider-Man: Homecoming', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Rachel Block, Brad Ricker, Salvatore Totino', 'Jonathan Goldstein, John Francis Daley, Jon Watts', 'Tom Holland, Michael Keaton, Robert Downey Jr., Marisa Tomei, Jon Favreau, Gwyneth Paltrow, Zendaya, Donald Glover', 'PG-13', 'Following the events of Captain America: Civil War, Peter Parker, with the help of his mentor Tony Stark, tries to balance his life as an ordinary high school student in Queens, New York City, with fighting crime as his superhero alter ego Spider-Man as a new threat, the Vulture, emerges.', 'Following the events of Captain America: Civil War, Peter Parker, with the help of his mentor Tony Stark, tries to balance his life as an ordinary high school student in Queens, New York City, with fighting crime as his superhero alter ego Spider-Man as a new threat, the Vulture, emerges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c24sv2weTHPsmDa7jEMN0m2P3RT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315635'),
  ('982260833661196291', 'Spider-Man: Into the Spider-Verse', 2018, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Bob Persichetti, Peter Ramsey, Rodney Rothman', 'Phil Lord, Rodney Rothman', 'Shameik Moore, Jake Johnson, Hailee Steinfeld, Mahershala Ali, Brian Tyree Henry, Lily Tomlin, Luna Lauren Vélez, Zoë Kravitz', 'PG', 'Struggling to find his place in the world while juggling school and family, Brooklyn teenager Miles Morales is unexpectedly bitten by a radioactive spider and develops unfathomable powers just like the one and only Spider-Man. While wrestling with the implications of his new abilities, Miles discovers a super collider created by the madman Wilson "Kingpin" Fisk, causing others from across the Spider-Verse to be inadvertently transported to his dimension.', 'Struggling to find his place in the world while juggling school and family, Brooklyn teenager Miles Morales is unexpectedly bitten by a radioactive spider and develops unfathomable powers just like the one and only Spider-Man. While wrestling with the implications of his new abilities, Miles discovers a super collider created by the madman Wilson "Kingpin" Fisk, causing others from across the Spider-Verse to be inadvertently transported to his dimension.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iiZZdoQBEYBv6id8su7ImL0oCbD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324857'),
  ('1063097111832548422', 'Spider-Man: No Way Home', 2021, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Chiranjiv Makwana, Mauro Fiore, Sally Ledger', 'Chris McKenna, Erik Sommers', 'Tom Holland, Zendaya, Benedict Cumberbatch, Jacob Batalon, Jon Favreau, Jamie Foxx, Willem Dafoe, Alfred Molina', 'PG-13', 'Peter Parker is unmasked and no longer able to separate his normal life from the high-stakes of being a super-hero. When he asks for help from Doctor Strange the stakes become even more dangerous, forcing him to discover what it truly means to be Spider-Man.', 'Peter Parker is unmasked and no longer able to separate his normal life from the high-stakes of being a super-hero. When he asks for help from Doctor Strange the stakes become even more dangerous, forcing him to discover what it truly means to be Spider-Man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1g0dhYtq4irTY1GPXvft6k4YLjm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:634649'),
  ('40764725944217497', 'Spider-Man: The Dragon''s Challenge', 1981, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Don McDougall', 'Lionel E. Siegel', 'Nicholas Hammond, Ellen Bry, Robert F. Simon, Benson Fong, Chip Fields, Rosalind Chao, Hagan Beggs, Richard Erdman', null, 'Spider-Man goes to China to help an official accused of World War II treachery. Two episodes of the TV series "Spider Man" edited together and released as a feature.', 'Spider-Man goes to China to help an official accused of World War II treachery. Two episodes of the TV series "Spider Man" edited together and released as a feature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wBmtFmSikG5u08FdGLRsF0Py59V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225938'),
  ('1124407187387205325', 'Spider''s Web', 1989, 'Drama', 'Bernhard Wicki, Gérard Vandenberg', 'Wolfgang Kirchner, Bernhard Wicki', 'Ulrich Mühe, Klaus Maria Brandauer, Armin Mueller-Stahl, Andrea Jonasson, Agnes Fink, Hans Korte, Hark Bohm, Horst Sachtleben', null, 'Ulrich Mühe plays a German businessman who was born completely without scruples. This makes him an eminently suitable candidate for success in the chaotic years after World War I. The shameless man''s story is contrasted with that of his polar opposite, a Jewish anarchist.', 'Ulrich Mühe plays a German businessman who was born completely without scruples. This makes him an eminently suitable candidate for success in the chaotic years after World War I. The shameless man''s story is contrasted with that of his polar opposite, a Jewish anarchist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3o9Fx8rAzDuaMFx6tEy9GsuL8t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197560'),
  ('692831343440725163', 'Spiderbabe', 2003, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Johnny Crash, M.A. Morales', 'John Paul Fedele, Terry West', 'Erin Brown, Julian Wells, Darian Caine, Adam Cox, Christine Domaniecki, Peter Quarry, Michael R. Thomas, Shelby Taylor', null, 'A socially awkward young woman gets bitten by a radioactive spider and becomes a crime-fighting superhero and tries to defeat a nefarious super villain while going after any man (or woman) she wants to bed down with.', 'A socially awkward young woman gets bitten by a radioactive spider and becomes a crime-fighting superhero and tries to defeat a nefarious super villain while going after any man (or woman) she wants to bed down with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mh7oL7A43NvNy1o5O2CouyoQTKl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30471'),
  ('325395862548700518', 'Spiderhead', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Claudio Miranda, Samantha Smith McGrady, Jim Millett', 'Rhett Reese, Paul Wernick', 'Chris Hemsworth, Miles Teller, Jurnee Smollett, Mark Paguio, Tess Haubrich, BeBe Bettencourt, Nathan Jones, Angie Milliken', 'R', 'A prisoner in a state-of-the-art penitentiary begins to question the purpose of the emotion-controlling drugs he''s testing for a pharmaceutical genius.', 'A prisoner in a state-of-the-art penitentiary begins to question the purpose of the emotion-controlling drugs he''s testing for a pharmaceutical genius.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7COPO5B9AOKIB4sEkvNu0wfve3c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:615469'),
  ('91716868254537965', 'Spiders', 2000, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Gary Jones, Jack Cooperman', 'Adam Gierasch, Stephen David Brooks, Jace Anderson', 'Lana Parrilla, Josh Green, Oliver Macready, Simona Williams, Mark Phelan, Leslie Zemeckis, Billy Maddox, Mark Totty', null, 'A DNA experiment on a rare breed of spider is taking place on a NASA space shuttle, when a freak meteor shower engulfs the shuttle, causing everything to go horribly wrong. One survivor is found on the ship and watched over in a secret location deep in the California desert. The problem continues, as the survivor isn''t alone, as another deadly spiders climbs out of him and goes on a rampage around the ship. Curious reporter Marci Eyre must now survive, escape and warn everyone before the spider reaches outside the desert.', 'A DNA experiment on a rare breed of spider is taking place on a NASA space shuttle, when a freak meteor shower engulfs the shuttle, causing everything to go horribly wrong. One survivor is found on the ship and watched over in a secret location deep in the California desert. The problem continues, as the survivor isn''t alone, as another deadly spiders climbs out of him and goes on a rampage around the ship. Curious reporter Marci Eyre must now survive, escape and warn everyone before the spider reaches outside the desert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7KU0Lo5eWGApnophGEzEMQm7z8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40039'),
  ('945788729326620320', 'Spiders', 2013, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Tibor Takács, Mark Roper, Lorenzo Senatore', 'Joseph Farrugia, Tibor Takács', 'Patrick Muldoon, Christa Campbell, William Hope, Sydney Sweeney, Pete Lee-Wilson, Shelly Varod, Dimiter Doichinov, Jon Mack', 'PG-13', 'After a Soviet space station crashes into a New York City subway tunnel, a species of venomous spiders is discovered, and soon they mutate to gigantic proportions and wreak havoc on the city.', 'After a Soviet space station crashes into a New York City subway tunnel, a species of venomous spiders is discovered, and soon they mutate to gigantic proportions and wreak havoc on the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vuF1EopyrrtRvVPsAsFBAThcWIT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164331'),
  ('426019336368256444', 'Spiders II: Breeding Ground', 2001, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Sam Firstenberg, Franklin A. Vallette, Peter Belcher', 'Stephen David Brooks', 'Stephanie Niznik, Greg Cromer, Daniel Quinn, Richard Moll, Dimiter Kuzov, Harel Noff, Yuri Safchev, Miroslava Bonjeva', null, 'Happy couple Jason and Alexandra lose their sail yacht in a storm and are grateful to get picked up by Captain Jim Bigelow''s commercial carrier. Suspicious about the ship''s doctor and realizing the ship is improbably empty and the radio not broken as the crew claims, Jason starts snooping around. Bodies on meat-hooks, genetic experimentation and giant spiders are what he finds.', 'Happy couple Jason and Alexandra lose their sail yacht in a storm and are grateful to get picked up by Captain Jim Bigelow''s commercial carrier. Suspicious about the ship''s doctor and realizing the ship is improbably empty and the radio not broken as the crew claims, Jason starts snooping around. Bodies on meat-hooks, genetic experimentation and giant spiders are what he finds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAgJTqKimQ2wCxKvYpHNLwt3MYs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40040'),
  ('646774338253258847', 'Spielberg', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Susan Lacy, Sam Painter, Ed Marritz', null, 'Steven Spielberg, Martin Scorsese, Richard Dreyfuss, Francis Ford Coppola, Tom Hanks, J.J. Abrams, Leonardo DiCaprio, Cate Blanchett', null, 'A documentary on the life and career of one of the most influential film directors of all time, Steven Spielberg.', 'A documentary on the life and career of one of the most influential film directors of all time, Steven Spielberg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2AAvIR2PHoxNITgLDOkXXlWLlua.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467062'),
  ('769842243642469696', 'Spieltrieb', 2013, 'Drama', 'Gregor Schnitzler', 'Kathrin Richter, Jürgen Schlagenhof', 'Michelle Barthel, Jannik Schümann, Maximilian Brückner, Richy Müller, Ulrike Folkerts, Sophie von Kessel, Isolde Barth, Elisa Schlott', null, 'A tangled drama of cruelty and manipulation, attraction and love.', 'A tangled drama of cruelty and manipulation, attraction and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYVZNUKyBEEf4uIoHFOUn0ZoDTx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226693'),
  ('1063505194865563077', 'Spies', 1928, 'Thriller, Romance', 'Fritz Lang, Fritz Arno Wagner', 'Fritz Lang', 'Rudolf Klein-Rogge, Gerda Maurus, Lien Deyers, Louis Ralph, Willy Fritsch, Paul Hörbiger, Fritz Rasp, Craighall Sherry', null, 'The mastermind behind a ubiquitous spy operation learns of a dangerous romance between a Russian lady in his employ and a dashing agent from the government''s secret service.', 'The mastermind behind a ubiquitous spy operation learns of a dangerous romance between a Russian lady in his employ and a dashing agent from the government''s secret service.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ri1agTtNaG8LemO9wcILukvULiR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78507'),
  ('382690128405207330', 'Spies', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy, War', 'Chuck Jones', 'Phil Eastman, Dr. Seuss', 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'The doltish but self-confident and self-congratulatory Private Snafu is in possession of a military secret during World War II. Over the course of the day, spouting rhymed couplets, he divulges the secret a little at a time to listening Axis spies. He tells his mom some of the secret when he calls her from a phone booth; the rest he spills to a dolly dolly spy who plies him with liquor. Snafu''s loose lips put himself at risk.', 'The doltish but self-confident and self-congratulatory Private Snafu is in possession of a military secret during World War II. Over the course of the day, spouting rhymed couplets, he divulges the secret a little at a time to listening Axis spies. He tells his mom some of the secret when he calls her from a phone booth; the rest he spills to a dolly dolly spy who plies him with liquor. Snafu''s loose lips put himself at risk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0EfVz6GE8ffIaPeaZkslsvn983.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233913'),
  ('328948455138442769', 'Spies in Disguise', 2019, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Nick Bruno, Troy Quane', 'Lucas Martell', 'Will Smith, Tom Holland, Ben Mendelsohn, Rashida Jones, Karen Gillan, DJ Khaled, Reba McEntire, Rachel Brosnahan', 'PG', 'Super spy Lance Sterling and scientist Walter Beckett are almost exact opposites. Lance is smooth, suave and debonair. Walter is… not. But what Walter lacks in social skills he makes up for in smarts and invention, creating the awesome gadgets Lance uses on his epic missions. But when events take an unexpected turn, Walter and Lance suddenly have to rely on each other in a whole new way.', 'Super spy Lance Sterling and scientist Walter Beckett are almost exact opposites. Lance is smooth, suave and debonair. Walter is… not. But what Walter lacks in social skills he makes up for in smarts and invention, creating the awesome gadgets Lance uses on his epic missions. But when events take an unexpected turn, Walter and Lance suddenly have to rely on each other in a whole new way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z52xI0MnoX1rqySFJYnmBqHbXRn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431693'),
  ('839472597971422065', 'Spies Like Us', 1985, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Robert Paynter, John Landis, Dusty Symonds', 'Dan Aykroyd, Lowell Ganz, Babaloo Mandel', 'Chevy Chase, Dan Aykroyd, Steve Forrest, Donna Dixon, Bruce Davison, Terry Gilliam, Frank Oz, Vanessa Angel', 'PG', 'Two bumbling government employees think they are U.S. spies, only to discover that they are actually decoys for nuclear war.', 'Two bumbling government employees think they are U.S. spies, only to discover that they are actually decoys for nuclear war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s0Sx8nd9Irq0aCPbsN78s0DYVlG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9080'),
  ('362897171105316341', 'Spike Island', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Mat Whitecross, Christopher Ross, John William Turner', 'Chris Coghill', 'Elliott Tittensor, Emilia Clarke, Nico Mirallegro, Adam Long, Jordan Murphy, Oliver Heald, Robert James-Collier, Matthew McNulty', null, 'Teenage musicians travel to England''s Spike Island in the hope of attending an outdoor performance by their favorite band, the Stone Roses.', 'Teenage musicians travel to England''s Spike Island in the hope of attending an outdoor performance by their favorite band, the Stone Roses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jKlnZHSfQW09Q1SICvpDwPL762o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141679'),
  ('551897896738547367', 'Spike of Bensonhurst', 1988, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Paul Morrissey, Mark Hatfield, Steven Fierberg', 'Paul Morrissey, Alan Bowne', 'Sasha Mitchell, Ernest Borgnine, Anne DeSalvo, Sylvia Miles, Geraldine Smith, Antonia Rey, Rick Aviles, Maria Pitillo', null, 'Spike Fumo is an Italian kid apsiring to be a boxer. He falls in love with a rich girl, who turns out to be the daughter of a Mafia boss. Spike is threatened to leave Bensonhurst by the mob, and then goes to a poverty-stricken Puerto Rican part of Brooklyn.', 'Spike Fumo is an Italian kid apsiring to be a boxer. He falls in love with a rich girl, who turns out to be the daughter of a Mafia boss. Spike is threatened to leave Bensonhurst by the mob, and then goes to a poverty-stricken Puerto Rican part of Brooklyn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uxY7MffVWZeBKSeHwl2pNxQxRJu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123620'),
  ('825185834527634698', 'Spin', 1995, 'Documentary', 'Brian Springer', 'Brian Springer', 'Brian Springer, George H. W. Bush, Bill Clinton, Al Gore, Larry King, Larry Agran, Jim Bakker, Bill Beutel', null, 'Pirated satellite feeds revealing U.S. media personalities’ contempt for their viewers come full circle in Spin. TV out-takes appropriated from network satellite feeds unravel the tightly-spun fabric of television—a system that silences public debate and enforces the exclusion of anyone outside the pack of journalists, politicians, spin doctors, and televangelists who manufacture the news. Spin moves through the L.A. riots and the floating TV talk-show called the 1992 U.S. presidential election.', 'Pirated satellite feeds revealing U.S. media personalities’ contempt for their viewers come full circle in Spin. TV out-takes appropriated from network satellite feeds unravel the tightly-spun fabric of television—a system that silences public debate and enforces the exclusion of anyone outside the pack of journalists, politicians, spin doctors, and televangelists who manufacture the news. Spin moves through the L.A. riots and the floating TV talk-show called the 1992 U.S. presidential election.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nByPlK7aFTmCNkFQrOpOa6mQYSx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170345'),
  ('153737493851522617', 'Spin', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy, Crime', 'Jamin Winans', 'Jamin Winans', 'Jonny Hayz II, Raymond Andrew Bailey, Troy Garner, Megan Heffernan, Kerry Knuppe', null, 'A mysterious DJ is sent to a city block to mend a series of chain reactions that occur in our everyday lives.', 'A mysterious DJ is sent to a city block to mend a series of chain reactions that occur in our everyday lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGyX7hqCgfcZ9MdzFKOSSbr4r3H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99251'),
  ('955874501466649875', 'Spin', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Henry Pincus, Steve Gainer', 'Henry Pincus', 'Michael Biehn, Adam Campbell, Katie Cassidy, Patrick John Flueger, Lauren German, Chris Lowell, Bijou Phillips, Amber Heard', null, 'Six young people spend the morning after a wild club spree trying to piece together their misadventures from the night before, including a trip to the veterinarian hospital, at least one breakup and the unexpected discovery of a mobster''s corpse. As the group shares their fragmented memories, some of their stories start to fit together while others just lead to more questions.', 'Six young people spend the morning after a wild club spree trying to piece together their misadventures from the night before, including a trip to the veterinarian hospital, at least one breakup and the unexpected discovery of a mobster''s corpse. As the group shares their fragmented memories, some of their stories start to fit together while others just lead to more questions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMOcq5ipUOOwNl4o4rV2pg6JLSt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57655'),
  ('861938403954574674', 'Spin', 2021, 'TV Movie, Family, Music', 'Jeremy Benning, Laurie Mirsky, Kevin Hennelly', null, 'Avantika, Abhay Deol, Meera Syal, Michael Bishop, Kerri Medders, Michela Luci, Anna Cathcart, Kyana Teresa', 'G', 'Rhea lives with her tight-knit multigenerational family. After her mother’s death, she has been her father’s emotional rock, and her life revolves around her family’s restaurant, her eclectic group of friends, and her after-school coding club. Everything changes when she falls for aspiring DJ Max and a long lost passion for music is reignited. Rhea discovers that she has a natural gift for creating beats and producing music that blends her Indian heritage, but must find the courage to follow her true inner talent.', 'Rhea lives with her tight-knit multigenerational family. After her mother’s death, she has been her father’s emotional rock, and her life revolves around her family’s restaurant, her eclectic group of friends, and her after-school coding club. Everything changes when she falls for aspiring DJ Max and a long lost passion for music is reignited. Rhea discovers that she has a natural gift for creating beats and producing music that blends her Indian heritage, but must find the courage to follow her true inner talent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9aRzuvaUT7XrUyf207hwrbxocGJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:734858'),
  ('96042629804370212', 'Spin Me Round', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Jeff Baena, Sean McElwee', 'Jeff Baena, Alison Brie', 'Alison Brie, Aubrey Plaza, Alessandro Nivola, Fred Armisen, Tim Heidecker, Tricia Helfer, Ayden Mayeri, Ego Nwodim', 'R', 'When the manager of an Italian restaurant chain wins the opportunity to attend the franchise’s educational immersion program in Italy, what she thought would be a romantic getaway devolves into chaos and catastrophe.', 'When the manager of an Italian restaurant chain wins the opportunity to attend the franchise’s educational immersion program in Italy, what she thought would be a romantic getaway devolves into chaos and catastrophe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/55yyTk2PeKeFyyjwNJN70iZZu9n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:826942'),
  ('656900725797955585', 'Spin Out', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tim Ferguson, Marc Gracie', 'Tim Ferguson, Edwina Exton', 'Xavier Samuel, Morgan Griffin, Lincoln Lewis, Melissa Bergland, Travis Jeffery, Kaden Hartcher, Adam Briggs, Aaron Tsindos', null, 'Billy and Lucy have grown up together in a small, close-knit Australian country town, where they form one of the town''s most formidable Ute driving teams. When Billy takes one risky car stunt too far, Lucy declares she is moving to the city - sending Billy into a spin. Amid the mayhem of the town''s annual "Bachelors and Spinsters" party, Billy only has one night to wake up to his true feelings for his best friend - or lose her forever. Spin Out is a fresh, feel-good comedy romance for the young and the young at heart.', 'Billy and Lucy have grown up together in a small, close-knit Australian country town, where they form one of the town''s most formidable Ute driving teams. When Billy takes one risky car stunt too far, Lucy declares she is moving to the city - sending Billy into a spin. Amid the mayhem of the town''s annual "Bachelors and Spinsters" party, Billy only has one night to wake up to his true feelings for his best friend - or lose her forever. Spin Out is a fresh, feel-good comedy romance for the young and the young at heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9M4kLmtyi5XgbukVVNfJecKCGWp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:404580'),
  ('675782950394275431', 'Spin the Bottle', 2024, 'Horror', 'Michael Street, Ted Campbell, Gavin Wiesen', 'John Cregan', 'Tanner Stine, Kaylee Kaneshiro, Tony Amendola, Ryan Whitney, Hal Cumpston, Angela Halili, Scarlett DeMeo, Ali Larter', 'R', 'When a group of friends play spin the bottle in a house marked by a brutal massacre, they unknowingly unleash an evil spirit and start dying in terrifying ways. Now, the survivors must stick together to uncover the house''s dark secrets and end the bloodshed.', 'When a group of friends play spin the bottle in a house marked by a brutal massacre, they unknowingly unleash an evil spirit and start dying in terrifying ways. Now, the survivors must stick together to uncover the house''s dark secrets and end the bloodshed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knZo3KnD7mT4aXwLDbYyQw7ZA8Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1030983'),
  ('535414308507604640', 'Spinal Tap II: The End Continues', 2025, 'Comedy, Music', 'Rob Reiner, Lincoln Else, Stephen Harrison', 'Rob Reiner, Michael McKean, Christopher Guest', 'Christopher Guest, Michael McKean, Harry Shearer, Rob Reiner, Valerie Franco, CJ Vanston, Jean Cromie, Kerry Godliman', 'R', 'The now estranged bandmates of Spinal Tap are forced to reunite for one final concert, hoping it will solidify their place in the pantheon of rock ''n'' roll.', 'The now estranged bandmates of Spinal Tap are forced to reunite for one final concert, hoping it will solidify their place in the pantheon of rock ''n'' roll.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8Vg1HOlAN8pNPkUrH7Mov1KOLk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:975225'),
  ('920613828662664580', 'Spine-Chilling Short Stories Kowabana: The Reserved Seat of the Dead', 2017, 'Horror', 'Yokoyama Kazuhiro, Takehiro Kuwashima, Yuko Aramaki', null, 'Akira Iimori, Hiroyuki Takagi, Rei Toda, Keisuke Urasaka, Okamoto Yuuya', null, 'One night, he wandered into a seedy bar in a small building. The frightening and bittersweet experience he had there changed his life.... The crevices in the heart that sprout in everyone''s daily life... This is an omnibus horror film with a new sense of horror, in which a variety of stories unfold by capturing the horrors that creep into the cracks in everyone''s daily life!', 'One night, he wandered into a seedy bar in a small building. The frightening and bittersweet experience he had there changed his life.... The crevices in the heart that sprout in everyone''s daily life... This is an omnibus horror film with a new sense of horror, in which a variety of stories unfold by capturing the horrors that creep into the cracks in everyone''s daily life!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhIrwdbIrG71jK70QeBKaJV56HV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:959705'),
  ('941324835919463746', 'Spinnin''', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Eusebio Pastrana', 'Eusebio Pastrana', 'Alejandro Tous, Olaf Fernández, Agustín Ruiz, Zoraida Kroley, Eduardo Velasco, Rubén Escámez, Arantxa Valdivia, Carolina Touceda', null, 'Garate and Omar are young, gay and in love, and want to have a child. After failed attempts with their female pals, they befriend Raquel, a pregnant woman whose partner has died of aids. Sound conventional? Spinnin'' is anything but.', 'Garate and Omar are young, gay and in love, and want to have a child. After failed attempts with their female pals, they befriend Raquel, a pregnant woman whose partner has died of aids. Sound conventional? Spinnin'' is anything but.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AgkpVeF3s5tkaHOknTlZ5Xof0lP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69747'),
  ('491790778154975305', 'Spinning', 2013, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Jeremy Lasky', null, 'Cheech Marin, Tony Shalhoub, Guido Quaroni, Paul Dooley, Michael Wallis, Keith Ferguson, Lloyd Sherr', null, 'Guido discovers he has a hidden talent as a street corner sign spinner.', 'Guido discovers he has a hidden talent as a street corner sign spinner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrnf2Q6doMoFr68Ai6Y2IgF8Fel.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296137'),
