  ('200811325472186867', 'Spinning Man', 2018, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 'Simon Kaijser, Polly Morgan, Ted Campbell', 'Matthew Aldrich', 'Guy Pearce, Pierce Brosnan, Minnie Driver, Alexandra Shipp, Odeya Rush, Jamie Kennedy, Clark Gregg, Sean Blakemore', 'R', 'Evan Birch is a family man and esteemed professor at a distinguished university. When a female student goes missing, police Detective Malloy has reason to be suspicious when crucial evidence makes Evan the prime suspect in her disappearance.', 'Evan Birch is a family man and esteemed professor at a distinguished university. When a female student goes missing, police Detective Malloy has reason to be suspicious when crucial evidence makes Evan the prime suspect in her disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lb73nmpv97C4C5WXoxTE0DD7ptU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458109'),
  ('411497382915452290', 'Spinout', 1966, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Norman Taurog, Claude Binyon Jr., Daniel L. Fapp', 'George Kirgo, Theodore J. Flicker', 'Elvis Presley, Shelley Fabares, Diane McBain, Dodie Marshall, Deborah Walley, Jack Mullaney, Will Hutchins, Warren Berlinger', 'NR', 'Band singer/race driver Mike McCoy must choose between marrying a beautiful rich girl and driving her father''s car in a prestigious race.', 'Band singer/race driver Mike McCoy must choose between marrying a beautiful rich girl and driving her father''s car in a prestigious race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pgqKE56C74L0RdKcb0aq3EEGkpw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18690'),
  ('493699234015303252', 'Spiral', 2007, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Adam Green, Joel David Moore, Will Barratt', 'Jeremy Boreing, Joel David Moore', 'Joel David Moore, Amber Tamblyn, Zachary Levi, Tricia Helfer, David Muller, Annie Neal, Lori Yohe, Ryan Chase', 'PG-13', 'A reclusive telemarketer has only one semblance of a friend: His telecommuter boss. But the telemarketer''s social circle seems to improve greatly when a whimsical co-worker enters his life. Only, as he begins to sketch his new friend''s portrait, disturbing "voices" from the phone man''s past threaten to lead him into a network of destruction.', 'A reclusive telemarketer has only one semblance of a friend: His telecommuter boss. But the telemarketer''s social circle seems to improve greatly when a whimsical co-worker enters his life. Only, as he begins to sketch his new friend''s portrait, disturbing "voices" from the phone man''s past threaten to lead him into a network of destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cyzyZ8HA2zqL9C3QrpHI7QqGr0r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18467'),
  ('191357202950129300', 'Spiral', 2009, 'Drama', 'Jorge Pérez Solano', null, 'Iazua Larios, Mayra Sérbulo, Harold Torres, Ángeles Cruz, Noé Hernández, Xochiquetzatl Rodríguez', null, 'Their men went to the North in search of their destiny, while they stayed.', 'Their men went to the North in search of their destiny, while they stayed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBgSsWSbEdnZWH4oQLb61Qe7DWs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225997'),
  ('168444124497774139', 'Spiral', 2019, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Kyle Cooper, Kurtis David Harder, Bradley Stuckel', 'Colin Minihan, John Poliquin', 'Jeffrey Bowyer-Chapman, Ari Cohen, June Laporte, Ty Wood, Lochlyn Munro, Chandra West, Paul McGaffey, Thomas Elms', 'NR', 'A same-sex couple moves to a small town so they can enjoy a better quality of life and raise their 16 year-old daughter with the best social values. But nothing is as it seems in their picturesque neighborhood.', 'A same-sex couple moves to a small town so they can enjoy a better quality of life and raise their 16 year-old daughter with the best social values. But nothing is as it seems in their picturesque neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkIek8qY0tc8YxSgUs83bkWFihD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:614199'),
  ('614958829279507217', 'Spiral', 2021, 'Drama', 'Sofiene Mamdi', 'Sofiene Mamdi', 'Sofiene Mamdi, Constantin Leu, Cécile Fisera, Julien Romano, Solène Salvat, Lara Mistretta, Macha Isakova, Anthony Pho', null, 'Alexander, a young actor, has been falling for a few months in a spiral of self-destruction, becoming strongly addicted to alcohol and drugs. One night, he is stabbed by drug dealers and almost dies. To get out of his addictions he wrote the scenario of a film "Spiral" close to autofiction where he would play the main role of Daniel. Olivier Rainer, a director whom he admires, agrees to direct the movie and make Alexander pass screen tests while rewriting the script by incorporating elements of the personal life of the actor. Alexander wishing to exorcise his demons and reach his catharsis will follow Olivier unconditionally in a blistering adventure where reality and fiction merge.', 'Alexander, a young actor, has been falling for a few months in a spiral of self-destruction, becoming strongly addicted to alcohol and drugs. One night, he is stabbed by drug dealers and almost dies. To get out of his addictions he wrote the scenario of a film "Spiral" close to autofiction where he would play the main role of Daniel. Olivier Rainer, a director whom he admires, agrees to direct the movie and make Alexander pass screen tests while rewriting the script by incorporating elements of the personal life of the actor. Alexander wishing to exorcise his demons and reach his catharsis will follow Olivier unconditionally in a blistering adventure where reality and fiction merge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kiZCD78g637GOxSn9IcJRPr9PH6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:766922'),
  ('720677324982906762', 'Spiral: From the Book of Saw', 2021, 'Horror, Mystery', 'David Sparkes, Jonnie Katz, Josh Keller', 'Pete Goldfinger, Josh Stolberg', 'Chris Rock, Samuel L. Jackson, Max Minghella, Marisol Nichols, Dan Petronijevic, Richard Zeppieri, Patrick McManus, Edie Inksetter', 'R', 'Working in the shadow of an esteemed police veteran, brash Detective Ezekiel “Zeke” Banks and his rookie partner take charge of a grisly investigation into murders that are eerily reminiscent of the city’s gruesome past. Unwittingly entrapped in a deepening mystery, Zeke finds himself at the center of the killer’s morbid game.', 'Working in the shadow of an esteemed police veteran, brash Detective Ezekiel “Zeke” Banks and his rookie partner take charge of a grisly investigation into murders that are eerily reminiscent of the city’s gruesome past. Unwittingly entrapped in a deepening mystery, Zeke finds himself at the center of the killer’s morbid game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTvSDfBuXTZTdRCNduGMANd7VEP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602734'),
  ('356431239901718298', 'Spirals', 1926, 'Animation', 'Oskar Fischinger', null, null, null, 'In ''Spirals'' Oskar Fischinger designed visual patterns of extreme complexity which often develop in overlapping cycles, yet he interrupts these patterns with radical editing of single frames of contrasting imagery. ''Spirals'' exists as a fragmentary unfinished experimental film. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2001.', 'In ''Spirals'' Oskar Fischinger designed visual patterns of extreme complexity which often develop in overlapping cycles, yet he interrupts these patterns with radical editing of single frames of contrasting imagery. ''Spirals'' exists as a fragmentary unfinished experimental film. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2001.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9XKRGln5MfRAFIQbrdH3i4bnFtn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184894'),
  ('767888205345439569', 'Spirit Halloween: The Movie', 2022, 'Adventure, Family, Horror, Fantasy, Mystery', 'David Poag, Andy Kugler', 'Billie Bates', 'Donovan Colan, Jaiden J. Smith, Dylan Martin Frankel, Marissa Reyes, Rachael Leigh Cook, Billie Roy, Christopher Lloyd, Aaliyah Calloway', 'PG-13', 'A group of middle schoolers must survive a night inside a haunted Spirit Halloween store.', 'A group of middle schoolers must survive a night inside a haunted Spirit Halloween store.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akWDID6zfsWHJhGCAAcbwbytU55.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:961427'),
  ('900883479814390749', 'Spirit in the Blood', 2024, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Carly May Borgstrom, Zamarin Wahdat, Brooklyn Harker', null, 'Sarah-Maxine Racicot, Michael Wittenborn, Summer H. Howell, Greg Bryk, Sarah Abbott, Lyla Elliott, Ariadne Deibert, Michelle Monteith', null, 'After a young girl is found dead in a secluded religious mountain community, a pack of teenage girls decide to fight against the evil spirits they believe killed her by embracing their own dark nature.', 'After a young girl is found dead in a secluded religious mountain community, a pack of teenage girls decide to fight against the evil spirits they believe killed her by embracing their own dark nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rEGnHwe4BqiARrjzcan6tmIisK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1275003'),
  ('493666146545078499', 'Spirit of Ecstasy', 2023, 'Drama', 'Héléna Klotz, Victor Seguin, Julien Flick', 'Jacques Audiard', 'Claire Pommet, Niels Schneider, Sofiane Zermani, Anna Mouglalis, Grégoire Colin, Mathieu Amalric, Irina Lellouche-Klotz, Gabriel Merz Chammah', null, 'A gender-questioning stock market trader is determined to make it in the world of finance — not for the glory or wealth, but because it''s leading them on the path to freedom.', 'A gender-questioning stock market trader is determined to make it in the world of finance — not for the glory or wealth, but because it''s leading them on the path to freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PYcEv6Z9zTff6ZFPhw7lSqOKpC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001245'),
  ('768830978054818282', 'Spirit Trap', 2005, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Adrian Curelea, Stuart St. Paul, Tudor Cotovelea', 'Phil O''Shea', 'Billie Piper, Luke Mably, Sam Troughton, Emma Catherwood, Chiké Okonkwo, Robert Goodman, Alsu, Oxana Moravec', 'R', 'When five young students move into an old unoccupied mansion an inexplicable chain of events is set into motion as a mysterious spirit clock begins to tick again. As the story unfolds, revealing each student''s dark secrets, the boundary between the real world and the afterlife is no longer clear. Will they find a way to escape or will they be trapped with the spirits forever?', 'When five young students move into an old unoccupied mansion an inexplicable chain of events is set into motion as a mysterious spirit clock begins to tick again. As the story unfolds, revealing each student''s dark secrets, the boundary between the real world and the afterlife is no longer clear. Will they find a way to escape or will they be trapped with the spirits forever?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYlBOIJOwUdgeSHDwk40RGSxSK5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22060'),
  ('828786341749604998', 'Spirit Untamed', 2021, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Western', 'Robert Edward Crawford, Elaine Bogan, Ennio Torresan Jr.', 'John Fusco', 'Isabela Merced, Julianne Moore, Marsai Martin, Mckenna Grace, Walton Goggins, Jake Gyllenhaal, Gary A. Hecker, Eiza González', 'PG', 'Lucky Prescott''s life is changed forever when she moves from her home in the city to a small frontier town and befriends a wild mustang named Spirit.', 'Lucky Prescott''s life is changed forever when she moves from her home in the city to a small frontier town and befriends a wild mustang named Spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLE2mvuvhvzmSICOsqR9uE50Ave.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:637693'),
  ('1121589245374541920', 'Spirit World', 2025, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Eric Khoo, Adrian Tan', 'Edward Khoo', 'Catherine Deneuve, Yutaka Takenouchi, Masaaki Sakai, Jun Fubuki, Denden, Kenichi Suzuki, Maiya Goshima, Haruto Yoshida', null, 'Legendary singer Claire Emery flies to Japan for a final sold-out concert. But when the show ends, so does Claire’s life on earth. However, an unexpected new life in the spirit world - where she will be guided by Yuzo, one of her biggest fans - awaits.', 'Legendary singer Claire Emery flies to Japan for a final sold-out concert. But when the show ends, so does Claire’s life on earth. However, an unexpected new life in the spirit world - where she will be guided by Yuzo, one of her biggest fans - awaits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYFJkDIjJVLy1Ma4lMRA9x37HbR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1229385'),
  ('274529797598093504', 'Spirit: Stallion of the Cimarron', 2002, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Drama, Western', 'Kelly Asbury, Lorna Cook, Jamie Lloyd', 'John Fusco, Michael Lucker', 'Matt Damon, James Cromwell, Daniel Studi, Chopper Bernet, Jeff LeBeau, John Rubano, Richard McGonagle, Matt Levin', 'G', 'A captured mustang remains determined to return to his herd no matter what.', 'A captured mustang remains determined to return to his herd no matter what.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUgYrz4twiJ3QgVGpRfey984NIB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9023'),
  ('69807121510135168', 'Spirited', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Kramer Morgenthau, Sean Anders', 'Sean Anders, John Morris', 'Will Ferrell, Ryan Reynolds, Octavia Spencer, Patrick Page, Sunita Mani, Loren G. Woods, Tracy Morgan, Joe Tippett', 'PG-13', 'Each Christmas Eve, the Ghost of Christmas Present selects one dark soul to be reformed by a visit from three spirits. But this season, he picked the wrong Scrooge. Clint Briggs turns the tables on his ghostly host until Present finds himself reexamining his own past, present and future.', 'Each Christmas Eve, the Ghost of Christmas Present selects one dark soul to be reformed by a visit from three spirits. But this season, he picked the wrong Scrooge. Clint Briggs turns the tables on his ghostly host until Present finds himself reexamining his own past, present and future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3zAzTMs5EP3cKusOxFNGSFE1WI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:632856'),
  ('227519455737092707', 'Spirited Away', 2001, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Hayao Miyazaki, Atsushi Okui, Kitaro Kosaka', 'Goro Miyazaki', 'Rumi Hiiragi, Miyu Irino, Mari Natsuki, Takashi Naito, Yasuko Sawaguchi, Tatsuya Gashûin, Ryunosuke Kamiki, Yumi Tamai', 'PG', 'A young girl, Chihiro, becomes trapped in a strange new world of spirits. When her parents undergo a mysterious transformation, she must call upon the courage she never knew she had to free her family.', 'A young girl, Chihiro, becomes trapped in a strange new world of spirits. When her parents undergo a mysterious transformation, she must call upon the courage she never knew she had to free her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39wmItIWsg5sZMyRUHLkWBcuVCM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129'),
  ('1008753733171863494', 'Spirited Killer', 1994, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Towatchai Ladloy, Panna Rittikrai', 'Neung', 'Panna Rittikrai, Tony Jaa, Banlu Srisaeng', null, 'A group of travelers visiting the exotic forests of Thailand is suddenly attacked by a multi-weapon wielding maniac. Some manage to escape, others perish under his merciless blows. The maniac is the Spirited Killer, a forest dweller who kills anyone who steps into his jungle.', 'A group of travelers visiting the exotic forests of Thailand is suddenly attacked by a multi-weapon wielding maniac. Some manage to escape, others perish under his merciless blows. The maniac is the Spirited Killer, a forest dweller who kills anyone who steps into his jungle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kfGeKCpEP8PVjyvAMWPVl3eN3up.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24946'),
  ('895373897073707086', 'Spiritism', 1962, 'Horror', 'Benito Alazraki, Enrique Wallace', 'Guillermo Calderón, Rafael García Travesí', 'José Luis Jiménez, Nora Veryán, Beatriz Aguirre, Alicia Caro, Carmelita González, Antonio Bravo, Jorge Mondragón, Jorge Russek', null, 'Satan gives a woman three wishes in this version of the classic tale, "The Monkey''s Paw."', 'Satan gives a woman three wishes in this version of the classic tale, "The Monkey''s Paw."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Dx2UrKIsTLgohGArr89iCHYvwj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92791'),
  ('688136695109746788', 'Spirits', 1990, 'Horror', 'Fred Olen Ray, Gary Graver', 'Fred Olen Ray, T.L. Lankford', 'Erik Estrada, Robert Quarry, Brinke Stevens, Oliver Darrow, Kathrin Middleton, Carol Lynley, Kaitlin Hopkins, Michelle Bauer', null, 'A priest, trying to regain his standing in the church after "falling" and sleeping with a woman, teams with a group of ESP experts to investigate a haunted house. It doesn''t help that one of the experts is a beautiful young woman.', 'A priest, trying to regain his standing in the church after "falling" and sleeping with a woman, teams with a group of ESP experts to investigate a haunted house. It doesn''t help that one of the experts is a beautiful young woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFZXhI41Wpr1zts40TeroWIQ7u6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30773'),
  ('426253787467758843', 'Spirits of the Air, Gremlins of the Clouds', 1988, 'Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Alex Proyas, Kit Quarry, David Knaus', 'Alex Proyas', 'Michael Lake, Melissa Davis, Boyd Norman, Rhys Davis', null, 'A religious brother and sister endure alone together in the post-apocalyptic Outback, until the sudden arrival of a stranger who helps them build a crude plane to fly out of the desert.', 'A religious brother and sister endure alone together in the post-apocalyptic Outback, until the sudden arrival of a stranger who helps them build a crude plane to fly out of the desert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/krD8aIWPfmUT3ZxEm41RB8m9qFi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108049'),
  ('744335917864867902', 'Spirits of the Dead', 1968, 'Horror, Mystery, Drama', 'Federico Fellini, Louis Malle, Roger Vadim', 'Roger Vadim, Pascal Cousin, Clement Biddle Wood', 'Brigitte Bardot, Alain Delon, Jane Fonda, Terence Stamp, Peter Fonda, James Robertson Justice, Salvo Randone, Françoise Prévost', null, 'Anthology film from three European directors based on stories by Edgar Allan Poe: a cruel countess haunted by a ghostly horse, a sadistic young man haunted by his double, and an alcoholic actor haunted by the Devil.', 'Anthology film from three European directors based on stories by Edgar Allan Poe: a cruel countess haunted by a ghostly horse, a sadistic young man haunted by his double, and an alcoholic actor haunted by the Devil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9HmCwfPG7URPSXSrmEAFN65VoWE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41225'),
  ('825119233589087536', 'Spirits'' Homecoming', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Cho Jung-lae, Yi Seung-hyeon, Kang Sang-hyup', 'Cho Jung-lae', 'Kang Ha-na, Choi Ri, Seo Mi-ji, Son Sook, Yi Seung-hyeon, Im Seong-cheol, Jeong Mu-seong, Lee Yoo-rin', 'NR', 'After the Japanese kidnap two Korean teenagers and take them to a comfort station to join other girls who are serving as sex slaves, only one of them survives. Decades later, the elderly woman tries to reunite with her friend''s spirit.', 'After the Japanese kidnap two Korean teenagers and take them to a comfort station to join other girls who are serving as sex slaves, only one of them survives. Decades later, the elderly woman tries to reunite with her friend''s spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yO8Z1Sl1iyhMZq01k7walZvWIBe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384641'),
  ('161564206168797963', 'Spiritual Constructions', 1927, 'Animation', 'Oskar Fischinger', null, null, null, 'One of Oskar Fischinger''s earliest films, Seelische Konstruktionen (as it is known in German), clearly points the way to the masterpieces of musically-blended experimental animation he would conceive in the decades to come. The sense of masterful timing and rhythm, the easy and natural -- though patently Fischinger-esque -- character traits of the subjects, and the smooth precision of both line and movement are all present already. Unique is the black-silhouetted, semi-cartoon characters (not nearly as rigidly self-contained as Lotte Reiniger''s cut-out forms) which seem to adhere to no physical limitations whatsoever. Morphing into shapes, structures, objects, patterns, and even one another, as though they were made of pure mercury and set to music. As for the "story", it''s rather non-sensical, and certainly silly, but also has a slightly dark and devious tinge to it as well; men becoming monsters, uncontrollable shape-shifting and the constant, almost desperate movement.', 'One of Oskar Fischinger''s earliest films, Seelische Konstruktionen (as it is known in German), clearly points the way to the masterpieces of musically-blended experimental animation he would conceive in the decades to come. The sense of masterful timing and rhythm, the easy and natural -- though patently Fischinger-esque -- character traits of the subjects, and the smooth precision of both line and movement are all present already. Unique is the black-silhouetted, semi-cartoon characters (not nearly as rigidly self-contained as Lotte Reiniger''s cut-out forms) which seem to adhere to no physical limitations whatsoever. Morphing into shapes, structures, objects, patterns, and even one another, as though they were made of pure mercury and set to music. As for the "story", it''s rather non-sensical, and certainly silly, but also has a slightly dark and devious tinge to it as well; men becoming monsters, uncontrollable shape-shifting and the constant, almost desperate movement.', null, 'tmdb:movie:189867'),
  ('362673846002809569', 'Spiritual Kung Fu', 1978, 'Action', 'Lo Wei, Chen Jung-Shu', 'Pan Lei', 'Jackie Chan, James Tien Chun, Wu Wen-Siu, Li Kun, Dean Shek Tin, Mu Szu-Cheng, Lee Hae-ryong, Wong Ching', null, 'Jackie Chan plays the part of the class clown in a shaolin temple whose deadliest secret is stolen. All is lost until Jackie''s character discovers dancing blue ghosts with bright red hair who haunt the library.', 'Jackie Chan plays the part of the class clown in a shaolin temple whose deadliest secret is stolen. All is lost until Jackie''s character discovers dancing blue ghosts with bright red hair who haunt the library.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NwhAvXqaVDacl3fvXlfsYXt8Dw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18760'),
  ('456930040026071049', 'Spiritual Trinity', 1991, 'Horror', 'Ng Min-Kan', null, 'Lam Ching-Ying, Kent Cheng Jak-Si, Pauline Wong, Gigi Lai Chi, Chin Shih-Erh, Bonnie Fu Yuk-Jing, Peter Chan Lung, Hon Chun', null, 'Two ghostexterminators have been married for many years. But they encounter a ghost they can not manage on their own and therefore ask the wife''s old boyfriend for help. This leads to a love triangle while the ghost is stronger than they had imagined.', 'Two ghostexterminators have been married for many years. But they encounter a ghost they can not manage on their own and therefore ask the wife''s old boyfriend for help. This leads to a love triangle while the ghost is stronger than they had imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMf9h6tMqEtiVdPrfFw7uhGH5h2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104639'),
  ('196661456145666715', 'Spiritual Voices', 1995, 'Documentary', 'Aleksandr Sokurov, Sergey Moshkov, Aleksandr Burov', 'Aleksandr Sokurov', null, null, 'In 1994, Alexander Sokurov accompanied Russian troops assigned to a frontier military post at the Tajikistan/Afghanistan border to film their experiences. While unnamed tribal forces occasionally engaged the troops in skirmishes, Sokurov’s haunting documentary chronicles the downtime between activity.', 'In 1994, Alexander Sokurov accompanied Russian troops assigned to a frontier military post at the Tajikistan/Afghanistan border to film their experiences. While unnamed tribal forces occasionally engaged the troops in skirmishes, Sokurov’s haunting documentary chronicles the downtime between activity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwMdsyJJFEEGOt6eeTcD7rE6wmY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130646'),
  ('430316307678061183', 'Spiritwalker', 2021, 'Action, Mystery, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Lee Seong-je, Lee Byeong-hoon, Yoon Jae-geun', 'Yoon Jae-geun', 'Yoon Kye-sang, Park Yong-woo, Lim Ji-yeon, Yoo Seung-mok, Park Ji-hwan, Lee Sung-wook, Hong Gi-jun, Seo Hyun-woo', null, 'Unable to remember anything about his life, a man begins regaining consciousness in a new body every 12 hours. Now, he must piece together his identity, all while evading attacks from pursuing agents and dangerous criminals alike.', 'Unable to remember anything about his life, a man begins regaining consciousness in a new body every 12 hours. Now, he must piece together his identity, all while evading attacks from pursuing agents and dangerous criminals alike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pufGxcWEyADFcoqeDcJlAAVX0Fl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602295'),
  ('129667152428396352', 'Spirou & Fantasio''s Big Adventures', 2018, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Alexandre Coffre, Jean-François Hensgens', 'Juliette Sales, Fabien Suarez, Alexandre Coffre', 'Thomas Solivérès, Alex Lutz, Ramzy Bedia, Géraldine Nakache, Christian Clavier, Charlotte Gabris, Vincent Desagnat, Monsieur Poulpe', null, 'When Spirou, supposedly a bellhop in a Palace, meets Fantasio, reporter scupper, everything starts very hard … and rather badly!', 'When Spirou, supposedly a bellhop in a Palace, meets Fantasio, reporter scupper, everything starts very hard … and rather badly!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etvxFMkSvAWtbaCwEwpWcyGK6JZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437316'),
  ('723694866296239000', 'Spite Marriage', 1929, 'Comedy', 'Edward Sedgwick, Buster Keaton, Reggie Lanning', null, 'Buster Keaton, Dorothy Sebastian, Edward Earle, Leila Hyams, William Bechtel, Jack Byron, Joe Bordeaux, Ray Cooke', null, 'An unimpressive but well-intentioned man is given the chance to marry a popular actress, of whom he has been a hopeless fan. But what he doesn''t realize is that he is being used to make the actress'' old flame jealous.', 'An unimpressive but well-intentioned man is given the chance to marry a popular actress, of whom he has been a hopeless fan. But what he doesn''t realize is that he is being used to make the actress'' old flame jealous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXt4ilTxsrY5a1Lagp1TE79vIvN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51303'),
