  ('1033434095138483367', 'Spitfire Over Berlin', 2022, 'War, Action, History', 'Callum Burn', 'Callum Burn, Andrew Burn', 'Kris Saddler, Tom Gordon, David Dobson, Vin Hawke', null, 'August 1944. With the American Eighth Air Force poised to strike over Nazi Germany, British Intelligence learns that they could be flying into a deadly trap. With only hours to spare, Flight Lieutenant Edward Barnes must fly a life and death mission over Berlin in his unarmed Spitfire to obtain photographic evidence and save the lives of 1200 men.', 'August 1944. With the American Eighth Air Force poised to strike over Nazi Germany, British Intelligence learns that they could be flying into a deadly trap. With only hours to spare, Flight Lieutenant Edward Barnes must fly a life and death mission over Berlin in his unarmed Spitfire to obtain photographic evidence and save the lives of 1200 men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xtPPOPTad1qopK6uDe3VlYUa22o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:976906'),
