  ('1071972673426845677', 'Splash', 1984, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy', 'Ron Howard, Jan R. Lloyd, Doug Metzger', 'Lowell Ganz, Babaloo Mandel, Bruce Jay Friedman', 'Tom Hanks, Daryl Hannah, Eugene Levy, John Candy, Dody Goodman, Shecky Greene, Richard B. Shull, Bobby Di Cicco', 'PG', 'A successful businessman falls in love with the girl of his dreams. There''s one big complication though; he''s fallen hook, line and sinker for a mermaid.', 'A successful businessman falls in love with the girl of his dreams. There''s one big complication though; he''s fallen hook, line and sinker for a mermaid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7FutTsMWBwVhjk1Ujf1wtndUVZh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2619'),
