  ('861254695914200470', 'Splatter University', 1984, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Richard W. Haines, Fred Cohen, Jim Grib', 'John Elias Michalakis, Miljan Peter Ilich, Richard W. Haines', 'Forbes Riley, Ric Randig, Dick Biel, Kathy Lacommare, Mary Ellen David, Laura Gold, Ken Gerson, Sal Lumetta', 'R', 'A sociology instructor finds her new teaching duties at a private college interrupted by the presence of a killer.', 'A sociology instructor finds her new teaching duties at a private college interrupted by the presence of a killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cJqS0Qyk9QZDvIojWKye9VhuwtO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30996'),
  ('341574153988137678', 'Splatter: Naked Blood', 1996, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Hisayasu Satō, Akiko Ashizawa', 'Taketoshi Watari', 'Misa Aika, Yumika Hayashi, Mika Kirihara, Sadao Abe, Masumi Nakao, Tadashi Shiraishi, Seiya Hiramatsu', null, 'A scientist taints his mother''s scientific experiment with his own drug that transforms pain into a pleasurable experience. Unfortunately for the three women involved in the experiment, the drug works a little bit too well.', 'A scientist taints his mother''s scientific experiment with his own drug that transforms pain into a pleasurable experience. Unfortunately for the three women involved in the experiment, the drug works a little bit too well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCLPovhiuoiKoN3JLUAlKQ7D5SL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36075'),
  ('606784297494692510', 'Splendor', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Ettore Scola, Luciano Tovoli', 'Ettore Scola', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Massimo Troisi, Marina Vlady, Paolo Panelli, Pamela Villoresi, Mauro Bosco, Ferruccio Castronuovo, Vernon Dobtcheff', null, 'Splendor is the name of an old movie theater managed by Jordan (Mastroianni), who inherited it from his father. The theater is in decay and only generates debts and trouble, but Jordan gets aid in his almost quixotian quest from projectionist Luigi (Troisi) and ushurette Chantale (Vlady). However, Jordan is finally forced to sell the Splendor to businessman Lo Fazio (Piperno), which plans to transform it in some kind of furniture store. When Jordan leaves the theater for the last time (the very first scene), he recalls the glorious days of Splendor and movies in general.', 'Splendor is the name of an old movie theater managed by Jordan (Mastroianni), who inherited it from his father. The theater is in decay and only generates debts and trouble, but Jordan gets aid in his almost quixotian quest from projectionist Luigi (Troisi) and ushurette Chantale (Vlady). However, Jordan is finally forced to sell the Splendor to businessman Lo Fazio (Piperno), which plans to transform it in some kind of furniture store. When Jordan leaves the theater for the last time (the very first scene), he recalls the glorious days of Splendor and movies in general.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83j7YRrgNQev6lexFX7hg8RmxRc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58526'),
  ('134943801843721872', 'Splendor', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gregg Araki, Jim Fealy, Tim Brown', 'Gregg Araki', 'Kathleen Robertson, Johnathon Schaech, Matt Keeslar, Kelly Macdonald, Eric Mabius, Dan Gatto, Linda Kim, Audrey Ruttan', 'R', 'Veronica is a white-bread beauty searching for a good man in Los Angeles. While slam dancing at a Halloween rave, she meets Abel, a sensitive poet. Then she meets Zed, a supersexy tattooed drummer with incredible biceps. Who will she choose? Does she go for true love or cheap sex? She can''t decide so she chooses both. But after managing to nurture a picture-perfect threesome, along comes Ernest, a rich movie director with deep baby blues that sweep Veronica off her feet. What''s a girl to do now?', 'Veronica is a white-bread beauty searching for a good man in Los Angeles. While slam dancing at a Halloween rave, she meets Abel, a sensitive poet. Then she meets Zed, a supersexy tattooed drummer with incredible biceps. Who will she choose? Does she go for true love or cheap sex? She can''t decide so she chooses both. But after managing to nurture a picture-perfect threesome, along comes Ernest, a rich movie director with deep baby blues that sweep Veronica off her feet. What''s a girl to do now?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8HoMVS7mSbfOLdjW7C764olnFZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35122'),
  ('514347578473714922', 'Splendor in the Grass', 1961, 'Drama, Romance', 'Elia Kazan, Boris Kaufman, Ulu Grosbard', 'William Inge', 'Natalie Wood, Warren Beatty, Pat Hingle, Audrey Christie, Barbara Loden, Zohra Lampert, Fred Stewart, John McGovern', 'NR', 'A fragile Kansas girl''s unrequited and forbidden love for a handsome young man from the town''s most powerful family drives her to heartbreak and madness.', 'A fragile Kansas girl''s unrequited and forbidden love for a handsome young man from the town''s most powerful family drives her to heartbreak and madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6Kw8Ui93SMhrk1MupCFwUg04vq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28569'),
  ('557772705817966511', 'Splice', 2010, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Vincenzo Natali, Sam Hudecki, Tetsuo Nagata', 'Antoinette Terry Bryant, Vincenzo Natali, Doug Taylor', 'Adrien Brody, Sarah Polley, Delphine Chanéac, David Hewlett, Abigail Chu, Stephanie Baird, Brandon McGibbon, Amanda Brugel', 'R', 'Elsa and Clive, two young rebellious scientists, defy legal and ethical boundaries and forge ahead with a dangerous experiment: splicing together human and animal DNA to create a new organism. Named "Dren", the creature rapidly develops from a deformed female infant into a beautiful but dangerous winged human-chimera, who forges a bond with both of her creators - only to have that bond turn deadly.', 'Elsa and Clive, two young rebellious scientists, defy legal and ethical boundaries and forge ahead with a dangerous experiment: splicing together human and animal DNA to create a new organism. Named "Dren", the creature rapidly develops from a deformed female infant into a beautiful but dangerous winged human-chimera, who forges a bond with both of her creators - only to have that bond turn deadly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oqaWnO3dKYAt3vZWAD4oLfOXOC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37707'),
  ('1039186300814613564', 'Splinter', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller, Crime, Science Fiction', 'Toby Wilkins, Nelson Cragg, Carla Marie Rugg', 'Kai Barry, Ian Shorr', 'Jill Wagner, Charles Baker, Rachel Kerbs, Paulo Costanzo, Shea Whigham, Laurel Whitsett', 'R', 'When their plans for a nature trip go awry, Polly and boyfriend Seth decide to check into a motel. On their way, they''re carjacked and kidnapped by low-rent crooks Dennis and Lacey, who take the victims and their SUV to a nearby gas station. Along the way, they encounter an increasingly terrifying horde of parasites, and if any of them intend to survive, they''ll have to outsmart the deadly organisms.', 'When their plans for a nature trip go awry, Polly and boyfriend Seth decide to check into a motel. On their way, they''re carjacked and kidnapped by low-rent crooks Dennis and Lacey, who take the victims and their SUV to a nearby gas station. Along the way, they encounter an increasingly terrifying horde of parasites, and if any of them intend to survive, they''ll have to outsmart the deadly organisms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7L6wgAPHtBUbJorBv5Kx8238a0h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13220'),
  ('994654932585170242', 'Splinterheads', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Brant Sersen, Michael Simmonds', 'Brant Sersen', 'Thomas Middleditch, Rachael Taylor, Christopher McDonald, Lea Thompson, Dean Winters, Frankie Faison, Edmund Lyndeck, Pamela Shaw', null, 'SPLINTERHEADS introduces Thomas Middleditch as Justin Frost, a twenty-something slacker whose “thing” is that he has no “thing” at all. When a small-time carnival rolls into town, he meets Galaxy (Rachael Taylor), a gorgeous con artist, or “splinterhead,” who has more “things” going for her than anyone he has ever met.', 'SPLINTERHEADS introduces Thomas Middleditch as Justin Frost, a twenty-something slacker whose “thing” is that he has no “thing” at all. When a small-time carnival rolls into town, he meets Galaxy (Rachael Taylor), a gorgeous con artist, or “splinterhead,” who has more “things” going for her than anyone he has ever met.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s42ZWpwdWKo7KpJhYLYdL6UEPPm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24385'),
  ('90366988169833842', 'Splinters', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Natalia Garayalde, Julieta Seco', 'Natalia Garayalde', 'Esteban Garayalde, Natalia Garayalde', null, 'On 3 November 1995, the Rio Tercero Military Factory exploded in Cordoba, prompting thousands of projectiles to fire and spread in the surrounding villages, in a tragedy that would leave seven dead and hundreds injured and affected. At the time, Natalia Garayalde was a twelve-year-old girl who lived with her family near the place, and he was still playing filming with the video camera her father had bought, when she recorded the immediate moments of the burst, while her family escaped the explosions, as well as the daily activities of the village in the days and weeks that follow. Twenty-five years later, that material captured from a girl''s candid and surprised gaze it becomes a thoughtful and painful testimony about the family, the destruction of a city, the traces of horror, the sinister truth about the case.', 'On 3 November 1995, the Rio Tercero Military Factory exploded in Cordoba, prompting thousands of projectiles to fire and spread in the surrounding villages, in a tragedy that would leave seven dead and hundreds injured and affected. At the time, Natalia Garayalde was a twelve-year-old girl who lived with her family near the place, and he was still playing filming with the video camera her father had bought, when she recorded the immediate moments of the burst, while her family escaped the explosions, as well as the daily activities of the village in the days and weeks that follow. Twenty-five years later, that material captured from a girl''s candid and surprised gaze it becomes a thoughtful and painful testimony about the family, the destruction of a city, the traces of horror, the sinister truth about the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/petrOvupCNkpSTOB4RODx95bgru.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763180'),
  ('1087264089907487972', 'Split', 1989, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Chris Shaw, Chris Shaw', 'Chris Shaw', 'Timothy Dwight, Joan Bechtel, John J. Flynn, Chris Shaw, John Martel, Jack Wiley, Barbara Horscraft, Debra Gordon', 'NR', 'A man is on the run from a Big Brother-like security force.', 'A man is on the run from a Big Brother-like security force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXS89dhUPiMLhOmiXWc2t3U8pH8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227430'),
  ('627361654015598361', 'Split', 2016, 'Fantasy, Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Deborah Kampmeier, Alison Kelly', 'Deborah Kampmeier', 'Amy Ferguson, Morgan Spector, Anna Mouglalis, Fredric Lehne, Raïna von Waldenburg, Antonia Campbell-Hughes, Joan MacIntosh, Jennifer Onvie', null, 'The story of a young woman who takes an epic journey to claim her own darkness and sexuality so she can stop putting it into the hands of her abusive lover. When Inanna, a young actress, working as a stripper, becomes obsessed with a mask maker, she sacrifices parts of herself and her life, piece by piece, in order to win his love. At the same time she enters a mythic journey in the theater. One that forces her to face the many abuses endured by women around that world and that blurs her performance, her dreams and her real life and results in a provocative and powerful confrontation that frees her. -- from official website', 'The story of a young woman who takes an epic journey to claim her own darkness and sexuality so she can stop putting it into the hands of her abusive lover. When Inanna, a young actress, working as a stripper, becomes obsessed with a mask maker, she sacrifices parts of herself and her life, piece by piece, in order to win his love. At the same time she enters a mythic journey in the theater. One that forces her to face the many abuses endured by women around that world and that blurs her performance, her dreams and her real life and results in a provocative and powerful confrontation that frees her. -- from official website', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8nn3m1wyu3woLg2tW1CAr44q53K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358364'),
  ('1109910638130597747', 'Split', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller', 'M. Night Shyamalan, Nicole Agostino, Mike Gioulakis', 'M. Night Shyamalan', 'James McAvoy, Anya Taylor-Joy, Haley Lu Richardson, Jessica Sula, Betty Buckley, Izzie Coffey, Brad William Henke, Sebastian Arcelus', 'PG-13', 'Though Kevin has evidenced 23 personalities to his trusted psychiatrist, Dr. Fletcher, there remains one still submerged who is set to materialize and dominate all the others. Compelled to abduct three teenage girls led by the willful, observant Casey, Kevin reaches a war for survival among all of those contained within him — as well as everyone around him — as the walls between his compartments shatter apart.', 'Though Kevin has evidenced 23 personalities to his trusted psychiatrist, Dr. Fletcher, there remains one still submerged who is set to materialize and dominate all the others. Compelled to abduct three teenage girls led by the willful, observant Casey, Kevin reaches a war for survival among all of those contained within him — as well as everyone around him — as the walls between his compartments shatter apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lli31lYTFpvxVBeFHWoe5PMfW5s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381288'),
  ('305754140049837022', 'Split Decisions', 1988, 'Drama', 'David Drury, Tim Suhrstedt', 'David Fallon', 'Gene Hackman, Craig Sheffer, Carmine Caridi, Jennifer Beals, Jeff Fahey, John McLiam, Eddie Velez, James Tolkan', 'R', 'When a boxer is killed because he wouldn''t take a dive, his brother tries to find a way to avenge him even if only symbolically.', 'When a boxer is killed because he wouldn''t take a dive, his brother tries to find a way to avenge him even if only symbolically.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7pKZmcbByBcTK8JwsMt0cfsI37N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93457'),
  ('55060506965593405', 'Split Image', 1982, 'Drama', 'Ted Kotcheff, Robert C. Jessup', 'Robert Kaufman, Robert Mark Kamen, Scott Spencer', 'Michael O''Keefe, Karen Allen, Peter Fonda, James Woods, Elizabeth Ashley, Brian Dennehy, Ronnie Scribner, Pamela Ludwig', 'R', 'An impressionable young man finds himself enslaved by a modern-day religious cult. In an effort to bring him back to reality, the boy''s parents hire a deprogrammer to kidnap him and return him to his family.', 'An impressionable young man finds himself enslaved by a modern-day religious cult. In an effort to bring him back to reality, the boy''s parents hire a deprogrammer to kidnap him and return him to his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5cwOd5VQvjCgWWPvp915xxliVfb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52777'),
