  ('235494446184650832', 'Splitsville', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Michael Angelo Covino, Adam Newport-Berra, Alejandro Valbuena', 'Michael Angelo Covino, Kyle Marvin', 'Kyle Marvin, Michael Angelo Covino, Dakota Johnson, Adria Arjona, Nicholas Braun, David Castañeda, O-T Fagbenle, Charlie Gillespie', 'R', 'After Ashley asks for a divorce, good-natured Carey runs to his friends, Julie and Paul, for support. He’s shocked to discover that the secret to their happiness is an open marriage, that is until Carey crosses the line and throws all of their relationships into chaos.', 'After Ashley asks for a divorce, good-natured Carey runs to his friends, Julie and Paul, for support. He’s shocked to discover that the secret to their happiness is an open marriage, that is until Carey crosses the line and throws all of their relationships into chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxCv6kUdywxYzIXX6xYcmX5APUV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1337562'),
