  ('1088760208865397174', 'Splitting Heirs', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Robert Young, Tony Pierce-Roberts, Trevor Wright', 'Eric Idle', 'Rick Moranis, Eric Idle, Barbara Hershey, Catherine Zeta-Jones, John Cleese, Sadie Frost, Stratford Johns, Brenda Bruce', 'PG-13', 'A member of the English upper class dies, leaving his estate and his business to an American, whom he thinks is his son who was lost as a baby and then found again. An Englishman who thinks he is an Indian comes to believe that he is actually the heir. He comes to hate the American who is his boss, his friend, and the man who has stolen the woman after whom he lusts.', 'A member of the English upper class dies, leaving his estate and his business to an American, whom he thinks is his son who was lost as a baby and then found again. An Englishman who thinks he is an Indian comes to believe that he is actually the heir. He comes to hate the American who is his boss, his friend, and the man who has stolen the woman after whom he lusts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bOxCNid7ZLB9SoUkIGhWKfDqrZy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20339'),
  ('189017100854450732', 'Spoiled Brats', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Tristan Tortuyaux, Nicolas Cuche', 'Nicolas Cuche, Laurent Turner', 'Gérard Jugnot, Camille Lou, Artus, Louka Meliava, François Morel, Tom Leeb, Clara Joly, Jean-Baptiste Sagory', null, 'The billionaire is tired of the whims of his own children and decides to teach them a lesson. He announces to them that he has become bankrupt. Now spoiled teenagers will have to do what they have never done: go to work, learn to love and value life.', 'The billionaire is tired of the whims of his own children and decides to teach them a lesson. He announces to them that he has become bankrupt. Now spoiled teenagers will have to do what they have never done: go to work, learn to love and value life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nW5LHayHlbavYD6XRM9SjKi55uu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:671043'),
  ('299885843921734081', 'Spoiled Children', 1977, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Bertrand Tavernier, Alain Levent, Claude Othnin-Girard', 'Bertrand Tavernier, Charlotte Dubreuil, Christine Pascal', 'Michel Piccoli, Christine Pascal, Michel Aumont, Gérard Jugnot, Arlette Bonnard, Liza Braconnier, Geneviève Mnich, Florence Haguenauer', null, 'Successful writer/director Bernard Rougerie is at a creative dead end and decides to isolate himself from his wife in order to complete the script for his next film. Bernard moves into an apartment building whose tenants are in the midst of a revolt against their abusive landlord. Reluctant at first, he joins their cause and then becomes involved in an affair with young, unemployed resident Anne.', 'Successful writer/director Bernard Rougerie is at a creative dead end and decides to isolate himself from his wife in order to complete the script for his next film. Bernard moves into an apartment building whose tenants are in the midst of a revolt against their abusive landlord. Reluctant at first, he joins their cause and then becomes involved in an affair with young, unemployed resident Anne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4AOdd8F3SqeXKgf7JW7IPv9dvpL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2060'),
  ('11240944052398610', 'Spoiler Alert', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Kit Bland, Brian Burgoyne, Michael Showalter', 'David Marshall Grant, Dan Savage', 'Jim Parsons, Ben Aldridge, Sally Field, Bill Irwin, Nikki M. James, Jeffery Self, Josh Pais, Antoni Porowski', 'PG-13', 'Journalist Michael Ausiello embarks on a rollercoaster ride of emotions when Kit Cowan, his partner of 14 years, is diagnosed with terminal cancer.', 'Journalist Michael Ausiello embarks on a rollercoaster ride of emotions when Kit Cowan, his partner of 14 years, is diagnosed with terminal cancer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6FQtqoIP7JUqc9hRwQQfuYG2kz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507903'),
  ('852589440700044781', 'SpongeBob SquarePants Presents The Tidal Zone', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure', 'Dave Cunningham, Sherm Cohen, Brandon Warren', 'Kaz, Mr. Lawrence, Andrew Goodman', 'Tom Kenny, Bill Fagerbakke, Rodger Bumpass, Clancy Brown, Mr. Lawrence, Jill Talley, Carolyn Lawrence, Lori Alan', null, 'GrandPat travels through alternate dimensions and timelines to get home.', 'GrandPat travels through alternate dimensions and timelines to get home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nKucyECwkf7MuU1GyWcf2S8SuMQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1088812'),
  ('144470792479418940', 'SpongeBob Squarepants: Kreepaway Kamp', 2024, 'TV Movie, Family, Comedy, Horror, Animation', 'Dave Cunningham, Fred Osmond, Kurt Snyder', 'Mike Bell, Bobby Gaylor, Danny Giovannini', 'Tom Kenny, Bill Fagerbakke, Rodger Bumpass, Clancy Brown, Carolyn Lawrence, Mr. Lawrence, Lori Alan, Carlos Alazraqui', 'NR', 'While at Kamp Koral for a reunion, SpongeBob and the gang are stalked by a mysterious figure lurking in the shadows as campers start disappearing one by one!', 'While at Kamp Koral for a reunion, SpongeBob and the gang are stalked by a mysterious figure lurking in the shadows as campers start disappearing one by one!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUOCmqkbCX94znDJNtSy1402Sie.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1354627'),
  ('48411259268207675', 'Sponsor', 2025, 'Drama', 'Albert Langitan', null, 'Angela Morena, Mon Confiado, Micaella Raz, Krista Miller, Jem Milton, Van Allen Ong, Vic Romano, Mark Dionisio', null, 'A movie about sisters who use their bodies to survive. To support her family, Jasmine becomes a sugar baby to a businessman. She regrets her choice as she learns that that it would put her and her sister''s life in danger.', 'A movie about sisters who use their bodies to survive. To support her family, Jasmine becomes a sugar baby to a businessman. She regrets her choice as she learns that that it would put her and her sister''s life in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Opn9aPs8UCBJQ6lqou3i8f9omC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1421198'),
  ('1042816308337209547', 'Spontaneous', 2020, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Quincy Wheeler, David Heimbecker, Benjamin Gardere', 'Brian Duffield', 'Katherine Langford, Charlie Plummer, Yvonne Orji, Hayley Law, Piper Perabo, Rob Huebel, Marlowe Percival, Laine MacNeil', 'R', 'When students in their high school begin inexplicably exploding (literally), seniors Mara and Dylan struggle to survive in a world where each moment may be their last.', 'When students in their high school begin inexplicably exploding (literally), seniors Mara and Dylan struggle to survive in a world where each moment may be their last.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhDICM8YxuDn9241O2UVEe9DupC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:604578'),
  ('702534785494029462', 'Spontaneous Combustion', 1990, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Tobe Hooper, Levie Isaacks', 'Howard Goldberg, Tobe Hooper', 'Brad Dourif, Cynthia Bain, Jon Cypher, William Prince, Melinda Dillon, Dey Young, Tegan West, Michael Keys Hall', 'R', 'A young man learns that his parents had been used in an atomic-weapons experiment shortly before his birth, and that the results have had some unexpected effects on him.', 'A young man learns that his parents had been used in an atomic-weapons experiment shortly before his birth, and that the results have had some unexpected effects on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44RKxTOBEJggUK9jHzsaIWFb668.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39195'),
  ('127570162981048938', 'Spook Chasers', 1957, 'Comedy', 'George Blair, Austen Jewell, Lindsley Parsons Jr.', 'Elwood Ullman', 'Huntz Hall, Stanley Clements, Percy Helton, William Henry, Darlene Fields, Eddie LeRoy, David Gorcey, Jimmy Murphy', null, 'Sach and the gang (Bowery Boys) find stashed cash in an old farmhouse apparently haunted.', 'Sach and the gang (Bowery Boys) find stashed cash in an old farmhouse apparently haunted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdMtJylP9QWzTJ6wq6uG6a0Bkgb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177252'),
  ('412909535037149261', 'Spook Louder', 1943, 'Comedy', 'Del Lord', 'Clyde Bruckman', 'Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Curly Howard, Lew Kelly, Stanley Brown, Theodore Lorch, Charles Middleton, Stanley Blystone', 'NR', 'The stooges are door-to-door salesman peddling a weight reducing machine, until they come to the house of an eccentric inventor, where they are mistaken for new caretakers, are left to guard his house, and must contend with enemy spies and a mysterious pie thrower.', 'The stooges are door-to-door salesman peddling a weight reducing machine, until they come to the house of an eccentric inventor, where they are mistaken for new caretakers, are left to guard his house, and must contend with enemy spies and a mysterious pie thrower.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47e0gLujkNYHUc077ycYcZFyah1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116073'),
  ('660861618881453274', 'Spook Sport', 1940, 'Animation, Music, Horror', 'Norman McLaren, Mary Ellen Bute, Ted Nemeth', null, null, null, 'It''s midnight in a graveyard. The principal characters are spooks, ghosts, bats, bells, and, at the end, the sun. As midnight strikes, 12 spooks appear, then two ghosts. They move to the music''s rhythm. Against the black night, they are blue and yellow. Bats appear as does a xylophone of bones. Mist rises, spooks swirl. A bell tolls. The sky turns light blue, the ghosts'' dance slows. Then black night returns bringing intimations of frenzy. Bones play snare drums; spooks peek out of square graves. Scary faces appear. Frenetic movement takes over. A rooster crows and all return to earth as the sun''s light appears.', 'It''s midnight in a graveyard. The principal characters are spooks, ghosts, bats, bells, and, at the end, the sun. As midnight strikes, 12 spooks appear, then two ghosts. They move to the music''s rhythm. Against the black night, they are blue and yellow. Bats appear as does a xylophone of bones. Mist rises, spooks swirl. A bell tolls. The sky turns light blue, the ghosts'' dance slows. Then black night returns bringing intimations of frenzy. Bones play snare drums; spooks peek out of square graves. Scary faces appear. Frenetic movement takes over. A rooster crows and all return to earth as the sun''s light appears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/icoQUnW0dj6w2hMhvcqa4QZJvLn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215221'),
  ('930228200879209299', 'Spookies', 1986, 'Horror', 'Genie Joseph, Robert Chappell, Brendan Faulkner', 'Thomas Doran, Genie Joseph, Brendan Faulkner', 'Felix Ward, Maria Pechukas, Dan Scott, Alec Nemser, A.J. Lowenthal, Pat Wesley Bryan, Peter Dain, Nick Gionta', 'R', 'Taking a wrong turn, travelers find themselves trapped in a mysterious house. One horror after another threatens them, as the sorcerer who lives within needs sacrifices to give eternal life to his beautiful bride.', 'Taking a wrong turn, travelers find themselves trapped in a mysterious house. One horror after another threatens them, as the sorcerer who lives within needs sacrifices to give eternal life to his beautiful bride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YOxFseJaJnAPdISzckZkPNIUwD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26679'),
  ('970688992742997160', 'Spooks', 1930, 'Animation, Comedy, Horror', 'Walter Lantz', null, 'Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Late in the evening, just as a skeleton puts out its cat for the night, the masked Phantom stalks the graveyard, pausing only to insult an overly inquisitive owl. The Phantom enters the local opera house and falls in love with Kitty, a feline singer who is terribly jealous of the star of the show, a husky-voiced hippo. The Phantom falls in love with Kitty at first sight. For her sake, he sabotages the hippo (by popping and deflating her). Then he puts a phonograph player down Kitty''s skirt. She walks out and pretends the recording is her own voice. Even though the record skips and, moments later, slows down to a stop (forcing the Phantom to crank the machine for her), Kitty is a hit. But does she appreciate the Phantom? No. Backstage, she jumps into the arms of Oswald the Rabbit. Enraged, the Phantom grabs Kitty and takes her down with him to the catacombs underneath the stage. Oswald goes on a rescue mission.', 'Late in the evening, just as a skeleton puts out its cat for the night, the masked Phantom stalks the graveyard, pausing only to insult an overly inquisitive owl. The Phantom enters the local opera house and falls in love with Kitty, a feline singer who is terribly jealous of the star of the show, a husky-voiced hippo. The Phantom falls in love with Kitty at first sight. For her sake, he sabotages the hippo (by popping and deflating her). Then he puts a phonograph player down Kitty''s skirt. She walks out and pretends the recording is her own voice. Even though the record skips and, moments later, slows down to a stop (forcing the Phantom to crank the machine for her), Kitty is a hit. But does she appreciate the Phantom? No. Backstage, she jumps into the arms of Oswald the Rabbit. Enraged, the Phantom grabs Kitty and takes her down with him to the catacombs underneath the stage. Oswald goes on a rescue mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Ba1aJJBiQpvOSSZgWGEJextsUv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88520'),
  ('922591969031491119', 'Spooks Run Wild', 1941, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Phil Rosen, Arthur Hammond', 'Carl Foreman, Charles R. Marion', 'Bela Lugosi, Leo Gorcey, Bobby Jordan, Huntz Hall, Dorothy Short, Sunshine Sammy Morrison, Dave O''Brien, David Gorcey', null, 'A group of delinquents on their way to summer camp get stuck in a haunted house.', 'A group of delinquents on their way to summer camp get stuck in a haunted house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3VVWorEdYRXRSDZuvyB03opQmNk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43796'),
  ('842186129297883550', 'Spooks: The Greater Good', 2015, 'Thriller, Action', 'Bharat Nalluri, Tom Ackerley, Richard Oxford', 'Jonathan Brackley, Sam Vincent', 'Peter Firth, Kit Harington, Elyes Gabel, Jennifer Ehle, Tim McInnerny, Tuppence Middleton, Eleanor Matsuura, David Harewood', 'R', 'During a handover to the head of counter-terrorism of MI5, Harry Pearce, a terrorist escapes custody. When Harry disappears soon after, his protégé is tasked with finding out what happened as an impending attack on London looms, and eventually uncovers a deadly conspiracy.', 'During a handover to the head of counter-terrorism of MI5, Harry Pearce, a terrorist escapes custody. When Harry disappears soon after, his protégé is tasked with finding out what happened as an impending attack on London looms, and eventually uncovers a deadly conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bpK63x3M7uFtoIetK5YniHXLE28.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292040'),
  ('1139220856104469504', 'Spooks!', 1953, 'Comedy', 'Jules White, Lester White, Eddie Saeta', 'Felix Adler', 'Shemp Howard, Larry Fine, Moe Howard, Norma Randall, Philip Van Zandt, Tom Kennedy, Steve Calvert, Frank Mitchell', null, 'The stooges are private detectives hired to find a missing girl. The boys disguise as pie salesmen and end up wandering around a mad scientist''s mansion, trying to find the girl. The boys confront a gorilla and various other bad guys, before rescuing the girl.', 'The stooges are private detectives hired to find a missing girl. The boys disguise as pie salesmen and end up wandering around a mad scientist''s mansion, trying to find the girl. The boys confront a gorilla and various other bad guys, before rescuing the girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArQrFekV0nARoBdlDA1ktZuyI1P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116817'),
  ('93668033117773033', 'Spooky Buddies', 2011, 'Comedy, Family, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Robert Vince, Mike Southon', 'Anna McRoberts, Robert Vince', 'Genevieve Hannelius, Sierra McCormick, Sage Ryan, Debra Jo Rupp, Skyler Gisondo, Tucker Albrizzi, Elisa Donovan, Nico Ghisi', 'PG', 'The nefarious Warwick the Warlock has returned from his astral imprisonment, and plans to make the final sacrifice for ultimate power - all he needs is the soul of a pure heart. The Buddies, alongside their new spectral friend Pip, race against the clock to defeat the sorcerer, who has enlisted the Halloween Hound to do his dirty work under the cover of the neighborhood festivities.', 'The nefarious Warwick the Warlock has returned from his astral imprisonment, and plans to make the final sacrifice for ultimate power - all he needs is the soul of a pure heart. The Buddies, alongside their new spectral friend Pip, race against the clock to defeat the sorcerer, who has enlisted the Halloween Hound to do his dirty work under the cover of the neighborhood festivities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cC6NleO3bn2FgFpkJx1RQvjccWL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70587'),
  ('598432528985071716', 'Spoonful of Sugar', 2022, 'Horror', 'Mercedes Bryce Morgan', 'Leah Saint Marie', 'Morgan Saylor, Kat Foster, Myko Olivier, Danilo Crovetti, David Yow, Christiana Montoya, Keith Powell, Shon Wilson', 'NR', 'Millicent, working on her thesis about children with severe allergies, is hired to babysit little Johnny, a sickly, mute child who suffers from every allergy under the sun. As she discovers Johnny’s dark family secrets, things begin to become unhinged.', 'Millicent, working on her thesis about children with severe allergies, is hired to babysit little Johnny, a sickly, mute child who suffers from every allergy under the sun. As she discovers Johnny’s dark family secrets, things begin to become unhinged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q4cLHdAJCHqAWIIplCHEyG6JgrR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1015081'),
  ('303851891299940488', 'Spoor', 2017, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Agnieszka Holland, Jolanta Dylewska, Rafał Paradowski', 'Olga Tokarczuk, Agnieszka Holland', 'Agnieszka Mandat, Wiktor Zborowski, Jakub Gierszał, Patrycja Volny, Miroslav Krobot, Borys Szyc, Andrzej Grabowski, Andrzej Konopka', null, 'A story about Janina Duszejko, an elderly woman, who lives alone in the Klodzko Valley where a series of mysterious crimes are committed. Duszejko is convinced that she knows who (or what) is the murderer, but nobody believes her.', 'A story about Janina Duszejko, an elderly woman, who lives alone in the Klodzko Valley where a series of mysterious crimes are committed. Duszejko is convinced that she knows who (or what) is the murderer, but nobody believes her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8a3rRg9hMp1swcejSGbUSDdSFl1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432799'),
  ('685453717039703550', 'Sport Goofy in Soccermania', 1987, 'Animation', 'Darrell Van Citters, Matthew O''Callaghan', null, 'Tony Pope, Will Ryan, Russi Taylor, Jack Angel, Phil Proctor, Chick Hearn', 'G', 'Uncle Scrooge donates an old beat-up trophy for Huey, Dewey and Louie''s soccer tournament. But when he finds out that it is actually worth a million dollars, he has to put together a ragtag team, led by Goofy to win it back.', 'Uncle Scrooge donates an old beat-up trophy for Huey, Dewey and Louie''s soccer tournament. But when he finds out that it is actually worth a million dollars, he has to put together a ragtag team, led by Goofy to win it back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJf6nXs39bChHUYLaBqHSXUrKvY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157132'),
  ('21610184479263150', 'Sport, Sport, Sport', 1970, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Elem Klimov, Boris Brozhovsky, Yuri Skhirtladze', 'German Klimov, Bella Akhmadulina', 'Zinoviy Gerdt, Yevgeny Matveyev, Nikita Mikhalkov, Larisa Shepitko, Vladimir Andreyev', null, 'Combining staged scenes, newsreel footage, and documentary episodes, the history of the development of sports is presented, showing the stadiums of Moscow, Philadelphia, Stockholm and Mexico City in the past and future.', 'Combining staged scenes, newsreel footage, and documentary episodes, the history of the development of sports is presented, showing the stadiums of Moscow, Philadelphia, Stockholm and Mexico City in the past and future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpTstaa5dOmGtVTJiFHesM0l1tc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67869'),
