  ('109662554540597506', 'Spotlight on a Murderer', 1961, 'Mystery', 'Georges Franju, Marcel Fradetal', 'Pierre Boileau, Thomas Narcejac, Georges Franju', 'Pierre Brasseur, Pascale Audret, Marianne Koch, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Dany Saval, Jean Babilée, Georges Rollin, Gérard Buhr', null, 'An old count hides just before he dies to annoy his heirs. The heirs search a manor for the count''s body and are killed off one by one. Jean-Marie, his fiancée Micheline, and Edwige investigate the deaths and search for the count''s body.', 'An old count hides just before he dies to annoy his heirs. The heirs search a manor for the count''s body and are killed off one by one. Jean-Marie, his fiancée Micheline, and Edwige investigate the deaths and search for the count''s body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m98DYNJRh4Wi56HyUxM2LKQl3VU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65610'),
  ('1127765524384682369', 'Spotlight on Christmas', 2020, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Ali Liebert, Dan Dumouchel, Damion Harper', 'Juliana Wimbles', 'Tori Anderson, Victor Zinck, Jr., Matthew James Dowden, Lia Frankland, Janet Kidder, Patti Allan, Michael St. John Smith, Celina Martin', 'NR', 'Dumped two weeks before Christmas, actress Olivia O’Hara secretly returns to her tiny hometown to hide out, eat cookies and avoid the press. What she doesn’t expect is to be faced with the family she left behind, meeting a charming new guy Casey Rawlins, and a nosy reporter following her every move.', 'Dumped two weeks before Christmas, actress Olivia O’Hara secretly returns to her tiny hometown to hide out, eat cookies and avoid the press. What she doesn’t expect is to be faced with the family she left behind, meeting a charming new guy Casey Rawlins, and a nosy reporter following her every move.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7VOErjeOwTz0YMiODDBUU74bTw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:744945'),
  ('470926425086785817', 'Spotswood', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mark Joffe, Tony Gilbert, Ellery Ryan', 'Andrew Knight, Max Dann', 'Anthony Hopkins, Ben Mendelsohn, Alwyn Kurts, Bruno Lawrence, John Walton, Rebecca Rigg, Toni Collette, Russell Crowe', null, 'Wallace is an efficiency expert, managing the high-profile downsizing of a major auto parts factory. But when he is hired to evaluate a small moccasin factory which seems from another era, Wallace has to reconsider the rapid modernization he advocates, as he is confronted by the human faces such plans hurt.', 'Wallace is an efficiency expert, managing the high-profile downsizing of a major auto parts factory. But when he is hired to evaluate a small moccasin factory which seems from another era, Wallace has to reconsider the rapid modernization he advocates, as he is confronted by the human faces such plans hurt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7YiAgDrraufIDlwAFU3fKtm0Hz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16982'),
  ('965695376516449852', 'Sprawa się rypła', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Janusz Kidawa', 'Janusz Kidawa', 'Franciszek Pieczka, Anna Miesiączek, Roch Sygitowicz, Justyna Pilarz, Jerzy Korcz, Liliana Czarska, Wawrzyn Pytlarz, Janusz Paździorko', null, 'During the USSR''s rule over Poland, highlander Józef Placek and his family have to convince the government that his late mother is, in fact, alive. If successful, they will be able to pocket the gifts that have been issued to her for reaching the ripe old age of 100, thus inspiring his neighbor''s, Kadela''s, jealousy.', 'During the USSR''s rule over Poland, highlander Józef Placek and his family have to convince the government that his late mother is, in fact, alive. If successful, they will be able to pocket the gifts that have been issued to her for reaching the ripe old age of 100, thus inspiring his neighbor''s, Kadela''s, jealousy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eW3jNVgdSRnEti17FAp4A4szdlD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:405963'),
  ('619480486643702611', 'Spray of the Days', 1968, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Charles Belmont', 'Charles Belmont, Philippe Dumarçay, Pierre Pelegri', 'Jacques Perrin, Marie-France Pisier, Sami Frey, Alexandra Stewart, Annie Buron, Bernard Fresson, Sacha Briquet, Moune de Rivel', null, 'Chick fell in love with Alise because of a shared passion for writer Jean-Sol Partre who gradually devoured their relationship. Soon after, Colin, the main character, also falls in love with a young girl, Chloe, but after their marriage she soon suffers from a strange illness: a water lily grows in her lungs.', 'Chick fell in love with Alise because of a shared passion for writer Jean-Sol Partre who gradually devoured their relationship. Soon after, Colin, the main character, also falls in love with a young girl, Chloe, but after their marriage she soon suffers from a strange illness: a water lily grows in her lungs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTOJ5ZLQaYWP0GCqQukMNeRwty5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217602'),
  ('1030196456750522857', 'Spread', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Mackenzie, Steven Poster, Irina Bryson', 'Jason Hall', 'Ashton Kutcher, Anne Heche, Margarita Levieva, Sebastian Stan, Ashley Johnson, Sonia Rockwell, Rachel Blanchard, Shane Brolly', 'R', 'A gigolo must contend with the prospect that he has found true love.', 'A gigolo must contend with the prospect that he has found true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27iaV68VjKWQabPhnklWD1kCqb1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19918'),
  ('274546825513477477', 'Spread Your Wings', 2019, 'Adventure, Family', 'Nicolas Vanier, Rémi Bouvier, Olivier Horlait', 'Matthieu Petit, Christian Moullec', 'Jean-Paul Rouve, Louis Vazquez, Mélanie Doutey, Frédéric Saurel, Lilou Fogli, Grégori Baquet, Dominique Pinon, Philippe Magnan', null, 'Christian, a visionary scientist, studies wild geese. For his son, a teenager obsessed with video games, the idea of spending a holiday with his father in the wilderness is a nightmare. However, father and son will get together around a crazy project: save a species endangered, thanks to the ultralight of Christian! Then begins an incredible and perilous journey ...', 'Christian, a visionary scientist, studies wild geese. For his son, a teenager obsessed with video games, the idea of spending a holiday with his father in the wilderness is a nightmare. However, father and son will get together around a crazy project: save a species endangered, thanks to the ultralight of Christian! Then begins an incredible and perilous journey ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6GqD6MabPjvPrJeTmRmgd896Py.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589982'),
  ('1013300110018488587', 'Spree', 2020, 'Comedy, Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Littleton Odom, Aaron Teeters, Casey Nicholas Price', 'Gene McHugh, Eugene Kotlyarenko', 'Joe Keery, Sasheer Zamata, David Arquette, A.J. Del Cueto, Andy Faulkner, Honor Levy, Sara Lassner, Linas Phillips', 'NR', 'Desperate for an online following, a rideshare driver has figured out a deadly plan to go viral and he will stop at nothing to get his five minutes of fame.', 'Desperate for an online following, a rideshare driver has figured out a deadly plan to go viral and he will stop at nothing to get his five minutes of fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tbYvzpy4QFhUHRBHe4VeUKJst96.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653598'),
  ('519371402373331581', 'Spriggan', 1998, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Hisashi Eguchi, Katsumi Matsuda, Masaaki Endou', 'Yasutaka Itô, Hirotsugu Kawasaki', 'Showtaro Morikubo, Ken Shiroyama, Takehito Koyasu, Katsumi Suzuki, Sakiko Tamagawa, Kinryu Arimoto, Ryuji Aigase, Kenji Takano', 'R', 'An elite superhuman agent must stop a foreign military unit from seizing control of an ancient artifact that holds the key to ultimate power.', 'An elite superhuman agent must stop a foreign military unit from seizing control of an ancient artifact that holds the key to ultimate power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nX2sgumjpBkEMzGFSMdBZMCiVgX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16767'),
  ('287293027881104298', 'Spring', 1947, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Grigori Aleksandrov, Yuri Yekelchik, Konstantin Petrichenko', 'Grigori Aleksandrov, Moris Slobodskoy, Aleksandr Raskin', 'Lyubov Orlova, Nikolai Cherkasov, Mikhail Sidorkin, Faina Ranevskaya, Rostislav Plyatt, Rina Zelyonaya, Nikolai Konovalov, Garen Zhukovskaya', null, 'A drab woman scientist, working on machine to harness solar energy, and a pert concert singer look-alike being courted to play her in a movie swap identities and find personal growth, professional success, love, and happiness.', 'A drab woman scientist, working on machine to harness solar energy, and a pert concert singer look-alike being courted to play her in a movie swap identities and find personal growth, professional success, love, and happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5cpd9lvVoO54br61EBB6B9SGian.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100638'),
  ('862997381499618418', 'Spring', 1970, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Arvo Kruusement, Harry Rehe, Mall Jaakson', 'Kaljo Kiisk, Voldemar Panso', 'Arno Liiver, Riina Hein, Aare Laanemets, Margus Lepa, Leonhard Merzin, Ain Lutsepp, Rein Aedma, Kalle Eomois', null, 'Paunvere parish school students Arno and Teele, Toots and Kiir, Tõnisson and Imelik experience feelings during one school winter, the traces of which they carry throughout their future lives - from true friendship and first love to self-discovery and clarifying life goals.', 'Paunvere parish school students Arno and Teele, Toots and Kiir, Tõnisson and Imelik experience feelings during one school winter, the traces of which they carry throughout their future lives - from true friendship and first love to self-discovery and clarifying life goals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/miB1rYhgp7FUalSLeRAWyMYeNvc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46809'),
  ('128533520099588782', 'Spring', 1971, 'Drama', 'Marcel Hanoun', 'Marcel Hanoun', 'Michael Lonsdale, Raymonde Godeau, Véronique Andriès, Catherine Binet, Anne-Marie Ramier, Guy Brémond, Maurice Poullenot, Julien Etchevery', null, 'One of four Hanoun films that take their titles from the seasons of the year, SPRING tells two parallel stories: a man, fleeing the forces of order, takes refuge in the forest, while a young girl living with her grandmother in a nearby village approaches the threshold of adolescence, and begins to discover both the world and herself. - Anthology Film Archive', 'One of four Hanoun films that take their titles from the seasons of the year, SPRING tells two parallel stories: a man, fleeing the forces of order, takes refuge in the forest, while a young girl living with her grandmother in a nearby village approaches the threshold of adolescence, and begins to discover both the world and herself. - Anthology Film Archive', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wiHLmyz6qPYfF4VAwPkiKJSX1Xw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233183'),
  ('999648867829492282', 'Spring', 2014, 'Horror, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Aaron Moorhead, Justin Benson, Aaron Moorhead', 'Justin Benson', 'Lou Taylor Pucci, Nadia Hilker, Nick Nevern, Augie Duke, Jeremy Gardner, Vinny Curran, Holly Hawkins, Vanessa Bednar', null, 'A young man in a personal tailspin flees the US to Italy, where he sparks up a romance with a woman harboring a dark, primordial secret.', 'A young man in a personal tailspin flees the US to Italy, where he sparks up a romance with a woman harboring a dark, primordial secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGiyGOHAtB0dZFirNbiTWapOpQG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241855'),
  ('3860890647150081', 'Spring and Port Wine', 1970, 'Drama', 'Peter Hammond, Norman Warwick', 'Bill Naughton', 'James Mason, Diana Coupland, Hannah Gordon, Susan George, Rodney Bewes, Len Jones, Keith Buckley, Avril Elgar', null, 'A stern father and lenient mother try to deal with the ups and downs of their four children''s lives in working class Bolton, England.', 'A stern father and lenient mother try to deal with the ups and downs of their four children''s lives in working class Bolton, England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kO1McmrXypeixIwXCtjDjIhiIpU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157031'),
  ('233966397090373994', 'Spring Bears Love', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Yong-ih, Nam Jin-a', 'Hwang Jo-yoon', 'Bae Doona, Kim Nam-jin, Yoon Ji-hye, Lim Hyun-kyung, Yoon Jong-shin, Uhm Tae-woong, Oh Kwang-rok, Lee Hyun-kyoung', null, 'A connected series of love notes scribbled in library art books convinces grocery store clerk Hyun-chae that a mystery man, known only as ''Vincent'', is pursuing a relationship with her. Meanwhile, a friend from her high-school days, subway driver Dong-ha, has relocated to Seoul to pursue a relationship with her.', 'A connected series of love notes scribbled in library art books convinces grocery store clerk Hyun-chae that a mystery man, known only as ''Vincent'', is pursuing a relationship with her. Meanwhile, a friend from her high-school days, subway driver Dong-ha, has relocated to Seoul to pursue a relationship with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hzi3vKMRlSzKrSF9Ea87MWDW2aC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32774'),
  ('741068217017783317', 'Spring Blossom', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Suzanne Lindon, Jérémie Attard, Natalia Ducrey', 'Suzanne Lindon', 'Suzanne Lindon, Arnaud Valois, Florence Viala, Frédéric Pierrot, Rebecca Marder, Arturo Giusi, Dominique Besnehard, Philippe Uchan', null, 'A 16-year-old girl, bored with her own age group, becomes involved with an older man at a theater she passes.', 'A 16-year-old girl, bored with her own age group, becomes involved with an older man at a theater she passes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/HLoCMVvU36t3uvm1KSPhSZQyG4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:712134'),
  ('558569861377008543', 'Spring Break', 1983, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Sean S. Cunningham, Steven Poster', 'David Smilow', 'David Knell, Perry Lang, Paul Land, Steve Bassett, Jayne Modean, Corinne Wahl, Richard B. Shull, Jessica James', 'R', 'Two sets of two college guys spend a spring break together in Fort Lauderdale, Florida. There they have lots of fun in and out of the sun.', 'Two sets of two college guys spend a spring break together in Fort Lauderdale, Florida. There they have lots of fun in and out of the sun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pC12FUSDIYIraix7BTjtW5ewNU9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21148'),
  ('494826629436371177', 'Spring Break Shark Attack', 2005, 'Action, Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Paul Shapiro, Michael Alan Brierley', 'James LaRosa', 'Shannon Lucio, Riley Smith, Justin Baldoni, Kathy Baker, Bryan Brown, Bianca Lishansky, Genevieve Howard, Warren McAslan', null, 'A young teenager travels to Florida, unknowing that a group of dangerous tiger sharks are ravaging the beach.', 'A young teenager travels to Florida, unknowing that a group of dangerous tiger sharks are ravaging the beach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqIIwaYI4to46Cc29as0BCECqNO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44732'),
  ('272631441288117987', 'Spring Breakdown', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Ryan Shiraki, Frankie DeMarco, Michael Viglietta', 'Rachel Dratch, Ryan Shiraki', 'Amy Poehler, Parker Posey, Rachel Dratch, Amber Tamblyn, Seth Meyers, Will Arnett, Rachel Hamilton, Harley Adams', 'R', 'Three women in their thirties head to a popular Spring Break destination and try to relive the Spring Break they never had.', 'Three women in their thirties head to a popular Spring Break destination and try to relive the Spring Break they never had.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9wU95xHvsWl7ZRMhUeXBOkpExY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18826'),
  ('148508728015289865', 'Spring Breakers', 2013, 'Drama, Crime', 'Benoît Debie, Harmony Korine, Krystian Lagowski', 'Harmony Korine', 'James Franco, Selena Gomez, Vanessa Hudgens, Ashley Benson, Rachel Anna Simon, Gucci Mane, Heather Morris, Ash Lendzion', 'R', 'After four college girls rob a restaurant to fund their spring break in Florida, they get entangled with a weird dude with his own criminal agenda.', 'After four college girls rob a restaurant to fund their spring break in Florida, they get entangled with a weird dude with his own criminal agenda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tyPnyEkL44qbAliM9jMRWc6bjg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122081'),
  ('538352748869416584', 'Spring Fever', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lou Ye, Zeng Jian', 'Mei Feng', 'Qin Hao, Chen Sicheng, Tan Zhuo, Wu Wei, Jiaqi Jiang, Zhang Songwen, Huang Xuan, Sun Qiang', null, 'Hired to spy on a philandering husband, Luo Haitao soon becomes entangled in a clandestine affair with the other man. Along with Luo''s girlfriend, they succumb to the delirium of drunken nights, but how long can their tryst last?', 'Hired to spy on a philandering husband, Luo Haitao soon becomes entangled in a clandestine affair with the other man. Along with Luo''s girlfriend, they succumb to the delirium of drunken nights, but how long can their tryst last?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OLJx4JHimNTsRIw7Y0ObzJouP9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117646'),
  ('782702419141841557', 'Spring Garden', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Ku Tae-jin', null, 'Jo Yoon-hee, Kim Joo-ryoung, Heo Dong-won, Jeong In-kyeom, Choo Ye-jin', null, 'So-hee, who enjoys a blissful life with her loving husband, and a baby on the way, wakes up in bed to find her husband hung himself right above her. Before she can process his death and the shock that caused her to lose her baby, she discovers that her husband left her a house in a remote area. How come she never knew about this place? This mysterious house has everything the couple hoped for in their dream house, but once the glamor wears off, an eerie feeling remains. As So-hee feels that a strange presence is going after her life, she begins to get suspicious and believes this house has something to do with her husband’s death. The more she doubts, the more strange things happen.', 'So-hee, who enjoys a blissful life with her loving husband, and a baby on the way, wakes up in bed to find her husband hung himself right above her. Before she can process his death and the shock that caused her to lose her baby, she discovers that her husband left her a house in a remote area. How come she never knew about this place? This mysterious house has everything the couple hoped for in their dream house, but once the glamor wears off, an eerie feeling remains. As So-hee feels that a strange presence is going after her life, she begins to get suspicious and believes this house has something to do with her husband’s death. The more she doubts, the more strange things happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0P2ZZccZ5HaxqUU32aVEouZAdi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977156'),
  ('1034208824228586930', 'Spring in a Small Town', 1948, 'Drama, Romance', 'Fei Mu, Li Shengwei', 'Li Tian-Ji', 'Wei Wei, Yu Shi, Li Wei, Cui Chaoming, Zhang Hongmei', null, 'A married couple living in a desolate small town in post-WWII China are paid a surprise visit by an old friend of the husband''s.', 'A married couple living in a desolate small town in post-WWII China are paid a surprise visit by an old friend of the husband''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kRiHwa1p7FDkPBxjjFNMY8pjc1f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21058'),
  ('985888527182337489', 'Spring Night, Summer Night', 1967, 'Drama', 'Joseph L. Anderson, Art Stifel, Brian Blauser', 'Doug Rapp, Joseph L. Anderson, Franklin Miller', 'Larue Hall, Ted Heimerdinger, Marjorie Johnson, John Crawford, Betty Ann Parady, Mary Cass, Ron Parady, Bob Jones', null, 'Carl and Jessie are half siblings who feel trapped by the existential and economic pressures of living in the small mining town of Canaan, Ohio. Their shared rebellion soon takes on the form of an illicit love affair depicted in interwoven sequences of lusty poeticism and ethnographic vérité. When Jessie becomes pregnant, the tension between the couple’s youthful vitality and the dire realities of rural society leads to consequences both despairing and hopeful.', 'Carl and Jessie are half siblings who feel trapped by the existential and economic pressures of living in the small mining town of Canaan, Ohio. Their shared rebellion soon takes on the form of an illicit love affair depicted in interwoven sequences of lusty poeticism and ethnographic vérité. When Jessie becomes pregnant, the tension between the couple’s youthful vitality and the dire realities of rural society leads to consequences both despairing and hopeful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxBrwqpanMNImAQWFYiSi7vHzli.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333202'),
  ('504293880681592707', 'Spring on Zarechnaya Street', 1956, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marlen Khutsiyev, Feliks Mironer, Radomir Vasilevsky', 'Feliks Mironer', 'Nina Ivanova, Nikolai Rybnikov, Vladimir Gulyaev, Valentina Pugachova, Gennadiy Yukhtin, Rimma Shorokhova, Nikolai Klyuchnev, Marina Gavrilko', null, 'The story unfolds in an industrial town where a young and charming literature teacher arrives, assigned to teach at an evening school. One of the boys from the metallurgical plant falls in love with the educated girl, but communication between the two young people turns out to be quite challenging.', 'The story unfolds in an industrial town where a young and charming literature teacher arrives, assigned to teach at an evening school. One of the boys from the metallurgical plant falls in love with the educated girl, but communication between the two young people turns out to be quite challenging.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cC6hpSIkWAGwIvAhF2R4ahN350w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54970'),
  ('1064050722832786676', 'Spring Parade', 1940, 'Comedy, Music', 'Henry Koster, Joseph A. Valentine', 'Felix Jackson, Bruce Manning', 'Deanna Durbin, Robert Cummings, Mischa Auer, Henry Stephenson, S.Z. Sakall, Walter Catlett, Anne Gwynne, Peggy Moran', 'NR', 'In this light and lovely romantic musical, a Hungarian woman attends a Viennese fair and buys a card from a gypsy fortune teller. It says that she will meet someone important and is destined for a happy marriage. Afterward she gets a job as a baker''s assistant. She then meets a handsome army drummer who secretly dreams of becoming a famous composer and conductor. Unfortunately the military forbids the young corporal to create his own music. But then Ilonka secretly sends one of the drummer''s waltzes to the Austrian Emperor with his weekly order of pastries. Her act paves the way toward the tuneful and joyous fulfillment of the gypsy''s prediction.', 'In this light and lovely romantic musical, a Hungarian woman attends a Viennese fair and buys a card from a gypsy fortune teller. It says that she will meet someone important and is destined for a happy marriage. Afterward she gets a job as a baker''s assistant. She then meets a handsome army drummer who secretly dreams of becoming a famous composer and conductor. Unfortunately the military forbids the young corporal to create his own music. But then Ilonka secretly sends one of the drummer''s waltzes to the Austrian Emperor with his weekly order of pastries. Her act paves the way toward the tuneful and joyous fulfillment of the gypsy''s prediction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLeEGQyFz9l8ZhjCxxxYFrcrgVf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218312'),
  ('98126240145027260', 'Spring Subway', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Zhang Yibai, Zhao Xiaoding, Gao Fei', 'Liu Fendou', 'Geng Le, Xu Jinglei, Gao Yuanyuan, Fan Wei, Zhang Yang, Wang Ning', null, 'A stylish urban romance about the silent suffering of a modern Chinese couple.', 'A stylish urban romance about the silent suffering of a modern Chinese couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kiVDVvOdok7W8Bi4QX7cnqZg3i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64156'),
  ('756248871127493734', 'Spring Swallow', 1989, null, 'Chen Yao-chi, Lin Wen-Chin', 'Hsi Sung, Pi Ko', 'Lu Hsiao-Fen, Chang Fu-Chien, Ma Jingtao', null, 'The story depicts a dwarf who wanted to get married. Through the arrangement of his family, he was going to marry a girl, Peach. Peach rejected him in the beginning and gradually she was touched by his talents and thoughtfulness and finally accepted him.', 'The story depicts a dwarf who wanted to get married. Through the arrangement of his family, he was going to marry a girl, Peach. Peach rejected him in the beginning and gradually she was touched by his talents and thoughtfulness and finally accepted him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGkBk6dgYqHpQ8vzrmAD8i1jIwZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505588'),
  ('1034706920608760911', 'Spring Tide', 1990, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Eddie Thomas Petersen, Dirk Brüel, Johan Carlsen', 'Eddie Thomas Petersen', 'Jesper Gredeli Jensen, Trine Dyrholm, Kirsten Olesen, Peter Schrøder, Jannie Faurschou, Rasmus With, Lars Lohmann, Finn Nørbygaard', null, 'Franco lives in a rough part of Copenhagen. His hooker mother has little time for him. Franco drifts into a life of crime, repeatedly confronting the authorities. To give him a new start, he’s placed in a foster home far away from Copenhagen. His new family greets him with warm hospitality. There’s also the beautiful countryside and, last but not least, the teen-aged daughter', 'Franco lives in a rough part of Copenhagen. His hooker mother has little time for him. Franco drifts into a life of crime, repeatedly confronting the authorities. To give him a new start, he’s placed in a foster home far away from Copenhagen. His new family greets him with warm hospitality. There’s also the beautiful countryside and, last but not least, the teen-aged daughter', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUSi71L69LrzFBbhALBSVyAQPMe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21973'),
  ('562460298704872894', 'Spring Wind', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Tamás Yvan Topolánszky, Claudia Sümeghy', null, 'Péter Magyar, Kriszta Bódis, Ervin Nagy, Andrea Rost, Márk Radnai', null, 'Follows the birth of a political and social movement from the inside, with Péter Magyar as its face. For more than a year, the filmmakers accompanied him on country tours, campaign sites, and background conversations, as well as being present in those quiet, intimate moments – many times in his own home – that have remained hidden from the public until now.', 'Follows the birth of a political and social movement from the inside, with Péter Magyar as its face. For more than a year, the filmmakers accompanied him on country tours, campaign sites, and background conversations, as well as being present in those quiet, intimate moments – many times in his own home – that have remained hidden from the public until now.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F9mvoVo2I7HeODEjFl1ryH66sc5x.jpg', 'plex:movie:tavaszi-szel-az-ebredes'),
  ('479465787913515339', 'Spring: Episode 1 - The Awakening of the Source / The Awakening of Nests', 1909, 'Fantasy', 'Louis Feuillade', null, null, null, 'Nymphs and cupids dance in celebration of the arrival of Spring.', 'Nymphs and cupids dance in celebration of the arrival of Spring.', null, 'tmdb:movie:194042'),
  ('912816356560721804', 'Springfield Rifle', 1952, 'War, Western', 'André de Toth, Edwin B. DuPar, Frank Mattison', 'Charles Marquis Warren, Frank Davis', 'Gary Cooper, Phyllis Thaxter, David Brian, Paul Kelly, Philip Carey, Lon Chaney Jr., James Millican, Guinn ''Big Boy'' Williams', 'NR', 'Major Lex Kearney, dishonourably discharged from the army for cowardice in battle, volunteers to go undercover to try to prevent raids against shipments of horses desperately needed for the Union war effort. Falling in with the gang of jayhawkers and Confederate soldiers who have been conducting the raids, he gradually gains their trust and is put in a position where he can discover who has been giving them secret information revealing the routes of the horse shipments.', 'Major Lex Kearney, dishonourably discharged from the army for cowardice in battle, volunteers to go undercover to try to prevent raids against shipments of horses desperately needed for the Union war effort. Falling in with the gang of jayhawkers and Confederate soldiers who have been conducting the raids, he gradually gains their trust and is put in a position where he can discover who has been giving them secret information revealing the routes of the horse shipments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmvePM95FtjB8m2tDD8K6mMZXV5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111043'),
  ('506228771072768098', 'Springman and the SS', 1946, 'Animation, Comedy, War', 'Jiří Trnka, Vladimír Novotný, Jiří Trnka', 'Jiří Brdečka, Jiří Trnka', null, null, 'The first animated picture made by Jiří Trnka for adults. It is a comic story of a legendary chimney-cleaner who, with the help of a spring from an old lounge-chair, became the terror of the Prague-occupying SS troops in World War II.', 'The first animated picture made by Jiří Trnka for adults. It is a comic story of a legendary chimney-cleaner who, with the help of a spring from an old lounge-chair, became the terror of the Prague-occupying SS troops in World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83NYaaLSw6TFPQwh8K81HPyzd33.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203102'),
  ('236073016792607681', 'Springsteen: Deliver Me from Nowhere', 2025, 'Drama, Music', 'Scott Cooper, Masanobu Takayanagi, Stephen A. Pope', 'Scott Cooper', 'Jeremy Allen White, Jeremy Strong, Paul Walter Hauser, Stephen Graham, Odessa Young, Gaby Hoffmann, Marc Maron, David Krumholtz', 'PG-13', 'Bruce Springsteen, a young musician on the cusp of global superstardom, struggles to reconcile the pressures of success with the ghosts of his past.', 'Bruce Springsteen, a young musician on the cusp of global superstardom, struggles to reconcile the pressures of success with the ghosts of his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csBV3eq4RDjNg1acNQ8kwOZyPlZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1230368'),
  ('620038999723992063', 'Springtime', 1929, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Ub Iwerks', null, null, 'NR', 'Flowers, insects, and a crow family all dance to a jaunty tune celebrating spring. After a brief storm, grasshoppers, frogs, and spiders cavort to the Dance of the Hours.', 'Flowers, insects, and a crow family all dance to a jaunty tune celebrating spring. After a brief storm, grasshoppers, frogs, and spiders cavort to the Dance of the Hours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77p6DiU6IkHc4JJgscHdnAr4rVc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67175'),
  ('675311051468195115', 'Springtime', 2004, 'Drama', 'Ryu Jang-ha, Lee Mo-gae, Oh Seung-chul', 'Ryu Jang-ha', 'Choi Min-sik, Jang Shin-young, Kim Ho-jung, Kim Kang-woo, Youn Yuh-jung, Kim Yeong-ok, Jang Hyun-sung, Choi Il-hwa', null, 'A struggling musician takes a job teaching music to middle school children in a rural mining town.', 'A struggling musician takes a job teaching music to middle school children in a rural mining town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7fVnNYdr8ZhyNODlmcOUhkGxFJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198553'),
  ('922958066498100620', 'Springtime for Pluto', 1944, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Thurl Ravenscroft', 'NR', 'Seduced by a satyr, Pluto celebrates spring. He goes around enjoying the scents, then imitating various animals. But when he imitates the butterfly (that transformed from a caterpillar before our eyes), he gets in trouble. The butterfly had done a little dance with a water droplet; Pluto picks a beehive as his "ball". The bees, of course, attack, and Pluto escapes by diving into some bushes of poison ivy. Then the "gentle" rains of spring come, along with the hail ("hail, hail the rains"), making a mess of Pluto''s house. When the rains end and the satyr returns, Pluto gives him the greeting he deserves.', 'Seduced by a satyr, Pluto celebrates spring. He goes around enjoying the scents, then imitating various animals. But when he imitates the butterfly (that transformed from a caterpillar before our eyes), he gets in trouble. The butterfly had done a little dance with a water droplet; Pluto picks a beehive as his "ball". The bees, of course, attack, and Pluto escapes by diving into some bushes of poison ivy. Then the "gentle" rains of spring come, along with the hail ("hail, hail the rains"), making a mess of Pluto''s house. When the rains end and the satyr returns, Pluto gives him the greeting he deserves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/clXnRIR7AepJsYSz9JtkYS8gQs1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68510'),
  ('874101077491898658', 'Springtime for Thomas', 1946, 'Comedy, Animation', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Frank Graham, Sara Berner, William Hanna, Bob Laztny, Jack Sabel', 'NR', 'It''s spring, and Tom is much more interested in the female cat next door than in Jerry.', 'It''s spring, and Tom is much more interested in the female cat next door than in Jerry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNzxIXbde6o8f7vUALwzGLBDNsl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40209'),
  ('425028353968377242', 'Springtime in a Small Town', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tian Zhuangzhuang, Mark Lee Ping-Bing', 'Zhong A-Cheng, Fei Mu', 'Jingfan Hu, Wu Jun, Ye Xiao Keng, Si Si Lu, Xin Baiqing', null, 'In a mansion decimated during World War II, a frustrated, bored housewife, Yuwen, is torn between caring for her ailing husband and her longing for a former sweetheart, a doctor who has come to treat her husband.', 'In a mansion decimated during World War II, a frustrated, bored housewife, Yuwen, is torn between caring for her ailing husband and her longing for a former sweetheart, a doctor who has come to treat her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/usPnOdqJgVIiJBM0acXNwQW3Hya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61485'),
  ('444581304292172011', 'Springtime in the Rockies', 1942, 'Music, Romance, Comedy', 'Irving Cummings', 'Walter Bullock, Ken Englund', 'Betty Grable, John Payne, Carmen Miranda, Cesar Romero, Charlotte Greenwood, Edward Everett Horton, Harry James, Chick Chandler', 'NR', 'Broadway partners Vicky Lane and Dan Christy have a tiff over Christy''s womanizing. Jealous Vicky takes up with her old flame and former dance partner, Victor Price, and Dan''s career takes a nosedive. In hopes of rekindling their romance and getting Vicky back on the boards with him, Dan follows her to a ritzy resort in the Canadian Rockies, where she and Victor are about to open their new act. But things get complicated when Dan wakes after a bender to find that he''s hired an outlandish Latin secretary, Rosita Murphy, which makes Vicky think he''s just up to his old tricks again.', 'Broadway partners Vicky Lane and Dan Christy have a tiff over Christy''s womanizing. Jealous Vicky takes up with her old flame and former dance partner, Victor Price, and Dan''s career takes a nosedive. In hopes of rekindling their romance and getting Vicky back on the boards with him, Dan follows her to a ritzy resort in the Canadian Rockies, where she and Victor are about to open their new act. But things get complicated when Dan wakes after a bender to find that he''s hired an outlandish Latin secretary, Rosita Murphy, which makes Vicky think he''s just up to his old tricks again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p66u6tPqVJRr4Lc3vrcjlSyc8yZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43784'),
  ('818817813617068472', 'Sprout', 2013, 'Drama', 'Baek Hyun-oh, Yoon Ga-eun, Lee Jun-il', 'Yoon Ga-eun', 'Kim Su-an, Kim So-jin, Oh Dong-ju, Jeong Ok-gwang, Kim Hyung-jung, Kim Eun-young, Son Seok-bae, Park Yeong', null, 'Little Bo-ri''s family has come together – as they do every year – to commemorate her late grandfather. Bean sprouts are missing from their meal and so Bo-ri is sent off to market to fetch some. An unexpected detour takes her to places she has never seen before.', 'Little Bo-ri''s family has come together – as they do every year – to commemorate her late grandfather. Bean sprouts are missing from their meal and so Bo-ri is sent off to market to fetch some. An unexpected detour takes her to places she has never seen before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8QdilWlZvMvgw6Gtq6poOkGW5ww.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424628'),
  ('13237099645270396', 'Sprout Wings and Fly', 1983, 'Documentary, Music', 'Alice Gerrard, Les Blank, Cece Conway', null, 'Tommy Jarrell', null, 'Set in the North Carolina Appalachians, Sprout Wings and Fly honors the fiddle playing of 82-year-old Tommy Jarrell of Toast, NC. Tommy was quirky, gregarious and generous, and this film shows him at his best, in fine fiddling form.', 'Set in the North Carolina Appalachians, Sprout Wings and Fly honors the fiddle playing of 82-year-old Tommy Jarrell of Toast, NC. Tommy was quirky, gregarious and generous, and this film shows him at his best, in fine fiddling form.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heZq1ICgwXP5mDml1pMFayuNfA9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259189'),
  ('1058672842506794039', 'Sprung', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Rusty Cundieff', 'Darin Scott, Rusty Cundieff', 'Tisha Campbell, Paula Jai Parker, John Witherspoon, Joe Torry, Rusty Cundieff, Clarence Williams III, Isabel Sanford, Yolanda Whitaker', 'R', 'Two pairs of best friends - Montel &amp; Clyde and Brandy &amp; Adina meet at the party, where Clyde makes Adina think he is very rich and gets her into bed the same evening. When Adina finds out that she''s been fooled, she becomes Clyde''s worst enemy. Meanwhile Montel and Brandy fall in love and plan to marry, and Adina and Clyde try to do everything to stop them.', 'Two pairs of best friends - Montel &amp; Clyde and Brandy &amp; Adina meet at the party, where Clyde makes Adina think he is very rich and gets her into bed the same evening. When Adina finds out that she''s been fooled, she becomes Clyde''s worst enemy. Meanwhile Montel and Brandy fall in love and plan to marry, and Adina and Clyde try to do everything to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quoo72l1VzxHDsE5yPw4RhHp4y7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60082'),
  ('151217749590129242', 'Spud', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Donovan Marsh, Lance Gewer, Bart Fouche', 'Donovan Marsh', 'John Cleese, Troye Sivan, Jamie Royal, Sven Ruygrok, Blessing Xaba, Tom Burne, Josh Goddard, Travis Hornsby', null, 'It''s South Africa 1990. Two major events are about to happen: The release of Nelson Mandela and, more importantly, it''s Spud Milton''s first year at an elite boys only private boarding school. Spud is a boy from an ordinary background who wins a scholarship to a private school in Kwazulu-Natal, South Africa. Surrounded by boys with nicknames like Gecko, Rambo, Rain Man and Mad Dog, Spud has his hands full trying to adapt to his new home.', 'It''s South Africa 1990. Two major events are about to happen: The release of Nelson Mandela and, more importantly, it''s Spud Milton''s first year at an elite boys only private boarding school. Spud is a boy from an ordinary background who wins a scholarship to a private school in Kwazulu-Natal, South Africa. Surrounded by boys with nicknames like Gecko, Rambo, Rain Man and Mad Dog, Spud has his hands full trying to adapt to his new home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZptpTY1VMMcyGdj3Hp5SY3M1IN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61410'),
  ('1035281838470307334', 'Spun', 2003, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Eric Broms, Jonas Åkerlund, John O''Rourke', 'Will De Los Santos, Creighton Vero', 'Jason Schwartzman, Mickey Rourke, Brittany Murphy, John Leguizamo, Patrick Fugit, Mena Suvari, Chloe Hunter, Elisa Bocanegra', 'R', 'Over the course of three days Ross, a college dropout addicted to crystal-meth, encounters a variety of oddball folks - including a stripper named Nikki and her boyfriend, the local meth producer, The Cook - but all he really wants to do is hook up with his old girlfriend, Amy.', 'Over the course of three days Ross, a college dropout addicted to crystal-meth, encounters a variety of oddball folks - including a stripper named Nikki and her boyfriend, the local meth producer, The Cook - but all he really wants to do is hook up with his old girlfriend, Amy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jiwNobUsd29ooowQyTeh0cvPBFL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12079'),
  ('228483048759793188', 'Sputnik', 2013, 'Adventure, Family', 'Markus Dietrich, Philipp Kirsamer', 'Markus Dietrich', 'Flora Thiemann, Finn Fiebig, Luca Johannsen, Devid Striesow, Yvonne Catterfeld, Maxim Mehmet, Andreas Schmidt, Jacob Matschenz', null, 'November 9, 1989, the day the Berlin Wall came down. A 10-year-old girl and her friends attempt to use their teleportation device to beam her uncle back to East Germany but instead, as they witness on TV, end up beaming everyone in their town into West Germany! They have to race against time to undo the experiment before the nasty border guards open fire...', 'November 9, 1989, the day the Berlin Wall came down. A 10-year-old girl and her friends attempt to use their teleportation device to beam her uncle back to East Germany but instead, as they witness on TV, end up beaming everyone in their town into West Germany! They have to race against time to undo the experiment before the nasty border guards open fire...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgt69PQ30L3IcafnBMXtNnHSRVy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259358'),
  ('563027260565378687', 'Sputnik', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Horror', 'Egor Abramenko, Maxim Zhukov, Oleg Romanov', 'Oleg Malovichko, Andrey Zolotarev', 'Oksana Akinshina, Fyodor Bondarchuk, Pyotr Fyodorov, Anton Vasilyev, Aleksey Demidov, Anna Nazarova, Albrecht Sander, Vitaliya Kornienko', 'R', 'At the height of the Cold War, a Soviet spacecraft crash lands after a mission gone awry, leaving the commander as its only survivor. After a renowned Russian psychologist is brought in to evaluate the commander’s mental state, it becomes clear that something dangerous may have come back to Earth with him…', 'At the height of the Cold War, a Soviet spacecraft crash lands after a mission gone awry, leaving the commander as its only survivor. After a renowned Russian psychologist is brought in to evaluate the commander’s mental state, it becomes clear that something dangerous may have come back to Earth with him…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eAUzmhP54bE1vPXaY7FbuZREJlR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:594718'),
  ('1008043879732150859', 'Spy', 2015, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Paul Feig, Garrett Warren, Tom Brown', 'Paul Feig', 'Melissa McCarthy, Rose Byrne, Jason Statham, Jude Law, Miranda Hart, Allison Janney, Bobby Cannavale, Peter Serafinowicz', 'R', 'A desk-bound CIA analyst volunteers to go undercover to infiltrate the world of a deadly arms dealer, and prevent diabolical global disaster.', 'A desk-bound CIA analyst volunteers to go undercover to infiltrate the world of a deadly arms dealer, and prevent diabolical global disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPBmfMHxQvRRNGYD5S5ko2KnX56.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238713'),
  ('675942861803846372', 'Spy Cat', 2019, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Wolfgang Lauenstein, Christoph Lauenstein', 'Jesper Møller', 'Axel Prahl, Alexandra Neldel, Erik Borner, Sylvain Urban, Obada Adnan, Susan Tackenberg, Alison Paule-Rippier, Mark Rossman', 'PG', 'Four crazy antiheroes on the run. Their leader is the unworldly innocent, naive Marnie, a house cat who is not allowed to leave the house and only knows about real life from television', 'Four crazy antiheroes on the run. Their leader is the unworldly innocent, naive Marnie, a house cat who is not allowed to leave the house and only knows about real life from television', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lU2Cx5lbSNMxgeKQPDOhAUdw91y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:509733'),
  ('820990957043600024', 'Spy Game', 2001, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Tony Scott, Dan Mindel, Alan Gilmore', 'Michael Frost Beckner, David Arata', 'Robert Redford, Brad Pitt, Catherine McCormack, Stephen Dillane, Larry Bryggman, Marianne Jean-Baptiste, Matthew Marsh, Todd Boyce', 'R', 'On the day of his retirement, a veteran CIA agent learns that his former protégé has been arrested in China, is sentenced to die the next morning in Beijing, and that the CIA is considering letting that happen to avoid an international scandal.', 'On the day of his retirement, a veteran CIA agent learns that his former protégé has been arrested in China, is sentenced to die the next morning in Beijing, and that the CIA is considering letting that happen to avoid an international scandal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6y8M1rxjKofQCRKKe6xeV91K2Fc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1535'),
  ('659141225168302439', 'Spy Games', 1999, 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 'Ilkka Järvi-Laturi, Michel Amathieu', 'Patrick Amos', 'Bill Pullman, Irène Jacob, Bruno Kirby, Udo Kier, Glenn Plummer, André Oumansky, Féodor Atkine, Janne Kinnunen', null, 'A romantic suspense-comedy about CIA agent Harry (Bill Pullman) and SVR agent Natasha (Irene Jacob) fighting to save the world, their lives and secret love in the post cold war Helsinki.', 'A romantic suspense-comedy about CIA agent Harry (Bill Pullman) and SVR agent Natasha (Irene Jacob) fighting to save the world, their lives and secret love in the post cold war Helsinki.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDrV526mssGl7WA2hPZeglK6BBz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37773'),
  ('260818206800295723', 'Spy Girl', 2004, 'Comedy, Action, Romance', 'Park Han-jun, Kim Deok-min', 'Ha Won-jun', 'Kim Jung-hwa, Gong Yoo, Nam Sang-mi, Jadu, Baek Il-seob, Kim Ae-kyung, Jo Dal-hwan, Ahn Hae-Suk', null, 'Ko-bong has a huge crush on Gye-soon who works at a fast food restaurant without knowing that the girl he love is a spy from North Korea.', 'Ko-bong has a huge crush on Gye-soon who works at a fast food restaurant without knowing that the girl he love is a spy from North Korea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUmRUcomkWWqrYEZriaKt76NXN6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45407'),
  ('1135627505084493545', 'Spy Hard', 1996, 'Comedy, Action', 'Rick Friedberg, John R. Leonetti, Fred Waugh', 'Rick Friedberg, Dick Chudnow, Jason Friedberg', 'Leslie Nielsen, Nicollette Sheridan, Charles Durning, Marcia Gay Harden, Barry Bostwick, Andy Griffith, Stephanie Romanov, Talisa Soto', 'PG-13', 'The evil Gen. Rancor has his sights set on world domination, and only one man can stop him: Dick Steele, also known as Agent WD-40. Rancor needs to obtain a computer circuit for the missile that he is planning to fire, so Steele teams up with Veronique Ukrinsky, a KGB agent whose father designed the chip. Together they try to locate the evil mastermind''s headquarters, where Veronique''s father and several other hostages are being held.', 'The evil Gen. Rancor has his sights set on world domination, and only one man can stop him: Dick Steele, also known as Agent WD-40. Rancor needs to obtain a computer circuit for the missile that he is planning to fire, so Steele teams up with Veronique Ukrinsky, a KGB agent whose father designed the chip. Together they try to locate the evil mastermind''s headquarters, where Veronique''s father and several other hostages are being held.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yoegp9XEG4YCbJJKR0wvm0BGYpG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10535'),
  ('15743305797471281', 'Spy Intervention', 2020, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Drew Mylrea', 'Lane Garrison, Mark Famiglietti', 'Poppy Delevingne, Drew Van Acker, Dave Sheridan, Blake Anderson, Brittany Furlan, Natasha Bassett, Lane Garrison, Ken Holmes', 'NR', 'When the world''s greatest spy meets the woman of his dreams, he abandons his adventurous existence and settles into the security of suburbia.', 'When the world''s greatest spy meets the woman of his dreams, he abandons his adventurous existence and settles into the security of suburbia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srS8rvH1SwKcpeYuzUqSNBU1llH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:663255'),
  ('446088926190203287', 'Spy Kids', 2001, 'Family, Action, Comedy, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Robert Rodriguez, Guillermo Navarro, Michael J. Sullivan', 'Robert Rodriguez', 'Alexa PenaVega, Daryl Sabara, Antonio Banderas, Carla Gugino, Alan Cumming, Tony Shalhoub, Teri Hatcher, Robert Patrick', 'PG', 'Carmen and Juni think their parents are boring. Little do they know that in their day, Gregorio and Ingrid Cortez were the top secret agents from their respective countries. They gave up that life to raise their children. Now, the disappearances of several of their old colleagues forces the Cortez'' return from retirement. What they didn''t count on was Carmen and Juni joining the "family business."', 'Carmen and Juni think their parents are boring. Little do they know that in their day, Gregorio and Ingrid Cortez were the top secret agents from their respective countries. They gave up that life to raise their children. Now, the disappearances of several of their old colleagues forces the Cortez'' return from retirement. What they didn''t count on was Carmen and Juni joining the "family business."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3rUkHIAAoKr6jU30q3Db4fcIF9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10054'),
  ('217904206013076544', 'Spy Kids 2: The Island of Lost Dreams', 2002, 'Family, Action, Adventure, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Robert Rodriguez, Robert Rodriguez, Ed Vega', 'Robert Rodriguez', 'Alexa PenaVega, Daryl Sabara, Antonio Banderas, Carla Gugino, Steve Buscemi, Mike Judge, Danny Trejo, Cheech Marin', 'PG', 'Exploring the further adventures of Carmen and Juni Cortez, who have now joined the family spy business as Level 2 OSS agents. Their new mission is to save the world from a mad scientist living on a volcanic island populated by an imaginative menagerie of creatures. On this bizarre island, none of the Cortez''s gadgets work and they must rely on their wits--and each other--to survive and save the day.', 'Exploring the further adventures of Carmen and Juni Cortez, who have now joined the family spy business as Level 2 OSS agents. Their new mission is to save the world from a mad scientist living on a volcanic island populated by an imaginative menagerie of creatures. On this bizarre island, none of the Cortez''s gadgets work and they must rely on their wits--and each other--to survive and save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8pfWCk6SlxxDLXXQdUHdxF5dwJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9488'),
  ('732409453459097089', 'Spy Kids 3-D: Game Over', 2003, 'Family, Action, Comedy, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Robert Rodriguez, Robert Rodriguez, Brian Bettwy', 'Robert Rodriguez', 'Daryl Sabara, Ricardo Montalban, Alexa PenaVega, Sylvester Stallone, Courtney Jines, Ryan Pinkston, Robert Vito, Bobby Edner', 'PG', 'Carmen''s caught in a virtual reality game designed by the Kids'' new nemesis, the Toymaker. It''s up to Juni to save his sister, and ultimately the world.', 'Carmen''s caught in a virtual reality game designed by the Kids'' new nemesis, the Toymaker. It''s up to Juni to save his sister, and ultimately the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/buA8dN4zLNr0dYBeKfHfMnEfdLE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12279'),
  ('872746339744940774', 'Spy Kids: All the Time in the World', 2011, 'Family, Comedy, Action, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Robert Rodriguez, Brian Bettwy, Vanessa Gaitan', 'Robert Rodriguez', 'Jessica Alba, Joel McHale, Rowan Blanchard, Mason Cook, Jeremy Piven, Alexa PenaVega, Daryl Sabara, Danny Trejo', 'PG', 'Eight years after the third film, the OSS has become the world''s top spy agency, while the Spy Kids department has since become defunct. Retired spy Marissa is called back into action, and to bond with her new stepchildren Rebecca and Cecil, she invites them along to stop the evil Timekeeper from taking over the world.', 'Eight years after the third film, the OSS has become the world''s top spy agency, while the Spy Kids department has since become defunct. Retired spy Marissa is called back into action, and to bond with her new stepchildren Rebecca and Cecil, she invites them along to stop the evil Timekeeper from taking over the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9pUVarhiXfCu8amjmyadzJJJITi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56288'),
  ('513088171699171150', 'Spy Kids: Armageddon', 2023, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Chase Carter, Brian Bettwy, David Rimer', 'Robert Rodriguez, Racer Rodriguez', 'Connor Esterson, Everly Carganilla, Zachary Levi, Gina Rodriguez, Billy Magnussen, D.J. Cotrona, Joe Schilling, Solar Dena Bennett', 'PG', 'When the children of the world’s greatest secret agents unwittingly help a powerful game developer unleash a computer virus that gives him control of all technology, they must become spies themselves to save their parents and the world.', 'When the children of the world’s greatest secret agents unwittingly help a powerful game developer unleash a computer virus that gives him control of all technology, they must become spies themselves to save their parents and the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vd8YdaH7dzeIMGTNwQinlSiA1gV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:790493'),
  ('968617786279320811', 'Spy School', 2008, 'Adventure, Family, Comedy, Action', 'Mark Blutman, Paul Elliott', 'David DuBos, Mark Blutman', 'Forrest Landis, AnnaSophia Robb, Taylor Momsen, Rider Strong, Lea Thompson, Roger Bart, D.L. Hughley, Brian Posehn', 'PG', 'Spy School is the story of a twelve year old boy known for telling tall tales who overhears a plot to kidnap the President''s daughter. When he goes public with his story, no one believes him, and he is forced to save her on his own.', 'Spy School is the story of a twelve year old boy known for telling tall tales who overhears a plot to kidnap the President''s daughter. When he goes public with his story, no one believes him, and he is forced to save her on his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9ten14NpRfFyrqXMFylUotTCFh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31377'),
  ('1006452242550204629', 'Spy Time', 2015, 'Action, Comedy', 'Javier Ruiz Caldera, Arnau Valls Colomer, Gerard Verdaguer', 'Javier Ruiz Caldera', 'Imanol Arias, Quim Gutiérrez, Berto Romero, Alexandra Jiménez, Carlos Areces, Emilio Gutiérrez Caba, Rossy de Palma, Eduardo Gómez', null, 'Adolfo, a thirty something security guard, is going through a bad patch. Not only his lifetime girlfriend has just to finished with him to be a guy with no ambition but, moreover, he becomes the target of a series of thugs led by Vázquez, a dangerous criminal who has just escaped from jail. Also he discovers that his father has a double identity. He is not a farmer engaged in the production of cold meat – as Adolfo has believed all his life, but Anacleto, a secret agent who is a bit down and the man who locked Vázquez up in jail thirty years ago. Adolfo will have to leave his comfort zone and work with his father, the person that Adolfo get on worse with in the world to survive the revenge of Vazquez and while, between shootouts and chases, trying to get his girlfriend back.', 'Adolfo, a thirty something security guard, is going through a bad patch. Not only his lifetime girlfriend has just to finished with him to be a guy with no ambition but, moreover, he becomes the target of a series of thugs led by Vázquez, a dangerous criminal who has just escaped from jail. Also he discovers that his father has a double identity. He is not a farmer engaged in the production of cold meat – as Adolfo has believed all his life, but Anacleto, a secret agent who is a bit down and the man who locked Vázquez up in jail thirty years ago. Adolfo will have to leave his comfort zone and work with his father, the person that Adolfo get on worse with in the world to survive the revenge of Vazquez and while, between shootouts and chases, trying to get his girlfriend back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRAlUIsJ0yfcAslfMIZOPm6ftUS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284514'),
  ('441632178511680986', 'SPY x FAMILY CODE: White', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Action', 'Kazuhiro Furuhashi, Kenji Takahashi, Miyabi Inamori', 'Ichiro Okouchi', 'Takuya Eguchi, Atsumi Tanezaki, Saori Hayami, Kenichirou Matsuda, Tomoya Nakamura, Kento Kaku, Banjo Ginga, Shunsuke Takeuchi', 'PG-13', 'While under the guise of taking his family on a weekend winter getaway, Loid''s attempt to make progress on his current mission Operation Strix proves difficult when Anya mistakenly gets involved and triggers events that threaten world peace.', 'While under the guise of taking his family on a weekend winter getaway, Loid''s attempt to make progress on his current mission Operation Strix proves difficult when Anya mistakenly gets involved and triggers events that threaten world peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xlIQf4y9eB14iYzNN142tROIWON.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1062807'),
  ('262928586207229713', 'Spy, Stand Up', 1982, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Jean Boffety, Yves Boisset, Urs Egger', 'Michel Audiard, Claude Veillot, Yves Boisset', 'Lino Ventura, Michel Piccoli, Bruno Cremer, Bernard Fresson, Marc Mazza, Roger Jendly, Heinz Bennent, Krystyna Janda', null, 'Sebastien Grenier, a former French spy, is working as a financial analyst in Zurich. However, his peaceful existence starts to disintegrate when he is recruited by a top French intelligence operative to discover how one of their own secret agents was found out and executed in broad daylight.', 'Sebastien Grenier, a former French spy, is working as a financial analyst in Zurich. However, his peaceful existence starts to disintegrate when he is recruited by a top French intelligence operative to discover how one of their own secret agents was found out and executed in broad daylight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4EYQ72FmW86PDMU6oyoaVzgp2Cl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15468'),
