  ('1070079575262897732', 'Squad', 2017, 'Action, Drama', 'Aytaç Ağırlar, Hayk Kirakosyan', 'Aytaç Ağırlar', 'Kaan Yıldırım, Hakan Kurtaş, Alina Boz, Aykut Akdere, Olgu Baran Kubilay, Semih Akyüzlü, Mehmet Selim Akgul, Mustafa Uğur Civaner', null, 'The film tells the poignant story of a soldier crossing the roads in a winter. Soldiers from different places should adapt to the military. Those men with dreams, goals, fears, and ambitions will learn to develop themselves in the toughest conditions of their military service, learn what it means to be a soldier, and have to fight with the demons in themselves.', 'The film tells the poignant story of a soldier crossing the roads in a winter. Soldiers from different places should adapt to the military. Those men with dreams, goals, fears, and ambitions will learn to develop themselves in the toughest conditions of their military service, learn what it means to be a soldier, and have to fight with the demons in themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDIRBL31LRNU6OMWiPnN2d2oC2E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477273'),
  ('1127647926439095309', 'Squad 36', 2025, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Olivier Marchal, Denis Rouden, Michaël Laguens', 'Olivier Marchal', 'Victor Belmondo, Tewfik Jallab, Soufiane Guerrab, Juliette Dol, Yvan Attal, Lydia Andréï, Jean-Michel Correia, Moussa Mansaly', 'R', 'Forced out of his elite unit, a troubled cop launches his own rogue investigation when mysterious killings claim the lives of his former colleagues.', 'Forced out of his elite unit, a troubled cop launches his own rogue investigation when mysterious killings claim the lives of his former colleagues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rfQi2JzENT5MNJhN1nkIZMNWm4M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1230208'),
  ('758919309997944659', 'Squanto: A Warrior''s Tale', 1994, 'Adventure, History', 'Xavier Koller, Chris Stoia, Ron Mezey', 'Darlene Craviotto', 'Adam Beach, Sheldon Peters Wolfchild, Irene Bedard, Eric Schweig, Leroy Peltier, Michael Gambon, Nathaniel Parker, Alex Norton', 'PG', 'It''s the 17th century, and Native American Squanto roams free in the New World until he''s captured by visiting sailors who take him back to England. Monk Brother Daniel teaches him social customs, but other Englishmen aren''t as kind. Squanto becomes the unwilling star of performances that highlight his fighting skills, but he eventually engineers a return trip to America. He finds that his home has changed forever, and he must chart a new path for his people.', 'It''s the 17th century, and Native American Squanto roams free in the New World until he''s captured by visiting sailors who take him back to England. Monk Brother Daniel teaches him social customs, but other Englishmen aren''t as kind. Squanto becomes the unwilling star of performances that highlight his fighting skills, but he eventually engineers a return trip to America. He finds that his home has changed forever, and he must chart a new path for his people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OQAT40mMFrIBe9ExBqG93DX13Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65158'),
  ('985728661178202119', 'Square Dance', 1987, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gregg Chooluck, Jacek Laskus, Katterli Frauenfelder', 'Alan Hines', 'Jason Robards, Jane Alexander, Winona Ryder, Rob Lowe, Deborah Richter, Guich Koock, Elbert Lewis, Charlotte Stanton', 'PG-13', 'An awkward 13-year-old leaves her cranky grandfather in rural Texas, to live with her mother in Fort Worth.', 'An awkward 13-year-old leaves her cranky grandfather in rural Texas, to live with her mother in Fort Worth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hSF0zK9KzcKTDZsXNbGRRK2HRLh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79615'),
