  ('693439360840937533', 'Squared Love', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Paulina Budyta, Maciej Lisiecki, Kacper Habisiak', 'Wiktor Piątkowski, Marzanna Polit', 'Adrianna Chlebicka, Mateusz Banasiuk, Agnieszka Żulewska, Anna Smołowik, Krzysztof Czeczot, Mirosław Baka, Tomasz Karolak, Bartłomiej Kotschedoff', 'NR', 'A celebrity journalist and renowned womanizer starts to rethink his life choices after he falls for a mysterious model who leads a double life.', 'A celebrity journalist and renowned womanizer starts to rethink his life choices after he falls for a mysterious model who leads a double life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qeRCXsOitUdtDXc5sSVgwYGTZyg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:787298'),
