  ('106511707986822621', 'Squared Love Everlasting', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Filip Zylber, Renata Kubiczek, Maciej Lisiecki', 'Wiktor Piątkowski, Natalia Matuszek', 'Adrianna Chlebicka, Mateusz Banasiuk, Ina Sobala, Tomasz Karolak, Monika Krzywkowska, Mirosław Baka, Helena Mazur, Krzysztof Czeczot', 'PG-13', 'Monika and Enzo''s whirlwind romance heads toward a fairy-tale ending until a bombshell revelation changes everything.', 'Monika and Enzo''s whirlwind romance heads toward a fairy-tale ending until a bombshell revelation changes everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9o9FrpdnQnS0OQoQQxwIROxaOoE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1150215'),
  ('819528107114455351', 'Squaring the Circle (The Story of Hipgnosis)', 2023, 'Documentary, Music', 'Anton Corbijn', 'Trish D Chetty', 'Aubrey Powell, Storm Thorgerson, Noel Gallagher, David Gilmour, Roger Waters, Paul McCartney, Nick Mason, Robert Plant', null, 'In 1968, art students Storm Thorgerson and Aubrey “Po” Powell made a trippy photo collage for their musician friends Syd, David and Roger. The resulting album and album cover, A Saucerful of Secrets, helped launch two careers: that of Pink Floyd, one of the 70s megabands, and of Hipgnosis, which, over the course of the next 25 years, designed a stream of iconic album covers.', 'In 1968, art students Storm Thorgerson and Aubrey “Po” Powell made a trippy photo collage for their musician friends Syd, David and Roger. The resulting album and album cover, A Saucerful of Secrets, helped launch two careers: that of Pink Floyd, one of the 70s megabands, and of Hipgnosis, which, over the course of the next 25 years, designed a stream of iconic album covers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsN7Zdy9Uo6bxellIGqiH6Kcs6I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:949808'),
  ('340733187302477077', 'Squatter''s Rights', 1946, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Walt Disney, Pinto Colvig, James MacDonald, Dessie Flynn', 'NR', 'Two chipmunks have made a cozy little home for themselves in the wood-burning stove of an empty cabin. They sleep in a matchbox, wash up in an empty acorn shell filled with water and look at their reflections on the back of a spoon, which serves as their bathroom mirror. They even have a staircase made with a pocket comb. Invading their space are Mickey Mouse and his dog Pluto, who are all set for a swell vacation. They don''t reckon on the two squatters. Pluto immediately discovers the presence of these two pests, but Mickey never finds out. All he knows is that when he tries to light the stove, the matches go out; he doesn''t know the chipmunks are blowing them out. Soon, Mickey is outside chopping wood, while Pluto is alone with the chipmunks. Pluto wants blood, but he''ll end up with a bottle of ketchup.', 'Two chipmunks have made a cozy little home for themselves in the wood-burning stove of an empty cabin. They sleep in a matchbox, wash up in an empty acorn shell filled with water and look at their reflections on the back of a spoon, which serves as their bathroom mirror. They even have a staircase made with a pocket comb. Invading their space are Mickey Mouse and his dog Pluto, who are all set for a swell vacation. They don''t reckon on the two squatters. Pluto immediately discovers the presence of these two pests, but Mickey never finds out. All he knows is that when he tries to light the stove, the matches go out; he doesn''t know the chipmunks are blowing them out. Soon, Mickey is outside chopping wood, while Pluto is alone with the chipmunks. Pluto wants blood, but he''ll end up with a bottle of ketchup.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gndvemCE0VlZCgwR3q6ugIkeJGz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68512'),
  ('775829508785119894', 'Squeak-squeak', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Jean Girault, Alain Gouze', 'Jacques Vilfrid, Jean Girault', 'Louis de Funès, Mireille Darc, Roger Dumas, Jacqueline Maillan, Daniel Ceccaldi, Christian Marin, Guy Tréjean, Philippe Nicaud', null, 'Léonard Monestier owns a large fortune, alas his wife Cynthia made a bad investment in a worthless oil concession. Far from letting this get him down, Léonard decides to find a sucker to buy this concession from him. Right on cue appears Antoine Brévin, a befuddled billionaire who is very interested in Léonard''s beautiful daughter Patricia and would do anything to win her hand...', 'Léonard Monestier owns a large fortune, alas his wife Cynthia made a bad investment in a worthless oil concession. Far from letting this get him down, Léonard decides to find a sucker to buy this concession from him. Right on cue appears Antoine Brévin, a befuddled billionaire who is very interested in Léonard''s beautiful daughter Patricia and would do anything to win her hand...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7715vX6RRrR6ArYFAYMYrkmAeY5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36324'),
  ('322257311118601231', 'Squealer', 2023, 'Thriller, Action, Horror', 'Andy Armstrong', 'Danielle Burgio, Andy Armstrong', 'Wes Chatham, Ronnie Gene Blevins, Tyrese Gibson, Theo Rossi, Kate Moennig, Danielle Burgio, Graham Greene, Sydney Carvill', 'R', 'When young women begin to disappear across a small town, a police officer and a street-smart social worker follow clues to a remote pig farm and discover the local butcher has been bringing his work home.', 'When young women begin to disappear across a small town, a police officer and a street-smart social worker follow clues to a remote pig farm and discover the local butcher has been bringing his work home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wdNdrqVJgkNNuYbI11TiiYkuP7Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1189798'),
  ('595317420836412683', 'Squeeze Play', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Lloyd Kaufman, Charles Kaufman, David Hastings', 'Haim Pekelis, Charles Kaufman', 'Jim Harris, Jennifer Hetrick, Rick Gitlin, Helen Campitelli, Rick Khan, Diana Valentien, Al Corley, Melissa Michaelsen', 'R', 'The girlfriends of softball players decide to form their own team as a way of avenging their neglect.', 'The girlfriends of softball players decide to form their own team as a way of avenging their neglect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdeH76UA4K6jwa0l7SjJBSdwAem.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61644'),
  ('305202075889561052', 'Squid Game in Conversation', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Hwang Dong-hyuk, Lee Jung-jae, Lee Byung-hun', 'R', 'Take a seat with the director and cast of Squid Game. Discover key moments, hear untold stories and see what this entire journey meant to them.', 'Take a seat with the director and cast of Squid Game. Discover key moments, hear untold stories and see what this entire journey meant to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMNcd8up1wvgBJnjNkOkWpZLHPC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1504735'),
