  ('1002361305209600563', 'Squint Your Eyes', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Andrzej Jakimowski, Adam Bajerski, Paweł Śmietanka', 'Andrzej Jakimowski', 'Zbigniew Zamachowski, Ola Prószynska, Rafal Guzniczak, Małgorzata Foremniak, Andrzej Chyra, Andrzej Mastalerz, Bartek Kuckowski, Kama Kowalczyk', null, 'The story of a spirited ten-year-old girl who has run away from her proudly affluent parents in town and finds grudging refuge with the slightly slovenly caretaker of an abandoned farm, an ex-teacher.', 'The story of a spirited ten-year-old girl who has run away from her proudly affluent parents in town and finds grudging refuge with the slightly slovenly caretaker of an abandoned farm, an ex-teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dMYaSMqnn2hFBvp733y0RqFErdi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81313'),
  ('807187442696718618', 'Squirm', 1976, 'Horror', 'Joseph Mangine, Jeff Lieberman, Neil Deluca', 'Jeff Lieberman', 'Don Scardino, Patricia Pearcy, R.A. Dow, Jean Sullivan, Peter MacLean, Fran Higgins, William Newman, Barbara Quinn', 'R', 'A violent electrical storm topples power lines into the rain soaked earth that is home for an aggressive breed of worms. The high voltage causes the worms to mutate into larger, hostile hordes of man-eating worms that lie in wait for the residents of Fly Creek.', 'A violent electrical storm topples power lines into the rain soaked earth that is home for an aggressive breed of worms. The high voltage causes the worms to mutate into larger, hostile hordes of man-eating worms that lie in wait for the residents of Fly Creek.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9mNz3y3UeGQydqBKBhcIPk5l6P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25241'),
  ('352519164306285598', 'Sr', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Lea Hartlaub', 'Lea Hartlaub', 'Dorothee Elmiger, Verena Hahn, Filipp Forberg, Karl Atteln, Pascal Capitolin', null, 'sr draws a panorama of human activity spanning centuries and continents. In 16 fragmentary episodes the film reports of political and societal conditions, of theoretical discourses, human creations and realities of everyday life.', 'sr draws a panorama of human activity spanning centuries and continents. In 16 fragmentary episodes the film reports of political and societal conditions, of theoretical discourses, human creations and realities of everyday life.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FsOsjTGZhOk5FZMoP9vdHnnCD5l9.jpg', 'plex:movie:sr-2026'),
  ('899221239038893557', 'Sri Asih', 2022, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Abdul Rachman Hidayat, Mujianto, Arfian', 'Joko Anwar, Upi', 'Pevita Pearce, Reza Rahadian, Christine Hakim, Jefri Nichol, Dimas Anggara, Surya Saputra, Jenny Zhang, Ario Bayu', null, 'Alana discover the truth about her origin: she’s not an ordinary human being. She may be the gift for humanity and become its protector as Sri Asih. Or a destruction, if she can’t control her anger.', 'Alana discover the truth about her origin: she’s not an ordinary human being. She may be the gift for humanity and become its protector as Sri Asih. Or a destruction, if she can’t control her anger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWUC05TaIMHQ21yahjF2AjyEWt3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:624091'),
  ('949650986772613873', 'Sri Chidambaram Garu', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Vinay Ratnam, Akshay Ram Podishetti, Sivaswamy Kesavarapu', 'Vinay Ratnam, Ram Charan Sattiraju', 'Vishnu Vardhan K, Sravan Kumar K, Tulasi, Shankar Rao, Vamsi Tummala', null, 'Sri Chidambaram Garu is the story of a broken young man who hides behind shame and a borrowed name, and through love, pain, and quiet courage, learns to see himself clearly and stand tall as who he truly is.', 'Sri Chidambaram Garu is the story of a broken young man who hides behind shame and a borrowed name, and through love, pain, and quiet courage, learns to see himself clearly and stand tall as who he truly is.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F4ZtSVD8QTr56vLuTiJQyMLN4dKz.jpg', 'plex:movie:sri-chidambaram'),
  ('669774507590761021', 'Srikanth', 2024, 'Drama', 'Tushar Hiranandani, Pratham Mehta, Abhimanyu Ray', 'Jagdeep Sidhu, Sumit Purohit', 'Rajkummar Rao, Jyothika, Alaya F, Sharad Kelkar, Anusha Nuthula, Srikant Mane, Arnav Abdagire, Srinivas Beesetty', null, 'In a world with odds stacked against him in every step of the way, Srikanth defies norms, blazing a trail from rural India to becoming the first visually impaired student at MIT. As he builds Bollant Industries, his success brings challenges for which he would not only chase personal dreams but safeguard a shared future for the ones just like him. This is the tale of an entrepreneur''s triumph and sacrifice, both which he welcomed with open arms and a smile.', 'In a world with odds stacked against him in every step of the way, Srikanth defies norms, blazing a trail from rural India to becoming the first visually impaired student at MIT. As he builds Bollant Industries, his success brings challenges for which he would not only chase personal dreams but safeguard a shared future for the ones just like him. This is the tale of an entrepreneur''s triumph and sacrifice, both which he welcomed with open arms and a smile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkWF1jIMQqWZSShNTAdBUqrdFsZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1093971'),
  ('889245723539473894', 'Srimanthudu', 2015, 'Action, Drama', 'G.M. Sekhar, Koratala Siva, R. Madhi', 'Koratala Siva', 'Mahesh Babu, Shruti Haasan, Jagapati Babu, Mukesh Rishi, Sampath Raj, Rajendra Prasad, Ali Basha, Shivaji Raja', null, 'Harsha, a multi-millionaire guy who has everything but there is something else he''s looking for and in the process he adopts a complete village trying to bring change in the people.', 'Harsha, a multi-millionaire guy who has everything but there is something else he''s looking for and in the process he adopts a complete village trying to bring change in the people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHSgSMZUiIqKCe76PBs6QuA6MRM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353533'),
  ('75851138438049708', 'SS Camp 5: Women''s Hell', 1977, 'Drama, Thriller, War, Horror', 'Sergio Garrone, Maurizio Centini, Marco Mattia Magretti', 'Sergio Garrone, Vinicio Marinucci', 'Paola Corazzi, Rita Manna, Giorgio Cerioni, Serafino Profumo, Attilio Dottesio, Patrizia Melega, Paola D''Egidio, Paola Lelio', null, 'During the last days of WW2, several female prisoners arrive at Camp 5 to work as sex slaves for officers and guinea pigs for horrific experiments by Nazi doctors who are trying to find a cure for burns. But these women are not going to die without a fight... Can they stay alive until the closing Red army comes to their rescue?', 'During the last days of WW2, several female prisoners arrive at Camp 5 to work as sex slaves for officers and guinea pigs for horrific experiments by Nazi doctors who are trying to find a cure for burns. But these women are not going to die without a fight... Can they stay alive until the closing Red army comes to their rescue?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fagxBXSndb0oJ9negDdKrXTHdsV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91878'),
  ('893606666914229582', 'SS Experiment Love Camp', 1976, 'Horror, War', 'Sergio Garrone, Marco Mattia Magretti, Mario Caporali', 'Sergio Chiusi', 'Mircha Carven, Paola Corazzi, Giorgio Cerioni, Giovanna Mainardi, Serafino Profumo, Attilio Dottesio, Patrizia Melega, Almina De Sanzio', null, 'Near the end of WW2, prisoners of war are used in experiments to perfect the Arian race.', 'Near the end of WW2, prisoners of war are used in experiments to perfect the Arian race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1s3NnoCbBbqEa50A4ch8WYLORti.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56386'),
  ('977543891917441907', 'SSS', 1989, 'Documentary', 'Marina Abramović, Charles Atlas', null, null, null, 'Marina Abramovic collaborated with videomaker Charles Atlas on this striking work of autobiographical performance. Abramovic delivers a monologue that traces a concise personal chronology. This brief narrative history, which references her past in the former Yugoslavia, her performance work, and her collaboration with and separation from Ulay, is intercut with images of Abramovic engaged in symbolic gestures and ritual acts—scrubbing her feet, staring like Medusa as snakes writhe on her head. Closing her litany with the phrase "time past, time present," Abramovic invokes the personal and the mythological in a poignant affirmation of self.', 'Marina Abramovic collaborated with videomaker Charles Atlas on this striking work of autobiographical performance. Abramovic delivers a monologue that traces a concise personal chronology. This brief narrative history, which references her past in the former Yugoslavia, her performance work, and her collaboration with and separation from Ulay, is intercut with images of Abramovic engaged in symbolic gestures and ritual acts—scrubbing her feet, staring like Medusa as snakes writhe on her head. Closing her litany with the phrase "time past, time present," Abramovic invokes the personal and the mythological in a poignant affirmation of self.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6go9sbgRtjZT11LULCsYx7gXCvJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:633724'),
  ('529742576714281296', 'SSSS.DYNAZENON Grand Episode', 2023, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Yoshihiro Miyajima, Akira Amemiya', 'Keiichi Hasegawa', null, 'PG-13', 'High schooler Yomogi comes across Gauma, a strange drifter claiming to be a Kaiju User. Soon after, a Kaiju attacks, and Gauma summons the giant robot Dynazenon to fight it. Yomogi, his classmate Yume, and local NEET Koyomi are caught in the chaos and join as copilots. Together, they form the Gauma Team. But Kaiju Eugenicists, a secret society of teens with special powers, stand in their way.', 'High schooler Yomogi comes across Gauma, a strange drifter claiming to be a Kaiju User. Soon after, a Kaiju attacks, and Gauma summons the giant robot Dynazenon to fight it. Yomogi, his classmate Yume, and local NEET Koyomi are caught in the chaos and join as copilots. Together, they form the Gauma Team. But Kaiju Eugenicists, a secret society of teens with special powers, stand in their way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uefl1nNHe9WOj2JYECCT0wMSAYT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1068607'),
  ('976194229885692950', 'Sssssss', 1973, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Gerald Perry Finnerman, Bernard L. Kowalski', 'Hal Dresner', 'Strother Martin, Dirk Benedict, Heather Menzies, Richard B. Shull, Tim O''Connor, Jack Ging, Reb Brown, Ted Grossman', 'PG', 'David, a college student, is looking for a job. He is hired by Dr. Stoner as a lab assistant for his research and experiments on snakes. David also begins to fall for Stoner''s young daughter, Kristina. However, the good doctor has secretly brewed up a serum that can transform any man into a King Cobra snake-and he plans to use it on David.', 'David, a college student, is looking for a job. He is hired by Dr. Stoner as a lab assistant for his research and experiments on snakes. David also begins to fall for Stoner''s young daughter, Kristina. However, the good doctor has secretly brewed up a serum that can transform any man into a King Cobra snake-and he plans to use it on David.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIKiHta0LrDpb2f80u7ybPFesoy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70345'),
  ('1104982073627336080', 'St Trinian''s', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Gavin Finney, Oliver Parker, Barnaby Thompson', 'Piers Ashworth, Nick Moorcroft', 'Talulah Riley, Rupert Everett, Gemma Arterton, Colin Firth, Lena Headey, Jodie Whittaker, Russell Brand, Anna Chancellor', null, 'When their beloved school is threatened with closure should the powers that be fail to raise the proper funds, the girls scheme to steal a priceless painting and use the profits to pull St. Trinian''s out of the red.', 'When their beloved school is threatened with closure should the powers that be fail to raise the proper funds, the girls scheme to steal a priceless painting and use the profits to pull St. Trinian''s out of the red.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aOVxLigLjkix69vq6iiu0XXPnai.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10748'),
  ('486243531843238239', 'St Trinian''s 2: The Legend of Fritton''s Gold', 2009, 'Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Oliver Parker, Barnaby Thompson, David Higgs', 'Piers Ashworth, Nick Moorcroft', 'Talulah Riley, Rupert Everett, Gemma Arterton, David Tennant, Colin Firth, Jodie Whittaker, Juno Temple, Tamsin Egerton', 'PG-13', 'After a wealthy philanthropist expresses an unusual interest in a ring found by her niece Annabelle, Miss Fritton explains that she''s descended from a pirate who, in 1598, stole treasure from another: the philanthropist''s ancestor. This discovery sends the racuous girls of St. Trinians on the hunt for buried treasure.', 'After a wealthy philanthropist expresses an unusual interest in a ring found by her niece Annabelle, Miss Fritton explains that she''s descended from a pirate who, in 1598, stole treasure from another: the philanthropist''s ancestor. This discovery sends the racuous girls of St. Trinians on the hunt for buried treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kRNowy4kk8gKHv1ek2xFueilDpc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37565'),
  ('628992468377313056', 'ST: Aka to Shiro no Sôsa File the Movie', 2015, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Tōya Satō', 'Yusuke Watanabe', 'Tatsuya Fujiwara, Masaki Okada, Mirai Shida, Sei Ashina, Masataka Kubota, Hiroki Miyake, Asaka Seto, Tetsushi Tanaka', null, 'The ST team at the Tokyo Metropolitan Police Department consists of eccentric members. Some members do not cooperate with others and others do not reveal themselves in front of others. With Samon as the leader of the ST team and young Inspector Tomohisa tasked with managing the team, the ST (Scientific Task Force) attempt to solve the most difficult of cases.', 'The ST team at the Tokyo Metropolitan Police Department consists of eccentric members. Some members do not cooperate with others and others do not reveal themselves in front of others. With Samon as the leader of the ST team and young Inspector Tomohisa tasked with managing the team, the ST (Scientific Task Force) attempt to solve the most difficult of cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUnHoMEVlWxxgsBGoyajYo4r0QF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290237'),
  ('467262892511435976', 'St. Agatha', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Darren Lynn Bousman, Joseph White, Gene Michael Smith', 'Andy Demetrio, Sara Sometti Michaels, Shaun Fletcher', 'Sabrina Kern, Carolyn Hennesy, Courtney Halverson, Seth Michaels, Trin Miller, Lindsay Seim, Jayson Warner Smith, Hannah Fierman', null, 'St. Agatha is set in the 1950s in small town Georgia. A pregnant con woman named Agatha is on the run and seeks refuge in a convent hidden in deafening isolation. What first starts out as the perfect place to have a child turns into a dark lair where silence is forced. Ghastly secrets are masked, and every bit of will power Agatha has is tested. She soon learns the sick and twisted truth of the convent and the odd people that lurk inside its halls. Agatha must now find a way to discover the unyielding strength needed to escape and save her baby before she’s caged behind these walls forever.', 'St. Agatha is set in the 1950s in small town Georgia. A pregnant con woman named Agatha is on the run and seeks refuge in a convent hidden in deafening isolation. What first starts out as the perfect place to have a child turns into a dark lair where silence is forced. Ghastly secrets are masked, and every bit of will power Agatha has is tested. She soon learns the sick and twisted truth of the convent and the odd people that lurk inside its halls. Agatha must now find a way to discover the unyielding strength needed to escape and save her baby before she’s caged behind these walls forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zpR3FzaagWTbwgFPn1P6sEZ4str.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502406'),
  ('58472666407011186', 'St. Elmo''s Fire', 1985, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Joel Schumacher, Stephen H. Burum, Gary Daigler', 'Joel Schumacher, Carl Kurlander', 'Emilio Estevez, Rob Lowe, Andrew McCarthy, Demi Moore, Judd Nelson, Ally Sheedy, Mare Winningham, Martin Balsam', 'R', 'Reluctant to let go of college life, a close-knit team of seven friends--irresponsible saxophone player Billy, young Republican Alec, his girlfriend Leslie, struggling journalist Kevin, drama queen Jules, lovesick waiter Kirby, and Wendy, a social worker with a heart of gold--realise the party is over. And as the burdens of maturity close in on the young dreamers, the complexities of adulthood and the daily struggle of growing up put their sacred friendship to the test. But everyone knows life is not a bed of roses. It won''t be easy, but when all is said and done, what will it take for St. Elmo''s clique to find its place in the real world?', 'Reluctant to let go of college life, a close-knit team of seven friends--irresponsible saxophone player Billy, young Republican Alec, his girlfriend Leslie, struggling journalist Kevin, drama queen Jules, lovesick waiter Kirby, and Wendy, a social worker with a heart of gold--realise the party is over. And as the burdens of maturity close in on the young dreamers, the complexities of adulthood and the daily struggle of growing up put their sacred friendship to the test. But everyone knows life is not a bed of roses. It won''t be easy, but when all is said and done, what will it take for St. Elmo''s clique to find its place in the real world?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g2SL3XHJas7hebZ2hhTrYLpKToD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11557'),
  ('624066183313064925', 'St. Giuseppe Moscati: Doctor to the Poor', 2007, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Giacomo Campiotti, Giuseppe Bonito, Gino Sgreva', 'Fabio Campus, Giacomo Campiotti, Lucia Maria Zei', 'Giuseppe Fiorello, Kasia Smutniak, Ettore Bassi, Carmine Borrino, Paola Casella, Giorgio Colangeli, Marco Gambino, Emanuela Grimalda', null, 'Giuseppe Moscati, Doctor saint of Naples, was a doctor of the early twentieth century, from an aristocratic family devoted his career to serving the poor. The film focuses on the human side, partially leaving aside the spiritual part.', 'Giuseppe Moscati, Doctor saint of Naples, was a doctor of the early twentieth century, from an aristocratic family devoted his career to serving the poor. The film focuses on the human side, partially leaving aside the spiritual part.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFFmBidr9d0KRlBq60CIEV4XZ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149043'),
  ('966056784226964233', 'St. Helens', 1982, 'Action, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Ernest Pintoff, Jacques Haitkin, BJ Davis', 'Peter Bellwood, Larry Ferguson', 'Art Carney, David Huffman, Cassie Yates, Albert Salmi, Ron O''Neal, Tim Thomerson, Bill McKinney, Redmond Gleeson', 'PG', 'Centers on the events leading up to the cataclysmic 1980 eruption of Mount St. Helens in Washington, with the story beginning on the day volcanic activity started on March 20, 1980, and ending on the day of the eruption, May 18, 1980.', 'Centers on the events leading up to the cataclysmic 1980 eruption of Mount St. Helens in Washington, with the story beginning on the day volcanic activity started on March 20, 1980, and ending on the day of the eruption, May 18, 1980.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6EPJ3HIxZTPixI625VfvCsYn6d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41916'),
  ('517504814997229338', 'St. Ives', 1976, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'J. Lee Thompson, Lucien Ballard', 'Barry Beckerman', 'Charles Bronson, John Houseman, Jacqueline Bisset, Maximilian Schell, Harry Guardino, Harris Yulin, Dana Elcar, Michael Lerner', 'PG', 'A dabbler-in-crime and his assistant hire an ex-police reporter to recover some stolen papers.', 'A dabbler-in-crime and his assistant hire an ex-police reporter to recover some stolen papers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIOyiNfJqrNB33fZeuN4X4PXBAN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37626'),
  ('631189040790558275', 'St. Ives', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Harry Hook, Robert Alazraki', 'Allan Cubitt', 'Jean-Marc Barr, Miranda Richardson, Chris McHallem, Richard E. Grant, Anna Friel, Jason Isaacs, Michael Gough, Cécile Pallas', null, 'In 1813, Capitaine Jacques St. Ives, a Hussar in the Napoleonic wars, is captured and sent to a Scottish prison camp. He''s a swashbuckler, so the prison''s commander, Major Farquar Bolingbroke Chevening, asks for lessons in communicating with women. Both men have their eyes on the lovely Flora, who resides with her aunt, the iconoclastic and well-traveled Miss Susan Emily Gilcrist. By chance, living close to the camp is Jacques''s grandfather and brother, whom Jacques believes died years before. Jacques decides to escape, find his relatives, and win the hand of Flora; Major Chevening and an unforeseen enemy stand in his way. Can Miss Gilcrist contrive to make everything work out?', 'In 1813, Capitaine Jacques St. Ives, a Hussar in the Napoleonic wars, is captured and sent to a Scottish prison camp. He''s a swashbuckler, so the prison''s commander, Major Farquar Bolingbroke Chevening, asks for lessons in communicating with women. Both men have their eyes on the lovely Flora, who resides with her aunt, the iconoclastic and well-traveled Miss Susan Emily Gilcrist. By chance, living close to the camp is Jacques''s grandfather and brother, whom Jacques believes died years before. Jacques decides to escape, find his relatives, and win the hand of Flora; Major Chevening and an unforeseen enemy stand in his way. Can Miss Gilcrist contrive to make everything work out?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLMyhtUAf3hHVY6oYu5SSKIC3a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49811'),
  ('789044889559931635', 'St. John''s Wort', 2001, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Ten Shimoyama, Kazuhiko Ogura', 'Gorô Nakajima, Ten Shimoyama, Takenori Sentô', 'Megumi Okina, Youichirou Saitou, Koji Ohkura, Reiko Matsuo, Minoru Terada, Yasunari Hashimoto', null, 'Nami has been creating artwork for a new video game based on images she''s been seeing in her dreams. With one of the game producers, she travels out to an abandoned house that seems to match her visions. As they explore the old mansion, Nami begins to have more visions of a forgotten childhood, until at last she comes across a photo of twin infants, labelled "Nami" and "Naomi". As Nami and the producer go from room to room, an unseen person seems to be watching them from a hidden room.', 'Nami has been creating artwork for a new video game based on images she''s been seeing in her dreams. With one of the game producers, she travels out to an abandoned house that seems to match her visions. As they explore the old mansion, Nami begins to have more visions of a forgotten childhood, until at last she comes across a photo of twin infants, labelled "Nami" and "Naomi". As Nami and the producer go from room to room, an unseen person seems to be watching them from a hidden room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYSYR5wjZG5fDNCA8uVrZE8a6Cq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108790'),
  ('1006764374755059226', 'St. Jorgen''s Day', 1930, 'Comedy', 'Porfiri Podobed, Yakov Protazanov, David Morskoi', 'Oleg Leonidov, Sigizmund Krzhizhanovsky', 'Igor Ilyinsky, Anatoli Ktorov, Mariya Strelkova, Mikhail Klimov, Vladimir Uralskiy, Georgui Agnivtsev, Alexander Geirot, Nikolai Gladkov', null, 'The priests, stock market officials, and police conspire to squeeze income out of pilgrims come to see relics of a Christ like figure. A pair of con men try to pass of a resurrected saint.', 'The priests, stock market officials, and police conspire to squeeze income out of pilgrims come to see relics of a Christ like figure. A pair of con men try to pass of a resurrected saint.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/clzd4u3ZIyLbWrnu7kqlJnkGcUj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166636'),
  ('979956323914434302', 'St. Louis Blues', 1929, 'Music, Drama', 'Dudley Murphy, Walter Strenge', 'Dudley Murphy', 'Bessie Smith, James P. Johnson, Alec Lovejoy, Jimmy Mordecai, Isabel Washington, Hall Johnson, Thomas Morris', null, 'In this all-black cast short, legendary blues singer Bessie Smith finds her gambler lover Jimmy messin'' with a pretty, younger woman; he leaves and she sings the blues, with chorus and dancers.', 'In this all-black cast short, legendary blues singer Bessie Smith finds her gambler lover Jimmy messin'' with a pretty, younger woman; he leaves and she sings the blues, with chorus and dancers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dv39xfGaBeuy8hZRDovTfS2fgwT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148941'),
  ('14104709188824793', 'St. Martin''s Lane', 1938, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tim Whelan, Jules Kruger, Philip Brandon', 'Clemence Dane', 'Charles Laughton, Vivien Leigh, Rex Harrison, Larry Adler, Tyrone Guthrie, Maire O''Neill, Gus McNaughton, Polly Ward', null, 'On the sidewalks of the London theater district the buskers (street performers) earn enough coins for a cheap room. Charles, who recites dramatic monologues, sees that a young pickpocket, Libby, also has a talent for dancing and adds her to his act. Harley, the theater patron who never knew Libby took his gold cigarette case, is impressed by Libby''s dancing and invites her to bring Charles and the other buskers in his group to an after-the-play party. Libby comes alone. A theatrical career is launched.', 'On the sidewalks of the London theater district the buskers (street performers) earn enough coins for a cheap room. Charles, who recites dramatic monologues, sees that a young pickpocket, Libby, also has a talent for dancing and adds her to his act. Harley, the theater patron who never knew Libby took his gold cigarette case, is impressed by Libby''s dancing and invites her to bring Charles and the other buskers in his group to an after-the-play party. Libby comes alone. A theatrical career is launched.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdn9bfRZyuufkj7tSWpBj1Mhztl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111642'),
  ('402376542734380273', 'St. Michael Had a Rooster', 1972, 'Drama, History', 'Vittorio Taviani, Paolo Taviani, Mario Masini', 'Vittorio Taviani', 'Giulio Brogi, Renato Cestiè, Vito Cipolla, Daniele Dublino, Stefano Guerrieri, Virginia Ciuffini, Renato Scarpa, Lorenzo Piani', null, 'Sentenced to life imprisonment for illegal activities, Italian International member Giulio Manieri holds on to his political ideals while struggling against madness in the loneliness of his prison cell.', 'Sentenced to life imprisonment for illegal activities, Italian International member Giulio Manieri holds on to his political ideals while struggling against madness in the loneliness of his prison cell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAWSfce00RapXZqQ9nZqOPTXHDm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67179'),
  ('1069463880613830368', 'St. Peter', 2005, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie, History', 'Giovanni Galasso, Carmine Elia, Francesco Sperandeo', 'Salvatore Basile, Francesco Arlanch, Gianmario Pagano', 'Omar Sharif, Daniele Pecci, Flavio Insinna, Claudia Koll, Lina Sastri, Sydne Rome, Philippe Leroy, Ettore Bassi', null, 'Saint Peter, a reluctant but passionate leader, from the crucifixion of Jesus to his own. The film''s first half dramatizes the New Testament''s "Acts": early fear, the renewal of Pentecost, Saul''s conversion, the decision to baptize pagans, and the Apostles'' dispersal. In the second half, an aged Peter goes to Rome to join Paul, arriving on the day of Paul''s arrest. Paul''s death brings a crisis to Rome''s Christians and to Peter; lessons from Jesus''s teachings guide his decision to stay. Events within the fictive household of Persius, a Roman aristocrat, capture the upheaval that Christian teachings bring to the Eternal City.', 'Saint Peter, a reluctant but passionate leader, from the crucifixion of Jesus to his own. The film''s first half dramatizes the New Testament''s "Acts": early fear, the renewal of Pentecost, Saul''s conversion, the decision to baptize pagans, and the Apostles'' dispersal. In the second half, an aged Peter goes to Rome to join Paul, arriving on the day of Paul''s arrest. Paul''s death brings a crisis to Rome''s Christians and to Peter; lessons from Jesus''s teachings guide his decision to stay. Events within the fictive household of Persius, a Roman aristocrat, capture the upheaval that Christian teachings bring to the Eternal City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cuOIRYcHb4Dx9Ur1VHOyIDZhuaG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112202'),
  ('540778222646110298', 'St. Vincent', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Theodore Melfi, John Lindley', 'Theodore Melfi', 'Bill Murray, Melissa McCarthy, Jaeden Martell, Naomi Watts, Chris O''Dowd, Terrence Howard, Scott Adsit, Lenny Venito', 'PG-13', 'A young boy whose parents just divorced finds an unlikely friend and mentor in the misanthropic, bawdy, hedonistic, war veteran who lives next door.', 'A young boy whose parents just divorced finds an unlikely friend and mentor in the misanthropic, bawdy, hedonistic, war veteran who lives next door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bb7MTHCIPhpKZFysDpxNaNrdMk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239563'),
  ('18632591958535517', 'Stacey', 1973, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Andy Sidaris, Mark Zavad', 'William Edgar', 'Anne Randall, Alan Landers, James Westmoreland, Marjorie Bennett, Anitra Ford, Cristina Raines, Nicholas Georgiade, Richard LePore', 'R', 'The sleazy and dangerous adventures of a gorgeous female private detective.', 'The sleazy and dangerous adventures of a gorgeous female private detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzagwOUK73jPlBkM9an3qHPdIXM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83418'),
  ('528105836267142141', 'Stacy: Attack of the Schoolgirl Zombies', 2001, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Naoyuki Tomomatsu, Masahide Iioka', 'Chisato Ōgawara', 'Norman England, Tomoka Hayashi, Yukijiro Hotaru, Ryôichi Inaba, Natsuki Kato, Ryûki Kitaoka, Shirô Misawa, Masayoshi Nogami', null, 'Girls surrounding 17 years old are affected by an illness that make her to be ''Stacies'': they feel a strange and momentary happiness until they become zombies.', 'Girls surrounding 17 years old are affected by an illness that make her to be ''Stacies'': they feel a strange and momentary happiness until they become zombies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVlUOSy7ScfxU7epbktKlSlNCIy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36836'),
  ('1130061784529902978', 'Stadium Nuts', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Claude Zidi, Paul Bonis, Lionel Bernier', 'Jacques Fansten, Claude Zidi', 'Gérard Rinaldi, Jean Sarrus, Gérard Filipelli, Jean-Guy Fechner, Paul Préboist, Martine Kelly, Gérard Croce, Jacques Seiler', null, 'Les Charlots, a French rock group, continue their adventures, in the manner of the Beatles in Hard Day''s Night. This is their second adventure. The foursome are on holiday, camping outside a village. The Olympic flame is going to pass through the village. A grocer, charged to prepare a celebration, calls upon the four to help. One of the four falls for the grocer''s daughter. However, she runs away after the sportsman carrying the flame. The foursome set of to find her and win her back.', 'Les Charlots, a French rock group, continue their adventures, in the manner of the Beatles in Hard Day''s Night. This is their second adventure. The foursome are on holiday, camping outside a village. The Olympic flame is going to pass through the village. A grocer, charged to prepare a celebration, calls upon the four to help. One of the four falls for the grocer''s daughter. However, she runs away after the sportsman carrying the flame. The foursome set of to find her and win her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n47PWzgUbZdIXG7l6cMIRXUmtUA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62660'),
  ('691836178578952501', 'Stadt in Flammen', 1984, null, 'Schmelzdahin', null, null, null, 'Film material is subjected to biochemical processes by burying it in the garden, storing it in a pond, or overheating it. The results of these natural processes of decay or aging are then copied back onto film and thus conserved in the state of their dissolution. - Lightcone', 'Film material is subjected to biochemical processes by burying it in the garden, storing it in a pond, or overheating it. The results of these natural processes of decay or aging are then copied back onto film and thus conserved in the state of their dissolution. - Lightcone', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXjA7TFQOohhauwXlpkkvIUQxGS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324580'),
  ('1024441797087808761', 'Stadtlandliebe', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Marco Kreuzpaintner, Ueli Steiger', 'Marco Kreuzpaintner, Hendrik Hölzemann', 'Jessica Schwarz, Tom Beck, Uwe Ochsenknecht, Gisa Flake, Christine Schorn, Horst Sachtleben, Vladimir Burlakov, Hannes Wegener', null, 'Sam and Anna are part of the hip, vegan, green, eco-friendly, upper-class subculture of Berlin. Anna is a successful doctor, and Nick works in advertising. However, life in Germany''s capital is fast-paced and stressful, so the two of them decide to take the next step towards the ideal "eco lifestyle" and move out to the country. As they arrive, they find that life in the country is much less relaxing than they expected, as the rather eccentric locals keep them on their toes.', 'Sam and Anna are part of the hip, vegan, green, eco-friendly, upper-class subculture of Berlin. Anna is a successful doctor, and Nick works in advertising. However, life in Germany''s capital is fast-paced and stressful, so the two of them decide to take the next step towards the ideal "eco lifestyle" and move out to the country. As they arrive, they find that life in the country is much less relaxing than they expected, as the rather eccentric locals keep them on their toes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xy2K2tVL8aXPq4h96NpHHsVvpfS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390852'),
  ('898882232559237171', 'Stag', 1997, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Gavin Wilding, Maryse Alberti', 'Evan Tylor, Pat Bermel', 'Mario Van Peebles, Andrew McCarthy, Kevin Dillon, Taylor Dayne, John Stockwell, William McNamara, Jerry Stiller, Ben Gazzara', null, 'An accidental death at a bachelor party spurs a night of shooting, kidnapping and murder in the host''s home.', 'An accidental death at a bachelor party spurs a night of shooting, kidnapping and murder in the host''s home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzy8BK7qN6HzOY79py1Dhvk7KLu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36434'),
  ('631436794166345773', 'Stag Night', 2008, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Peter A. Dowling, Toby Moore', 'Peter A. Dowling', 'Kip Pardue, Vinessa Shaw, Breckin Meyer, Scott Adkins, Karl Geary, Sarah Barrand, Luca Bercovici, Suzanna Urszuly', 'R', 'Four guys on a bachelor party get off the subway at a station that shut down in the 70''s and, after watching a transit cop get brutally murdered, find themselves running for their lives beneath the streets of NY.', 'Four guys on a bachelor party get off the subway at a station that shut down in the 70''s and, after watching a transit cop get brutally murdered, find themselves running for their lives beneath the streets of NY.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gscnLqGWWC1q1HBvzfu35uwsQC0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24421'),
  ('675112687770222493', 'Stage Beauty', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Richard Eyre, Andrew Dunn', 'Jeffrey Hatcher', 'Claire Danes, Billy Crudup, Derek Hutchinson, Mark Letheren, Tom Wilkinson, Ben Chaplin, Hugh Bonneville, Fenella Woolgar', 'R', 'Humble Maria, who outfits top London theater star Ned Kynaston, takes none of the credit for the male actor''s success at playing women. And because this is the 17th century, Maria, like other females, is prohibited from pursuing her dream of acting. But when powerful people support her, King Charles II lifts the ban on female stage performers. And just as Maria aided Ned, she needs his help to learn her new profession.', 'Humble Maria, who outfits top London theater star Ned Kynaston, takes none of the credit for the male actor''s success at playing women. And because this is the 17th century, Maria, like other females, is prohibited from pursuing her dream of acting. But when powerful people support her, King Charles II lifts the ban on female stage performers. And just as Maria aided Ned, she needs his help to learn her new profession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3rTkp6d8NG2dPdb3Ert3C0YojK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26108'),
  ('885738125684197428', 'Stage Door', 1937, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gregory La Cava, Robert De Grasse, Carroll Clark', 'Anthony Veiller, Morrie Ryskind', 'Katharine Hepburn, Ginger Rogers, Adolphe Menjou, Gail Patrick, Constance Collier, Andrea Leeds, Samuel S. Hinds, Lucille Ball', 'NR', 'A spirited heiress wishing to break into theatre on her own merit arrives at a boardinghouse where aspiring young actresses and showgirls are brought together through their cynicism and disappointments.', 'A spirited heiress wishing to break into theatre on her own merit arrives at a boardinghouse where aspiring young actresses and showgirls are brought together through their cynicism and disappointments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4zqAKoJAtmkK71IyeWHc6spEKB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43864'),
  ('994174127063249651', 'Stage Door Canteen', 1943, 'Comedy, Music, Romance, War', 'Virgil Hart, Lew Borzage, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Delmer Daves', 'Cheryl Walker, William Terry, Marjorie Riordan, Lon McCallister, Margaret Early, Sunset Carson, Dorothea Kent, Frederick Brady', 'NR', 'A young soldier on a pass in New York City visits the famed Stage Door Canteen, where famous stars of theatre and film appear and host a recreational center for servicemen during the war. The soldier meets a pretty young hostess and they enjoy the many entertainers and a growing romance.', 'A young soldier on a pass in New York City visits the famed Stage Door Canteen, where famous stars of theatre and film appear and host a recreational center for servicemen during the war. The soldier meets a pretty young hostess and they enjoy the many entertainers and a growing romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1pUUs6kVSXz1x06coXhX2qZYjWA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38726'),
  ('939847836357836755', 'Stage Door Cartoon', 1944, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Arthur Q. Bryan', null, 'That wascawwy wabbit is chased into a theatre by Elmer Fudd, and ends up having to perform to save himself, as well as convince Elmer to act himself. The vaudeville industry was never this wacky!', 'That wascawwy wabbit is chased into a theatre by Elmer Fudd, and ends up having to perform to save himself, as well as convince Elmer to act himself. The vaudeville industry was never this wacky!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NtvAr7QUV8bkU7DLuFx6ah9tlm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100354'),
  ('880016722460972913', 'Stage Fright', 1950, 'Thriller', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Wilkie Cooper, Louis Levy', 'Whitfield Cook', 'Jane Wyman, Marlene Dietrich, Michael Wilding, Richard Todd, Alastair Sim, Sybil Thorndike, Kay Walsh, Miles Malleson', null, 'A struggling actress tries to help a friend prove his innocence when he''s accused of murdering the husband of a high-society entertainer.', 'A struggling actress tries to help a friend prove his innocence when he''s accused of murdering the husband of a high-society entertainer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l43OTqhib8do1WwXig8JI8Y68Fd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1978'),
  ('919450111961597978', 'Stage Fright', 1987, 'Horror', 'Renato Tafuri, Michele Soavi, Rubina Michettoni', 'George Eastman', 'Barbara Cupisti, David Brandon, Robert Gligorov, Mary Sellers, Giovanni Lombardo Radice, James Sampson, Jo Ann Smith, Domenico Fiore', 'R', 'While a group of young actors rehearse a new musical about a mass murderer, a notorious psychopath escapes from a nearby insane asylum.', 'While a group of young actors rehearse a new musical about a mass murderer, a notorious psychopath escapes from a nearby insane asylum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXIMhd4JsEPA3Q9PfHyTmytNO2J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20465'),
  ('929626060007858622', 'Stage Fright', 1997, 'Drama, Animation, Horror', 'Steve Box', 'Tess Daulton, Steve Box', 'Graham Fellows, Tess Daulton', null, 'A vaudevillian''s act involving the juggling of dogs is no longer a hit. He and his partner must face a brutal villain and assorted obstacles in order to secure their future.', 'A vaudevillian''s act involving the juggling of dogs is no longer a hit. He and his partner must face a brutal villain and assorted obstacles in order to secure their future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NGktwg4IZgycJCMI24G8dWTwKA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54818'),
  ('870708750753960949', 'Stage Fright', 2014, 'Horror', 'Jerome Sable, Kevin Hourigan, Bojan Zoric', 'Jerome Sable', 'Allie MacDonald, Meat Loaf, Douglas Smith, Minnie Driver, Brandon Uranowitz, Melanie Leishman, Thomas Alderson, Kent Nolan', 'R', 'A high-end musical theater camp is terrorized by a bloodthirsty killer who hates musical theater.', 'A high-end musical theater camp is terrorized by a bloodthirsty killer who hates musical theater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a92NoM9rikfHrLbWS2Isg0cYXw4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156597'),
  ('107311469223253251', 'Stage Mother', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Drew McLean, Michael Cowie, Andrew Mortimer', 'Brad Hennig', 'Jacki Weaver, Lucy Liu, Adrian Grenier, Mya Taylor, Allister MacDonald, Anthony Skordi, Oscar Moreno, Jackie Beat', 'R', 'A conservative church-choir director moves from Texas to San Francisco to run her deceased gay son''s drag club.', 'A conservative church-choir director moves from Texas to San Francisco to run her deceased gay son''s drag club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWlJfxePrUrUGXv2bCxqncId3x2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:626020'),
  ('387864171580915705', 'Stage Struck', 1925, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Allan Dwan, George Webber', 'Forrest Halsey', 'Gloria Swanson, Lawrence Gray, Gertrude Astor, Oliver Sandys, Ford Sterling, Carrie Scott, Emile Hoch, Margery Whittington', null, 'Daydreaming waitress Jennie Hagen fantasizes about becoming a famous actress, while in reality she and her cook boyfriend, Orme Wilson, hope to one day own their own diner. Although Orme loves Jennie, he also has a weakness for stage stars -- so when a riverboat theatrical crew comes to their town, he is smitten by lead actress Lillian Lyons. Desperate to keep Orme, Jennie insists on going onstage to best Lillian, but is soon out of her depth.', 'Daydreaming waitress Jennie Hagen fantasizes about becoming a famous actress, while in reality she and her cook boyfriend, Orme Wilson, hope to one day own their own diner. Although Orme loves Jennie, he also has a weakness for stage stars -- so when a riverboat theatrical crew comes to their town, he is smitten by lead actress Lillian Lyons. Desperate to keep Orme, Jennie insists on going onstage to best Lillian, but is soon out of her depth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l711nus4DPVRdk9Hdeph22iHY2K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147618'),
  ('58623608568705297', 'Stage Struck', 1958, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sidney Lumet, Franz Planer, William C. Gerrity', 'Ruth Goetz, Augustus Goetz', 'Henry Fonda, Susan Strasberg, Joan Greenwood, Herbert Marshall, Christopher Plummer, Daniel Ocko, Pat Harrington Sr., Frank Campanella', null, 'A young woman arrives in New York City determined to become a great theatrical star, but discovers that her goal may not be as easily attainable as she had hoped.', 'A young woman arrives in New York City determined to become a great theatrical star, but discovers that her goal may not be as easily attainable as she had hoped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2taT00UvxPyKIofYvIJ5RTV1pV9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111910'),
  ('9954607788593960', 'Stagecoach', 1939, 'Western, Adventure', 'John Ford, Bert Glennon, Wingate Smith', 'Dudley Nichols', 'Claire Trevor, John Wayne, George Bancroft, Andy Devine, Thomas Mitchell, John Carradine, Donald Meek, Berton Churchill', 'G', 'A group of people traveling on a stagecoach find their journey complicated by the threat of Geronimo, and learn something about each other in the process.', 'A group of people traveling on a stagecoach find their journey complicated by the threat of Geronimo, and learn something about each other in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgMnfnwWZ3nkx4t0bUDEKtW24O8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:995'),
  ('543003476887551493', 'Stagecoach', 1966, 'Western', 'Gordon Douglas, William H. Clothier', 'Dudley Nichols', 'Ann-Margret, Red Buttons, Mike Connors, Alex Cord, Bing Crosby, Robert Cummings, Van Heflin, Slim Pickens', 'PG', 'A group of unlikely travelling companions find themselves on the same stagecoach to Cheyenne. They include a drunken doctor, a bar girl who''s been thrown out of town, a professional gambler, a travelling liquor salesman, a banker who has decided to embezzle money, a gun-slinger out for revenge and a young woman going to join her army captain husband. All have secrets but when they are set upon by an Indian war party and then a family of outlaws, they find they must all work together if they are to stay alive.', 'A group of unlikely travelling companions find themselves on the same stagecoach to Cheyenne. They include a drunken doctor, a bar girl who''s been thrown out of town, a professional gambler, a travelling liquor salesman, a banker who has decided to embezzle money, a gun-slinger out for revenge and a young woman going to join her army captain husband. All have secrets but when they are set upon by an Indian war party and then a family of outlaws, they find they must all work together if they are to stay alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsifrzutFIzt51FLVDbWW5AOTUG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39287'),
  ('915365893266694880', 'Stagecoach', 1986, 'TV Movie, Western', 'Ted Post, William J. Hole Jr., Jerome M. Siegel', null, 'Willie Nelson, Waylon Jennings, Johnny Cash, Kris Kristofferson, John Schneider, Elizabeth Ashley, Anthony Newley, Anthony Franciosa', null, 'Story follows a stagecoach ride through Old West Apache territory. On board are a cavalry man''s pregnant wife, a prostitute with a broken heart, a Marshal taking in his prisoner Johnny Ringo, a crooked gambler, and the infamous Doc Holliday', 'Story follows a stagecoach ride through Old West Apache territory. On board are a cavalry man''s pregnant wife, a prostitute with a broken heart, a Marshal taking in his prisoner Johnny Ringo, a crooked gambler, and the infamous Doc Holliday', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oMOufGBtSbh4o2lgSRACBDdP2s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33410'),
  ('220895676851256836', 'Stages of Love', 2024, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Victor Rodenbach, Victor Seguin', 'Victor Rodenbach, Camille Lugan, Pauline Bayle', 'William Lebghil, Vimala Pons, Jérémie Laheurte, Pauline Bayle, Julie Hega, Sarah Le Picard, Lucie Gallo, Salif Cissé', null, 'For years, Henri and Nora have shared everything: they love each other, and she directs the plays he performs in. When Henri lands his first film role, the production of their new show is threatened, and their relationship explodes. They start wondering: is it possible to love each other without belonging to one another?', 'For years, Henri and Nora have shared everything: they love each other, and she directs the plays he performs in. When Henri lands his first film role, the production of their new show is threatened, and their relationship explodes. They start wondering: is it possible to love each other without belonging to one another?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/LHDFWJFHVA8Q7HoL6VqcZzpiia.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1315540'),
  ('321474063464902172', 'Staggered', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Martin Clunes, Simon Kossoff', 'Simon Braithwaite, Paul Alexander', 'Martin Clunes, Anna Chancellor, Michael Praed, Michèle Winstanley, Kate Byers, Sarah Winman, David Kossoff, Helena McCarthy', null, 'Very much in love, Neil''s wedding plans are sabotaged, beginning when he is abandoned, naked, on a Scottish island. A road trip ensues, with Neil encountering many obstacles as he makes his way to London for what he believes is to be his wedding day. Or is it?', 'Very much in love, Neil''s wedding plans are sabotaged, beginning when he is abandoned, naked, on a Scottish island. A road trip ensues, with Neil encountering many obstacles as he makes his way to London for what he believes is to be his wedding day. Or is it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2OsUaR35otkGF8cBPuB6EtpbuGK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54804'),
  ('372475993272291109', 'Stain on the Snow', 1954, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'André Bac, Luis Saslavsky', 'Luis Saslavsky, André Tabet', 'Daniel Gélin, Daniel Ivernel, Marie Mansart, Véra Norman, Nadine Basile, Paul Faivre, Joëlle Bernard, Camille Guérini', null, '"La neige était sale" is based on a novel and play by the phenomenally prolific Georges Simenon. Upon learning that his mother was a prostitute, Frank (Daniel Gélin) dejectedly vows that he, too, will live a life of debauchery. Part of his self-degradation program is to kill someone, and since the story takes place during the Nazi occupation of France, he chooses a German officer as his victim. His steady descent into psychosis and depravity becomes his ultimate undoing.', '"La neige était sale" is based on a novel and play by the phenomenally prolific Georges Simenon. Upon learning that his mother was a prostitute, Frank (Daniel Gélin) dejectedly vows that he, too, will live a life of debauchery. Part of his self-degradation program is to kill someone, and since the story takes place during the Nazi occupation of France, he chooses a German officer as his victim. His steady descent into psychosis and depravity becomes his ultimate undoing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jemKpla0wjYLnFFXwNWTS1tIOnC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:545053'),
  ('917355554524219391', 'Staircase', 1969, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Christopher Challis, Marc Grunebaum, Pierre Roubaud', 'Charles Dyer', 'Rex Harrison, Richard Burton, Cathleen Nesbitt, Beatrix Lehmann, Stephen Lewis, Neil Wilson, Gordon Heath, Avril Angers', 'R', 'An aging gay couple owns a barber shop in the East End of London. One of them is a part-time actor about to go on trial for propositioning a police officer. The action takes place over the course of one night as they discuss their loving but often volatile past together and possible future without each other.', 'An aging gay couple owns a barber shop in the East End of London. One of them is a part-time actor about to go on trial for propositioning a police officer. The action takes place over the course of one night as they discuss their loving but often volatile past together and possible future without each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zs9xJWbdEo9DI5YPLtxfeWNnogC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77937'),
  ('169728642332250157', 'Staircase C', 1985, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jean-Charles Tacchella, Jacques Assuérus', 'Elvire Murail, Jean-Charles Tacchella', 'Robin Renucci, Jean-Pierre Bacri, Jacques Bonnaffé, Catherine Leprince, Catherine Frot, Michel Aumont, Claude Rich, Hugues Quester', null, 'Story of a snooty young critic at the centre of several plotlines which run throughout his apartment block.', 'Story of a snooty young critic at the centre of several plotlines which run throughout his apartment block.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QSjLAFbtKi5Ue3UxNY9oXPnkRx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41912'),
  ('944083293383428749', 'Stairway to Light', 1945, 'Drama, History, Documentary', 'Sammy Lee, Charles Salerno Jr.', 'Rosemary Foster', 'John Nesbitt, Dewey Robinson, Gene Roth, Harry Wilson, Wolfgang Zilzer', 'NR', 'This John Nesbitt''s Passing Parade short tells the story of 18th Century French physician Dr. Philippe Pinel, who initiated enlightened, humane treatment of the mentally ill.', 'This John Nesbitt''s Passing Parade short tells the story of 18th Century French physician Dr. Philippe Pinel, who initiated enlightened, humane treatment of the mentally ill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKdnPKY7E5NZSQGIJZtUNnUCnvU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240390'),
  ('557048993417002754', 'Stake Land', 2010, 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jim Mickle, Ryan Samul, Aaron Crozier', 'Jim Mickle, Nick Damici', 'Connor Paolo, Nick Damici, Danielle Harris, Kelly McGillis, Gregory Jones, Traci Hovel, Marianne Hagan, James Godwin', 'R', 'Martin was a normal teenage boy before the country collapsed in an empty pit of economic and political disaster. A vampire epidemic has swept across what is left of the nation''s abandoned towns and cities, and it''s up to Mister, a death dealing, rogue vampire hunter, to get Martin safely north to Canada, the continent''s New Eden.', 'Martin was a normal teenage boy before the country collapsed in an empty pit of economic and political disaster. A vampire epidemic has swept across what is left of the nation''s abandoned towns and cities, and it''s up to Mister, a death dealing, rogue vampire hunter, to get Martin safely north to Canada, the continent''s New Eden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5Cq3svR0XPEb9VkVBHPowT1Bxf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52015'),
  ('1028428426627224004', 'Stakeout', 1958, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Yoshitarō Nomura, Seiji Inoue', 'Shinobu Hashimoto', 'Minoru Ōki, Takahiro Tamura, Seiji Miyaguchi, Hideko Takamine, Kin Sugai, Masao Shimizu, Ryōhei Uchida, Kamatari Fujiwara', null, 'Two detectives begin a stakeout based on the slim chance of catching a murderer whom they suspect will try to reunite with an old flame.', 'Two detectives begin a stakeout based on the slim chance of catching a murderer whom they suspect will try to reunite with an old flame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzfixRrZslqTJlM4i6s61tz8Hbh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37293'),
  ('993374057468486243', 'Stakeout', 1987, 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 'John Seale, John Badham, Peter McLennan', 'Jim Kouf', 'Richard Dreyfuss, Emilio Estevez, Madeleine Stowe, Aidan Quinn, Dan Lauria, Forest Whitaker, Earl Billings, Jackson Davies', 'R', 'Two detectives observe an escaped convict''s ex-girlfriend, but complications set in when one of them falls for her.', 'Two detectives observe an escaped convict''s ex-girlfriend, but complications set in when one of them falls for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tqX6eSGMT2ltu0TX7h6zvEvRCK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10859'),
  ('260525083229658124', 'Stalin', 1992, 'Drama, History, War, TV Movie', 'Ivan Passer, Vilmos Zsigmond', 'Paul Monash', 'Robert Duvall, Julia Ormond, Maximilian Schell, Jeroen Krabbé, Joan Plowright, Jim Carter, Miriam Margolyes, Frank Finlay', 'NR', 'The life and career of the brutal Soviet dictator, Josef Stalin. Through the eyes and memories of Anna Aliluyeva, Stalin’s granddaughter, the film traces the rise of the Bolshevik tyrant from Lenin’s return from exile to his brutal struggle with Trotsky, the creation of his feared secret police and the merciless inner workings of his regime. As Anna recounts her grandfather’s life, viewers gain an intimate, personal perspective on the paranoia and purges that left even his closest circles living in constant fear.', 'The life and career of the brutal Soviet dictator, Josef Stalin. Through the eyes and memories of Anna Aliluyeva, Stalin’s granddaughter, the film traces the rise of the Bolshevik tyrant from Lenin’s return from exile to his brutal struggle with Trotsky, the creation of his feared secret police and the merciless inner workings of his regime. As Anna recounts her grandfather’s life, viewers gain an intimate, personal perspective on the paranoia and purges that left even his closest circles living in constant fear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxkirHGxqcRGN7b8fROEIx85D6E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56448'),
  ('145900537770526733', 'Stalin''s Couch', 2016, 'Drama', 'Fanny Ardant, Renato Berta, Renaud Personnaz', 'Fanny Ardant', 'Gérard Depardieu, Emmanuelle Seigner, Paul Hamy, François Chattot, Tudor Aaron Istodor, Xavier Maly, Luna Picoli-Truffaut, Alexis Manenti', null, 'Set in the 1950s Soviet Union, centers on a young artist who is commissioned to create Stalin''s monument and must go through KGB scrutiny.', 'Set in the 1950s Soviet Union, centers on a young artist who is commissioned to create Stalin''s monument and must go through KGB scrutiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYOsSHic4NXJII1KdcFdVsFnDXS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415005'),
  ('700416464861304916', 'Stalin''s Daughter', 2015, 'Documentary, History', 'Jean Schablin, Jobst Knigge', 'Jobst Knigge', 'Nick Benjamin, Svetlana Alliluyeva, Joseph Stalin, Marfa Peshkova, Alexander Burdonsky, Olga Trifonova, Sergei Khrushchev, Martha Schad', null, 'A shock wave started as Stalin''s daughter Svetlana Iosifovna Alliluyeva fled to the West. During her childhood, she remained at the center of power and was her father''s favorite child. However, her life was overshadowed by death and violence. Her mother and brother died, family members were murdered, and her partner was exiled by Stalin. The Iron Curtain was an obstacle in her family dream. This documentary shows for the first time interviews with friends and relatives, exclusive photos and documentation, as well as the last and never broadcast interview with Alliloejeva.', 'A shock wave started as Stalin''s daughter Svetlana Iosifovna Alliluyeva fled to the West. During her childhood, she remained at the center of power and was her father''s favorite child. However, her life was overshadowed by death and violence. Her mother and brother died, family members were murdered, and her partner was exiled by Stalin. The Iron Curtain was an obstacle in her family dream. This documentary shows for the first time interviews with friends and relatives, exclusive photos and documentation, as well as the last and never broadcast interview with Alliloejeva.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PKBBo0nzvKtW0wysKYVi7f22Bf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433185'),
  ('1081815670806383709', 'Stalingrad', 1993, 'Drama, History, War', 'Joseph Vilsmaier, Rolf Greim, Klaus Moderegger', 'Joseph Vilsmaier, Jürgen Büscher, Johannes Heide', 'Dominique Horwitz, Thomas Kretschmann, Jochen Nickel, Sebastian Rudolph, Dana Vávrová, Martin Benrath, Sylvester Groth, Karel Heřmánek', 'NR', 'A German Platoon is explored through the brutal fighting of the Battle of Stalingrad. After half of their number is wiped out and they''re placed under the command of a sadistic captain, the platoon lieutenant leads his men to desert. The platoon members attempt escape from the city, now surrounded by the Soviet Army.', 'A German Platoon is explored through the brutal fighting of the Battle of Stalingrad. After half of their number is wiped out and they''re placed under the command of a sadistic captain, the platoon lieutenant leads his men to desert. The platoon members attempt escape from the city, now surrounded by the Soviet Army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rB78VDAOK94KJWp9ofgE3GSQEor.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11101'),
  ('341205440178323048', 'Stalingrad', 2013, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Fyodor Bondarchuk, Maxim Osadchy-Korytkovsky, Inna Shterengarts', 'Ilya Tilkin, Sergey Snezhkin', 'Mariya Smolnikova, Yanina Studilina, Pyotr Fyodorov, Thomas Kretschmann, Sergey Bondarchuk, Dmitry Lysenkov, Andrey Smolyakov, Aleksey Barabash', 'R', 'A band of determined Russian soldiers fight to hold a strategic building in their devastated city against a ruthless German army, and in the process become deeply connected to a Russian woman who has been living there.', 'A band of determined Russian soldiers fight to hold a strategic building in their devastated city against a ruthless German army, and in the process become deeply connected to a Russian woman who has been living there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pk2d5ahR9g4R3YDlhNA5m1vHhFv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203793'),
  ('793005683975181430', 'Stalingrad: Dogs, Do You Want to Live Forever?', 1959, 'Drama, War', 'Frank Wisbar, Helmut Ashley', 'Frank Dimen, Heinz Schröter, Frank Wisbar', 'Joachim Hansen, Wilhelm Borchert, Wolfgang Preiss, Carl Lange, Horst Frank, Peter Carsten, Richard Münch, Günter Pfitzmann', null, 'In the winter of 1943, against the background of battle scenes, a young German Lieutenant who increasingly distrusts the inhuman Nazi ideology struggles with the concept of war.', 'In the winter of 1943, against the background of battle scenes, a young German Lieutenant who increasingly distrusts the inhuman Nazi ideology struggles with the concept of war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPEl5chk4Sbe6P9ih7vlkszCE9d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46874'),
  ('1135204853092906597', 'Stalingrad: Film 1', 1990, 'War, History', 'Yuri Ozerov, Igor Slabnevich, Vladimir Gusev', 'Yuri Ozerov', 'Mikhail Ulyanov, Archil Gomiashvili, Sergey Nikonenko, Boris Nevzorov, Bruno Frejndlikh, Liubomiras Laucevičius, Yelena Tonunts, Yuri Kuzmenko', null, 'In January 1942, Adolf Hitler appoints Fedor von Bock to command Army Group South and supervise Operation Blau. The German forces advance in the south of Russia, scattering the Soviets and approaching Stalingrad, that seems on the verge of falling to the enemy''s hands. The movie ends with Vasily Chuikov assuming command of the 62nd Army at September.', 'In January 1942, Adolf Hitler appoints Fedor von Bock to command Army Group South and supervise Operation Blau. The German forces advance in the south of Russia, scattering the Soviets and approaching Stalingrad, that seems on the verge of falling to the enemy''s hands. The movie ends with Vasily Chuikov assuming command of the 62nd Army at September.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYNptPu6yd9GNhnKzp2OBkYTRXz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156141'),
  ('960412414858581116', 'Stalk of the Celery Monster', 1979, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tim Burton', 'Tim Burton', null, null, 'The only fragments remaining of the film today depict a dentist named Dr. Maxwell Payne making bloody experiments with his patients. He tries a woman, and after that the monster of the title shows up, roaring. In the following clip, the woman leaves, as Dr. Maxwell Payne searches for another victim.', 'The only fragments remaining of the film today depict a dentist named Dr. Maxwell Payne making bloody experiments with his patients. He tries a woman, and after that the monster of the title shows up, roaring. In the following clip, the woman leaves, as Dr. Maxwell Payne searches for another victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80t14LHKgszE7pKz199P4nDRpWI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187478'),
  ('234397868634667071', 'Stalked by My Doctor', 2015, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Horror', 'David Benullo, Chris Fishel, Daniel Ringey', 'Doug Campbell', 'Eric Roberts, Brianna Joy Chomer, Deborah Zoe, Jon Briddell, Carson Boatman, Caryn Richman, Wyntergrace Williams, Crystal Allen', 'PG-13', 'When a teenage girl is miraculously saved by a heart surgeon, the doctor begins to flirt with her. Her father doesn’t believe her and unbeknownst to all, the doctor is obsessed with the girl.', 'When a teenage girl is miraculously saved by a heart surgeon, the doctor begins to flirt with her. Her father doesn’t believe her and unbeknownst to all, the doctor is obsessed with the girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJn7Mo1RjC0mTqiiVY0T2VlSmwz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374515'),
  ('282476716774811056', 'Stalked by My Doctor: The Return', 2016, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Horror', 'Robert Ballo, Daniel Ringey, John Rhode', 'Doug Campbell', 'Eric Roberts, Claire Blackwelder, Hilary Greer, Mark Grossman, Christopher Crabb, Lesli Kay, Tiffany Adams, Sarah Kraft', null, 'Dr. Beck, who has changed his name, saves a young teenage girl drowning in Mexico, whom he falls in love with. As always, there are some complications in his way, but he has plans to possibly get past them and get the girl of his dreams.', 'Dr. Beck, who has changed his name, saves a young teenage girl drowning in Mexico, whom he falls in love with. As always, there are some complications in his way, but he has plans to possibly get past them and get the girl of his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNR9qhsV05lZpFCgT8YfTqnsHCP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:414610'),
  ('148597770028025533', 'Stalked by My Neighbor', 2015, 'Crime, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Daniel Ringey, Neil Kinsella, Doug Campbell', 'Doug Campbell', 'Amy Pietz, Kelcie Stranahan, Katrina Norman, Grant Harvey, Ethan Erickson, Kelly Packard, Dorien Wilson, Charles Hoyes', null, 'A girl and her mother escape to suburban safety after a home invasion scares them out of the city, but they''re soon menaced by a sinister figure.', 'A girl and her mother escape to suburban safety after a home invasion scares them out of the city, but they''re soon menaced by a sinister figure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dU0c3qVTYKXcBPP2fIffdEPrThQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333620'),
  ('236087302939297693', 'Stalker', 2020, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Tyler Savage, Antonio Cisneros', 'Tyler Savage, Dash Hawkins', 'Vincent Van Horn, Landry Allbright, Paula Jai Parker, Michael Joplin, Dusty Sorg, Carla Valentine, Stephanie Barkley, Christine Ko', null, 'A young man’s budding romance is threatened when he befriends a strange ride share driver.', 'A young man’s budding romance is threatened when he befriends a strange ride share driver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0DxpP5gdTPQKxZrBV4FWQdBfLB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:724901'),
  ('538055181139064091', 'Stalker', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Steve Johnson, Simon Stolland', 'Chris Watt', 'Sophie Skelton, Stuart Brennan, Bret Hart, Olivia J. Night, Doddi El-Gabry', null, 'Rose Hepburn, a young actor working in horror movies, returns to her empty hotel. Forced to use the old freight elevator, it jolts to a halt on the twelfth floor, leaving her trapped with an unusual stranger. Left with no mobile phone signal as a storm approaches, tensions escalate and suspicions rise when Rose discovers the identity of the mysterious man is Daniel Reed, a camera operator on her latest movie, who is seemingly obsessed with her. As the elevator hangs precariously high about to plunge down at any minute, some harsh truths and actions start unfolding.', 'Rose Hepburn, a young actor working in horror movies, returns to her empty hotel. Forced to use the old freight elevator, it jolts to a halt on the twelfth floor, leaving her trapped with an unusual stranger. Left with no mobile phone signal as a storm approaches, tensions escalate and suspicions rise when Rose discovers the identity of the mysterious man is Daniel Reed, a camera operator on her latest movie, who is seemingly obsessed with her. As the elevator hangs precariously high about to plunge down at any minute, some harsh truths and actions start unfolding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6aZ3KUntef8IbT16uMNSkcUPe1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1004130'),
  ('65253302843128926', 'Stalled', 2013, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Christian James', 'Dan Palmer', 'Dan Palmer, Antonia Bernath, Tamaryn Payne, Giles Alderson, Victoria Broom, Marcus Kelly, Victoria Eldon, Chris R. Wright', null, 'A janitor gets trapped in a women''s restroom and encounters an all-out attack by a horde of zombies.', 'A janitor gets trapped in a women''s restroom and encounters an all-out attack by a horde of zombies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZsdkeOJJ0MFqcGRrbaHF4Rs5YC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169644'),
  ('1049399230126661607', 'Stalled', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Matthew Black, Kyle Sanders', 'Matthew Black', 'Jacob Daniels, Larry Woods', null, 'Late for the most important meeting of his life, a toxic executive finds himself trapped in a time paradox within a public restroom.', 'Late for the most important meeting of his life, a toxic executive finds himself trapped in a time paradox within a public restroom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9NRpxQRZrmKLQL9F9d0ADRB6Yx8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1032394'),
  ('557169568537342834', 'Stamboul Quest', 1934, 'Romance, Thriller, Drama', 'Sam Wood, James Wong Howe', 'Leo Birinski, Herman J. Mankiewicz', 'Myrna Loy, George Brent, Lionel Atwill, C. Henry Gordon, Rudolph Anders, Mischa Auer, Leo G. Carroll', 'NR', 'In 1915, German Counter-Intelligence Chief Von Sturm learns that someone is providing the British with critical strategic planning for the Turkish theater. He suspects Ali Bey, Turkish commander for the Dardanelles, and dispatches Annemarie to Constantinople to secure the proof. En route, she becomes involved with Douglas Beall, a footloose American. Complications ensue, requiring Annemarie to engage in some dangerous improvisations.', 'In 1915, German Counter-Intelligence Chief Von Sturm learns that someone is providing the British with critical strategic planning for the Turkish theater. He suspects Ali Bey, Turkish commander for the Dardanelles, and dispatches Annemarie to Constantinople to secure the proof. En route, she becomes involved with Douglas Beall, a footloose American. Complications ensue, requiring Annemarie to engage in some dangerous improvisations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQP6AHp30m2tDttIoTaXuwf5Vd7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63041'),
  ('837021877076542091', 'Stamp Day for Superman', 1954, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Thomas Carr', 'David T. Chantler, Whitney Ellsworth', 'George Reeves, Noel Neill, Jack Larson, John Hamilton, Tristram Coffin, Billy Nelson', null, 'Superman''s commitment to promote US Savings Stamps is temporarily delayed when Lois is kidnapped.', 'Superman''s commitment to promote US Savings Stamps is temporarily delayed when Lois is kidnapped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/JMrDpSFbnn8PyLwrQFRgu16wjM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192650'),
  ('542782491018906610', 'Stamped from the Beginning', 2023, 'Documentary, Animation', 'Roger Ross Williams, Marc Kelly', 'David Teague', 'Angela Davis, Alexa Rachelle Jennings, Rafa Marinho, Ibram X. Kendi, Honorée Fanonne Jeffers, Brittany Packnett, Jennifer L. Morgan, Paisley Rose Carswell', 'R', 'Using innovative animation and expert insights, this documentary based on Ibram X. Kendi''s bestseller explores the history of racist ideas in America.', 'Using innovative animation and expert insights, this documentary based on Ibram X. Kendi''s bestseller explores the history of racist ideas in America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dksKQ0jEpKCG31tfyh7Pag7ALiA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1132535'),
  ('37235265931127690', 'Stan & Ollie', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jon S. Baird, Laurie Rose, Sarah MacFarlane', 'Jeff Pope', 'Steve Coogan, John C. Reilly, Shirley Henderson, Nina Arianda, Rufus Jones, Danny Huston, Joseph Balderrama, John Henshaw', 'PG', 'With their golden era long behind them, comedy duo Stan Laurel and Oliver Hardy embark on a variety hall tour of Britain and Ireland. Despite the pressures of a hectic schedule, and with the support of their wives Lucille and Ida – a formidable double act in their own right – the pair''s love of performing, as well as for each other, endures as they secure their place in the hearts of their adoring public', 'With their golden era long behind them, comedy duo Stan Laurel and Oliver Hardy embark on a variety hall tour of Britain and Ireland. Despite the pressures of a hectic schedule, and with the support of their wives Lucille and Ida – a formidable double act in their own right – the pair''s love of performing, as well as for each other, endures as they secure their place in the hearts of their adoring public', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qDBDXA8Od8gc4IQMnoXUKyj8Pf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394741'),
  ('292684240566373427', 'Stan Helsing', 2009, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Bo Zenga, Robert C. New', 'Bo Zenga', 'Steve Howey, Diora Baird, Kenan Thompson, Desi Lydic, Leslie Nielsen, Travis MacDonald, Darren Moore, Jeremy Crittenden', 'R', 'A spoof on many horror movie series. Ending his shift at the video rental, Stan''s picked up by his BFF and 2 cute girls, all going to a Halloween party. Will they even get there?', 'A spoof on many horror movie series. Ending his shift at the video rental, Stan''s picked up by his BFF and 2 cute girls, all going to a Halloween party. Will they even get there?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qDlmKahejt0NoQzw65tnLayEhHZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23988'),
