  ('135406062970403895', 'Stan the Flasher', 1990, 'Drama', 'Serge Gainsbourg, Olivier Guéneau', 'Serge Gainsbourg', 'Claude Berri, Aurore Clément, Élodie Bouchez, Richard Bohringer, Michel Robin, Daniel Duval, Serge Gainsbourg', null, 'Claude Berri, who usually participates in films by directing them, here returns to the screen as Stan, an over-the-hill lothario, much given to quoting Shakespeare, who occasionally goes around naked under his raincoat and exposes himself to strangers, who are usually not interested in his primitive display of genitalia. It also appears that he is unable to sexually satisfy his much younger lover, and he suspects her of having another boyfriend. He earns his living tutoring students (mostly young girls) in English literature. When, in his frustration, he gropes one of the girls in her home during a tutoring session, she protests, her father (who is at home) beats him up, and he is sentenced to a jail term. There, he is teamed up with a slightly loopy murderer. When he gets out of jail, he finds his girlfriend has left for good, and ends his life.', 'Claude Berri, who usually participates in films by directing them, here returns to the screen as Stan, an over-the-hill lothario, much given to quoting Shakespeare, who occasionally goes around naked under his raincoat and exposes himself to strangers, who are usually not interested in his primitive display of genitalia. It also appears that he is unable to sexually satisfy his much younger lover, and he suspects her of having another boyfriend. He earns his living tutoring students (mostly young girls) in English literature. When, in his frustration, he gropes one of the girls in her home during a tutoring session, she protests, her father (who is at home) beats him up, and he is sentenced to a jail term. There, he is teamed up with a slightly loopy murderer. When he gets out of jail, he finds his girlfriend has left for good, and ends his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2SirYuwwJIhkxrL8SXtkrWbez1J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72590'),
  ('1009022304267170356', 'Stand Alone', 1985, 'Action, Drama', 'Alan Beattie, Tom Richmond, Tim Suhrstedt', 'Roy Carlson', 'Charles Durning, Pam Grier, James Keach, Bert Remsen, Willard E. Pugh, Barbara Sammeth, Lu Leonard, Cory ''Bumper'' Yothers', 'R', 'A World War II vet is pushed to the limit when gang members and drug dealers take over his neighborhood.', 'A World War II vet is pushed to the limit when gang members and drug dealers take over his neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jelvAOK817mp2FOKTkWsXi2VJiP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226739'),
  ('346607127940574164', 'Stand by for Action', 1942, 'Action, Drama, War, Comedy', 'Robert Z. Leonard, Charles Rosher', 'George Bruce, John L. Balderston, Herman J. Mankiewicz', 'Robert Taylor, Charles Laughton, Brian Donlevy, Walter Brennan, Chill Wills, Marilyn Maxwell, Henry O''Neill, Marta Linden', 'NR', 'U. S. Navy Lieutenant Gregg Masterman, of The Harvard and Boston Back Bay Mastermans, learned about the sea while winning silver cups sailing his yacht. He climbs swiftly in rank, and is now Junior Aide to Rear Admiral Stephen Thomas.', 'U. S. Navy Lieutenant Gregg Masterman, of The Harvard and Boston Back Bay Mastermans, learned about the sea while winning silver cups sailing his yacht. He climbs swiftly in rank, and is now Junior Aide to Rear Admiral Stephen Thomas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qx89ELAxdMHhRPBr8PIv3O6W2PH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98399'),
  ('995788013061894464', 'Stand by Me', 1986, 'Crime, Drama', 'Rob Reiner, Thomas Del Ruth, Irby Smith', 'Raynold Gideon, Bruce A. Evans', 'Wil Wheaton, River Phoenix, Corey Feldman, Jerry O''Connell, Kiefer Sutherland, Casey Siemaszko, Gary Riley, Bradley Gregg', 'R', 'After learning that a boy their age has been accidentally killed near their rural homes, four boys decide to go see the body. Gordie, Vern, Chris, and Teddy encounter a mean junk man and a marsh full of leeches, but they also learn more about one another and their very different home lives. Just a lark at first, the boys'' adventure evolves into a defining event in their lives.', 'After learning that a boy their age has been accidentally killed near their rural homes, four boys decide to go see the body. Gordie, Vern, Chris, and Teddy encounter a mean junk man and a marsh full of leeches, but they also learn more about one another and their very different home lives. Just a lark at first, the boys'' adventure evolves into a defining event in their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vz0w9BSehcqjDcJOjRaCk7fgJe7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235'),
  ('939418041665478413', 'Stand by Me Doraemon', 2014, 'Animation, Adventure, Science Fiction, Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'Takashi Yamazaki, Ryuichi Yagi', 'Takashi Yamazaki', 'Wasabi Mizuta, Megumi Oohara, Yumi Kakazu, Subaru Kimura, Tomokazu Seki, Satoshi Tsumabuki, Vanilla Yamazaki, Sachi Matsumoto', null, 'Sewashi and Doraemon find themselves way back in time and meet Nobita. It is up to Doraemon to take care of Nobita or else he will not return to the present.', 'Sewashi and Doraemon find themselves way back in time and meet Nobita. It is up to Doraemon to take care of Nobita or else he will not return to the present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wc7XQbfx6EIQqCuvmBMt3aisb2Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265712'),
  ('1008673865696585202', 'Stand by Me Doraemon 2', 2020, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Science Fiction, Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'Takashi Yamazaki, Ryuichi Yagi, Keiichi Momose', 'Takashi Yamazaki', 'Wasabi Mizuta, Megumi Oohara, Yumi Kakazu, Subaru Kimura, Tomokazu Seki, Bakarhythm, Shin''ichi Hatori, Nobuko Miyamoto', null, 'Nobita travels to the future to show his beloved grandma his bride, but adult Nobita has fled his own wedding.', 'Nobita travels to the future to show his beloved grandma his bride, but adult Nobita has fled his own wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBv8iOFPLnXmtELUjcFc7OKHsR4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728754'),
  ('403698457803786689', 'Stand Out: An LGBTQ+ Celebration', 2022, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Page Hurwitz, Linda Mendoza', null, 'Billy Eichner, Eddie Izzard, Margaret Cho, Sandra Bernhard, Tig Notaro, Wanda Sykes, Rosie O''Donnell, James Adomian', null, 'A group of LGBTQ+ comedians get together to celebrate a brand of queer comedy. Legends, headliners, and emerging talent all perform at The Greek Theatre for an unforgettable queer stand-up event.', 'A group of LGBTQ+ comedians get together to celebrate a brand of queer comedy. Legends, headliners, and emerging talent all perform at The Greek Theatre for an unforgettable queer stand-up event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pflwbz4m4YCwS5wb0wXCk2lDkgU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:982783'),
  ('968628159001554334', 'Stand Up and Cheer!', 1934, 'Comedy, Music, Family', 'Hamilton MacFadden, Ernest Palmer, L. William O''Connell', null, 'Warner Baxter, Madge Evans, James Dunn, Sylvia Froos, John Boles, Arthur Byron, Shirley Temple, Ralph Morgan', 'PG', 'President Franklin Roosevelt appoints a theatrical producer as the new Secretary of Amusement in order to cheer up an American public still suffering through the Depression. The new secretary soon runs afoul of political lobbyists out to destroy his department.', 'President Franklin Roosevelt appoints a theatrical producer as the new Secretary of Amusement in order to cheer up an American public still suffering through the Depression. The new secretary soon runs afoul of political lobbyists out to destroy his department.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBRPNKU85TOmSzXVLzUF3lmlDRL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46159'),
  ('692095443029250897', 'Stand Up Crabs, the Sea Is Rising!', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Jacques Grand-Jouan', 'Jean-Jacques Grand-Jouan', 'Martin Lamotte, Véronique Genest, Virginie Thévenet, Richard Bohringer, Valérie Mairesse, Dominique Lavanant, Luis Rego, László Szabó', null, 'Barely out of prison, where she spent five long years, a pretty prostitute sows disorder in the life of a hitherto peaceful couple.', 'Barely out of prison, where she spent five long years, a pretty prostitute sows disorder in the life of a hitherto peaceful couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCpvkgUwia7p4isNMIP73Aulk5L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:304322'),
  ('120069888381161083', 'Stand Up Girl', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Nawell Madani, Ludovic Colbeau-Justin, Thomas Lerebour', 'Nawell Madani, Ali Bougheraba, Kamel Guemra', 'Nawell Madani, François Berléand, Mimoun Benabderrahmane, Leyla Doriane, Antoinette Gomis, Lara Laquiz, Djebril Zonga, Olivier Barthélémy', null, 'Lila, grows up in the high-rises of the Marolles in Brussels. Along with her sister and her friends, she dreams of becoming a dancer and revolutionising the world of hip-hop. While her friends stay in Brussels, Lila leaves everything - comfort, family - behind to go to Paris, where she is certain her persistence will pay off. Except that life in Paris quickly takes an unexpected turn. The woman who dreamed of being a choreographer ends up as a lap dancer in a rap video, and that’s only the beginning of her disillusionment. After a chance meeting with a drama teacher, she bears her heart and soul on stage and begins doing stand-up. This time, her unusual dedication leads her to find her calling. However, she still has to fight one final battle: convincing her father that she has made the right choice.', 'Lila, grows up in the high-rises of the Marolles in Brussels. Along with her sister and her friends, she dreams of becoming a dancer and revolutionising the world of hip-hop. While her friends stay in Brussels, Lila leaves everything - comfort, family - behind to go to Paris, where she is certain her persistence will pay off. Except that life in Paris quickly takes an unexpected turn. The woman who dreamed of being a choreographer ends up as a lap dancer in a rap video, and that’s only the beginning of her disillusionment. After a chance meeting with a drama teacher, she bears her heart and soul on stage and begins doing stand-up. This time, her unusual dedication leads her to find her calling. However, she still has to fight one final battle: convincing her father that she has made the right choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iawovuxzAurX1OGhG5NtikU042.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398939'),
  ('286736133487184940', 'Stand Up Guys', 2012, 'Thriller, Comedy, Action, Crime', 'Fisher Stevens, Scott Robertson, Jonas Spaccarotelli', 'Noah Haidle', 'Al Pacino, Christopher Walken, Alan Arkin, Julianna Margulies, Addison Timlin, Vanessa Ferlito, Mark Margolis, Katheryn Winnick', 'R', 'After serving 28 years in prison for accidentally killing the son of a crime boss, newly paroled gangster Val reunites with his former partners in crime, Doc and Hirsch, for a night on the town. As the three men revisit old haunts, reflect on their glory days and try to make up for lost time, one wrestles with a terrible quandary: Doc has orders to kill Val, and time is running out for him to figure out a way out of his dilemma.', 'After serving 28 years in prison for accidentally killing the son of a crime boss, newly paroled gangster Val reunites with his former partners in crime, Doc and Hirsch, for a night on the town. As the three men revisit old haunts, reflect on their glory days and try to make up for lost time, one wrestles with a terrible quandary: Doc has orders to kill Val, and time is running out for him to figure out a way out of his dilemma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pOXmX1rldFQv3rFkWwe4uqbPWPJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121824'),
