  ('951448617372559258', 'Stand-In', 1937, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tay Garnett, Charles Kerr, Charles G. Clarke', 'C. Graham Baker, Gene Towne', 'Leslie Howard, Joan Blondell, Humphrey Bogart, Alan Mowbray, Marla Shelton, C. Henry Gordon, Jack Carson, William V. Mong', 'NR', 'An east coast efficiency expert, who stakes his reputation on his ability to turn around a financially troubled Hollywood studio, receives some help from a former child star who now works as a stand-in for the studio.', 'An east coast efficiency expert, who stakes his reputation on his ability to turn around a financially troubled Hollywood studio, receives some help from a former child star who now works as a stand-in for the studio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kElHrXgDNhZ9MSeiJqaeaQ9NZMB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118936'),
  ('412082016205967506', 'Standard Operating Procedure', 2008, 'Documentary, War', 'Errol Morris, Robert Richardson, Robert Chappell', null, 'Javal Davis, Ken Davis, Tony Diaz, Tim Dugan, Lynndie England, Jefferey Frost, Megan Ambuhl Graner, Sabrina Harman', 'R', 'Errol Morris examines the incidents of abuse and torture of suspected terrorists at the hands of U.S. forces at the Abu Ghraib prison.', 'Errol Morris examines the incidents of abuse and torture of suspected terrorists at the hands of U.S. forces at the Abu Ghraib prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2QCXsisMLYsozC2qJtYGa3Rvsi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8847'),
  ('1112506033688812338', 'Stander', 2003, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Bronwen Hughes, Jess Hall, Guy Travers', 'Bima Stagg', 'Thomas Jane, Dexter Fletcher, David O''Hara, Deborah Kara Unger, Ashley Taylor, Marius Weyers, At Botha, Lionel Newton', 'R', 'The life and career of Andre Stander, a South African police officer turned bank robber.', 'The life and career of Andre Stander, a South African police officer turned bank robber.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZdbA5MScI0dDeeyI2BzuI2lfut.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18927'),
  ('11849573656385118', 'Standing in the Shadows of Motown', 2002, 'Documentary, Music', 'Paul Justman', 'Walter Dallas, Ntozake Shange', 'Richard ''Pistol'' Allen, Jack Ashford, Bob Babbitt, Benny ''Papa Zita'' Benjamin, Eddie ''Bongo'' Brown, Bootsy Collins, Johnny Griffith, Ben Harper', 'PG', 'In 1959, Berry Gordy Jr. gathered the best musicians from Detroit''s thriving jazz and blues scene to begin cutting songs for his new record company. Over a fourteen year period they were the heartbeat on every hit from Motown''s Detroit era. By the end of their phenomenal run, this unheralded group of musicians had played on more number ones hits than the Beach Boys, the Rolling Stones, Elvis and the Beatles combined - which makes them the greatest hit machine in the history of popular music. They called themselves the Funk Brothers. Forty-one years after they played their first note on a Motown record and three decades since they were all together, the Funk Brothers reunited back in Detroit to play their music and tell their unforgettable story, with the help of archival footage, still photos, narration, interviews, re-creation scenes, 20 Motown master tracks, and twelve new live performances of Motown classics with the Brothers backing up contemporary performers.', 'In 1959, Berry Gordy Jr. gathered the best musicians from Detroit''s thriving jazz and blues scene to begin cutting songs for his new record company. Over a fourteen year period they were the heartbeat on every hit from Motown''s Detroit era. By the end of their phenomenal run, this unheralded group of musicians had played on more number ones hits than the Beach Boys, the Rolling Stones, Elvis and the Beatles combined - which makes them the greatest hit machine in the history of popular music. They called themselves the Funk Brothers. Forty-one years after they played their first note on a Motown record and three decades since they were all together, the Funk Brothers reunited back in Detroit to play their music and tell their unforgettable story, with the help of archival footage, still photos, narration, interviews, re-creation scenes, 20 Motown master tracks, and twelve new live performances of Motown classics with the Brothers backing up contemporary performers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rsOTrPTRhBgw5eWAgJISBMiIg5m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30192'),
  ('964327692822984224', 'Standing Still', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Matthew Cole Weiss', 'Matthew Perniciaro, Timm Sharp', 'Jon Abrahams, Amy Adams, Roger Avary, Mena Suvari, Aaron Stanford, Xander Berkeley, Ethan Embry, Adam Garcia', 'R', 'A chain reaction of confrontations and romantic encounters occurs when college friends reunite for one''s wedding.', 'A chain reaction of confrontations and romantic encounters occurs when college friends reunite for one''s wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKn3tCS4cZAOWbrjHaAYyDqdkzH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14167'),
  ('318105808311608684', 'Standing Tall', 2015, 'Drama', 'Guillaume Schiffman, Emmanuelle Bercot', 'Marcia Romano, Emmanuelle Bercot', 'Rod Paradot, Catherine Deneuve, Sara Forestier, Benoît Magimel, Diane Rouxel, Élizabeth Mazev, Anne Suarez, Christophe Meynet', null, 'The film tells the story of Malony and his education as he grows from a six-year-old into an 18-year-old. A minors’ judge and a caseworker work tirelessly to try to save the young offender.', 'The film tells the story of Malony and his education as he grows from a six-year-old into an 18-year-old. A minors’ judge and a caseworker work tirelessly to try to save the young offender.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCl8rEQnv1hgvIdH6SVKwzecaOT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329819'),
  ('1083474647024520256', 'Standing Up', 2013, 'Drama', 'Alex Nepomniaschy, D.J. Caruso', 'D.J. Caruso', 'Chandler Canterbury, Annalise Basso, Radha Mitchell, Val Kilmer, Keith Flippen, William J. Harrison, Jared Kemmerling, Kate Maberly', null, 'Based on one of the most beloved Young Adult novels of all time: Two kids are stripped naked and left together on an island in a lake - victims of a vicious summer camp prank; But rather than have to return to camp and face the humiliation, they decide to take off, on the run together. What follows is a three day odyssey of discovery and self-discovery.', 'Based on one of the most beloved Young Adult novels of all time: Two kids are stripped naked and left together on an island in a lake - victims of a vicious summer camp prank; But rather than have to return to camp and face the humiliation, they decide to take off, on the run together. What follows is a three day odyssey of discovery and self-discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kOfwxDQ1REdQyZ9lyiBKEqSM6K9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179154'),
  ('523677016961909854', 'Standing Up, Falling Down', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Matt Ratner, Noah Rosenthal', 'Peter Hoare', 'Billy Crystal, Ben Schwartz, Grace Gummer, Eloise Mumford, John Behlmann, David Castañeda, Kevin Dunn, Debra Monk', null, 'An unlikely friendship kindles between a struggling stand-up comedian from L.A. — forced to move back home to Eastern Long Island with his tail between his legs — and a tragically flawed, but charming and charismatic, alcoholic dermatologist. Discovering to be kindred spirits, each helps the other find healing, in addition to the confidence to face the "failures" in their lives.', 'An unlikely friendship kindles between a struggling stand-up comedian from L.A. — forced to move back home to Eastern Long Island with his tail between his legs — and a tragically flawed, but charming and charismatic, alcoholic dermatologist. Discovering to be kindred spirits, each helps the other find healing, in addition to the confidence to face the "failures" in their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPf007Zt2zdPk62FfeNYnxBbXUG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597231'),
  ('343898700371062887', 'Standoff', 1998, 'Crime', 'Andrew Chapman, Nancy Schreiber, Bill Berry', 'Andrew Chapman', 'Robert Sean Leonard, Dennis Haysbert, Natasha Henstridge, Tricia Vessey, Paul Ben-Victor, Keith Carradine, Paul Scherrer, Andre G. Ellingson', null, 'The FBI and Texas police make ready to storm the headquarters of a heavily armed sect of religious fanatics. But the operation goes horribly wrong and a couple of agents seek protection at an abandoned farm. But they are not the only ones there.', 'The FBI and Texas police make ready to storm the headquarters of a heavily armed sect of religious fanatics. But the operation goes horribly wrong and a couple of agents seek protection at an abandoned farm. But they are not the only ones there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5HKyZ4dZq7d2meVJuM6zxZ5Df9o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169158'),
  ('838119890211375549', 'Standoff', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Adam Alleca, Zoran Popović, Elizabeth Scherberger', 'Adam Alleca', 'Thomas Jane, Laurence Fishburne, Jim Watson, Ella Ballentine, Joanna Douglas, Ted Atherton, Laura de Carteret, John Tench', 'R', 'A troubled veteran gets a chance at redemption by protecting a girl from an assassin after she witnesses a murder. Holding a shotgun with a single shell, he engages in physical and psychological warfare in a desperate fight for the girl''s life.', 'A troubled veteran gets a chance at redemption by protecting a girl from an assassin after she witnesses a murder. Holding a shotgun with a single shell, he engages in physical and psychological warfare in a desperate fight for the girl''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9gqp8wFesW3LxxvCPKswLchPSeO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:344041'),
  ('519948138038189476', 'Stanley', 1972, 'Horror', 'William Grefé, Clifford H. Poland Jr.', 'Gary Crutcher, William Grefé', 'Chris Robinson, Alex Rocco, Steve Alaimo, Susan Carroll, Mark Harris, Rey Baumel, Paul Avery, Marcia Knight', 'PG', 'Tim Ochopee, a shell-shocked Seminole Indian has just returned from a tour of Vietnam. He lives a peaceful life deep in the Everglades with his pet snake Stanley. Upon his return, he finds out his father has passed away. When he learns how he was killed, Tim lets Stanley and his brood loose on the people who''ve done him wrong, leading to a thrilling climax.', 'Tim Ochopee, a shell-shocked Seminole Indian has just returned from a tour of Vietnam. He lives a peaceful life deep in the Everglades with his pet snake Stanley. Upon his return, he finds out his father has passed away. When he learns how he was killed, Tim lets Stanley and his brood loose on the people who''ve done him wrong, leading to a thrilling climax.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8bGLKW2b3avorw8l29oqG9pD8E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67320'),
  ('447379433666593967', 'Stanley & Iris', 1990, 'Drama, Romance', 'Martin Ritt, Donald McAlpine, Patrick J. Palmer', 'Irving Ravetch, Harriet Frank Jr.', 'Jane Fonda, Robert De Niro, Swoosie Kurtz, Martha Plimpton, Jamey Sheridan, Feodor Chaliapin Jr., Zohra Lampert, Loretta Devine', 'PG-13', 'An illiterate cook at a company cafeteria tries for the attention of a newly widowed woman. As they get to know one another, she discovers his inability to read. When he is fired, she takes on trying to teach him to read in her kitchen each night.', 'An illiterate cook at a company cafeteria tries for the attention of a newly widowed woman. As they get to know one another, she discovers his inability to read. When he is fired, she takes on trying to teach him to read in her kitchen each night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ydDNS3aCnBWOT9jQiEVmN56rk2i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36094'),
  ('478900241913437934', 'Stanley and Livingstone', 1939, 'Adventure, History', 'Henry King, Otto Brower, George Barnes', 'Philip Dunne, Julien Josephson', 'Spencer Tracy, Nancy Kelly, Richard Greene, Walter Brennan, Charles Coburn, Cedric Hardwicke, Henry Hull, Henry Travers', 'NR', 'When American newspaperman and adventurer Henry M. Stanley comes back from the western Indian wars, his editor James Gordon Bennett sends him to Africa to find Dr. David Livingstone, the missing Scottish missionary. Stanley finds Livingstone ("Dr. Livingstone, I presume.") blissfully doling out medicine and religion to the happy natives. His story is at first disbelieved.', 'When American newspaperman and adventurer Henry M. Stanley comes back from the western Indian wars, his editor James Gordon Bennett sends him to Africa to find Dr. David Livingstone, the missing Scottish missionary. Stanley finds Livingstone ("Dr. Livingstone, I presume.") blissfully doling out medicine and religion to the happy natives. His story is at first disbelieved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qzllhCKNOsrFWhULvMpSaE2OaFx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89086'),
  ('639759562167225089', 'Stanley Ka Dabba', 2011, 'Comedy, Family', 'Amole Gupte', 'Amole Gupte', 'Partho A. Gupte, Amole Gupte, Divya Dutta, Raj Zutshi, Walter D''Souza, Leo Crasto, Faraz Ansari, Vidyut Jammwal', null, 'School boy Stanley does not carry lunch, which is noticed by a teacher who forces kids to share their food with him. He soon warns Stanley that he must get a lunch box if he wants to attend school.', 'School boy Stanley does not carry lunch, which is noticed by a teacher who forces kids to share their food with him. He soon warns Stanley that he must get a lunch box if he wants to attend school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ivNFQZCg7ZeDtPK900DD4iwPSc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68256'),
  ('193430620226021078', 'Stanley Kubrick: A Life in Pictures', 2001, 'Documentary', 'Jan Harlan', null, 'Tom Cruise, Barbara Kroner, Steven Marcus, Alexander Singer, Paul Mazursky, Jack Nicholson, Shelley Duvall, Matthew Modine', null, 'With commentary from Hollywood stars, outtakes from his movies and footage from his youth, this documentary looks at Stanley Kubrick''s life and films. Director Jan Harlan, Kubrick''s brother-in-law and sometime collaborator, interviews heavyweights like Jack Nicholson, Woody Allen and Sydney Pollack, who explain the influence of Kubrick classics like "Dr. Strangelove" and "2001: A Space Odyssey," and how he absorbed visual clues from disposable culture such as television commercials.', 'With commentary from Hollywood stars, outtakes from his movies and footage from his youth, this documentary looks at Stanley Kubrick''s life and films. Director Jan Harlan, Kubrick''s brother-in-law and sometime collaborator, interviews heavyweights like Jack Nicholson, Woody Allen and Sydney Pollack, who explain the influence of Kubrick classics like "Dr. Strangelove" and "2001: A Space Odyssey," and how he absorbed visual clues from disposable culture such as television commercials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGrzFNyc9ztyAJejneh9734Y9Uj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30416'),
  ('478961884214395284', 'Stanley Kubrick''s Boxes', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Jon Ronson', 'Jon Ronson', 'Jon Ronson, Anthony Frewin, Jan Harlan, Christiane Kubrick, Manuel Harlan, Anya Kubrick, Leon Vitali, Vincent Tilsley', null, 'A few years after his death, the widow of Stanley Kubrick (1928-1999) asks Jon Ronson to look through the contents of about 1,000 boxes of meticulously sorted materials Kubrick left. Ronson finds that most contain materials reflecting work Kubrick did after the release of "Barry Lyndon" in 1975, when Kubrick''s film output slowed down. Ronson finds audition tapes for "Full Metal Jacket," photographs to find the right hat for "Clockwork Orange" or the right doorway for "Eyes Wide Shut" -- thousands of details that went into Kubrick''s meticulous approach. Ronson believes that the boxes show "the rhythm of genius." Interviews with family, staff, and friends are included.', 'A few years after his death, the widow of Stanley Kubrick (1928-1999) asks Jon Ronson to look through the contents of about 1,000 boxes of meticulously sorted materials Kubrick left. Ronson finds that most contain materials reflecting work Kubrick did after the release of "Barry Lyndon" in 1975, when Kubrick''s film output slowed down. Ronson finds audition tapes for "Full Metal Jacket," photographs to find the right hat for "Clockwork Orange" or the right doorway for "Eyes Wide Shut" -- thousands of details that went into Kubrick''s meticulous approach. Ronson believes that the boxes show "the rhythm of genius." Interviews with family, staff, and friends are included.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svi87pIHWohYQrI0yowbdLhPcSp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97394'),
  ('787134258611393613', 'Stans', 2025, 'Documentary, Music', 'Steven Leckart', null, 'Eminem, Carson Daly, Ed Sheeran, Dr. Dre, LL Cool J, Adam Sandler, Devon Sawa, Anthony Bozza', 'NR', 'A revealing, edgy, and disarmingly personal journey into the world of superfandom, told through the lens of one of the world''s most iconic and enduring artists, Eminem, and the fans that worship him.', 'A revealing, edgy, and disarmingly personal journey into the world of superfandom, told through the lens of one of the world''s most iconic and enduring artists, Eminem, and the fans that worship him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqIvV9wWIA5h1UREfCcnBBlcr6Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1244999'),
  ('534703036964445538', 'Stanza 17-17 palazzo delle tasse, ufficio imposte', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Michele Lupo, Guglielmo Mancori', 'Sergio Donati, Michele Lupo', 'Gastone Moschin, Philippe Leroy, Lionel Stander, Franco Fabrizi, Raymond Bussières, Ugo Tognazzi, Joyce Geraldine Stewart, Tano Cimarosa', null, 'Architect Giambattista Manteghin, actor Romolo Moretti, Prince Pantegani and inventor Leonardo Rossi meet while trying to bribe a tax official out of paying exorbitant taxes. The four get together and conspire to rob the taxation office building, which happens to have been designed by Manteghin.', 'Architect Giambattista Manteghin, actor Romolo Moretti, Prince Pantegani and inventor Leonardo Rossi meet while trying to bribe a tax official out of paying exorbitant taxes. The four get together and conspire to rob the taxation office building, which happens to have been designed by Manteghin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9gyrbv5RIi9KM18bS3e8pObjnuc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205557'),
  ('376519864673174130', 'Star', 1982, 'Drama, Family', 'Vinod Pande, Nadeem Khan', 'Biddu, Tariq Yunus', 'Saeed Jaffrey, Rati Agnihotri, Raj Kiran, Kumar Gaurav, Padmini Kolhapure, A.K. Hangal, Dina Pathak, Ravindra Kapoor', null, 'Dev Kumar Verma comes from a middle-class family and must find employment to support his dad and mom. Dev, however, has set his mind upon becoming a music sensation like Elvis Presley. He loses his job because of this, and refuses to work until and unless he gets a job to his liking, much to the dismay of his parents and his brother, Shiv Kumar. Dev does get employment at Charlie''s Disco, where he meets with Maya and falls in love with her. When Charlie''s Disco''s competitor, Rana, finds out about Dev, he wants to hire Dev, but Dev decides to continue to work with Charlie''s Disco, as a result Dev and Charlie get a beating by Rana''s men, and Dev is unable to sing. After recuperating, Dev is devastated to find out that Maya and Shiv Kumar are in love with each other. What impact will this have on Dev and his brother on one hand, and what of his career in music?', 'Dev Kumar Verma comes from a middle-class family and must find employment to support his dad and mom. Dev, however, has set his mind upon becoming a music sensation like Elvis Presley. He loses his job because of this, and refuses to work until and unless he gets a job to his liking, much to the dismay of his parents and his brother, Shiv Kumar. Dev does get employment at Charlie''s Disco, where he meets with Maya and falls in love with her. When Charlie''s Disco''s competitor, Rana, finds out about Dev, he wants to hire Dev, but Dev decides to continue to work with Charlie''s Disco, as a result Dev and Charlie get a beating by Rana''s men, and Dev is unable to sing. After recuperating, Dev is devastated to find out that Maya and Shiv Kumar are in love with each other. What impact will this have on Dev and his brother on one hand, and what of his career in music?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pU7oXmVdNPrzj2XOGIQ6ciMnH42.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125225'),
  ('192661222274115769', 'Star', 1993, 'Romance, Drama', 'Michael Miller, Alex Nepomniaschy', null, 'Jennie Garth, Craig Bierko, Terry Farrell, Penny Fuller, Mitchell Ryan, Jim Haynie, Albert Hall, Jane Daly', null, 'When Crystal Wyatt was 16 her father passed away. From that time her life would never be the same. Crystal is banished from the family ranch, and starts a new life as a singer in a San Francisco nightclub.', 'When Crystal Wyatt was 16 her father passed away. From that time her life would never be the same. Crystal is banished from the family ranch, and starts a new life as a singer in a San Francisco nightclub.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uh4dc15oIICvpl23JaQilM99zrv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136244'),
  ('898827886915250364', 'Star', 2001, 'Comedy, Action', 'Guy Ritchie, Christopher Soos', 'Guy Ritchie', 'Clive Owen, Madonna, Michael Beattie, Toru Tanaka Jr., D-Teflon, Troy Aguayo, Woon Young Park', null, 'The Driver now carries an arrogant rock star who is visiting a major city. Played by Madonna, this title character wants to get away from her bodyguards in the Driver''s BMW. He soon gets tired of her and decides to have a bit of fun.', 'The Driver now carries an arrogant rock star who is visiting a major city. Played by Madonna, this title character wants to get away from her bodyguards in the Driver''s BMW. He soon gets tired of her and decides to have a bit of fun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zslEgrYEg6EDzOYrr8EfDoQK8j1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22599'),
  ('772920208609710043', 'Star', 2015, null, 'Emilie Mannering, Hervé Baillargeon', 'Emilie Mannering', 'Kevin Geronimo Tejeda, Justin Joselin Geronimo Morris', null, 'Tito and Jay are two brothers living in the Montreal neighborhood of Park Extension. Accompanying these young people in their daily life marked by complicity and intimidation, Star tackles themes dear to teenagers: identity and friendship.', 'Tito and Jay are two brothers living in the Montreal neighborhood of Park Extension. Accompanying these young people in their daily life marked by complicity and intimidation, Star tackles themes dear to teenagers: identity and friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVGnSMBc42TGwvV5QTHpH0PgyJp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:611791'),
  ('645515039214109885', 'Star', 2017, 'Drama', 'Marc-Aurèle Vecchione, Nicolas Desaintquentin', null, 'Serge Bondt, Sonia Joubert, Michael Kaves, Emmanuel Lapalus, Romain Le Pabic, Astrid Meloni, Finlay Murphy, Blqck Picqsso', null, 'Star is a young graffiti writer, the best in his city, Paris. His reputation attracts him as much into art galleries than in the police precincts. Accused of vandalism, he faces jail. Despite the threat, he decides to go to Rome with his crew in search of the meaning of his art.', 'Star is a young graffiti writer, the best in his city, Paris. His reputation attracts him as much into art galleries than in the police precincts. Accused of vandalism, he faces jail. Despite the threat, he decides to go to Rome with his crew in search of the meaning of his art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zeGcw5pPVT4DhHrSLUDxE58QJQn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449430'),
  ('282116238715768557', 'Star', 2019, 'Drama', 'Stefano Clari', 'Stefano Clari', 'Daniele Mariani, Giorgia Spinelli, Maria Vittoria Casarotti Todeschini, Gabriele Stella, Mario Grossi', null, 'Giacomo is a low-level actor and voice actor with a great passion for acting. After another disappointing audition he has one last chance to get the part assigned', 'Giacomo is a low-level actor and voice actor with a great passion for acting. After another disappointing audition he has one last chance to get the part assigned', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oObDGDhycViadrRCC2XJwwXAcR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:812434'),
  ('56249364980785815', 'Star', 2024, 'Drama, Romance', 'Elan, Ezhil Arasan', 'Elan', 'Kavin Raj, Lal, Aaditi Pohankar, Preity Mukhundhan, Geetha Kailasam, Vetrimaaran, Thangapandiyan, Lollu Sabha Maaran', null, 'Follows a youngster Kalai and his aspirations of becoming a ''Star'' in the Tamil Film Industry. Born in a lower-middle-class family, will Kalai overcome all his struggles to emerge as a Star?', 'Follows a youngster Kalai and his aspirations of becoming a ''Star'' in the Tamil Film Industry. Born in a lower-middle-class family, will Kalai overcome all his struggles to emerge as a Star?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c74qjGjs6XEKYDTYc1bxRzRkigT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1276338'),
  ('675779995641856488', 'Star', 2026, 'Action', 'Vijaya Surya', 'Vijaya Surya', 'Rajatha Raksha, Vasudev M Rao, Pradeep Parakrama, Balaram Panchal, Sharath Prakash', null, 'A boy arrives in a town to help a friend and finds two rival gangs at war. Gang leader Chandra recruits him as Nakshatra. When he falls for Bhoomi, he must choose between loyalty to his friend, the gang, and his newfound love.', 'A boy arrives in a town to help a friend and finds two rival gangs at war. Gang leader Chandra recruits him as Nakshatra. When he falls for Bhoomi, he must choose between loyalty to his friend, the gang, and his newfound love.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BYzJmOTgxNmUtZWVjZS00NzcyLTg3YzktMzRjZjY3NzgzNzNhXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:star-2026'),
  ('585047679572895894', 'Star 80', 1983, 'Drama', 'Bob Fosse, Sven Nykvist, Glen Sanford', 'Bob Fosse', 'Mariel Hemingway, Eric Roberts, Cliff Robertson, Carroll Baker, Roger Rees, David Clennon, Josh Mostel, Lisa Gordon', 'R', 'Paul Snider is a narcissistic, small time hustler who fancies himself a ladies man. His life changes when he meets Dorothy Stratten working behind the counter of a Dairy Queen. Under his guidance Dorothy grows to fame as a Playboy Playmate. But when Dorothy begins pursuing an acting career, the jealous Paul finds himself elbowed out of the picture by more famous men.', 'Paul Snider is a narcissistic, small time hustler who fancies himself a ladies man. His life changes when he meets Dorothy Stratten working behind the counter of a Dairy Queen. Under his guidance Dorothy grows to fame as a Playboy Playmate. But when Dorothy begins pursuing an acting career, the jealous Paul finds himself elbowed out of the picture by more famous men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2SkA02fXbZYnV1qjOIQprjXloF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30707'),
  ('17831992345205499', 'Star Command', 1996, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie, Action', 'Achim Poulheim, Jim Johnston', 'Melinda M. Snodgrass', 'Jay Underwood, Jennifer Bransford, Chris Conrad, Tembi Locke, Morgan Fairchild, Ivan Sergei, Eva Habermann, Kelly Hu', null, 'A bunch of young and impulsive space cadets make their first real flight in space and realize that the attack they suffered wasn''t a training mission. They face the Enemy alone and have the chance to save the world, and maybe to prevent the war? Can the cadets conquer the more experienced, stronger and much more evil enemy?', 'A bunch of young and impulsive space cadets make their first real flight in space and realize that the attack they suffered wasn''t a training mission. They face the Enemy alone and have the chance to save the world, and maybe to prevent the war? Can the cadets conquer the more experienced, stronger and much more evil enemy?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bu0tbmHgaAibaRaWLRtdlr2aoH9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6436'),
  ('171228763847717150', 'Star Crystal', 1986, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Lance Lindsay, Robert Caramico', 'Lance Lindsay', 'C. Juston Campbell, Faye Bolt, John W. Smith, Taylor Kingsley, Marcia Linn, Emily Longstreth, Lisa Goulian, Randall England', 'R', 'Crew members aboard a space ship encounter an alien life form intent on killing them.', 'Crew members aboard a space ship encounter an alien life form intent on killing them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPi0JjIctx5yo7pEJwkXdDJOeTT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69900'),
  ('31699508087616446', 'Star Fox Zero: The Battle Begins', 2016, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Action, Adventure', 'Kyoji Asano, Yoshikazu Iwanami, Eiji Inomoto', 'Eiji Umehara, Aya Takaha', 'Takashi Ohara, Kei Hayami, Kunpei Sakamoto, Kosuke Takaguchi, Atsushi Abe, Tsuguo Mogami', null, 'An animated short based on the game "Star Fox Zero", that was streamed during a Nintendo Treehouse live presentation on April 20, 2016. The short was produced by Miyamoto, in collaboration with Japanese animation studios Production I.G and Wit Studio.', 'An animated short based on the game "Star Fox Zero", that was streamed during a Nintendo Treehouse live presentation on April 20, 2016. The short was produced by Miyamoto, in collaboration with Japanese animation studios Production I.G and Wit Studio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yh2i3Mr5XkiGuXkf3yDWkbyAm9Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393808'),
  ('807687401464954955', 'Star Garden', 1974, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'The "star", as it is singular, is the sun; and it is metaphored, at the beginning of this film, by the projector anyone uses to show forth. Then the imaginary sun begins its course throughout whatever darkened room this film is seen within. At "high noon" (of the narrative) it can be imagined as if in back of the screen, and then to shift its imagined light-source gradually back thru aftertones and imaginings of the "stars" of the film till it achieves a one-to-one relationship with the moon again. This "sun" of the mind''s eye of every viewer does not necessarily correspond with the off-screen "pictured sun" of the film; but anyone who plays this game of illumination will surely see the film in its most completely conscious light.', 'The "star", as it is singular, is the sun; and it is metaphored, at the beginning of this film, by the projector anyone uses to show forth. Then the imaginary sun begins its course throughout whatever darkened room this film is seen within. At "high noon" (of the narrative) it can be imagined as if in back of the screen, and then to shift its imagined light-source gradually back thru aftertones and imaginings of the "stars" of the film till it achieves a one-to-one relationship with the moon again. This "sun" of the mind''s eye of every viewer does not necessarily correspond with the off-screen "pictured sun" of the film; but anyone who plays this game of illumination will surely see the film in its most completely conscious light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUtuoiNvPYFXbKrRPaf5ikvwdme.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164585'),
  ('910143054766515340', 'Star in the Dust', 1956, 'Western', 'John L. Russell, Charles F. Haas, Frank Shaw', 'Oscar Brodney', 'John Agar, Mamie Van Doren, Richard Boone, Coleen Gray, Leif Erickson, James Gleason, Randy Stuart, Terry Gilkyson', 'NR', 'The sheriff of Gunlock is planning to hang Sam Hall, who shot three farmers found on cattle land, at sundown. At the casino, betting is 8 to 3 he won''t make it. The cattlemen are set to rescue Sam; the farmers hope to lynch him before he can be rescued; and Hall schemes for escape with his girl Nellie. But Sheriff Jorden is most concerned with finding out who hired Hall: a leading suspect is the sheriff''s future brother-in-law.', 'The sheriff of Gunlock is planning to hang Sam Hall, who shot three farmers found on cattle land, at sundown. At the casino, betting is 8 to 3 he won''t make it. The cattlemen are set to rescue Sam; the farmers hope to lynch him before he can be rescued; and Hall schemes for escape with his girl Nellie. But Sheriff Jorden is most concerned with finding out who hired Hall: a leading suspect is the sheriff''s future brother-in-law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7XsNKZpfo9VJ04XWV4fPPWULGwV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111942'),
  ('86440829352854728', 'Star in the Night', 1945, 'Drama, Family, Western', 'Don Siegel, Robert Burks', 'Saul Elkins', 'J. Carrol Naish, Donald Woods, Rosina Galli, Richard Erdman, Lynn Baggett, John Miles, Anthony Caruso, Irving Bacon', null, 'Nick, a motel owner who has lost faith in more than just the humanity of mankind, is visited by a kindly stranger on Christmas Eve. The motel''s guests are only concerned for themselves until a poor man and his wife drive up to the motel, unable to go any further. Out of rooms, Nick''s wife prepares a place for them in a shed under a neon star Nick had just finished hanging. Their plight brings out the generosity in everyone, including Nick, who remembers another family almost two thousand years earlier that also found a makeshift room at an inn under another kind of star.', 'Nick, a motel owner who has lost faith in more than just the humanity of mankind, is visited by a kindly stranger on Christmas Eve. The motel''s guests are only concerned for themselves until a poor man and his wife drive up to the motel, unable to go any further. Out of rooms, Nick''s wife prepares a place for them in a shed under a neon star Nick had just finished hanging. Their plight brings out the generosity in everyone, including Nick, who remembers another family almost two thousand years earlier that also found a makeshift room at an inn under another kind of star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ntLaZdRWQZ0wYMVGRpyCXPdYHc2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150604'),
  ('237854475288936597', 'Star Kid', 1997, 'Action, Adventure, Family, Science Fiction', 'Manny Coto, Judy Taylor, Rohn Schmidt', 'Manny Coto', 'Joseph Mazzello, Richard Gilliland, Corinne Bohrer, Alex Daniels, Joey Simmrin, Brian Simpson, Ashlee Levitch, Jack McGee', 'PG', 'Shy seventh-grader Spencer Griffith''s life changes when the meteor falls into local junkyard and he finds a Cybersuit - the wise and strong robot from another galaxy. Spencer puts Cybersuit on and becomes a different kind of guy', 'Shy seventh-grader Spencer Griffith''s life changes when the meteor falls into local junkyard and he finds a Cybersuit - the wise and strong robot from another galaxy. Spencer puts Cybersuit on and becomes a different kind of guy', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srnvpaAg83sfYr82meDe6k1nDd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54007'),
  ('594807589307441392', 'Star Knight', 1985, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'José Luis Alcaine, Fernando Colomo, Antonio Isasi Jr.', 'Miguel Ángel Nieto, Fernando Colomo, Andreu Martín', 'Klaus Kinski, Harvey Keitel, Fernando Rey, Maria Lamor, José Vivó, Julieta Serrano, Miguel Bosé, Josep Maria Pou', null, 'A medieval alchemist (Klaus Kinski), knight (Harvey Keitel) and priest (Fernando Rey) mistake a flying-saucer alien for a dragon.', 'A medieval alchemist (Klaus Kinski), knight (Harvey Keitel) and priest (Fernando Rey) mistake a flying-saucer alien for a dragon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxA49czCVK8mAzn8z2OGFFzzrJw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72824'),
  ('638312911701264111', 'Star Maps', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Miguel Arteta, Chuy Chávez', 'Miguel Arteta', 'Douglas Spain, Efrain Figueroa, Kandeyce Jorden, Martha Velez, Lysa Flores, Annette Murphy, Robin Thomas, Vincent Chandler', 'R', 'Carlos wants to be an actor. But his father, Pepe, wants him to work in the family business, that is, male prostitution. Carlos decides that he will be one of his father''s boys until he can get his foot in the door in Hollywood.', 'Carlos wants to be an actor. But his father, Pepe, wants him to work in the family business, that is, male prostitution. Carlos decides that he will be one of his father''s boys until he can get his foot in the door in Hollywood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jXt9Ww1pMKcS1n1uGg7QuGFVaCT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108401'),
  ('718776335912917844', 'Star Odyssey', 1979, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Alfonso Brescia, Silvio Fraschetti', 'Alfonso Brescia, Giacomo Mazzocchi, Massimo Lo Jacono', 'Yanti Somer, Gianni Garko, Malisa Longo, Chris Avram, Ennio Balbo, Roberto Dell''Acqua, Nino Castelnuovo, Pino Ferrara', null, 'Earth is attacked by an intergalactic villain and his army of robotic androids.', 'Earth is attacked by an intergalactic villain and his army of robotic androids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/59d7HtzfECGwOAbi5vfJUeFUHSO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74839'),
  ('1021979755381156123', 'Star of Midnight', 1935, 'Comedy, Mystery, Romance', 'Stephen Roberts, J. Roy Hunt, Max Steiner', 'Anthony Veiller, Edward Kaufman, Howard J. Green', 'William Powell, Ginger Rogers, Paul Kelly, Gene Lockhart, Ralph Morgan, Leslie Fenton, J. Farrell MacDonald, Russell Hopton', 'NR', 'When a dancer disappears from a theater, Clay Dalzell is asked to investigate, leading him on a trail of murder and deception.', 'When a dancer disappears from a theater, Clay Dalzell is asked to investigate, leading him on a trail of murder and deception.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2COOIXN7GzOaaMf7BS0EZukJGPP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53863'),
  ('948406931195273186', 'Star Pilot', 1966, 'Science Fiction', 'Pietro Francisci', 'Pietro Francisci', 'Leonora Ruffo, Mario Novelli, Roland Lesaffre, Kirk Morris, Gordon Mitchell, Alfio Caltabiano, Leontine May, Nando Angelini', 'PG', 'Aliens from the constellation Hydra crash-land on the island of Sardinia. A prominent scientist, his daughter, several young technicians, and a pair of Oriental spies are taken hostage by the beings so they can use them to repair their spaceship''s broken engine. With that done, they take off towards their home planet, taking the earthlings with them. However, the humans attempt to mutiny against their captors, inadvertently sending their tiny spaceship hurtling into the infinite beyond...', 'Aliens from the constellation Hydra crash-land on the island of Sardinia. A prominent scientist, his daughter, several young technicians, and a pair of Oriental spies are taken hostage by the beings so they can use them to repair their spaceship''s broken engine. With that done, they take off towards their home planet, taking the earthlings with them. However, the humans attempt to mutiny against their captors, inadvertently sending their tiny spaceship hurtling into the infinite beyond...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5tIzipXqUqudRY4L2lKngyzG8vx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80339'),
  ('514132327279116678', 'Star Runners', 2009, 'TV Movie, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Matt King, Ivo Peitchev', 'Rafael Jordan', 'Connor Trinneer, James Kyson, Toni Trucks, Aja Evans, Michael Culkin, Shelly Varod, Velizar Binev, Todd Jensen', null, 'Two space smugglers are caught by the government and told if they deliver a crate to a certain location the charges will be forgotten. Turns out the crate is the key to a cover up and other parties want it to.', 'Two space smugglers are caught by the government and told if they deliver a crate to a certain location the charges will be forgotten. Turns out the crate is the key to a cover up and other parties want it to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWCcML3jaU4nUNP8CroRPdCHFD4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30203'),
  ('622212599158548766', 'Star Slammer', 1986, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Fred Olen Ray, Paul Elliott', 'Michael Sonye', 'Sandy Brooke, Susan Stokey, Ross Hagen, Marya Gant, Aldo Ray, Dawn Wildsmith, Richard Hench, Michael Sonye', 'R', 'Two women who have been unjustly confined to a prison planet plot their escape, all the while having to put up with unhinged guards, crazed wardens and mutant rodents.', 'Two women who have been unjustly confined to a prison planet plot their escape, all the while having to put up with unhinged guards, crazed wardens and mutant rodents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/clBB3cpaASKvId3aCHJ6f1ngx0q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68171'),
  ('241263311746378020', 'Star Spangled Rhythm', 1942, 'Comedy, Music', 'George Marshall, Theodor Sparkuhl, Leo Tover', 'Melvin Frank, George S. Kaufman, Norman Panama', 'Bing Crosby, Bob Hope, Fred MacMurray, Franchot Tone, Ray Milland, Victor Moore, Dorothy Lamour, Paulette Goddard', 'NR', 'Pop, a security guard at Paramount has told his son that he''s the head of the studio. When his son arrives in Hollywood on shore leave with his buddies, Pop enlists the aid of the studio''s dizzy switchboard operator in pulling off the charade. Things get more complicated when Pop agrees to put together a show for the Navy starring Paramount''s top contract players.', 'Pop, a security guard at Paramount has told his son that he''s the head of the studio. When his son arrives in Hollywood on shore leave with his buddies, Pop enlists the aid of the studio''s dizzy switchboard operator in pulling off the charade. Things get more complicated when Pop agrees to put together a show for the Navy starring Paramount''s top contract players.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHhEqEs4eOrYpevBRW87tLbTApy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108220'),
  ('878535205272725842', 'Star Time', 1992, 'Mystery, Crime, Horror', 'Alexander Cassini, Fernando Argüelles, Gregory L. Everage', 'Alexander Cassini', 'Michael St. Gerard, John P. Ryan, Maureen Teefy, Thomas Newman, Dana Dantine, Duncan Roulend, Robert Resnick, Angel Santana', null, 'When his favorite television show is canceled, Henry Pinkle is driven over the edge and decides to commit suicide. Then he meets Sam Bones, a mysterious agent who promises happiness and stardom if he follows his instructions.', 'When his favorite television show is canceled, Henry Pinkle is driven over the edge and decides to commit suicide. Then he meets Sam Bones, a mysterious agent who promises happiness and stardom if he follows his instructions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KvE6L1vfiPjEqGpdJFgcYxhSha.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158087'),
  ('572645466565728573', 'Star Trek', 2009, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'J.J. Abrams, Dan Mindel, Keith P. Cunningham', 'Roberto Orci, Alex Kurtzman', 'Chris Pine, Zachary Quinto, Leonard Nimoy, Eric Bana, Bruce Greenwood, Karl Urban, Zoe Saldaña, Simon Pegg', 'PG-13', 'The fate of the galaxy rests in the hands of bitter rivals. One, James Kirk, is a delinquent, thrill-seeking Iowa farm boy. The other, Spock, a Vulcan, was raised in a logic-based society that rejects all emotion. As fiery instinct clashes with calm reason, their unlikely but powerful partnership is the only thing capable of leading their crew through unimaginable danger, boldly going where no one has gone before. The human adventure has begun again.', 'The fate of the galaxy rests in the hands of bitter rivals. One, James Kirk, is a delinquent, thrill-seeking Iowa farm boy. The other, Spock, a Vulcan, was raised in a logic-based society that rejects all emotion. As fiery instinct clashes with calm reason, their unlikely but powerful partnership is the only thing capable of leading their crew through unimaginable danger, boldly going where no one has gone before. The human adventure has begun again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hN2ZtF3Uw6mhIHZiqL0SKzELtKn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13475'),
  ('335362982543641609', 'Star Trek Beyond', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Justin Lin, Stephen F. Windon, Sean Goojha', 'Simon Pegg, Doug Jung', 'Chris Pine, Zachary Quinto, Karl Urban, Zoe Saldaña, Simon Pegg, John Cho, Anton Yelchin, Idris Elba', 'PG-13', 'The USS Enterprise crew explores the furthest reaches of uncharted space, where they encounter a mysterious new enemy who puts them and everything the Federation stands for to the test.', 'The USS Enterprise crew explores the furthest reaches of uncharted space, where they encounter a mysterious new enemy who puts them and everything the Federation stands for to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m7SHlvcGfCkbzk2xP7XHDOI6o93.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188927'),
  ('527947646220766991', 'Star Trek II: The Wrath of Khan', 1982, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Nicholas Meyer, Gayne Rescher, Douglas E. Wise', 'Jack B. Sowards', 'William Shatner, Leonard Nimoy, Ricardo Montalban, DeForest Kelley, James Doohan, Walter Koenig, George Takei, Nichelle Nichols', 'PG', 'The starship Enterprise and its crew is pulled back into action when old nemesis, Khan, steals a top secret device called Project Genesis.', 'The starship Enterprise and its crew is pulled back into action when old nemesis, Khan, steals a top secret device called Project Genesis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPyLsKl8Z0LOoxeaFXsY5MxhR5s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154'),
  ('783216567681074865', 'Star Trek III: The Search for Spock', 1984, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Charles Correll, Leonard Nimoy, John Hockridge', 'Harve Bennett', 'William Shatner, DeForest Kelley, James Doohan, George Takei, Walter Koenig, Nichelle Nichols, Christopher Lloyd, Robin Curtis', 'PG', 'A surprise visit from Spock''s father provides a startling revelation: McCoy is harboring Spock''s living essence.', 'A surprise visit from Spock''s father provides a startling revelation: McCoy is harboring Spock''s living essence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yqEj0oPfKBMCz7YcCARHDgH7VFm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157'),
  ('694949374389771169', 'Star Trek Into Darkness', 2013, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'J.J. Abrams, Dan Mindel, Ramsey Avery', 'Roberto Orci, Alex Kurtzman, Damon Lindelof', 'Chris Pine, Zachary Quinto, Zoe Saldaña, Benedict Cumberbatch, Karl Urban, Simon Pegg, Bruce Greenwood, Peter Weller', 'PG-13', 'When the crew of the Enterprise is called back home, they find an unstoppable force of terror from within their own organization has detonated the fleet and everything it stands for, leaving our world in a state of crisis. With a personal score to settle, Captain Kirk leads a manhunt to a war-zone world to capture a one man weapon of mass destruction. As our heroes are propelled into an epic chess game of life and death, love will be challenged, friendships will be torn apart, and sacrifices must be made for the only family Kirk has left: his crew.', 'When the crew of the Enterprise is called back home, they find an unstoppable force of terror from within their own organization has detonated the fleet and everything it stands for, leaving our world in a state of crisis. With a personal score to settle, Captain Kirk leads a manhunt to a war-zone world to capture a one man weapon of mass destruction. As our heroes are propelled into an epic chess game of life and death, love will be challenged, friendships will be torn apart, and sacrifices must be made for the only family Kirk has left: his crew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aim3kVNh1MPIxPEFeJrl9e9Uf1a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54138'),
  ('751866598551262879', 'Star Trek IV: The Voyage Home', 1986, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Leonard Nimoy, Donald Peterman, Nilo Rodis-Jamero', 'Steve Meerson, Nicholas Meyer, Peter Krikes', 'William Shatner, Leonard Nimoy, DeForest Kelley, James Doohan, George Takei, Walter Koenig, Nichelle Nichols, Mark Lenard', 'PG', 'When a huge alien probe enters the galaxy and begins to vaporize Earth''s oceans, Kirk and his crew must travel back in time in order to bring back whales and save the planet.', 'When a huge alien probe enters the galaxy and begins to vaporize Earth''s oceans, Kirk and his crew must travel back in time in order to bring back whales and save the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xY5TzGXJOB3L9rhZ1MbbPyVlW5J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168'),
  ('737444450012794146', 'Star Trek V: The Final Frontier', 1989, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'William Shatner, Andrew Laszlo, Douglas E. Wise', 'David Loughery', 'William Shatner, Leonard Nimoy, DeForest Kelley, James Doohan, George Takei, Walter Koenig, Nichelle Nichols, Laurence Luckinbill', 'PG', 'A renegade Vulcan with a startling secret hijacks the U.S.S. Enterprise in order to find a mythical planet.', 'A renegade Vulcan with a startling secret hijacks the U.S.S. Enterprise in order to find a mythical planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uiXr41VLYsuug3CZbFrKLSNahuZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172'),
  ('621029452465660150', 'Star Trek VI: The Undiscovered Country', 1991, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Hiro Narita, Nicholas Meyer, Randy Suhr', 'Nicholas Meyer, Denny Martin Flinn', 'William Shatner, Leonard Nimoy, DeForest Kelley, James Doohan, Walter Koenig, Nichelle Nichols, George Takei, Mark Lenard', 'PG', 'After years of war, the Federation and the Klingon empire find themselves on the brink of a peace summit when a Klingon ship is nearly destroyed by an apparent attack from the Enterprise. Both worlds brace for what may be their deadliest encounter.', 'After years of war, the Federation and the Klingon empire find themselves on the brink of a peace summit when a Klingon ship is nearly destroyed by an apparent attack from the Enterprise. Both worlds brace for what may be their deadliest encounter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvTOJD7Gz668GLy2nNdLRQvpPsv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174'),
  ('396687984483562380', 'Star Trek: First Contact', 1996, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Jonathan Frakes, Matthew F. Leonetti, Jerry Fleck', 'Brannon Braga, Ronald D. Moore', 'Patrick Stewart, Jonathan Frakes, Brent Spiner, LeVar Burton, Michael Dorn, Gates McFadden, Marina Sirtis, James Cromwell', 'PG-13', 'The Borg, a relentless race of cyborgs, are on a direct course for Earth. Violating orders to stay away from the battle, Captain Picard and the crew of the newly-commissioned USS Enterprise E pursue the Borg back in time to prevent the invaders from changing Federation history and assimilating the galaxy.', 'The Borg, a relentless race of cyborgs, are on a direct course for Earth. Violating orders to stay away from the battle, Captain Picard and the crew of the newly-commissioned USS Enterprise E pursue the Borg back in time to prevent the invaders from changing Federation history and assimilating the galaxy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqhHe893Vcf07jNkNQ31tu85dKG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199'),
  ('148928961555977459', 'Star Trek: Generations', 1994, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'David Carson, John A. Alonzo, Chris Soldo', 'Ronald D. Moore, Brannon Braga', 'Patrick Stewart, Jonathan Frakes, Brent Spiner, LeVar Burton, Michael Dorn, Gates McFadden, Marina Sirtis, William Shatner', 'PG', 'Captain Jean-Luc Picard and the crew of the Enterprise-D find themselves at odds with the renegade scientist Soran who is destroying entire star systems. Only one man can help Picard stop Soran''s scheme...and he''s been dead for seventy-eight years.', 'Captain Jean-Luc Picard and the crew of the Enterprise-D find themselves at odds with the renegade scientist Soran who is destroying entire star systems. Only one man can help Picard stop Soran''s scheme...and he''s been dead for seventy-eight years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gh0ZZRwSmlzEZTIZee3ZCN9Jssx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193'),
  ('103746778306019647', 'Star Trek: Insurrection', 1998, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Jonathan Frakes, Matthew F. Leonetti, Bing Sokolsky', 'Michael Piller', 'Patrick Stewart, Brent Spiner, Michael Dorn, Jonathan Frakes, F. Murray Abraham, Anthony Zerbe, Gregg Henry, Donna Murphy', 'PG', 'When an alien race and factions within Starfleet attempt to take over a planet that has "regenerative" properties, it falls upon Captain Picard and the crew of the Enterprise to defend the planet''s people as well as the very ideals upon which the Federation itself was founded.', 'When an alien race and factions within Starfleet attempt to take over a planet that has "regenerative" properties, it falls upon Captain Picard and the crew of the Enterprise to defend the planet''s people as well as the very ideals upon which the Federation itself was founded.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQCMAHeg5M9HpDIqanYbWdr4brB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200'),
  ('78614977836260238', 'Star Trek: Nemesis', 2002, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Stuart Baird, Jeffrey L. Kimball, Doug Coleman', 'John Logan', 'Patrick Stewart, Jonathan Frakes, Brent Spiner, LeVar Burton, Michael Dorn, Gates McFadden, Marina Sirtis, Tom Hardy', 'PG-13', 'En route to the honeymoon of William Riker to Deanna Troi on her home planet of Betazed, Captain Jean-Luc Picard and the crew of the U.S.S. Enterprise receives word from Starfleet that a coup has resulted in the installation of a new Romulan political leader, Shinzon, who claims to seek peace with the human-backed United Federation of Planets. Once in enemy territory, the captain and his crew make a startling discovery: Shinzon is human, a slave from the Romulan sister planet of Remus, and has a secret, shocking relationship to Picard himself.', 'En route to the honeymoon of William Riker to Deanna Troi on her home planet of Betazed, Captain Jean-Luc Picard and the crew of the U.S.S. Enterprise receives word from Starfleet that a coup has resulted in the installation of a new Romulan political leader, Shinzon, who claims to seek peace with the human-backed United Federation of Planets. Once in enemy territory, the captain and his crew make a startling discovery: Shinzon is human, a slave from the Romulan sister planet of Remus, and has a secret, shocking relationship to Picard himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cldAwhvBmOv9jrd3bXWuqRHoXyq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201'),
  ('507973724454098357', 'Star Trek: Section 31', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Olatunde Osunsanmi, Glen Keenan, Anne Van Koeverden', 'Craig Sweeny', 'Michelle Yeoh, Omari Hardwick, Sam Richardson, Kacey Rohl, Sven Ruygrok, Robert Kazinsky, Humberly González, James Hiroyuki Liao', 'PG-13', 'Emperor Philippa Georgiou joins a secret division of Starfleet tasked with protecting the United Federation of Planets and faces the sins of her past.', 'Emperor Philippa Georgiou joins a secret division of Starfleet tasked with protecting the United Federation of Planets and faces the sins of her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNu6P4jYU55Cb3CC2SndtAKvois.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1114894'),
  ('434279363633440353', 'Star Trek: The Motion Picture', 1979, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Mystery', 'Robert Wise, Richard H. Kline, Daniel McCauley', 'Harold Livingston', 'William Shatner, Leonard Nimoy, DeForest Kelley, James Doohan, George Takei, Walter Koenig, Nichelle Nichols, Stephen Collins', 'G', 'When an unidentified alien destroys three powerful Klingon cruisers, Captain James T. Kirk returns to the newly transformed U.S.S. Enterprise to take command.', 'When an unidentified alien destroys three powerful Klingon cruisers, Captain James T. Kirk returns to the newly transformed U.S.S. Enterprise to take command.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wfiAfNwH6CMKxz4vRaW8CPTabtk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152'),
  ('678917080628509466', 'Star Wars', 1977, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction', 'Gilbert Taylor, George Lucas, Anthony Waye', 'George Lucas', 'Mark Hamill, Harrison Ford, Carrie Fisher, Peter Cushing, Alec Guinness, Anthony Daniels, Kenny Baker, Peter Mayhew', 'PG', 'Princess Leia is captured and held hostage by the evil Imperial forces in their effort to take over the galactic Empire. Venturesome Luke Skywalker and dashing captain Han Solo team together with the loveable robot duo R2-D2 and C-3PO to rescue the beautiful princess and restore peace and justice in the Empire.', 'Princess Leia is captured and held hostage by the evil Imperial forces in their effort to take over the galactic Empire. Venturesome Luke Skywalker and dashing captain Han Solo team together with the loveable robot duo R2-D2 and C-3PO to rescue the beautiful princess and restore peace and justice in the Empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6FfCtAuVAW8XJjZ7eWeLibRLWTw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11'),
  ('700853965507348056', 'Star Wars Biomes', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Documentary', null, null, null, 'G', 'Take a virtual vacation to some of the Star Wars films'' most iconic and beloved locations like Hoth, Tatooine, and Sorgan, as this charming series whisks you off for fly-through tours of the Galaxy Far, Far Away.', 'Take a virtual vacation to some of the Star Wars films'' most iconic and beloved locations like Hoth, Tatooine, and Sorgan, as this charming series whisks you off for fly-through tours of the Galaxy Far, Far Away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4qkDuumUuGi5zl8Cqkc0aXYWr3E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:825647'),
  ('1012356466877734301', 'Star Wars Kid: The Rise of the Digital Shadows', 2022, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Maxime Pilon-Lalande, Mathieu Fournier', 'Jonathan Trudel, Mathieu Fournier', 'Ghyslain Raza, Andy Baio, Jonathan Trudel, Jean-Michel Berthiaume, Kate Eichhorn, Kathleen Rouillard, François Vigeant, Christian Bouchard', null, 'Ghyslain Raza, better known as the “Star Wars Kid,” breaks his silence to reflect on our hunger for content and the right to be forgotten in the digital age.', 'Ghyslain Raza, better known as the “Star Wars Kid,” breaks his silence to reflect on our hunger for content and the right to be forgotten in the digital age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zspMlOFJ76g5KyfmucgnvnkJnuN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:956879'),
  ('1006725257144352335', 'Star Wars Rebels: Spark of Rebellion', 2014, 'Adventure, Animation, Action, Science Fiction, TV Movie, Family', 'Steward Lee, Steven G. Lee', 'Simon Kinberg', 'Freddie Prinze Jr., Vanessa Marshall, Taylor Gray, Tiya Sircar, Steve Blum, Dave Filoni, David Oyelowo, Jason Isaacs', null, 'It is a dark time. The Jedi are no more, and the Empire rules the galaxy with an iron fist -- bringing tyranny to the Outer Rim world of Lothal. Their ominous presence is a cloud over the planet, squashing any hope of freedom or a better life, especially for 14-year-old orphan Ezra Bridger. But the young con artist soon finds that destiny has other plans for him, as he encounters a small band of rebels who dare to strike back against the Empire.', 'It is a dark time. The Jedi are no more, and the Empire rules the galaxy with an iron fist -- bringing tyranny to the Outer Rim world of Lothal. Their ominous presence is a cloud over the planet, squashing any hope of freedom or a better life, especially for 14-year-old orphan Ezra Bridger. But the young con artist soon finds that destiny has other plans for him, as he encounters a small band of rebels who dare to strike back against the Empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ApPuHAhH4wYGb4YCLChJYQvHUEF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287663'),
  ('394602500931356396', 'Star Wars Rebels: The Siege of Lothal', 2015, 'Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Bosco Ng, Brad Rau', 'Henry Gilroy', 'Taylor Gray, Freddie Prinze Jr., James Earl Jones, Vanessa Marshall, Tiya Sircar, Ashley Eckstein, David Oyelowo, Billy Dee Williams', null, 'The Inquisitor is dead. The Ghost crew has connected with other rebel cells. And a new ally named Ahsoka Tano has emerged. Despite these successes and developments, the fight against the Empire takes a deadly turn, as the evil Sith Lord Darth Vader comes to Lothal.', 'The Inquisitor is dead. The Ghost crew has connected with other rebel cells. And a new ally named Ahsoka Tano has emerged. Despite these successes and developments, the fight against the Empire takes a deadly turn, as the evil Sith Lord Darth Vader comes to Lothal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQ4AkODSeqHaBk6XKuQCFu3YnPD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337755'),
  ('732223473119870901', 'Star Wars: Droids - The Great Heep', 1986, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Family, TV Movie', 'Clive A. Smith, Scott Glynn, Gordon Stanfield', 'George Lucas, Ben Burtt', 'Anthony Daniels, Long John Baldry, Winston Rekert, Graeme Campbell, Noam Zylberman, Dan Hennessey, Melleny Melody', null, 'C-3PO and R2-D2 are on their way to Biitu to meet their new master, Mungo Baobab, when their ship is attacked and they are taken prisoner. Biitu has been taken over by the giant mechanical Great Heep who works with the Empire, enslaving the natives by using droid enforcers and draining R2 units to keep up his strength. Meanwhile Mungo has been imprisoned to be handed over to his arch enemy Admiral Screed.', 'C-3PO and R2-D2 are on their way to Biitu to meet their new master, Mungo Baobab, when their ship is attacked and they are taken prisoner. Biitu has been taken over by the giant mechanical Great Heep who works with the Empire, enslaving the natives by using droid enforcers and draining R2 units to keep up his strength. Meanwhile Mungo has been imprisoned to be handed over to his arch enemy Admiral Screed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rTylicBcqBI019WqCb835RmxMkk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248931'),
  ('1077939535337659248', 'Star Wars: Episode I - The Phantom Menace', 1999, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction', 'George Lucas, David Tattersall, Peter Russell', 'George Lucas', 'Liam Neeson, Ewan McGregor, Natalie Portman, Jake Lloyd, Ian McDiarmid, Pernilla August, Oliver Ford Davies, Hugh Quarshie', 'PG', 'Anakin Skywalker, a young slave strong with the Force, is discovered on Tatooine. Meanwhile, the evil Sith have returned, enacting their plot for revenge against the Jedi.', 'Anakin Skywalker, a young slave strong with the Force, is discovered on Tatooine. Meanwhile, the evil Sith have returned, enacting their plot for revenge against the Jedi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6wkfovpn7Eq8dYNKaG5PY3q2oq6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1893'),
  ('817502303210576030', 'Star Wars: Episode II - Attack of the Clones', 2002, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction', 'George Lucas, David Tattersall, Peter Russell', 'Jonathan Hales, George Lucas', 'Hayden Christensen, Ewan McGregor, Natalie Portman, Christopher Lee, Samuel L. Jackson, Frank Oz, Ian McDiarmid, Pernilla August', 'NR', 'Following an assassination attempt on Senator Padmé Amidala, Jedi Knights Anakin Skywalker and Obi-Wan Kenobi investigate a mysterious plot into the heart of the Separatist movement and the beginning of the Clone Wars.', 'Following an assassination attempt on Senator Padmé Amidala, Jedi Knights Anakin Skywalker and Obi-Wan Kenobi investigate a mysterious plot into the heart of the Separatist movement and the beginning of the Clone Wars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZNPzxqM2s5DyVWab09NTQScDQt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1894'),
  ('304723966379282930', 'Star Wars: Episode III - Revenge of the Sith', 2005, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction', 'George Lucas, David Franco, Ron Fricke', 'George Lucas', 'Hayden Christensen, Ewan McGregor, Natalie Portman, Ian McDiarmid, Samuel L. Jackson, Jimmy Smits, Frank Oz, Anthony Daniels', 'PG-13', 'When the sinister Sith unveil a thousand-year-old plot to rule the galaxy, the Republic crumbles and from its ashes rises the evil Galactic Empire. Jedi hero Anakin Skywalker must choose a side.', 'When the sinister Sith unveil a thousand-year-old plot to rule the galaxy, the Republic crumbles and from its ashes rises the evil Galactic Empire. Jedi hero Anakin Skywalker must choose a side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xfSAoBEm9MNBjmlNcDYLvLSMlnq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1895'),
  ('649026024276102365', 'Star Wars: The Clone Wars', 2008, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Dave Filoni, Dave Bullock, George Samilski', 'Scott Murphy, Steven Melching, Henry Gilroy', 'Matt Lanter, Ashley Eckstein, James Arnold Taylor, David Acord, Dee Bradley Baker, Christopher Lee, Nika Futterman, Kevin Michael Richardson', 'PG', 'As the Clone Wars sweep through the galaxy, the heroic Jedi Knights struggle to maintain order and restore peace. More and more systems are falling prey to the forces of the dark side as the Galactic Republic slips further and further under the sway of the Separatists and their never-ending droid army. Anakin Skywalker and his Padawan learner Ahsoka Tano find themselves on a mission with far-reaching consequences, one that brings them face-to-face with crime lord Jabba the Hutt. But Count Dooku and his sinister agents, including the nefarious Asajj Ventress, will stop at nothing to ensure that Anakin and Ahsoka fail at their quest. Meanwhile, on the front lines of the Clone Wars, Obi-Wan Kenobi and Master Yoda lead the massive clone army in a valiant effort to resist the forces of the dark side...', 'As the Clone Wars sweep through the galaxy, the heroic Jedi Knights struggle to maintain order and restore peace. More and more systems are falling prey to the forces of the dark side as the Galactic Republic slips further and further under the sway of the Separatists and their never-ending droid army. Anakin Skywalker and his Padawan learner Ahsoka Tano find themselves on a mission with far-reaching consequences, one that brings them face-to-face with crime lord Jabba the Hutt. But Count Dooku and his sinister agents, including the nefarious Asajj Ventress, will stop at nothing to ensure that Anakin and Ahsoka fail at their quest. Meanwhile, on the front lines of the Clone Wars, Obi-Wan Kenobi and Master Yoda lead the massive clone army in a valiant effort to resist the forces of the dark side...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJQfixW818LUdSXlCDL3JZm0S0g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12180'),
  ('49146224915264627', 'Star Wars: The Force Awakens', 2015, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction', 'J.J. Abrams, Dan Mindel, Yanick Dusseault', 'Michael Arndt, Lawrence Kasdan, J.J. Abrams', 'Daisy Ridley, John Boyega, Oscar Isaac, Adam Driver, Carrie Fisher, Harrison Ford, Mark Hamill, Lupita Nyong''o', 'PG-13', 'Thirty years after defeating the Galactic Empire, Han Solo and his allies face a new threat from the evil Kylo Ren and his army of Stormtroopers.', 'Thirty years after defeating the Galactic Empire, Han Solo and his allies face a new threat from the evil Kylo Ren and his army of Stormtroopers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wqnLdwVXoBjKibFRR5U3y0aDUhs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140607'),
  ('328343549198555446', 'Star Wars: The Last Jedi', 2017, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction', 'Steve Yedlin, Chris Lowe, Jamie Christopher', 'Rian Johnson', 'Mark Hamill, Carrie Fisher, Adam Driver, Daisy Ridley, John Boyega, Oscar Isaac, Andy Serkis, Lupita Nyong''o', 'PG-13', 'Rey develops her newly discovered abilities with the guidance of Luke Skywalker, who is unsettled by the strength of her powers. Meanwhile, the Resistance prepares to do battle with the First Order.', 'Rey develops her newly discovered abilities with the guidance of Luke Skywalker, who is unsettled by the strength of her powers. Meanwhile, the Resistance prepares to do battle with the First Order.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kOVEVeg59E0wsnXmF9nrh6OmWII.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181808'),
  ('966112646533134943', 'Star Wars: The Legacy Revealed', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Kevin Burns', 'Kevin Burns', 'Robert Clotworthy, George Lucas, Peter Jackson, J.J. Abrams, Joss Whedon, Kevin Smith, Stephen Colbert, Dan Rather', null, 'The special focuses on how Star Wars is relevant today and the history that inspired it, and also makes various connections to Greek mythology. It consists of several interviews with well-known politicians, journalists, and critics, along with historical content and clips from all six of the Star Wars movies.', 'The special focuses on how Star Wars is relevant today and the history that inspired it, and also makes various connections to Greek mythology. It consists of several interviews with well-known politicians, journalists, and critics, along with historical content and clips from all six of the Star Wars movies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8DHOCDpZagHDNPt0K3O82ppGKx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128295'),
  ('868966228778385105', 'Star Wars: The Mandalorian and Grogu', 2026, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Jon Favreau, Aja Kai Rowley, Kim Richards', 'George Lucas, Jon Favreau, Dave Filoni', 'Pedro Pascal, Sigourney Weaver, Jeremy Allen White, Jonny Coyne, Dave Filoni, Steve Blum, Martin Scorsese, Hemky Madera', 'PG-13', 'The evil Empire has fallen, and Imperial warlords remain scattered throughout the galaxy. As the fledgling New Republic works to protect everything the Rebellion fought for, they have enlisted the help of legendary Mandalorian bounty hunter Din Djarin and his young apprentice Grogu.', 'The evil Empire has fallen, and Imperial warlords remain scattered throughout the galaxy. As the fledgling New Republic works to protect everything the Rebellion fought for, they have enlisted the help of legendary Mandalorian bounty hunter Din Djarin and his young apprentice Grogu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QujwMB124KqSPbWlLRHBO5wygE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1228710'),
  ('792545222448667708', 'Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker', 2019, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction', 'Roxana Alexandru, Jeff Taylor, Dan Mindel', 'Chris Terrio, J.J. Abrams', 'Carrie Fisher, Mark Hamill, Daisy Ridley, Adam Driver, John Boyega, Oscar Isaac, Anthony Daniels, Naomi Ackie', 'PG-13', 'The surviving Resistance faces the First Order once again as the journey of Rey, Finn and Poe Dameron continues. With the power and knowledge of generations behind them, the final battle begins.', 'The surviving Resistance faces the First Order once again as the journey of Rey, Finn and Poe Dameron continues. With the power and knowledge of generations behind them, the final battle begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/db32LaOibwEliAmSL2jjDF6oDdj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181812'),
  ('330128162584943633', 'Star Watching Dog', 2011, 'Drama', 'Tomoyuki Takimoto', 'Hiroshi Hashimoto', 'Toshiyuki Nishida, Umika Kawashima, Kimiko Yo, Tetsuji Tamayama, Yoichi Nukumizu, Mari Hamada, Sansei Shiomi, Shido Nakamura', null, 'An abandoned car is discovered near a camping ground and inside it is the body of an identified middle-aged man and a dog who seems to have died months later. This is the story of the life of the loving and faithful dog and his owner told from the dog''s point of view. City hall employee Kyousuke Okutsu is assigned to uncover the man''s identity for a proper funeral. As he investigates the situation, he remembers his late family and his own dog''s unfailing loyalty.', 'An abandoned car is discovered near a camping ground and inside it is the body of an identified middle-aged man and a dog who seems to have died months later. This is the story of the life of the loving and faithful dog and his owner told from the dog''s point of view. City hall employee Kyousuke Okutsu is assigned to uncover the man''s identity for a proper funeral. As he investigates the situation, he remembers his late family and his own dog''s unfailing loyalty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uL2htS4U6LK91pyyiNvu2rEJDXK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111378'),
  ('714107933979305861', 'Star Wreck: In the Pirkinning', 2005, 'Science Fiction, Action, Comedy', 'Timo Vuorensola, Sami Aho-Mantila', 'Rudi Airisto, Samuli Torssonen, Jarmo Puskala', 'Samuli Torssonen, Atte Joutsen, Timo Vuorensola, Antti Satama, Karoliina Blackburn, Janos Honkonen, Seppo Honkanen, Tiina Routamaa', null, 'Star Wreck: In the Pirkinning begins with Captain James B. Pirk of the starship Kickstart shipwrecked on the 21st century Earth with his crew. Originally from the distant future, Pirk and his crew traveled back in time to save the Earth from hostile aliens, but lost their ship and became stranded. Pirk''s daily routine consists mainly of stuffing his face at the local fast food restaurant, and he is finding it difficult to convince the ladies he is, in fact, an intergalactic space hero from the future. As the prospects for humanity''s conquest of space look increasingly bleaker, Pirk comes up with a questionable plan to save mankind''s future...', 'Star Wreck: In the Pirkinning begins with Captain James B. Pirk of the starship Kickstart shipwrecked on the 21st century Earth with his crew. Originally from the distant future, Pirk and his crew traveled back in time to save the Earth from hostile aliens, but lost their ship and became stranded. Pirk''s daily routine consists mainly of stuffing his face at the local fast food restaurant, and he is finding it difficult to convince the ladies he is, in fact, an intergalactic space hero from the future. As the prospects for humanity''s conquest of space look increasingly bleaker, Pirk comes up with a questionable plan to save mankind''s future...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5DgNTleInAJt9QFoBPztE3Opf7u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15493'),
  ('143071704185192906', 'Star!', 1968, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Robert Wise, Ernest Laszlo', 'William Fairchild', 'Julie Andrews, Richard Crenna, Michael Craig, Daniel Massey, Robert Reed, Bruce Forsyth, Beryl Reid, John Collin', 'G', 'Gertrude Lawrence rises to stage stardom at the cost of happiness.', 'Gertrude Lawrence rises to stage stardom at the cost of happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMyOm5hLWeuoWBea1DJrcJy8bU6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52959'),
  ('1068534461592165156', 'Starbright', 2026, 'Adventure, Action', 'Francesco Di Giacomo, Francesco Lucente, Chris Butcher', 'Joseph Bitonti, Olimpia Lucente', 'John Rhys-Davies, Ted Levine, Elisabeth Röhm, Diego Boneta, Alexandra Dowling, Becky Ann Baker, Christine Ebersole, Gbenga Akinnagbe', null, 'A young woman becomes the guardian of a fallen star, which she must protect from dangerous forces with the help of a brave stranger.', 'A young woman becomes the guardian of a fallen star, which she must protect from dangerous forces with the help of a brave stranger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1Zl07DNYeSyNcz9hf8hDsS2oB5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:662707'),
  ('920846727463687358', 'Starbuck', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Ken Scott', 'Martin Petit, Ken Scott', 'Patrick Huard, Julie Le Breton, Antoine Bertrand, Dominic Philie, Marc Bélanger, Igor Ovadis, David Michaël, Sarah-Jeanne Labrosse', null, 'David Wozniak is a perpetual adolescent who discovers that, as a sperm donor, he has fathered 533 children. He is advised that more than 100 of his offspring are trying to force the fertility clinic to reveal the true identity of "Starbuck," the pseudonym he used when donating his sperm. To make matters worse, his girlfriend Valérie is pregnant with his child, but doesn''t feel that he is mature enough to be a father.', 'David Wozniak is a perpetual adolescent who discovers that, as a sperm donor, he has fathered 533 children. He is advised that more than 100 of his offspring are trying to force the fertility clinic to reveal the true identity of "Starbuck," the pseudonym he used when donating his sperm. To make matters worse, his girlfriend Valérie is pregnant with his child, but doesn''t feel that he is mature enough to be a father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7ZyIR941krELzP7POiFUu0yhFq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79108'),
  ('1128641925921972629', 'Starchaser: The Legend of Orin', 1985, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Science Fiction, Action', 'Steven Hahn', 'Jeffrey Scott', 'Joe Colligan, Carmen Argenziano, Noelle North, Anthony De Longis, Tyke Caravelli, Les Tremayne, Ken Sansom, John Moschitta Jr.', null, 'Set on the subterranean Mine-World, a band of human worker are treated like slaves under the power of the evil overlord Zygon until one, Orin, unearths the hilt of a mythical sword that only he can master. Escaping the planet, he runs into the rogue smuggler Dagg and a pair of helpful droids and the princess, who all team up to return to the Mine-World with a plan to defeat Zygon and free Orin''s enslaved people.', 'Set on the subterranean Mine-World, a band of human worker are treated like slaves under the power of the evil overlord Zygon until one, Orin, unearths the hilt of a mythical sword that only he can master. Escaping the planet, he runs into the rogue smuggler Dagg and a pair of helpful droids and the princess, who all team up to return to the Mine-World with a plan to defeat Zygon and free Orin''s enslaved people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zC5OU1G1eeIN1xTnXPWibolYrf6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32147'),
  ('811885435410512629', 'Starcrash', 1978, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Luigi Cozzi, Paul Beeson, Roberto D''Ettorre Piazzoli', 'Luigi Cozzi, Nat Wachsberger', 'Marjoe Gortner, Caroline Munro, Christopher Plummer, David Hasselhoff, Robert Tessier, Joe Spinell, Nadia Cassini, Judd Hamilton', 'PG', 'A pair of smugglers manage to pick up a castaway while running from the authorities, who turns out to be the only survivor from a secret mission to destroy a mysterious superweapon designed by the evil Count Zartharn. The smugglers are soon recruited by the Emperor to complete the mission, as well as to rescue the Emperor''s son, who has gone missing.', 'A pair of smugglers manage to pick up a castaway while running from the authorities, who turns out to be the only survivor from a secret mission to destroy a mysterious superweapon designed by the evil Count Zartharn. The smugglers are soon recruited by the Emperor to complete the mission, as well as to rescue the Emperor''s son, who has gone missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npJt35Q36aGcTYpcg9epbwQIIkz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22049'),
  ('1071705618946929174', 'Starcrossed', 1985, 'Science Fiction, Romance, TV Movie', 'Jeffrey Bloom, Gil Hubbs', 'Jeffrey Bloom', 'James Spader, Belinda Bauer, Peter Kowanko, Clark Johnson, Jacqueline Brookes, Chuck Shamata, Tony Devon, James Kidnie', null, 'An alien woman is running from a deadly enemy and tries to hide on Earth where she meets a young mechanic, who helps her to get back home and to fight for the freedom of her people.', 'An alien woman is running from a deadly enemy and tries to hide on Earth where she meets a young mechanic, who helps her to get back home and to fight for the freedom of her people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9aS6iJqXliMMlokbXJchhemckvG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81882'),
  ('571040759905089704', 'Starcrossed', 2005, 'Drama', 'James Burkhammer, Kelly Evans, Kristin Mente', 'James Burkhammer', 'J.B. Ghuman Jr., Marshall Allman, John Wesley Shipp, Simon Ragaine, Derek Sean Lara, Darcy DeMoss, Gina Rodgers, Torrey DeVitto', null, 'Two brothers develop a sexual attraction to one another amid the unkind world around them.', 'Two brothers develop a sexual attraction to one another amid the unkind world around them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3VSRVU1UQLcSKNg2eXvSKXpyZni.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44279'),
  ('810920576405544118', 'StarDog and TurboCat', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Ben Smith', 'Ben Smith', 'Luke Evans, Nick Frost, Gemma Arterton, Bill Nighy, Ben Bailey Smith, Rachael Louise Miller, Cory English, Morgan Cambs', 'PG', 'When vigilante cat, Felix, and loyal canine, Buddy, set out to find Buddy’s lost owner, they discover not only the power of friendship, but their inner superpowers along the way.', 'When vigilante cat, Felix, and loyal canine, Buddy, set out to find Buddy’s lost owner, they discover not only the power of friendship, but their inner superpowers along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aM0Ksnnuc7NtRibMUhXGmAYAMrx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515789'),
  ('1136251533589058080', 'Stardom', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Guy Dufaux, Denys Arcand, Jacques Leduc', 'Denys Arcand, Jacob Potashnik', 'Jessica Paré, Dan Aykroyd, Charles Berling, Robert Lepage, Camilla Rutherford, Thomas Gibson, Frank Langella, Paul Reynolds', null, 'A young girl is plucked from small-town obscurity and thrust into the spotlight of the glamorous world of super-models.', 'A young girl is plucked from small-town obscurity and thrust into the spotlight of the glamorous world of super-models.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmvVAym5DE15R9ZdRMe49GOVps.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47302'),
  ('1010564407456180890', 'Stardust', 1973, 'Comedy, Music', 'Alberto Sordi, Carlo Vanzina, Franco Di Giacomo', 'Bernardino Zapponi, Ruggero Maccari, Alberto Sordi', 'Alberto Sordi, Monica Vitti, John Phillip Law, Edoardo Faieta, Vanda Osiris, Carlo Dapporto, Franco Angrisano, Franca Scagnetti', null, 'The lives of two local professional dancers change suddenly as American soldiers stop in their town hoping to be entertained in accordance with the Broadway style. Effectively, they perform up to their expectations. However, as the army men have to march northward, their moment of glory finishes heartlessly.', 'The lives of two local professional dancers change suddenly as American soldiers stop in their town hoping to be entertained in accordance with the Broadway style. Effectively, they perform up to their expectations. However, as the army men have to march northward, their moment of glory finishes heartlessly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDJosYVRqmnuUiyRBWFH4KwdfOq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73995'),
  ('201753175033905740', 'Stardust', 1974, 'Drama', 'Michael Apted, Anthony B. Richmond', 'Ray Connolly', 'David Essex, Adam Faith, Larry Hagman, Rosalind Ayres, Marty Wilde, Keith Moon, Dave Edmunds, Ines Des Longchamps', 'R', 'Jim MacLaine is now enjoying the nomadic ''gigs and groupies'' life on tour with his band. When he achieves all his wildest dreams of international stardom, the sweet taste of success begins to turn sour.', 'Jim MacLaine is now enjoying the nomadic ''gigs and groupies'' life on tour with his band. When he achieves all his wildest dreams of international stardom, the sweet taste of success begins to turn sour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kRy0iFx8KrNqWftoq6n2aCtlWvm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27196'),
  ('206919871307961311', 'Stardust', 2007, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Romance, Family', 'Matthew Vaughn, Ben Davis, Martin Harrison', 'Matthew Vaughn, Jane Goldman', 'Charlie Cox, Claire Danes, Michelle Pfeiffer, Mark Strong, Jason Flemyng, Robert De Niro, Sienna Miller, Sarah Alexander', 'PG-13', 'In a countryside town bordering on a magical land, a young man makes a promise to his beloved that he''ll retrieve a fallen star by venturing into the magical realm. His journey takes him into a world beyond his wildest dreams and reveals his true identity.', 'In a countryside town bordering on a magical land, a young man makes a promise to his beloved that he''ll retrieve a fallen star by venturing into the magical realm. His journey takes him into a world beyond his wildest dreams and reveals his true identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zbFmxy3DqKYL2M8Hop6uylp2Uy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2270'),
  ('954648557857083064', 'Stardust', 2020, 'Music, Drama', 'Gabriel Range, Nicholas D. Knowland, Dan Hubbard', 'Christopher Bell, Gabriel Range', 'Johnny Flynn, Marc Maron, Jena Malone, Derek Moran, Anthony Flanagan, Julian Richings, Aaron Poole, Monica Parker', 'NR', 'In 1971, rock star David Bowie travels to America for the first time to promote his third album, The Man Who Sold the World. There, he embarks on a coast-to-coast publicity tour. During this tour, Bowie creates his iconic Ziggy Stardust persona, inspired by artists like Iggy Pop and Lou Reed.', 'In 1971, rock star David Bowie travels to America for the first time to promote his third album, The Man Who Sold the World. There, he embarks on a coast-to-coast publicity tour. During this tour, Bowie creates his iconic Ziggy Stardust persona, inspired by artists like Iggy Pop and Lou Reed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4auKoOWYVbLwmVBv0fdZUwTyiwk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:579400'),
  ('248126872292232435', 'Stardust Memories', 1980, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Woody Allen, Gordon Willis, Yudi Bennett', 'Woody Allen', 'Woody Allen, Charlotte Rampling, Jessica Harper, Marie-Christine Barrault, Tony Roberts, Daniel Stern, Amy Wright, Helen Hanft', 'PG', 'While attending a retrospect of his work, a filmmaker recalls his life and his loves: the inspirations for his films.', 'While attending a retrospect of his work, a filmmaker recalls his life and his loves: the inspirations for his films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1EHgpL2hMVRcr6tIOy7VGLxaPs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11337'),
  ('218628758350550048', 'Starfighter', 2015, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Miguel Alexandre', null, 'Picco von Groote, Steve Windolf, Frederick Lau, Alice Dwyer, Paula Kalenberg, Walter Sittler, Peter Kremer, Jan Messutat', null, 'Germany in the "Swinging Sixties": the Bundeswehr is equipping itself with the ultra-modern "Starfighter" fighter jet. The air force pilots, including the daredevil Harry and his buddy Richie, are the stars of the armed forces. But the fascination with the fastest fighter jet in the world is offset by a dramatic series of accidents: Pilots crash to their deaths in the "Starfighter" one after the other. Officially, the disasters are attributed to human error. But Harry''s wife Betti doesn''t believe this - and after another serious accident, she takes up the fight against a seemingly overpowering alliance of politics, the military and business, supported by her friend Helga...', 'Germany in the "Swinging Sixties": the Bundeswehr is equipping itself with the ultra-modern "Starfighter" fighter jet. The air force pilots, including the daredevil Harry and his buddy Richie, are the stars of the armed forces. But the fascination with the fastest fighter jet in the world is offset by a dramatic series of accidents: Pilots crash to their deaths in the "Starfighter" one after the other. Officially, the disasters are attributed to human error. But Harry''s wife Betti doesn''t believe this - and after another serious accident, she takes up the fight against a seemingly overpowering alliance of politics, the military and business, supported by her friend Helga...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/buRsiY1zd7BQ6UcN78UPIpRWXIG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334087'),
  ('437944960647759937', 'Starfish', 2019, 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction', 'A.T. White', 'A.T. White', 'Virginia Gardner, Christina Masterson, Eric Beecroft, Natalie Mitchell, Shannon Hollander, Elias Brett, Tanroh Ishida, Regina Saldivar', null, 'Humanity is about to come to an end due to a mysterious signal; trapped at the home of a dead friend, Aubrey tries to turn things around after finding a mysterious cassette tape.', 'Humanity is about to come to an end due to a mysterious signal; trapped at the home of a dead friend, Aubrey tries to turn things around after finding a mysterious cassette tape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ellZ2dQLPVeWgd2fjf4arcZwALc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542713'),
  ('120146427424730199', 'Starflight: The Plane That Couldn''t Land', 1983, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Jerry Jameson, Héctor R. Figueroa', 'Robert M. Young', 'Lee Majors, Hal Linden, Lauren Hutton, Ray Milland, Gail Strickland, George DiCenzo, Tess Harper, Terry Kiser', null, 'Starflight One, a commercial aircraft that can whisk passengers around the globe in a matter of hours, embarks on its maiden voyage. The trip goes horribly awry, however, when the aircraft is forced out of the atmosphere and into outer space. As it is too dangerous to attempt reentry, Captain Cody Briggs, his passengers and his crew brave declining levels of oxygen while NASA scientists scramble to launch a rescue mission in a race against time.', 'Starflight One, a commercial aircraft that can whisk passengers around the globe in a matter of hours, embarks on its maiden voyage. The trip goes horribly awry, however, when the aircraft is forced out of the atmosphere and into outer space. As it is too dangerous to attempt reentry, Captain Cody Briggs, his passengers and his crew brave declining levels of oxygen while NASA scientists scramble to launch a rescue mission in a race against time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24wBAt0OAbFukArnE8SLKp0JYP3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15494'),
  ('304252768971957445', 'Starfuckers', 2022, 'Drama', 'Antonio Marziale, Matthew Pothier', 'Antonio Marziale', 'Cole Doman, Jonathan Slavin, Antonio Marziale', null, 'An intimate evening between a film director and an escort is disrupted when a familiar face arrives.', 'An intimate evening between a film director and an escort is disrupted when a familiar face arrives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8npktslnIHCR9LZ9C2TzFKOcjri.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:914281'),
  ('576989039761764527', 'Stargames', 1998, 'Adventure, Family, Science Fiction', 'Greydon Clark, Nicholas Josef von Sternberg', 'Greydon Clark, David Reskin', 'Trevor Clark, Travis Clark, Darby Hinton, Jacqulin Cole, Daran Norris, Conrad Hadan, Brian Fitzpatrick, Greydon Clark', 'NR', 'A young space prince on the run from an evil space villain, stranded on Earth and waiting for his grandfather the king to rescue him, befriends an Earth child named Brian and together they evade robots, bears, and triangles.', 'A young space prince on the run from an evil space villain, stranded on Earth and waiting for his grandfather the king to rescue him, befriends an Earth child named Brian and together they evade robots, bears, and triangles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wffFaKj17ODuX8yPy4sr8jGg8Qt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273735'),
  ('110878654528087803', 'Stargate', 1994, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Roland Emmerich, Karl Walter Lindenlaub, Patrick Tatopoulos', 'Roland Emmerich, Dean Devlin', 'James Spader, Kurt Russell, Jaye Davidson, Viveca Lindfors, Alexis Cruz, Mili Avital, Erick Avari, John Diehl', 'PG-13', 'An interstellar teleportation device, found in Egypt, leads to a planet with humans resembling ancient Egyptians who worship the god Ra.', 'An interstellar teleportation device, found in Egypt, leads to a planet with humans resembling ancient Egyptians who worship the god Ra.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4T6Po0XnZlevmhfPh3ZfEs5butR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2164'),
  ('35540532899643573', 'Stargate: Continuum', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Martin Wood, Thom Wells, Peter F. Woeste', 'Brad Wright', 'Ben Browder, Amanda Tapping, Christopher Judge, Michael Shanks, Claudia Black, Beau Bridges, Richard Dean Anderson, Cliff Simon', 'PG', 'Ba''al travels back in time and prevents the Stargate program from being started. SG-1 must somehow restore history.', 'Ba''al travels back in time and prevents the Stargate program from being started. SG-1 must somehow restore history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rQUvblJHU8766FatqTtCMiRhph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12914'),
  ('562904579720456940', 'Stargate: The Ark of Truth', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Robert C. Cooper, Peter F. Woeste, David Clarke', 'Robert C. Cooper', 'Ben Browder, Amanda Tapping, Christopher Judge, Michael Shanks, Beau Bridges, Claudia Black, Currie Graham, Morena Baccarin', 'NR', 'SG-1 searches for an ancient weapon which could help them defeat the Ori, and discover it may be in the Ori''s own home galaxy. As the Ori prepare to send ships through to the Milky Way to attack Earth, SG-1 travels to the Ori galaxy aboard the Odyssey. The International Oversight committee have their own plans and SG-1 finds themselves in a distant galaxy fighting two powerful enemies.', 'SG-1 searches for an ancient weapon which could help them defeat the Ori, and discover it may be in the Ori''s own home galaxy. As the Ori prepare to send ships through to the Milky Way to attack Earth, SG-1 travels to the Ori galaxy aboard the Odyssey. The International Oversight committee have their own plans and SG-1 finds themselves in a distant galaxy fighting two powerful enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kIqsCdZBmKYuPwaDnrFYzK1gqlM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13001'),
  ('798725890484015132', 'Stargirl', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Family', 'Julia Hart, Kaären F. Ochoa, Amanda Luce', 'Kristin Hahn, Julia Hart, Jordan Horowitz', 'Grace VanderWaal, Graham Verchere, Karan Brar, Maximiliano Hernández, Darby Stanchfield, Giancarlo Esposito, Collin Blackford, Annacheska Brown', 'PG', 'An unassuming high schooler finds himself inexplicably drawn to the free-spirited new girl, whose unconventional ways change how they see themselves…and their world.', 'An unassuming high schooler finds himself inexplicably drawn to the free-spirited new girl, whose unconventional ways change how they see themselves…and their world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwsrtzSrr7G6xjxsa7IwaAMHpEF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382748'),
