  ('661806505504801127', 'Staring at Strangers', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Félix Viscarret, Alvaro Gutierrez', 'Félix Viscarret, David Muñoz, Juan José Millás', 'Paco León, Leonor Watling, Àlex Brendemühl, María Romanillos, Juan Diego Botto, Susana Abaitua, Marcos Ruiz', null, 'Carpenter Sergio runs away and hides in a closet after his boss fired him. When the closet arrives at its buyer''s house, he decides to stay there, hiding in his new home living with an unknown family.', 'Carpenter Sergio runs away and hides in a closet after his boss fired him. When the closet arrives at its buyer''s house, he decides to stay there, hiding in his new home living with an unknown family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozgB7njLoj0xRb1VtVCTrNH3FEw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:939899'),
  ('461624042600896095', 'Stark Fear', 1962, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Ned Hockman, Robert E. Bethard', 'Dwight V. Swain', 'Beverly Garland, Skip Homeier, Kenneth Tobey, Hannah Stone, George Clow, Paul Scovil, Edna Neuman, John Arville', null, 'A marriage falls apart when a dutiful wife becomes the breadwinner after her husband loses his job. This angers him and after reveling in her humiliation, he leaves her. Fortunately, the wife lands on her feet, but not before she obtains closure with her brutish husband.', 'A marriage falls apart when a dutiful wife becomes the breadwinner after her husband loses his job. This angers him and after reveling in her humiliation, he leaves her. Fortunately, the wife lands on her feet, but not before she obtains closure with her brutish husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jeczqdttlh7oFL4VgMdjVFuwO7e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80687'),
  ('779109848799510452', 'Stark Love', 1927, 'Drama', 'Karl Brown, James Murray, Paul Wing', 'Karl Brown, Walter Woods', 'Helen Mundy, Forrest James, Reb Grogan, Silas Miracle', null, '"Man is absolute ruler. Woman is working slave.” Such are the rigid attitudes framing this tale of a country boy’s beliefs about chivalry that lead him to try to escape a brutal father with the girl he loves', '"Man is absolute ruler. Woman is working slave.” Such are the rigid attitudes framing this tale of a country boy’s beliefs about chivalry that lead him to try to escape a brutal father with the girl he loves', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UT3P5OC7Hp5roD6Da5v8SmqZz9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205898'),
  ('316290684328167898', 'Stark Raving Mad', 2002, 'Comedy, Crime, Action', 'Drew Daywalt, Chuck Cohen, David Schneider', 'Drew Daywalt, David Schneider', 'Seann William Scott, Timm Sharp, Patrick Been, John B. Crye, Suzy Nakamura, Lou Diamond Phillips, Dave Foley, Kavan Smith', null, 'A crook quietly plots his revenge against the boss who murdered his brother while working for him.', 'A crook quietly plots his revenge against the boss who murdered his brother while working for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MtKcti03XF7btAjr9wcTLrLZ4e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14809'),
  ('877321619250263362', 'Starlet', 2012, 'Drama', 'Sean Baker, Radium Cheung', 'Sean Baker, Chris Bergoch', 'Dree Hemingway, Besedka Johnson, Stella Maeve, James Ransone, Karren Karagulian, Mickey O''Hagan, Sheri Vecchio, Robert Malmuth', 'NR', 'An unlikely friendship forms between 21 year-old Jane and the elderly Sadie after Jane discovers a hidden stash of money inside an object at Sadie''s yard sale.', 'An unlikely friendship forms between 21 year-old Jane and the elderly Sadie after Jane discovers a hidden stash of money inside an object at Sadie''s yard sale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mVU5KjD5b4Df3CRTnJqKFSwg5y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91679'),
  ('496715673901674947', 'Starman', 1984, 'Science Fiction, Romance, Drama', 'Donald M. Morgan, John Carpenter, Joe Alves', 'Raynold Gideon, Bruce A. Evans', 'Jeff Bridges, Karen Allen, Charles Martin Smith, Richard Jaeckel, Robert Phalen, Tony Edwards, John Walter Davis, Ted White', 'PG', 'When an alien takes the form of a young widow''s husband and asks her to drive him from Wisconsin to Arizona, the government tries to stop them.', 'When an alien takes the form of a young widow''s husband and asks her to drive him from Wisconsin to Arizona, the government tries to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgDeFWkYi6e9FT5RiQPCbQ9HlXZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9663'),
  ('1083616206102682190', 'Starman', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Gianluca Cerasola, Daniele Poli', 'Gianluca Cerasola', 'Luca Parmitano, Andrew Morgan, Alexander Skvortsov, Giancarlo Giannini, Jovanotti, Vittorio Thermes', null, 'Luca Parmitano is the first italian astronaut to perform an extravehicular activity, currently part of the crew engaged in the Expedition 61 mission on board the International Space Station (SSI), is ready to tell his latest space adventures.', 'Luca Parmitano is the first italian astronaut to perform an extravehicular activity, currently part of the crew engaged in the Expedition 61 mission on board the International Space Station (SSI), is ready to tell his latest space adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kgDuOqRQmIaYA46w5nHYfQouevd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:691694'),
  ('295275115918621451', 'Starquest II', 1996, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Fred Gallo, Mark Parry', 'Fred Gallo', 'Adam Baldwin, Robert Englund, Duane Davis, Jerry Trimble, Kate Rodger, Gretchen Palmer, Jeannie Millar, Jolie Jackunas', null, 'After a nuclear war, four warriors from Earth awaken on a space ship. Unable to determine what purpose they are there and, above all, who rescued them, panic breaks out. The young scientist Lee and his attractive colleague Susan face the killer aliens in a bitter struggle for the survival of mankind.', 'After a nuclear war, four warriors from Earth awaken on a space ship. Unable to determine what purpose they are there and, above all, who rescued them, panic breaks out. The young scientist Lee and his attractive colleague Susan face the killer aliens in a bitter struggle for the survival of mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKgvIIqqnOxcaqOPdi6IfnMHttA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222872'),
  ('464781842760350748', 'Starred Up', 2014, 'Drama', 'David Mackenzie, Michael McDonough', 'Jonathan Asser', 'Jack O''Connell, Ben Mendelsohn, Rupert Friend, David Ajala, Peter Ferdinando, Gershwyn Eustache Jnr, Anthony Welsh, David Avery', 'R', '19-year-old Eric, arrogant and ultra-violent, is prematurely transferred to the same adult prison facility as his estranged father. As his explosive temper quickly finds him enemies in both prison authorities and fellow inmates — and his already volatile relationship with his father is pushed past breaking point — Eric is approached by a volunteer psychotherapist, who runs an anger management group for prisoners. Torn between gang politics, prison corruption, and a glimmer of something better, Eric finds himself in a fight for his own life, unsure if his own father is there to protect him or join in punishing him.', '19-year-old Eric, arrogant and ultra-violent, is prematurely transferred to the same adult prison facility as his estranged father. As his explosive temper quickly finds him enemies in both prison authorities and fellow inmates — and his already volatile relationship with his father is pushed past breaking point — Eric is approached by a volunteer psychotherapist, who runs an anger management group for prisoners. Torn between gang politics, prison corruption, and a glimmer of something better, Eric finds himself in a fight for his own life, unsure if his own father is there to protect him or join in punishing him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1DRGfyRxYQclvJOJiXwAw5gDg2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209276'),
  ('485472345262355342', 'Starry Eyes', 2014, 'Horror, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Kevin Kölsch, Dennis Widmyer, Adam Bricker', 'Kevin Kölsch, Dennis Widmyer', 'Alex Essoe, Amanda Fuller, Fabianne Therese, Noah Segan, Shane Coffey, Natalie Hauck, Nick Simmons, Pat Healy', 'NR', 'A hopeful young starlet uncovers the ominous origins of the Hollywood elite and enters into a deadly agreement in exchange for fame and fortune.', 'A hopeful young starlet uncovers the ominous origins of the Hollywood elite and enters into a deadly agreement in exchange for fame and fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1sIumVCl91XThMoJqUjpERYeAM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254194'),
  ('762182082888580027', 'Starry Starry Night', 2011, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Tom Lin, Jake Pollock', 'Tom Lin, Jimmy Liao Fu Bin', 'Josie Xu Jiao, Lin Hui-min, René Liu, Harlem Yu, Gwei Lun-mei, Janel Tsai, Kenneth Tsang, Shih Chin-Hang', null, 'There was once a young girl named May who felt alienated from everyone around her. May is worried about her mother and father, whose marriage is on the rocks, and she yearns to return to the woods where her grandfather lives. One day, May befriends a boy as lonely as she is. When reality catches up, they run away to a beautiful world that belongs only to them. Both imaginatively escapist and heartbreakingly realistic, their journey speaks to kids and adults alike with the pain of solitude, the sorrow of loss, and the warmth of hope.', 'There was once a young girl named May who felt alienated from everyone around her. May is worried about her mother and father, whose marriage is on the rocks, and she yearns to return to the woods where her grandfather lives. One day, May befriends a boy as lonely as she is. When reality catches up, they run away to a beautiful world that belongs only to them. Both imaginatively escapist and heartbreakingly realistic, their journey speaks to kids and adults alike with the pain of solitude, the sorrow of loss, and the warmth of hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DEDG5QcktqifgQwO4rW9BLWdEO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85878'),
  ('63539547497327477', 'Stars', 1959, 'Drama, War', 'Werner Bergmann, Konrad Wolf, Michael Englberger', 'Angel Vagenshtain', 'Sasha Krusharska, Jürgen Frohriep, Erik S. Klein, Stefan Pejchev, Georgi Naumov, Ivan Kondov, Milka Tuykova, Shtilyan Kunev', null, 'Stationed in a secluded Bulgarian village in 1943, Walter – a German Wehrmacht sergeant and artist – lives in almost idyllic distance from the war. Then a transit camp is set up for Jews arriving from Greece. When Ruth, one of the internees, asks Walter to help a pregnant woman, the two form an unlikely bond.', 'Stationed in a secluded Bulgarian village in 1943, Walter – a German Wehrmacht sergeant and artist – lives in almost idyllic distance from the war. Then a transit camp is set up for Jews arriving from Greece. When Ruth, one of the internees, asks Walter to help a pregnant woman, the two form an unlikely bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCWu2icolAmBWES6TuW0Ib4nLkH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199177'),
  ('781937262706615834', 'Stars & Bars', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Pat O''Connor, Jerzy Zieliński, Ned Dowd', 'William Boyd', 'Daniel Day-Lewis, Harry Dean Stanton, Kent Broadhurst, Maury Chaykin, Matthew Cowles, Joan Cusack, Keith David, Spalding Gray', 'R', 'A British art expert leaves New York to buy a long-lost Renoir from a Georgia eccentric.', 'A British art expert leaves New York to buy a long-lost Renoir from a Georgia eccentric.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWa2bcfVwJZH1oR25HGh5tQl5gb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129628'),
  ('562357295594539817', 'Stars 80', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Frédéric Forestier, Thomas Langmann, Michel Abramowicz', 'Karine Angeli, Thomas Langmann', 'Richard Anconina, Patrick Timsit, Bruno Lochet, Lio, Jean-Luc Lahaye, Jeanne Mas, Gilbert Montagné, François Feldman', null, 'Die-hard fans of the 1980s, Vincent and Antoine run a company that supplies doubles of faded stars throughout the whole of France. What starts out as a promising business venture ends up as a calamity when Vincent and Antoine have over forty engagements booked but no one to attend them. They then have a brainwave. Why not get in touch with the real stars of the 1980s and persuade them to make a comeback? Why make do with an imitation when you can have the real McCoy?', 'Die-hard fans of the 1980s, Vincent and Antoine run a company that supplies doubles of faded stars throughout the whole of France. What starts out as a promising business venture ends up as a calamity when Vincent and Antoine have over forty engagements booked but no one to attend them. They then have a brainwave. Why not get in touch with the real stars of the 1980s and persuade them to make a comeback? Why make do with an imitation when you can have the real McCoy?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ZqFtdcF06WAM2wfgBadTSiAaRU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139156'),
  ('1138292522873024835', 'Stars 80, la suite', 2017, 'Music, Comedy', 'Thomas Langmann, Frédéric Auburtin, Éric Guichard', 'Thomas Langmann', 'Richard Anconina, Patrick Timsit, Bruno Lochet, Jean-Marc Généreux, Lio, Jean-Luc Lahaye, Gilbert Montagné, Phil Barney', null, 'Vincent and Antoine, tired of the tours, decide to go on holiday with all the troop of Stars 80.', 'Vincent and Antoine, tired of the tours, decide to go on holiday with all the troop of Stars 80.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBxHyJizlJs1MVzZrRVG4PN9XJ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395439'),
  ('466917852139071975', 'Stars Above Us', 2019, 'Drama', 'Christina Ebelt, Bernhard Keller', 'Christina Ebelt, Franziska Krentzien', 'Franziska Hartmann, Claudio Magno, Kai Ivo Baulitz, Nicole Johannhanwahr, Davina Donaldson, Elias Reichert, Marita Breuer, Leon Kamps', null, 'Forced into homelessness, Melli, a single mother, takes her son Ben to a forest. There they build a makeshift camp, set back from the paths so that no one can find them. They think this solution is only temporary. Melli firmly believes their lives will improve soon, a feeling that is strengthened when she is employed as a trainee flight attendant. Unlike Melli, Ben actually enjoys the exciting camp trip. Life under difficult conditions further strengthens the bond between mother and son.', 'Forced into homelessness, Melli, a single mother, takes her son Ben to a forest. There they build a makeshift camp, set back from the paths so that no one can find them. They think this solution is only temporary. Melli firmly believes their lives will improve soon, a feeling that is strengthened when she is employed as a trainee flight attendant. Unlike Melli, Ben actually enjoys the exciting camp trip. Life under difficult conditions further strengthens the bond between mother and son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFyMbLevTFSMLQpk7p0qPk5rWny.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:608617'),
  ('1103641109565587104', 'Stars and Stripes', 1939, 'Music, Animation', 'Norman McLaren', null, null, null, 'An abstract animation by Norman McLaren, who was born in Scotland in 1914. His interest in filmmaking began early in life after he became acquainted with works by the great Russian filmmakers Eisenstein and Pudovkin and the German animator Oskar Fischinger.', 'An abstract animation by Norman McLaren, who was born in Scotland in 1914. His interest in filmmaking began early in life after he became acquainted with works by the great Russian filmmakers Eisenstein and Pudovkin and the German animator Oskar Fischinger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2V6V3QU2vFHhbCaPtKsXCBZRMYs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236224'),
  ('587885464239422136', 'Stars and Stripes Forever', 1952, 'Drama, Music', 'Henry Koster, Alfred Newman', 'Lamar Trotti', 'Clifton Webb, Debra Paget, Robert Wagner, Ruth Hussey, Finlay Currie, Roy Roberts, Thomas Browne Henry, Helen Van Tuyl', null, 'A film biography of the composer John Philip Sousa, from his early days in the Marine Corps Band through the Spanish-American War in 1898.', 'A film biography of the composer John Philip Sousa, from his early days in the Marine Corps Band through the Spanish-American War in 1898.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3I2rfMf0WCsY1TBcf3q7pAEe7a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43365'),
  ('506750861795290201', 'Stars at Noon', 2022, 'Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Éric Gautier, Claire Denis, Martin Proano', 'Claire Denis, Léa Mysius, Andrew Litvack', 'Margaret Qualley, Joe Alwyn, Benny Safdie, Danny Ramirez, Nick Romano, Stephan Proaño, Robin Durán, John C. Reilly', 'R', 'In present-day Nicaragua, a headstrong American journalist and a mysterious English businessman strike up a romance as they become embroiled in a dangerous labyrinth of lies and conspiracies and are forced to try and escape the country.', 'In present-day Nicaragua, a headstrong American journalist and a mysterious English businessman strike up a romance as they become embroiled in a dangerous labyrinth of lies and conspiracies and are forced to try and escape the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/viR50oQCs8ObciADFGWHUyChexZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:603204'),
  ('1101962018432398407', 'Stars by the Pound', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Marie-Sophie Chambon, Yann Maritaud', 'Marie-Sophie Chambon, Anaïs Carpita', 'Laure Duchêne, Angèle Metzger, Pauline Serieys, Isabelle De Hertogh, Philippe Rebbot', null, 'Lois, 16, has only one dream: becoming an astronaut. However, although she’s gifted in physics, she has a big problem: Lois weighs over 200 pounds – a family trait she’s inescapably stuck with. Then, just when everything seems lost, Lois meets Amélie, Stannah, and Justine: three teenagers shattered, like her, by life’s tough breaks; yet ready for anything in order to leave with her for outer space…', 'Lois, 16, has only one dream: becoming an astronaut. However, although she’s gifted in physics, she has a big problem: Lois weighs over 200 pounds – a family trait she’s inescapably stuck with. Then, just when everything seems lost, Lois meets Amélie, Stannah, and Justine: three teenagers shattered, like her, by life’s tough breaks; yet ready for anything in order to leave with her for outer space…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2V5psYsUdmz5og3gy6xSQfPpeuT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504054'),
  ('406992359693091692', 'Stars Fell on Alabama', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Wey Wang, V.W. Scheich', 'Robert Windom', 'Ciara Hanna, James Maslow, Jason Burkey, Lesa Wilson, Jaclyn Betham, Ginny MacColl, Andrew Rush, Mike Bash', null, 'Successful Hollywood agent Bryce Dixon is returning to Alabama for the first time in 15 years for his high school reunion. When he learns he''s the only one of his friends who isn''t married with children, he convinces his client, starlet Madison Belle, to pretend to be his girlfriend. But he soon learns that success has different meanings, and romance may be closer than he thinks.', 'Successful Hollywood agent Bryce Dixon is returning to Alabama for the first time in 15 years for his high school reunion. When he learns he''s the only one of his friends who isn''t married with children, he convinces his client, starlet Madison Belle, to pretend to be his girlfriend. But he soon learns that success has different meanings, and romance may be closer than he thinks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGMa5XCyUFFWaIlKZoQvW6gCwGp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:767979'),
  ('784553910546051748', 'Stars in My Crown', 1950, 'Drama, Western', 'Jacques Tourneur, Dolph Zimmer, Charles Schoenbaum', 'Margaret Fitts', 'Joel McCrea, Ellen Drew, Dean Stockwell, Alan Hale, Lewis Stone, James Mitchell, Amanda Blake, Juano Hernández', null, 'An orphaned man recalls his upbringing with his aunt and her husband, the parson, in a small Western town during the Reconstruction.', 'An orphaned man recalls his upbringing with his aunt and her husband, the parson, in a small Western town during the Reconstruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nKE6dBnB5W4AosuCrwILhnSDmUc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111390'),
  ('1111076354664107252', 'Stars of Eger', 1968, 'War, History, Romance, Adventure', 'Zoltán Várkonyi', null, 'Imre Sinkovits, György Bárdy, Kovács István, Tibor Bitskey, Gábor Agárdy, Venczel Vera, Éva Ruttkai, Hilda Gobbi', null, 'This romantic and grandiose historical film depicts the era of the constant incursions and heroic battles fought by the defenders of the castle of Eger, led by captain István Dobó, against the heavy odds of superior numbers through the lives and love of Bornemissza Gergely and Cecey Éva. Gergely is inaugurated as a fighter already at the age of 7, when he escapes the captivity of the half-eyed Turk, Jumurdzsak, with Vica and the war-booty. In thirty years'' time he becomes the first assistant of captain Dobó and the brain of the castle in the defence of Eger.', 'This romantic and grandiose historical film depicts the era of the constant incursions and heroic battles fought by the defenders of the castle of Eger, led by captain István Dobó, against the heavy odds of superior numbers through the lives and love of Bornemissza Gergely and Cecey Éva. Gergely is inaugurated as a fighter already at the age of 7, when he escapes the captivity of the half-eyed Turk, Jumurdzsak, with Vica and the war-booty. In thirty years'' time he becomes the first assistant of captain Dobó and the brain of the castle in the defence of Eger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sENhscK5vMkrsWvTUYkNECF8dse.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41861'),
  ('969357979021998122', 'Starship Invasions', 1977, 'Science Fiction', 'Mark Irwin, Ed Hunt', 'Ed Hunt', 'Robert Vaughn, Christopher Lee, Helen Shaver, Daniel Pilon, Tiiu Leek, Henry Ramer, Victoria Lynn Johnson, Doreen Lipson', 'PG', 'Captain Rameses and his Legion of the Winged Serpent brigade are out to claim Earth for their dying race. Out to save Earth is an alien guard patrol located in the Bermuda Triangle, the League of Races. LOR leaders warn Rameses that he''s breaking galactic treaty rules. The alien villain responds by launching an invasion which telepathically drives Earthlings to suicide. The LOR implore UFO expert Professor Duncan to help them. Eventually, the two alien forces battle. Will the Earth be saved?', 'Captain Rameses and his Legion of the Winged Serpent brigade are out to claim Earth for their dying race. Out to save Earth is an alien guard patrol located in the Bermuda Triangle, the League of Races. LOR leaders warn Rameses that he''s breaking galactic treaty rules. The alien villain responds by launching an invasion which telepathically drives Earthlings to suicide. The LOR implore UFO expert Professor Duncan to help them. Eventually, the two alien forces battle. Will the Earth be saved?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NWchZ7g8auDsuPR9fJoNmPs8QD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42542'),
  ('1004734343396451022', 'Starship Troopers', 1997, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Jost Vacano, Paul Verhoeven, Gregg Goldstone', 'Edward Neumeier', 'Casper Van Dien, Dina Meyer, Denise Richards, Jake Busey, Neil Patrick Harris, Clancy Brown, Michael Ironside, Patrick Muldoon', 'R', 'Set in the future, the story follows a young soldier named Johnny Rico and his exploits in the Mobile Infantry. Rico''s military career progresses from recruit to non-commissioned officer and finally to officer against the backdrop of an interstellar war between mankind and an arachnoid species known as "the Bugs."', 'Set in the future, the story follows a young soldier named Johnny Rico and his exploits in the Mobile Infantry. Rico''s military career progresses from recruit to non-commissioned officer and finally to officer against the backdrop of an interstellar war between mankind and an arachnoid species known as "the Bugs."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cxCmv23O7p3hyHwqoktHYkZcGsY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:563'),
  ('680355484840864539', 'Starship Troopers 2: Hero of the Federation', 2004, 'Adventure, Horror, Action, Science Fiction', 'Phil Tippett, Christian Sebaldt, Mark Anthony Little', 'Edward Neumeier', 'Colleen Porch, Richard Burgi, Lawrence Monoson, Brenda Strong, Ed Lauter, Cy Carter, Kelly Carlson, Ed Quinn', 'R', 'A group of troopers take refuge in an abandoned outpost after fighting alien bugs, failing to realize that more danger lays in wait.', 'A group of troopers take refuge in an abandoned outpost after fighting alien bugs, failing to realize that more danger lays in wait.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iqrqOjLaFcGNnSQlJxYLfgrhqn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10304'),
  ('268437022368426220', 'Starship Troopers 3: Marauder', 2008, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Action', 'Edward Neumeier, Lorenzo Senatore, Corry Turner', 'Edward Neumeier', 'Casper Van Dien, Jolene Blalock, Stephen Hogan, Boris Kodjoe, Amanda Donohoe, Marnette Patterson, Danny Keogh, Stelio Savante', 'R', 'The war against the Bugs continues! A Federation Starship crash-lands on the distant Alien planet OM-1, stranding beloved leader Sky Marshal Anoke and several others, including comely but tough pilot Lola Beck. It''s up to Colonel/General Johnny Rico, reluctant hero of the original Bug Invasion on Planet P, to lead a team of Troopers on a daring rescue mission.', 'The war against the Bugs continues! A Federation Starship crash-lands on the distant Alien planet OM-1, stranding beloved leader Sky Marshal Anoke and several others, including comely but tough pilot Lola Beck. It''s up to Colonel/General Johnny Rico, reluctant hero of the original Bug Invasion on Planet P, to lead a team of Troopers on a daring rescue mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vh5nospDpMOxZhyhRiXWWMmSFQe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11127'),
  ('198838972624262948', 'Starship Troopers: Invasion', 2012, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Shinji Aramaki, Alumi Yano', 'Flint Dille', 'Luci Christian, David Anthony Matranga, Justin Doran, David Wald, Andrew Love, Leraldo Anzaldua, Sam Roman, Emily Neves', 'R', 'The troopers of two starships have joined forces to terminate a massive bug attack at a Federation outpost. Before the mission can be completed and the survivors evacuated, one ship abruptly departs and goes inexplicably dark. The remaining battle-hardened troopers race to the rescue only to discover that the threat from the bugs is about to hit home.', 'The troopers of two starships have joined forces to terminate a massive bug attack at a Federation outpost. Before the mission can be completed and the survivors evacuated, one ship abruptly departs and goes inexplicably dark. The remaining battle-hardened troopers race to the rescue only to discover that the threat from the bugs is about to hit home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJJY16XSazUgDvbWEXQ1ulLiz8q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114478'),
  ('795118721833952367', 'Starship Troopers: Traitor of Mars', 2017, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Shinji Aramaki, Masaru Matsumoto, Masaru Matsumoto', 'Edward Neumeier', 'Casper Van Dien, Dina Meyer, DeRay Davis, Justin Doran, Luci Christian, Emily Neves, Scott Gibbs, Juliet Simmons', 'R', 'Federation trooper Johnny Rico is ordered to work with a group of new recruits on a satellite station on Mars, where giant bugs have decided to target their next attack.', 'Federation trooper Johnny Rico is ordered to work with a group of new recruits on a satellite station on Mars, where giant bugs have decided to target their next attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzqEq8Jbvb5SYGoYPqLyIRrt6Cm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460790'),
  ('438457727212374595', 'Starsky & Hutch', 1975, 'Action, Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Barry Shear, Archie R. Dalzell', 'William Blinn', 'Paul Michael Glaser, David Soul, Richard Ward, Michael Lerner, Michael Conrad, Albert Morgenstern, Antonio Fargas, Gilbert Green', null, 'A young couple in a car exactly like Starsky''s is killed by hitmen and word is out on the street that there''s a contract out on Starsky and Hutch. This is a TV-pilot that was an ABC Movie of the Week and later turned into the TV-series.', 'A young couple in a car exactly like Starsky''s is killed by hitmen and word is out on the street that there''s a contract out on Starsky and Hutch. This is a TV-pilot that was an ABC Movie of the Week and later turned into the TV-series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BT4jCtlFWbzg7kqkfAvcrbMj3d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252962'),
  ('505047155740082181', 'Starsky & Hutch', 2004, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Todd Phillips, Barry Peterson, Chad S. Frey', 'John O''Brien, Todd Phillips, Scot Armstrong', 'Ben Stiller, Owen Wilson, Snoop Dogg, Vince Vaughn, Fred Williamson, Juliette Lewis, Jason Bateman, Amy Smart', 'PG-13', 'Join uptight David Starsky and laid-back Ken "Hutch" Hutchinson as they''re paired for the first time as undercover cops. The new partners must overcome their differences to solve an important case with help from street informant Huggy Bear and persuasive criminal Reese Feldman.', 'Join uptight David Starsky and laid-back Ken "Hutch" Hutchinson as they''re paired for the first time as undercover cops. The new partners must overcome their differences to solve an important case with help from street informant Huggy Bear and persuasive criminal Reese Feldman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmBYVkBjhVspPv3GGus84qhBo1a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9384'),
  ('664943119310172737', 'Starstruck', 1982, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Mark Moffatt, Gillian Armstrong, Mark Turnbull', 'Stephen MacLean', 'Joey Kennedy, Ross O''Donovan, Margo Lee, Max Cullen, Pat Evison, John O''May, Dennis Miller, Norm Erskine', 'PG', 'A Sydney teen tries to make it as a rock singer, with help from her odd 14-year-old cousin.', 'A Sydney teen tries to make it as a rock singer, with help from her odd 14-year-old cousin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDDvwdJLzxCYpC7Y8tS4sdF0zMh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49409'),
  ('637245249098353598', 'Starstruck', 2010, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie, Music', 'Michael Grossman, Horacio Marquínez, John Pontrelli', null, 'Sterling Knight, Danielle Campbell, Maggie Castle, Brandon Mychal Smith, Chelsea Kane, Matt Winston, Toni Trucks, Abbie Cobb', null, 'Pop star Christopher Wilde has fame, fortune and a big-budget Hollywood movie awaiting him. But after meeting Jessica Olson, a down-to-earth girl from the Midwest, he is faced with following his heart or doing what''s best for his career.', 'Pop star Christopher Wilde has fame, fortune and a big-budget Hollywood movie awaiting him. But after meeting Jessica Olson, a down-to-earth girl from the Midwest, he is faced with following his heart or doing what''s best for his career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kuyJuNiiZvu5iNr8Dgv5y75v1uc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35558'),
  ('1001456064705915662', 'Start Me Up', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Christophe Offenstein, Lucien Jean-Baptiste, Chloé Guedeney', 'Santiago Requejo, Javier Lorenzo', 'Lucien Jean-Baptiste, Isabelle Nanty, Gérard Darmon, Zabou Breitman, Firmine Richard, Syana Medjber, Nalya Medjber, Grégoire Bonnet', null, 'A grandfather decides to launch a childcare business alongside a bitter divorcee who is also an aging game show icon trying to make a comeback.', 'A grandfather decides to launch a childcare business alongside a bitter divorcee who is also an aging game show icon trying to make a comeback.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHmxiFg5kcgaPZVKb3bioxMsH4H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1101242'),
  ('527609728077533856', 'Start the Revolution Without Me', 1970, 'Comedy, History', 'Bud Yorkin, Jean Tournier, Georges Grodzenczyk', 'Lawrence J. Cohen, Fred Freeman', 'Gene Wilder, Donald Sutherland, Hugh Griffith, Jack MacGowran, Billie Whitelaw, Victor Spinetti, Ewa Aulin, Helen Fraser', null, 'Two sets of identical twins are accidentally switched at birth. One pair, Phillipe and Pierre DeSisi, are aristocratic and haughty, while the other, Charles and Claude Coupé, are poor and dim-witted. On the eve of the French Revolution, both sets find themselves entangled in palace intrigue.', 'Two sets of identical twins are accidentally switched at birth. One pair, Phillipe and Pierre DeSisi, are aristocratic and haughty, while the other, Charles and Claude Coupé, are poor and dim-witted. On the eve of the French Revolution, both sets find themselves entangled in palace intrigue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4gspFa639yUWLSyefP5yCxKgRi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19753'),
  ('798085944716467695', 'Start-Up', 2019, 'Drama, Action, Comedy', 'Choi Jung-yol, Kim Min-jae, Lee Hyung-bin', 'Choi Jung-yol', 'Don Lee, Park Jeong-min, Jung Hae-in, Yum Jung-ah, Choi Sung-eun, Kim Jong-soo, Yoon Kyung-ho, Kim Kyung-duk', null, 'Two boys are becoming real adults during a turbulent time as they experience a world that doesn''t go their way.', 'Two boys are becoming real adults during a turbulent time as they experience a world that doesn''t go their way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l4pTmfKWYCyZIVgNV158JyWlhzW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:581530'),
  ('666671970915689942', 'Starter for 10', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Tom Vaughan, Ashley Rowe, Ian Bailie', 'David Nicholls', 'James McAvoy, Alice Eve, Rebecca Hall, Catherine Tate, Dominic Cooper, Benedict Cumberbatch, James Corden, Mark Gatiss', 'PG-13', 'In 1985, against the backdrop of Thatcherism, Brian Jackson enrolls in the University of Bristol, a scholarship boy from seaside Essex with a love of knowledge for its own sake and a childhood spent watching University Challenge, a college quiz show. At Bristol he tries out for the Challenge team and falls under the spell of Alice, a lovely blond with an extensive sexual past.', 'In 1985, against the backdrop of Thatcherism, Brian Jackson enrolls in the University of Bristol, a scholarship boy from seaside Essex with a love of knowledge for its own sake and a childhood spent watching University Challenge, a college quiz show. At Bristol he tries out for the Challenge team and falls under the spell of Alice, a lovely blond with an extensive sexual past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0NU3kgn87iNffUUDeItUXZKUKl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14055'),
  ('637278359689105637', 'Starting Out in the Evening', 2007, 'Drama', 'Andrew Wagner, Harlan Bosmajian', 'Fred Parnes, Andrew Wagner', 'Frank Langella, Lauren Ambrose, Patti Perkins, Adrian Lester, Lili Taylor, Dennis Parlato, Jeff McCarthy, Michael Cumpsty', 'PG-13', 'Leonard Schiller once counted among New York''s literary lions, but illness and ten years of writer''s block have lowered his profile, almost to the point of obscurity. When Heather Wolfe, an ambitious literature major, asks to interview him for her thesis on his work, her interest forces him to address the issues that he has avoided all these years, and stirs in him feelings he has long forgotten, much to his daughter''s consternation.', 'Leonard Schiller once counted among New York''s literary lions, but illness and ten years of writer''s block have lowered his profile, almost to the point of obscurity. When Heather Wolfe, an ambitious literature major, asks to interview him for her thesis on his work, her interest forces him to address the issues that he has avoided all these years, and stirs in him feelings he has long forgotten, much to his daughter''s consternation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKCSp9ot1ofu0nC24DLekqdqb5U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13076'),
  ('1001108854783336078', 'Starting Over', 1979, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Alan J. Pakula, Alex Hapsas, Sven Nykvist', 'James L. Brooks', 'Burt Reynolds, Jill Clayburgh, Candice Bergen, Charles Durning, Frances Sternhagen, Austin Pendleton, Mary Kay Place, MacIntyre Dixon', 'R', 'After divorcing his ambitious singer wife, a middle-aged man begins a new relationship with a teacher.', 'After divorcing his ambitious singer wife, a middle-aged man begins a new relationship with a teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvhfunLx3iL3VM0rjmFLV2dcEyd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54663'),
  ('534503395045555211', 'Startup.com', 2001, 'Documentary', 'Chris Hegedus, Jehane Noujaim, Jehane Noujaim', null, 'Kaleil Isaza Tuzman, Tom Herman, Kenneth Austin, Tricia Burke, Roy Burston, David Camp, Dora Glottman, Julian Herbstein', 'R', 'Friends since high school, 20-somethings Kaleil Isaza Tuzman and Tom Herman have an idea: a Web site for people to conduct business with municipal governments. This documentary tracks the rise and fall of govWorks.com from May of 1999 to December of 2000, and the trials the business brings to the relationship of these best friends. Kaleil raises the money, Tom''s the technical chief. A third partner wants a buy out; girlfriends come and go; Tom''s daughter needs attention. And always the need for cash and for improving the site. Venture capital comes in by the millions. Kaleil is on C-SPAN, CNN, and magazine covers. Will the business or the friendship crash first?', 'Friends since high school, 20-somethings Kaleil Isaza Tuzman and Tom Herman have an idea: a Web site for people to conduct business with municipal governments. This documentary tracks the rise and fall of govWorks.com from May of 1999 to December of 2000, and the trials the business brings to the relationship of these best friends. Kaleil raises the money, Tom''s the technical chief. A third partner wants a buy out; girlfriends come and go; Tom''s daughter needs attention. And always the need for cash and for improving the site. Venture capital comes in by the millions. Kaleil is on C-SPAN, CNN, and magazine covers. Will the business or the friendship crash first?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ognPQebXUCRfKwAyRodR0j0xLjd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14268'),
  ('416508020386460221', 'Starve Acre', 2024, 'Horror, Drama, Fantasy', 'Liam Saint-Pierre, Daniel Kokotajlo, Adam Scarth', 'Daniel Kokotajlo', 'Matt Smith, Morfydd Clark, Arthur Shaw, Erin Richards, Sean Gilder, Melanie Kilburn, Robert Emms, Roger Barclay', 'NR', 'When their son starts acting strangely, a couple unwittingly allow dark and sinister forces into their home, awakening a long-dormant ancient evil rooted deep in the countryside.', 'When their son starts acting strangely, a couple unwittingly allow dark and sinister forces into their home, awakening a long-dormant ancient evil rooted deep in the countryside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5j37QHXuNygzEa2X54RMlOb6hj3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:933090'),
  ('402755808501132502', 'Starving Generation', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Léa Frédeval, Gordon Spooner', 'Léa Frédeval, Bastien Daret', 'Louane, François Deblock, Kemar, Nina Mélo, Rabah Nait Oufella, Bruno Sanches, Souheila Yacoub, Pierre-François Martin-Laval', null, 'At 21, Zoe is sick and tired of everyone taking her for granted, just because she’s young. She dreams of a day when all millennials go on strike, so that people finally recognize their true value.', 'At 21, Zoe is sick and tired of everyone taking her for granted, just because she’s young. She dreams of a day when all millennials go on strike, so that people finally recognize their true value.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LH7DlJeIykHQVfog6IUWQ1fXVP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522531'),
  ('1036461765221686762', 'Starving in Suburbia', 2014, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Tara Miele, Damian Horan', 'Tara Miele', 'Laura Slade Wiggins, Emma Dumont, Callie Thorne, Izabella Miko, Brendan Meyer, Marcus Giamatti, Sharon Lawrence, Paula Newsome', null, 'When seventeen-year-old Hannah stumbles upon a website about Thinspiration--an online community devoted to anorexia as a life choice--she becomes an obsessive follower of the site founder, ButterflyAna. By the time Hannah''s family realizes what is happening and get Hannah the help she needs, the disease has fully taken hold and Hannah is refusing to eat. Will this family be able to exorcise the demon of anorexia from their lives?', 'When seventeen-year-old Hannah stumbles upon a website about Thinspiration--an online community devoted to anorexia as a life choice--she becomes an obsessive follower of the site founder, ButterflyAna. By the time Hannah''s family realizes what is happening and get Hannah the help she needs, the disease has fully taken hold and Hannah is refusing to eat. Will this family be able to exorcise the demon of anorexia from their lives?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSTqlLJ0gNEIQVNwVe9YhvAcdZo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273059'),
  ('262902471220523245', 'Stash House', 2012, 'Thriller', 'Eduardo Rodríguez, Matthew Irving, Farris Hopkins', 'Gary Spinelli', 'Dolph Lundgren, Briana Evigan, Sean Faris, Jon Huertas, Alyshia Ochse, Sebastian James, Lance E. Nichols, Lawrence Turner', null, 'Dave and Emma have found the perfect house, until they discover a stash of heroin and end up imprisoned in it by violent thugs.', 'Dave and Emma have found the perfect house, until they discover a stash of heroin and end up imprisoned in it by violent thugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/foxavF6GeFiowM8Uut5rdn2HaRB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102630'),
  ('1149267633786649549', 'Stasis', 2017, 'Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Nicole Jones-Dion, Nicole Jones-Dion', 'Nicole Jones-Dion', 'Anna Harr, Mark Grossman, London Grace, Tiana Masaniai, Caleb Thomas, Richard Lippert, Jeff Locker, Greg Lutz', null, 'After a night out of partying and left behind by her friends, Ava wakes up and sneaks back home only to find that she''s already safe in bed. But that''s not Ava - it''s someone who looks just like her. A time-traveling fugitive has stolen Ava''s body, her identity, and her life. What''s more -- she''s not alone. There are others, hiding in the past, secretly living among us, plotting to alter the future. Without her body, Ava is a virtual ghost, silent and invisible to the world. And, so far as she knows, she''s the only one who can stop them and put the timeline back on course.', 'After a night out of partying and left behind by her friends, Ava wakes up and sneaks back home only to find that she''s already safe in bed. But that''s not Ava - it''s someone who looks just like her. A time-traveling fugitive has stolen Ava''s body, her identity, and her life. What''s more -- she''s not alone. There are others, hiding in the past, secretly living among us, plotting to alter the future. Without her body, Ava is a virtual ghost, silent and invisible to the world. And, so far as she knows, she''s the only one who can stop them and put the timeline back on course.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g0AgiPF1qBObVDLK7pwncujVpuo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460024'),
  ('1081570676578933972', 'State Affairs', 2009, 'Thriller', 'Eric Valette', 'Alexandre Charlot', 'André Dussollier, Thierry Frémont, Rachida Brakni, Denis Podalydès, Christine Boisson, Gérald Laroche, Serge Hazanavicius, Éric Savin', null, 'A plane explodes above the Gulf of Guinea. An escort girl is murdered in a Parisian park. Thousands of miles separate these two events, and yet Nora Chahyd, believes there''s a connection between them, much to his superiors chagrin. As Nora investigates, getting dangerously close to the powers that be, the murders and betrayals accumulate, and signs point to a state affair at the heart of it all.', 'A plane explodes above the Gulf of Guinea. An escort girl is murdered in a Parisian park. Thousands of miles separate these two events, and yet Nora Chahyd, believes there''s a connection between them, much to his superiors chagrin. As Nora investigates, getting dangerously close to the powers that be, the murders and betrayals accumulate, and signs point to a state affair at the heart of it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecEWwV0cZOT5afiieO0wtKOzeGI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36138'),
  ('1043991878904476842', 'State and Main', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'David Mamet, Oliver Stapleton, Dieter Busch', 'David Mamet', 'Alec Baldwin, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Charles Durning, Clark Gregg, Patti LuPone, William H. Macy, Sarah Jessica Parker, David Paymer', null, 'The residents of a small Vermont town don''t know what hit them when a beleaguered Hollywood film crew brings a chaotic shoot to their quaint village.', 'The residents of a small Vermont town don''t know what hit them when a beleaguered Hollywood film crew brings a chaotic shoot to their quaint village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/348hvpWeSGdAQlCrGvKbpC0FpQN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21991'),
