  ('100276702973707553', 'State of Consciousness', 2023, 'Thriller', 'Marcus Stokes', 'Rylend Grant, Dikran Ornekian, Guillaume Tunzini', 'Emile Hirsch, Tatjana Nardone, Kesia Elwin, Robin Mugnaini, David Wurawa, Michael E. Rodgers, Lara Pictet, Gaia Scodellaro', 'R', 'Nightmares and reality become indistinguishable to Stephen when he is forced to take medication for a psychological disorder he doesn''t have. To regain his sanity and get back to his normal life, he sets out to escape from the institution he has been trapped in.', 'Nightmares and reality become indistinguishable to Stephen when he is forced to take medication for a psychological disorder he doesn''t have. To regain his sanity and get back to his normal life, he sets out to escape from the institution he has been trapped in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6sdKYVGIrUTIHZZxUJf1PdBPN5e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:842927'),
  ('890331818022295302', 'State of Emergency', 2012, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Turner Clay', 'Turner Clay', 'Jay Hayden, Andy Stahl, Tori White, Scott Lilly, Kathryn Todd Norman, McKenna Jones, Loren Albanese, Clay Burke', 'NR', 'Chaos consumes a small town when a chemical facility explodes releasing a deadly toxin. Moments after the leak, the town''s residents show signs of mutation, causing the military to quarantine the area leaving any survivors helpless and trapped inside. The story follows Jim, a young man isolated within the red zone, as he eludes flesh eating zombies in an attempt to win back his freedom.', 'Chaos consumes a small town when a chemical facility explodes releasing a deadly toxin. Moments after the leak, the town''s residents show signs of mutation, causing the military to quarantine the area leaving any survivors helpless and trapped inside. The story follows Jim, a young man isolated within the red zone, as he eludes flesh eating zombies in an attempt to win back his freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m7qQoj6x58VLeN4WoQQVIosacjb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136476'),
  ('424731816335639563', 'State of Fear', 2026, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Pedro Morelli, Kauê Zilli', 'Pedro Morelli, Julia Furrer', 'Naruna Costa, Camilla Damião, Seu Jorge, David Santos, Marcélia Cartaxo, Lee Taylor, Enio Cavalcante, Hermila Guedes', 'R', 'As São Paulo erupts in an unprecedented wave of violence, a lawyer with underworld ties must strike a deal with the police to rescue her kidnapped niece.', 'As São Paulo erupts in an unprecedented wave of violence, a lawyer with underworld ties must strike a deal with the police to rescue her kidnapped niece.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Eaqedg8MAlnP51GYY8MCSIdTnV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1426964'),
  ('221793484819020748', 'State of Grace', 1990, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Phil Joanou, Jordan Cronenweth, Richard Quinlan', 'Dennis McIntyre', 'Sean Penn, Ed Harris, Gary Oldman, Robin Wright, John Turturro, Burgess Meredith, R. D. Call, Joe Viterelli', 'R', 'Hell''s Kitchen, New York. Terry Noonan returns home after a ten-year absence. He soon reconnects with Jackie, a childhood friend and member of the Irish mob, and rekindles his love affair with Jackie''s sister Kathleen.', 'Hell''s Kitchen, New York. Terry Noonan returns home after a ten-year absence. He soon reconnects with Jackie, a childhood friend and member of the Irish mob, and rekindles his love affair with Jackie''s sister Kathleen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNMeRLY3MeY2FFeh639plHai3F1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1662'),
  ('689713017324107876', 'State of Play', 2009, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Kevin Macdonald, Doug Coleman, Rodrigo Prieto', 'Tony Gilroy, Billy Ray, Matthew Michael Carnahan', 'Russell Crowe, Ben Affleck, Rachel McAdams, Helen Mirren, Robin Wright, Jason Bateman, Jeff Daniels, Michael Berresse', 'PG-13', 'When a congressional aide is killed, a Washington, D.C. journalist starts investigating the case involving the Representative, his old college friend.', 'When a congressional aide is killed, a Washington, D.C. journalist starts investigating the case involving the Representative, his old college friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mWsfeSFUM3NxWa62UrA9IIn240B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16995'),
  ('230902979993084484', 'State of Siege', 1972, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Costa-Gavras, Pierre-William Glenn', 'Costa-Gavras, Franco Solinas, Franco Solinas', 'Yves Montand, Renato Salvatori, O.E. Hasse, Jacques Weber, Jean-Luc Bideau, Maurice Teynac, Yvette Etiévant, Gloria Laso', null, 'Assigned to South America, US official Philip Michael Santore is employed by a counterinsurgency agency. His position makes him a target for a local band of guerrillas, and, before long, Santore is kidnapped. As a prisoner, he undergoes interrogation, shedding light on the violent situation in the country. Once the insurgents are done with their questioning, they must decide whether Santore lives or dies.', 'Assigned to South America, US official Philip Michael Santore is employed by a counterinsurgency agency. His position makes him a target for a local band of guerrillas, and, before long, Santore is kidnapped. As a prisoner, he undergoes interrogation, shedding light on the violent situation in the country. Once the insurgents are done with their questioning, they must decide whether Santore lives or dies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEH5yjGFgcEmS36XhFzIblQF0fJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91487'),
