  ('642769010020706635', 'State Reasons', 1978, 'Thriller, Drama', 'André Cayatte', 'Jean Curtelin, André Cayatte', 'Jean Yanne, Monica Vitti, Michel Bouquet, François Périer, Jean-Claude Bouillon, Gabriel Jabbour, Maristella Greco', null, 'Professor Marrot obtains the secret documents containing evidence of the illegal weapon transactions between the French government, in the face of its high official Leroi, and two African countries. Before making the public statement, Marrot finds himself under surveillance. In the critical circumstances his Italian friend and partner Angela takes action and the game continues.', 'Professor Marrot obtains the secret documents containing evidence of the illegal weapon transactions between the French government, in the face of its high official Leroi, and two African countries. Before making the public statement, Marrot finds himself under surveillance. In the critical circumstances his Italian friend and partner Angela takes action and the game continues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwiPeIjzRNkwvzZyE7n6VpRrV6x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306454'),
  ('177743817508296051', 'State Secret', 1950, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance, Mystery', 'Robert Krasker, Guy Hamilton, Sidney Gilliat', 'Sidney Gilliat', 'Douglas Fairbanks Jr., Glynis Johns, Jack Hawkins, Herbert Lom, Walter Rilla, Karl Stepanek, Hans Olaf Moser, Guido Lorraine', 'NR', 'While working in England, an American surgeon Dr. John Marlowe is invited to Vosnia (a fictitious East-European country) to receive an award and demonstrate his life-saving surgery. Unwittingly caught in the middle of a dangerous and corrupt series of political events, Marlowe then becomes the object of a shoot-to-kill, vicious pursuit. Fleeing, he seeks help from an English-speaking actress, Lisa Robinson, and the two attempt to escape across the treacherous mountains of Vosnia.', 'While working in England, an American surgeon Dr. John Marlowe is invited to Vosnia (a fictitious East-European country) to receive an award and demonstrate his life-saving surgery. Unwittingly caught in the middle of a dangerous and corrupt series of political events, Marlowe then becomes the object of a shoot-to-kill, vicious pursuit. Fleeing, he seeks help from an English-speaking actress, Lisa Robinson, and the two attempt to escape across the treacherous mountains of Vosnia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8WRphRz9yn5nJtV8faSy4PRy0GB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118236'),
  ('373434504317598165', 'Stateless Things', 2012, 'Drama', 'Kim Kyung-mook, Kang Gook-hyun', 'Kim Kyung-mook', 'Paul Lee, Yeom Hyun-joon, Kim Sae-byuk, Lim Hyung-kook, Kim Jung-pal', null, 'Stateless Things crosscuts between the lives of two young men, one an illegal immigrant from North Korea stuck in dead-end jobs, the other the kept boy of a married businessman stifling in a swanky apartment.', 'Stateless Things crosscuts between the lives of two young men, one an illegal immigrant from North Korea stuck in dead-end jobs, the other the kept boy of a married businessman stifling in a swanky apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3xETyJN4CKiWGBeaBDstxkiU9g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99513'),
  ('49695798076976186', 'Stateline Motel', 1973, 'Drama, Crime', 'Gábor Pogány, Maurizio Lucidi', 'Vittoria Vigorelli, Fulvio Gicca Palli, Maurizio Lucidi', 'Fabio Testi, Ursula Andress, Eli Wallach, Barbara Bach, Massimo Girotti, Carlo De Mejo, Howard Ross, Céline Lomez', null, 'After robbing a jewelry shop in Canada, two Americans arrange a meeting near the US borders in order to split the loot. One of them has an accident with his car on his way there and gets stuck in an isolated motel until his car is fixed. The owner of the motel, a sexy woman in her thirties, falls in love with him, but her suspicions about him begin to multiply, as the police arrive at the motel...', 'After robbing a jewelry shop in Canada, two Americans arrange a meeting near the US borders in order to split the loot. One of them has an accident with his car on his way there and gets stuck in an isolated motel until his car is fixed. The owner of the motel, a sexy woman in her thirties, falls in love with him, but her suspicions about him begin to multiply, as the police arrive at the motel...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nRAYRlHWsoPO95ci0Ugt9ZlEDr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260914'),
  ('248809427916841597', 'Staten Island', 2009, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'James DeMonaco, Christopher Norr', 'James DeMonaco', 'Ethan Hawke, Vincent D''Onofrio, Seymour Cassel, Julianne Nicholson, Ian Brennan, Michael Hogan, Larry Mitchell, Rosemary De Angelis', 'R', 'Sully is desperate to give his unborn son the chance he never had. Jasper wants to escape the mobsters that have infiltrated his life and business. Parmie, a local mob boss, dreams of crushing the competition. All three men live in Staten Island, and once their lives intersect, nothing will ever be the same.', 'Sully is desperate to give his unborn son the chance he never had. Jasper wants to escape the mobsters that have infiltrated his life and business. Parmie, a local mob boss, dreams of crushing the competition. All three men live in Staten Island, and once their lives intersect, nothing will ever be the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQ7Fr2amTUigFLH55eTRlzVJL9y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25927'),
  ('922938426977423830', 'Staten Island Summer', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Rhys Thomas, Anthony Wolberg', 'Colin Jost', 'Graham Phillips, Zack Pearlman, Ashley Greene, Cecily Strong, John DeLuca, Bobby Moynihan, Fred Armisen, Michael Patrick O''Brien', 'R', 'Pals Danny and Frank spend the summer after high school working as lifeguards while figuring out their future.', 'Pals Danny and Frank spend the summer after high school working as lifeguards while figuring out their future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mAG2oqObFOR58bUI8A2DQCkRlcf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343934'),
  ('162232093114525131', 'Stateside', 2004, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Reverge Anselmo, Adam Holender, Tom Priestley Jr.', 'Reverge Anselmo', 'Rachael Leigh Cook, Jonathan Tucker, Agnes Bruckner, Daniel Franzese, Carrie Fisher, Joe Mantegna, Val Kilmer, Diane Venora', 'R', 'The film follows a rebellious teenager on leave from the Marines who falls in love with a female musician. The relationship is threatened when she develops a mental illness...', 'The film follows a rebellious teenager on leave from the Marines who falls in love with a female musician. The relationship is threatened when she develops a mental illness...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPRZpD44rA1ZqgcLjKyVw4fIlgo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43670'),
  ('1023766294508965072', 'Static', 1986, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mark Romanek, Jeffrey Jur', 'Mark Romanek, Keith Gordon', 'Keith Gordon, Amanda Plummer, Bob Gunton, Janice Abbott, Reathel Bean, Kitty Mei-Mei Chen, Barton Heyman, Jane Hoffman', 'R', 'Ernie Blick has just lost his job at a crucifix factory. Luckily, for Ernie, this allows him more time to devote to his invention. Yes, Ernie is an inventor -- and he''s come up with something big. So big, in fact, Ernie''s convinced it will change the way people look at life and death. With the support of his drummer friend Julia and his ex-Green Beret-evangelist cousin, Ernie unveils it to the world. But even he isn''t prepared for the public''s reaction.', 'Ernie Blick has just lost his job at a crucifix factory. Luckily, for Ernie, this allows him more time to devote to his invention. Yes, Ernie is an inventor -- and he''s come up with something big. So big, in fact, Ernie''s convinced it will change the way people look at life and death. With the support of his drummer friend Julia and his ex-Green Beret-evangelist cousin, Ernie unveils it to the world. But even he isn''t prepared for the public''s reaction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fSRFgYkoYxSjnFvicM18LySMFD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83862'),
  ('686449248674126505', 'Static', 2012, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Gabriel Cowan, Michael Halper, Dave Casper', 'Gabriel Cowan', 'Milo Ventimiglia, Sarah Shahi, William Mapother, Sara Paxton, Dominic Bogart, Oz Kalvan', 'NR', 'A couple facing marital problems after losing their child finds their life together further complicated by a mysterious visitor.', 'A couple facing marital problems after losing their child finds their life together further complicated by a mysterious visitor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecPbDVrirQgXcjOrwfyFBOQmq1S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165567'),
  ('429697101161502622', 'Station', 1981, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Yasuo Furuhata, Daisaku Kimura, Kensho Yamashita', 'Sō Kuramoto', 'Ken Takakura, Chieko Baisho, Ayumi Ishida, Setsuko Karasuma, Yuko Kotegawa, Kunie Tanaka, Ryudo Uzaki, Hideo Murota', null, 'A detective goes out of his way to crack the case of a serial killer who specialises in murdering police officers.', 'A detective goes out of his way to crack the case of a serial killer who specialises in murdering police officers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ASuWq3kDQRdXLe5B5WVXJq0lls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115221'),
  ('179818112036118085', 'Station for Two', 1982, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Eldar Ryazanov, Leonid Chertok, Vadim Alisov', 'Eldar Ryazanov, Emil Braginskiy', 'Lyudmila Gurchenko, Oleg Basilashvili, Nikita Mikhalkov, Nonna Mordyukova, Mikhail Kononov, Anastasia Voznesenskaya, Aleksandr Shirvindt, Tatyana Dogileva', null, 'Platon Ryabinin, a pianist, is traveling by train to a distant town of Griboedov to visit his father. He gets off to have lunch during a twenty minute stop at Zastupinsk railway station. He meets Vera, a waitress, after he refuses to pay her for the disgusting food he doesn''t even touch and misses his train due to police investigation of the incident. His passport is then accidentally taken away from him by Andrei, Vera''s fiancé, and his money is stolen as he waits for the next train to Griboedov. Vera learns that Platon is about to get sentenced and sent to prison in the Far East for a car accident he isn''t guilty for. During the few days that Platon has to spend in Zastupinsk he and Vera develop feelings for each other...', 'Platon Ryabinin, a pianist, is traveling by train to a distant town of Griboedov to visit his father. He gets off to have lunch during a twenty minute stop at Zastupinsk railway station. He meets Vera, a waitress, after he refuses to pay her for the disgusting food he doesn''t even touch and misses his train due to police investigation of the incident. His passport is then accidentally taken away from him by Andrei, Vera''s fiancé, and his money is stolen as he waits for the next train to Griboedov. Vera learns that Platon is about to get sentenced and sent to prison in the Far East for a car accident he isn''t guilty for. During the few days that Platon has to spend in Zastupinsk he and Vera develop feelings for each other...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKQAFPdfIx95NUzhklbnjUxfaib.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32336'),
  ('950586229876950378', 'Station Six-Sahara', 1963, 'Drama', 'Seth Holt', 'Brian Clemens, Bryan Forbes', 'Carroll Baker, Peter van Eyck, Ian Bannen, Denholm Elliott, Hansjörg Felmy, Mario Adorf, Biff McGuire, Harry Baird', null, 'A beautiful blonde joins a small group of men running an oil station in the Sahara Desert and starts the emotions soaring.', 'A beautiful blonde joins a small group of men running an oil station in the Sahara Desert and starts the emotions soaring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9I1lrCrKszbD2yPbERq9d37niYK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138876'),
  ('1101873923412162283', 'Station West', 1948, 'Western', 'Harry J. Wild, Sidney Lanfield, Joel Freeman', 'Frank Fenton, Winston Miller', 'Dick Powell, Jane Greer, Agnes Moorehead, Tom Powers, Gordon Oliver, Steve Brodie, Guinn ''Big Boy'' Williams, Raymond Burr', 'NR', 'When two US cavalrymen transporting a gold shipment get killed, US Army Intelligence investigator John Haven goes undercover to a mining and logging town to find the killers.', 'When two US cavalrymen transporting a gold shipment get killed, US Army Intelligence investigator John Haven goes undercover to a mining and logging town to find the killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/768q6hR1gZIBZnZfNSZs7113ybZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37294'),
  ('295364309787761434', 'Stations of the Cross', 2014, 'Drama', 'Alexander Sass, Dietrich Brüggemann', 'Dietrich Brüggemann, Anna Brüggemann', 'Lea van Acken, Franziska Weisz, Florian Stetter, Lucie Aron, Moritz Knapp, Michael Kamp, Georg Wesch, Chiara Palmeri', null, 'Maria finds herself caught between two worlds. At school this 14-year-old girl has all the typical teenage interests, but when she’s at home with her family she follows the teachings of the Society of St. Paul and their traditionalist interpretation of Catholicism. Everything that Maria thinks and does must be examined before God. And since the Lord is a strict shepherd, she lives in constant fear of committing some misconduct...', 'Maria finds herself caught between two worlds. At school this 14-year-old girl has all the typical teenage interests, but when she’s at home with her family she follows the teachings of the Society of St. Paul and their traditionalist interpretation of Catholicism. Everything that Maria thinks and does must be examined before God. And since the Lord is a strict shepherd, she lives in constant fear of committing some misconduct...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJgvoCG1GtGibgjg8ABBIVExZ0F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254721'),
  ('485817552349093950', 'Statues Also Die', 1953, 'Documentary', 'Chris Marker, Alain Resnais, Ghislain Cloquet', 'Chris Marker', 'Jean Négroni, François Mitterrand, Pope Pius XII, Sugar Ray Robinson', null, 'Commissioned by the journal Présence Africaine, this short documentary examines how African art is devalued and alienated through colonial and museum contexts. Beginning with the question of why African works are confined to ethnographic displays while Greek or Egyptian art is celebrated, the film became a landmark of anti-colonial cinema and was banned in France for eight years.', 'Commissioned by the journal Présence Africaine, this short documentary examines how African art is devalued and alienated through colonial and museum contexts. Beginning with the question of why African works are confined to ethnographic displays while Greek or Egyptian art is celebrated, the film became a landmark of anti-colonial cinema and was banned in France for eight years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbKnnqUC09pmHwvbDlRYdhrYFJe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37927'),
  ('1135336710346057479', 'Status Update', 2018, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Scott Speer, Tim Whyte, Vincente Baker', 'Jason Filardi', 'Ross Lynch, Olivia Holt, Harvey Guillén, Courtney Eaton, Brec Bassinger, Wendi McLendon-Covey, Rob Riggle, Jay Brazeau', 'PG-13', 'After being uprooted by his parents'' separation and unable to fit into his new hometown, a teenager stumbles upon a magical app that causes his social media updates to come true.', 'After being uprooted by his parents'' separation and unable to fit into his new hometown, a teenager stumbles upon a magical app that causes his social media updates to come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/E4twRNScyq3g6tRpvK6X8LdD1z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416494'),
  ('1009401148915672252', 'Staudamm', 2014, 'Drama', 'Thomas Sieben', 'Christian Lyra, Thomas Sieben', 'Friedrich Mücke, Liv Lisa Fries, Dominic Raacke, Arnd Schimkat, Carolin Fink, Lucy Wirth', null, 'A young man called Roman is working for an attorney. Roman has to travel to a small village in Bavaria, in order to get some files from a local police station. These files keep records about a high school massacre committed by a student a year ago. Due to bureaucratic reasons, Roman has to stay in the village for a few days. By accident he meets a young girl called Laura, who has survived the massacre. By becoming more acquainted to Laura, Roman also becomes more interested in the tragic event. Later on he realizes that Laura is hiding a secret. She has been more involved in the incident.', 'A young man called Roman is working for an attorney. Roman has to travel to a small village in Bavaria, in order to get some files from a local police station. These files keep records about a high school massacre committed by a student a year ago. Due to bureaucratic reasons, Roman has to stay in the village for a few days. By accident he meets a young girl called Laura, who has survived the massacre. By becoming more acquainted to Laura, Roman also becomes more interested in the tragic event. Later on he realizes that Laura is hiding a secret. She has been more involved in the incident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/giy5gTr79rA9PkasW6xeyz3stdZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283979'),
  ('811617391197823121', 'Staunton Hill', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'George Cameron Romero, Jeremiah Tinsley, Mark Shandley', 'David Rountree', 'Kathy Lamkin, Cristen Coppen, David Rountree, Kiko Ellsworth, Christine Carlo, Paula Rhodes, Charlie Bodin, B.J. Hendricks', 'NR', 'When a group of hikers take off for a weekend of fun and adventure in remote mountain region, they unwittingly stumble across the Staunton family - for whom the hill is named - and find themselves at the mercy of a depraved, diabolical brood that will stop at nothing to rid their property of these "trespassers." The only law on Staunton''s Hill is the law of the Stauntons...and, in this case, the penalty for defying that law is death.', 'When a group of hikers take off for a weekend of fun and adventure in remote mountain region, they unwittingly stumble across the Staunton family - for whom the hill is named - and find themselves at the mercy of a depraved, diabolical brood that will stop at nothing to rid their property of these "trespassers." The only law on Staunton''s Hill is the law of the Stauntons...and, in this case, the penalty for defying that law is death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/esbTc6W5RMTHVWoOX9NoK69KtH5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25537'),
  ('1067141827976671007', 'Stavisky...', 1974, 'Crime, Drama, History', 'Alain Resnais, Sacha Vierny, Philippe Lopez', 'Jorge Semprún', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, François Périer, Anny Duperey, Michael Lonsdale, Roberto Bisacco, Claude Rich, Charles Boyer, Pierre Vernier', null, 'Biarritz, 1933. Charm and talent help small-time swindler Serge Alexandre, alias Stavisky, to bribe his way into the centre of French political power. But when his great scam involving millions gets exposed, he brings the government to the verge of collapse and the country to the brink of civil war.', 'Biarritz, 1933. Charm and talent help small-time swindler Serge Alexandre, alias Stavisky, to bribe his way into the centre of French political power. But when his great scam involving millions gets exposed, he brings the government to the verge of collapse and the country to the brink of civil war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFY7YNUeGr65fWVdPwxQjoyPmkA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61296'),
  ('320285432284538640', 'Stay', 2005, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Roberto Schaefer, Marc Forster, Kevin Tod Haug', 'David Benioff', 'Ewan McGregor, Naomi Watts, Ryan Gosling, Kate Burton, Elizabeth Reaser, Bob Hoskins, BD Wong, Janeane Garofalo', 'R', 'Psychiatrist Sam Foster has a new patient, Henry Letham, who claims to be suicidal. In trying to diagnose him, Sam visits Henry''s prior therapist and also finds Henry''s mother -- even though Henry has said that he murdered both of his parents. As reality starts to contradict fact, Sam spirals into an unstable mental state. Then he finds a clue as to how and when Henry may try to kill himself, and races to try to stop him.', 'Psychiatrist Sam Foster has a new patient, Henry Letham, who claims to be suicidal. In trying to diagnose him, Sam visits Henry''s prior therapist and also finds Henry''s mother -- even though Henry has said that he murdered both of his parents. As reality starts to contradict fact, Sam spirals into an unstable mental state. Then he finds a clue as to how and when Henry may try to kill himself, and races to try to stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrLZVP8jG0KBcabahRPp6UP7Oy2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8066'),
  ('615990417399600995', 'Stay Alive', 2006, 'Horror, Mystery', 'William Brent Bell, Alejandro Martínez, Steve Battaglia', 'Matthew Peterman, William Brent Bell', 'Jon Foster, Samaire Armstrong, Frankie Muniz, Sophia Bush, Jimmi Simpson, Adam Goldberg, Wendell Pierce, Milo Ventimiglia', 'PG-13', 'After the brutal death of a friend, a group of friends find themselves in possession of a video-game called "Stay Alive," a blood-curdling true story of a 17th century noblewoman known as the Blood Countess. After playing the game when they know they shouldn''t, however, the friends realize that once they die in the game — they die for real!', 'After the brutal death of a friend, a group of friends find themselves in possession of a video-game called "Stay Alive," a blood-curdling true story of a 17th century noblewoman known as the Blood Countess. After playing the game when they know they shouldn''t, however, the friends realize that once they die in the game — they die for real!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hsSJwroE7jugEROB8tmyxJP91Ho.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10069'),
  ('147243054317013522', 'Stay as You Are', 1978, 'Romance, Drama', 'Alberto Lattuada, José Luis Alcaine', 'Enrico Oldoini, Alberto Lattuada', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Nastassja Kinski, Mónica Randall, Ania Pieroni, Francisco Rabal, Barbara De Rossi', 'R', 'A married Roman landscape architect starts an affair with a young woman who might be a shadow from his past.', 'A married Roman landscape architect starts an affair with a young woman who might be a shadow from his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wiEyZCHPjfP1znUWfEZIbEyocFH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31214'),
  ('258710357873197772', 'Stay Away from Me', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Alessio Maria Federici', 'Edoardo Falcone, Davide Lantieri, Alessio Maria Federici', 'Enrico Brignano, Ambra Angiolini, Anna Galiena, Giampaolo Morelli, Fabio Troiano, Giorgia Cardaci, Giorgio Colangeli, Gianna Paola Scaffidi', null, 'Jacopo has a serious problem. He may be a brilliant marriage guidance counsellor, but he can never manage to have a steady relationship for more than two weeks. And for good reason: since he was very young, Jacopo has been cursed and brought bad luck to every woman who has fallen in love with him. Really bad luck. Because of this, he has vowed to stay away from women, for their own good. But the moment he lays eyes on Sara at a friend’s birthday party, he is smitten. Despite his resistance, the two fall head over heels leading to back-to-back, laugh-out-loud moments of disaster! Sara will quickly learn the consequences of her choice as the limits of her love are put to the test.', 'Jacopo has a serious problem. He may be a brilliant marriage guidance counsellor, but he can never manage to have a steady relationship for more than two weeks. And for good reason: since he was very young, Jacopo has been cursed and brought bad luck to every woman who has fallen in love with him. Really bad luck. Because of this, he has vowed to stay away from women, for their own good. But the moment he lays eyes on Sara at a friend’s birthday party, he is smitten. Despite his resistance, the two fall head over heels leading to back-to-back, laugh-out-loud moments of disaster! Sara will quickly learn the consequences of her choice as the limits of her love are put to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBcVaSYCVO3oMoDuKs4KMjJlNtT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236325'),
  ('926715814718924027', 'Stay Away, Joe', 1968, 'Western, Music, Comedy', 'Dale Hutchinson, Peter Tewksbury, Fred J. Koenekamp', 'Michael A. Hoey', 'Elvis Presley, Burgess Meredith, Joan Blondell, Katy Jurado, Thomas Gomez, Henry Jones, L.Q. Jones, Quentin Dean', 'PG', 'Joe Lightcloud persuades his Congressman to give him 20 heifers and a prize bull so he and his father, Charlie, can prove that the Navajos can successfully raise cattle on the reservation. If their experiment is successful, then the government will help all the Navajo people. But Joe''s friend, Bronc Hoverty, accidentally barbecues the prize bull, while Joe sells the heifers to buy plumbing and other home improvements for his stepmother.', 'Joe Lightcloud persuades his Congressman to give him 20 heifers and a prize bull so he and his father, Charlie, can prove that the Navajos can successfully raise cattle on the reservation. If their experiment is successful, then the government will help all the Navajo people. But Joe''s friend, Bronc Hoverty, accidentally barbecues the prize bull, while Joe sells the heifers to buy plumbing and other home improvements for his stepmother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zslRaj04IkzfrtPomJURHuClOqL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49776'),
  ('853298473638726942', 'Stay Cool', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Michael Polish, Adam Rehmeier, M. David Mullen', 'Mark Polish', 'Winona Ryder, Mark Polish, Sean Astin, Hilary Duff, Josh Holloway, Jon Cryer, Chevy Chase, Jessica St. Clair', 'PG-13', 'A successful author is forced to confront an unrequited high school crush when he returns home to deliver a commencement address to graduating seniors. Shasta O''Neil, a sexy high school senior flirts with the visiting author and invites him to the prom.', 'A successful author is forced to confront an unrequited high school crush when he returns home to deliver a commencement address to graduating seniors. Shasta O''Neil, a sexy high school senior flirts with the visiting author and invites him to the prom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8VDrfWam5pVH0vxE1nyLMVwYuIm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11388'),
  ('414662389743054274', 'Stay Hungry', 1976, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bob Rafelson, Victor J. Kemper, Alan Hopkins', 'Bob Rafelson, Charles Gaines', 'Jeff Bridges, Sally Field, Arnold Schwarzenegger, R.G. Armstrong, Robert Englund, Helena Kallianiotes, Roger E. Mosley, Woodrow Parfrey', 'R', 'A dishonest businessman asks rich layabout Craig Blake to help him buy a gym, which will be demolished for a development project in Alabama. But after spending time with weightlifter Joe Santo and gym worker Mary Tate Farnsworth, Craig wants out of the deal. The property negotiations turn ugly, causing a brawl at the gym and a spectacle at a big bodybuilding meet, as Craig learns that it''s not easy to turn your back on fair-weather friends.', 'A dishonest businessman asks rich layabout Craig Blake to help him buy a gym, which will be demolished for a development project in Alabama. But after spending time with weightlifter Joe Santo and gym worker Mary Tate Farnsworth, Craig wants out of the deal. The property negotiations turn ugly, causing a brawl at the gym and a spectacle at a big bodybuilding meet, as Craig learns that it''s not easy to turn your back on fair-weather friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WNMcRYtk74QNL53ZxVIDjpBbzF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5228'),
  ('217207057116285722', 'Stay Out of the Attic', 2020, 'Horror', 'Jerren Lauder', 'Julie Auerbach, Jesse Federman, Jason Scott Goldberg', 'Morgan Alexandria, Bryce Fernelius, Michael Flynn, Ryan Francis, Brynn Hurlburt, Avery Pizzuto', null, 'A diverse group of ex-cons-turned-movers are convinced by their creepy client, Vern Muller, to pull an all-nighter for a generous pay bump. As the night progresses and rooms are cleared, they slowly uncover the horrors that exist inside his old Victorian mansion, which include boobytraps, human experimentation, Nazi monsters and more. Will they survive the night?', 'A diverse group of ex-cons-turned-movers are convinced by their creepy client, Vern Muller, to pull an all-nighter for a generous pay bump. As the night progresses and rooms are cleared, they slowly uncover the horrors that exist inside his old Victorian mansion, which include boobytraps, human experimentation, Nazi monsters and more. Will they survive the night?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kEKQjLYZiIy78eEiMrtBfqSm3LU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:787009'),
  ('52638091342818948', 'Stay Still', 2021, 'Drama', 'Francesco Di Giacomo, Elisa Mishto', 'Elisa Mishto', 'Natalia Belitski, Luisa-Céline Gaffron, Giuseppe Battiston, Martin Wuttke, Katharina Schüttler, Kim Riedle, Leslie Malton, Jürgen Vogel', null, 'These young women are an odd couple. Julie is quick-witted and stubborn. She celebrates idleness and even voluntarily checks into a psychiatric clinic. Nurse Agnes, on the other hand, is always eager to do the right thing and to meet everyone''s expectations of her, which is not always easy. When the two of them accidentally meet one day, odds are they won''t get along. But they quickly feel attracted to one another, despite their enormous differences.', 'These young women are an odd couple. Julie is quick-witted and stubborn. She celebrates idleness and even voluntarily checks into a psychiatric clinic. Nurse Agnes, on the other hand, is always eager to do the right thing and to meet everyone''s expectations of her, which is not always easy. When the two of them accidentally meet one day, odds are they won''t get along. But they quickly feel attracted to one another, despite their enormous differences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6uCTweH2UApH2zB5FD8wsH4ijBW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:530554'),
  ('437755761399058493', 'Stay Tuned', 1992, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Peter Hyams, Peter Hyams, Jack Frost Sanders', 'Tom S. Parker, Jim Jennewein', 'John Ritter, Pam Dawber, Jeffrey Jones, David Tom, Heather McComb, Bob Dishy, Joyce Gordon, Eugene Levy', 'PG', 'Salesman Roy Knable spends all his free time watching television, to the exasperation of his wife, Helen. One day, TV salesman Spike convinces Roy to buy a satellite dish offering 666 channels. The new addition to Roy''s home entertainment system sucks him and Helen into Hellvision, a realm run by Spike, who is an emissary of Satan. For 24 hours, the couple must survive devilish parodies of TV programs if they want to return to reality alive.', 'Salesman Roy Knable spends all his free time watching television, to the exasperation of his wife, Helen. One day, TV salesman Spike convinces Roy to buy a satellite dish offering 666 channels. The new addition to Roy''s home entertainment system sucks him and Helen into Hellvision, a realm run by Spike, who is an emissary of Satan. For 24 hours, the couple must survive devilish parodies of TV programs if they want to return to reality alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yd2MN9zA30eGjf89DaaNoUXbRNp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23939'),
  ('1152594842073228011', 'Stay With Me', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mustafa Uğur Yağcıoğlu', 'Çaglar Yurt', 'Çağlar Ertuğrul, Meriç Aral, Murat Aygen, Nilay Duru, Ege Aydan, Levent Sülün, Tuna Arman, Deniz Baytaş', null, 'Emir is a handsome, rich, successful man in his thirties. He was born into a family of workers and dedicated to study. He works day and night by putting everything in his life into the background. One of Turkey''s most important investment bank has been working as an investment adviser at. He has been a complete predator in terms of working hard. Because there was no opportunity to learn to establish relationships with people, there was a big gap in Emir. One night, Emir''s life changes when he meets Zeynep, the worst street singer in the world, and they both begin to help each other without knowing it.', 'Emir is a handsome, rich, successful man in his thirties. He was born into a family of workers and dedicated to study. He works day and night by putting everything in his life into the background. One of Turkey''s most important investment bank has been working as an investment adviser at. He has been a complete predator in terms of working hard. Because there was no opportunity to learn to establish relationships with people, there was a big gap in Emir. One night, Emir''s life changes when he meets Zeynep, the worst street singer in the world, and they both begin to help each other without knowing it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3T56ZJlmWKMei5q6RmEW3Uoxqkw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:607337'),
  ('848986087056010816', 'Stay With Us', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Gad Elmaleh', 'Gad Elmaleh, Benjamin Charbit', 'Gad Elmaleh, Régine Elmaleh, David Elmaleh, Olivia Jubin, William Azoulay, Judith Elmaleh, Catherine Thiercelin, Nicolas Port', null, 'Gad Elmaleh decides to leave New York and move back to Paris, to get baptized and become a Catholic. Despite his attempt to hide the truth from his Jewish family, Gad''s parents discover their son''s unconditional love for the Virgin Mary – and for them, it’s a nightmare! Determined to bring Gad back to reason and to his Jewishness, they turn his conversion into a battlefield - as Gad tries to make them understand by any means necessary that his sincere beliefs do not change his identity and the love he has for his family.', 'Gad Elmaleh decides to leave New York and move back to Paris, to get baptized and become a Catholic. Despite his attempt to hide the truth from his Jewish family, Gad''s parents discover their son''s unconditional love for the Virgin Mary – and for them, it’s a nightmare! Determined to bring Gad back to reason and to his Jewishness, they turn his conversion into a battlefield - as Gad tries to make them understand by any means necessary that his sincere beliefs do not change his identity and the love he has for his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phA5vYVI3qK1oYLLUHPiDenJb4R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:998783'),
  ('661238765169240916', 'Staying Alive', 1983, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Sylvester Stallone, Nick McLean', 'Norman Wexler, Sylvester Stallone', 'John Travolta, Cynthia Rhodes, Finola Hughes, Steve Inwood, Julie Bovasso, Charles Ward, Steve Bickford, Patrick Brady', 'PG', 'It''s five years later and Tony Manero''s Saturday Night Fever is still burning. Now he''s strutting toward his biggest challenger yet - making it as a dancer on the Broadway stage.', 'It''s five years later and Tony Manero''s Saturday Night Fever is still burning. Now he''s strutting toward his biggest challenger yet - making it as a dancer on the Broadway stage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFyTQt1HRlqr5SCEkuO4NoHM5B9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10805'),
  ('696773078595806285', 'Staying Together', 1989, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Dick Bush, Lee Grant', 'Monte Merrick', 'Sean Astin, Dermot Mulroney, Tim Quill, Stockard Channing, Melinda Dillon, Jim Haynie, Daphne Zuniga, Levon Helm', null, 'After their father abruptly sells the beloved family-owned restaurant that has employed them for years, the charismatic McDermott boys - hot-tempered Brian (Quill), lovelorn Kit (Mulroney) and jokester Duncan (Astin) - find themselves at odds with their parents and each other.', 'After their father abruptly sells the beloved family-owned restaurant that has employed them for years, the charismatic McDermott boys - hot-tempered Brian (Quill), lovelorn Kit (Mulroney) and jokester Duncan (Astin) - find themselves at odds with their parents and each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4aWYb3fc2knW1WCH6fMX9AvVkiE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28706'),
  ('1039813006624121741', 'Staying Vertical', 2016, 'Drama', 'Alain Guiraudie, Claire Mathon', 'Alain Guiraudie', 'Damien Bonnard, India Hair, Raphaël Thiéry, Christian Bouillette, Basile Meilleurat, Laure Calamy, Sébastien Novac', null, 'Screenwriter Leo is searching for the wolf in the south of France. During a scouting excursion he is seduced by Marie, a free-spirited and dynamic shepherdess. Nine months later she gives birth to their child. Suffering from post-natal depression and with no faith in Leo, who comes and goes without warning, Marie abandons both of them. Leo finds himself alone, with a baby to care for.', 'Screenwriter Leo is searching for the wolf in the south of France. During a scouting excursion he is seduced by Marie, a free-spirited and dynamic shepherdess. Nine months later she gives birth to their child. Suffering from post-natal depression and with no faith in Leo, who comes and goes without warning, Marie abandons both of them. Leo finds himself alone, with a baby to care for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Q0iRB26y60JVW6HpbOru1BnH4h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380622'),
  ('170748470474983160', 'Steak', 2007, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Quentin Dupieux', 'Quentin Dupieux', 'Éric Judor, Ramzy Bedia, Jonathan Lambert, Vincent Belorgey, SebastiAn, Laurent Nicolas, Sébastien Tellier, Alain Gendreau', null, 'George is the scapegoat of his classmates. One day he cracks and shoots them. His best and only friend Blaise is accused in his place and sentenced to 7 years in a psychiatric hospital. At the day of his release, Blaise realizes he only has one family: his best friend George. But he does not want to hear about his childhood friend, as he tries to integrate with the “Chivers” a gang whose members wear red jackets and boots, drink milk, drive sport trucks and play an incomprehensible and violent game that mixes cricket and mental arithmetic.', 'George is the scapegoat of his classmates. One day he cracks and shoots them. His best and only friend Blaise is accused in his place and sentenced to 7 years in a psychiatric hospital. At the day of his release, Blaise realizes he only has one family: his best friend George. But he does not want to hear about his childhood friend, as he tries to integrate with the “Chivers” a gang whose members wear red jackets and boots, drink milk, drive sport trucks and play an incomprehensible and violent game that mixes cricket and mental arithmetic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IugtyTSEBusqT9F8nIcc3tD6hN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49084'),
  ('892907754725982083', 'Steak (R)evolution', 2014, 'Family, Documentary, Adventure', 'Franck Ribière', null, 'Franck Ribière, Yves-Marie Le Bourdonnec', null, 'Far from intensive farming and industrial output, a revolution is already under way; good red meat has become a rare, indeed, luxury product. But where is the world''s best steak found? Franck Ribière and his favorite butcher, Yves-Marie Le Bourdonnec, generous, charming, and ecological, set out to meet the new players in the field to try to understand what makes a cut of meat good.', 'Far from intensive farming and industrial output, a revolution is already under way; good red meat has become a rare, indeed, luxury product. But where is the world''s best steak found? Franck Ribière and his favorite butcher, Yves-Marie Le Bourdonnec, generous, charming, and ecological, set out to meet the new players in the field to try to understand what makes a cut of meat good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTdtSgRGALFGV6BPqeYxBlCYeSm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299511'),
  ('236460576899379753', 'Steal', 2002, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Gérard Pirès, Tetsuo Nagata', 'Mark Ezra', 'Stephen Dorff, Natasha Henstridge, Bruce Payne, Steven Berkoff, Clé Bennett, Karen Cliche, Alain Goulem, Andreas Apergis', 'R', 'An entrepreneurial criminal, Slim (Dorff) is as smart as they come. Cocky and confident, he assembles a team of risk-taking rush-seekers to pull off a series of five bank heists, each time using a different extreme sport to make the getaway. Following an unexpected windfall on only their second job, the gang nets $20 million in untraceable bonds. Having scored enough money to retire on, Slim and his crew decide to call the robbery game quits. But both the mob and the police have other plans in mind for Slim: they want him to keep working, for them.', 'An entrepreneurial criminal, Slim (Dorff) is as smart as they come. Cocky and confident, he assembles a team of risk-taking rush-seekers to pull off a series of five bank heists, each time using a different extreme sport to make the getaway. Following an unexpected windfall on only their second job, the gang nets $20 million in untraceable bonds. Having scored enough money to retire on, Slim and his crew decide to call the robbery game quits. But both the mob and the police have other plans in mind for Slim: they want him to keep working, for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJYLcMIlYfxADjc2VEk0cHxd5N6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12577'),
  ('1122527426518664256', 'Steal Big Steal Little', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Andrew Davis, Frank Tidy', 'Jeanne Blake, Andrew Davis, Lee Blessing', 'Andy Garcia, Alan Arkin, Rachel Ticotin, Joe Pantoliano, Ally Walker, David Ogden Stiers, Kevin McCarthy, Richard Bradford', 'PG-13', 'Ruben and Robby are twin brothers, adopted by Mona, one of the wealthiest - and most eccentric - women in Santa Barbara. Ruben is devoted to Mona, but Robby is more devoted to her money. So when Mona leaves her fortune and estate to Ruben it starts a battle between brothers that soon leads to madness, mayhem, and even attempted murder. On Ruben''s side is Lou Perilli an ex-Chicago cop and used car dealer who knows the law - and how to get around it. On Robby''s side is ruthless businessman Reed Tyler, who is out to turn a swift profit on Mona''s property. Walking a shifty line between them is Eddie Agopian, the family lawyer, who doesn''t care which side wins as long as he''s on the winner''s side. But whether they''re stealing big or stealing little, they''re all stealing in this hilarious comedy about greed, power... and brotherly love.', 'Ruben and Robby are twin brothers, adopted by Mona, one of the wealthiest - and most eccentric - women in Santa Barbara. Ruben is devoted to Mona, but Robby is more devoted to her money. So when Mona leaves her fortune and estate to Ruben it starts a battle between brothers that soon leads to madness, mayhem, and even attempted murder. On Ruben''s side is Lou Perilli an ex-Chicago cop and used car dealer who knows the law - and how to get around it. On Robby''s side is ruthless businessman Reed Tyler, who is out to turn a swift profit on Mona''s property. Walking a shifty line between them is Eddie Agopian, the family lawyer, who doesn''t care which side wins as long as he''s on the winner''s side. But whether they''re stealing big or stealing little, they''re all stealing in this hilarious comedy about greed, power... and brotherly love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83TvBaWt8wZHUZo8MKwE2cLRBiT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78406'),
  ('447617759074659229', 'Steal My Heart', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Lee Hyeon-jong, Byun Bong-sun, Song Hyun-suk', 'Lee Gyu-bok', 'Kim A-joong, Joo Won, Ju Jin-mo, Baek Do-bin, Bae Sung-woo, Ju Seok-tae, Cha Tae-hyun, Hwang Tae-kwang', null, 'Lee Ho-tae meets the first love of his dreams, Yoon Jin-sook for the first time in ten years but is shocked to find out she''s a hit-and-runner.', 'Lee Ho-tae meets the first love of his dreams, Yoon Jin-sook for the first time in ten years but is shocked to find out she''s a hit-and-runner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mYVIXA4S84mGISc3McjxYYeZj2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245597'),
  ('950521172514429895', 'Steal This Film', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Peter Sunde, Jamie King', null, 'Rickard Falkvinge, Gottfrid Svartholm, Fredrik Neij, Peter Sunde, Aaron Swartz', null, 'Steal This Film focuses on Pirate Bay founders Gottfrid Svartholm, Fredrik Neij and Peter Sunde, prominent members of the Swedish filesharing community. The makers claimed that ''Old Media'' documentary crews couldn''t understand the internet culture that filesharers took part in, and that they saw peer-to-peer organization as a threat to their livelihoods. Because of that, they were determined to accurately represent the filesharing community from within. Notably, Steal This Film was released and distributed, free of charge, through the same filesharing networks that the film documents.', 'Steal This Film focuses on Pirate Bay founders Gottfrid Svartholm, Fredrik Neij and Peter Sunde, prominent members of the Swedish filesharing community. The makers claimed that ''Old Media'' documentary crews couldn''t understand the internet culture that filesharers took part in, and that they saw peer-to-peer organization as a threat to their livelihoods. Because of that, they were determined to accurately represent the filesharing community from within. Notably, Steal This Film was released and distributed, free of charge, through the same filesharing networks that the film documents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Q7EahFIXrbB3buo4zeMNKNHCIt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15324'),
  ('507818799019179043', 'Steal This Movie', 2000, 'Drama', 'Robert Greenwald, Denis Lenoir', 'Bruce Graham', 'Vincent D''Onofrio, Janeane Garofalo, Jeanne Tripplehorn, Kevin Pollak, Donal Logue, Kevin Corrigan, Alan van Sprang, Troy Garity', null, 'Five years after Yippie founder Abbie Hoffman goes underground to avoid a drug-related prison sentence, he contacts a reporter to get out the story of the FBI''s covert spying, harassment and inciting of violence they then blame on the Left.', 'Five years after Yippie founder Abbie Hoffman goes underground to avoid a drug-related prison sentence, he contacts a reporter to get out the story of the FBI''s covert spying, harassment and inciting of violence they then blame on the Left.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEylWTGRZoOR51wo422rhYXkV6Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18153'),
  ('248074494465138694', 'Steal Wool', 1957, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Ralph Wolf tries to forcibly remove Sam Sheepdog in order to gain access to a flock of sheep. Without success, he uses a lasso, cannon, a string of firecrackers, and a giant rubber band.', 'Ralph Wolf tries to forcibly remove Sam Sheepdog in order to gain access to a flock of sheep. Without success, he uses a lasso, cannon, a string of firecrackers, and a giant rubber band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykFZge2YMXOXXshhupyrozSSnx7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100355'),
  ('278376228681584883', 'Stealing Beauty', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'Bernardo Bertolucci, Serena Canevari, Darius Khondji', 'Susan Minot', 'Liv Tyler, Sinéad Cusack, Jeremy Irons, Jason Flemyng, Joseph Fiennes, Carlo Cecchi, Donal McCann, Jean Marais', 'R', 'Lucy Harmon, an American teenager is arriving in the lush Tuscan countryside to be sculpted by a family friend who lives in a beautiful villa. Lucy visited there four years earlier and exchanged a kiss with an Italian boy with whom she hopes to become reacquainted.', 'Lucy Harmon, an American teenager is arriving in the lush Tuscan countryside to be sculpted by a family friend who lives in a beautiful villa. Lucy visited there four years earlier and exchanged a kiss with an Italian boy with whom she hopes to become reacquainted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ugxnyVmBK952bwOcE4M0szNimx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14553'),
  ('383950673864899096', 'Stealing Christmas', 2003, 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Gregg Champion', 'Lloyd Gold', 'Tony Danza, Lea Thompson, Angela Goethals, Betty White, David Parker, Malcolm Stewart, Alf Humphreys, Gwynyth Walsh', 'NR', 'When thief Jack Clayton is about to be caught at the mall, he dresses up as Santa Claus and hops on the bus to Evergreen. He is mistaken for the new Santa at Sarah Gibson''s tree store. He is very reluctant at first, but after becoming a part of the town, and falls in love with Sarah, he begins to have second thoughts on robbing Evergreen''s bank.', 'When thief Jack Clayton is about to be caught at the mall, he dresses up as Santa Claus and hops on the bus to Evergreen. He is mistaken for the new Santa at Sarah Gibson''s tree store. He is very reluctant at first, but after becoming a part of the town, and falls in love with Sarah, he begins to have second thoughts on robbing Evergreen''s bank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUbjU9IGAPhWiwyITwjJ39u4IcA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40836'),
  ('976570477584936072', 'Stealing Harvard', 2002, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'Bruce McCulloch, Ueli Steiger, Drew Ann Rosenberg', 'Peter Tolan', 'Jason Lee, Tom Green, Leslie Mann, Megan Mullally, Dennis Farina, Tammy Blanchard, Richard Jenkins, Chris Penn', 'PG-13', 'John and his girlfriend have vowed to marry once they save $30,000 for their dream house. But the minute they achieve their financial goal, John finds out his niece has been accepted at Harvard, and he''s reminded of his promise to pay for her tuition (nearly $30,000). John''s friend Duff convinces him to turn to petty crime to make the payment … but Duff''s hare-brained schemes spin quickly out of control.', 'John and his girlfriend have vowed to marry once they save $30,000 for their dream house. But the minute they achieve their financial goal, John finds out his niece has been accepted at Harvard, and he''s reminded of his promise to pay for her tuition (nearly $30,000). John''s friend Duff convinces him to turn to petty crime to make the payment … but Duff''s hare-brained schemes spin quickly out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iCHAn0eVAXwybuzoQO598aKMVJD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12770'),
  ('705781520258806518', 'Stealing Heaven', 1988, 'History, Romance, Drama', 'Clive Donner', 'Chris Bryant', 'Derek de Lint, Kim Thomson, Denholm Elliott, Bernard Hepton, Rachel Kempson, Angela Pleasence, Kenneth Cranham, Patsy Byrne', 'R', 'Abelard, a famous teacher of philosophy at the cathedral school of Notre Dame, falls in love with one of his students, Héloïse d''Argenteuil. A sixteen-year old girl raised in a convent, Héloïse has an intellectual curiosity and rebels against the status of women in 12th century Europe. When others begin to suspect their relationship, Heloise''s uncle Fulbert and the bishop of Paris work together to put a stop to it. Héloïse becomes pregnant with Abelard''s child, and they are married in secret. Abelard struggles for acting against the will of God, yet is unable to escape his love for Heloise.', 'Abelard, a famous teacher of philosophy at the cathedral school of Notre Dame, falls in love with one of his students, Héloïse d''Argenteuil. A sixteen-year old girl raised in a convent, Héloïse has an intellectual curiosity and rebels against the status of women in 12th century Europe. When others begin to suspect their relationship, Heloise''s uncle Fulbert and the bishop of Paris work together to put a stop to it. Héloïse becomes pregnant with Abelard''s child, and they are married in secret. Abelard struggles for acting against the will of God, yet is unable to escape his love for Heloise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rvf6APZtYJSZa5BCdmIoLixj1r3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115457'),
  ('983797446661435009', 'Stealing Home', 1988, 'Drama, Romance', 'Steven Kampmann, William Porter, Jefferson Sage', 'Steven Kampmann, William Porter', 'Mark Harmon, William McNamara, Jodie Foster, Helen Hunt, Jonathan Silverman, Harold Ramis, John Shea, Blair Brown', 'PG-13', 'Billy Wyatt, a former high school and minor-league baseball player, receives a telephone call from his mother revealing that his former child-sitter, and later in his teens, his first love, Katie Chandler, has died. Wyatt returns home to deal with this tragedy, reminiscing over his childhood growing up with his father, Katie, and best friend Alan Appleby.', 'Billy Wyatt, a former high school and minor-league baseball player, receives a telephone call from his mother revealing that his former child-sitter, and later in his teens, his first love, Katie Chandler, has died. Wyatt returns home to deal with this tragedy, reminiscing over his childhood growing up with his father, Katie, and best friend Alan Appleby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwl2DNSO4nnOYUTMubBC2DpMpOQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32331'),
  ('146777507440121317', 'Stealing Raden Saleh', 2022, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'Angga Dwimas Sasongko, Bagoes Tresna Adji', 'Angga Dwimas Sasongko, Husein M. Atmodjo', 'Iqbaal Ramadhan, Angga Yunanda, Aghniny Haque, Rachel Amanda, Ari Irham, Umay Shahab, Atiqah Hasiholan, Tio Pakusadewo', null, 'To get his father out of prison, a master forger assembles a diverse team of specialists to steal a priceless painting.', 'To get his father out of prison, a master forger assembles a diverse team of specialists to steal a priceless painting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66yOibmlqxASFoNyEZIORELJqBC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:832544'),
  ('416926485449777947', 'Stealing Rembrandt', 2003, 'Action, Comedy', 'Eric Kress, Jannik Johansen, Eigil Jacobsen', 'Anders Thomas Jensen, Jannik Johansen', 'Lars Brygmann, Jakob Cedergren, Nikolaj Coster-Waldau, Nicolas Bro, Sonja Richter, Søren Pilmark, Gordon Kennedy, Paprika Steen', null, 'Two bumbling scrap metal thieves - father and son - steal the wrong painting during a museum heist. The painting turns out to be the only original Rembrandt painting in Denmark, and all hell breaks loose. What do you do when you''ve got Interpol, the Danish police and the entire Danish underworld on your heels? And who was this Rembrandt guy anyway?', 'Two bumbling scrap metal thieves - father and son - steal the wrong painting during a museum heist. The painting turns out to be the only original Rembrandt painting in Denmark, and all hell breaks loose. What do you do when you''ve got Interpol, the Danish police and the entire Danish underworld on your heels? And who was this Rembrandt guy anyway?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gN38rJZ77dtnVqbIGTkNtF4glX2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11196'),
  ('338685478537025592', 'Stealing Sinatra', 2003, 'History, Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Ron Underwood, Brian Pearson', 'Howard Korder', 'David Arquette, William H. Macy, Thomas Ian Nicholas, Matthew Bennett, Deanna Milligan, Desiree Zurowski, Sam McMurray, Eric Johnson', 'R', 'In need of a grubstake, a young man convinces a couple of friends to help him kidnap Frank Sinatra Jr. It''s a true story', 'In need of a grubstake, a young man convinces a couple of friends to help him kidnap Frank Sinatra Jr. It''s a true story', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rb2XrjDjdVqBqVb13zRw2zUmrqO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63903'),
  ('135716340119483901', 'Stealth', 2005, 'Science Fiction', 'Dean Semler, Rob Cohen, Jim Millett', 'W.D. Richter', 'Josh Lucas, Jessica Biel, Jamie Foxx, Sam Shepard, Joe Morton, Ebon Moss-Bachrach, Richard Roxburgh, David Andrews', 'PG-13', 'Deeply ensconced in a top-secret military program, three pilots struggle to bring an artificial intelligence program under control ... before it initiates the next world war.', 'Deeply ensconced in a top-secret military program, three pilots struggle to bring an artificial intelligence program under control ... before it initiates the next world war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVtQHyTwaDhYFVRFXSuDthC2bXH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10048'),
  ('213288037182378415', 'Stealth Fighter', 1999, 'Action, Thriller', 'Jim Wynorski, J. E. Bash', 'Lenny Juliano', 'Ice-T, Costas Mandylor, Erika Eleniak, William Sadler, Ernie Hudson, Sarah Dampf, Tommy Lister Jr., Andrew Divoff', null, 'A navy pilot fakes his own death and steals a stealth fighter plane from a U.S.A.F base. He then acts as a mercenary, targeting military installations around the world.', 'A navy pilot fakes his own death and steals a stealth fighter plane from a U.S.A.F base. He then acts as a mercenary, targeting military installations around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGqNehnTJIimasvXYAIyWtWV2Ce.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30817'),
  ('70499382880621263', 'Steam: The Turkish Bath', 1997, 'Drama', 'Ferzan Özpetek, Pasquale Mari, Gianluca Mazzella', 'Aldo Sambrell, Ferzan Özpetek, Stefano Tummolini', 'Alessandro Gassmann, Mehmet Günsür, Francesca D''Aloja, Halil Ergün, Şerif Sezer, Başak Köklükaya, Carlo Cecchi, Alberto Molinari', null, 'Francesco and Marta run a husband-and-wife design company in Rome. When Francesco''s aunt dies in Istanbul he travels there to sort out the hamam Turkish steam bath that she left him. He finds a love and warmth in his relatives'' Istanbul home that is missing from his life in Italy.', 'Francesco and Marta run a husband-and-wife design company in Rome. When Francesco''s aunt dies in Istanbul he travels there to sort out the hamam Turkish steam bath that she left him. He finds a love and warmth in his relatives'' Istanbul home that is missing from his life in Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a1c3p8qvTXf3Eue9QNzq1kVG5MM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27104'),
  ('144370931484545063', 'Steamboat Bill, Jr.', 1928, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Charles Reisner, Devereaux Jennings, Sandy Roth', null, 'Buster Keaton, Tom McGuire, Ernest Torrence, Tom Lewis, Marion Byron, James T. Mack, Ford West', 'NR', 'The just-out-of-college, effete son of a no-nonsense steamboat captain comes to visit his father whom he''s not seen since he was a child.', 'The just-out-of-college, effete son of a no-nonsense steamboat captain comes to visit his father whom he''s not seen since he was a child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zygJMsmXxeyDc1N67OCZc8xtq4I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25768'),
  ('1080226101576095305', 'Steamboat Round the Bend', 1935, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'George Schneiderman, John Ford', 'Lamar Trotti, Dudley Nichols', 'Will Rogers, Anne Shirley, Irvin S. Cobb, Eugene Pallette, John McGuire, Berton Churchill, Francis Ford, Roger Imhof', 'NR', 'A Louisiana con man enters his steamboat into a winner-take-all race with a rival while trying to find a witness to free his nephew, about to be hanged for murder.', 'A Louisiana con man enters his steamboat into a winner-take-all race with a rival while trying to find a witness to free his nephew, about to be hanged for murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/httH3BiRr7GFpQyCcTaBkgZ3WOF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72609'),
